        {
          "id": "krea2-57803fee52e380f470770f72",
          "alias": "单女湿身白挂脖海滩沉思站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a wooden seaside staircase, taking a selfie facing a mirror or a glass reflective surface. She wears a delicate white halter dress woven from fine coarse tweed with a soft pink texture. The neckline and pocket edges are adorned with three-dimensional lace trim and delicate pink rose embroidery. The skirt drapes naturally, outlining an elegant silhouette. Naturally draped over her shoulder, she holds a light blue smartphone in her right hand. The triple camera module on the back is clearly visible, and her earlobes are adorned with simple black geometric earrings that reflect slightly in the sunlight. The middle view is a moist beach, with fine grains shining golden yellow. After the tide recedes, shallow puddles remain that reflect the sky and the distant rock outlines. Several huge brown reefs are scattered across the tidal flats, some soaked by seawater, some exposed to sunlight. The background is a vast sea surface, with waves of varying shades of blue-green. Gentle waves lap the shore, and in the distance, several jagged islands appear and disappear. The sky is clear and deep blue, with almost no clouds. Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the frame, casting a warm and soft golden glow over the entire scene. The composition uses a symmetrical frame, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, and wooden columns on both sides forming guiding lines that draw the gaze toward the main subject; At the same time, by utilizing mirror reflections or the perspective effect created by glass windows, the background space can be extended and expanded, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the image. Forming a complete visual loop. In terms of lighting and ambiance, the overall lighting is a soft backlight typical of the daytime golden hour, creating delicate transitions and highlights that enhance the sense of depth; The seawater and rocks in the background create rich contrasts of light and shadow under the sunlight, while the water on the beach reflects shimmering waves, creating a peaceful, warm, and vacation-filled atmosphere. The entire image exudes an artistic sense of beautiful moments casually captured in daily life, combining youthful vitality with the tranquility and vastness of the seaside natural scenery. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, dominated by warm tones and balanced by the blue ocean as a cool tone, presenting a gentle, healing, and slightly artistic visual experience. It feels like a lifestyle aesthetic shot taken with a regular phone but with professional photography quality, allowing one to feel the unique laziness and romance of a summer afternoon by the sea.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
