        {
          "id": "krea2-9716bceae1c0eca277927c1a",
          "alias": "单女灰外套公园俏皮站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the shade of a city park, wearing a light gray-green hooded softshell jacket. The fabric is soft and slightly wrinkled, with a small brand logo on the chest and a small red label on the left hem. The overall style is casual and outdoor-oriented; She wears a fluffy light gray wool beret, with a black cloth badge embedded in the center of the hat, shining with a healthy glow in the sunlight; Her expression is naturally relaxed yet slightly playful; She carries a black backpack with a simple and sturdy body, a strap made of black fabric, the bag clearly fitting her back, and a corner of the backpack showing a subtle metal fastener detail; On the left side of the foreground is a thick tree trunk with rough, brownish bark, roots partially exposed above the ground, surrounded by withered yellow leaves and scattered green grass. The ground is paved with soil, gravel, and several irregular square stone slabs, forming a winding path leading into the distance; The middle ground is where she stands, while the background is wrapped in layers of lush green leaves. Light comes from the upper right, representing a gentle sunset or early morning backlight. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves to form fine light spots, while light shadows are cast behind her, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette of the photo is dominated by earth tones and natural green, complemented by the gray-green of the costumes and the light gray of the hat, creating a harmonious transition. The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, with just the right contrast between light and shadow, avoiding excessive saturation or overflowing highlights, presenting a realistic, natural, yet artistically beautiful visual effect; The shooting angle is a close-up with a level view and a slight upward angle. The camera is relatively close to the person but does not compress the sense of space, preserving sufficient environmental information; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, evoking the everyday vibe of youthful campus or urban strolls, as if capturing the most unexpectedly beautiful moments of an ordinary afternoon. It is both lively and refinedly composed, like a casual shot taken with a smartphone camera under natural light, yet thanks to precise framing and lighting use, it appears professional and highly engaging.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
