        {
          "id": "krea2-62d0e77c953ded2815e0cba7",
          "alias": "单女俏皮坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "The pleats of the garment naturally draped along her body, highlighting youthful energy and a sense of fashion; In the foreground is a delicate, warm golden sandy beach, with clear grain textures that glow softly under the sunlight, with scattered small shells and fragments of seaweed at your feet; The middle area extends to the seaside, with several visitors sitting or standing on the shallow shore, each in different poses. In the distance, there are several colorful umbrellas and simple tents, hinting that this is a lively but quiet seaside resort; The background is the vast, boundless blue sea, with varying shades of blue. Gentle waves lap the shore, and the outline of a small island can be faintly seen on the distant horizon. The sky is a pure, deep blue, without a single cloud. The entire image is filled with a fresh, natural, and youthful vibe, as if capturing a carefree seaside holiday moment. It combines the refined beauty of professional photography with the authenticity and lifestyle of everyday shooting, allowing people to feel the beautiful resonance of sunshine, sea breeze, and youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
