        {
          "id": "krea2-1f895d7ddf5f4e8b2173693b",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, lightly drifting in the breeze, adding dynamism and vitality; She wears a delicate off-white woven straw hat with a wide brim trimmed with lace trim, and on the left side is a pure white plumeria flower with yellow stamens, slightly tilted, as if gently trembling in the wind; She wore a sleeveless washed blue denim dress with delicate texture and pleats, with matching lace trim on the shoulders, and the hem naturally draped down to near the knees; Her right hand gently holds a blue hollowed-out knit handbag, with clearly visible textures that harmonize with the dress's tone; She wears a gentle and serene smile, looks directly at the camera, and exudes youthful innocence along with a hint of shyness; The overall posture is naturally relaxed, the body leans slightly forward, and the left hand lets down or gently supports the hem of the skirt, creating a momentary beauty that is captured unintentionally. In the foreground is the pale sandy beach where she stands, with fine and soft grains, scattered at her feet a few white petals or tiny shells, and the ground reflecting slightly from the light, enhancing the spatial layers; The middle is a vast, calm sea surface, with water gradients from pale blue to sky blue. Gentle waves lap the shore, forming fine white foam. The water reflects the bright colors of the sky, and in the distance, the blurred outlines of city buildings can be faintly seen. The lines are simple and hazy, suggesting that this is a seaside area that combines both natural and urban atmosphere. The background is a pure, flawless sky, dominated by large areas of high-gloss white, almost completely overexposed, creating a strong contrast of light and dark, with only faint blue-gray transitions remaining on the horizon. This approach not only highlights the subject, but also gives the painting a dreamy, ethereal, and even slightly surreal atmosphere. The composition adopts a classic centrally symmetrical portrait style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, the head slightly tilted to the right, and the direction of sight subtly interacting with the camera to enhance emotional connection; The overall composition is vertically rectangular, extending to the beach beneath and the distant sea-sky boundary, creating a sense of spatial depth from near to far; For lighting and shadowing, it uses soft backlighting techniques in the early morning or evening, with the light source coming from the upper back of the subject to enhance the sense of depth; Create the effect of a \"veil of light\"; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and full of summer romance, featuring a slight film graininess and a retro filter style with low color saturation. It resembles everyday photos taken with an old digital camera on a sunny afternoon, yet carefully graded in post-production to present cinematic visual texture.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
