        {
          "id": "krea2-e57ca497f3e78f876bda86c7",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤困倦倚靠喝",
          "prompt": "She wore a lightweight, semi-transparent white long-sleeved cover-up top, paired with a gray camisole with lace trim at the neckline, adding a touch of sweetness and refinement. Her right hand gently holds a fresh coconut, while her left hand holds a purple straw, ready or in the process of sipping coconut juice. Her movements are natural and relaxed, her fingers long and slender, and her nails neatly trimmed. Behind her is a black-and-white striped beach mat with a simple and powerful pattern, serving as a visual support to stabilize the composition. The foreground focuses on the coconut in her hand, which is firmly held by both hands, serving as an important visual anchor in the frame. The medium is her complete figure from waist to head, with some beach mats extending to create spatial layering. The background is blurred blue sea, with gentle waves gently lapping the shore. In the distance, a blurry brownish-yellow reef outline appears, and the sky appears in a pale gray-blue tone, suggesting it might be cloudy or early morning or evening. The overall environment is peaceful and open. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the main figure occupying the center right of the frame, gazing directly at the camera, creating a strong sense of interaction and immersion. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a soft, diffused light effect, without strong shadows, creating a fresh, pure, and slightly dreamy summer seaside vibe. The overall color scheme leans toward a soft and warm balance—white, beige, navy blue, and black stripes intertwine, with purple straws as the only bright accent, neither out of place nor visually interesting. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if taken with a daily phone or small camera, with slight noise and natural color saturation, preserving a lifelike warmth rather than excessive post-processing artistry, creating a romantic atmosphere of \"casual shots yet full of stories.\" The entire scene conveys youth, freedom, comfort, and the beauty of nature, like a carefree afternoon enjoying a moment of tranquility and sweetness in the sunshine and sea breeze.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
