        {
          "id": "krea2-a1820ebe1fff69cd7c0fdd39",
          "alias": "单女米T恤镜前俏皮站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie, wearing a light beige sleeveless sports tank top that hugs her figure and outlines a slender waistline and a healthy physique. She pairs it with dark brown high-waisted tight sweatpants that are slim and smooth, accentuating her leg lines. Her left hand naturally hangs at her waist, fingers lightly resting on her waistband, while her right hand steadily holds up a phone for mirror selfies. The phone case features the classic Hello Kitty pattern, with a striking and cute red bow, and the phone's camera module clearly visible. On her wrist, she wears a white smart wristband and a colorful beaded bracelet, with two stacked silver necklaces hanging around her neck: a simple cross pendant, and another adorned with a round metal badge. Her earlobes are adorned with delicate stud earrings, and her nails are painted with shiny purple nails. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the painting, composed in medium to near close shots. The background is the indoor environment, with a light wood grain wall on the left and a glass door with a dark metal frame on the right. The door is inlaid with geometric lattice windows, through which soft and diffused outdoor light can be faintly visible, creating a hazy, blurred background effect that makes the subject stand out even more. The foreground is guided by the visual focal point of the phone screen, hand movements, and some clothing textures; the middle ground features the torso and clothing details; and the background creates a sense of spatial depth through door frames and walls. The overall light and shadow are soft and even, forming a natural transition between light and dark, without strong shadows, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The color palette mainly features warm brown, off-white, and dark brown, accented with colorful elements from the phone case. The overall atmosphere combines the relaxed and casual feel of daily life with the artistic beauty of fashionable dressing, presenting a natural, youthful, and energetic selfie scene. It seems to capture a moment of ordinary afternoon relaxation at home, retaining a sense of life while maintaining refined details, showcasing exceptional personal charm and confident posture in an ordinary setting.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
