        {
          "id": "krea2-fbbda4593b629fda2beac341",
          "alias": "单女床自拍",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman adds an unintentional sense of laziness and authenticity. The overall makeup is light yet highly expressive, as if just awakening from the morning tranquility, carrying a lingering sleepiness and innocence. She wore a simple off-white spaghetti strap spaghetti strap top, made of soft and skin-friendly fabric that revealed subtle wrinkles and natural textures in light under the light. On her chest were two layered silver necklaces—one a slender chain, the other a delicate heart-shaped pendant engraved with a clear brand logo, creating a richly layered visual focal point around her neck. The background is a cozy indoor environment, with a bed covered with pristine white sheets behind it. The headboard is light beige or cream-toned, with clean, modern lines; On the right, a drawn gold or champagne-colored curtain can be faintly seen, its vertical folds creating a warm metallic texture under the light, adding spatial depth and a luxurious atmosphere to the scene. The entire composition uses a close-up selfie perspective, with the main figure occupying the left center of the frame, the head slightly tilted, while the right arm and hand naturally extend to the right edge of the frame, creating visual balance. The lighting and shadow processing is extremely delicate, with the main light source coming slightly above the front of the figure, creating a three-dimensional and layered texture. The background lighting is relatively soft and slightly dim, highlighting the brightness and clarity of the main subject. The overall atmosphere is warm, quiet, and private, carrying a strong sense of everyday life and personal emotional expression, as if capturing a moment in a private space, full of youthful energy and sentiment. The image quality closely resembles the realism of amateur phone photography, with moderate color saturation and rich details yet naturalness, presenting an artistic beauty that is both fashionable and approachable, allowing people to feel the character's inner gentleness and confidence.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
