        {
          "id": "krea2-5a50068fa252284da3170e36",
          "alias": "单女长裤城市冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a bright yellow bench, carefully styled in a side-parted look, with exquisite makeup, slightly tilting her head to gaze out into the camera, her expression revealing a cold elegance and confidence typical of urban fashion. She wore a highly designed red beaded top, made of sheer sheer fabric adorned with intricate red crystal beads, outlining intricate patterns like a spider web, dotted with several three-dimensional red spider decorations, creating both visual impact and a hint of mystery; She paired the bottom with high-waisted burgundy velvet wide-leg pants. The fabric was thick and soft, with pleats naturally draping down. The cuffs revealed her slender wrists, and she wore a simple silver bracelet and earrings, blending luxury, sexiness, and street art elements. In the foreground, she leans against a bench, her legs long and slender, and the hem of her skirt naturally draping over the edge of the bench, forming a gentle visual guideline. The medium focuses on her upper body and clothing details, especially the beaded spider web structure on her chest, which shines brilliantly under the light and becomes a visual focal point. The background is a graffiti-covered wall, colorful and boldly brushed, mainly black, orange, and red. Faintly visible letters like \"DOCTOR\" and \"SS\" along with abstract graphics create a strong street culture atmosphere, sharply contrasting with the characters' exquisite and luxurious attire and enhancing the visual tension. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, body slightly tilted, and the diagonal lines formed by the bench's diagonal lines and legs to enhance the sense of dynamism. In terms of light and shadow, the background graffiti wall is in a slightly darker shaded area, highlighting the subject through contrast of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere presents a contradictory aesthetic—glamour and roughness, refinement and rebellion, classical and modernity coexist. It combines the dramatic tension of a high-end fashion shoot with the realism and life of everyday shooting. The color palette is dominated by rich red tones, complemented by bright yellow seats and colorful graffiti as a backdrop, creating a strong visual impact and immersive atmosphere. The visuals are full of narrative and emotional resonance. It feels like telling a story about identity, style, and belonging to the city.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
