        {
          "id": "krea2-72df952c0740d20a3de98665",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园注视",
          "prompt": "In a corner of a park bathed in gentle dusk, a woman wore a light, flowing off-white spaghetti strap long dress, embroidered with several pale gold floral patterns on the hem, faintly visible in the sunlight, as if carrying the breath of a gentle breeze. She leaned slightly back on a dark brown wooden bench, gently swaying with her movements, adding a touch of liveliness and elegance. It feels as if a silent exchange is taking place with the viewer, conveying youthful vitality and inner tranquility and joy. The background is a vague yet layered lush green forest, with branches and leaves forming a mottled halo in the backlight. On the far left, a classical black wrought iron street lamp can be seen, its outline faintly visible against the blurred background, adding a retro romantic atmosphere and spatial depth to the scene. In the foreground, the curved armrests and wooden slats of the bench are cut into the scene with sharp, clear lines, not only guiding the gaze to the figures but also enhancing the stability and realism of the composition. The entire frame uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figures appear taller and more approachable, while the trees in the background and the sky form a broad visual extension. The light and shadow are handled with delicate and natural tones, edges shimmering with gold but avoiding harsh shadows, creating an overall hazy, poetic, and slightly film-textured warm atmosphere. The colors are mainly earth tones and plant greens, creating a harmonious and unified yet layered visual experience. The entire image radiates beautiful moments casually captured in daily life, like an old film camera shot under the afternoon sun. It features slight grainy noise and soft focus effects, preserving the warmth of real life while possessing the refined beauty of artistic photography, conveying a tranquil, free, and vibrant summer afternoon mood—a carefree moment belonging to the city's park, the gentlest memory frame, making one stop and gaze as if hearing the rustling of leaves. Feel the comfort of a gentle breeze and the quiet flow of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
