        {
          "id": "krea2-616d5bba2ede1999c91494f1",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫楼梯站立",
          "prompt": "A youthful Dongya stands on the outdoor campus staircase, wearing a simple and fresh white short-sleeved shirt in a school uniform, with a blue round school emblem embroidered on the chest pocket and a black pleated short skirt. The overall color palette is mainly fresh and natural white, black, and gray, complemented by vibrant colors from background greenery, creating a clean, fresh, and vibrant campus atmosphere; The atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and full of youthful vitality, combining the casual realism of daily life with subtle traces of delicate artistic photography, as if capturing an unintentional moment after school or during recess, evoking carefree student days and fond memories of youth; The visual guide line is formed by diagonal railings, forming a narrative rhythm of \"guide first—then focus\"; The entire image presents high definition and delicate image quality similar to professional camera shooting, but in light and shadow handling and composition rhythm, it retains the natural, unartificial beauty typical of everyday amateur equipment. It is neither overly sharp nor overly soft, perfectly balancing realism and artistic expression, allowing viewers to feel the purity and beauty of youth while also sensing the subtle emotional fluctuations and life atmosphere behind the scenes.",
