        {
          "id": "krea2-7dc753ffc51242b0c7dfaa0f",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣厨房坐指向",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by a white ceramic sink, her makeup delicate and soft, displaying an unintentional elegance and composure in everyday life. She wore an off-white strapless top layered over a loose black knit cardigan. The fabric was soft and comfortable, with sleeves casually rolled up to reveal slender arm lines. The overall outfit was simple yet stylish, creating a warm atmosphere for home life. Her hands gently cupped the water flowing from the faucet. The water was clear and transparent, forming sparkling droplets and splashes at her fingertips. Droplets fell into the sink below, creating ripples and a strong sense of movement. A few plump, bright red strawberries float in the trough, their vibrant and enticing flesh that contrasts with the clear flow, adding a sense of life and visual focal point to the scene. In the foreground are the edge of the sink, flowing water, and scattered strawberries, which together form the most direct visual elements of the painting; The middle shots focus on the woman's body posture, clothing details, and hand movements, forming the core subject of the composition; In the background, there is a light-colored brick wall with clear and natural textures, paired with black metal hooks and hanging wooden signs (engraved with \"Taste Good\"). Next to it is a retro-style off-white coffee machine or blender, topped with a transparent glass jar filled with round cookies, and beside it are two bottles of yellow liquid drinks. The labels are blurred but the colors are warm. Together, these items create a modern, minimalist kitchen or laundry space full of everyday charm. In composition, shoot from a slightly top-down angle, placing the figure slightly to the right center of the frame, using the edge of the sink as a guiding line to naturally extend to the bottom of the frame, creating a stable visual center. Light comes from the left window, creating a soft and layered contrast of light and shadow, while high-light reflections form on the water surface and droplets, enhancing the image's realism and three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly warm white and beige, complemented by black clothing and accented red strawberries. The harmonious color combination creates a bright, fresh, tranquil, and slightly lazy afternoon atmosphere. It combines the delicate texture of artistic photography with the warmth and authenticity of everyday scenes, as if capturing the most touching moment in an ordinary day—the sound of flowing water, the fragrance of strawberries, smiles as before, time gently frozen in this moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
          "_classification": {
            "binding": "f8be9086263a170a1271693fee450a19c745ba1e8007d705a22552f305e6e602",
