        {
          "id": "krea2-60d9cf91bdaa9b269d7e733c",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙雪地困倦坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in the center of a white plush carpet, wearing an off-white strapless mini dress adorned with fine sequins and lace trim. Over it is a fluffy, soft white long-haired fur shawl, paired with transparent crystal high-heeled sandals adorned with sparkling bow decorations. Around her neck is a delicate, dazzling diamond necklace, and delicate tassel earrings at her earlobes. Her makeup is delicate and soft, her posture relaxed yet noble. She crossed her legs, gracefully lifted her right leg, lightly tapped the ground with her left foot, and leaned her body slightly, creating a serene and confident atmosphere. On the left side of the foreground stands a silver Christmas tree covered in thick artificial snow, its branches adorned with sparkling glass beads, silver ribbons, and white spherical decorations, reflecting a dreamy glow under soft light; Nearby, several black-and-white gift boxes printed with the \"CHANEL\" logo are scattered, one of which is tied with a white ribbon, and the brand logo is clearly visible on the edge. The entire composition is dominated by pure white, with layers of white gauze drapes flowing like clouds in the background. Above hangs strings of crystal beaded curtains, which hang from above to the middle of the scene, forming visual guiding lines. Some beaded curtains in the foreground create a blurred effect, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The composition adopts a symmetrical layout slightly to the right center, with the figure as the absolute visual focal point, surrounded by surrounding elements on both sides, forming a stable and dynamic composition. Light comes from the soft light boxes above and in front, evenly bright yet not glaring, making the figure's skin delicate and smooth, fully showcasing the details of clothing and accessories, while creating soft reflections on the ground to enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is filled with luxury, festive and fairy-tale romance, with natural and delicate light and shadow transitions, moderate color saturation to a cool tone, creating a pure, dreamy, and high-end fashion visual experience. It feels like being inside a winter aristocratic party or a Christmas-themed studio, with a strong commercial photography texture and artistic beauty, suitable for fashion posters, holiday promotions, or high-end social platform displays.",
