        {
          "id": "krea2-2750468644f147b8204c5d09",
          "alias": "单女T恤门戏谑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a minimalist, modern Japanese-style room, wearing a light gray loungewear. Her top is a short camisole adorned with metal buttons, paired with matching loose shorts. Her waistline is naturally visible, her skin fair and delicate, and her abdomen reveals a slender waistline. It appears both lazy and authentic. Her right hand holds a soft, fluffy white towel gently over her head, while her left hand hangs naturally or is slightly raised. Her posture is relaxed yet full of tension, her head tilted slightly, and her expression is both calm and slightly teasing. In the foreground are her long legs and the hem of her shorts, with smooth and graceful leg lines; her feet are not in the frame but hint at a standing posture. The medium shots focus on her torso and upper body movements, with clearly visible clothing textures and rich details in the folds and drawstrings of the knitted fabric. The background features a white Japanese-style sliding door or partition wall divided by a black wooden frame. The clean lines create a clean sense of space, and behind the door, a corner of a white sofa or bed can be faintly seen. The soft fabric texture echoes the figure. The composition uses a medium and near portrait shot, with the subject positioned slightly to the center, the body extending diagonally, forming a natural visual guidance path. The lighting in the painting is soft and even, with soft light from the front and side shining on the figure, making the contours clear but not stiff. The shadow transitions are delicate without strong contrast, creating the effect of natural indoor light in the morning or afternoon. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and full of everyday life, with a subtle laziness and sensuality, as if someone has just showered or is tidying up their appearance. The scene is realistic and close to everyday life, yet the posture and lighting effects give it the refined feel of artistic photography. The color palette mainly consists of cool gray and pure white, harmoniously unified for a premium feel and immersive visual experience. The images present a realistic texture reminiscent of \"amateur equipment shooting,\" but through careful composition and lighting control, the emotional expression and narrative depth are intensified, making the characters both intimate and dramatic, as if capturing a fleeting moment of life, yet imbued with a cinematic serene beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
