        {
          "id": "krea2-97ae6638ab00a1cddc886ed7",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙雪地困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, her skin fair and delicate like porcelain, appearing even more pure and flawless under cool blue-green light and shadow; She wore a light, flowing light blue spaghetti strap dress with subtle pleats and a cinched waist, revealing her slender collarbones and back lines. She leaned elegantly against the edge of the white bathtub, her left hand resting lightly on the edge of the tub, her right hand naturally hanging at her side, her nails neatly trimmed and adorned with delicate pearl decorations, her movements flowing and full of tension. The foreground features abundant blooming blue hydrangeas, white roses, and interspersed with green-leaved ferns. The flowers are rich in layers, petals full, and the colors transition naturally from sky blue to snow white. Some flowers are slightly tilted or partially cover the figure's legs and skirt hem, creating a soft focus blur effect while creating a lush and romantic visual envelopment. The central area is centered around the bathtub, with a smooth, white ceramic surface reflecting soft light. Behind the bathtub is a semi-transparent sheer curtain that emits a hazy blue light. Faintly visible hanging crystal ornaments sway gently in the breeze, enhancing the dreamy atmosphere; The right background is dominated by large monstera leaves, with deep green broad leaves layered in layers, veins distinct, creating a warm and cool contrast and color balance with the flowers on the left. The composition uses the classic three-part layout: the figure is positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, with the gaze naturally guided to the upper left. The bathtub's curve and body curves together form a visual flow path, while the foreground flowers form a natural framed composition, enhancing depth and a sense of envelopment. By using blurred effects of foreground flowers and contrasting the contrast of solid and void with background plants, the lighting and shadow atmosphere is presented as a professional indoor studio lighting effect. The main light source comes from the front left of the figure, while the background light is cool blue, creating a tranquil, cool, and slightly mysterious spa-like or dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color scheme is unified between teal-blue, mint green, and cream white, with moderate saturation and smooth transitions between light and dark, presenting a sense of sophistication and artistic photography quality. The floral texture is clearly distinguishable, the fabric folds naturally according to the body's shape, and the crystal bead string in the background has precisely distributed reflective points. The entire scene resembles a carefully arranged still life, full of cinematic texture and immersive aesthetic experience, as if capturing a private moment belonging to a summer afternoon or rainy morning. It combines the sophistication of a fashion blockbuster with the gentle poetry of everyday life revealed unintentionally.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
