        {
          "id": "krea2-16c4a6fceecab3726f7ff141",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市冷淡倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the red leather seats of a convertible sports car, wearing a simple and stylish white printed camisole top paired with black high-waisted shorts, exuding youthful energy and refined beauty, gently fluttering in the breeze, adding a touch of vitality and freedom; Her posture is relaxed and confident, one foot lightly resting on the edge of the open car door, the other naturally resting beside the seat, both hands gently gripping the inner door handle, the overall look combining modern urban flair with the aesthetic of artistic photography; The foreground focuses on her slender leg lines and the textured details of the interior, including smooth, delicate red leather seats, tech-inspired black door panels and metal trim, and faintly visible purple ambient light strips along the door edges. These elements together create a strong visual layering and sense of spatial depth; The middle view features the main contour of her body and the partial structure of the vehicle, such as the roof bracket, seat backs, and the design of the inner doors, forming a natural visual flow path; The background features a thick wall of green plants and reddish-brown flower bed fences rendered with blurred greenery. The blurred greenery creates a tranquil and vibrant outdoor environment, while also emphasizing the prominence of the main figures and vehicles; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward view, cleverly using the lines of the car body and the curvature of the seats to form a framed composition, placing the figure at the visual center. The shallow depth of field effect further compresses the background space, fully focusing the viewer's attention on the character's expressions, expressions, and body language; The lighting is soft and even, with diffused natural daylight outlining the delicate texture of her skin and the texture and folds of her clothes. The transition of shadows is natural and natural, giving the scene a warm and authentic atmosphere; The color scheme is striking yet harmoniously unified. The bright red interior contrasts sharply with the black body, while her black-and-white clothing balances the overall visual tension with neutral tones. The green vegetation in the background provides a natural cool accent, making the red theme stand out even more; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a lifestyle aesthetic that is both modern luxury and relaxed and pleasant, as if capturing a leisurely moment with the perfect afternoon sun and gentle breeze. It symbolizes high-end automotive culture while conveying the character's inner ease and composure. The entire image exudes a strong artistic photography vibe blended with real life scenes, like a professional photographer using a high-end digital camera to capture moments under natural light, with a delicate and lifelike texture. It possesses cinematic narrative depth and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
