        {
          "id": "krea2-ea551360181fef04d0732d8c",
          "alias": "单女沙发坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a pure white sofa, draped in a fluffy, soft light blue and white plush hooded blanket, with the brim trimmed with three-dimensional white fur balls. The white sofa in the background has clean and smooth lines, with a full and rounded backrest and cushion. On the right side, a corner of white bedding or carpet can be faintly seen, making the overall space clean and free of clutter. Light softly diffuses from the left front, creating a natural transition between light and dark; the plush surface reflects delicate highlights, and shadows are soft and not abrupt; The overall color palette is mainly pure white, light blue, and milky white, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere like sunlight streaming through a window on a winter afternoon. The texture is as delicate as film reels, with a slight soft-focus effect. The emotions are gentle and sweet, with a hint of shyness and curiosity, like a girl just finishing a nap or enjoying some solitude. The whole scene is full of life and artistic beauty, like a daily portrait shot with amateur equipment yet highly professional, rich in details without clutter, transitioning to the background sofa silhouette. Step by step, it creates a comfortable and secure spatial experience.",
