        {
          "id": "krea2-0ee49e70f99785a18eedc849",
          "alias": "单女白礼服酒店困倦倚靠持书",
          "prompt": "A graceful woman wore an elegant and exquisite white strapless gown. The upper part featured a sparkling sequin design that reflected a delicate and dreamy luster under the light. The hem naturally fell to the ankles to fit her figure, and the side slits cleverly revealed the leg lines. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the front slightly right, while subtle highlights are created at the armrest and skirt edges. The background uses soft focus blur techniques to enhance the subject's prominence; The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, carrying the luxury of a high-end hotel or private banquet hall. The main color palettes are warm gold, cream white, and deep blue, creating a quiet, noble, and slightly private nighttime scene; The visual style leans toward professional studio or high-end fashion magazine shoots, featuring cinematic-grade lighting and post-production color grading, as if capturing an elegant woman in a moment at an important occasion. It combines the warmth of everyday life with the refinement of artistic creation, perfectly blending realism with idealized aesthetics.",
