        {
          "id": "krea2-9347d5b0d590bc331bc638b9",
          "alias": "单女人鱼黑礼服酒店困倦",
          "prompt": "A graceful woman wore a fitted black deep V-neck mermaid evening gown, with delicate straps adorned with delicate pearl chains. Her right hand rested lightly on the armrest of a vintage brown leather sofa, while her left hand naturally rested at her waist, her posture graceful and graceful, displaying a noble and elegant demeanor; In the background is a luxurious indoor space, with a giant crystal chandelier suspended high on the left. The lamp body is composed of countless sparkling crystal beads and warm yellow bulbs, emitting a hazy and dreamy golden halo that creates a beautiful bokeh blur effect in the painting, creating a romantic and enchanting atmosphere; On the right is a dark wooden partition wall with geometric circular hollow patterns, where light and shadow cast warm, soft mottled light through the holes, adding depth to the space; In the distance, a few dark seats, stepped floors, and faint external streetlights or window reflections suggest this is a nighttime high-end hotel lobby, private club, or fine dining room; In the foreground is a richly textured brown leather sofa, its smooth surface reflecting ambient light, forming a sharp contrast with the figure's black dress; The entire composition uses a medium to close-up portrait composition, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center. Diagonal lines (such as sofa armrests and background wall structures) guide the viewer's attention to the core of the character; The use of lighting is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the front and above, complemented by a background chandelier providing warm-toned ambient light to enhance the atmosphere. The figure's back and skirt edges retain moderate shadows to enhance the sense of depth; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is rich and warm, full of cinematic texture and high-end fashion vibes, presenting a nightlife aesthetic that is both mysterious and enchanting; The colors of the painting are mainly black, gold, and brown. The black gown sets a calm tone, while the golden chandelier and warm brown sofa create a warm sense of luxury, creating a strong visual contrast yet harmonious unity; The details in the paintings are rich but not overly complicated, with clear focus and just the right amount of background blur, conveying a character image that is understated luxury, independent and confident, and highly artistically expressive; The entire image seems to have come from a professional studio or high-end commercial photo shoot, possessing strong visual impact and emotional appeal, evoking elegant moments of urban nightlife or the opening moments of an important social event.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
