        {
          "id": "krea2-14bc4bd63828ace7379596fa",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫高塔严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a refined vintage-style collegiate outfit with an off-white turtleneck shirt underneath with pleated cuffs, a brown vest-style dress that reached her knees, a matching bow decoration at the waist, and a small, delicate round badge embroidered on the chest pocket. The overall color scheme was warm and soft, presenting a classic combination of cream brown and off-white, full of artistic retro vibe. Behind it is a grand classical building facade, with beige stone arched doors and windows on the left. The window frames are beautifully lined, and the glass reflects the pale blue tones of the sky; On the right stands a white openwork carved clock tower, its surface woven from intricate geometry and vine patterns, with intricate details that create a visual balance that echoes the left side of the building. The stone steps extend upward from the bottom of the painting, progressing layer by layer. The material is light gray-brown marble with clearly visible grain. The staircase edges feature classical carved railings, with rounded capitals and smooth handrail lines, enhancing the sense of depth and solemn atmosphere of the scene. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the visual focus. The background buildings and stairs form a strong perspective guideline, naturally guiding the viewer's gaze toward the main subject; At the same time, symmetrical elements on both sides of the building create a sense of stability, but the figure's tilted body posture and raised hand gestures break symmetry, infusing the painting with dynamic vitality. The light comes from scattered light on cloudy days, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a peaceful, cool, and warm atmosphere; The sky appears grayish-white, suggesting cloudy or thin cloudy conditions, giving the overall tone warm gray and earth tones to enhance the calm texture of the composition. The color saturation in the image is moderately low, emphasizing realism rather than excessive rendering, presenting a delicate texture reminiscent of everyday smartphone photography. The details are rich yet natural, like a snapshot of life casually captured, yet the characters' postures and the combination of environment give it a special sense of poetry and storytelling.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
