        {
          "id": "krea2-53d5493ced083ae18a8d64a0",
          "alias": "单女制服教室害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A female student sits on a somewhat worn wooden chair in the classroom, dressed in a soft-toned Japanese school uniform style, paired with a light gray knit cardigan, lined with a delicate white collar and a sailor-collared shirt with a delicate four-leaf clover embroidery. She wears a light purple satin bow at the chest and a pleated short skirt in the same color, presenting a soft, fresh, and slightly collegiate visual effect; Her fingertips curled slightly, her movements playful yet unintentional, her expression gentle yet slightly shy, as if immersed in her own little world, forming a subtle emotional exchange with the audience; In the foreground is an old-fashioned metal-framed wooden chair with a warm orange-brown sheen, with slight wear and mottled textures left by time. The edges of the metal stand show slight rust. In the composition, the chair occupies the lower third of the frame, serving as a visual guide to draw the viewer's attention to the main figure. The medium shot focuses on the girl's upper body and posture. The texture of the garment is delicate and soft, the knit texture is clearly visible, the skirt's pleats are layered, and light and shadow create a gentle transition on the garment; The background is the classroom window area, where the light outside is bright but softened. Natural light streaming in creates a hazy atmosphere. The window frame lines are simple, and a light green curtain hangs by the window, gently brushed by the breeze. On the right side, a deep blue backpack hangs on the chair's back, adding a touch of everyday life. The entire composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position. Using shallow depth of field to blur background details, light mainly comes from the window in the upper right, softly and evenly casting light and shadow on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. At the same time, subtle shadows are cast on the folds of clothing and the edge of the chair, enhancing the sense of depth. The colors are mainly low-saturation gray, white, and pale purple, complemented by contrasts of warm yellow and cool blue backgrounds. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, healing, and full of nostalgic and artistic vibe of youthful campus life. Like a daily photo taken with amateur equipment, it possesses the delicate texture and emotional tension of professional photography. The image conveys a gentle, innocent, and slightly lazy afternoon feeling, as if time stands still at this moment, allowing one to feel the unique sweetness and tranquility of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
