        {
          "id": "krea2-528d22c05cfbbe18cb9f11bb",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服博物馆困倦注视",
          "prompt": "Her fingers were long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed. On her ring finger was a ring-shaped intricately designed floral design, with a deep sapphire set in the center, surrounded by a ring of dazzling diamonds. The earrings trembled with the slightest movement of her head, sparkling in the light; A slender silver chain necklace faintly visible around her neck, her collarbones gracefully lined, echoing the curve of the collar at the chest; She wore a high-quality, deep blue sleeveless satin gown, with fabric as smooth as satin, a subtle sheen reflected on the surface, and an asymmetrical diagonal collar that naturally draped down to the chest, creating a soft pleated layering; On her wrist are two stacked silver bracelets: one with hollowed-out carved designs, the other with a three-dimensional structure of pavé diamonds. Under the light, the two complement each other, highlighting the slenderness of her wrist and the luxury of her jewelry; The entire composition uses compact medium and close-up shots, using shallow depth of field techniques to completely blur the background into a deep dark tone, preserving only the hazy transitions at the edges of the figures' outlines, enhancing the subject's presence; guiding the viewer's gaze deeper into the layers, ultimately focusing on the beauty of jewelry details; The use of lighting is extremely meticulous, using soft side backlighting. The light source comes from the upper left side of the image, creating a strong mirror reflection on the jewelry surface that sharply contrasts with the dark background; The overall atmosphere presents a serene and mysterious sense of sophistication, combining cinematic dramatic tension with the gentle texture of classical oil paintings, as if stepping into a dark corner of a private dinner or art gallery, where subtle fragrances intertwine with the cool luster of jewelry, creating a visual experience that is both real and slightly dreamy; The color palette is dominated by deep blue, black, and silver-white, creating a harmonious beauty with warm and cool contrasts; The image quality is delicate and lifelike, as if shot with a top-tier camera, featuring professional studio-level lighting and post-processing effects. The overall style combines the sophistication of a fashion blockbuster with the deep emotional expression of an artistic portrait, allowing viewers to feel an inner strength and emotional resonance beneath understated luxury.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
