        {
          "id": "krea2-bd876e6b7256abb7b8dce094",
          "alias": "单女樱花困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a gorgeous red Hanfu gracefully leans against the trunk of a sturdy ancient tree, wearing a delicate blue and gold floral crown hairpiece. She turned sideways to look back at the camera, her skin fair and delicate. Her Hanfu was made of deep red satin, with wide, flowing sleeves. The cuffs and waist were embroidered with white and light purple entwined floral patterns, layered and distinct. The fabric was delicate and featured a semi-transparent tulle design, which revealed a hazy texture under the light. Her right hand gently stroked the tree trunk, while her left hand naturally rested on the branch. Her fingertips were slender, her nails neatly trimmed, her posture relaxed yet dignified. In the foreground, a few blurred green leaves and branches can be seen, forming a natural blurred frame that guides the viewer to focus on the main figure; In the middle is the trunk of an ancient tree she leans on, with rough grain and a sense of the passage of time. The bark cracks are clearly visible, forming a sharp contrast with her soft clothing; The background features a sky full of blooming white flowers, resembling pear blossoms or cherry blossoms, with dense petals that blur into a dreamy, soft-focused light patch, creating a romantic and poetic spring atmosphere. The entire composition uses an inclined composition, with the figure's body extending diagonally, forming strong visual support with the tree trunk. Both the background and foreground are soft-focused to highlight the main subject. Light comes from the upper left, soft natural light in the early morning or afternoon, creating warm highlights and subtle shadows that enhance the image's sense of depth and depth. The overall color scheme is dominated by warm red and cool white, with strong contrasts yet harmonious unity, creating a tranquil, beautiful, and slightly melancholic emotional atmosphere in classical Eastern aesthetics. The visuals are full of cinematic texture, like a work blending classical meticulous brushwork with modern photographic art. It combines the realism of everyday amateur equipment with the artistic depth of professional post-production color grading and composition, allowing one to feel the eternal artistic mood of an Eastern beauty as time flows.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
