        {
          "id": "krea2-1a9133b2faa8c897af42ec74",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣公寓沉思站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a white metal railing outdoors, her body slightly turned and her head elegantly looking back at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. She wore a loose light gray-white knit cardigan made of soft and fluffy fabric, with delicate ribbed patterns at the cuffs and hem. The collar was slightly open to reveal the white turtleneck sweater underneath, giving off a warm yet casual look. She pairs a classic plaid skirt with a mix of deep blue and purple-red, with neat hems that contrast sharply with sheer black tights. On her feet, she wears brown suede loafers with rounded toes and low heels, giving the overall look a Japanese-style campus or light collegiate style. She crosses her arms over her chest, her posture relaxed yet dignified, her legs standing naturally and her left foot slightly leaning forward, her body steady and balanced, showcasing a beauty that blends youthful energy with serene temperament. The foreground features a blue synthetic floor, possibly part of the school playground or public activity area, with a smooth and flat surface with a subtle reflective texture; The middle ground features a white metal railing running through the painting. The vertical railing lines are simple and rhythmic, visually forming a guiding line and creating a contrast between solid and void with the architectural structure in the background; The background consists of two parts: on the left is the blurred outline of modern urban skyscrapers, with glass curtain walls reflecting soft daylight; on the right are dense green trees with lush branches and leaves gently swaying in the breeze, with dappled light and shadow filtering through the gaps between the leaves. The distant sky displays a subtle grayish-white tone, with no intense direct sunlight but even, soft diffused light enveloping the entire scene, creating a peaceful and gentle atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait angle, with the person positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to extend the background elements and creating visual balance. Light comes from the front slightly above, creating subtle shadows on her legs and the folds of her clothes, enhancing the sense of dimension. The atmosphere of the painting is quiet, fresh, and slightly nostalgic, as if frozen in a campus corner under the gentle afternoon sunshine, combining the everyday warmth of daily life with the unique innocence and poetry of youth. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, without strong contrasts, emphasizing soft focus and transparency, presenting an overall film-like warm, slightly grainy texture of the image, as if shot in natural light with an entry-level digital camera. It preserves the intimacy and subtle beauty of real-life scenes rather than overly polished commercial films, full of story and emotional resonance, making one imagine her mood and story background at that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
