        {
          "id": "krea2-2c3c2b3ca0db4e190b312c77",
          "alias": "单女短裙森林冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a lush forest path, dressed in a delicate white lace two-piece set. The top is off-shoulder, with layers of ruffled leaf and delicate embroidered floral patterns on the cuffs and neckline. The bottom is a short skirt made from the same fabric, with a puffy, multi-layered hem and naturally draped waistbands. The overall style is fresh and sweet, full of summer pastoral vibes; It adds a touch of lazy and natural beauty; She turned slightly, her head gently tilted, her expression calm and tinged with thought. The watermelon's skin was green, the flesh bright red like clouds, and the juice was plump and tempting, shining with a crystal-clear luster in the sunlight. In the foreground, the lower half of her body and the edge of her skirt are visible; the ground is damp soil and scattered stones, faintly glowing; The middle shot shows her complete body contour, clearly visible from shoulder to knee, with delicate folds and subtle changes in light and shadow on the clothing; The background is composed of dense green leaves with rich layers. After blurring, soft, hazy green light spots are created, creating a dreamlike depth effect, with faint distant outlines of rocks or streams visible; The entire composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the main figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, and the line of sight naturally extends to the upper right of the frame, enhancing spatial sense and visual flow; Light comes from the upper left, creating a warm and even highlight, while maintaining subtle transitional layers in the shadows, enhancing the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and healing, filled with the lazy and pleasant mood of a summer afternoon. The colors are mainly fresh mint green, tender white, and watermelon pink, with moderate saturation and a slight contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a scene that is both realistic and slightly fairy-tale-like; The images present a high-resolution texture reminiscent of professional camera shooting, with rich details, clearly visible fabric fibers, and a natural blurred background. It has a strong cinematic feel and artistic photography style, resembling a carefully composed outdoor portrait piece that conveys a beautiful atmosphere of youth, freedom, and coexistence with nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
