        {
          "id": "krea2-2cc03f04ecf541de57ff61bc",
          "alias": "单女旗袍竹林严肃站立展示",
          "prompt": "Her overall makeup is fresh and natural, like uncut jade. She wore a modified qipao made of deep blue silk, with a stand-up collar that highlighted Eastern charm. The fabric's surface was delicately pleated and interwoven with light and shadow, showcasing the silk's unique smoothness and drape. Layered with a bright red lace long-sleeve shawl, the intricate and delicate texture blooms like a flower between the shoulders and arms, creating a striking color contrast and material collision, preserving traditional elements while infusing modern fashion. Her hands are elegantly folded in front of her abdomen, her nails neatly trimmed and painted in light pink, her posture composed and restrained, exuding a calm and confident aura. In the foreground, the edge of the white stone bench she sits on is simple and clean, visually transitioning with the lush green grass behind her; The middle scene is her courtyard environment. On the left, you can see a tall bamboo or palm tree trunk with clear bark grain. Beside the tree stands a wooden plaque engraved with golden calligraphy, with simple and elegant handwriting; On the right side, dense green grass and jagged Taihu stones are stacked together. The stone's surface is mottled and rough, creating a visual tension of both strength and softness with the tender blades. The background is a typical classical Jiangnan architecture, with black-lacquered wooden window lattices decorated with meandering geometric patterns. The window lattices are intricately hollowed out, faintly revealing the lush greenery outside. Simple lanterns hang under the eaves, and the walls are plain white with clean lines, giving the overall structure a steady yet rhythmic feel. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, facing the camera directly, creating a strong sense of interaction and emotional connection; Using shallow depth of field blur to handle background details makes the subject stand out more; The horizontal extension of the painting leaves ample blank space, balanced left and right spaces, and a sky area at the top suggests an open atmosphere. The visual guide lines converge from the crossed of the figure's arms toward the center, while the window lines in the background and plant branches form a natural guiding path, enhancing the depth of the composition. The light is soft and even, like diffused light in the early morning or evening, shining diagonally from the left front of the figure, with natural transitions in the shadows, without any harsh cuts; The overall color scheme is mainly blue and red, complemented by green vegetation and the black-and-white buildings to create a warm and cool contrast, creating a rich Eastern aesthetic atmosphere. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a touch of artistic retro charm. It combines the poetic Zen charm of classical gardens with the fashionable vitality of modern women, presenting a fleeting beauty that feels like a \"time freezes\" moment. It is like a meticulous, richly colored ink figure painting perfectly blending with modern photography, full of storytelling and emotional resonance, evoking the image of a beauty sitting alone in the misty rain of Jiangnan, leisurely and at ease, enjoying peaceful years.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
