        {
          "id": "krea2-718d9bedcfbaf01baa1ff495",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤庭院困倦坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table by the window, wearing a light mint green lace-trimmed camisole that reveals her delicate, fair shoulders, neck, and arms. On her left wrist, she wears a delicate gold bracelet, while her right hand gently holds a glass filled with golden fruit drinks. A black straw is inserted in the cup, her head slightly lowered as she sucks on the straw, her expression serene and gentle, radiating the lazy and pleasant atmosphere of a summer afternoon. In the foreground is a warm natural wood-colored tabletop with natural textures and soft reflectivity, edges covered with off-white velvet fabric or knit mats, adding a warm texture to the scene; The middle ground is the upper part of her body, with smooth lines from her collarbone to elbows covering her temples. The background is blurred with green plants and glass window frames, creating a blurred depth of field. Outside the window, lush trees and faintly visible reflections on the water create a quiet and private atmosphere in a café or courtyard corner; The composition uses a right-right third-division method, with the figure's head positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition. Visual guidance is achieved through clear focus and progressive blurring, with the main figure and drinks deliberately highlighted, and the background heavily blurred to create a \"shallow depth of field\" effect, enhancing spatial depth; Light comes from natural sources on the front side, creating a delicate contrast between light and dark that enhances the sense of depth; The overall color palette is centered around fresh and natural green, warm wood tones, pale pink skin, and bright yellow drinks. The color saturation is moderate, creating a gentle, healing, and slightly dreamy everyday aesthetic atmosphere. It feels as if shooting with amateur equipment but with precise composition and light control, giving it a professional and delicate feel, evoking a sense of everyday intimacy and an artistic tranquil beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
