        {
          "id": "krea2-efdd76cb29205bd41e0c5044",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙废墟冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the blue-gray tiles of an old Chinese roof ridge, wearing a delicate strapless dress with delicate blue-green floral patterns woven over an off-white base fabric. When she gazes into the camera, she reveals a quiet yet slightly distant expression, as if telling stories accumulated over time; Her left hand rests lightly on the dark wooden floor in front of her, her fingertips painted with bright red nail polish, creating a visual focal point with the overall understated tone. On her wrist is a delicate gold bracelet that glows with a warm metallic sheen under the light; In the foreground is the wooden floor she leans on, with clear wood grain. The surface looks slightly rough from the passage of time, mixed with scattered leaves and dust, hinting at the scene's antiquity and authenticity; The middle features layers of neatly arranged gray-white Chinese tiles, each bearing traces of weathering and fine cracks, giving a sense of historical weight. The edges of the tiles are slightly rounded by rain, and some gaps are scattered with withered yellow leaves; The background features a higher wall structure made of rough cement or brick, with a grayish color and surface covered with peeling marks and mottled stains, enhancing the vintage and ruined aesthetic atmosphere throughout the painting; The composition uses medium to close shots, with the main figure occupying the center-left position of the frame, while repeated geometric lines formed by tiles serve as visual guides, extending into the depth of the background; Light comes from the upper side, representing soft natural light that evenly falls on the skin and clothing of the figure, outlining delicate contours and textures, while creating interplay of light and shadow on the tile surface to enhance the three-dimensional effect; The shadowed areas are concentrated behind the figure and on the ground to avoid overexposure; The overall atmosphere combines classical Eastern charm with modern fashion, creating a \"New Chinese Style\" aesthetic concept—preserving the poetic charm of traditional architecture while incorporating the softness and confidence of contemporary women; The color scheme is mainly cool gray and white, accented with blue-green flowers and red dots on nail polish, creating visual balance and emotional tension; The image texture is delicate and authentic, with rich details. It combines studio-level professionalism with the realistic graininess and slight noise typical of everyday amateur equipment, making the entire image full of life and artistic appeal. It feels like a carefully composed portrait photograph, capturing a tranquil afternoon and a fleeting moment on the rooftop of an ancient building.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
