        {
          "id": "krea2-2ead2981ce14b6778a5061fb",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩自信坐",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman sits sideways on a pebble beach by the riverbank, wearing a light, flowing white jacquard long dress. The fabric has a delicate floral sheen, and under soft natural light, it reveals a warm silky texture. Her fingertips are painted with light green nail polish, her hands naturally folded over the armrests of a black folding chair, her posture relaxed and composed, her expression calm and focused, as if immersed in the lakeside thoughts at dusk; In the foreground is a folding chair with a black metal frame and natural wood armrests. The fabric upholstery is clearly visible, and the leg structure is simple and practical, forming a visual anchor point with the figure; In the middle of the scene, the river winds gently, its surface as calm as a mirror, reflecting the hazy outlines of the sky and the vegetation along the shore. The riverbank is paved with pebbles of various sizes and mottled colors, with rough and natural textures that add a rugged, earthy texture to the scene. The background features rolling lush forests, with rich layers of trees; nearby branches and leaves are dense, while in the distance, they gradually blend into the misty twilight, creating an atmosphere of depth and tranquility; The entire composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the main figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the canvas, creating a natural flow of visual flow; The camera angle slightly looks down, giving the character a calmer feel, while cleverly incorporating ground details at the bottom of the frame to enhance realism; Light comes from the warm evening sun diagonally above the right side, creating a natural transition of light and shadow in three-dimensional light and shadow effects. The folds of the garment produce subtle reflections, highlighting material details; The background and foreground are in a state of shallow depth blur, highlighting the main subject while reinforcing spatial layering; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, full of poetry and Zen charm. It combines the independent temperament of modern urban women with the distant mood of natural landscapes. The color palette mainly features warm white, gray-brown, and dark green, with low saturation, presenting a low-key, restrained image style with a slightly vintage film texture. It feels like a high-resolution portable camera capturing a real moment at sunset, combining the compositional beauty of artistic photography with the warmth and authenticity of everyday shooting, conveying a healing mood of escaping the noise and enjoying a moment of solitude.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
