        {
          "id": "krea2-50256c8c51186caf21746c0f",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands alone in front of a weathered old village wall, dressed in a simple off-white short-sleeved top and light blue denim shorts, with pure white socks naturally draped down her chest, adding a touch of softness and playfulness. She stands just below the center of the frame, becoming the visual focal point without feeling abrupt, blending seamlessly with the background. In the foreground are scattered dead leaves and mottled soil on the ground. A few rays of sunlight filtered through the gaps between the branches above, creating soft, scattered patches of light. The interplay of light and shadow highlighted the outlines of her ankles and calves, adding layers and a sense of authenticity to the scene. In the middle is the gray-brown old wall, whose surface is covered with fine cracks and peeling marks from the passage of time. In some places, moss and water stains can be seen. There is a noticeable gap in the lower left of the wall, revealing the rough brick and stone structure inside. These details not only enrich the texture of the painting but also hint at the passage of time and the traces of natural forces. The background is an old tiled roof covered with thick green vines and weeds. The tiles are layered and some are broken and slanted, roots stubbornly poking out from the cracks, twisting and clinging. The lush greenery is full of wild vitality, forming a stark contrast with the weathered walls below. The composition uses a classic central composition, with the figure standing in the center, forming a stable and balanced composition. At the same time, vertical lines on the walls and horizontal extensions of the roof are used to enhance the sense of spatial depth. The visual guide line extends down from the edge of the eaves at the top to the top of the character's head, then naturally transitions from the character's body outline to the shadowed area on the ground, guiding the viewer's gaze sequentially through the entire scene. In terms of lighting and shadow, the light comes from the upper left of the figure, soft but not glaring, creating a clear sense of light and shadow on her, especially the shoulders, arms, and legs, where natural shadow transitions are created. The light and shadow on the walls appear mottled and flickering, enhancing the realism and drama of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, nostalgic, and poetic, combining the simple realism of daily life with a touch of artistic touch. It resembles a documentary photo taken with amateur equipment but full of storytelling. The tone leans toward natural and cool tones, emphasizing texture and light and shadow changes, conveying an emotional tone of loneliness and tenderness accumulated over time. It makes one imagine the woman's current state of mind and the story behind it. The entire scene is full of the atmosphere of life and humanistic care, neither deliberately staged nor completely casually candid. Rather, it lies somewhere in between, capturing the profound emotions and aesthetic value contained in an ordinary moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
