        {
          "id": "krea2-6bdf7cb2909491ac27b6ca4f",
          "alias": "单女黑外套海滩困倦坐",
          "prompt": "On a tropical beach at night, a woman sits upright on a wooden swing. She wears a black velvet baseball jacket paired with white skinny jeans and a gray inner layer. Her outfit is simple, fashionable, yet relaxed. Around her neck is a delicate and delicate silver bow necklace. Under warm yellow lighting, her skin looks delicate and fair. In the foreground, the swing's thick hemp rope and wooden seat are clearly visible, with sand grains gently undulating underfoot, creating a realistic tactile feel. In the middle of the frame, the delicate golden beach stretches into the distance, with a folding chair and scattered footprints faintly visible, suggesting someone is pausing to rest; In the background, brightly lit resort-style buildings and towering palm trees hang like stars, while distant trees are outlined by blue neon lights, creating a dreamy atmosphere where warmth and cool intertwine. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical close-up of the figure, with the main subject prominently centered, and the composition layered and rich in depth. The use of light and shadow is highly dramatic, with warm-toned artificial light sources from the front and sides highlighting the character's outline and clothing texture, while retaining natural transitions in background shadows to create a hazy yet warm night atmosphere. Creating emotional resonance. The visual atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, with a hint of lazy comfort, as if time has frozen in this moment, filled with the relaxed joy and self-expression of urban youth vacationing abroad. The colors are mainly warm yellow, deep blue, black, gray, and white, with striking contrasts that are not glaring, presenting a visual experience that is taken with everyday amateur equipment yet possesses professional-grade artistic beauty. This is a film capturing moments of youth, freedom, and beautiful nights, full of life atmosphere and emotional tension, immersing viewers in its gentle and authentic visual storytelling.",
