        {
          "id": "krea2-c0fa6a6366910d9cf860db72",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市温柔站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a vintage iron railing, wearing a pair of slim metal-framed glasses. She wears a simple pure white high-waisted knit cropped top paired with light gray sweatpants, and a casually tied orange thin jacket at the waist creating a striking color contrast. The pleats of the garment are natural and textured; Her arms are gracefully raised above her head, her hands lightly touching the railing, fingers slightly spread, her posture relaxed and full of movement, as if embracing freedom or enjoying a moment of tranquility; In the foreground is a rust-stained dark vertical iron railing, whose rugged texture sharply contrasts with the figure's soft lines, with parts of the railing hidden by the figure's arms, creating a sense of layering; In the background, a warm yellow-toned wooden wall and blurred interior furnishings reveal faint outlines of wine racks, glasses, and bottled liquors, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere amid soft bokeh; The overall composition is a vertical shot in the middle and foreground, with the figure positioned slightly above the center, and the upward extension of the visual scene through the lifting of both hands; Light and shadow come from soft, diffused light from the left front, while subtle shadows on the right side and rear enhance the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and slightly nostalgic, with warm yellow, cream white, and orange tones as the main palette, complemented by the dark blue rust brown of the iron railings, creating a lazy afternoon or dusk vibe with urban bourgeois vibes; The images have cinematic texture and film-grained texture, rich in details without clutter, presenting a style that combines artistic depth with everyday realism. It feels as if a professional photographer has used a high-end camera to shoot under carefully lit indoor lighting, perfectly blending the subject's inner emotions with the ambient atmosphere.",
