        {
          "id": "krea2-8c90543daca66a510fcefb77",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣广场愤怒站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands gracefully sideways in a modern, minimalist indoor corridor, gazing back at the camera with a clean and fresh makeup look. She wore a black-and-white diagonal striped knit off-shoulder top, with a loose cut casually draped over her shoulders, revealing one shoulder and collarbone. The sleeves were voluminous and layered, paired with light-colored shorts that outlined her long, well-proportioned legs. She wore a pair of white platform sandals, with simple uppers and brown soles adding a touch of steadiness. She slung a silver-gray quilted chain square bag across her right shoulder. The bag was delicate and compact, with a shiny metal clasp that reflected a delicate sheen in the light, creating a harmonious look with the overall outfit. The foreground focuses on the details of her slender legs and feet, with the floor made of gray-white marble tiles with natural textures, reflective textures clearly visible, reflecting her light reflection. The medium shot is her complete figure from waist to knees, with her body slightly leaned back, arms naturally bent, and hands gently resting on shoulders, creating a relaxed yet fashionable dynamic aesthetic. The background features a simple off-white wall and a deep black-framed sliding door or cabinet. The wall is clean and unadorned, and the black door frame creates a strong contrast, enhancing the sense of depth and modernity in the space. The composition uses a vertical perspective, with the figures occupying most of the space. The edge of the door frame forms a visual guiding line, and light comes from the soft indoor light source on the left, evenly spreading over the figure, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow. The shadowed areas are soft and not glaring, avoiding overexposure. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, high-end, fashionable, and full of the refined vibe of urban life. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with silver, presenting a calm, restrained yet vibrant visual experience. It resembles a lifestyle aesthetic photo taken with amateur equipment yet full of artistic sensibility—capturing a momentary elegant posture rather than a staged effect. It is authentic and emotional, allowing people to feel the subtle taste and composure revealed in daily life.",
