        {
          "id": "krea2-1fa3d27ae4b6b2137ab3c23e",
          "alias": "单女白礼服酒廊冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully reclined on a modern, white hollowed-out woven lounge chair, her body soft and full of tension, her head slightly turned as if silently telling some inner story; She wore a stunning white strapless gown, adorned with intricate lace embroidery and three-dimensional feather decorations. Every pleat shimmered with a pearl-like luster, creating a dreamlike texture under soft light. The visual guide starts from the edge of the lounge chair and naturally leads to the background through light and shadow transitions; The overall lighting is soft and even, with the main light source coming from the front left, creating a sense of sophistication and depth; The atmosphere is tranquil, noble, with a hint of detachment and mystery, as if you are in a private art gallery or a fashionable photo studio, with no noise and only pure artistic expression; The color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, creating a warm and cool contrast and harmonious unity; The image quality is delicate and lifelike, as if shot in a studio with a professional-grade camera, offering a cinematic feel and a hazy, oil-painterly soft focus effect. Details are rich yet not cluttered, presenting an overall visual experience that combines everyday realism with artistic height, allowing viewers to feel an elegance and serene beauty that transcends time and space.",
