        {
          "id": "krea2-f6c8b560d37f1806f0b125d3",
          "alias": "单女衬衫竹林俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "The overall makeup emphasizes clarity rather than heavy embellishment; Her right hand is gently raised, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light transparent or light pink nail polish, while her left hand rests naturally on the front of her shirt, fingers lightly pinching the edge of the fabric, her posture elegant and full of storytelling; She wears a loose, flowing white Chinese tulle robe, made of light and transparent fabric like cicada wings, printed with intricate bamboo leaf patterns in ink wash style. The lines are simple and lively, naturally folding with the curves of her body. The cuffs are wide and relaxed, and the hem drapes smoothly, creating an atmosphere of \"ethereal elegance\" and \"softness\" in classical Eastern aesthetics; The foreground focuses on the upper body and hand movement details of the figure, using shallow depth of field to blur the background and strengthen the visual focus of the subject; The middle ground area is the transition from the chest to the waist, with rich layers of clothing folds, and light and shadow creating soft contrasts of light and dark on the fabric surface, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality; The background is a pure white or very light gray monochrome wall with no distractions, filling the space only with even, soft diffuse light, creating a clean, ethereal, and tranquil visual environment; The composition uses vertical full-body close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly above center, the head slightly lowered, and the gaze downward, creating a quiet and emotionally charged narrative flow; The overall lighting atmosphere presents a \"soft light studio\" effect, with the main light source coming from a slightly higher angle in front, providing uniform and soft light without strong shadows. The skin and clothing surfaces show delicate highlights, supplemented by slight side backlighting to outline the edges, enhancing three-dimensionality without disrupting the soft tone; The color palette is mainly cool white, accented with a touch of ink-colored bamboo grain, forming a minimalist combination of high-end gray and pure white. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, introspective, and poetic, blending classical Eastern artistic conception with modern aesthetics. It resembles a reinterpretation of an ink wash lady painting in contemporary photography language, combining traditional charm with contemporary fashion. It is suitable for artistic portraits, magazine covers, or high-end commercial advertising scenes. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot in an indoor studio with a professional-grade camera. It possesses cinematic-quality picture quality and emotional expression.",
          "description": "",
