        {
          "id": "krea2-57188ac63fe0520a632bd6d3",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙街道坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully in the soft warm light of the room, her expression serene yet tinged with laziness and confidence. She wore a tight-fitting high-neck white long-sleeve top with delicate fabric that hugged her figure, outlining smooth curves and subtly showing wrinkles and luster under the light; She pairs the lower half with a black short skirt or a long skirt with a slit that falls casually beside the knees, revealing her long legs. The skin on her legs is fair and delicate, and she wears black lace-up over-the-knee socks on her calves. The finely intersecting straps extend from her ankles up to the inner thighs, creating a visually striking line. On the inside of her right leg, a delicate small tattoo pattern is faintly visible, with handwritten elegance resembling a handwritten signature. On her left wrist, she wears a simple black leather watch strap, her right hand resting gently on her knee, fingers naturally relaxed, her posture relaxed yet relaxed. The background features a light beige vertical striped curtain, where sunlight filters through the gaps and casts warm light and shadow streaks behind the walls and figures, creating a rich contrast of light and shadow and a sense of spatial depth; The floor is dark wood, with faint light brown baseboards visible along the edges, adding a touch of steadiness to the composition. The composition uses a slightly slanted rule of thirds, with the main body positioned slightly to the left of the frame, the body facing right but the head slightly turned toward the camera, creating dynamic balance; The foreground focuses on the strap details at her raised knees, legs, and ankles; the middle is where her upper body overlaps with the hem of her skirt; the background is blurred to highlight the subject. The visual guide line consists of her gaze direction, arm posture, and the crossing lines of the leg straps, ultimately stopping at the details of the straps and tattoos. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, resembling the natural light effect of the afternoon sunset or dusk by the window. Light enters diagonally from the left, creating a natural three-dimensional transition between light and shadow; The shadows are soft and not harsh, with warm off-white, cream gold, and deep black tones as the main tones, creating a quiet, private, and slightly artistic atmosphere. It feels like a daily photo taken on a quiet afternoon, with a slight cinematic film graininess and real camera lens distortion. The overall image is full of emotional tension and aesthetic depth, combining fashion and everyday life, making it a beautiful visual work suitable for mobile wallpaper or social media sharing.",
