        {
          "id": "krea2-8d53d57525fd12ca5cde7753",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣客厅冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in the spacious and bright living room of a modern apartment, exuding a calm and confident aura. She wore a simple beige knit cardigan with thick and soft fabric, clearly visible texture, casually draped over to create natural pleats and layers. Underneath, she wore a light brown camisole that outlined her slender shoulders and neck, and wore a delicate butterfly-shaped necklace around her neck, adding a delicate decorative touch. Her hands gently rolled around the sleeves of her cardigan, her posture relaxed and natural, as if she had just woken up from a warm afternoon, enjoying a moment of tranquility. In the foreground is a minimalist light gray fabric sofa with delicate button decorations, paired with matching body cushions. The texture is soft and comfortable, with the edge partially hidden by the figure's body, creating a gentle visual transition. The middle ground features massive floor-to-ceiling glass windows with light wood frames, and heavy gray-blue gradient curtains hang along the windows. The curtains feature delicate vertical stripes that subtly create light and shadow effects under the light. Outside the window is the skyline of city skylines filled with skyscrapers, with clusters of buildings faintly visible in the mist, and distant building silhouettes blurred, creating a sense of depth in urban life. The entire composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. Soft daylight streams through the window, evenly streaming into the room through the glass. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, and light gray, accented by dark brown and gray-blue, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly sophisticated atmosphere. The atmosphere is tranquil yet full of life, featuring a cold, modern urban backdrop while conveying inner peace and composure through the gentle postures and soft lighting of the characters. The overall visual guidance is smooth and natural, ultimately integrating into the cityscape outside the window, forming a spatial narrative logic from near to far, from inside to outside. The visual style leans toward a realistic and delicate everyday photography aesthetic, simulating the slight noise and natural color saturation of amateur equipment shoots, preserving a sense of everyday warmth and realism rather than the flawless perfection of over-retouching or commercial blockbusters, allowing viewers to experience an artistic beauty close to everyday life.",
