        {
          "id": "krea2-10458329b3fdc8c2c88b3378",
          "alias": "单女全裸旗袍小径愤怒倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman wore a refined qipao with a delicate black background and red floral patterns. The fabric was as delicate as velvet, with full, vivid floral patterns and naturally colored edges. She leaned slightly to the side on dark wooden furniture, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Her left hand was interlaced and lightly touched on her wrist. Her long nails were neatly trimmed and painted with a subtle nude pink nail polish. On her wrist was a delicate golden four-leaf clover-shaped bracelet that glowed warmly in the dim light. A few strands fell over her shoulders, and on her right sideburn was a delicate pink peony flower ornament. The petals overlap, echoing the floral patterns on the qipao. Light streams in from the upper left of the painting, forming a warm and bright beam that outlines three-dimensional layers of light and shadow. The background is a deep dark brown curtain or drape, with a blurred texture that almost completely blends into the darkness. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, creating a strong sense of intimacy and immersion. The visual guide lines naturally extend from the light path and the character's arm. The overall tone leans toward warm brown and deep red, creating a strong contrast but not glaring. The clear contrast between light and shadow creates a heavy texture reminiscent of classical oil painting, while also carrying the delicate realism of modern photography. The atmosphere is tranquil, private, poetic, and slightly nostalgic. Like afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattices and shining into the attic of an old house, the scene is filled with Eastern aesthetics and cinematic narrative tension. The images have a film texture, with fine grain and moderate color saturation, presenting a visual effect that is taken with everyday amateur equipment yet possesses professional-level artistic expression.",
