        {
          "id": "krea2-673f93ef0a07cc88d5398b17",
          "alias": "单女绿背心床手持物",
          "prompt": "She wore a lightweight, brightly colored mint green sleeveless top, with the hem naturally draped and tied into a delicate knot, revealing a slender waistline and smooth skin. She paired it with pure white sheer shorts or a skirt, the fabric flowing naturally with the curves of the body. The overall color scheme was fresh and bright, full of vitality like summer morning light. Her right hand elegantly holds a plump, round, evenly colored green apple. The apple's surface is smooth like glaze, with a natural stem that glows gently under the sunlight. The foreground focuses on her long, fair fingers and the delicate texture of the apples, with neatly trimmed nails painted with light pink polish. Her fingertips gently touch the apple skin, and light and shadow on the knuckles create a soft, three-dimensional effect; The center of the shot shows her graceful silhouette from shoulders and neck to waist, with the green top's pleats and smooth skin transitions, highlighting a healthy texture; The background features large areas of softened white curtains or bed sheets, with faint fabric textures that let in soft, diffused sunlight outside, creating a bright, clean, and tranquil atmosphere. On the left edge, another green apple can be seen on a white plate or tabletop, serving as a visual extension. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds and a center-right placement of the figure, with the main body occupying the golden ratio area of the composition, while diagonal arm lines and clothing folds create dynamic balance. Following the apple and hand movements, the overall atmosphere is wrapped in soft colors and light and shadow. In terms of lighting, it uses high-profile natural light shooting, with the light source coming from the upper left window direction. The lighting is uniform and soft, with almost no harsh shadows, enhancing the sense of depth without compromising purity; The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and healing, blending fresh Japanese photo shoots or Korean lifestyle aesthetics. It combines the warmth of everyday life with artistic refinement and emotional tension, as if capturing a tranquil moment of lazy afternoon sunlight filling the room, conveying a healthy, innocent, and natural attitude toward life. The image has moderate saturation, harmonious color contrast, realistic texture like film cameras, and slight grainy noise, simulating the natural sharpness and soft focus effect of ordinary digital cameras or mobile phones. Make the entire image both professional and refined, while closely capturing the beautiful moments of everyday life for ordinary people.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
