        {
          "id": "krea2-3268beb8e92f0af23f333d13",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙窗边冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in the driver's seat of a luxury sports car, wearing a black off-shoulder long-sleeve dress paired with sheer black stockings and delicate lace trim, showcasing a fashionable yet slightly sexy everyday style; Her makeup is delicate and exquisite, revealing a confident and composed expression; Her left hand rests gently on the steering wheel, while her right hand naturally rests at her leg, her posture relaxed yet full of control; The interior features off-white leather seats paired with a black center console, and the steering wheel features a striking yellow lotus emblem to highlight the brand's identity. The car window glass is clear and transparent, reflecting the blurred reflections of other vehicles and lights in the showroom; Enhance visual impact through low-angle shooting; The central view showcases the interior layout and details, including elements such as seats, dashboard, air conditioning vents, and seatbelt buckles; The background is the interior environment of the automobile showroom, with a tall metal roof structure, hanging advertising lightboxes, and faintly visible cars displayed in the distance, creating an atmosphere of a commercial display space; The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the main figure positioned on the right side of the frame. Light and shadow use soft and even indoor top lighting, supplemented by local reflection effects to create clear layers in the overall composition. The atmosphere presents a refined lifestyle aesthetic in a modern city, blending the mechanical power of automotive culture with the contrasting tension of feminine softness, conveying a fashionable and confident lifestyle attitude; Image quality aims for realistic and delicate phone or regular camera shooting results, retaining slight noise and color deviations, avoiding excessive sharpening and filter beautification, emphasizing scene authenticity and immersion; The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with off-white and metallic silver, creating a cool yet sophisticated visual language; The edges of the painting are appropriately blurred, highlighting the subject while hinting at spatial depth; The overall mood conveys a relaxed and joyful atmosphere of daily self-expression and social sharing, as if capturing precious moments casually captured during friends' gatherings, combining artistic expression with a sense of life documentary.",
