        {
          "id": "krea2-92328121f6b2ec947f304d2d",
          "alias": "单女白T恤客厅俏皮喝",
          "prompt": "A woman elegantly reclines on her side on the modern minimalist living room floor, wearing a pure white lace-trimmed camisole and matching shorts. Her makeup is delicate and soft. Her right hand holds a transparent straw, gently sipping a bright red watermelon chunk from a bowl. Her left hand gently holds a light brown wooden bowl filled with crystal-clear watermelon cubes. The bowl rests on a light gray-blue square pillow, and a simple gold ring is on her wrist, exuding a relaxed yet lively demeanor. Next to her was a fluffy white little dog, its fluffy, curly fur as soft as clouds, curiously poking its head close to her arm, as if sniffing or hoping to share the sweet fruits; In the foreground is a bi-color carpet of off-white and light gold with fine wave patterns, with delicate and layered textures, and light creating a soft transition of light and shadow on its surface; In the middle ground, the woman's body and pet form the visual focal point, while in the background is a wide, comfortable off-white sofa paired with several colorful cushions—one bright yellow suede pillow is casually placed on the edge of the sofa, while another light gray pillow supports her body beneath her; Farther away is a simple cream-colored built-in wardrobe door panel with clean and sharp lines. On the left, you can see a floor-to-ceiling window adorned with beige vertical striped curtains, faintly revealing the outline of the city's nightscape. Scattered on the floor by the window are a few untidied cardboard boxes and plastic bags, hinting at the real traces of life and the cozy atmosphere of home. The entire composition uses a slightly tilted overhead angle, creating a dynamic balance between the characters and the environment, while the interaction with the puppy on the right adds fun and warmth to the scene; The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the front left window, evenly casting on the woman's skin and clothing, creating subtle three-dimensional shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly warm white, beige, and light gray, accented with the bright red of watermelon and pure white of dog fur, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and slightly intimate atmosphere for an afternoon at home. It feels like capturing the most pleasant moment of a lazy summer, combining the everyday life atmosphere with carefully arranged artistic beauty. The image is authentic and natural, It looks like a high-quality life record shot with a smartphone, but after post-production color grading and composition optimization, it presents a highly refined visual texture.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
