        {
          "id": "krea2-232641c1efe106e63606d459",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙摄影棚冷淡坐持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a wooden bench, wearing a light, flowing beige strapless dress with layers like sheer fabric, gently swaying in the breeze, exuding a soft yet slightly vintage aura; Some parts hang down on the chest, while the rest drape naturally over the shoulders. On the right side of the bun is a simple and elegant azure jade hairpin, resembling a combination of ancient copper coins and tassels, glowing with a warm luster under the sunlight; The overall makeup leans toward a fresh Japanese style, emphasizing the skin's translucency and natural glow; She folded her hands on her knees, her posture elegant and serene, as if immersed in a moment of tranquility. In the foreground is a rugged wooden bench where she sits, with clearly visible grain and surface marks of wear and natural weathering. On the left, a dark brown wooden pillar slants into the edge of the composition, adding depth to the composition; The middle shot is the transitional area between her exposed shoulder and neck lines and the light skirt. Light falls from the upper right, creating soft highlights on her shoulders and collarbones, while casting delicate shadows on her left shoulder and back to enhance the three-dimensional effect; The background is a lush green water area surrounded by lush greenery. The surface is as calm as a mirror, reflecting the lush trees along the shore and the dappled stone riverbank. In the distance, the silhouettes of buildings with blue bricks and gray tiles can be faintly seen, creating a poetic atmosphere reminiscent of a Jiangnan water town or ancient town by the stream; The entire composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the visual center, and the camera slightly angled down, making viewers feel as if they are right beside her, feeling that privacy and tranquility; At the same time, the bright light source on the right creates a halo contrasting with the dark-toned wooden structure on the left, resulting in delicate and realistic light and shadow processing. Natural light filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled and dazzling effect that enhances the sense of layering in the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, carrying a hazy artistic vibe and the charm of Eastern classical aesthetics. The colors are mainly emerald green, beige, and wood brown, with moderate saturation and a balanced warm and cool tone, presenting a texture reminiscent of \"everyday amateur equipment shooting\"—not professional studio lighting, but real moments casually captured under natural light. The images have slight noise and color overflow, making them feel more everyday and intimate, as if recording a beautiful moment frozen casually rather than a deliberately staged artwork.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
