        {
          "id": "krea2-be2def461f49db873501ad50",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔面包店坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in an outdoor café, wearing a gold bracelet inlaid with pink four-leaf clover on her wrist, which glows gently under natural light. She wears a blue-gray plaid denim shirt with clearly visible fabric texture, sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender wrist lines. In front of her sits a transparent plastic cup of iced Americano printed with the \"PARIS BAGUETTE BAKERY CAFE\" logo, with a black straw stuck in the lid. The liquid is deep brown and translucent, reflecting the surrounding light In the foreground is a pale green tea bowl held in a white ceramic bowl, with slight condensation marks on the rim. On the right side, there is an orange-yellow drink with only part of the cup exposed. The tabletop is a wooden countertop with clear natural wood grain, paired with a white paper mat for a simple contrast. The background is the café's facade decoration. On the left wall hangs a neon sign shaped like a pink milk tea cup, and above hangs a string of warm yellow bulbs forming a string of light decorations. The light spreads out softly at dusk or dusk, creating a soft and warm atmosphere. In the distance, you can see a green wall enclosed by a wooden fence. Vines climb above, with grape clusters faintly visible throughout. The architectural structure is mainly modern minimalist, with black metal framed glass doors and windows and beige walls creating a sense of visual layering. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure occupying the left central position, creating a sense of spatial depth from near to far. The lighting atmosphere presents a soft natural afternoon or evening light effect, with light slanting into the frame from the right front of the figure, creating delicate reflections on the table and cup body, creating a tranquil atmosphere. The lazy yet slightly artistic life scenes feature warm brown, off-white, light blue, and pink tones with moderate saturation, presenting a daily yet artistic image quality. It feels like real life moments captured with a smartphone, but post-processing enhances the emotional atmosphere. The entire image conveys the beautiful mood of urban youth enjoying moments of solitude and tranquility during their leisure time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
