        {
          "id": "krea2-7939ca4b81c2d09af34abe3b",
          "alias": "单女金背心床害羞倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman lazily leans against the soft, pristine bed, her fingers curled slightly to reveal delicate knuckles, revealing a calm yet slightly shy expression. She wore a pale yellow spaghetti strap vest, her skin fair and radiant, appearing especially gentle under soft lighting. Her shoulders were graceful, and her long, natural arms rested at her side or knee. In front of her lay a Japanese cookbook with a brightly colored cover, with \"cookie\" written in striking orange letters, an English translation below \"Many Kinds of Cookies,\" and numerous tempting cookie images—round, strip, lace, and more—arranged in pink wrapping. She casually held or half-covered the book, as if reading or just putting it down, with the edges slightly rolled, adding a touch of everyday life. And the mouthwatering cookbook cover, composed with a slightly overhead close-up shot, creates a strong intimacy and immersive experience. The background is a simple and cozy bedroom environment, with white pillows and sheets occupying the upper part of the composition, creating a pure visual blank space. In the distance, blue and beige lace or fabric decorations can be faintly seen scattered around the bedside, adding layers and everyday details to the composition. The lighting and shadow treatment throughout the scene is extremely delicate and soft. Natural light from the window streams in from the upper left, creating a warm golden tone, while shadows are cleverly softened, giving the overall atmosphere a dreamy creamy tone—sweet Japanese vibe while retaining the texture of real life. The visual guide naturally extends from the direction she gazes at to the cover of the book in her hand, then leads through the cookie pattern on the book to the colored fabric below, forming a smooth visual path. The entire image exudes a healing atmosphere of a lazy afternoon and home leisure. It combines exquisite composition and color control reminiscent of artistic photography with the realism and warmth of everyday amateur equipment, as if you can smell the biscuit aroma and the scent of sunlight drifting through the air, evoking a moment of tranquility and sweet moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
