        {
          "id": "krea2-f1db0bb0d888cae405509c6d",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣海滩困倦倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "She turned slightly to look back, carrying a hint of playfulness and confidence, as if silently communicating with someone off-camera. Her makeup is delicate but not overpowering, giving her a pure yet slightly sexy vibe. She wore a light olive green hollow-out knit suit. The top featured a camisole design with cross-straps on the back, and numerous holes and tassel details on the chest and sleeves. The material was lightweight and breathable, showing off her skin in the sunlight, exuding a summer vacation vibe; The bottoms are matching high-waisted shorts in the same color, with loose waist ties that hang down, highlighting the waistline and hip curves. Her right hand gently supports a palm leaf or rock beside her, her left hand hangs naturally, her body slightly leaning, her posture relaxed and rhythmic. The foreground features parts of her legs and skirt, along with several green leaves filtered by sunlight, creating a sense of depth and layering; The middle features her complete figure and costume details, surrounded by dense shrubs, leaves of varying sizes and varying shades of green, interwoven into a vibrant backdrop; The background consists of huge fan-shaped palm leaves, with clearly visible veins and edges swaying in the wind. In the distance, faint architectural outlines or the sky can be seen, suggesting this is a seaside resort or tropical garden scene. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking medium to close-up shot, with the figure occupying the center to the right, while the shrubs on the left create visual balance. She guides the viewer's gaze to linger on her and explore the details. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with sunlight slanting in from the right side into the frame, creating a soft transition between light and shadow and enhancing the sense of depth; The background vegetation appears semi-transparent due to backlighting, creating a dreamy, transparent atmosphere. The entire painting is dominated by different layers of green, forming a harmonious and unified natural tone, occasionally dotted with white flowers and yellow centers, creating visual highlights. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot by a high-end digital camera on a clear afternoon, with a slight depth blur effect, making the subject stand out and the background is hazy, giving a strong cinematic and everyday atmosphere, conveying a relaxed, carefree tropical vacation atmosphere. It is both artistic and closely tied to everyday life, reflecting a natural documentary style.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
