        {
          "id": "krea2-34a2be5a49fb610a8dc598f8",
          "alias": "单女毛衣窗边严肃侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman occupies the center of the frame, slightly tilting her head back to gaze at the camera, her fingers gently touching the high-collar edge of a knitted sweater, her posture lazy yet full of life. She wore a beige coarse knit cardigan with clear and three-dimensional textures, delicate pleats at the cuffs and neckline, and a light-colored slip dress faintly visible underneath. The fabric was soft and warm, rich in details and texture, presenting delicate light and shadow transitions and soft warm tones under natural light. Create intimacy and emotional resonance. In the middle ground, you can see wooden shelves in the background behind her, neatly arranging ceramic cups and plates, glassware, and other café or home items. The items are arranged neatly without looking cluttered, adding to the everyday atmosphere; On the right side, large green plants have spreading leaves that are full of vitality, forming a natural contrast with the warm environment. The background is a bright and transparent interior space, with modern minimalist track spotlights and white frosted glass lampshades hanging from the ceiling. Soft natural light streams in outside, the window frames are natural wood, and the curtains feature light blue vertical stripes. The overall space is spacious and filled with a tranquil atmosphere reminiscent of Japanese wabi-sabi aesthetics or Nordic minimalism. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with a slightly tilted angle that brings a sense of dynamism and approachability. The subject is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with ample blank space but not a sense of emptiness. The plants in the background on the right are balanced with the window on the left. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the window at the upper right of the frame, while delicate shadow layers are cast on the sweater surface to enhance the sense of depth; Indoor lighting serves as an auxiliary light source, projecting from above to avoid overexposure. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and healing, evoking the lazy feeling of afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. It combines the intimate realism of daily life with the exquisite composition and emotional expression of artistic photography, as if capturing a tender moment revealed unintentionally, allowing people to feel a quiet companionship and inner peace. The entire scene resembles a snapshot of real life casually taken with amateur equipment (such as a phone or small camera) under natural light, yet thanks to precise composition, The control of light and shadow and emotional expression create strong visual appeal and artistic appeal, conveying a youthful, gentle, and comfortable lifestyle aesthetic.",
