        {
          "id": "krea2-d24abb7ad0a7cdf7a922d78d",
          "alias": "单女西装花园困倦蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on the stone-paved path of an outdoor garden, slightly lowering her head to gaze at the camera, exuding a quiet yet slightly playful youthful vibe. She wore a loose, vintage-style plaid blazer in beige and brown. The jacket was thick with clear texture, natural pleats at the cuffs and collar, and a pure white collared shirt underneath. The collar was neatly exposed, with a faint glimpse of light-colored leggings or skirt edges at the hem. She wore shiny black loafers with gold metal accents on the toe and white socks. The overall outfit blended collegiate style with a casual vibe, creating a contrasting beauty that was both formal and casual. Her hands naturally folded in front of her knees, her left hand gently resting on her right, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with elegant white nails, her posture relaxed yet full of ceremony. The foreground shows the gray stone floor where her lower body and feet rest, with clear gaps and slight wear on the surface, enhancing realism; In the middle is her complete figure from waist to head, slightly leaning forward and maintaining a stable center of gravity. The background is a lush and layered plant landscape. On the left is a large area of dense deep green broad-leaved plants, their edges glowing with a yellow-green gradient, appearing vibrant under sunlight. To the right and behind is a cluster of blooming pink flowers, with dense, full, and highly saturated petals that contrast sharply with the green leaves. In the distance, a few orange-red blossoms can be faintly seen, adding warmth and depth to the scene. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position, body in an oblique pose, and the background flower clusters enhancing spatial layering. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft natural backlight that creates a warm and bright highlight area, while delicate shadows are cast on her right side and on the background plants, enhancing the sense of depth and atmosphere. The overall light and shadow transitions are natural, with moderate contrast between light and dark, without strong harsh light or overexposure, presenting a warm, tranquil, and slightly dreamy afternoon atmosphere. The color scheme is mainly pink, green, and beige, accented with black and white. The tones are harmonious and unified, visually comfortable and soft, creating a lazy and cozy daily vibe in a spring campus or park. It also carries a slight artistic filter effect, as if shot with an old film camera under soft light, preserving slight noise and grainy texture, making the image more emotionally warm and memorable, conveying a youthful, tranquil, and slightly melancholic poetic mood.",
