        {
          "id": "krea2-98b900b7112932c17a6de330",
          "alias": "单女礼服庭院愤怒站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a delicately wavy sequin strapless gown stands elegantly in a courtyard surrounded by lush green plants. The paper bird is mainly colored pink, white, and pale gold, with wings spread like ready to take flight, its tail feathers long and flowing. The colors glow translucent under the sunlight, and when her fingertips gently touch the bird's head, the posture is full of ritual and fairy-tale-like dreaminess; Her body is slightly turned to the side, her shoulders and neck lines graceful and smooth, and her long arms naturally raised, forming a graceful arc that places the paper bird at the center of the visual focus; In the foreground, several fresh bamboo leaves extend diagonally from the upper right corner into the mirror frame, with sharp edges that create a strong contrast with the background blur, creating a rich sense of spatial depth; The middle frame features her voluptuous body and the paper bird in her hand, forming the central subject of the composition. Light and shadow flow across her skin and skirt, outlining a three-dimensional and gentle contour; The background features dense green vegetation of varying shades, including broadleaf shrubs and bamboo groves. Some areas are soft-focused and blurred, making the main elements stand out more and hinting at a private, tranquil garden corner, with wooden railings or stone steps faintly embedded in the greenery; The entire composition uses a slanted three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right, the paper bird extending to the upper left, and the light flowing softly and evenly from the natural daylight in the front left, with delicate shadow transitions avoiding harsh cuts; The overall atmosphere is elegant and ethereal, full of the fusion of classical Eastern aesthetics and modern fashion photography. It combines the vitality of a spring garden with a touch of surreal fairy tale romance, as if immersed in a secret garden in a dreamland, with every frame radiating a gentle artistic beauty; The color palette is mainly emerald green, mint blue, and pink-white, blending warm and cool without losing harmony. The overall color tone is fresh and bright without being glaring, creating a tranquil, healing, gentle, and poetic immersive viewing experience. It is as if you can hear the wind rustling through bamboo leaves and feel the dappled sunlight filtering through the branches, bringing peace of mind and longing for the beautiful moments where nature and art dance together.",
