        {
          "id": "krea2-d46b8e390bddf14ee7b3fe61",
          "alias": "单女全裸礼服窗边困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright by the wooden railing by the window, wearing a delicate light champagne strapless gown adorned with dazzling black and gold gemstones and fine sequins, which reflect a warm yet understated luxurious glow under natural light. The petals were layered and delicate and delicate, the green leaves dense and bright, the stems upright and verdant. The flowers almost covered her entire upper body, creating a soft yet vibrant visual focal point; Gazing into the camera, as if silently telling the story of her heart; The foreground focuses on a bouquet of roses in her arms and slender fingers, her nails neatly trimmed with elegant white or nude nails, her fingers naturally relaxed; The middle frame shows her complete upper body and gown details, with light and shadow flowing between skin and fabric, highlighting three-dimensionality and textured texture; The background is a blurred, lush green plant landscape outside the window, with soft bokeh blurred through the glass windows. Sunlight filters through leaves, casting dappled shadows, creating a hazy and dreamy atmosphere; On the left, you can see some wooden window frame structures, with clean and powerful vertical lines, contrasting with the soft green background on the right; The composition uses the classic central composition, with figures centered, and the bouquet in the foreground and background blur to create a sense of spatial layering; Light comes from the natural backlight on the left front, creating subtle contour light and highlight. The shadow transitions are natural and not stiff, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, poetic, and slightly nostalgic with gentleness. The colors are mainly warm champagne gold, soft pink rose, and deep dark green, complemented by a fresh green background, together creating an image aesthetic that blends sophistication with everyday life. It feels like it came from an art movie or a high-end fashion magazine cover, featuring the delicate graininess and slight noise typical of real camera shots. It presents the warm, authentic, and artistically captivating visual texture captured by everyday amateur equipment.",
