        {
          "id": "krea2-0a2a5e41b2d25b93597a50c9",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道微笑站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a street corner in a bustling city, wearing a striking red long-sleeved tight top. The cleverly designed cut-out shoulder details at the collar outline elegant lines under natural light, paired with slightly loose light blue jeans, with a slender waistline subtly revealed at the waistband, giving the overall look a blend of youthful energy and fashion taste. Her makeup is delicate and soft, and she looks straight at the camera with a confident and composed smile, arms crossed over her chest, her posture both relaxed and full of control. Her left hand hangs naturally, steadily holding an iconic brown LV monogram cylindrical bag. The bag is covered with classic Monogram patterns and adorned with colorful personalized stickers—a striking red rose, large pink \"LV\" lettering, a black round badge, and feather decorations. These elements infuse the originally luxurious bag with a playful and rebellious street art vibe, creating a striking visual contrast. On the right side of the foreground is a cluster of blooming bright red poinsettias, with full, intense petals. Against the backdrop of green leaves, the color appears even more vibrant, echoing the red of women's clothing and serving as a visual anchor in the composition, guiding the viewer's attention to the main subject. The middle section depicts paved city streets, with yellow traffic markings clearly visible. The glass windows reveal the golden \"CHAUMET\" signboard and warm yellow lighting inside to create a luxurious jewelry store atmosphere. Above the window, blue neon lights outline abstract snake patterns, creating a refined sense of high-end commercial space through interplay of light and shadow. The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual weight. The background building and display window form a symmetrical frame, enhancing the subject's presence. The light comes from natural daylight, and the red top presents a saturated and layered sheen, with natural shadow transitions without harsh contrasts; The background buildings are slightly blurred due to their distance, creating a shallow depth of field effect that makes the main subject stand out more. The overall atmosphere blends the boldness of urban fashion with the casual style of street culture, combining the refined style of luxury goods with the unique expression of personality. The harmonious light and shadow and bright colors create a relaxed, confident, and everyday photo style full of everyday life. It seems to capture the moment of the protagonist strolling through a high-end commercial district on a sunny afternoon and stopping to take photos. The image is filled with youthfulness, trendiness, and self-expression, visually giving the texture of a commercial blockbuster while retaining the natural realism of casual phone photography. It shows how urban youth seek their own fashion attitude amid the bustle.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
