        {
          "id": "krea2-f37d9edb5235790ebb9a144d",
          "alias": "单女黑背心咖啡厅坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a cozy and elegant restaurant booth, wearing a simple black sleeveless top paired with a light vertical striped skirt, looking relaxed yet elegant. In the foreground is a natural wood tabletop with transparent glass water bottles, empty wine glasses, and white plates filled with leftover leafy greens. The tableware is faintly visible, hinting at the recently concluded dining time; In the center is a beige-gray fabric sofa seat, with a classic black diamond-patterned leather handbag diagonally placed to its right. The chain is made of gold metal, reflecting a delicate sheen under soft lighting. The details of the bag complement the character's outfit for a low-key and luxurious visual effect; In the background is a row of neatly arranged wine bottles, with clearly legible labels such as \"Selma,\" \"Venica,\" and \"Chat Fou.\" Some bottles have a pale green glassy texture, with various details at the mouth or cap. Through a three-tiered layout of tabletop items in the foreground, chairs and bags in the center, and wine bottles in the background, spatial depth is achieved; The lighting atmosphere is mainly based on warm indoor lighting, creating contrasts of light and shadow to enhance the sense of depth. The wine bottles in the background are backlit and appear transparent and hazy. The overall color palette leans toward warm yellow and deep brown, creating a quiet, romantic, and slightly lazy, ambiguous atmosphere reminiscent of a late-night bar or private café. The image texture leans toward real-life scenes, with slight natural noise and slight blur effects from phone selfies or portable cameras, emphasizing a documentary rather than a commercial blockbuster. The overall mood conveys a private moment captured unintentionally— Enjoy a moment of tranquility and solitude in the bustling city.",
