        {
          "id": "krea2-4b747499ffb79522a723c60f",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙花园倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the dark wooden railing of a classical Chinese garden, wearing a light, flowing light pink semi-transparent long dress adorned with delicate gold sequin trims on the shoulders, which glow softly under the sunlight. The hem gently flutters in the wind, as if blending seamlessly with the surrounding natural environment; With a calm and serene expression, the overall posture is relaxed and relaxed, standing barefoot on the blue brick floor, with slender ankle lines, presenting a free-spirited yet slightly classical poetic beauty; In the foreground is the dark brown wooden railing she leans against against a gray-black brick wall. The railing is orderly structured, featuring traditional Chinese carved details. The texture of the brick wall is clearly visible, and some areas are illuminated by sunlight, creating contrasts of light and shadow. The central scene features the complete silhouette of her body and the corridor structure extending behind her. The columns are dark wood, topped with a typical Chinese-style tiled roof. The eaves are slightly raised, the tiles arranged neatly, and some eaves hang circular hollowed-out decorative plaques with faintly visible \"double happiness\" patterns, adding a strong cultural atmosphere; The background is dense green vegetation and the jagged Taihu stone rockery. The plants are rich in layers, and the leaves display varying shades of green under sunlight. The rockery is robust and rustic, with surfaces covered in naturally weathered patterns. Together with the distant pavilions and towers, it creates a sense of depth and creates a tranquil and profound garden atmosphere. The entire composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, while the lines of the railing guide the viewer's gaze into the distant depths of the garden; Light comes from the upper right of the painting, representing a bright afternoon sun. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves and falls on the figures, creating a mottled and dazzling effect of light and shadow. The skirt hem and skin reflect a warm, soft halo, while sharp shadows are cast on the railings and walls, enhancing the sense of depth and spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and harmonious, carrying a touch of dreamlike softness and classical charm, as if immersed in a painting of ink painting. It combines the elegant subtlety of Eastern gardens with the delicate texture of modern photography. The colors are mainly warm tones, paired with dark wood structures and dark green vegetation, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The painting is full of poetry and storytelling, evoking a sense of inner peace as if escaping the hustle and bustle and returning to nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
