        {
          "id": "krea2-bf2015785cad7194693c7f02",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍花园哭泣坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a natural stone bank by a classical garden pond, dressed in a refined light blue qipao, with a matching ribbon bow tied around her neckline. Over her shoulders hangs a thin off-white lace gown, like cicada wings, with tassels naturally hanging down in the breeze. She gently held a round silk fan in both hands, the fan surface delicately embroidered with red and pink peonies and fluttering butterfly shadows, reflecting in the sunlight with hazy and vivid color layers. The fan handle had a warm natural wood hue, and on her wrist was a vintage bracelet adorned with amber, turquoise, and red agate, shimmering with a gentle sheen in the light. The rock she leaned on was jagged and porous, its surface covered with traces of time and mottled moss. Beneath her feet was a crystal-clear pond water like a mirror, reflecting the willow branches on the shore and the scattered light of the sky. Occasionally, ripples spread across the water's surface, blurring the edges of the reflection. On the left side of the foreground is a dense cluster of lush green shrubs, whose leaves glisten brightly under the sunlight, with tiny rays of sunlight filtering through the branches and leaves; Above her head hangs a cluster of soft, slender willow branches, tender green like mist, swaying gently in the wind. The central view is the winding shoreline of the pond, formed by stacks of gray-brown Taihu stones of various sizes. Scattered wild grass and small flowers dot the cracks, and in the distance, a traditional Chinese stone figure sculpture can be faintly seen, half-hidden deep in the shade of trees, exuding a simple and solemn posture. The background is a wide lawn and dense forest, with tall and lush trees. Sunlight filters through layers of leaves, casting dappled shadows, while in the distance, the outlines of modern buildings are faintly blurred by greenery. The entire composition adopts a centrally symmetrical main figure layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the golden ratio point of the composition, creating a stable and rhythmic visual center; Background vegetation and weeping willows form natural guiding lines, while the reflection of the pond water expands spatial depth. The light comes from the upper right, a soft afternoon direct light that creates a strong contrast with the shadows, enhancing the sense of depth and texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil yet rich in classical Eastern poetry, combining the profound elegance of a garden with a gentle and serene temperament. The interplay of light and shadow creates a dreamy \"cinematic feel\" and \"film texture.\" The color saturation is moderate to cool tones, but the embroidery on the skin and fan surfaces presents warm highlights, forming a visual focal point. The images feature slight soft focus and grainy noise effects, simulating the natural bokeh and film texture of professional camera shooting, giving the images a sense of realism and narrative tension reminiscent of an art film. It feels as if capturing a fleeting moment of a Jiangnan lady sitting alone in the courtyard, holding a round fan in quiet reflection on a spring afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
