        {
          "id": "krea2-90127cc1c921c6de158f7859",
          "alias": "单女黑牛仔公寓冷淡站立比耶",
          "prompt": "Looking directly at the camera, she wears an off-white fitted long-sleeve top with a V-shaped neckline and fine buttons on the chest, accentuating her slender waistline; She pairs it with high-waisted black denim shorts, with a metal button clearly visible at the waistband. The shorts are sharply cut, outlining her long, well-proportioned leg lines. On her feet, she wore black over-the-knee socks, with flat, snug edges that fit her calves, adding a touch of fashion and mystery. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, holding a pink smartphone frame, the screen reflecting the light from the surrounding environment; A small black bag is slung across his right shoulder, with the strap simply draped over his shoulder. In the foreground is the gray asphalt road where she stands, with clear floor textures, scattered light spots, and soft shadows, presenting the authentic texture of everyday street scenes. The middle shot is the main visual space occupied by her body, with the area from her waist to her knees precisely captured, creating a strong visual focal point. The background is a blurred city streetscape, with blurred shaded trees, faint outlines of pedestrians and vehicles in the distance, and some circular halo effects, creating a dreamlike atmosphere with shallow depth of field. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure standing in the center and the line of sight extending vertically down to the ground, forming a stable and powerful composition. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with natural light evenly pouring from the upper side while creating subtle transitions of light and shadow on the sides of the body, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of urban life. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, while fine dust floats in the air, as if one can hear a moment of tranquility amid the city's noise. The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts. The classic combination of off-white and black highlights the character's elegant temperament, while the green vegetation in the background harmonizes with the gray tones of the ground, presenting an overall street portrait style that is fresh, natural, and slightly artistic. It combines the refined beauty of professional photography with the authenticity and lifestyle of everyday shooting, conveying a sense of free, unadorned youthful vitality.",
