        {
          "id": "krea2-bd7655d541550d50fe1afce5",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣商场冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a bright clothing mall mirror for a selfie. She wears a thick, well-textured gray V-neck knit sweater with a loose fit, draping naturally. She holds a white phone in her right hand, with a case printed with cute cartoon animal patterns. The camera is focused on herself, with her left hand tucked into the sweater pocket, striking a relaxed, casual yet fashionable pose. The foreground focuses on her upper body and the movement of holding a phone, with the phone camera clearly visible, forming a visual anchor; In the middle of the scene, the mall shelves and hanging clothes behind her are visible. On the left, you can see a white T-shirt printed with three little bears; on the right, you can faintly see a pink jacket and other winter clothes. The price tags like \"1.28\" are blurred, creating a realistic shopping atmosphere. The background is the mall's interior space, where neatly arranged fluorescent tubes on the ceiling emit a cool white light. The metal shelves have clean lines, while the distant product display area appears slightly blurred, emphasizing the main figures through a shallow depth of field effect. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical mirrored selfie perspective, with the person positioned slightly to the center, and the phone naturally extending to the right edge of the frame, creating visual balance; then extending to the background product area, forming a progressive hierarchical relationship; In terms of lighting and shadows, the overall design uses uniformly diffused light from artificial lighting sources on the mall's roof. The sweater material reflects a delicate sheen, while the background lighting presents slightly overexposed highlight areas, creating a sense of everyday life yet full of authentic life. The atmosphere blends youthful energy, fashion styling display, and the relaxed joy of everyday shopping. The color palette is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with a touch of warm lipstick and cartoon phone case elements. The color contrast is gentle but not jarring, conveying a refined yet down-to-earth authentic lifestyle aesthetic of \"ordinary girls enjoying shopping in the mall.\" It's like a photo casually taken with amateur equipment yet full of detail and emotional tension. It combines commercial compositional awareness with the naturalness and spontaneity of ordinary people taking pictures. The overall scene is tranquil and vivid, carrying the warmth and charm of everyday life for urban youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
