        {
          "id": "krea2-1a0091aeae0ace8285617aa2",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣商店愤怒站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an indoor clothing store or fitting room, her overall makeup clean and fresh, leaning toward a natural, everyday style rather than a strong stage vibe. She wore a creamy white plush hooded zip-up knit cardigan, made of fluffy and soft fabric. The hat edges were adorned with a puffy white synthetic fur collar, ribbed tapered designs at the cuffs and hem, a simple and practical chest pocket, and a small white brand label visible on the left chest. The metal zipper fastener was delicate and compact, reflecting a faint glow under the light. The bottom is paired with black high-waisted shorts that fit the body perfectly, with the hem length just right to reveal the upper thigh. Underneath, sheer black leggings are layered, with a semi-transparent material that shows the natural skin tone, and the ankles faintly reveal the outline of black boots or shoes. Her right hand hangs naturally at one side of her body, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored nail polish. Her posture is relaxed and confident yet dignified. Her body is slightly turned toward the camera, and her head is slightly tilted forward to create a subtle angle, creating a sense of warmth and gentleness. The background features a light gray textured wall, evenly distributed with fine grainy textures, giving it a modern minimalist industrial feel. On the left, a black metal frame structure can be seen, possibly a mirror or partition door frame. The mirror faintly reflects the partial outline of another black-and-white striped down jacket, while the right edge reveals a patchwork pattern of someone wearing yellow sneakers' ankles and floor tiles, hinting that the scene is a real public space or commercial environment. The foreground focuses on the entire figure, with a standard vertical portrait composition. The subject is slightly centered to the right, with soft and even light and shadow treatment. The main light source comes from the front slightly left, allowing natural diffusion without strong shadows. The folds of the clothing and the fluffy parts of the fur collar create delicate light and dark layers. The overall color tone is mainly neutral gray, pure white, and deep black. The color contrast is sharp but not glaring, creating a calm, sophisticated, and warm visual atmosphere. The overall image presents a beautiful moment captured casually from daily life, combining the realism of fashionable outfits with the refined composition and artistic beauty of portrait photography. It appears as if taken by amateur equipment such as a mobile phone or a small camera. The image has slight noise and compression marks, enhancing the realistic feel of everyday life while maintaining a balance of clarity and color saturation. The image combines documentary warmth with visual appeal, conveying a blend of youthful vitality, gentle tranquility, and modern urban life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
