          "id": "krea2-264afe5c6de7659c6ee33ac2",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣商店冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a bright and tidy clothing store in front of the mirror for a selfie, wearing a slender cross necklace around her neck, adding a touch of understated elegance to a minimalist look. She wore a light beige lightweight cardigan, made of soft and fitting fabric, paired with a pure white V-neck T-shirt underneath and black high-waisted shorts that outlined her long, well-proportioned legs. In her right hand, she held up a smartphone with a Hello Kitty cartoon case for a mirrored selfie, while her left hand naturally hung down, clutching a pink shopping bag. A sparkling ring was on her fingertip, reflecting a gentle glow in the soft light. The foreground focuses on her body contours from waist to above the knees and the phone in her hand. The folds and layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, while the background features rows of neatly arranged racks. On the left hang warm brown T-shirts decorated with lace-up sequins, while on the right are colorful tops such as orange-red, sky blue, and light green. In the distance, shelves hang with various printed shirts. The recessed spotlights on the ceiling evenly cast cool white light. The floor is covered with marble-patterned tiles of varying shades, reflecting the light from above to form strips of light. The entire space is spacious and symmetrical, with a centrally symmetrical composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with mirror reflections creating a sense of depth. Visual guidance lines extend from hangers and floor light strips into the depths, creating an immersive shopping atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light brown, and gray-blue. The lighting is bright and even, with slight shadows enhancing the sense of depth. The atmosphere is relaxed and daily yet stylish, like a real-life photo taken with a regular phone, with details that are authentic and natural. Full of life and youthful energy, it seems to capture a girl's joyful moment while choosing a favorite item. The entire scene conveys a modern urban woman's self-expression and relaxed lifestyle attitude while shopping, combining the orderly beauty of a commercial space with personal emotional warmth and artistic narrative tension in daily life.",
