        {
          "id": "krea2-3e0da029a81e0cde71d980c9",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤厨房沉思倚靠摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the scene, with bright and expressive double eyelids. She wears a light blue short-sleeved tight T-shirt that accentuates her slender waist, paired with high-waisted black polka dot shorts with white underwear. The shorts are lightweight and skin-friendly, with natural pleats that accentuate her leg lines. Around her neck is a simple gold necklace, and on her left wrist is a delicate silver bracelet. Her hands rest naturally on the dark, reflective desk in front of her, while her right hand gently supports the edge of a white laptop. Her left hand was casually placed in a corner of the table, with an open notebook and a black gel pen beside her. The whole pose was both relaxed and effortlessly elegant. In the foreground is a mirror-smooth, dark tabletop that reflects the legs, clothing, and parts of the environment, enhancing the sense of spatial layering and authenticity; The center is the central area of the composition, where the woman's body and the table are formed. Her body leans slightly forward, her back slightly curved to form a gentle S-shaped curve. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space. On the right, you can see a wooden open kitchen cabinet, neatly displayed with transparent glass cups, dark ceramic bottles, and other decorative items. Warm yellow light strips are embedded below the cabinet, creating a cozy atmosphere; Further away, on the left wall hangs a circular golden metallic decorative piece. The wall surface is soft off-white or light gray, with a faint ceiling feature of ventilation openings. In the upper right corner, a large round soft light panel hangs, emitting a uniform and soft top light while creating a subtle shadow transition against the background. The overall composition adopts a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The diagonal angle highlights the body's curves and dynamic beauty, the background blur enhances the subject's prominence, and objects on the table naturally guide the figure to the lower right corner, creating a smooth visual flow. In terms of lighting, the top uses soft light as the main source, supplemented by warm light bands at the bottom of the background cabinet to create a richly layered contrast of light and dark. The skin texture is delicate and translucent, and natural shadows in the folds of clothing enhance the three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme leans toward low-saturation cream tones and wood tones, creating a quiet, comfortable, and slightly intimate home and office atmosphere. It combines the everyday life atmosphere with the refined aesthetics of high-end artistic photography, presenting a sense of realism and everyday warmth like \"amateur equipment shooting.\" But the attention to detail is highly professional, as if capturing moments of life from a high-end imaging device, full of storytelling and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
