        {
          "id": "krea2-5c671fd48c58118ffc0a0073",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤街道微笑持手机",
          "prompt": "She wears a gentle smile, her makeup delicate but not heavy, highlighting her youthful and pure temperament; She wore a light blue thin long-sleeve top with a camisole printed with cat patterns and English slogans underneath. The buttons at the chest were neatly arranged, and the sleeves were gently rolled up to reveal her slender arm lines. She paired it with an off-white loose midi skirt, giving the overall style a fresh and sweet look with a Japanese vibe. To the right extends a lush meadow, with leaves gently swaying in the wind, creating a natural vitality; The middle view features a neat gray stone-paved sidewalk, with a clean and flat surface that transitions in layers with the green belt behind. In the distance, pedestrians, seats, and the outlines of modern urban facilities can be faintly seen; The background is a bustling city streetscape, featuring tall trees, metal lamp posts, shop signs, and blurred crowd activity. The buildings are vivid in color but are blurred, preserving the urban atmosphere without overpowering the main venue; The composition uses a slightly slanted mid-to-near perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The foreground shrubs form a natural frame, and the light and shadow effect presents soft natural light at dusk or afternoon. The light shines obliquely from the upper right, with distinct layers of clothing materials and soft shadows that are soft but not stiff; The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of life and youthful energy. It combines the convenience and liveliness of urban living, while conveying a sense of tranquility and comfort through greenery and natural elements. The main color palette is blue, gray, and white, complemented by vivid green plants, presenting a fresh and elegant Japanese aesthetic. It preserves the realistic texture and slight noise typical of everyday phone photography, avoiding excessive post-processing to make the footage closer to real life scenes, as if a beautiful moment encountered on an ordinary afternoon street scene.",
