        {
          "id": "krea2-6ecf5fea346b282df7458123",
          "alias": "单女米风衣森林俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "The overall look is both casual and fashionable. She wore a white fitted inner layer, a beige loose trench coat, dark brown skinny sweatpants, and thick knit socks, paired with white platform casual shoes adorned with pearl embellishments for a sweet touch. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the canvas, becoming the visual focal point. Their body lines and guardrails form a diagonal composition to guide the gaze, while the posture of the legs creates a dynamic balance with the stone path on the ground. In the foreground is a clearly visible stone-paved walkway and rugged wooden railings, with a rough and natural texture, partially illuminated by sunlight and casting soft shadows; The middle view extends to winding paths, with faint red cables or cableway structures weaving through the forest in the distance, hinting at the unique features of the scenic area; The background features rolling verdant mountains and a hazy mist, with towering pine trees and lush foliage, and distant mountain silhouettes faintly visible in the mist, creating a profound sense of space and tranquility. The overall composition is shot from a slightly upward angle, enhancing the subject's presence and the strong contrast with the environment. Lighting and shadow mainly use bright natural light, with sunlight slanting from above, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow on the stone floor. The background mountain features a slight soft-focus blur to enhance the depth of the image's layers. The color palette is earth tones and natural greens as the main tones, with light-colored clothing harmoniously contrasting with dark brown. The overall atmosphere is fresh and tranquil, yet lively, with a realistic texture reminiscent of outdoor travel photography. It looks as if taken with ordinary camera equipment, retaining slight noise and natural depth of field, conveying a relaxed, nature-friendly lifestyle aesthetic. The images are full of storytelling and emotional resonance, allowing people to feel the free spirit and youthful charm of the mountains and fields.",
