        {
          "id": "krea2-bbc57b0058264afb98fdb07c",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣公园俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "On a sunlit autumn park lawn, a woman sits cross-legged on a lawn paved with golden ginkgo leaves, becoming the absolute visual focal point of the scene. She wears a loose, comfortable light gray knit cardigan, adorned with delicate dark gray geometric and animal patterns. The cuffs feature delicate ribbed trim, paired with a black short skirt and pure white over-the-knee socks, paired with blue-and-white color-blocked sneakers. The overall look presents a relaxed yet refined everyday collegiate aesthetic. She wears a fluffy, soft white plush headband on her head, adding a playful and cute winter vibe to the entire look, which glows gently under the sunlight. Her arms are naturally outstretched in an embrace, as if embracing the tranquility and beauty of autumn. Leaning behind her is a transparent plastic folding umbrella, with slender and clearly visible ribs. A few dead leaves are scattered on the canopy surface, blending seamlessly with the surroundings, adding a sense of life while skillfully balancing the visual weight of the composition. In the foreground, several intact ginkgo leaves fall precisely between her knees and calves, their edges slightly curled, their color gradient from golden yellow to orange-yellow, delicate and authentic, echoing the fallen leaves at her feet, enhancing the seasonal atmosphere. The middle ground is the lawn where she sits, lush green grass mixed with dense, layered fallen leaves, and the interplay of light and shadow creates a warm and vibrant atmosphere. In the background, there is a row of neatly arranged trees, with the lower half of the trunk painted white. The branches and leaves are lush and dense, some of the leaves have turned autumn hues. In the distance, faint outlines of modern buildings can be seen, hinting that this is a public green space within the city. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center. Natural light pours down from the upper right while casting long shadows on the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The lighting is warm and soft, with a warm yellow tone and a slight film graininess, simulating the realistic texture of a phone or regular camera rather than excessive sharpening or post-processing. The composition is stable and balanced, with a prominent subject. Fallen leaves in the foreground focus the viewer's gaze on the figures, while the trees in the background form a natural frame structure, creating a peaceful, healing, and slightly artistic autumn afternoon atmosphere. Overall, it conveys a relaxed and carefree sense of everyday happiness immersed in the beauty of nature. It combines a sense of everyday warmth with a photographic artistic compositional beauty and emotional expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
