        {
          "id": "krea2-7dd7c934c7f3d17766b05108",
          "alias": "单女城市冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "The window frame forms a natural frame-style composition to enhance visual focus; Light comes from the front left of the figure, with natural light streaming through the window and subtle shadows on the right side, creating a sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the refinement and composure of modern urban life, featuring a slight soft-focus effect that simulates the texture of professional studio or high-end smartphone photography. The color palette mainly leans toward warm white and beige, complemented by cool gray urban elements in the background to create visual balance; The image blends a strong sense of everyday realism with artistic beauty, resembling a carefully curated social media lifestyle photo or a fashion magazine page, emphasizing the harmonious unity of people and environment, conveying an image of an independent, confident, and urban woman who enjoys contemporary life. The light and shadow layers are rich and delicate, the color saturation is moderate, neither abrupt nor dull, and the overall visual experience is comfortable and pleasant, making it suitable for commercial promotion, fashion outfit display, or personal artistic expression.",
          "description": "",
