        {
          "id": "krea2-45e50b9b204d240b757a532a",
          "alias": "单女毛衣城市俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman stands in a bright and luxurious indoor space, wearing simple and exquisite gold hoop earrings, exuding an overall aura that blends classical charm with modern fashion; She wore a deep brown, semi-transparent three-sleeve knit top with a tight waistline that accentuated her slender figure. She wore a high-waisted A-line short skirt with a gray-and-white vintage landscape print featuring delicate French pastoral brushstrokes. The hem edges were adorned with small metal buttons, making the skirt light and flowing, revealing the long, well-proportioned thighs and calf skin. She wears a pair of white pointed high heels, with the toe set with finely detailed, sparkling rhinestones that reflect a crystal-clear luster under the light, adding a touch of playfulness and refinement; Her posture is calm and confident, her hands naturally hanging at her sides, legs slightly crossed, creating a dynamic balance that is both relaxed and powerful, as if silently telling a story about self and space. The foreground is the marble floor beneath her feet, with clear and natural textures. Sunlight streams through the window screens, casting interplay of light and shadow on the floor, reflecting a delicate texture; The central area features the white carved door frame and wall where she stands. The door frame lines are smooth and elegant, the wall is decorated with simple plaster lines, and on the right side is a wall lamp, its round glass cover reflecting softly in the light; In the background is a huge floor-to-ceiling window. Outside the window is the city skyline filled with skyscrapers, with layers of buildings scattered in layers. The sky appears in a clear light blue tone, with faint bridges and urban greenbelt visible in the distance. Curtains are half-drawn, creating a sense of harmony between interior and exterior; The entire composition uses diagonal lines, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left, and the natural light beams formed by windows serve as visual focal points, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; The light mainly comes from the natural light from the left window direction, soft and layered, casting warm shadows on the floor and walls, creating contrasts of light and shadow and enhancing the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, noble, and full of everyday life. It combines the exquisite composition and light and shadow treatment of art photography with the realism and approachability of everyday shooting. The main color palettes are white, beige, and brown, complemented by silver-gray patterns and pearl white high heels, creating a low-key luxury, gentle and elegant visual experience. Every element serves the emotional expression and spatial narrative of the main characters, conveying a restrained yet powerful female empower and aesthetic pursuit.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
