        {
          "id": "krea2-d2ff220c499c5b3b145777f6",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣摄影棚温柔注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a form-fitting beige-toned knit slip dress, featuring vertical ribbed weaving that showcased subtle texture and three-dimensional tailoring under the light, highlighting the smooth and elegant curves of her body. The thin strap design accentuated her slender collarbone, and the hem length and mid-thigh revealed long, fair leg skin. Her left hand hangs naturally as she gently carries a matching knit cardigan. The fabric is soft and voluminous, with folds naturally spreading, hinting at something she just took off or is about to put on, adding a touch of everyday dynamism. In the foreground, the details of her hands are clearly visible: neatly trimmed nails, fingertips lightly touching the edges of clothing, creating subtle visual focal points. The middle shot features her complete torso and skirt details, with the main body positioned slightly to the center, leaving space on the left side to naturally extend the gaze into the background, creating a balanced and breathable composition. The background features a simple and elegant white wall with classical vertical line decorations and recessed wall panels. On the right side hangs heavy and flowing white curtains, naturally hanging with folds, sunlight streaming in from outside, casting soft layers of light and shadow on the walls and curtains, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The floor is paved with light gray marble-textured tiles, reflecting a subtle sheen that further enhances the space's cleanliness and sense of luxury. The overall composition is a mid-shot close-up with a half-body to thigh ratio, with the character slightly turned to the side but head turned toward the camera, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and distant. Ultimately, it is enveloped by the light and shadow of the background. The lighting and shadow processing is extremely delicate, with the main light source coming from the front left of the frame, softly and evenly illuminating the front of the figure, enhancing depth and realism; The curtains and walls in the background create contrasts of light and shadow depending on the angle of light, but the overall color remains a unified warm white tone to avoid clutter and distractions. The entire painting is filled with a tranquil, lazy, and intimate afternoon atmosphere. The colors are mainly low-saturation beige brown, cream white, and gray, creating a gentle and restrained emotional tone. It combines the refined feel of a professional studio with the authentic atmosphere of everyday moments captured unintentionally. The texture of the image is as delicate and silky as silk, full of artistic beauty and warmth of life, like a classic shot from a fashion magazine cover or a high-end home photo collection, evoking a sense of elegance and composure that needs no words.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
