        {
          "id": "krea2-a5fa850cf14aa20551d4862c",
          "alias": "单女高跟鞋城市沉思坐展示",
          "prompt": "The overall look is clean and neat yet maintains soft curves; With a slight sheen, she wears a small gold round earring earring, with delicate and soft makeup. Her left hand rests lightly on her right knee, while her right hand naturally hangs at her leg, her posture relaxed and composed, showcasing a serene and confident urban feminine temperament. In the foreground, her long, fair legs and high heels are clearly outlined. Sunlight streams through floor-to-ceiling windows onto the marble floor, creating bright spots and delicate shadows. The floor reflects the reflections of the chair and the figure's legs, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; In the middle is a black metallic chair she sits on, with a pure white flowing sheer curtain behind her. The curtain gently flutters in the breeze, creating a soft, blurred transition along the edge of the window frame; The background is the cityscape outside the window, with towering buildings that are soft-focused to create a hazy, blurred effect. Faint glimpses of green trees and distant architectural silhouettes create an atmosphere of tranquility in a bustling city; The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figures positioned at the golden ratio on the right side, and the left left left space formed by windows and light and shadow, creating visual balance; A slight overhead angle makes the figure appear more three-dimensional and full, while highlighting the lines of his legs and the delicate details of his high heels; Light comes naturally from the left front window, creating a warm contrast between light and dark, while reflective areas on the floor enhance the sense of transparency in the image; The overall atmosphere is quiet, upscale, artistic, and full of everyday life. The color palette mainly consists of pure white, beige, and black, accented with green outside the windows, creating a fresh and elegant modern home scene; The images have a strong realistic photographic texture, as if shot with amateur equipment, but thanks to lighting and compositional techniques, they present professional-grade images. Details are rich yet not cluttered, with clear light and shadow layers, moderate to warm color saturation, emphasizing the expressiveness of real materials and emotional expression. It is suitable for fashion portraits, lifestyle photography, or indoor aesthetic displays.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
