        {
          "id": "krea2-8fc76a6fbee01ac5f8224fff",
          "alias": "单女衬衫城市害羞注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a delicate white vertical striped knitted long-sleeve shirt with a structured collar, delicate gold buttons on the chest, and an off-white plaid pleated mini skirt on the bottom. The skirt is light and flowing, adorned with matching metal buttons at the waist, blending French retro style with urban fashion. Her makeup is elegant, her fingertips lightly touched, her posture gentle yet reserved, revealing a calm, shy, or thoughtful mood. Her earlobes are adorned with a pair of exquisite gold hoop earrings, which reflect gently under soft light, adding a touch of refined detail. The foreground focuses on her leg lines and the hem of her skirt; her legs are long and well-proportioned, naturally crossed, and her skin appears delicate and soft under the light; The middle frame is the main part of her body, forming a visual focus from her neck to knees. The simple curves of the black chair contrast with the gentle contours of the figure, creating a harmonious unity; In the background is a large window, and outside the window are blurred urban greenery and architectural silhouettes. Sunlight filters through the window screens into the room, creating soft light and shadow transitions between the floor and the figures. The white curtain hanging on the right sways gently in the breeze, adding dynamism and depth to the scene. The entire composition uses a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, using natural light columns formed by windows as the main light source, slanting in from the upper left, while subtle shadows are cast on the skirt hem and the edge of the seat, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The colors of the painting are mainly white, off-white, and light gray, complemented by black seats and green vegetation outside the windows as a contrast of warmth and coolness, creating a clean, bright, and slightly artistic and lazy atmosphere. The visual guide line extends from the character's downward gaze, matching the posture of folded hands, then traces upward from the hem of the skirt and chair to the head and background, forming a complete visual loop. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, avoiding strong contrasts of light and shadow, presenting a hazy beauty like afternoon sunlight piercing through a thin veil. The air seems to be filled with dust and specks of light, enhancing the image's realism and poetic atmosphere. The entire image presents a style that is both everyday and artistic, like private moments captured by amateur equipment (such as a phone or small camera) under natural light. Rather than deliberately pursuing perfect composition, it uses authentic lighting and everyday scene arrangements and the natural state of the subjects to convey a tranquil, gentle, and slightly detached emotional atmosphere. It evokes a moment of quiet afternoon solitude, combining the refinement of urban life with the warmth and authenticity of ordinary living.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
