        {
          "id": "krea2-73b6c6f29397ccbc6e083af3",
          "alias": "单女白西装宅邸温柔注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a delicate, unified off-white silk suit, with a long-sleeved shirt on top. The neckline is tied with a wide matching silk bow, with a three-dimensional rose decoration in the center. The cuffs are adorned with three delicate pearl buttons. The lower half is paired with a high-waisted pleated short skirt. The layered skirt is light and flowing, and the cinched waist naturally outlines a slender waistline. The overall look is simple yet luxurious. The background features pure white walls and an arched porch structure, decorated with delicate plaster relief lines. The floor is paved with marble-patterned tiles, and light streams in diagonally from the right window, casting soft transitions of light and shadow between the walls and floor, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The painting uses shallow depth of field, with background blur highlighting the main subject, while maintaining a sense of corridor depth to guide the viewer's gaze. Natural soft light is used, supplemented by side backlighting to outline the contours. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, cream white, and gray-white, creating a pure, sophisticated, and gentle visual impression. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, blending French vintage romance with modern fashion aesthetics, like a carefully arranged indoor portrait painting. It combines the warmth of daily life with the refinement of artistic creation, like a fleeting moment of tenderness captured in a sunlit aristocratic mansion, full of narrative and emotional tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
