        {
          "id": "krea2-23c33035103280a9cec34bc8",
          "alias": "单女黑西装摄影棚沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman with outstanding temperament stands in a bright indoor space, dressed in a delicate black tweed suit. Her top is a cropped fitted top with vintage lapels and metal button accents. Delicate faux edging patterns are visible at the cuffs and hem. The bottom is high-waisted shorts made of the same material, with a slender gold chain belt at the waist that naturally drapes down to the sides of the thighs, adding a touch of subtle luxury. Wearing delicate gold earrings, her left hand is gently tucked into her pocket, while her right hand hangs naturally, exuding elegance and composure. The foreground focuses on her silhouette from waist to knees, highlighting the three-dimensional tailoring and fabric texture of the garment; The middle frame features her complete upper body and some leg lines, while the background consists of large white walls, sheer curtains with light on both sides, and a minimalist, modern white desktop on the right. Warm natural light filters through the curtain gaps, casting soft light and shadow stripes on the floor and tabletop, creating a tranquil and transparent atmosphere. The composition uses a medium-near portrait frame, with the subject positioned slightly to the center, and the shallow depth blurs background details to strengthen the subject's status. Light comes from the left window edge, creating soft side lighting that outlines the three-dimensional contours of her shoulders, neck, and arms. At the same time, subtle light and shadow layers and suede reflective effects are created on the garment surface. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gold, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a visual experience where high-end fashion and everyday refinement blend well. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot in a high-end studio or high-quality lifestyle scenes, combining artistic expression with authentic life atmosphere. It is suitable for fashion magazines, brand promotions, or personal aesthetic displays. It conveys an image of a modern woman who is independent, confident, elegant, and composed.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
