        {
          "id": "krea2-3eeb272708aa122bb18d2bfb",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the dark wooden railing of a classical Chinese pavilion. She wears an off-white sleeveless fit top paired with a high-quality black long dress, a slender silver chain necklace around her neck, delicate hollowed-out pendant earrings hanging from her earlobes, and multiple layers of silver bracelets adorning her wrists. Her hands folded lightly on the railing, her posture relaxed and composed, her body slightly leaning forward to create a subtle dynamic balance, displaying a tension within tranquility; In the foreground is a dark brown wooden railing structure, whose vertical and horizontal lines intersect to create a stable framing effect. The railing surface has a natural matte texture and slight reflection; In the middle shot, the main figure occupies the center of the composition, with light softly diffused from the front side, creating natural transitions of light and shadow on her collarbones, shoulders, neck, and arms; The background is a blurred garden landscape, with traditional pavilions and towers with flying eaves and upturned corners faintly visible. In the distance, trees are lush and leafy, with several maples or red maples showing a rich orange-red hue, standing out against the backdrop of green vegetation. The background uses a large aperture with shallow depth of field to create a dreamy circular light spot bokeh effect, creating a hazy, poetic spatial depth; The composition adopts a left-centered, symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the frame. The visual guide line extends from the horizontal line of the railing to the character's arms, creating a warm and soft twilight atmosphere. The main light source comes from the upper left, with soft natural light filtering through the leaves and casting on the figure, creating a mottled and shadowy texture. The background shadow area also has a slight cool contrast, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The entire image exudes a serene and elegant temperament rooted in Eastern aesthetics, combining professional studio-level detail and artistic beauty with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting—there are slight noise and color overflow marks at the edges, preserving a genuine touch of everyday life, as if captured by chance on an autumn afternoon. It is neither deliberately staged nor completely natural, but an idealized portrait work carefully designed and fine-tuned in post-production, combining cinematic and documentary feel, conveying a sense of calm and A restrained and vibrant image of a modern Eastern woman.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
