        {
          "id": "krea2-a825cfeeb8010302e9903e2c",
          "alias": "单女白西装城市自信站立",
          "prompt": "An elegant and confident woman stands in a bright, spacious modern interior space. She wears a delicate off-white suit. The top features long-sleeved tops and a neckline adorned with a matching wide silk scarf bow. The waist is naturally cinched to accentuate her curves. The bottom is a pleated short skirt with layers of pleats, the skirt light and flowing. She wears a pair of light beige pointed heels adorned with sparkling crystal buttons, creating an overall look that is simple yet luxurious in detail. Her makeup is fresh and natural, with her left hand lightly resting at her waist and her right hand naturally letting go, her posture relaxed yet somewhat dignified. The foreground focuses on her long, well-proportioned legs and slender ankles, with the floor covered by large, mirror-like white marble tiles, with natural grain clearly visible, reflecting soft light and the silhouette of the figure, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The middle frame shows her complete figure and clothing details, while the background consists of a white door frame with classical lines and carved patterns, and a large floor-to-ceiling window on the right. The curtains are made of sheer fabric, with vertical stripes that shimmer through the light. Outside, faint greenery and the building's silhouette can be seen, creating a contrast between solid and void. The composition adopts a central axis symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned at the center of the frame, creating a stable visual center of gravity and a dynamic balance effect; The image uses a low-angle downward angle, making the character appear more upright and noble, while emphasizing the beauty of the leg lines. The lighting and shadow atmosphere mainly uses natural soft light to create a warm and delicate texture, with smooth and unobtrusive shadow transitions; Floor reflection and curtain light create richly layered light and dark zones, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme mainly features pure white, off-white, and gray-white, harmoniously unified to present a sophisticated, tranquil, and slightly lazy fashionable lifestyle aesthetic. It feels as if you are inside a high-end urban apartment or an art studio, combining the refined feel of professional commercial photography with the elegant moments of everyday life. The images are delicate and authentic, full of narrative tension and emotional appeal, like a carefully composed fashion portrait that conveys the beauty of gentle strength and inner confidence.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
