        {
          "id": "krea2-bbbaa914cd4f5839e0fef725",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙博物馆困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a hugging light pink long-sleeved dress with an asymmetrical one-shoulder drop cut at the neckline. The skirt is tightly outlined with smooth curves, the hem lightly tapered above the knee, paired with simple white pointed heels. Her toes naturally curl slightly, exuding a calm yet powerful posture. Her makeup is delicate and elegant, revealing a hint of restrained confidence and a calm beauty; The foreground focuses on her long, straight legs and slender ankles. Sunlight streams through the right-side floor-to-ceiling window, casting sharp stripes of light and shadow on the smooth marble floor. The floor is covered with classic gray-and-white marble patterns, reflecting the daylight outside and the soft, diffused light inside. In the middle is a voluminous white plush armchair, with its curved backrest forming a gentle curve transitioning between it and the seat. The door frame and window frame structures are symmetrically arranged, with half-open white sheer curtains faintly visible on the left side, and bright, spacious floor-to-ceiling windows on the right. Outside, greenery is hazy, and natural light pours in through the window gaps, creating warm highlights on the shoulders, neck, arms, and legs, while soft shadows are cast on the back of the body and the ground. The overall light and shadow contrast is sharp yet harmonious, creating a tranquil yet slightly dramatic atmosphere; The composition uses a classic central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the golden ratio point. The curves of the armchair and body posture create visual balance, with a strong sense of horizontal extension and ample blank space on both sides, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Layer by layer, the viewer's gaze is drawn toward the heart of the painting; The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents the unique softness and clarity of morning or afternoon sunlight piercing through clouds. The light has a slight warm tone, but the overall tone leans toward cool white, creating a clean, sophisticated, and slightly dreamy minimalist aesthetic. The entire scene exudes a quiet and luxurious lifestyle, as if you are in a private art gallery or boutique hotel suite in a modern city. The atmosphere is both everyday and full of artistic flair. The details are rich but not overly complicated, offering strong visual impact and emotional appeal. Suitable as reference images for fashion portraits, commercial advertisements, or high-end lifestyle photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
