        {
          "id": "krea2-75e40593863c8870942be2e8",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman, dressed in a dreamy light pink strapless gown, sits on damp black rocks by the sea. The hem of her skirt spreads like clouds at her feet, creating a soft yet dynamic foreground. The fabric is light and sheer, with delicate pleats and three-dimensional layers, accented by delicate white feather decorations and small metallic flowers. The shoulders and waist are set with sparkling crystals or sequins, casting a subtle luster under the light. She wore a simple yet elegant gold necklace, fan-shaped earrings, and a watch intricately designed with colorful gemstones. On the ring finger of her left hand, she wore a slender ring. The overall accessory was understated yet highly textured, perfectly complementing the dress. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, body slightly turned, head slightly tilted, gaze directed toward the viewer, creating a strong sense of interaction and emotional tension; The skirt extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a visual guiding line. The background features dark, damp rocks and the faintly visible edge of seawater. The rock surface is covered with mottled water stains and moss traces, mainly in dark gray, dark green, and cool white, forming a strong contrast with the soft pink foreground, highlighting the subject's softness and purity. Light comes from the front side, soft and slightly warm at dusk, outlining clear contours and a sense of depth, while casting soft shadows on the rocky background to enhance spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and tinged with a touch of loneliness, like an unfinished lyrical poem. It combines the refinement of a high-end fashion blockbuster with the collision of natural wildness and inner emotions. The transitions of light and shadow are delicate, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting an artistic photography style that is both realistic and dreamy. It feels as if a professional photographer is using a high-end DSLR to capture it at dusk, with a film texture and slight grainy noise, giving the image a warm, retro cinematic aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
