        {
          "id": "krea2-a171a1f508193c0b85a76087",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚愤怒站立（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman with outstanding temperament stands in a minimalist modern interior, exuding a calm yet confident sense of sophistication. She wore a well-tailored black strapless dress with a cinched waist design that outlined a slender waistline. One side of the waist was cleverly tied to create asymmetrical pleats, and the slit at thigh height revealed long, beautiful legs. The fabric was delicate and draped down, with a soft sheen that was not glaring, appearing matte black under the light. She wears black stiletto sandals set with sparkling crystals or rhinestones, creating a subtle luxury that echoes the earrings. In the foreground, her intact figure occupies the lower center of the frame, her feet standing steadily on a large light gray tiled floor, with clear gaps between the tiles, and the faint light reflected from the ground enhances the sense of spatial depth; The central feature is a dark brown solid wood low cabinet with clean and smooth lines and vintage medieval-style drawer handles. On the left side of the cabinet is a white ceramic vase with several white flowers inside, creating a minimalist lifestyle aesthetic atmosphere; The background features pure white walls with no decorations, enhancing the visual focus of the main figure, while the large blank spaces evoke a serene and ethereal feel. The composition uses a full-body vertical portrait, with the figures centered symmetrically but slightly tilted in posture to break rigidity and create a visual flow path. Light and shadow use soft diffuse light, with the main light source coming from the left front of the figure and subtle shadows on the right side creating a sense of depth. The overall color scheme is primarily black, white, and gray, accented with warm wood tones, creating a cool, elegant, and slightly detached high-end fashion atmosphere. The entire image presents professional studio shooting standards, combining the depth of artistic photography composition with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich yet never overshadow the main focus, conveying an independent, composed, and powerful lifestyle attitude of urban women.",
