        {
          "id": "krea2-7ba618d899acece457b1f05d",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫公寓困倦蹲注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a loose, comfortable white turtleneck knit crop top that revealed a slender waistline and a flat stomach. She paired matching puffy shorts with thick, soft white plush boots, creating a clean and pure look full of fairy-tale-like healing. She squats on a blue-edged decorative platform with a smooth curve, leaning slightly forward, her posture relaxed yet expressive, as if preparing to stand up or interact with the audience. On the left side of the foreground is a handwoven willow basket with blue and white geometric ribbons tied at the rim. Inside the basket are an orange-red pumpkin sculpture, several red and yellow autumn leaves, and a small white flower, creating a rich atmosphere of autumn harvest and fairy-tale festivals. The center features the platform she sits on and a vintage wooden arched window behind her. The window frame is dark brown with clear grain, and through the glass, you can faintly see the warm interior decor. Colorful wooden boxes and wind chime decorations hang on the walls, fabric dolls and warm-toned fabrics are placed on the windowsill, and the background wall is light beige with subtle patterns. The entire space feels like a dreamy corner in a fairy tale house or theme park. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the right. The pumpkin basket in the foreground on the left serves as a balancing element guiding the viewer's gaze toward the main subject, while the window forms a natural frame to enhance the sense of depth. The lighting in the picture is soft and even, the layers of clothing folds are distinct, shadows are soft and unobtrusive, and the overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a lazy feeling like afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The color palette is mainly white, complemented by blue platforms, brown wood structures, and warm accents of orange-red pumpkin and autumn leaves, creating a cool and warm contrast without conflict, creating a visual experience that is both fresh and sweet. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, the contours are clear, and the area inside the background window is slightly dark, creating a contrast of light and dark that highlights the subject. The entire image exudes a carefully captured amateur photographic beauty from everyday life—possibly taken with a phone or regular camera under soft indoor lighting, without excessive post-processing, preserving the texture of real materials and natural tonal transitions. It resembles a private diary-like portrait of daily life, blending fairy-tale fantasy with real warmth, evoking joyful moments in a theme park, theater backstage, or family gathering. It features exquisite artistic composition while maintaining a warm, everyday warmth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
