        {
          "id": "krea2-30f520034705e0437710517b",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "A close-up half-length portrait of a woman, gently swaying in the wind, adding vitality and realism; It forms a subtle contrast with the overall warm atmosphere; She wore an off-white vertically striped knit sweater, soft and thick, with loose and comfortable cuffs. The fabric texture was clearly visible under the light. A delicate gold chain strap was slung across the chest, exposing the body and coordinating the color with the sweater. Around her neck was a simple silver chain necklace, with a small and delicate pendant that reflected understated luxury in the details. Her hands are folded and gently clasped in front of her, her nails neatly trimmed, her posture natural and relaxed, exuding a reserved yet gentle temperament; The composition uses a slightly upward angle, with the figure occupying the right side of the main body to create an intimate dialogue; The background features a blurred brick wall and interlaced withered branches. The texture of the brick wall is faintly discernible but is soft-focused, with bold and powerful lines of dead branches, creating a visual tension of warm and cool tones and a sense of firmness and softness. The characters are serene and elegant like figures in a painting, with subtle and restrained emotional expressions full of storytelling; The color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and ochre red, accented with metal gold chains, creating a harmonious and warm visual system; The image style pursues high realism and photographic texture, simulating professional camera shooting effects, with delicate noise control and natural depth transitions. Slight light glow at the edges enhances realism, avoiding excessive post-processing, preserving the feel of life and genuine emotional expression, presenting portrait photography that combines artistic beauty with everyday authenticity.",
