        {
          "id": "krea2-59221a276d3b6399bddf3122",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服雪地困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A graceful woman stands as the absolute subject of the painting, standing at the center of the snow-white stage, as if speaking poetic feelings within the tranquility. Her upper body wears a bold and elegant white strapless top, adorned with fluffy, three-dimensional feather-like ornaments on the chest, with subtle pleats at the edges that reflect a pure shine under the light; The lower half is a perfectly tailored black velvet gown, with the hem dragging to the floor forming an elegant curve. At the waist, a gorgeous heart-shaped metal clasp with gold trim outlines a dazzling silhouette, and a crystal-clear teardrop-shaped pearl pendant hangs below, becoming the visual focal point. The high slit design cleverly reveals her long, straight leg lines, paired with black stiletto sandals adorned with fine diamonds. The uppers sparkle with sparkling stars, echoing the minimalist ring on her left wrist and the multi-layered pearl necklace around her neck. The overall look presents a strong black-and-white contrast with luxurious and exquisite details. In the foreground are her slender hands—her right hand naturally hanging at her side, her left hand gently holding a silver-gray microphone, her fingertips calm and poised, hinting that she is about to or has just completed a performance full of emotional expression; The flawless white stage floor beneath your feet reflects soft light, extending a clean and pure sense of space. The middle ground is surrounded by lush floral installations on both sides: on the left, purple hydrangeas and pink roses cluster together, with plump and vibrant petals and lush green leaves to set off the scene; On the right side, a large number of fluffy, misty, pale green feather-like plants intertwine with pale purple flowers, creating rich layers and a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. These flowers are not perfectly symmetrical but naturally extend asymmetrically, giving the painting a sense of dynamic balance. The background is a pure gray curtain, simple yet full of modern artistic flair. The composition uses a central composition: the figure stands slightly to the left center, with the body slightly tilted to the right, the head slightly raised, and the gaze directed toward the upper right of the frame, creating a subtle psychological tension and sense of spatial extension; The camera angle is a level view with a slightly low angle, enhancing the character's noble temperament and stage presence; The floral installations on both sides of the painting curve inward at a slanting angle, forming a strong visual guiding path. In terms of lighting and shadows, the overall use of a softbox illumination is used, with the light source coming from the upper front position, giving clear contours without harsh shadows; The hem of the dress and the bouquet area have a slight backlighting effect, creating a soft halo at the edges to enhance three-dimensionality and material expressiveness; The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, complemented by warm colors like purple, pink, and green from flowers, creating a unique atmosphere where cold elegance and romance coexist. The entire scene exudes an atmosphere that combines high-end fashion with an artistic lyrical temperament. It combines the precise control and artistic beauty of a professional studio with a natural, lively vibe of everyday life, as if capturing a real moment rather than deliberately staged shots, allowing viewers to feel the inner emotional flow of the characters and the poetic resonance of the scene.",
