        {
          "id": "krea2-9b7ee67fd823b99a7bd9e52c",
          "alias": "单女黑挂脖庭院冷淡站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an outdoor courtyard, wearing a pair of striking red round earrings paired with a black halter-style sleeveless dress that creates a striking color contrast. The dress is made of smooth and delicate material, with an elegant neckline and hollowed-out details. In her right hand, she holds an unfolded white oil-paper umbrella, its surface as white as snow, the ribs clearly visible, and a small red round bead adorned at the end of the handle, adding a splash of color to the overall image. Her body leans slightly, her posture naturally relaxed. As if about to step forward or just stop, the foreground is her huge white oil-paper umbrella occupying most of the space below the frame. The umbrella's surface has delicate texture, soft edges, and light and shadow create subtle transitions of light and shadow on its surface. In the middle is her slender arms and some leg lines, her skin fair and delicate, glowing with a healthy glow in the sunlight. The background is a blurred green vegetation and red brick building walls, lush with branches and leaves, the leaves displaying a richly layered green tone under the sunlight. Dappled light and shadow scattered across the grass, while the distant red brick wall and dark window frames created a warm and slightly vintage tone. The composition adopted a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame. The white oil-paper umbrella extended diagonally from the lower right corner to the center of the image, forming a visual guide line that created a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. Light came from the upper left side, with soft daylight evenly casting shadows below the umbrella and on the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere was tranquil, elegant, and full of Eastern aesthetic conception The image exudes a fresh and natural atmosphere, as if immersed in a poetic Jiangnan garden. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with green plants and red accents, creating a warm and cool contrast. It highlights the main subject while maintaining harmony and unity. The image texture is delicate and authentic, featuring professional studio-level lighting effects and post-processing color grading, presenting a style that is both artistic and close to everyday life, as if shooting with a high-end digital camera paired with a large aperture lens. Capturing the momentary dynamic beauty and emotional tension, the entire scene exudes a unique charm where youthful energy and classical charm intertwine.",
