        {
          "id": "krea2-eed55067b46bdebdfcd30283",
          "alias": "单女金礼服舞台困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a dark, minimalist chair, wearing a delicate gold mesh sequin spaghetti strap gown. The dress is woven from countless fine, shiny metal sequins, reflecting a flowing star-like glow in the soft warm light, accentuating her figure with elegant curves; Her arms are covered with finely textured black velvet long gloves that extend from the shoulders to the wrists, creating a strong and harmonious visual contrast with the golden dress. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, while her right hand hangs lightly at the side of her leg, her posture composed yet tinged with a mysterious tension; As if a breeze or a moment of emotional surge freezes in time; Around her neck, she wears a multi-layered vintage-style necklace, including a chunky chain, round silver coin pendants, and wood grain decorations, offering rich layers and an exotic flair; Her expression is calm and full of storytelling; The background is a purely deep black space, dotted with numerous scattered golden circular light spots, creating a dreamy stage lighting or stardust effect, enhancing the depth and atmosphere of the scene; The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical portrait style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, the head slightly tilted forward, forming a direct emotional connection between the gaze and the viewer; The use of dramatic lighting and shadow is used, with the main light source coming from the front right of the figure, while a soft shadow transition is formed on the left side to enhance the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere blends high-end fashion, mysterious sensuality, and the texture of an art film, featuring slight grainy noise and film-like color tendencies. It feels as if shot by a professional studio using high-end digital cameras, yet retains the subtle realism and warm emotional warmth found in everyday amateur shooting. The whole scene is like a silent poem, telling the story of a modern woman who wanders between brilliance and loneliness.",
          "description": "",
