        {
          "id": "krea2-30dde762fb536aa485a7c53c",
          "alias": "单女紫和服窗边专注跪手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels in the center of a traditional Japanese tatami room, dressed in a delicate light purple kimono adorned with white daisy patterns. The petal edges outline delicate lines, with a bright yellow patch at the center, soft and layered in color. A warm golden wide belt is tied around her waist, creating an elegant contrast with the outfit. Her hands were gently folded over her knees, fingertips slightly curved, and her nails neatly trimmed, presenting a reserved yet dignified posture. In the foreground is a tatami mat spread below her knees, with clearly visible textures; the light brown straw texture contrasts materially with the soft fabric of her kimono. The middle frame depicts her complete silhouette, wrapped in kimono from waist to ankles, with natural folds that create subtle transitions of light and shadow under the light. On the left side of the background is a Japanese-style sliding door framed with wooden frames, letting in soft natural light. On the right wall hangs an ink landscape scroll, depicting distant mountains shrouded in mist and clouds, with simple and expressive brushwork. Beside it, a blue-and-white porcelain vase holding several bouquets of pink peonies can be faintly seen. The flowers are full and vibrant, echoing the kimono patterns in color. The entire composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned slightly below the center of the frame, maintaining a stable and focused visual focus. Light comes from the front left window, creating a soft side glow, while casting gentle shadows on the right side of the body and the floor, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and restrained, infused with the subtle poetry unique to Eastern aesthetics. The light and shadow are as gentle as silk, with earth tones as the main palette, accented by bright yellow and pink florals, creating a scene that is both everyday and full of ritual. The visual style simulates the realism of amateur equipment shooting, rich in details without overpowering the main focus, emphasizing the integration of natural environment with the characters' emotions, presenting a tranquil beauty reminiscent of \"art in life.\"",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
