        {
          "id": "krea2-5cfe9d8b580e90c7eae1bc29",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上温柔倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a wooden chair, leaning slightly forward, her posture naturally relaxed. She wore a loose white long-sleeve shirt with light and flowing fabric, naturally draped cuffs, layered with a light gray sleeveless knit vest. The soft wool texture contrasted gently with the shirt, and underneath, a white crewneck base layer was faintly visible. The overall outfit was simple and comfortable, full of the lazy vibe of everyday life. Her legs are naturally crossed, her knees slightly exposed, and she wears pure white mid-calf socks at her ankles. Her fingers are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her left hand gently rests on her calf, giving her a quiet posture of deep thought or ready to rise. The earphones have clean, modern lines and are suspended from the wall via metal hooks. Beside it, a window can be faintly seen letting in soft natural light, and the edges of the window frame are blurred to create a sense of spatial depth. In the foreground is the wooden chair she sits on, with a clearly visible backrest and delicate and warm wood grain. The legs are simple and stable, and a wooden clothes hanger under the chair extends diagonally into the frame, adding details to everyday life. The composition uses a slightly upward angle to make the subjects appear more intimately and approachable. Using shallow depth of field technology, the background wall, headphones, and distant window areas create a natural blur effect, enhancing the subject's prominence. Then, the sleeves and leg lines guide the movement downward, finally converging at the chair's contact point with the floor, forming a stable and layered visual flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the main light source coming from the right window direction, creating a delicate transition between light and dark. Subtle shadows appear in the folds of the clothing, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, and light gray, with moderate low saturation, creating a peaceful, cozy, and healing home atmosphere. It feels like a moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice, frozen in time. The image has a slight film grain texture, like everyday photos taken with a regular digital camera or phone under natural light. It combines the authenticity of life with the delicate beauty of artistic photography, conveying a youthful, gentle, and calm attitude toward life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
