        {
          "id": "krea2-4bbe87b14207bb3a06d69569",
          "alias": "单女白T恤海滩忧伤行走",
          "prompt": "The cuffs featured delicate stitching details, and the hem gently lifted in the breeze, harmonizing with her posture; With a hint of thoughtful melancholy or calmness, the overall makeup is minimalist, highlighting a pure and flawless temperament; The foreground focuses on her shoulders, neck, and upper body, with a close-up composition, placing the figure slightly at the center left of the frame, with the body slightly tilted. The middle ground is a sandy beach, with fine and even grains, warm gray-brown in color, and faint ripple marks on the surface. A few footprints and scattered stones can be faintly seen. In the distance to the right, a man in a white T-shirt slowly walks toward the seaside embankment. His figure is blurred, serving as a secondary element in the painting and adding spatial layering; The background is where the open coastline meets the sky. In the distance, there is a low concrete breakwater or viewing platform, sparsely poised with a few tourists. Further away, the hazy horizon shifts from light blue above to a pale orange sunset near the horizon. The clouds are thin and light, spreading like silk across the horizon, creating a tranquil atmosphere at dusk; The entire frame is shot at a wide or medium focal length, with slight perspective distortion to enhance the sense of presence and immersion; then guided by the foreground garment texture to the mid-view beach texture; The light and shadow come from the right diagonal upper part, representing the soft light of the golden evening hour. The light is soft and has a warm contrast, while the body shadows transition naturally, avoiding abrupt segmentation; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, slightly lonely and poetic, with cool blue and warm orange as the main colors, creating a visual contrast yet harmonious unity, conveying an emotional tone of youthful farewell, free imagination, or inner monologue; The image quality leans toward a realistic and natural phone shooting style, with rich detail retention, minimal noise, and low color saturation, presenting gentle moments captured casually in daily life rather than over-retouched commercial blockbusters.",
