        {
          "id": "krea2-ff6be622e4a266155c5a1fc8",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内愤怒站立",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the scene, naturally falling down to her shoulders and back, with a simple and unobtrusive headband. Around her neck wears a small, delicate star-shaped pendant necklace, giving the overall vibe a fresh, natural, and slightly youthful playfulness. She wore a white sporty tank top with a distinctive blue trim at the neckline and hem, and the word \"Unlovable\" printed on the chest. The handwriting was elegant in handwriting, matching the border, simple yet full of personality; Pair it with loose white shorts and a knotted fabric of the same color at the waist, creating a relaxed and casual home style that exudes a comfortable and relaxed lifestyle. In the foreground, her lower body and one arm rest on the edge of a wooden bedside or table, her hand posture relaxed and natural, fingers gently resting on the wooden surface, with the wood grain clearly visible. Beside it, a corner of a black desk lampshade is faintly visible, hinting at the warm atmosphere of the indoor environment. The medium shots focus on her upper body, shoulders, and neck lines. The fabric feels soft and hugged her figure, with soft light and shadow outlining the contours of the skin and the details of the garment's folds. The blue lines along the edges of the vest stand out especially against a lighter background. The background uses a blurred effect. On the right side, there is a window with blinds, where sunlight streams through the gaps, creating soft, mottled light spots on the walls and floor. The left wall is clean and elegant, with a large green plant in the corner spreading out, adding vitality and layering. The overall background tones are mainly warm white and light wood tones, creating a bright and transparent space. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, head slightly turned toward the camera, and body lines extending to enhance movement, presenting a natural and comfortable atmosphere for everyday shooting. Finally, the transition to light and shadow in the background and plants forms a visual path that moves from near to far, from fine to wide. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the right window direction, creating a soft and natural side backlight that creates a warm, hazy silhouette light, while subtly shadowing the sides of the body to enhance the sense of depth; The overall lighting is uniform but not glaring, with moderate color saturation, leaning towards creamy tones and light blue accents, creating a peaceful, gentle, and healing atmosphere. The entire image presents a lifestyle aesthetic that seems to be casually taken with amateur equipment yet highly textured, combining authentic life atmosphere with meticulously composed artistic beauty. It exudes both innocence and vitality while revealing confidence and composure about one's own state, allowing one to feel the tranquil moments under the afternoon sunlight and the gentle flow of the inner world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
