        {
          "id": "krea2-742cd6f60dbc718a09a35201",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙竹林自信持相机",
          "prompt": "Naturally falling behind her shoulders, the tips are slightly curled and glow with a healthy shine under soft light. On her head is a light yellow straw-woven bamboo hat with wide brims, edges adorned with fine woven patterns and delicate beadwork. Her right hand gently lifts the bamboo handle of the bamboo hat, her posture elegant and natural, blocking some sunlight while cleverly serving as a visual guide in the composition. She wore a pure white sleeveless lace slip dress, with delicate and intricate lace lace trim at the neckline and waist. The fabric was light and soft, gently swaying in the breeze, revealing the natural glow of her skin. Around her neck was a very thin gold necklace, and the pendant was a simple small cross shape, subtle and delicate in light and shadow. The curve of the bamboo hat, the length of the fingers, and the delicate contrast of the transparent nails; The middle shot is a partial part of her extended arms and skirt hem, with rich layers of fabric folds and changes in light and shadow; The background is completely occupied by a hazy, dense green plant, with layers of leaves that create a blurred gradient from near to far, creating a profound sense of depth and a tranquil natural atmosphere. The entire image is composed vertically, with the main subject positioned slightly above the center, and the slanting lines of the bamboo hat and the curves of the arms together form a dynamic balance. Light comes from the upper left, soft natural daylight, filtering through the gaps in the leaves and enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly fresh and bright green and pure white, harmoniously unified and full of vitality and healing. The visual atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and full of summer pastoral poetry, with a slight film grain texture and soft focus effect. It feels like an amateur work taken under the shade of an old digital camera or phone in the shade of an afternoon. It combines the atmosphere of life with artistic beauty, conveying a tranquil mood of escaping the noise and returning to nature, allowing people to feel the beautiful moments of youth, innocence, and coexistence with nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
