        {
          "id": "krea2-756a40023e738764e3d2e901",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙椅上坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair in an outdoor field, wearing a light, flowing white sleeveless dress adorned with delicate lace trim at the collar and sleeves. The fabric naturally falls in the breeze, her shoulders are soft, her posture relaxed and elegant, her head slightly tilted back, as if quietly feeling the gentle touch of sunlight and breeze. She leans back in the chair, arms naturally folded over her chest, exuding a serene yet slightly lazy beauty. The foreground is a close-up of her body, including her arms, shoulders, and part of the skirt, as well as the wooden grain of the chair's armrests clearly visible. On the small wooden table beside the chair are several jars of colorful paint bottles—yellow, blue, green, and other vivid tones form visual focal points, suggesting she may be a painter or enjoying artistic creation. In the distance, dense and verdant forests with dense canopies and rich layers, The leaves appear in varying shades of green under the light, the sky is bathed in soft warm light, clouds are thin, and sunlight pours diagonally from the upper left of the image, creating a bright backlight effect that creates a dreamlike silhouette light. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with just the right contrast between light and shadow. The entire composition uses a slanted third-division method, with the figure positioned at the lower right third. On the right side, a pure white and light paper windmill floats in the air. Its dynamic effect adds vitality and childlike fun to the static image, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, healing, and full of poetry. It carries a faint sense of nostalgia and artistic atmosphere, like a leisurely moment when afternoon sunlight bathes the fields. The texture of the image is as delicate as film film, with color saturation that is moderately warm and has a slight soft-focus effect, enhancing the dreamlike and immersive experience. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with smooth transitions between light and shadow, emphasizing the translucency of the subject's skin and the light texture of the clothing. The background blur is well handled, creating a beautiful bokeh effect that makes the subject stand out more. The entire image exudes a gentle, romantic, and free aesthetic for living. Like a silent pastoral poem, it combines the realism of amateur equipment with professional-grade color grading, offering a sense of everyday warmth while retaining the refinement and depth of artistic photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
