        {
          "id": "krea2-69bfdab2aa154e8a2a0a0d98",
          "alias": "单女毛衣雪地困倦",
          "prompt": "A woman occupies the center of the painting, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush hat with a wide brim full of layers. The plush texture is as delicate as snow, the edges slightly flared, and the makeup is delicate but not exaggerated, emphasizing the skin's radiance and natural rosiness. The sleeves are off-white knitted fabric with clearly visible textures, and the cuffs are loose and comfortable, giving the overall look a warm yet stylish winter vibe. Rich in details and well-layered; In the middle shot, the lines of her knitted sweater and arms can be seen; the folds of the garment are natural, blending with the background to create spatial depth; The background presents a nighttime outdoor scene, with a deep night sky above dotted with scattered starlight or artificial light sources. The edges of the plush hat create bright highlights due to reflections, while the background is deliberately darkened to create a \"backlit silhouette\" effect that highlights the subject; The overall atmosphere is warm and dreamy, with a touch of fairy tale flavor, as if you are in a secret garden under the winter night starry sky. It combines the casual vibe of daily life with cinematic soft-focus aesthetics and romantic moods; The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with beige clothing providing a warm tone, and a deep blue background paired with starlight highlights to create a sense of tranquility and mystery; The image style simulates the authentic texture of amateur equipment, retaining slight noise and slight out-of-focus edges, enhancing a sense of everyday life and intimacy. It achieves professional-grade retouching without showing traces of artificial retouch, presenting an artistic portrait work that combines youthful vitality, winter warmth, and dreamy poetry.",
