        {
          "id": "krea2-293fbfec38297b59cdacc29a",
          "alias": "单女毛衣窗边严肃坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car, her body slightly leaning against the window frame, her hands folded and gently gripping beneath the frame, fingertips naturally exposed. Her sleeves are loose, light gray-white hoodies, with delicate ribbed knit patterns at the collar and cuffs. The soft fabric drapes and pleats naturally with her posture, as if immersed in a moment of peace and imagination on a journey. Her makeup is elegant and natural, almost invisible. In the foreground, the dark inner side of the car door and the metal frame of the window where she leans is visible, giving a steady and solid texture. The edges of the reflection are slightly out of focus but retain the figure's outline and expression, enhancing the spatial depth of the scene. The center view is the surface of the off-white leather seat she sits on, with a delicate and soft texture and neat stitching. The seat edge and the backrest connect with a natural curve, harmoniously matching the warm tones of her sweatshirt. Through the car window in the background, the green landscape on the side of the city road is shown. In the distance, you can see lush trees and lush leaves, with the canopy shining in the sunlight in bright green layers. Other vehicles are driving on the road, their bodies blurred and blurred, creating a dynamic and shuttling atmosphere. In the distance, the low silhouettes of city buildings can be faintly seen at the junction with the sky. The sky shows a gradient from pale gold to light blue, with thin and light clouds, making the entire background space spacious and full of life. The composition is shot at an angle, with the camera positioned close to the inside of the car window, the angle slightly raised and tilted to the right, so the main subject occupies the center right of the frame, with the head facing to the left front, creating a visual guiding path. The overall composition is vertical, suitable for phone shooting or daily selfies, with ample blank space, and ample space at the top and bottom to accommodate environmental elements and light and shadow changes. In terms of lighting and shadows, the main light source comes from natural daylight in the upper left area, which is a type of backlighting that enhances three-dimensionality while avoiding overexposure. The interior ceiling and seats receive even but relatively dark light, creating a contrast of light and dark that enhances the main subject. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, healing, artistic, and full of youthful energy, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and travel. It seems to record a moment of an ordinary yet precious daily journey. The color saturation is moderately low, with warm gray, off-white, and light brown as the main tones, complemented by green vegetation outside the window and pale blue sky. The overall visual style is fresh, natural, authentic, and unpretentious, offering a strong immersive viewing experience and emotional resonance. The details are rich and delicate, presenting a lifestyle aesthetic image shot with ordinary equipment yet highly artistically moving.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
