        {
          "id": "krea2-aff335a5878d5389c74534ed",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩微笑坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the beach, bathed in the warm, soft golden sunlight of dusk. She wears a delicate white lace spaghetti strap dress that is light and flowing, with delicate embroidery on the hem and straps faintly visible under the light, showcasing elegance and softness. It adds a lazy yet authentic texture. She held a dark smartphone in both hands, with a minimalist brand logo printed on the back. The camera was pointed at herself, as if taking a selfie or recording this beautiful moment. Her fingers were long and fair, her nails neatly trimmed, her posture natural relaxed, and she turned slightly to look back at the camera, carrying a touch of tranquility and contemplation, revealing a gentle and reserved smile. Under backlighting, subtle highlights and shadow layers are presented, with an overall understated and natural makeup that emphasizes a healthy glow rather than heavy embellishment. Details are sharp and clear, while the background completely blurs into a dreamy circular light spot, formed by the sunset reflected on the water's surface. Warm yellow halos of varying sizes and interlocking light and shadow scatter across the scene like stars, creating a strong sense of depth and romantic atmosphere. The composition is shot from a slightly upward angle, placing the figure to the lower right of the frame to strengthen the emotional connection. The overall composition is vertical, matching the visual habits of shooting with a phone or sharing on social media. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is highly cinematic, with warm lighting shining from behind and from the side above, while the background light spots emit a hazy, dreamy atmosphere. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil, gentle, and healing dusk mood, as if time has stood still at this moment, with only the gentle sea breeze and inner peace of monologue. The colors in the painting are mainly warm gold, off-white, and light brown, with moderate saturation, avoiding excessive brightness and emphasizing a natural, soft visual experience. It features a strong Japanese artistic or Korean photo style, while retaining the authenticity and everyday atmosphere of everyday photography. It feels as if a beautiful moment encountered by the sea on a regular phone is captured and frozen in time, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
