        {
          "id": "krea2-117409f3dbea1009efa362fb",
          "alias": "单女白睡裙小径困倦拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wore a simple and elegant white spaghetti strap nightgown, with the straps slender and hugging the skin, outlining a long, graceful collarbone line and soft shoulder curves. The fabric was lightweight and breathable, glowing with a warm glow under the sunlight. She is draped in a fluffy, soft off-white plush blanket. The blanket is thick and layered, with the fluffy fibers displaying rich textured details under the light. Part of the blanket covers her shoulders and chest, while the other end is gently draped over her arm, creating natural folds and transitions of light and shadow. In the foreground, the edges of the plush blanket occupy the lower left and middle areas of the composition, adding a cozy and healing atmosphere. The middle shot focuses on the neck, collarbones, and shoulders, with light streaming diagonally from the right, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow, illuminating her smooth skin and the folds of her clothing. The shadowed areas transition naturally, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The background adopts a minimalist style, a pure light beige or cream wall, with no decorations or clutter obstructing the view. The large areas of blank space and soft gradient light and shadow create a tranquil and ethereal sense of space, focusing the viewer's attention entirely on the figures themselves. The composition uses a vertical long format, with the character's head positioned slightly to the upper right of the frame, and the gaze naturally directed to the lower left, creating visual balance and guidance; The slightly tilted posture of the subject adds dynamism and affinity to the painting. At the same time, the right shoulder and collarbone lines form a natural visual guiding path, allowing the viewer's gaze to flow smoothly throughout the frame. The lighting and shadow treatment is extremely meticulous. The light source comes from the upper right corner of the frame, typically soft natural window light or early morning sunlight. The light penetrates the plush blanket, creating delicate highlights and soft shadow layers on its surface, while a warm golden halo forms around the shoulders and neck, creating a dreamy soft focus effect. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and healing, with a strong Japanese style and cinematic feel. The color palette mainly consists of cream white, beige, and light apricot, with low saturation but moderate contrast, presenting a hazy yet realistic \"film feel.\" The image texture is delicate and authentic, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in indoor natural light. The details are rich yet not cluttered, conveying a relaxed afternoon, a homely relaxation, and a sweet healing emotional tone, evoking a sense of pure gentleness and peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
