        {
          "id": "krea2-9dfa4a1df5bb9cdfd62711c1",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤家中困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wore a light pink camisole over a loose long-sleeve shirt in the same color. The fabric was soft with natural pleats, the straps were slender, and the neckline faintly revealed the lining details, creating an overall look that felt gentle and relaxed at home. Her hands gently held a string of white hollowed-out lace fabric, her fingertips slender, nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish. The lace texture was clear, with tassels hanging naturally at the edges, adding depth to the image. As if lost in his own thoughts. Light slanted from the left side of the frame into the room, creating a warm and soft backlighting effect. Light and shadow outline natural transitions between light and dark on the skin, with slight shadows on the shoulders and arms to enhance the sense of depth. The background is a hazy off-white curtain, made of lightweight fabric that lets light through. Sunlight filters through the curtain, creating soft scattered light spots that create a tranquil and cozy indoor environment. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, and the line of sight naturally extending to the blank area on the right side of the painting, creating visual blank space and imaginative space. The overall color palette of the painting is mainly warm pink, cream white, and light beige, with low color saturation, presenting a soft and dreamy atmosphere. The light and shadows are soft and layered, combining the brightness of daylight with the privacy and tranquility of the indoor environment. The visual style leans toward realistic and delicate portrait photography, with a slight film graininess texture. It looks like amateur equipment but features professional-grade post-processing color grading. It emphasizes emotional expression rather than mere portrait recording. The overall atmosphere is calm, gentle, and slightly artistic, suitable for moments of afternoon solitude, inner calm, or emotional reflection, with strong artistic appeal and a sense of everyday beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
