        {
          "id": "krea2-e464ce3c071577d04b26c313",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍庭院冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman is the absolute subject of the painting, dressed in a delicate and elegant royal blue short-sleeved qipao. The fabric features delicate jacquard patterns, which, under soft light, present a silky smoothness and subtle sheen. Matching frog buttons are visible at the collar and cuffs, the waistline naturally cinches, and the skirt drapes smoothly, outlining the gentle and dignified silhouette of an Eastern woman. A slight downward angle enhances the character's presence and noble temperament, while using shallow depth of field to firmly lock the viewer's gaze onto the character. The crossed hands guide the gaze downward to the waistline of the qipao, then naturally transition into the architectural structure in a blurred background; For lighting and ambiance, soft diffuse natural light is used, with the light source coming from the left front of the figure and subtle shadows on the right side to enhance the sense of depth. The background light is darker to emphasize the subject; The overall color scheme is balanced between warm and cool, with blue and gray as the main tones, creating a tranquil, nostalgic, and poetic atmosphere. It feels as if time has frozen in a Republican-era afternoon courtyard, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the genuine warmth of everyday shooting. The images are full of narrative tension and emotional appeal, evoking the image of an untold story or a scene about to unfold, combining classical aesthetic depth with modern aesthetic taste.",
