        {
          "id": "krea2-9c865a3ccad9641c2de62bc7",
          "alias": "单女白袜子街道愤怒行走",
          "prompt": "She slung a beige canvas shoulder bag across her shoulder, paired with white mid-calf socks and cream-colored platform casual sneakers. The overall look retains the innocence of campus while maintaining the comfort and casualness of modern daily life. She stood at the edge of the sidewalk at a city street corner, her body slightly turned, her right hand lightly touching her skirt, her left hand naturally letting go, her posture elegant and relaxed, as if she were slowly walking down the street after school, capturing a fleeting moment of tranquility; In the foreground is a clearly visible gray square tile-paved walkway. Under the slanting sunlight, long, soft, warm lines of light and shadow are cast, creating a visual rhythm of light and shadow between the bricks. In the left foreground stands a silver metal barrier pillar with a warm yellow glow at the top, while on the right is a slightly mottled wooden low railing, with scattered leaves and small debris along the edges, adding a touch of real life. The middle section extends to the center of the street, where a zebra crossing is visible. In the distance, a black car is parked, and an outdoor table and chairs are placed by the roadside. Pedestrians can be faintly seen weaving through the shadows of the trees. In the background, a row of tall, dense green trees forms a natural barrier. The leaves in the sunset glow display richly layered emerald hues, and the interlaced branches form a natural frame structure. In the distance, the blurred outlines of buildings and the junction with the sky are gently enveloped by golden evening glow; The composition uses a low-angle downward view, employing perspective to enhance spatial depth. The subject occupies about two-thirds of the right side of the frame, with the left side blank to create a sense of breathability, while the contrast of solid and void highlights the subject's presence; The visual guidance path is clear, starting from the light and shadow lines beneath the feet to the curves of the legs, creating a strong immersive viewing experience; The lighting is extremely delicate, using the golden evening backlight or side backlighting techniques. Sunlight filters through the gaps between leaves from the right rear of the subject, while the shadows retain appropriate layers to avoid overexposure; The overall atmosphere blends cinematic feel with everyday life, combining the gentle healing of fresh Japanese campus aesthetics with the lazy romantic mood unique to urban dusk. The color palette is dominated by warm orange, olive green, and gray-blue, with moderate saturation that is not glaring. The image texture is as delicate and soft as film, with meticulous attention to detail, as if shot by a high-quality digital camera under natural light for amateurs, rather than a heavily post-processed commercial blockbuster. It conveys an unpolished yet highly infectious authentic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
