        {
          "id": "krea2-3cb0d51758deb3319eb995df",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "The overall makeup is clean, fresh, and non-aggressive. Some parts are gently loosened by a breeze, with slightly natural curls at the ends. The cable ends with a gray-white plug, with clearly visible details. She wore a white plaid dress adorned with delicate pleated lace, with a plaid pattern woven from light gray and pure white. Layers of ruffled designs on the neckline and cuffs added a sweet touch. A wide off-white shoulder strap slung across her shoulders, with metal fasteners reflecting a faint sheen in the sunlight. Her left hand gently lifted, fingertips lightly touching the edge of the earbud earbud, as if adjusting volume or feeling the rhythm of music, while her right hand naturally hung in front of her, fingers lightly gripping part of the shoulder strap, her posture relaxed and full of life. The composition adopts a slightly upward-looking perspective, making the characters appear more approachable and endearing, while leaving enough space to showcase the details of the clothing and accessories. The middle section shows the structure of her dress and suspenders, as well as the extension of the headphone cable along her body, guiding the gaze downward. The entire image uses highly saturated warm tones, with soft and bright lighting, typically shot against or side backlighting under natural light, enhancing depth and texture. She firmly captures the audience's attention on her gentle and reserved expressions and immersive listening experience. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, exuding a youthful artistic vibe. It features exquisite lighting and composition like a professional studio, while retaining the authentic and natural vitality of daily life. It seems to capture a beautiful moment of a girl enjoying music and solitude under the sun. The images are full of storytelling and emotional resonance, with strong visual appeal and artistic expression. They are suitable as mobile wallpapers or social media avatars, evoking viewers' longing and resonance for a simple, happy life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
