        {
          "id": "krea2-5511b38057f647e80f1317ca",
          "alias": "单女短裙沙发困倦坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "She sits half-sideways, gazing back at the camera, gently embracing a fluffy pink rabbit plush plush with her left hand. The doll's fur is curly, and its body is gently wrapped by her arms, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground, her skirt hem and doll occupy the lower area, with layers of lace trim that create a hazy texture under soft light. On the left, a touch of pink satin fabric hangs down, resembling a corner of a sofa or sheet, adding warmth and a sense of everyday life. The middle frame is the transitional space between her complete silhouette and the background bookshelf. The bookshelf has a simple white multi-layer structure, with pink rose bouquets, framed paintings, and ceramic ware placed on the shelves. The items are arranged in an orderly yet orderly manner, creating a warm and cozy home atmosphere. The background features a combination of light beige walls and bookshelves, with light pouring in from the left window, creating bright highlights on the shoulders and headband edges, while natural gradient shadows transition on the right side. The composition uses the classic three-division method, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, and the left blank area filled with strong lighting, creating visual balance and a sense of breathability; The figure's head and doll together form a visual anchor, guiding the viewer's gaze naturally from top to bottom to the details of the skirt and hands. The use of light and shadow gives a cinematic feel, with natural light from outside the window creating a soft-focus scattered effect, creating delicate layers and a sense of depth, while also creating a slight backlit edge halo to enhance the dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cream white, light pink, and beige. The saturation is low but the contrast is soft, creating a tranquil and gentle atmosphere like afternoon sunlight filling a room. The images are filled with a romantic mood that is sweet but not cloying, as if time has stood still at this moment, full of healing and nostalgic artistic beauty. The entire image appears to have been taken by a professional photographer using a high-end digital camera paired with a softbox and a large-aperture lens, presenting a highly realistic and delicate texture and immersive emotional expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
