        {
          "id": "krea2-15f30a3a26d4ec7e895f7d2b",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣门站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an open white refrigerator, wearing a soft, fitted light pink knit camisole with delicate vertical textures, creating subtle shadows of natural folds and skin contact in soft light; Pair it with loose, comfortable light gray sport shorts with elastic ruffles at the waistband, and the legs drag down to mid-thigh, revealing a slender leg line. She was gently twisting open the metal cap of a transparent glass bottle with her right hand, steadily supporting the bottle with her left. The liquid inside was pale yellow, with a simple white label on the bottle. A few bubbles or droplets remained at the mouth of the bottle, hinting at the chill of just taking it out of the fridge. Slightly tilting her head to gaze into the camera, the foreground focuses on the glass bottle and its cap she holds with both hands, the bottle body reflecting a crystal-clear texture under the light; The middle frame shows her upper body and shorts, with a slightly forward-leaning posture to create a natural dynamic balance; The background shows the refrigerator interior and its surroundings. The refrigerator door is open, and the warm and soft lighting illuminates the green plastic bottles, orange containers, and other blurred outlines of items inside the refrigerator compartment. On the left side of the fridge door is a blue-purple border paper inventory label, faintly visible with the word \"continus,\" while on the right is a curved mirror reflecting the warm tones of light and shadow inside. The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the person positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, and the camera angle slightly below level view, creating a friendly and natural shooting angle. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the warm yellow glow inside the refrigerator, which shines from behind and above the figure, while creating a slight shadow transition on the chest and abdomen to enhance the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of the everyday feel of home life. It combines the cleanliness of a modern home environment with the relaxed and comfortable feeling of enjoying a moment of coolness through the characters' movements and expressions. The colors are mainly pink, gray, and white, complemented by warm yellow lighting inside the refrigerator, creating a low-saturation yet layered visual experience. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if taken by a high-end digital camera in indoor natural light, combining a sense of everyday realism with artistic softness.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
