        {
          "id": "krea2-fc7829789234c6b956fe7ea6",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫桌边冷淡躺阅读",
          "prompt": "The necklace is adorned with a gentle little pearl, subtle yet revealing refined taste; She wore a loose, comfortable off-white turtleneck sweatshirt with delicate ribbed knit designs at the cuffs. The fabric was soft and fluffy, with pleats naturally draping down, creating a relaxed yet gentle homely visual impression; Her hands are folded and gently resting on the edge of a natural wood-colored round table, fingertips curled slightly, her posture relaxed and focused. In front of her lies a book with an elegant cover, its pages pure white, faintly visible in gold-embossed text and lines, hinting at themes of reading or reflection; The composition adopts a classic side close-up perspective, with the subject occupying two-thirds of the left side of the canvas, with the line extending to the front right. The background is a modern minimalist home environment with shallow depth blur treatment, faintly visible off-white and light gray cabinets, drawer cabinets, and wooden countertops. The color scheme is unified and harmonious, with no unnecessary decorations distracting the subject; The overall use of light and shadow is extremely delicate, creating a soft transition between light and dark, with no obvious harsh shadows, enhancing depth and realistic tactile sensation; The color palette is dominated by warm whites, accented with cool accents of natural wood brown, light gray, and metallic silver, creating a tranquil, cozy, and slightly artistic visual atmosphere, as if stepping into a corner of an afternoon study or café where sunlight streams through the window lattice; The entire scene presents the beauty of moments captured in everyday life, with slight film graininess and soft-focus effects, simulating the authentic texture of amateur equipment rather than the overly polished commercial blockbuster style. It emphasizes emotional expression rather than formal perfection, conveying a poetic state of quiet introspection and immersion in one's own world, making one feel as if time stands still at this moment, with only breathing and thoughts flowing silently.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
