        {
          "id": "krea2-5ec694ba05a6dc6b038e1fbc",
          "alias": "单女白T恤车厢俏皮坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sitting inside a subway carriage displays a relaxed, cheerful, and slightly playful everyday mood. She wore a simple pure white camisole that accentuated her slender waist, paired with a fresh plaid pleated mini skirt woven from mint green and white. The layered hem added a dynamic look, highlighting youthful energy while maintaining a refined feel. Her right hand elegantly held a chocolate milkshake in a transparent plastic cup. The liquid in the cup was a rich brown color, with fine smoothie granules and bubble patterns visible on the rim. A white straw was inserted diagonally inside, as if she had just taken a sip, leaving behind a hint of lazy comfort. On her left shoulder, she slung a cute brown plush bear-shaped shoulder bag, with a brown leather strap naturally hanging down her thigh, adding a touch of playfulness and warmth to the overall look. She leans sideways against the edge of a green seat, her legs long and naturally crossed, knees slightly bent, her left hand gently resting on her right knee, her posture relaxed and confident, her whole being like a carefully composed portrait of life. The interior of the subway carriage is dominated by bright green, with metal armrests and silver-gray window frames creating a cool, industrial feel. The seats are smooth in line, and the blurred city architecture and flowing light outside hint at the train in progress. Their blurred effects create a strong depth of field effect, firmly locking the visual focus on the female lead. The composition uses medium to near shots, with the main figure occupying the central position. The slightly tilted angle enhances spatial depth, while cleverly using the carriage structure to guide the gaze from the foreground to the mid- to long-range view. The light comes from evenly distributed LED illumination on the top of the carriage, soft and bright. The wrinkles of the clothes and the plush texture on the plush package surface are clearly visible, and the transition of shadows is natural and soft. The overall atmosphere combines the fast-paced urban life with the quiet moments of personal privacy. Through color combinations (green, white, mint green, brown) and material contrasts (smooth metals, soft fabrics, plush toys), it creates a fresh, healing, and youthful visual narrative. It feels as if capturing the gentlest and most beautiful moments of an ordinary day. It combines the authenticity of life with the refinement and beauty of artistic photography, suitable for amateur photography while presenting professional-level light and shadow control and compositional balance. It lets you feel that subtle tenderness and ease amid the city's noise.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
