        {
          "id": "krea2-2014f3d03fb689f104f97694",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道俏皮站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman, the absolute subject of the scene, has fair and delicate skin that radiates a healthy glow. She wears a light gray-white slim long-sleeve Henley collar top, with three metallic buttons on the chest delicately accentuating her elegant collarbones and slender waist. She pairs it with deep blue washed denim shorts with naturally rolled hems, revealing her long legs. The overall look is simple, fashionable, and exudes youthful energy. She slightly turns her body, glances back slightly at the camera, her posture relaxed and natural yet expressive. Her left arm hangs naturally at her side, her right arm slightly bent, and her right hand resting lightly on her waist, creating a lively moment that is captured unintentionally. In the foreground is the dark gray stone lakeside walkway where she stands, with clearly visible surface textures. On the left side is the shimmering lake, where the water reflects the sky and the shore, creating a flowing mirror effect; In the middle of the frame, the lively sidewalk extends behind her, with several passersby blurred out—some carrying backpacks, others dressed casually—creating a dynamic atmosphere of a real street scene. On the right is a sturdy ancient tree, its trunk weathered and weathered, its branches and leaves dense and dense, casting vast shadows and interwoven light under the afternoon sun; In the distance, the undulating outlines of turquoise mountains are evenly layered, forming a layered contrast with the bright sunlight nearby. In the distance, traditional architectural eaves or bridge structures can be faintly seen, adding to the local cultural character. The composition uses a close-up perspective of the person in the medium and near shots, with the main subject occupying the center-right position of the composition. At the same time, a natural guiding line along the lakeshore extends to the left side of the painting, guiding the distant landscape background; Then it smoothly extends downward to the contact point between the leg line and the ground, finally spreading out to the background of people and natural scenery. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a warm and soft daytime natural light environment, with sunlight pouring down from a high angle on the right side, enhancing the sense of depth and skin texture; The lake surface reflects light in cool tones, enhancing visual focus; The overall atmosphere is fresh and tranquil, blending with the everyday life of urban life. It combines the distant beauty of natural landscapes with the realism of modern city streets. The color saturation is moderate, with blue-gray, off-white, and olive green as the main tones forming a harmonious and unified visual tone. The rich and delicate light and shadow layers create an imaging style that is both everyday authentic and artistically beautiful. It feels like a casual snapshot of precious life taken with a regular smartphone camera on a sunny afternoon, offering a strong immersive viewing experience and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
