        {
          "id": "krea2-d8612ce2b29617f1a5943865",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫图书馆忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright at a wooden desk in the library, wearing a simple pure white shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing her collarbones and slender neckline. The fabric is light and thin, revealing the contours of her skin. Her legs are crossed and hang naturally, her bare feet lightly touching the desk, her posture lazy yet elegant. She held a black hardcover book, its pages slightly open, but instead staring directly at the camera, with a subtle hint of scrutiny or contemplation, her expression calm yet containing strength. In the foreground is a smooth, warm dark brown wooden tabletop, whose surface reflects soft light spots that slanting in, creating a geometric light and shadow interplay. On the tabletop, faint blurred reflections and the edges of books are visible, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The center frame is the main part of her body, with smooth lines from shoulders to knees. The white shirt shows subtle folds and highlights under the light, giving the garment a delicate and authentic feel. The background features layers upon layers of tall bookshelves, with books neatly arranged but somewhat blurred. The spines are colorful but lose their clarity due to depth of field, creating a quiet atmosphere of knowledge accumulation. The bookshelf structure extends to both sides of the frame, forming a visually guiding framework. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figure appear more upright and prominent. The foreground table serves as a guiding line, and the lighting and shadow design is highly dramatic. A beam of cool-toned natural light from the upper side passes through the window, falling on her right shoulder, neck, and leg, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, while the shadowed areas deepen the sense of layering and three-dimensionality in the image. The overall color scheme leans toward cool blue-gray, accented with a touch of warm yellow light spots, creating a tranquil, artistic, and slightly lonely afternoon atmosphere. The visuals are full of cinematic texture, with a high-end film graininess, rich details that don't overshadow the audience, natural transitions of light and shadow, and restrained emotions rich in storytelling, as if capturing a moment of intellectual immersion immersed in their own world—both everyday and full of artistic tension, evoking a moment of serenity in literature, philosophy, or inner monologue.",
