        {
          "id": "krea2-ffd441cdbb1aca9565d01e7e",
          "alias": "单女粉高领衫室内困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female figure occupies the center of the frame, wearing a soft light pink turtleneck zip-up sports jacket. The front of the jacket features a silver-white zipper as a visual focal point. The fabric is delicate and soft, presenting a comfortable everyday casual feel. The poster's lines are simple and powerful, with sharp color contrasts, creating a visual interplay of reality and illusion with the real person. In the right background of the painting, a large green plant has broad, deep green leaves with clear veins and slightly curled edges. Its dark silhouette contrasts strongly with the pink in the foreground, adding spatial layering; Further in the background is the indoor environment, where light-colored walls, ceiling-embedded downlights emit even cool light, and faintly visible wooden furniture or door frame structures. The overall space is simple and modern, with a warm white tone; The composition uses medium to near point close-ups, with the figure centered slightly to the left, the poster occupying the left third as a visual guide, and greenery in the upper right to create balance; Then, the vertical lines of the zipper guide the viewer's gaze downward to the details of the clothing; In terms of lighting and shadow atmosphere, the light source comes from the upper front of the figure, creating a slight three-dimensional shadow outlining the outline, while the background lighting is relatively dim, making the subject stand out more; The overall atmosphere is gentle and dreamy with a touch of loneliness. The color scheme is mainly pink accented with green, creating a heart-pounding anime-style aesthetic. It combines realism with artistic touch, resembling a photo casually taken with a phone but carefully colored and filtered in post-processing. The authentic texture of everyday life blends with the magical world of anime, allowing people to feel the power of youth, passion, and self-expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
