        {
          "id": "krea2-3543ed7d6b84efe59532f09f",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣床微笑自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman lounged lazily on a soft bed, her body slightly turned and her head naturally tilted. She wore a pair of exquisitely crafted golden metal glasses, clear and transparent. Her left hand gently supported the rim, as if adjusting the angle or about to take it off, revealing a quiet yet slightly playful gentle smile. She wore a simple and comfortable light gray knit camisole with delicate fabric texture, tight straps that hug the skin, outlining an elegant collarbone line and a long neckline. On the inside of her left arm, near the elbow, is a small, delicate colorful flower tattoo featuring a small flower with orange-red petals and green leaves. The vivid and cute colors gently contrast with the overall understated tone. On her wrist is a minimalist gold dial watch with a white leather strap, adding a touch of refined lifestyle. Her legs are naturally bent and crossed, her knees round and full, with smooth, slender leg lines. The foreground is deliberately blurred, with a faint glimpse of a black camera body, hinting that this is a selfie taken with amateur equipment, adding realism and a sense of everyday life to the image. The middle frame shows her relaxed posture and clothing details, while the background features soft, fluffy bedding, including off-white pillows and dark gray plush blankets or sheets, with natural pleats and interlaced light and shadow, creating a warm and cozy home atmosphere. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, while the blurred camera outline in the foreground creates spatial layering and narrative depth. Light comes from the upper left side of the painting, soft natural light in the early morning or afternoon, streaming through the curtains. The highlights are warm and bright, while the shadows are soft and delicate. The overall atmosphere is cozy, tranquil, and private, full of the poetic beauty of everyday life. It feels like a lazy sunny weekend afternoon, where she enjoys a moment of peace and self-expression in her own little world. The entire scene exudes a healing, gentle, artistic, and slightly heartfelt visual feeling. The saturation is moderate, and the color scheme is harmoniously coordinated. presenting a realistic and artistically captivating visual style.",
