        {
          "id": "krea2-fe3ba22fcd78469002ee0c7e",
          "alias": "单女透视外套街道愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "On a city street corner at night, a woman stands beside a slightly worn green public phone booth. She wears a deep blue, glossy long down jacket with a fluffy white plush trim at the collar, creating a soft contrast with the beige fitted knit top underneath. The top cleverly reveals her full bust, paired with black sheer stockings and black shorts, creating an overall look that combines urban fashion with a touch of playful sexiness. In the foreground, withered fallen leaves scatter on the gray cement floor, their edges curled and glowing faintly under cool-toned lighting, hinting at the changing seasons and the passage of time; In the middle is a vintage green public telephone, its body covered in signs of use. The button area is clearly visible, with colorful function labels pasted above. In the background, a blurred glass window and faint tree shadows appear. Outside the window, warm yellow hazy light spots shine through, creating a dreamlike blur effect. In the distance, the outlines of buildings are faintly visible, hinting that this is a corner on the edge of a bustling city. The composition adopts a slightly upward-looking mid-to-near perspective, placing the figure slightly to the right center of the frame, making the visual focus stable and attractive; At the same time, phone booths are used as vertical line elements to guide the gaze upward, enhancing the sense of depth in the image. The light mainly comes from the artificial lighting on the left side of the painting, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, while the background is treated with deep dark tones to enhance the subject's presence. The overall atmosphere blends the tranquility of urban nights, the loneliness of nostalgic phone booths, and the warmth and vitality radiating from the characters. The interplay of light and shadow presents a narrative scene that is both real and cinematic, as if captured by chance. It carries both a casual sense of everyday life and subtle emotional tension, like a story-filled city night portrait shot with an amateur camera. The details are rich but not chaotic, and the color contrasts are sharp but not glaring. She successfully creates a poetic atmosphere between reality and dreams, making people imagine what she is confiding in on the phone or waiting for a response.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
