        {
          "id": "krea2-c9e5a3612a493e01ec842620",
          "alias": "单女雪地冷淡倚靠吃",
          "prompt": "Amidst a quiet and gentle curtain of snow, a woman becomes the most captivating focal point of the scene. Exuding an unrefined youthful vibe. In the foreground, she leans slightly forward, her posture naturally relaxed, as if preparing to step into this snowy landscape, or just stopping to admire the scenery before her; In the background is a rustic wooden cabin with a heavy snow roof, and a faded wooden sign hanging beneath the eaves, engraved with the words \"Forest Tavern.\" The characters are bold yet slightly mottled, revealing a rustic feeling shaped by the passage of time; The walls are built from rough logs and stones, covered with a thin layer of snow. Between the wood grain and cracks, faint moss and ice crystals can be seen, adding a touch of primitive nature; In the distance lies a hazy snowy forest, with intertwined branches and trunks, snow bending the treetops, mist swirling in the air, blurring the boundary between mountains and trees, creating a dreamlike sense of deep space; The composition uses a slightly overhead perspective, placing the figure slightly below the center of the frame. The eaves, signboard, and snow lines on the ground form a stable visual framework, while shallow depth of field techniques are employed to create a soft-focus effect on the forest and buildings in the background, highlighting the clarity and three-dimensionality of the subject; The light comes from daylight scattered on cloudy days, with an overall cool tone, mainly gray-white, light blue, and earthy brown, creating a visual balance; The light and shadow are soft and even, without strong contrasts of light and dark, enhancing the sense of depth; Fine snowflakes float in the air, gliding overhead like sprites, leaving brief yet lively trails in the blurred background, infusing the painting with dynamic vitality; The entire image exudes a tranquil, healing, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere—both the biting cold of winter and the hope and tenderness of the figures' smiles and warm clothing. It feels like a hidden forest corner far from the noise, where time quietly stands still, and only snowflakes fall silently, bearing witness to this pure beauty; The image quality leans toward the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with moderate color saturation, slight film grain noise and slight color cast, simulating the image texture captured by a mobile phone camera or small digital camera in low-temperature environments, allowing viewers to feel a subtle poetry and lifestyle atmosphere rather than a deliberately produced commercial blockbuster; The entire scene is filled with storytelling and emotional tension—whispers of winter, moments of tranquility in the snow, gentle encounters on the road, and deep inner longing for purity and freedom. Every detail silently tells the profound emotional experience of loneliness, companionship, warmth, and self-discovery.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
