        {
          "id": "krea2-de41bb19a1ca41514cd9ffe5",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装公寓冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "On a sunny afternoon, a woman stands by the stainless steel railing on the rooftop terrace of a city apartment, dressed in a sharply tailored, form-fitting deep blue one-piece swimsuit. The silk-thin straps accentuate the elegant curve of her back and add a touch of casual laziness. Her body turns slightly, her head facing the camera, her left hand gently resting on the railing, her right hand naturally hanging at her side, and a simple gold bracelet on her wrist that glows warmly in the sunlight. Her posture is relaxed and relaxed, as if savoring this rare tranquil moment in the city's sky. Light and shadow create subtle transitions of light and shadow on her back and hips, highlighting the smoothness and strength of her figure. In the foreground is the terrace floor where she stands, along with a metal railing. The railing surface reflects the sky's deep blue and the outlines of the surrounding buildings. In the right corner, a white freezer or small appliance can be seen, topped with several transparent glass cups and a small red brush. The details are realistic and lifelike, suggesting this is a private space for everyday use. The middle view is the terrace area extending behind her, paved with light-colored tiles with slight shadows and reflections along the edges. In the distance, faint green plants can be seen scattered throughout, injecting a touch of vitality into the concrete cityscape. In the background is a cluster of city residential buildings, with a modern-style gray concrete building on the left featuring neatly arranged windows and balcony railings bordered by green borders; On the right side are old-style residential buildings with red brick exteriors, with roof layouts arranged in a harmonious manner. Some buildings are equipped with satellite antennas and air conditioning units, and power lines crisscross between buildings, creating a rich, authentic urban atmosphere. The entire composition uses a slightly overhead diagonal angle, with the main figure positioned about one-third to the right. The light comes from the upper left of the frame, a typical hard afternoon light. Sunlight penetrates the clouds, casting a striking contrast on her skin and clothing, creating a striking contrast between highlights and shadows. At the same time, sharp and clear projections are cast on railings and building surfaces, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The overall color scheme is dominated by warm golden yellows and cool azures, with the sky presenting a pure, translucent blue that sharply contrasts with the character's dark swimsuit, highlighting the subject's presence. The atmosphere combines the heat and vitality of summer afternoon sunlight with the rare private tranquility found among urban skyscrapers. It carries a strong realist photography style, like everyday photos taken with a regular phone or portable camera. Yet through careful composition and light and shadow processing, it is endowed with refined, stylish, and story-rich visual tension. The images are full of everyday life while maintaining artistic beauty, as if capturing a fleeting moment of urban poetry—when the hustle and bustle of city life is temporarily set aside, Only a quiet moment remains, breathing with the sunlight and the city.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
