        {
          "id": "krea2-a6cde3b3a620082369aaecb0",
          "alias": "单女霓虹夜景冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep purple loose long-sleeved top made of soft fabric with a subtle sheen, with faint white stitching decorations on the collar. Around her neck is a slender silver chain necklace, and her wrist is wrapped with multiple layers of metal bracelets, becoming a visual focal point in a cool setting; In the foreground is a vividly colored, vintage-style yellow public telephone, its surface covered in the marks of time and scratches. Its vivid yellow-green color scheme looks like a dazzling lightning bolt against a dark background. The metal hook above the phone reflects a faint glow, and the spiral tube connecting the receiver winds like a vessel into the woman's palm, forming a dynamic and narrative visual bond in the scene. The middle shot focuses on the woman's interaction with the phone. Her fingers gently press the edge of the receiver, her body leaning forward slightly, forming an almost prayerful posture that hints at the special significance of the call to her; The background is a blurry silhouette of the city's night scene, with distant building silhouettes faintly visible. Window light emits scattered blue or red light, creating a unique sense of loneliness and detachment in the city's late night. At the same time, shallow depth of field technology blurs the background, keeping the viewer's gaze firmly fixed on the central subjects of the characters and telephone; The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the figure positioned on the right third of the frame, and the left blank space occupied by the telephone, creating visual balance; The overall composition is slanted and tilted, enhancing instability and a sense of dynamism; The visual guidance path starts from the bright colors of the foreground telephone, arousing viewers' curiosity and resonance with the call content; The lighting and shadow use have a cinematic feel, with the main light source coming from the red neon light in the upper right, creating a strong contrast between light and dark and high contrast. The light penetrates dust particles in the air, outlining only the ambient light; The atmosphere blends cyberpunk aesthetics with nostalgia. The contrast of red and green creates a tense, ambiguous, and romantic mood. The entire scene feels like being on the edge of a late 20th-century dungeon or a futuristic city, filled with a poetic atmosphere of loneliness, secrets, and time stopping; The shooting style simulates the image features captured by amateur equipment (such as mobile phones or small digital cameras) in low-light environments, preserving slight noise and color overflow effects to enhance realism and documentary feel; Overall, it presents an immersive narrative atmosphere, like a still movie still, inviting viewers into a story world full of metaphor and emotional tension, prompting viewers to imagine whether the message on the other end of the phone is salvation or destruction.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
