        {
          "id": "krea2-262150fcc72ae9f1a70bec56",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣雪地忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her fingers are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her fingertips lightly touch the collar, her movements natural and restrained, creating a subtle beauty that feels like hesitation to speak. She wore a thick and warm blue knit sweater with a soft texture of gradient washed blue and white, covered with a thin layer of snow. The fluffy texture at the edges of the garment subtly created a three-dimensional effect under the light, and an off-white wooden button stood quietly on the chest, adding a touch of vintage handmade warmth. The composition uses an extremely close-up perspective, almost compressing the entire picture into a single emotionally charged visual unit. The figures occupy most of the space, while the background completely blurs into a hazy, snowy world. The outlines of distant trees or architectural structures can be faintly seen. The blurred lines suggest the cold outdoor environment but do not interfere with the subject's emotional expression. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, sliding along her trembling fingertips to snowflakes drifting down her collar, then slowly spreading into the entire blurred yet pure background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is extremely soft, with light coming from the upper sides, like diffused light filtering through clouds on a winter afternoon. There are no strong shadow cuts, and the overall color tone leans toward cool tones yet still warm. The low-saturation blue, white, and gray are the main colors, creating a poetic atmosphere that is both cool and full of vitality. The image texture pursues the realistic graininess and slight color shifts of film cameras, simulating the delicate noise and color gradation effects of vintage film in low-temperature environments, as if a photo gently touched by time, carrying a touch of nostalgic artistic flair. The entire image conveys a tranquil, restrained, slightly melancholic yet youthful vitality. It is both a tribute to the beauty of the harsh winter and a deep gaze into delicate inner emotions. It carries a strong artistic cinematic feel and the documentary warmth of everyday photography, guarding a gentle warmth of everyday life in a cold world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
