        {
          "id": "krea2-6078fc70a49d10a00fdb8ce0",
          "alias": "单女短裤沙发温柔手持物",
          "prompt": "In the corner of the sofa behind, a warm-toned yellow cushion can be seen, and on the right, a pink storage box or small item is faintly visible. The overall space color palette is mainly warm white, light gray, and pale pink, creating a comfortable and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, her exposed ankles and calves in the foreground, and the middle ground showing the texture layers of sweaters and shorts, with background blur to highlight the subject; The light comes from soft indoor sources, creating delicate transitions between light and shadow. Shadows are soft and unobtrusive, sweater fibers reflect subtle luster, and the overall light and shadow atmosphere is warm and healing, carrying the lazy and innocent feel of Japanese style. The color saturation is moderate, with fresh and soft tones. It feels like afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice, filling the air with a cotton candy-like sweetness and tranquility. The entire image exudes the warmth of everyday life, as if photographed with amateur equipment yet possesses professional-grade texture and emotional expression, with every detail meticulously crafted It conveys a genuine, carefree, and loving aesthetic of life.",
