        {
          "id": "krea2-8aa647d010d2567807f7004d",
          "alias": "单女金T恤街道困倦躺舔咬",
          "prompt": "deep within a Japanese old street gently steeped by time, a woman lazily curled up on a brightly colored blue bench. She wore a pale yellow pinstripe short-sleeve T-shirt and a light blue denim skirt, paired with a pair of white platform sneakers. She held a cold white ice cream in her hand, gently licking her tongue, exuding carefree innocence and satisfaction, exuding a subtle charm where youth, freedom, and the breath of life intertwined. A striking red and white circular sign is attached to the back of the bench, with \"decorative character\" written in bold Japanese. Behind her were mottled wooden door frames and faded concrete walls, with several lush green vines clinging to the walls, their branches swaying gently in the breeze, adding a vibrant natural touch to this small space. In the corner of the wall are several clay flowerpots planted with low green plants, their leaves shimmering with the glow of life in the light and shadow. In the distance lies narrow stone-paved streets, flanked by layers of traditional Japanese buildings. The beige walls contrast warmly with the dark gray eaves, and behind a half-open wooden door faintly reveals a rippled metal rolling shutter. Above the lintel hangs a wooden sign reading \"Hotel Shimizu,\" with rustic and serene handwriting hinting that this was once a stopover for travelers. At the end of the street, a red car can be faintly seen parked by the roadside, adding a lively touch of warmth to the scene. The entire composition adopts a slightly overhead diagonal angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side and the bench extending to the right, guiding the gaze naturally into the background and creating a sense of spatial depth and narrative extension. The light comes from the upper left, the warm and gentle afternoon sun, filtering through the leaves as mottled specks, casting delicate shadows on the floor and walls, creating a visual rhythm of light and shadow. The overall tone is warm, mainly blue, yellow, and brown, accented with green plants, presenting a nostalgic yet lively film texture. It features slight grain noise and soft focus effects, as if shot with an old digital camera or film machine, with slight outfocus at the edges, enhancing the immersive atmosphere. The air is filled with the unique laziness of a summer afternoon—the scent of cicadas, sunlight, fresh grass, and sweet ice cream quietly drifting across the scene. The entire scene is like a quiet slice of life, capturing the most ordinary yet touching moments in the city's corners: a bench, an ice cream, an old street, together weaving a poetic chapter of growth, memory, and everyday happiness. It is both tangible and dreamy, with a dreamlike artistic filter, evoking a gentle resonance deep within viewers about simple joy and the passage of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
