        {
          "id": "krea2-4fbd14c7e5ff71a75c5ff3af",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙广场神秘站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the center of an elegant vintage interior space, wearing a striking red satin slip dress that fits her body and outlines her soft curves. The waist features delicate pleats, the neckline edges are trimmed with delicate lace, the straps drape delicately down to the chest, and a simple silver heart-shaped necklace around her neck adds a touch of gentle romance; Her arms hang naturally, draped in a fluffy, heavy dark gray long-fur coat. Her makeup was delicate and soft. In the foreground, she wore sheer black sheer pantycoons with small polka dots, her legs long, with her right foot slightly raised and her left leg slightly bent, her posture elegant and composed; The background features dark wood-paneled walls and classical stone column structures. The stone columns have clear textures and a warm color like marble. Above the wall is a black metal frame decorative mirror, reflecting the soft glow of a warm yellow wall lamp and blurred architectural silhouettes. In the right corner, a red square cardboard box and some wooden chair backs can be faintly seen, hinting that this is a hotel lobby or high-end restaurant entrance area; The composition uses a full-body perspective in the middle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center. The symmetrical layout enhances stability, while the stone pillar on the right forms a visual guide line with the dark wall on the left. Soft warm lighting is applied from the front and upper sides, while soft shadows are cast on the sides and background wall to enhance the sense of depth and layering. The overall atmosphere combines urban fashion with retro luxury, with a rich red color scheme dominated by deep gray, black, and off-white, creating a visual tension that is both passionate and bold yet subdued and mysterious. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot by a high-end smartphone or portable camera under natural light, retaining everyday graininess and slight noise, giving the image a friendly, everyday beauty rather than an overly polished commercial feel, allowing viewers to feel a subtle and inadvertently captured These moments are full of personal charm, combining the exquisite composition of artistic photography with the authentic warmth of casual street photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
