        {
          "id": "krea2-232625554c548857d836a6eb",
          "alias": "单女黑西装车内俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a refined black professional suit, paired with a white shirt and black stockings, sat elegantly in the spacious and luxurious rear seats of a high-end business vehicle, exuding a charming, confident, and slightly playful aura; The vehicle features a deep metallic teal body, with doors fully open, forming a natural visual framework that envelops the figure. The inside of the doors and the window edges reflect soft ambient light, creating a refined and modern atmosphere; In the foreground, the door sills feature metal steps with anti-slip textures and some door structures, clearly showing door hinges and intricate mechanical details. The floor reflects the reflections of the figure's legs and seat contours, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; The mid-sized view focuses on the female body and the luxurious seats inside the car—the seats are made of premium gray leather, equipped with electrically adjustable armrests, independent headrests, and the \"RZ\" brand logo. The seat cushion and backrest lines are smooth and tech-savvy, with hidden footrests and storage space under the seats. The overall interior is dominated by cool tones, accented by fine stitching and metal trim, highlighting understated luxury. The background is either a modern showroom or a high-end interior space, with a geometric metal grille ceiling at the top. Embedded warm spotlights cast soft, even light from above, and in the distance, faint warm yellow lights and the city silhouette reflected by glass curtain walls can be seen through car windows, hinting that the scene is in the commercial center of the city; The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figure appear taller and more upright. The door edges form natural diagonal lines to divide the frame, enhancing dynamic tension; Extending further into the background lighting and architectural silhouettes, forming spatial narrative layers from near to far; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward cool, soft light. The main light source comes from roof spotlights and diffused ambient light, evenly illuminating the skin and clothing details. At the same time, subtle transitions of highlight and shadow are created on the metal surfaces of the doors and seat leather, creating a three-dimensional texture. The color palette mainly consists of dark gray, teal, silver-white, and black, creating a calm, restrained yet vibrant modern urban elite vibe; The image quality pursues a realistic and delicate photographic style, similar to professional cameras shooting in soft indoor light. The details are rich but not overly sharpened, and the overall atmosphere combines the professionalism of a business elite with the gentleness of feminine charm, conveying a relaxed attitude toward enjoying comfort and freedom in a bustling city.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
