        {
          "id": "krea2-4e3bad4b066f36eabc4b4d12",
          "alias": "单女上衣森林困倦站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera by the metal railing of the viewing platform, wearing a soft off-white knit top and a light purple pleated long skirt. Her hands gently rest on the railing, gazing into the distance, as if immersed in the poetry of spring; In the foreground are several lush and blooming cherry blossom branches, with layers of pink petals overlapping. Some branches extend diagonally into the frame, forming a natural visual frame. The petal edges have a slightly hazy blurred effect, creating a dreamy, soft-focus atmosphere; In the middle is a layered pink cherry blossom forest, densely packed with blossoms like clouds, intertwining with distant cityscapes and winding roads to form a gentle picture. The railing surface shows signs of wear and tears from years and frost, adding a touch of everyday quality; The background features the rolling outlines of deep green mountain ranges, with distinct mountain layers. Above the distant peaks, a majestic snow-capped volcanic peak can be faintly seen. Its pristine white summit contrasts sharply with the gray-blue sky. The clouds are thin and bright, and sunlight filters through the clouds to cast soft rays; The composition uses the classic three-section method, with the figure positioned in the lower right third of the frame. The line of sight extends from the railing to the distant mountains, while cherry blossom branches run diagonally across the upper left corner of the painting, creating dynamic balance; The visual guidance path naturally transitions from cherry blossom branches in the foreground to the middle of the figure, then extends to the snow-capped mountains in the distance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly cool, with sunlight slanting from the upper right of the figure. The overall color palette is mainly pink, light purple, and off-white, complemented by distant mountain gray-green and snow-white mountains. The color saturation is moderate to soft, presenting an aesthetic style reminiscent of a watercolor painting, with a sense of realism and a slight retro soft-focus texture reminiscent of film filters, as if shooting with an old-fashioned digital camera at dusk. It captures the gentlest moment of spring, with the entire painting filled with a poetic mood of tranquility, romance, and a touch of solitude, allowing one to feel the harmonious resonance between life and nature amid the changing seasons.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
