        {
          "id": "krea2-51a0f12bfa5214c24fd001ab",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣花园困倦过肩",
          "prompt": "In a vibrant spring garden, a woman wears a soft pink knit cardigan and a pure white layered long dress, wearing a naturally woven straw hat. She poses at a low angle looking upward, lightly holding a vintage silver-black film camera with both hands, as if capturing this dazzling and dreamlike moment before her; Her figure is gently framed by large blurred tulip petals and lush green leaves in the foreground. Several pink, orange-red, and pale yellow tulips blur into hazy patches of color in the foreground, creating a strong sense of depth and layering. At the same time, a plaid fabric draped over her shoulder can be faintly seen, adding a touch of casual everyday life to the overall composition; The background features towering cherry trees with dense branches, covered in red blossoms like rosy clouds blooming freely under the clear blue sky. The main subject is positioned slightly above the center of the composition, with the blurred flowers in the foreground naturally focusing on the details of the figures and the camera's movements, while the cherry trees in the background spread out like a giant colorful canvas, enhancing spatial depth and poetic atmosphere; In terms of lighting and shadow, bright and even natural sunlight streams down, making the folds of the dress and the texture of petals clearly visible, giving the image a warm and transparent texture; The color palette is mainly saturated pink, red, white, and green, paired with the cool blue of the sky, creating a vivid and harmonious contrast that creates a dreamy yet tranquil spring atmosphere. The overall style combines professional studio-like refined composition with the natural breathing of amateur equipment. It combines the grainy texture and soft-focus edges unique to film images while retaining the liveliness and imperfections of real-life scenes, delivering an immersive, healing artistic aesthetic experience. It evokes the gentle yet vibrant moments of spring.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
