        {
          "id": "krea2-c88882333dc215577c7432ff",
          "alias": "单女外套街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor street in a snowy winter scene, wearing a luxurious and heavy natural fur coat. The fur is mainly gray-white, mixed with varying shades of brown spots. The collar is wide and rounded, with naturally curled edges, presenting the authentic texture of wild animal fur; The middle ground is a blurry street scene behind her, with several white cars parked by the roadside, taillights reflecting cold light, the car covered in thin snow, and fine moisture or rain marks on the windows, faintly outlining the figures' silhouettes; The background features trees with withered branches interlaced in winter, their bare trunks and distinct lines, forming a distant and bleak silhouette under the gray-white sky. In the distance, a low, gray building and snow-covered roof can be faintly seen, and the entire space is filled with a cold and silent atmosphere; The composition uses a slightly upward-looking medium and close-up shot, with the subject centered to the right, ample blank space, highlighting the main subject while preserving the environmental narrative; Visual guidance begins with the delicate texture of fur in the foreground, then extends to the empty street scenes and tree shadows in the background, creating a sense of spatial depth from near to far, from solid to void; The light and shadows are soft and even, scattered on cloudy days without strong shadows. The light shines obliquely from the upper left, creating subtle highlights and shadows on the fur's surface, highlighting the three-dimensional effect and texture of the material; The overall color palette is mainly cool gray, off-white, and light brown, creating a quiet, lonely, and slightly nostalgic winter mood. The images have a slight graininess and film texture, as if shot on cloudy days with an old digital camera or phone. The color saturation is relatively low, dynamic range is limited, but the natural noise and imperfections of real-life scenes are preserved, enhancing the documentary feel and immersive atmosphere. The entire frame combines the exquisite composition of a fashionable blockbuster with the casual warmth and authenticity of everyday street photography. It conveys the restrained yet resilient emotional tension of a person facing the changing seasons alone in a cold city.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
