        {
          "id": "krea2-7707285ee8edb9958af69a0c",
          "alias": "单女雪地困倦注视",
          "prompt": "Her steps lightly stepped along an ancient path paved with rough stones, with several wooden steps beneath her feet, hinting at the extension and ascent of the path; The foreground is occupied by numerous blooming cherry blossom branches, with petals as white as snow and pink like rosy clouds. Some branches are blurred and extend diagonally from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a natural visual framework that draws the viewer's attention to the central figure; The middle ground area features winding paths, flanked by lush green grass mixed with scattered flower petals. In the distance, the blurry silhouettes of several tourists can be faintly seen, either stopping to admire or taking photos, adding a touch of life to the scene without overshadowing the main focus; In the background is a continuous cherry blossom forest, with flowers densely packed like clouds, overlapping canopies that display a hazy, pale pinkish-white tone under the soft sunlight. In the distance, the outline of the deep green forest can be faintly seen, while the sky is a bright and pure light gray with no obvious clouds, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere; The entire composition uses diagonal lines, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, guiding the gaze from the cherry blossom branches in the foreground through the middle path, ultimately focusing on the figure's back and extending into the distant sea of flowers; The visual guide lines are clear and distinct—from cherry blossom branches in the foreground to the shoulders of the figures and then to the distant flower grove, forming a smooth visual flow that allows viewers to naturally follow the characters' steps into the painting; In terms of lighting and shadow, the overall lighting is soft and even, belonging to diffused light typical of early morning or evening. The figure's back is softly illuminated, the fabric texture is delicate and visible, cherry blossom petal edges are translucent, and the ground pebbles reflect with subtle highlights but no strong shadows, giving the scene a dreamy soft-focus texture; The color palette mainly consists of teal, white, and pink, complemented by a belt and red flowers as visual focal points. The overall tone is fresh and elegant, with moderate saturation, a slight film graininess and softening effect, imitating the warm filter style of old cameras or mobile phones; The atmosphere is filled with poetry and Zen. Cherry blossoms symbolize the fleeting yet beautiful life, while the woman's silhouette represents a calm and reserved state of mind. The entire scene exudes the unique tenderness, romance, and subtle melancholy of spring, as if time has frozen at this moment, with only the sound of petals drifting in the wind intertwined with footsteps, forming a visual poem about Eastern aesthetics, seasonal changes, and the search for inner peace on a solitary journey; The details are rich yet not overly crowded. Shallow depth of field control highlights the subject, background blur enhances spatial depth, while preserving the realism and traces of daily life in the environment. Overall, it presents a natural, unadorned warmth that combines professional photography standards with everyday amateur equipment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
