        {
          "id": "krea2-4b7d8c7478e37d5e58aecdeb",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙摄影棚温柔坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "In a corner of a café terrace where vintage industrial style blends with natural greenery, a couple is immersed in a gentle and intimate moment. The hem of the dress flutters in the breeze, and the faint lace texture glows softly in the sunlight; The man sits upright on a high rattan chair, wearing a simple white shirt paired with a dark vest. In the foreground is a wooden floor cut by sunlight with mottled light and shadow. Several green plants peek out from the windowsill and doorway, their edges shimmering with a crystal-clear glow under the light. The half-open old wooden door frame on the left forms a natural frame, guiding the gaze to focus on the main figure. The middle view is the terrace space where the two are located, with wooden tables and chairs, hanging vintage industrial chandeliers (multi-layer disc-shaped lampshades), and brick wall structures all creating a rich sense of depth. Soft shadows cast beneath the chandelier enhance the spatial dimension; In the background, a lush courtyard view visible through large glass windows is lush. Outside, the trees and leaves are lush, creating a hazy blur effect against the backlight, contrasting warmly and coolly with the warm tones of the interior. Meanwhile, the exposed brick wall on the right has a rough and textured texture, adding a touch of rustic life atmosphere. The entire composition uses a slanted style, with the figure positioned slightly to the right. The lines of doors and windows form visual guides, creating a dramatic atmosphere of light and shadow. Natural light from outside enters from the upper left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The parts of the woman's legs and skirt illuminated are as soft as silk, while the man's profile is in a mix of light and shadow, creating a hazy poetic atmosphere. The overall color scheme leans toward warm yellow and gray-brown, accented with green plants, creating a lazy, nostalgic, and slightly artistic afternoon atmosphere. It feels as if time stands still at this moment, with the air filled with the intertwining aroma of coffee and grass. The images combine the exquisite composition and delicate texture of a professional studio while preserving the real temperature and traces of daily life captured by everyday shooting equipment—like precious moments casually recorded in natural light with a phone or small digital camera, yet thanks to precise focus control, The right balance of exposure and emotional expression ultimately resulted in a visual work that combines artistic beauty with emotional resonance.",
