        {
          "id": "krea2-7d0eb5998d00335f9744bbce",
          "alias": "单女棕西装公园忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "deep within a park gently touched by sunlight, a woman sits quietly on a dark brown wooden bench, her figure becoming the undisputed visual focal point of the scene. Her posture is elegant yet slightly contemplative, as if immersed in inner monologue or memories. She wore a tailored dark brown blazer over a white collared shirt with a delicate floral skirt at the hem, classic Mary Jane shoes paired with light gray mid-calf socks, blending collegiate style with urban flair, radiating youthful energy with a hint of artistic flair. Gently swaying in the breeze, adding a dynamic beauty. On the bench beside her sits a small black square bag, with golden metal clasps shimmering in the light, serving as the finishing touch in the details. In the foreground is a close-up of her long legs and feet, sunlight filtering through the leaves casting dappled shadows on the ground, with a few beams of light falling precisely on her feet and skirt edges, creating a visual contrast of light and shadow. In the middle is a rustic wooden bench, with clearly visible curved armrests and horizontal grain. The seat surface has a gentle sheen due to the passage of time, and the empty seat on the left side suggests spatial extension and a sense of solitude. The background features dense canopies and lush lawns, with sunlight filtering through layers of leaves forming soft, bokeh-like circular light spots. In the distance, blurred figures and white fences can be faintly seen, creating a realistic park environment while maintaining depth in the scene. The composition is shot from a slightly top-down side angle, with the figure positioned in the right-hand rule of the frame, leaving a large natural background on the left to enhance the sense of spatial breathing; Forming a visual closed loop. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a lazy, warm afternoon tone, with the main light source coming from the upper left, creating delicate shadow transitions that make the skin feel full and three-dimensional. The overall color saturation is moderate, with green, brown, and off-white as the main tones, accented by a red floral dress and black leather shoes, creating a harmonious yet contrasting visual rhythm. The image quality leans toward film camera simulation, with slight grainy noise and soft focus edges, creating a cinematic and nostalgic feel; Precise depth control, sharp and clear subjects, and well-handled background blur enhance emotional expression and immersive scenes. The direction of light is clear, the contrast between light and shadow is natural, and the shadows are not achromatic but retain subtle highlights, giving the painting a gentle touch as if \"kissed by sunlight.\" The entire scene exudes a quiet, introspective, and slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere, like a life-oriented artistic photograph, capturing everyday moments yet full of narrative tension, making one imagine her emotional story at this moment—is it waiting, a memory, or a faint confusion about the future? The image contains no noise, only light, shadow, greenery, and silent companionship, forming a work of great emotional depth and aesthetic value.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
