        {
          "id": "krea2-44ebd398f18644631ff2810d",
          "alias": "单女透视黑外套室内媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a vintage-style indoor setting, wearing a richly textured black long-fur fur coat paired with a tight red strapless dress underneath. The hem hugs her figure and outlines elegant curves. She wears sheer stockings with fine black polka dot patterns and platform black-and-white striped shoes, exuding a strong sense of autumn and winter fashion and luxury. Wearing a simple and exquisite heart-shaped pendant necklace around her neck, her makeup is delicate and soft. Her right hand gently strokes the collar of her fur coat, while her left hand rests naturally on her knee, presenting a relaxed and captivating pose; She sat on a wooden framed chair with simple leg lines, and beside it sat a black leather handbag, its folds naturally pleated, with subtle gold chain details; The background is the interior space of a classical building, with a deep black fireplace structure at the center. The sides are supported by off-white marble columns with clear and delicate column patterns. Above the fireplace are black wooden panel decorative stripes, and the floor is paved with gray stone bricks joined together. In the lower right corner, a faint red furniture edge adds visual contrast; The entire composition centers on the person, using a medium and close-up perspective. It feels as if you are in a low-key luxury private lounge or boutique hotel lounge, exuding a touch of lazy sensuality in the tranquility. The images present a professionally arranged studio-like texture, while retaining the slight noise and natural color saturation common in everyday phone photography, giving the images a truly lifelike warmth and emotional tension.",
