        {
          "id": "krea2-97ff985a861e6e193fd362b0",
          "alias": "单女白外套室内害羞跪摆拍",
          "prompt": "She wore a fluffy, soft white knitted wool coat with delicate textures, natural pleated details at the cuffs and pockets, paired with a blue-and-white gradient plaid scarf that softly wrapped around her neck and fell to her chest, blending colors and light to create a visual rhythm of warmth and coolness. With a radiant yet slightly shy smile, looking directly at the camera seemed to share a private and joyful moment. She folds her hands on her knees, poses relaxed and natural, her legs slightly crossed, displaying a calmness and elegance that comes from everyday life. The wall beside her is a gray-blue cement-textured surface, evenly distributed with circular rivet holes, adding an industrial feel and traces of time; Above hangs a faded, yellowed \"Exit\" sign, written in both Traditional Chinese and English. The metal frame is mottled by oxidation, with fine cracks and wear on the surface, revealing the space's genuine signs of use and historical accumulation. In the background, you can see the deep green window frame structure and translucent glass reflecting the blurred city light and shadow, while slight dust and stains appear at the distant transition between walls and floors, creating a realistic, untouched spatial atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the main figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, facing the camera but with a slight tilt of the head, creating dynamic balance; In the foreground are some wooden benches and armrests, whose rough texture and worn paint enhance the rustic feel of the scene; The middle ground is the character's entire body, the signboards behind them, and the walls; The distant view features blurred glass reflections and architectural silhouettes. Evoking emotional resonance in viewers. The overall color scheme interweaves warm yellow and cool gray-blue, presenting a unique atmosphere where sunlight filters through the interior at dusk or early morning. The light and shadows are soft and layered, and the image is full of film texture and a sense of life. It looks like amateur-style photos taken with an old digital camera or phone under natural light, with slight noise and low color saturation, emphasizing realism rather than excessive refinement. It conveys a peaceful, healing, and slightly nostalgic lifestyle aesthetic, allowing people to feel warmth and beauty in ordinary moments.",
