        {
          "id": "krea2-8088d2d634847a3c190b751d",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套面包店俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a high chair with a metal frame indoors, wearing a fluffy, soft gradient blue-gray faux plush zip-up jacket. The edges and cuffs of the jacket are thick and fuzzy, giving a warm and healing feel. Underneath, she wears white shorts and white knit socks, revealing her slender, slender calves. Her left hand gently strokes the jacket's collar, her posture playful yet slightly lazy. In the foreground is her raised palm and part of the jacket's plush texture, with a close-up highlighting the ring's reflection and plush details; In the middle of the frame, her full sitting posture and the metal legs of the chair contrast with the gray-spotted tiles on the floor; The background is blurred, and on the right side is a white cardboard stand printed with \"UNO BAKERY\" and a French date menu. Below are several magazine or flyer pages, one of which faintly shows \"FASHION\" and an orange floral pattern, with blurred white clothing stacks and metal door frame outlines in the background. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. Hand movements guide the visual focus upward, and the body's curves form a stable triangular support with the chair, presenting a natural, everyday snapshot rather than deliberately staged. The light and shadows are soft and even, diffused from the front and side soft light boxes or windows, with light shadows that are subtle and not jarring, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere; The colors are mainly low-saturation gray-blue, off-white, and silver-gray, accented with a touch of warm orange. The overall tone is calm and gentle, exuding youthful vitality. There is slight film grain noise and the characteristic slight blur of mobile photography, enhancing everyday realism and a friendly atmosphere. The entire image conveys a relaxed, sweet, and casual urban lifestyle aesthetic, as if capturing a relaxing moment during an afternoon break in a café or bakery.",
