        {
          "id": "krea2-c46de167778df7c2ab6f86d4",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙森林困倦坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "deep within a cherry blossom forest bathed in gentle morning light, a woman in a pure white, flowing long dress sits quietly on a green slope. She tilts her head slightly back, gently holding a vintage black film camera with both hands, her lens aimed at the blooming branches above, as if capturing a dreamlike moment where the sky and petals intertwine; Gently brushing in the breeze, you can immerse yourself in the poetic charm of spring; In the foreground is a cluster of pinkish-white cherry blossom petals blurred, layered like clouds and mist, forming a hazy yet layered visual barrier that naturally draws the viewer's gaze toward the main figure in the middle shot; In the middle of the scene, the green grass where the woman sits is fresh, with fresh leaves and dripping leaves. Sunlight filters through petals, casting dappled shadows, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the grass, creating a fresh contrast with the woman's pure white dress. In the background is a huge and lush cherry tree with strong and powerful branches, densely blooming into a pink cloud of clouds, with the canopy extending to the top of the canvas, creating a visual tension of upward growth; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, emphasizing the grandeur of the cherry trees and the woman's petite yet vibrant posture; The visual guide naturally converges from the foreground blurred petals to the woman's gesture of holding the mirror, then extends to the sea of flowers blooming overhead, forming a smooth path of emotional and visual flow; Light comes from the upper side, with soft golden sunlight filtering through the petals, creating a warm and slightly dreamy atmosphere, with a slight soft-focus effect and slightly overexposed edges that enhance the cinematic texture of the image; The colors are mainly pale pink, tender green, and pure white, with moderate saturation yet rich emotional expression, presenting a tranquil, romantic, and slightly melancholic spring afternoon atmosphere, as if time has frozen at this moment, with only petals gently dancing in the wind; The overall image features a strong artistic photography style, with rich yet cluttered details. It combines the realism of everyday equipment with the refined beauty of professional image processing. Every light and shadow, every cluster of petals, and every contour is carefully designed to create a visual poem full of Eastern aesthetics blending with modern photographic language.",
