        {
          "id": "krea2-70b05915a39c96b2aa399614",
          "alias": "单女白T恤床温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges cross-legged on a bed covered with a soft plush blanket, sunlight streaming in from one window, casting warm and soft shadows on her bare skin and clothes, creating a quiet and slightly intimate afternoon atmosphere at home; She wore a lightweight, breathable white sleeveless polka dot tank top and shorts printed with elegant cartoon patterns. On her feet, she wore light blue knit stockings with slightly curled cuffs revealing her ankles. The overall outfit looked casual and comfortable yet not lacking; Add a touch of casualness and authenticity; As if inviting the audience into this quiet, private space; The bed she sits on is covered with a thick blanket of leopard print and off-white, with a huge pink plush teddy bear scattered beside it. Its rounded, fluffy shape visually echoes the soft curves of femininity; The background wall is a plain light gray, with a faint glimpse of a white night lamp or decorative piece on the right side. The bed edge and blanket edges form natural guiding lines, with light coming from the upper left side of the painting, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow in a three-dimensional effect. The shadows on the right side of the figure and the legs are richly layered, with warm yellow and light pink as the main color palette, accented by white and blue, presenting a healing and youthful atmosphere in everyday life; The details of the visuals are handled with delicate realism, with a strong sense of everyday storytelling and the authentic graininess of photographic equipment. It feels like a casual yet highly infectious moment captured by a regular phone or small camera under natural light. The entire scene exudes an unedited yet captivating \"everyday aesthetic,\" allowing viewers to feel the protagonist's inner relaxation, sweetness, and gentle longing for life at that moment.",
