        {
          "id": "krea2-4eabc233f49e2758a8690dac",
          "alias": "单女绿外套舞台困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman occupies the central subject of the composition, creating a strong visual contrast with the cool-toned background; She wore a deep green suede beret, with the brim naturally hanging down to cover part of her hairline, revealing a delicate earring that sparkled faintly under stage lights; She wore a loose olive green jacket with a matte texture and slight pleats, paired with a pure white crew-neck T-shirt underneath, adorned with a slender black collar around her neck to add a trendy street vibe; Her right hand wears a thick glove inlaid with dense silver rhinestones, her fingers elegantly making a \"V\" gesture, and the details of her hand shine under the spotlight, becoming one of the visual focal points; Some are pinned down by the hat, while the rest fall softly over the shoulders. The foreground is a dynamic composition area formed by her upper body and arms. The folds of the jacket sleeves, the metallic reflection of the gloves, and her raised fingers all guide the viewer's gaze upward to the right; Connecting foreground and background, enhancing emotional expression of characters; The background is a pure, deep blue-green gradient curtain with no distractions or distractions, using only soft, scattered halos to create an immersive stage atmosphere, making the main figures stand out even more. In terms of lighting and shadow, it uses a strong side backlighting design, with a bright green cold light cutting diagonally from the right front to enhance the sense of depth; The background light source is evenly dispersed, avoiding hard-edged projections, resulting in an overall cinematic high dynamic range effect; The atmosphere blends urban pop culture, stage performance art, and personal emotional expression, combining a cold and mysterious avant-garde vibe with a playful youthful vibe. It feels like capturing backstage moments of an electronic concert or spontaneous snapshots from a fashion show. It features a strong artistic photography style, with moderate color saturation but sharp contrasts. The overall tone leans toward low-saturation cool tones, precisely controlling light and shadow to create characters that are both dreamy and realistic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
