        {
          "id": "krea2-54d1f2c4aeb51c07ef895f69",
          "alias": "男女蓝衬衫城市微笑倚靠演奏",
          "prompt": "The warm glow of the setting sun, like molten gold, gently bathes the entire image. The woman looks up, her smile radiant as a flower. She extends her right hand, playfully interacting as if playfully playing. On her finger, a simple silver ring glows softly in the evening light, and a delicate pearl bracelet gracefully extends along the curve of her wrist. Their skin glowed with a golden glow, radiating a gentle texture. The man wore a loose light blue shirt with a slightly open collar, revealing a slender silver chain around his neck; The woman wore a white spaghetti strap dress, her shoulders and neck graceful, fluttering in the wind like ink-colored silk. The foreground focuses on the intimate interactions between the two, with the man occupying about two-thirds of the left side of the frame, while the woman's body leans slightly back, creating a natural visual balance; The middle shot shows their loving body language and delicate expressions, with the woman's raised arm guiding her gaze upward to the background; The background is the vast sea, shimmering with waves, sunlight shattering into countless leaping gold foils on the water, the distant skyline blurred and soft, and the sea and sky blending between orange-yellow and pale purple, creating a tranquil and romantic evening atmosphere. The composition uses a diagonal layout, with the figures' poses forming a stable triangular structure. The man leaning left and the woman tilting right create dynamic tension. At the same time, the foreground blur effect creates a dreamy, large-area light spot effect on the background sea, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. guiding the audience to immerse themselves in this warm moment. In terms of lighting and shadow, he employs strong backlighting techniques to create a beautiful halo around the edges of the figure, highlighting three-dimensionality without losing softness; The overall color palette leans warm, mainly golden-orange, off-white, and light gray, with moderate saturation to create a retro cinematic feel. The atmosphere was calm and passionate, full of sweet intimacy, as if time had stood still at this moment, with only the gentle sound of waves lapping on the shore resonating with their heartbeats. The entire image exudes a strong Korean romantic atmosphere, like a carefully edited film romance short film, combining the everyday life of everyday life with emotional depth beyond reality. Every frame feels like a visual poem tailor-made for youth and love, evoking gentle vows about promises, companionship, and eternity.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
