        {
          "id": "krea2-d7e25e1942fe6d889d16c9c5",
          "alias": "单女灰短裤小径俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the goal line of an artificial turf football field, wearing the Argentina national team's classic blue and white vertical stripe jersey. The shoulders and cuffs feature a black three-stripe logo, the AFA emblem and two gold stars are clearly printed on the chest, paired with dark gray sports shorts, black knee-high socks (with white parallel bars on the edges), and white high-top sneakers (also featuring three black stripes on the upper). The overall look is full of youthful energy and football culture. She sat cross-legged, legs naturally crossed, her hands gently supporting a traditional black-and-white soccer ball. The classic hexagon and pentagonal patchwork pattern on the surface was clearly visible, and she held the ball firmly in front of her knees, forming a visual focal point. She exudes a confident yet slightly playful expression, wearing a delicate and petite necklace around her neck, adding a touch of refined elegance. In the foreground is the green artificial turf where she sits, with distinct grass texture, soft texture, and rich layers. The white goal line beneath her feet acts like a bright dividing line, naturally dividing the scene into front-back spaces. The lines are clean and sharp, highly visually instructive. The center shot features her and the soccer ball in her hand, forming the core of the composition. The composition is shot from a slightly overhead angle, making the figure feel friendly and approachable, while also highlighting her interaction with the football. In the background, a slanted white net is displayed, with a clearly visible mesh structure that glows softly under sunlight. Behind the net is an orange-red plastic track with regular texture and vivid colors, creating a strong color contrast with the green lawn, enhancing spatial depth and athletic atmosphere in the painting. The entire composition is bright and evenly lit, with natural outdoor light on a sunny daytime. The light and shadows are soft without strong shadows, and the folds of clothing and the soccer ball surface reflect delicate highlights, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere. In terms of composition, the composition uses a central left-leaning golden ratio point layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, and the net diagonally extending from the upper right to the lower left, enhancing the dynamic and stable image. The visual guidance path starts from the foreground goal line and naturally transitions to the central shot, with figures and a football in the background, guiding the audience to immerse themselves in a relaxed and enjoyable sports setting. The overall atmosphere combines youthful energy, sporty passion, and a sweet temperament. The colors are mainly blue, white, and green, accented with orange-red tracks, bright yet harmonious, presenting a realistic and lifelike feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The images are rich and full-bodied, full of narrative tension and emotional warmth, as if capturing a moment of peace and happiness by the sidelines of a football-loving girl. It combines the passionate elements of competitive sports with a gentle, romantic aesthetic of life.",
          "description": "",
