        {
          "id": "krea2-3adca5e9dc926bb1b233074c",
          "alias": "单女森林困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "On a deepening autumn dusk, a woman dressed in elegant Hanfu sits quietly beside a forest path, adding a touch of gentleness and vitality. Her expression is focused and slightly contemplative, as if immersed in a tranquil world created by the warm light of the lanterns. She wore a snow-white wide-sleeved Hanfu, with light and flowing fabric. The sheer fabric shimmered softly in the dim light, with elegant ink floral embroidery accented on the collar. A deep red ribbon tied around her waist contrasted sharply with the white garment, appearing both classical and dignified yet lively and charming. She gently held the lantern with both hands, her right hand gently pointing inside, her fingertips lightly touching the edge of the lamp paper, as if silently conversing with this warm light source. The lantern is the central visual focal point of the painting, forming a circular paper structure with a warm yellow soft glow inside. On the surface of the lamp paper, faint patterns of ink birds or cloud patterns can be seen, faintly appearing under the interplay of light and shadow, adding poetry and Zen charm. Above the lantern hangs a thin bamboo pole, gently swaying in the wind and echoing the surrounding branches and leaves. The foreground portion features the woman's half-body and the lantern as the main subject, with the composition centered slightly to the right, creating a stable yet layered sense of space. The middle shot features the path where the woman sits and the ground paved with fallen leaves, with the blur effect focusing the viewer's gaze on the figures and lanterns. The background features dense, intertwined withered branches and scattered orange-yellow autumn leaves, creating a hazy bokeh under shallow depth of field. In the distance, blurred outlines of buildings or silhouettes of trees can be faintly seen, creating a deep and tranquil forest atmosphere. The entire composition uses diagonal lines, with branches extending from upper left to lower right forming natural guiding lines with the woman's posture, drawing the viewer's gaze toward the center of the lantern. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is extremely soft and dreamy, with the main light source coming from the lantern itself, outlining a soft outline and delicate folded texture. At the same time, mottled light spots and halos appear in the background, floating and flickering like fireflies, enhancing the fairy-tale and romantic atmosphere of the painting. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, gray-white, and dark brown, with low color saturation, presenting a cinematic-quality film texture with slight grain noise, simulating the realistic texture of amateur cameras in low-light conditions. The camera angle is slightly down, bringing the characters' expressions closer to the details of the lanterns, enhancing emotional resonance. A faint mist or moisture fills the air, softening the background and hinting at the slightly cool and moist atmosphere of an autumn night. The entire painting exudes the serene poetic charm of Eastern classical aesthetics, combining the realism of everyday life with a surreal dreamlike atmosphere. Like a meticulously painted meticulous painting or a film still, it conveys emotional tension of loneliness, tenderness, longing, and self-immersion, making one imagine it is a fragment from an autumn night's story, carrying unspoken words and inner monologues.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
