        {
          "id": "krea2-c5d79997a44181d90c799193",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "In a grand and spacious modern football field, a woman stands in front of the metal railing at the edge of the stands, becoming the absolute visual focal point of the scene. She paired it with black skinny pants that revealed a slim waistline, exuding youthful energy and street style vibes. On top of her head, she wears a pair of small, delicate, and shiny red little devil horns, adding a playful and adorable rebellious vibe. In the foreground is a cold, hard silver metal railing, whose clean lines contrast with the soft curves of the figures, while guiding the viewer's attention to the main figure. The middle ground features a vast, boundless emerald green lawn, with clear white edges extending like a painting. At the center of the lawn is a huge circular pattern, vibrant and colorful, suggesting the core area of the competition or event. The distant view features tiered, stepped stands arranged in layers, most of which are empty, with only a few spectators dressed in red scattered in the distance, creating a grand yet somewhat lonely atmosphere. The entire course is evenly covered with artificial lighting, bright but not glaring, softly outlining figures and grass textures, while subtly reflecting on the metal railings. Although the billboards and electronic screens in the background are blurry, they are still faintly discernible, adding a sense of commercial and modern energy to the real arena. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, placing the character slightly lower in the frame. Using a wide-angle lens enhances the sense of depth and scale of the court space, making the character stand out and impressive. The visual guide starts from the foreground railing, extends to the vast field behind, and finally converges on the sparse crowds and stands in the distance, forming a smooth and layered visual flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a bright texture reminiscent of \"artificial daylight,\" with red and green as the dominant color palette, creating a mix of passion, dynamism, youthful energy, yet tinged with a hint of loneliness—as if enjoying a private celebration moment beyond the hustle and bustle of the arena. The entire photo exudes a strong sense of realism from everyday amateur equipment, without excessive retouching, preserving the noise and details of the on-site environment. It's like a casual phone snapping a moment of artistic appeal. It captures both the passion of a sporting event and the lively charm of youth. In the vast arena, she is both participant and observer, the most vibrant and unruly soul of this grand performance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
