        {
          "id": "krea2-9433cd7b5052790e84f847f8",
          "alias": "单女蓝警服沉思倚靠演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a dark blue police uniform and a police cap with the \"POLICE\" badge. The brim is smooth and reflective, making the badge clearly visible. The uniform collar is designed to hang low, with the \"POLICE\" logo sewn on the chest and cuffs. The cuff edges are decorated with black leather texture patchwork. The overall tailoring fits the body perfectly, highlighting the beauty of curves. Looking directly into the camera, her makeup is delicate and natural, creating a fresh and sweet atmosphere. In her right hand, she holds a pair of silver-gray metal handcuffs, with delicate industrial textures and glossy reflections. Her fingers are slender and slender, her nails neatly trimmed and painted in light pink, and a faint purple string bracelet is faintly visible on her wrist, adding a touch of everyday detail. The figure's posture is naturally relaxed, with a slight forward lean and a slight tilt of the head, creating a highly approachable sense of interaction. The background is a pure white wall or light-colored curtains, simple and free of cluttered elements, making the visual focus entirely on the figure. The foreground focuses on handcuffs and fingers, the middle ground features the torso and uniform details, and the background is blurred to enhance spatial layering. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the figure occupying most of the frame and a slight overhead angle, creating an immersive feeling of close contact for viewers. Light comes from the left side of the front, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating subtle highlights only under the brim, shoulders, and the back of the hand, enhancing the sense of dimension and texture. The overall atmosphere combines the realism of everyday shooting with the dramatic impact of role-playing. It combines the sense of order and authority brought by professional uniforms, while the expressions and prop choices reveal a lighthearted, cute, and slightly ambiguous charm, presenting a \"gentleness beneath a serious uniform\" aesthetic of contradiction. The colors are mainly deep blue and silver-gray, creating a gentle contrast within calm restraint. The image style is close to amateur equipment shooting, preserving natural noise and slight exposure transitions. Without excessive post-processing, it conveys a real, intimate, and non-commercial personal imagery temperament. It feels as if casually recorded in a private space, yet the carefully crafted character settings and composition give it narrative tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
