        {
          "id": "krea2-a3b5c8206fdd962b68b7db21",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道冷淡持书",
          "prompt": "In a vintage Hong Kong-style street-side restaurant, a woman lounges lazily on a red leather upholstered booth. She wears a black cropped dress adorned with delicate silver bow embroidery and sparkling sequins on the shoulders and cuffs, gleaming with a delicate metallic sheen under the warm light. Her posture is relaxed yet elegant, making her look like a city portrait frozen in time; In the foreground is a restaurant menu and promotional poster spread out on a wooden tabletop. The poster is vividly colored, printed with vintage English words \"ALL FOR THE WINNER\" and several old actors wearing qipaos. Below are clear images of dishes and promotional slogans. One round plate displays steak or meat rolls drizzled with sauce, with a prominent red table sign numbered \"2\" next to it. The lighting and shadow atmosphere combine the soft-focus texture of Japanese film photography with the realistic roughness of street snapshots. Warm and cool light areas blend together, creating an ambiguous space between dream and reality; The overall color palette is mainly deep red, black, and wood tones, complemented by silver metallic reflections and green menu accents, creating a visual tension that intertwines high and low saturation; The visual style blends the narrative feel of retro film stills with the spontaneous spontaneity of contemporary street photography, combining meticulously arranged fashion with the lively atmosphere of real life scenes. Like an old magazine cover forgotten in a corner, it captures the beauty of a moment and carries the tender moments overlooked in the city's corners.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
