        {
          "id": "krea2-6b65957489c997a2568a3232",
          "alias": "单女背心困倦倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a light purple long-sleeved top paired with a dark sleeveless vest, adorned with gold buttons on the vest's shoulders. The overall outfit is simple and gentle, blending seamlessly with the environment. In the foreground, a full, sky-blue balloon occupies the lower left area of the painting. Its surface is smooth with a soft sheen, partially obscured by branches and slightly blurred light spots in the foreground, creating visual layers and adding a dreamy atmosphere. The middle frame is the main part of her body, faintly visible from shoulder to knee, surrounded by lush green plants, with interlaced branches and leaf edges, some naturally hanging down to the top of the frame, forming a natural frame structure. The background is a blurred forest and sky, with tree outlines faintly visible in bokeh, and in the distance, a faint glimpse of white walls or a corner of a building. The color saturation is reduced, creating a sense of depth and tranquility. The composition uses a vertical style slightly to the right center, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, the balloon forming a visual balance point in the lower left corner, and branches extending diagonally from above, while also creating natural occlusion and light and shadow changes. Light comes from the upper side, soft and natural, like diffused afternoon light filtering through the gaps in leaves, while also creating soft reflections on the surface of the balloon. Shadowed areas like the neck and collar are handled very softly to avoid a stiff cut. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and tinged with melancholy, as if captured by chance on a summer afternoon, carrying the confusion of youth and poetic loneliness. The color tone leans toward cool tones, with blue and green as the main tone, harmonizing with the background. The image quality is close to real camera shooting, with slight grainy noise and soft focus effects, especially noticeable in the background of branches and leaves in the foreground and background blur, presenting a film-like hazy beauty and a sense of everyday life. At the bottom of the image, faint outlines of the ground or stone steps can be faintly seen, suggesting the scene is real and enhancing immersion. The entire scene is like a silent poem, telling a story about waiting, longing, or self-reflection through light, shadow, color, and composition, full of emotional tension and artistic beauty, suitable for social media covers or mood wallpapers.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
