        {
          "id": "krea2-665e87bb3c019bde626cab65",
          "alias": "单女白外套废墟忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A female racer wore a retro-style white and dark blue patchwork racing jacket, covered with classic sponsor badges, such as those from Michelin, Shoei, Shell, Rothmans Honda, and other brands clearly visible. The cuffs were decorated with red and white stripes, giving the overall look a nostalgic vibe of 1980s professional racing culture; She leans sideways on a vividly colored classic Honda race motorcycle, her hands naturally resting near the handlebars, her left hand lightly touching the body, her right hand hanging down, her posture relaxed and calm; His expression is focused with a hint of melancholy or contemplation, as if immersed in an inner world beyond the track; The motorcycle helmet is placed in front of the seat, with a white shell accented with orange-blue stripes. The front of the helmet is printed with the word \"SHOEI,\" and the side is labeled \"Rothmans Honda.\" The mirrored visor reflects a blurred environmental outline; The foreground focuses on the detailed textures of the helmet and the woman's arm, highlighting the contrast between the fabric folds and the glossy car paint; The middle ground shows the woman's torso and the main structure of the motorcycle, including the edge of the fuel tank, frame lines, and handlebar contours, forming the visual anchor point of gravity; The background is a wide countryside road scene, with distant hills rolling gently, a sky covered with gray-blue clouds, and faint vegetation and roads stretching to the horizon in the distance, creating a sense of solitary and vast space; The composition uses a slightly slanted rule of thirds, with the figure positioned on the right third of the canvas, their bodies facing the lower left, and ample negative space on the left side to enhance narrative tension; The visual guidance path starts with the foreground helmet and ultimately extends to the background and distance, forming an emotional progression from near to far; The lighting atmosphere presents a cloudy, scattered light effect, with soft and even light without strong shadows, but the jacket and the car's highlight areas enhance the sense of depth; The tones are a mix of warm and cool tones, with the off-white jacket contrasting with the blue-orange paint scheme. The gray-green earth tones set the main subject, presenting the unique grainy texture and slight fading characteristic of film cameras. It simulates the soft focus and dynamic range compression effects of vintage film, giving the image a cinematic nostalgic and artistic atmosphere. It's like an amateur photographer capturing moments on an abandoned track with an old digital camera, full of life and emotional depth, evoking the complex mindset of youth, speed, loneliness, and dreams.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
