        {
          "id": "krea2-c1f29f547429f3ee16df04d6",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣户外忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath an outdoor bus stop, slightly tilting her head to look back at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. She wore a loose, comfortable white knit jacket with a soft and fluffy texture, giving off a warm and gentle feel under the sunlight. She paired it with a blue and white plaid scarf. The scarf was vividly colored, with the blue section featuring a gradient gradient and delicate plush texture. The scarf was casually draped over her shoulders and neck, adding a touch of laid-back everyday charm. In particular, the texture details of the scarf and jacket are clearly captured, creating a strong visual center. The middle ground is the bus stop structure where she stands, including light blue metal columns, transparent glass windows, and blurred signs posted on the walls. These elements form real everyday scenes, but due to depth control, they appear slightly blurred and do not distract the subject. The background extends to the street behind the platform and the outlines of distant buildings. The sky is clear and blue, sunlight streaming in from the side, casting clear shadows on the ground and figures, creating a contrast of light and shadow that enhances the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figures positioned on the right side of the canvas, leaving space on the left to showcase the platform structure. The overall layout is balanced and dynamic. Then extend into the background space. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil. Sunlight filters through glass windows and platform ceilings, casting dappled beams of light while creating soft transitions in the shadows. The overall color scheme leans toward a natural interplay of warm and cool light, with a grainy texture reminiscent of film film and a slight fading effect, creating a youthful atmosphere that is slightly nostalgic, fresh, and slightly melancholic. Like a snapshot of life caught unintentionally under the afternoon sun, it is both authentic and full of artistic appeal, as if you can hear the sound of wind passing through the platform. Feeling the cool yet warm atmosphere of winter, the entire image exudes a quiet, gentle, and slightly narrative everyday aesthetic, as simple and moving as film footage taken with an amateur camera.",
