        {
          "id": "krea2-1d9735796a57338688c52b74",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣桌边冷淡坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways at a wooden desk, intently writing or painting, wearing a beige knit cardigan paired with a white inner layer and deep red wide-leg pants, her posture calm and immersive; In the foreground is a warm wooden tabletop, topped with a vintage-style glass-covered cake rack holding brown drinks, alongside a red and white patterned mug, folded notes, a yellow banana, a metal coffee pot covered with lace cloth, and a bunch of slender green plant branches nestled in a transparent vase; In the middle shot, her focused work figure forms a visual focal point with the objects on the table. On the right is a wooden chair draped with a thick blanket with geometric patterns, and the backrest lines are simple; The background is a window at night. Outside, the night is hazy, the window frame is white, and plaid curtains hang softly, letting in a soft warm light from the room. Several books with deep blue covers are neatly arranged along the windowsill edges; The composition adopts a slightly tilted side view, with the figure occupying the right half of the frame, and the left side leaving ample space to display tabletop items and the view outside the window, creating a balance between movement and stillness; The visual guide extends from the coffee pot in the lower left corner of the table to the tip of the pen in the woman's hand, then through her lowered gaze leads to the blurred night view outside the window, creating a narrative rhythm from near to far, from object to person; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, creating contrasts of light and shadow, while faint cool-toned light outside the window serves as supplementary light, enhancing the spatial layers; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of life and artistic vibes, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious late-night creative moment. The light and shadow are delicate and soft like an oil painting, rich in details without overpowering the main focus, presenting a realistic texture and emotional warmth reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The image saturation is moderate, with slight graininess and natural color transitions, like a moment frozen in afternoon sunlight streaming into the study. It combines cinematic narrative with the authentic warmth of everyday life.",
