        {
          "id": "krea2-2297002d40bf721bbed52fab",
          "alias": "单女外套镜前愤怒持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman's silhouette occupies the center of the frame, wearing a dark hooded jacket. Her silhouette is outlined in the strong backlight of the sunset, forming a clear and gentle silhouette, gently drifting in the breeze. The flower spikes spread like clouds, glowing with a hazy pink and warm yellow under the light, as if carrying tender memories or the whispers of the seasons; The foreground focuses on the cattail in her hand and some sleeves, using shallow depth of field to make details slightly blurred yet layered, creating an intimate and tranquil impression; The middle ground is the transitional zone between the main contour of her body and the distant water. The water is as calm as a mirror, reflecting the fading colors of the sky. The waves shimmer without obvious splashes, hinting at a peaceful and undisturbed twilight; The background is a magnificent sunset sky, where the sun slowly sinks into the horizon, radiating a rich, rounded golden glow. Around it, a soft gradient spreads from orange-red to pale purple to light blue. The clouds are thin and light, dotted with just a few touches of pale hues. The sky's colors are highly saturated yet transition naturally, without any awkward patchwork; The composition follows the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, with a bouquet of cattails extending to the left edge, creating visual balance and guidance; At the same time, backlighting is used, placing the light source behind the figure to create a strong contrast between light and dark. This not only enhances the silhouette effect but also gives the scene dramatic tension and poetic atmosphere; Then, the details of the cattail reed naturally flow into the hand, extending toward the distant sunset and the colors of the sky, ultimately returning to the contemplative and tranquil mood conveyed by the figure's overall posture; In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the sunset on the horizon, which is warm and soft without being glaring, evenly casting on the surface of the cattail reeds to create delicate layered variations, enhancing the sense of depth and dreaminess; The overall atmosphere presents a serene, introspective, gentle, and slightly melancholic poetic beauty, as if time has frozen in this moment, with the characters immersed in personal thoughts or reverence for nature. The entire scene exudes a healing power, combining the ordinary realism of daily life with the aesthetic mood reminiscent of artistic photography. The colors are warm and emotionally dynamic, harmoniously unified, combining the passionate sunset with the gentle lingering of dusk, together constructing a twilight painting full of storytelling and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
