        {
          "id": "krea2-050958d9481ab476d7aae36c",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤街道冷淡倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a retro-style white football jersey with the \"Teka\" sponsor logo printed on the chest. The shoulders were adorned with three black stripes, the neckline had a deep blue trim, the left chest featured the club badge, and the right hem featured a small patterned logo. She paired it with black shorts and over-the-knee white socks, and classic black-and-white sneakers. The overall look was full of street fashion and sporty vibes; Her posture was natural and relaxed, her left hand casually resting on the low concrete wall behind her, her body slightly leaning to the side, legs crossed, exuding youthful energy and casual confidence; The background is the exterior walls of modern urban buildings, made from large light gray tiles joined together, with surfaces showing slight signs of age and fine stains. Metal drainage grilles are installed beneath the walls, and the floor is made of dark gray square tiles. The overall environment is simple and neat, evoking the texture of everyday urban life. The foreground focuses on the lines of the characters' legs and the details of their shoes; the middle shots present the upper body and leaning posture; the background is moderately blurred to highlight the subject; the composition uses a mid-to-low angle downward angle, making the figure appear more upright and slender, while also creating a sense of spatial depth; The visual guide line extends from the character's raised arm to the head, then naturally transitions through the body's curves to the legs, finally converging at the sneakers underfoot, forming a smooth and dynamic narrative path; The lighting atmosphere is soft and even, resembling diffused light from cloudy days or building shadows. Light shines from the side slightly above, creating delicate reflections in the folds of clothing, enhancing three-dimensionality and material realism. The overall tone leans toward cool gray and low saturation, creating a quiet, lazy yet youthful city street photo atmosphere. The images have a strong realist photographic texture, as if shot by a regular phone or entry-level camera, preserving natural noise and slight color deviation, giving images a warm and authentic amateur lifestyle, while maintaining exquisite composition and artistic beauty, perfectly blending sports culture elements with contemporary youth fashion expression, conveying a lifestyle attitude of freedom, passion, and self-expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
