        {
          "id": "krea2-5cf9f84ee13d4a8de3b40bbd",
          "alias": "单女黑西装酒店神秘坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on the edge of a modern-style wooden desk, leaning slightly forward. Her ring and middle fingers wear delicate gold rings. She wears a sharply tailored black blazer, with a black low-cut top visible at the collar. Three round gold buttons at the cuffs sparkle in the dim light. The short hem reveals her long legs, with her ankles not visible. The overall posture is both professional and exudes a touch of lazy and casual fashion; The foreground focuses on the line of her legs at the junction of the tabletop. The desk is made of dark wood grain, with a smooth surface reflecting some of the figure's outlines. On the table sits a white cardboard box-shaped item, with faint light brown oval patterns visible on the side. Beside it, a black smartphone sits quietly; The middle shot shows her entire body silhouette and the details of her interactions with the phone. The suit fabric is thick and has subtle textures, with clear folds at the cuffs and collar, and a slight waistline at the back accentuating her curves. In the background is a vertical curtain with deep brown vertical stripes, which is semi-transparent and creates interplay of light and shadow under the light. Behind the curtain, faint outlines of city buildings or window frames can be faintly visible, and in the distant ceiling, a round warm light bulb emits a soft white light. At the same time, a mottled halo effect is cast on the curtains; The composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, with the main figure occupying the center to the right of the frame. The telephone receiver's spiral cable naturally extends to the left edge of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. Meanwhile, the desk edge horizontal line and the line of the character's legs form a stable visual balance; The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a warm yet slightly mysterious indoor dusk atmosphere. The main light source is from the upper left, with the suit jacket and curtains forming a dark tone, accented by gold buttons and nail polish accents, creating a low-key luxury and high-end feel. The overall color palette leans toward warm brown and black, with slight film graininess and soft focus effects, as if shot by a professional-grade digital camera inside a hotel suite with a large aperture lens. The image texture is delicate and authentic, combining cinematic feel with stylish photorealistic temperament, presenting an independent confidence in urban nightlife, a calm and composed modern female image.",
