        {
          "id": "krea2-957924e2bc97db40cbe0f7ed",
          "alias": "单女城市冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "The brick surfaces reflect warm yellow light from the surroundings, adding depth to the image; The middle ground features the blurred outlines and steps of urban buildings behind her, with clean and modern lines, hinting that this is a bustling metropolitan public space; The background is a dazzling night scene blurred, with countless white circular light spots scattered like a starry river among the branches and leaves, creating a dreamlike bokeh effect. Orange-red maple leaves interspersed with accents, contrasting warmth and cool with the blue-toned architectural lighting, enhancing the atmosphere of autumn and winter nights; The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the golden ratio point, with branches above spanning the top of the frame forming a natural frame, while the foreground ground guides the gaze upward; The visual guide line is composed of floor tiles, the posture of the figures, and the lighting fixtures hanging above. For lighting, low-angle side backlighting is used, so the subject is evenly softened by ambient light. The warm white light filtering through the branches above creates soft highlights, contrasting with the cool-toned background light source and creating a warm yet slightly distant atmosphere; The overall color palette is mainly cream white, warm orange-red, and deep blue-gray, with moderate saturation, presenting a texture that is both realistic and artistically filtered. It's like a gentle moment captured on the street with a high-end digital camera, featuring slight film graininess and soft focus effects, evoking Japanese street photography or movie poster styles, conveying a tranquil, romantic, nostalgic, and hopeful mood.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
