        {
          "id": "krea2-51404522904a7449b4c17245",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges lazily on a high-back chair with soft velvet texture. She wears a loose, flowing pure white long-sleeved shirt made of lightweight, soft fabric, which drapes naturally with the curves of her body and forms smooth pleats. The cuffs are casually rolled up to reveal slender wrists. Around her neck is a delicate rose gold necklace, with a small transparent crystal pendant that clearly shows the lines of her collarbone; She wears a simple gold earring on her right earlobe, a delicate ring on her ring and middle fingers, and a delicate rose gold bracelet on her wrist, glowing softly in the gentle light. In the foreground is her snow-white shirt hem and exposed leg skin; in the center is the pink high-back chair she leans on, with a vertical, full, soft cushion and a delicate matte suede texture. The color is a delicate macaron pink, creating a fresh and soft color dialogue with the white shirt. The background is minimalist light-colored walls or curtains, with a unified warm white or off-white tone, with no decorations obstructing the view, creating a clean, tranquil, and private sense of space. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the subject occupying most of the frame. The slightly tilted shooting angle adds dynamism and layering, while the shallow depth of field blurs the background to make the subject stand out. She guides the audience's emotions to flow with her thoughts. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is extremely soft and warm. The light source comes from the front left of the frame, belonging to a softbox or window scattered light, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. There are no harsh shadows, and the overall image presents a creamy soft-focus texture. The color palette is mainly pink and white, complemented by subtle glow from metal jewelry, creating a gentle, tranquil, and slightly artistic atmosphere. It resembles a fashionable photo carefully arranged in a professional studio, yet carries a sense of realism and aesthetics unintentionally captured in daily life, as if morning sunlight streaming through the curtains into the bedroom The moment she just wakes up or is about to leave is captured, filled with a lazy, carefree, restrained, and story-rich artistic beauty.",
