        {
          "id": "krea2-33f01b81a4d1ae26ec013b92",
          "alias": "单女外套雪地冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman dressed in a luxurious fur coat stands on a glass viewing platform high up, gazing sideways at the magnificent scene where snowy plains and sunset blend into the breeze. She wears a light beige low-cut slip dress with a light flowing hem that outlines elegant curves. Around her neck is a simple silver chain necklace. On her left wrist, a slender silver bracelet gleams with a cold metallic sheen under the light. Her right hand hangs naturally, fingertips lightly touching the hem, her posture calm yet slightly contemplative; The fur coat is fluffy and thick, with deep brown and gray-brown alternating plush textures in distinct layers. Each ring of fur is full and rounded, presenting a warm amber tone against the backlight, visually echoing the golden glow reflected on the frozen river in the distance; In the foreground is a transparent glass railing, whose surface condenses fine moisture and frost marks due to low temperatures, reflecting figures and sky reflections, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; The middle features winding snow-covered riverbanks and sparse clusters of withered trees, with branches casting slender shadows at dusk. The ice layers mirror the sky with gradients of orange-red and pale blue, and the shimmering sunlight shimmers like golden fragments; The background is a vast, boundless snowy plain stretching endlessly toward the horizon, distant mountain ranges faintly outlined, the sky transitioning from a nearby deep blue to the golden sunset at the horizon, the sun hanging in the upper left, its light soft yet penetrating, dyeing the edges of the clouds orange-red and pink-purple; The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned on the right third of the canvas, the left blank space emphasizing spaciousness, and the glass railing serving as a horizontal dividing line to enhance the layers; Ultimately leading to the distant snowfield and sunset junction; The light and shadow atmosphere presents the unique tranquility and solitude of winter evenings, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. The cool background tones of snowy scenes and sky create a sense of chill and vastness. The overall color scheme is earth brown, ice blue, and warm orange, with moderate saturation and a natural, authentic texture. The visual style combines cinematic narrative with the realistic graininess and slight noise typical of everyday amateur equipment. The shots feature slight distortion and shallow depth of field, making the subject clear and prominent, while the background becomes blurred and hazy. It feels like a precious moment casually captured on a cold winter evening with a phone, yet the characters' postures and environmental ambiance fill the space with poetry and artistic tension, conveying nobility in solitude, freedom in contemplation, and the small yet beautiful presence of humans and nature against a grand backdrop.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
