        {
          "id": "krea2-efcd0f020ed4abad5bb47c97",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林沉思坐指向",
          "prompt": "On a forest staircase gently wrapped in lush greenery, a couple sits quietly in the center of the dark wooden steps, forming the emotional focal point at the heart of the painting. The woman wore a flowing white long dress with a light hem that fell to her knees, cuffs adorned with delicate lace, and a light beige wide-brimmed straw hat. She leaned sideways against the man, who was dressed in a soft pink suit over a white shirt with a slightly open collar and naturally rolled-up cuffs. Both have fair skin that looks delicate and soft under natural light, with a clear sense of material—the woman's skirt is as thin as gauze, while the man's suit is crisp but with pleated details. Both wear simple white casual shoes, harmonizing with the overall atmosphere. The canopies intertwine, shading the sky, with only the faint grayish-white light at the top. In the distance, the faint outlines of tree trunks can be faintly seen, creating a sense of depth and spatial expansiveness. The entire composition adopts a symmetrical layout, with steps running along a central axis running through the frame, placing the figures near the visual golden ratio point to reinforce the subject's position; At the same time, stepped lines guide the viewer's gaze upward, ultimately focusing on the moments of character interaction, creating a strong emotional pull. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by soft, diffused light, with sunlight streaming through gaps in the canopy, creating warm and bright highlights on the shoulders, skirt hems, and steps of the figures, while naturally transitioning light and dark contrasts in body shadows to enhance the sense of depth; The overall tone leans warm, dominated by low-saturation greens and creamy whites and pale pinks, complemented by deep brown wood tones for contrast, creating a peaceful, healing, and youthful pastoral atmosphere. The visual style combines naturalism with aesthetic photography, as if shot with a regular digital camera under the shade of an afternoon tree. There are slight noise and film graininess, with colors leaning slightly toward warm yellow tones. Post-processing preserves the original texture without losing a soft filter effect, giving the entire image an unpolished yet deeply emotional aesthetic of life. It combines everyday intimacy with artistic compositional thinking and emotional tension, allowing viewers to easily immerse themselves in the purity and beauty of youth and love.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
