        {
          "id": "krea2-ccb3375306c360100b61348d",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on the concrete steps at the entrance of the railway tracks, her body slightly turned to the right of the frame, exuding a quiet yet slightly melancholic youthful temperament; She wore a loose long dark gray coat paired with a matching short skirt underneath, black over-the-knee socks, and brown lace-up leather shoes. A tiny metal decorative button was faintly visible at the ankle, creating an overall look that was simple and retro, full of Japanese artistic flair. Its cold, hard lines contrast with the gentle beauty of the figures, while guiding the viewer's attention to the main subjects; The middle ground features crisscrossing tracks and sleepers, with surfaces covered in traces of time and gravel particles. Sunlight casts sharp shadows on them, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering; In the background is a stationary yellow vintage locomotive, with a warm and heavy body color, clear outlines of windows and doors, a faint numbering label on the side, and a striking yellow and black warning pole and red signal light standing nearby. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow on the figures' shoulders, backs, and the ground, creating a mottled and varied effect of light and shadow, while the rails and railings create a strong contrast of light and shadow. The atmosphere is tranquil and full of stories, as if frozen in a moment between daily outings, evoking both the rushed pace of urban life and a touch of poetic loneliness and contemplation; The colors are dominated by warm yellow tones, with the yellow of the locomotive, the light blue of the sky, the gray-black of the tracks, and the deep gray of the figures' costumes forming a harmonious contrast, while the golden green plant bottles and hairpins add to the composition's calmness yet vitality; The entire image presents the authentic texture of a film camera, with delicate quality but slight noise and color shifts, smooth edge transitions, as if from a nostalgic movie, combining the depth of artistic photography with the intimate feeling of everyday leisure to capture moments of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
