        {
          "id": "krea2-8b2a56ebc2093a3252e64282",
          "alias": "单女短裙森林冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant blue-and-white Hanfu sits upright on a grassy forest in the woods. Her robes flutter like clouds and mist, layers of sheer fabric gently swaying in the breeze. The fabric is delicate and smooth, with delicate light-colored embroidery patterns faintly visible throughout. The waist strap hangs naturally, and the overall outfit exudes the gentleness and ethereal elegance of classical Eastern aesthetics. The center of the piano was inlaid with exquisite floral patterns in a black background, embroidered with intricate floral and vine patterns using gold and green threads. The strings were clearly visible, the shaft long and upright, and the headstock carved simply yet full of traditional charm; The woman gently strokes the body of the qin with both hands, her posture elegant and composed. Her fingertips are close to the strings, as if about to pluck or just play a melodious melody. The qin and person merge into one, conveying the beauty of classical instrumental rhythm; In the foreground is the ground beneath her knees, covered with withered yellow and tender green grass leaves, some stems scattered in small fragments, a few fallen leaves scattered throughout, sunlight filtering through the canopy, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a warm and gentle visual layer; In the middle shot, her body and body occupy the main positions, with the hem of her skirt and the body forming a natural visual focal point. The folds of the clothing echo the lines of the strings, and the background is a hazy green forest, with dense branches and leaves rendered into soft color blocks, preserving only the outlines and light spots, creating a profound sense of space and tranquility, while also emphasizing the prominence of the subject. The composition uses a medium to close-up perspective, with the figure standing slightly to the right, head facing upward to the left, creating an asymmetrical yet harmonious balance. Natural light shines from the right side diagonally above, outlining the character's outline and robe texture, creating a strong sense of light and shadow contrast in three-dimensionality; In terms of lighting, warm yellow afternoon sunlight filters through the leaves, enhancing depth and realism, while the ground and background appear in a darker, cool green, creating a subtle contrast with the warm tones of the figures; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, and full of classical Eastern charm. The cinematic soft focus and film texture resemble a lady in an ink painting, or like photos taken with everyday leisure equipment but full of artistic beauty. The color saturation is moderate, with natural transitions between light and shadow, conveying a leisurely mood of escaping the hustle and bustle and immersing oneself in the beauty of nature and music.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
