        {
          "id": "krea2-a2510f4391e3a147cb4d7124",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚注视",
          "prompt": "The plush texture looked especially cozy and comfortable under the warm light, and the sleeves were slightly rolled up to reveal her slender wrists; In the foreground are neatly stacked books. At the top is a hardcover book with a vintage yellow cover decorated with gold stamping. Below are purple, white, and blue-covered paperbacks. The blue spine is printed with the words \"TAMIE OLIVER\" and handwritten font, with yellowed edges revealing the marks of time; The middle section covers the lower part of the figure and the stacked book area, forming the visual focal point; The background is blurred into soft, warm-toned window light and shadow, with faint glimpses of faint greenery or architectural outlines outside, creating a tranquil and cozy indoor atmosphere; The composition uses the classic three-part portrait method, with the person's head positioned above the golden ratio point of the composition, naturally guiding the viewer with stacked books, forming a stable base, and creating a balanced and harmonious overall composition; The visual guide lines are formed by the direction of the characters' gaze, the layering of books, and soft light and shadow. The use of light and shadow is soft and natural, creating subtle transitions between light and shadow, while light shadows are cast along the edges of pages to enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, full of artistic vibe and healing, as if you are in a study or café corner bathed in afternoon sunlight, radiating poetic associations of youth, knowledge, and a beautiful life; The colors are mainly low-saturation Morandi tones, with green sweaters, yellow book covers, and blue spines forming a fresh and pleasing color scheme. The warm background creates a cozy and cozy home atmosphere; The image quality is delicate and realistic, featuring the high definition and delicate light and shadow of professional studio shooting, while retaining the natural feel and everyday warmth of amateur equipment shooting, presenting an overall aesthetic that is both exquisite and heartfelt.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
