        {
          "id": "krea2-d2c5c599f67ffb87b0087f05",
          "alias": "单女花园俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in a sunlit outdoor garden, adding a touch of liveliness and gentleness. She tilts her head slightly back, as if immersed in the beautiful moment where floral fragrance and warm sunlight intertwine. She wears an off-white ribbed knitted short-sleeved top, the soft and delicate fabric glowing softly under the light, outlining a slender and elegant silhouette. Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of bright, dazzling golden sunflower flowers. The flowers are full and blooming, with petals layered like flames, the center deep brown and rounded, and the stems and leaves emerald green and upright. One of the small flowers playfully falls on her fingertip, creating a natural and lively interactive effect. The clarity and sharpness are clear, while the background is treated as a soft, hazy green plant blur area, transitioning from near to far to create a dreamlike bokeh effect. In the distance, a faint sea of golden flowers can be seen, echoing the main subject in color. The composition uses the classic three-part vertical composition. The figure is positioned slightly lower to the left of the frame, with the gaze and flower branch naturally extending to the upper right, guiding the viewer's gaze upward with their emotions. The overall composition presents a strong sense of depth and breathing. The atmosphere is calm and healing, full of youthful energy and natural poetry. The entire image exudes a fresh and elegant Japanese film style, with slight grainy noise and a soft-focus filter effect. The color palette is mainly bright yellow-green, complemented by the warm white of the subject's skin and the off-white of clothing, creating a lazy and pleasant visual experience on a spring afternoon. The image's emotions are full and sincere, conveying a cherishing of the beauty of life and pure inner joy, like a carefully crafted photographic artwork capturing the most touching poetic moments of ordinary daily life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
