        {
          "id": "krea2-24e1aea62903018b88615b21",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市冷淡倚靠（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman with outstanding temperament leans against a dappled beige concrete wall, wearing a highly designed black velvet dress. On the right side, a sturdy black industrial-style column runs through the frame, with bolts fixed on the column's surface; The background features a blurred modern architectural glass curtain wall and dark window frames, with warm yellow indoor lighting faintly visible through the glass; The overall composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame and the body facing left to create dynamic balance; The visual guide extends from the edge of the wall she leans against and the steps beneath her feet into the depths of the frame. Light comes from the upper left side of the frame, soft yet directional, creating bright highlights at the edges of her fur collar, collarbones, legs, and shoe contours, while casting clear shadows on the wall and floor, creating a sense of three-dimensional layering; The atmosphere is tranquil yet rich in urban fashion, combining the refinement of high-end fashion shoots with the authentic texture of city streets. Light and materials collide to create a low-key luxury visual tension. The color palette is mainly black, beige, and gray-white, with moderate saturation. Overall, it presents a scene that is both cool and gentle, combining artistry with everyday authenticity. It's like a street shot captured by a professional camera at dusk—rich in detail yet without noise, full of narrative and emotional resonance.",
