        {
          "id": "krea2-854d2078121b593c33d09bd3",
          "alias": "单女毛衣节庆困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "The cuffs and neckline featured delicate twisted weave patterns, soft and comfortable to convey warmth and a homely feeling in winter; Her right arm extends forward, her fingertips lightly touching or hovering beside a beautifully decorated Christmas tree, adorned with sparkling red glass beads, golden bells, and orange ribbons. The branches and leaves are deep green and dense, creating a festive atmosphere; The foreground is blurred, with blurred green pine needles interwoven with scattered red circular light spots, creating a natural depth transition. A faint red Chinese knot sticker with the character \"Fu\" (decorative character) can be seen, hinting at the fusion of Spring Festival or New Year themes; The middle ground is a partial Christmas tree where the main figure interacts with the character, while the background consists of hazy white gauze curtains and hanging orange tassel stripes. Behind the curtains are scattered warm yellow string lights, with soft strips of light and shadow drawn from the fabric; The entire composition combines a tilted perspective with the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned on the left side of the canvas, creating an imaginative space; The overall composition is enveloped in warm and soft orange and pink-gold tones. The main light source comes from the front right of the figure, outlining a three-dimensional and soft contour. At the same time, a delicate transition of light and shadow is formed on the sweater surface, with shadows kept low saturation to avoid excessive contrast; Background lighting and front light spots together create a dreamy bokeh effect, enhancing the layering and immersive atmosphere of the image; The entire image presents a warm, romantic, serene, and healing artistic style, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens and completed under soft indoor lighting. It is a carefully composed composition with strong visual narrative and emotional resonance, evoking a winter afternoon, holiday celebration, or private memorial moment. It is full of everyday life yet artistically beautiful, suitable for social media sharing or personal photo collections.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
