        {
          "id": "krea2-77c0f2df0b97f4eafc67e2f1",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙厨房坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a bright kitchen corner, sunlight streaming through the window onto her, casting clear and soft shadows on the pristine white wall behind her. She wears a delicate lace embroidered slip dress adorned with three-dimensional pink and beige floral patterns, edged with golden threads. She wears a loose gray-blue plaid shirt casually draped over her shoulders, with naturally draped cuffs and a loose skirt covering her knees. Her right hand is gently raised, fingertips lightly plucking the tip, and her ring finger wears a vintage carved ring. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, also wearing a uniquely designed ring. The background is a clean white tiled wall, with the edge of a stainless steel sink and the outline of a hanging pot in the corner. Light enters from the right, creating a layered interplay of light and shadow between her skin, the folds of her clothes, and the tile gaps. The light and shadow are soft yet three-dimensional, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly lazy afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, light gray, pale pink, and deep blue. The colors are harmonious and soft, and the image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with everyday amateur equipment, yet it features professional-level lighting and emotional expression, full of life and artistic beauty, allowing one to feel a quiet moment gently wrapped in sunlight in an ordinary space.",
