        {
          "id": "krea2-3f5d7c94cc422e475478f855",
          "alias": "单女短裙城市沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a modern indoor leisure space, wearing Arsenal's iconic red home jersey, with \"Emirates\" and \"F.BETTER\" printed on the chest of the white sponsor lettering. The Arsenal crest is clearly visible on the left chest, the cuffs feature the classic three-stripe white stripe design, and the collar is white lapel. The overall tailoring exudes a sporty fashion sense; Add a lazy and casual vibe; She sat on her side, legs elegantly crossed, right hand lightly resting on her knee, left hand naturally resting beside her thigh, fingers slender and long, wearing a simple and exquisite metal ring ring, her nails neatly trimmed with light pink nail art; She wears a pair of small, transparent, framed glasses around her neck, with chain pendants delicately draped down her chest, cleverly matching her jersey; Her expression is gentle yet tinged with a thoughtful haze, her makeup is natural and fresh, highlighting a healthy glow; The foreground focuses on the middle and lower parts of her body, including the lines of her legs, the edges of her skirt, and details of her hands. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the center of the frame, and the background blurred to create a sense of depth; In the middle of the scene, you can see a corner of the light-colored sofa or seat where she sits, with a smooth surface and clean lines that harmonize with the overall environment; The background presents a warm atmosphere of light and shadow interwoven with dim yellow and deep red. In the distance, a blurry neon sign emits a soft red glow, and the Chinese characters \"Shanghai\" are faintly visible, hinting at urban nightscapes or social venues such as bars and restaurants; On the left background, a warm yellow desk lamp emits soft light, casting a hazy reflection on the ground, creating a warm and cool contrast with the red light source on the right; The overall composition centers on the figure, with delicate use of light and shadow. The main subject is illuminated by soft frontal lighting, with natural shadow transitions in the folds of clothing, and the background light source creates a dreamlike bokeh effect; The atmosphere is filled with the lazy romantic vibe of urban nightlife, combining sports elements with fashionable outfits to present a unique visual tension that combines youthful energy with artistic flair. The color palette is dominated by red, complemented by white, beige, and warm yellow and dark red backgrounds, creating a visual experience that is both passionate and inviting. It feels like capturing a touching moment of brief pause and self-enjoyment in the bustling city. The entire frame has a professional studio lighting texture while retaining the authenticity and everyday life of everyday shooting. It conveys a modern female charm that is relaxed and uninhibited yet tasteful.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
