        {
          "id": "krea2-d63b44ded7f2cbabb1a12d63",
          "alias": "单女外套城市冷淡坐（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a dark brown wavy metallic bench with strong visual textures. She wears a fluffy, soft faux fur coat with leopard print patterns, paired with a subtle taupe tight knit vest underneath, and a pair of high-knee black suede boots, with thin cords trimmed on the sides, blending wildness with refined fashion. On her left shoulder sits a black crocodile leather handbag, adorned with a gold metal chain and the brand's signature three-dimensional lettering decoration, reflecting a delicate sheen under the light. The entire composition uses a medium to near ground perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. The background is a large glass curtain wall in a modern architectural style, divided by a silver-gray metal frame into a neat grid. The glass surface reflects indoor lighting and blurred silhouettes, creating a sense of depth and a cool atmosphere in the urban space. In the foreground is a sculptural bench, whose uneven wavy surface creates a visual rhythm of light and shadow under the light, creating a strong material contrast with the figure's soft plush coat. The visual guide naturally extends from the character's line of sight into the background, while the curve of the bench and the lines of the character's legs form a dynamic balance. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the left or front of the image, creating subtle shadow layers. The glass curtain wall in the background shows cool-toned reflections, creating a temperature contrast with the warm-toned clothing of the characters. The overall atmosphere combines urban modernity with personal privacy, featuring exquisite composition reminiscent of a high-end fashion magazine cover while retaining the authentic texture and lifestyle of everyday phone photography. The light and shadow transitions are natural, color saturation is moderate, emphasizing the harmonious interaction between material details and the character's expression, presenting an artistic beauty that is both bold and restrained, fashionable yet gentle.",
