        {
          "id": "krea2-02da0fac565d4269ad3b1cac",
          "alias": "单女全裸外套广场微笑坐伸展",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly at the center of a light gray-beige suede sofa, draped in a fluffy, luxurious light taupe long fur coat. The fur is fine and soft, the edges naturally curled, and the cuffs and neckline are covered with thick and full fur, creating a soft silhouette. This contrasts sharply with the deep blue washed jeans she wears in terms of material and color, highlighting her layered fashion taste; A faint, almost imperceptible smile appeared; She gently gripped a transparent glass cup with both hands, holding light-colored drinks. A thin black straw was inserted diagonally into the liquid from the rim. She gently pressed the tip of the straw with her right index finger, while her left hand steadily supported the bottom. Her nails were neatly trimmed and painted in light pink or nude nail polish, and she wore a simple and petite ring on her ring finger. On her right side (left side of the image) sofa armrest sits a black leather handbag. The bag is square and crisp, adorned with a thick black leather shoulder strap and metal chain decoration. The lid is slightly open, revealing part of the internal structure; The feature wall is painted in a light beige with subtle texture, featuring uneven textured textures that enhance the warmth and artistic atmosphere of the space; On the central wall behind her hangs a large abstract figure oil painting on a pure black background, using gray-white and pale gold tones to outline a human silhouette with its back to the viewer, stretching out in posture. The lines are smooth and expressive, creating a subtle echo between the painting and the figure; In the upper left corner of the painting, the leaves of a green plant can be faintly seen, its branches and leaves spreading, injecting a touch of fresh vitality into the warm-toned space; The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the main figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the image, while sofa lines and background frames form a stable visual framework; The light is soft and even, with diffused light from the front and above, creating delicate highlights on the fur coat surface, fully showcasing the sofa suede and canvas texture; The overall atmosphere combines urban fashion with artistic tranquility, with natural light and shadow transitions and harmonious color coordination, creating a lifestyle aesthetic scene that is both everyday and full of sophistication. It feels like a relaxing afternoon in a boutique café or private art space. The details are rich and authentic, offering a strong immersive visual experience.",
          "description": "",
