        {
          "id": "krea2-7559d4ec3b314d467cd0ca6b",
          "alias": "单女绿外套草地忧伤泼洒",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep green thick coat paired with a red and black plaid scarf casually draped over her shoulders. The scarf's texture and color appear especially vivid in the warm light. Her posture is naturally relaxed, slightly turned toward the camera, hands seemingly hidden in collars or pockets. The overall look is simple yet refined, with blurry fields or open grasslands in the background, faint hill outlines and hazy skies visible in the distance. The sky is dyed by the sunset in a soft golden yellow to pale pink gradient, with halos pouring down from the top of the canvas forming a soft halo effect above the figures' heads. The foreground features delicate bokeh blur, with faint outlines of a few wildflowers or grass leaves, but the soft focus renders them almost transparent, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The middle ground is a clear area about one meter around the main figure, with rich layers of light and shadow. On the right side is the Japanese title \"She Satsutsu ni Naraba ba\" is elegantly arranged in handwritten vertical script, with the actor Takeru Satoh below. Masami Nagasawa, Nana Mori, and production information: the bottom shows the release date \"2024 3.22 Fri. Roadshow,\" with the English title \"April, Come She Will\" on the left side spanning the screen in slender pink handwriting. In the upper right, a Japanese slogan \"それでもdecorative characterをする\" is arranged vertically. The entire image uses minimalist composition, with the figures centered to the left, maintaining a stable visual focus, and using shallow depth of field to create a strong sense of spatial front and back. Slowly moving to the details of the text, the light and shadow atmosphere is filled with the romance and nostalgia of a spring evening. Warm gold tones dominate the image, complemented by a touch of cool gray-blue tones for balance, creating a calm, gentle, and slightly melancholic mood. The overall image resembles a film photo taken with amateur equipment, featuring slight noise and vintage graininess, with faded edges. The color saturation is moderate yet layered, presenting an artistic beauty reminiscent of a movie poster, while retaining the natural imperfections and warmth of real photography, conveying a sense of youth, Themes of love and the changing of seasons.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
