        {
          "id": "krea2-2ed7efc8ed6269033c28a04b",
          "alias": "单女门微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilts her head, looking directly at the camera with a playful and gentle smile, glistening healthily under soft light. The delicate texture of the plush material is clearly visible up close, with each strand showing subtle layers due to light reflection. The folds at the collar and cuffs naturally stack, enhancing the true texture of the garment; The middle frame extends to both sides of her body and the background transition, where some arm lines are soft, and the outlines of the clothes appear somewhat three-dimensional under the light and shadow. The background is a minimalist, modern indoor environment. The light gray walls and white door or window frames form a clean and crisp geometric structure. The wall surface is smooth but has slight reflections or water stains, suggesting it may have just weathered rain or dampness. The right door frame edge lets in soft natural light, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. At the same time, natural shadows are created around the neck and clothing folds, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall color scheme leans toward a creamy white and gray tone that blends warm and cool tones, highlighting the warmth of plush materials and the calm contrast of the background space, creating a comfortable, healing, relaxed, childlike atmosphere full of childlike fun and life, as if capturing a lazy afternoon or a private moment after rain. Combining the intimacy of daily life with the delicate beauty of artistic photography, the image texture closely resembles the real graininess and slight noise of amateur equipment, preserving natural color transitions and light and shadow changes, avoiding perfection caused by excessive post-processing, allowing viewers to experience authentic, warm, and emotionally resonant images.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
