        {
          "id": "krea2-ce63ed70c5265f774a988276",
          "alias": "单女衬衫城市愤怒",
          "prompt": "The shirt cuffs feature classic blue and white stripes, paired with a delicate black high-waisted mini skirt that drapes naturally, accentuating her body proportions. On her left wrist, she wears a simple white watch strap, while on her right wrist a slender gold bracelet. The overall look combines sporty energy with urban sophistication. The foreground focuses on the details of her upper body and hands, while the background is blurred, faintly revealing marble-textured walls, embedded warm light strips, metal vents, and several beige fabric sofa chairs. The floor is paved with black-and-white geometric tiles that reflect soft indoor lighting. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the body slightly tilted to the right, creating dynamic balance; The visual guide line extends from her arms upward to the hairpin, creating a warm and soft light and shadow atmosphere. Indirect light from the top and sides evenly casts light, creating natural transitions of reflection and shadow on the floor and walls, creating a comfortable, relaxed, and slightly lifelike indoor atmosphere. It seems to capture a natural moment during a brief rest or preparation for an outing. The image is full of everyday realism and subtle beauty, with sharp color contrasts that are not glaring, with the three tones of red, white, and black harmoniously united. Overall, it presents a natural and authentic style that combines professional photography quality with amateur equipment, conveying a tone of youthfulness, vitality, and relaxed joy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
