        {
          "id": "krea2-07f900daf6fae13c280ea0b3",
          "alias": "单女短裙小巷困倦站立持灯",
          "prompt": "In an ancient-style stone-paved alley gently bathed in warm orange lanterns, a woman dressed in traditional Hanfu stands sideways at the center right of the painting. Inside the lantern, a soft glow shone through, its surface painted with elegant ink-colored patterns on withered branches, like a moon imbued with life and stories. As her body tilted slightly, the hem of her skirt was gently lifted by an invisible breeze, trailing smooth and rhythmic arcs across the damp ground. The red and black interwoven dress created rich layers amid the interplay of light and shadow. The cuffs were embroidered with classical meander patterns, and the belt was tight yet her figure was completely unrestrained. Instead, it adds a touch of Eastern charm that blends softness and strength; In the foreground is a damp blue brick pavement, reflecting lanterns hanging above and the silhouettes of women, with water stains shimmering with tiny light. In the middle is the winding alleys on both sides, where wooden eaves and weathered old walls appear and disappear in the hazy background. Several strings of red lanterns hang down from the eaves—some clearly visible, others blurred by depth of field as warm patches of light, creating a sense of depth and historical depth; In the background, the outline of a dense, sturdy old tree casts a huge silhouette in the night. The branches resemble ancient palms reaching toward the sky, creating a contrast with the warm light of lanterns, while also enhancing the spatial layers and mysterious atmosphere of the painting. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking perspective, making the figures appear more upright and sacred. The lantern is placed as the visual focal point in the lower left of the frame, extending to the distant sky and treetops; The light mainly comes from the diffuse glow of lanterns and the warm glow of streetlights. The overall color scheme is dominated by amber red, dark gold, and ink black, creating a dreamy atmosphere of dusk or early night. The shadows are soft but not harsh, blending classical poetry with modern photographic aesthetics. It combines the blank space reminiscent of ink painting with the unique grainy texture and color saturation characteristic of film cameras, like a scroll slowly unfolding from the past, carrying humid air, a faint sandalwood scent, and faint distant sounds of silk and bamboo instruments, immersing viewers in the scene. Feel the subtlety, elegance, and time-contemplation power found in Eastern aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
