        {
          "id": "krea2-5f96af57573475fa31b4afc5",
          "alias": "单女白内衣客厅忧伤倚靠戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges lazily on a white leather sofa, dressed in simple white lingerie and loose army green work pants, wearing white wired headphones. Her left hand gently holds a vintage silver mini camera, as if ready to capture a moment. She leans back slightly, rests her right leg on the armrest of the sofa, her posture relaxed yet full of storytelling; In the foreground, a small brown-and-black short-haired dog sits upright, surrounded by a plush teddy bear, adding a touch of warmth to everyday life; The middle ground features geometric lines formed by the sofa and the black-and-white grid tiles on the floor. Sunlight streams in diagonally through the right window, casting clear light and shadow on the floor, illuminating the puppy and parts of the sofa's edge, creating a contrast of light and shadow; In the background is a light blue wall with several blurred decorative frames hanging from it. In the corner stands a transparent glass fish tank, inside which you can faintly see aquatic plants and swimming fish. Further away, half-drawn white curtains let in soft daylight outside, filling the space with a private and peaceful sense of home. The composition uses a slightly low-angle overhead shot, making the characters appear more three-dimensional and present, while the puppy is positioned slightly to the right below the frame to create a visual balance, creating a stable yet slightly dynamic structure in the image; The visual guide line is formed by light streaming in from outside the window, the curved contour of the sofa, and the dog's head raised posture, forming a focal point of emotion and narrative; The lighting and shadow atmosphere strongly evoke the texture of Japanese film films, with an overall cool blue-green tone. However, areas illuminated by the warm sun appear creamy soft gold, creating a visual layer of intertwined warmth and coolness. The shadowed areas are deep yet not oppressive, giving the image a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly melancholic mood. The air seems to carry unspoken secrets and gentle loneliness. The text \"YOU ARE THE ONLY ONE WHO SAW MY YESTERDAY\" is overlaid in bold white font on the left side of the frame, with a dialog-style English verse at the bottom, using delicate language to reinforce the character's inner monologue and emotional expression. The entire image exudes a private mood of a city youth immersed alone in music, memories, and pet companionship in the afternoon. It combines the exquisite composition and emotional rendering of artistic photography with the authentic, casual, unadorned atmosphere of everyday life. Like snapshots casually taken with an old digital camera in the living room at home, carefully processed with color grading and text layout, presenting a unique aesthetic style that lies between commercial blockbusters and amateur creation, evoking a moment when time stands still— It is a yesterday only you can understand, and a world exclusive to each other.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
