        {
          "id": "krea2-d7e253b8e9b669a0ed593cd0",
          "alias": "单女兔女郎束身衣酒吧困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a luxurious bunny girl outfit stands at the center of the frame, exuding a charming aura that is both playful and noble; She wore a corset-style one-piece swimsuit with a black base fabric densely adorned with intricate and luxurious golden Baroque embroidery and beads. The heart-shaped area on the chest was set with numerous sparkling rhinestones, creating a strong visual focal point. The cloak is made of layers of fluffy feathers layered with transparent lace mesh, glowing softly under the light and swaying lightly with the body's posture, creating a dreamy, dynamic beauty; Wearing a pair of transparent thick-soled high-heeled sandals with black rubber heels, clearly showing the toe lines and foot contours, enhancing the fashionable and avant-garde feel of the overall look; The foreground focuses on her long, well-proportioned legs, with smooth and graceful leg lines, transitioning naturally from knees to ankles, and paired with high heels, her body proportions are even more prominent; The middle section fully presents her elegant posture and clothing details, including the three-dimensional relationships of her arms, torso, skirt hem, and head accessories; The background features a smooth, silver-gray reflective wall evenly distributed with tiny glitter particles, reflecting tiny glow like stardust under the lights, creating a subtle textured effect. In terms of lighting atmosphere, the main light source comes from the upper front position, softly and evenly illuminating the front of the figure. The metal and beaded decorations on the costume reflect bright highlights, contrasting with the cool reflections on the background wall; The shadowed areas are concentrated on the back of the body and the ground contact points, presenting a natural gradient transition without any stiff cuts; The overall atmosphere blends the sophistication of a haute couture fashion show, the passionate celebration of a nightclub party, and the dramatic tension of stage performances. Through the collision of black and gold colors and feather elements, it conveys a mysterious, sexy, yet elegant visual narrative, as if immersed in a grand performance or themed party that blends classical aristocratic aesthetics with modern pop culture. The entire scene is full of artistic expression and an immersive viewing experience, whether as a photographic masterpiece or a digital art creation. All demonstrate extremely high aesthetic value and visual impact.",
