        {
          "id": "krea2-617f8bb57fdda296e3958db7",
          "alias": "单女白外套商店愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car with her back to the camera, wearing a fluffy, thick creamy white plush hooded jacket. The fluffy texture at the cuffs and neckline looks soft and warm under natural light. The jacket hangs loosely and drapes, with the hem naturally folding on the seat as you sit, creating soft pleats and a sense of volume; She wears a light khaki baseball cap with a clear black \"BALENCIAGA\" logo on the front. The metal handles contrast sharply with the plastic panel materials, and the seatbelt is slanted across the waist, with details that are realistic. The background reveals the street scene through the front windshield, with the glass reflecting blurred architectural outlines and shop signs. In the distance, red fire hydrants and green construction fences can be seen. Street lights and natural light intertwine to create a daily urban atmosphere; The composition uses a slightly top-down rear view, placing the main subject slightly to the right center of the frame. The window frames naturally divide the space, guiding the gaze to focus on the characters' movements and clothing details; The visual guide extends from the direction of the figure holding the phone out the window, hinting at their immersion in the digital world; Light and shadow come from the high left window on the exterior, with soft daylight projected from the side, creating richly layered areas of light and dark on the plush coat surface. The shadows are soft and not glaring, while the roof and seat edges inside the cabin provide slight shadows, enhancing the depth of the space. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, embodying the daily laziness and fashionable attitude of modern urban youth. The color palette mainly consists of off-white, khaki, and black-gray, accented with blue phone cases, creating restrained yet layered colors; The visual texture leans toward a realistic life documentary style, reminiscent of the slight noise and natural distortion seen in ordinary smartphone shots, rather than professional studio effects. It conveys a casual, inadvertently captured beauty of real moments, combining the casual street trend with the artistic expression of refined styling, like an undefined narrative fragment waiting for viewers to interpret its emotions and stories.",
