        {
          "id": "krea2-18bca4de0effedc59fe7539a",
          "alias": "单女红T恤床困倦站立",
          "prompt": "Underneath, she wore a bright red camisole embroidered with a simple and elegant heart-shaped pattern outlining silver threads. She paired a delicate floral long dress with a faint hem, giving the outfit layers layers yet a sense of style; In the foreground, several graceful green plants and a few blooming orange-yellow flowers are delicate. The petals are light and the leaf veins are clear, glistening softly under warm light. On the right, a cluster of flower branches extends diagonally toward the bottom of the composition, forming a visual guiding line; In the middle is the pink bedsheet or drape she stands on, with natural folds on the surface, soft as clouds, and a faint warm sheen, harmonizing with the tone of her clothing; The background features a hazy decorative wall covered with blurred floral and geometric wallpaper, mainly in a pink-purple gradient. Above, a slanted glass window structure filters in cool purple beams, contrasting with the warm indoor light. In the distance, faint outlines of other plants and furniture can be seen; The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side for light and plants to extend for a visually asymmetrical yet balanced visual effect. The camera angles slightly upward to enhance the character's softness and nobility; From the perspective of the viewer, it extends to the light and shadow area in the upper right corner of the frame, guiding the audience to immerse their emotions alongside the characters; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and dreamy. The main light source comes from the front left of the figure, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. Meanwhile, a cool-colored light spot in the right background penetrates to create a sense of transparency. The overall color palette is mainly pink, purple, red, and off-white, with moderate saturation, creating a quiet and romantic atmosphere like afternoon sunlight streaming through the curtains. The visuals are full of gentle healing and an art film quality, like a page from a private diary, with a strong sense of realism and life like everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich but not cluttered. Every light and color tells a story of love and tranquility.",
