        {
          "id": "krea2-5965657d7ae1c84561898c24",
          "alias": "单女棕外套门倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against a vintage carved wooden door, wearing a fluffy, luxurious light brown faux fur coat with fine, soft fur that drapes like clouds. The naturally curled edges glow warmly under soft light, and she wears a silky deep brown satin mini skirt underneath, outlining a long, curvaceous figure. Warm yellow light pours down from the ceiling track lights and chandeliers, creating soft light and shadow transitions between the wooden floor and walls. The walls are decorated with vertical striped wallpaper and classical oil paintings. A large painting depicting a figure hangs on the right wall, with wine bottles faintly displayed inside a glass cabinet. Behind the bar in the distance, a wine rack and an Apple logo display are placed. On the left, through the glass door, you can see a metal-framed chair and a geometric carpet. The overall environment is filled with a sense of sophistication and artistic flair. The composition uses a slightly low-angle perspective to make the figures appear more upright and noble. The light mainly comes from the upper right, creating three-dimensional shadows and soft reflections. The atmosphere is tranquil, luxurious, and lazy, with a refined feel reminiscent of a fashion magazine cover. The whole scene looks like a professional camera shot in the warm afternoon, capturing a city woman's composure and self-expression in her private space. The tones lean toward warm yellow and earthy brown tones, emphasizing material contrast and spatial layering. It feels as if you are at the entrance of a boutique café or private club, waiting to be discovered with a natural and effortless posture, showcasing a sophisticated taste and independent temperament that reveal something subtle in everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
