        {
          "id": "krea2-83f5fc8372a03a731059d34a",
          "alias": "单女警服城市困倦跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate anime-style police uniform kneels by the window of a modern urban skyscraper, her posture elegant and full of tension. She slightly turns to the side, gazing back at the camera. Her blue police cap is adorned with a gold badge and red circular decorations. The epaulets feature cartoon rabbit patterns, with fine buttons and dark ties visible at the collar. The light blue uniform jacket is tailored and fitting, paired with a high-waisted black pencil skirt that highlights her long legs. Her legs are dressed in sheer black stockings and a pair of pointed black high heels. Her right knee is kneeling with her left knee slightly bent. The body leans forward in a graceful arc. The right hand wears a white glove and grips a silver-gray-blue plastic toy firearm prop. The left hand gently rests on the edge of the windowsill, with a faint black wristband visible on the wrist. Outside the window is a soft-focused city skyline, with skyscrapers indistinctly outlined and a bright pale blue hue. Light pours in through the large windows, casting clear shadows on the floor tiles. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, and the composition uses a low-angle downward angle to enhance the figure's uprightness and presence. The foreground features smooth, reflective light-colored tiles and window sills, while the middle ground features the character's entire body and some of the buildings outside the window as a blurred background. The visual guide line extends from the character's knees and arms to the toy gun in their hand, forming a natural focal point. The overall lighting is soft and warm, with natural light from outside the window as the main light source, complemented by indoor lighting on the side to create subtle shadow layers. The atmosphere combines the dreamy feel of anime and anime with the cold aura of real cities. The image texture is delicate and realistic, with moderate color saturation, and features slight film graininess and slight noise, as if shot with amateur equipment, yet with professional-grade post-production color grading, the overall visual narrative is both everyday and full of dramatic tension. The characters' expressions are naturally relaxed yet the character settings are precisely portrayed, creating a wonderful atmosphere immersed in virtual role-play in a real space.",
