        {
          "id": "krea2-f96446cdf9cff1282b6edc39",
          "alias": "单女围巾广场温柔站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a modern-style large stadium plaza, wearing a blue and yellow football team jersey, paired with a thick scarf adorned with the team's badge and tassel decorations in the same color, and a beige long skirt. The overall look is full of youthful energy and the passionate spirit unique to fans; In the foreground is the open plaza paved with reddish-brown bricks where she stands. The bricks are neatly arranged but show slight signs of wear, and scattered white scraps of paper or debris on the ground, suggesting the frequent foot traffic and authentic sense of everyday life. In the middle shot, several passersby with blurred strokes are seen walking or stopping to chat. Some carry backpacks, some carry shopping bags, and some look down at their phones. They wear everyday clothes such as black coats, jeans, and sneakers, each with distinct movements that together create dynamic layers of the background crowd, adding a social atmosphere and spatial depth to the scene. The background is the stadium's massive concrete structure, whose multi-tiered stepped stands feature a strong futuristic industrial aesthetic. The rugged lines and exposed steel frames create a strong geometric contrast under the clear sky, with distant hills faintly visible on the skyline, and the sky appears pale blue and cloudless, with soft and even lighting; The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical main figure, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition. The camera slightly tilts up to enhance the character's presence and architectural pressure, while using a wide-angle perspective to capture the vast square space and architectural mass, creating a grand and intimate visual tension; Ultimately focusing on the structural details of the building's rooftop; In terms of lighting and atmosphere, sunlight slants in from the front left of the figure, casting clear and slightly sharp shadows on the right side of the body, enhancing the sense of depth and authenticity. The overall tone is warm and moderately saturated, presenting a peaceful and warm mood under the afternoon sun; The entire image exudes a daily atmosphere that combines sports passion with youthful romance. It features professional-level refined composition and color control, while retaining the slight noise, natural exposure transitions, and real-world noise typical of amateur equipment shooting. It feels like ordinary fans casually capturing moments on game or training days. It neither deliberately pursues perfect commercial vibes nor sacrifices emotional warmth and artistic depth, allowing people to feel the unique sense of ritual and belonging embedded in ordinary life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
