        {
          "id": "krea2-f76fb671f73fbb9fe4301d93",
          "alias": "单女和服竹林微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Japanese kimono sits quietly atop rustic stone steps. The kimono is pure white, with a wide bright red belt tied around her waist. The sleeves and skirt edges are adorned with delicate dark red embroidery patterns that wind like vines, adding an elegant touch of Eastern aesthetics. She leans barefoot lightly on the stone steps, her posture leisurely and poetic. Her left hand rests naturally at her knee, while her right hand is elegantly raised, fingertips slightly raised, as if lightly touching bamboo leaves falling from above or facing the breeze. Her serene expression reveals a hint of contemplation and longing, with a subtle smile that conveys a Zen atmosphere that transcends the mundane world and converses with nature. The texture is rough yet rich in historical depth, forming a strong contrast with the gentle and elegant clothing of women. On a small wooden tray beside her sat a simple set of white ceramic wine sets—a slender-necked wine bottle and a small wine glass. The slightly tilted rim hinted at the moment of just finishing or about to raise one, adding a touch of life and ritual. The background is a dark brown old-fashioned wooden wall, with clearly visible wood grain. Above it are traditional lattice window latticework, partially covered by dense bamboo vines. Bamboo leaves sway gracefully in the faint light, casting mottled shadows through the gaps, creating a deep and tranquil spatial layer. The entire composition uses an almost vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, leaving a large dark space on the right to enhance the sense of loneliness and mystery, while guiding the gaze upward to the junction between the bamboo leaves and the sky. By blurring background details through shallow depth of field, the main subject stands out more. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, soft and slightly dim, typical of scattered light in the evening or cloudy days, especially creating highlights around the belt and cuffs, highlighting the contrast between material and color. The overall color palette leans toward cool gray and brown, with only obi red and kimono embroidered red as visual anchors, bursting with vitality and emotional tension in a oppressive environment. The atmosphere is tranquil and distant, infused with strong Japanese courtyard aesthetics and wabi-sabi style. It combines the restrained and reserved beauty of the classical East with the precise capture of mood and artistic conception by modern photography, like a poetic realm of blank spaces in a long ink scroll, immersing visitors in a moment of tranquility where time flows slowly. Although the visuals are not professional studio works, the composition is rigorous, the light and shadow are delicate, and the atmosphere is rich, presenting an effect of amateur equipment shooting with great artistic depth and narrative feel. It feels like a literary moment encountered on the streets and alleys, yet carefully refined and infused with emotion, evoking a deep resonance in viewers of Eastern philosophy, natural harmony, and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
