        {
          "id": "krea2-3e071d2032ca5036837d3f92",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服愤怒倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black graduation gown, wearing a graduation cap adorned with pink roses and white flowers, with delicate embroidery adorning the brim. She slightly turned to glance back, revealing her white, neat teeth, some gently illuminated by sunlight, radiating youthful vitality; Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of pale pink and white flowers. The flowers are delicate and dripping, the green leaves create a fresh contrast, and the bouquet hangs naturally in the lower right corner of the frame, creating a soft visual balance with the figure's posture; The pink and white patterns appear faintly in the light, and the tassels hanging from the sleeves sway gently in the breeze, adding a touch of vitality; In the middle shot, she wears a black bachelor's robe that is wide and loose, with a delicate texture of fabric. Under natural light, it shows subtle folds and transitions of light and shadow, with the edges of the robe and the bouquet forming a color contrast yet harmoniously unified; The background is a blurred outdoor green plant, with layered leaves transformed into a hazy emerald patch of light under shallow depth of field, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. In the distance, faint shadows of trees create a soft halo, as if the whole world is making way for this tranquil moment; The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, creating a natural pull along the visual flow; The camera angle tilts slightly upward, making the characters more approachable and sacred, while also enhancing the solemnity and joy of the graduation moment; Light comes from the natural daylight in the upper left, soft but not glaring, forming a warm golden highlight, while shadows softly wrap around the folds of the robe, outlining a three-dimensional silhouette; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of hope, combining the ritual and commemorative spirit of graduation season with a touch of sweetness and romance. The color palette is dominated by black, pink, and green, with just the right balance of warmth and coolness, creating an artistic beauty that is both solemn and warm. The visual style leans toward the realism and life atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment, rich in details without clutter, with moderate color saturation, preserving authentic textures and light and shadow changes in the natural environment, allowing viewers to feel an unfiltered yet highly infectious emotional expression, as if capturing a precious moment of growth, dreams, and a beautiful future.",
