        {
          "id": "krea2-c285ce6147ad235d40f1606d",
          "alias": "单女泳装摄影棚冷淡蹲拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman squats half-squatting, leaning against the edge of a slightly worn blue wooden picnic table. She wears a bikini with fine stripes alternating light green and white, the crossed straps on the back outlining soft curves, and the full and natural curves of her hips hugging the wooden plank. Her body turns slightly to the side, and she gently lifts her head to look back at the camera, adding a touch of casualness and authenticity. Her left hand rests gently on the edge of the table, while her right hand naturally rests at her knee, creating an overall posture that is both relaxed and full of tension, showcasing an unrefined everyday beauty. The foreground focuses on her exposed shoulders, back, waist, hips, and leg lines, presenting warm tones under soft light, with the folds and skin textures clearly visible, creating a strong sense of visual depth. In the middle is a blue bench worn down by time, with mottled paint revealing the natural color of the wood. The gaps between the wooden boards are mixed with traces of fine sand and sea breeze. The tilt forms a dynamic balance with the figure's body, forming a solid supporting structure for the painting. The background features a blurred beach and sparse greenery, with distinct grains of sand. In the distance, a few low shrubs can be faintly seen. The composition adopts a slightly top-down angle, capturing the character's outline from the side. The bench's diagonal lines guide the gaze upward to the right, giving the composition a sense of flow and breathing. The figure's center of gravity shifts to the right, but the head turns to create a subtle asymmetrical aesthetic. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, as if afternoon sunlight filters through the clouds, with light shining from the front left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow between her back and hips. The shadowed areas aren't stiff but naturally blend into the skin's texture, enhancing the sense of dimension. At the same time, the background area has a slight backlighting effect, giving the edges of the sand and plant outlines a slight highlight, enhancing the layering of the image. The overall atmosphere combines the leisure of a summer beach with the tranquility of a private space, featuring studio-like exquisite lighting control while retaining the natural feel and lifestyle characteristic of amateur equipment shooting. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, with the characters immersed in their own worlds, yet silently resonating emotionally with the viewer. The contrast of warm and cool is harmonious and unified; the blue bench resembles a calm geometric line cutting through the scene, while the warm tones of the figures' skin become the visual focal point, creating a visual experience that is both fresh and slightly sexy, conveying a free, pure, and nature-centered attitude toward life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
