        {
          "id": "krea2-23961d79054b2c55ecfa4da6",
          "alias": "单女庭院沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone in a wooden room filled with traditional Japanese atmosphere, dressed in loose, comfortable white cotton loungewear. The fabric is light and soft, subtly revealing the texture of her skin under natural light. The hem and cuffs drape naturally, with soft lines. She sits barefoot cross-legged on the deep brown wooden floor, her toes slender, her posture relaxed and slightly contemplative, holding a pale yellow toothbrush in both hands, as if pondering something or immersing herself in a moment of tranquility. In the foreground are her bare feet and calves, with clearly visible ankles and toes. On the left floor, several pairs of pristine white slippers are casually placed, suggesting this is a private, everyday living space. In the middle of the frame, her curled body and white clothing form the visual focal point. Light slants through the large window on the right into the room, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The window frame is divided by dark wood strips into several rectangular grids, and outside, a lush courtyard and blurred tree shadows can be faintly seen. Through the glass, dappled light and shadows are reflected, adding a tranquil poetic charm to the scene. In the background is a wooden door leading to a deep corridor, with the space behind the door blurred, leaving only hazy green light spots and wooden structures, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition uses a slightly tilted low-angle shot to make the subjects appear more authentic and natural, while window frames are used as natural frames to envelop the subject, enhancing the warm atmosphere of being \"surrounded by sunlight.\" The visual guide line is composed of the edge of the window frame, the curves of the figure's body, and the arrangement of slippers on the floor, leading viewers into her inner world of thought. The overall lighting is soft and warm, with the main light source coming from the upper right, creating a side backlight effect. At the same time, delicate shadows are cast on the floor and the folds of clothing, enhancing the sense of depth. The atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and tinged with a subtle sense of nostalgia, like afternoon sunlight streaming into a corner of an old house, where time seems to stand still, presenting a poetic beauty that unintentionally reveals in everyday life. The image tones are mainly warm brown, off-white, and dark green, with low saturation, presenting the grainy texture and slight fading characteristic of film cameras. It feels like capturing real moments casually under natural light with an old digital camera or phone. It combines the refined composition of artistic photography with the casual and everyday atmosphere of amateur equipment, allowing people to feel the gentleness and tranquility of ordinary days.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
