        {
          "id": "krea2-f739c412ccc06fce8d64a27f",
          "alias": "单女白制服乡村沉思站立手持物",
          "prompt": "One stands outdoors under the sunlight, wearing a classic white sailor uniform with deep blue double-striped trim on the collar, a bright red silk bow tied at the chest, and the ends of the ribbon naturally hanging down, creating a soft visual focal point. Her hands were raised above her head, her posture natural and vivid, showcasing everyday moments of youthful campus life. With a hint of shyness and contemplation, it presents a warm texture under natural light. The foreground focuses on her upper body and arm movements, with raised hands forming graceful curves that create a dynamic balance with her slightly forward-leaning body. In the middle shot, you can see the blurry outlines of her surroundings, including distant mottled tree shadows, faint corners of wooden eaves, and scattered dead leaves and grass on the ground, creating an authentic atmosphere like a campus or countryside courtyard. The entire composition uses medium to close shots, with the main subject positioned slightly to the center, leaving ample blank space to highlight the emotional expression of the characters. At the same time, the red bow tie serves as a color anchor, creating a strong contrast against the white base. The light and shadow atmosphere is filled with the soft natural light of a daytime afternoon, with even yet layered lighting. The highlights are bright and transparent, shadows transition naturally, and the overall tone leans toward a fresh and elegant film style with a slight grainy texture, simulating the noise aesthetics of vintage digital cameras or mobile phones, giving the image a genuine and nostalgic emotional warmth. The atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, carrying the hazy atmosphere unique to adolescence and subtle emotions of self-exploration, as if frozen on an afternoon after school, undisturbed by anyone. It carries the innocence of campus youth while also subtly expressing a faint longing for growth and the future. Overall, it presents a documentary beauty reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting—not pursuing perfect composition, but making it more artistically appealing through genuine emotions and natural light and shadow.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
