        {
          "id": "krea2-00fc309653a99f42898018df",
          "alias": "单女绿牛仔浴室沉思坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways at the edge of a pristine white bathroom sink, her body slightly leaning forward. Her right hand firmly holds a black smartphone and takes a selfie in the mirror. The phone camera is clearly visible, and she is focused on her reflection on the screen. Her expression is calm yet slightly contemplative, with delicate but not heavy makeup. She wears an off-white fitted long-sleeve top that outlines a slender waistline, paired with army green high-waisted jeans. The pants are slimming and fitting, with a full and prominent hip line. The overall look is simple, modern, and full of everyday beauty. In the foreground is the smooth, white surface of the washbasin and the visual focal point formed by her legs and hips; the middle is the core of the image, composed of her body, phone, and mirror reflections; the background features light gray tiled walls and dark brown wooden doors that create a warm and cool contrast. On the right wall corner, a silver metal tissue rack is installed, with a faint glimpse of stacks of white towels below. On the left, the shower room's transparent glass door frame and silver handle are visible. The compact and practical layout embodies the typical features of modern hotel or apartment bathrooms. The composition is shot at a slightly upward-angled angle, with the figure occupying the center-left position, naturally directing the gaze toward the phone screen at the upper right. The mirror also uses reflections to extend the visual space, creating a rich sense of depth. The visual guide naturally extends from the character's arm holding the phone to the mirror reflection area, then the vertical lines on the background door panel enhance stability. The lighting atmosphere presents a soft, evenly diffused indoor light, with light from the top or side sources. This creates subtle transitions of highlights and shadows on the character's skin, clothing textures, and mirror reflections, without strong contrast, creating a quiet and intimate everyday atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly neutral gray, off-white, and army green, harmoniously unified. It retains the texture of real life scenes while embodying the refinement of artistic photography, as if capturing an ordinary yet self-aware moment. It evokes the individual's attention and expression of self-image in modern urban life. The entire image is shot with a regular phone but possesses professional-level compositional thinking, combining documentary quality with aesthetic tension, presenting a low-key, restrained yet vibrant contemporary women's daily imaging style.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
