        {
          "id": "krea2-15aaaf910fb0233b744970d0",
          "alias": "单女短裙冷淡奔跑手持物",
          "prompt": "Her hands were gracefully moved: her right hand gently pressed the strings, her left hand slowly plucking, her fingers slender and long, skin fair and delicate, her robes flowing like clouds, and the hem of her skirt tinged with pale pink and light blue ink floral patterns. The body naturally stretches out with posture, the layers of fabric shimmering softly under the light, presenting a silky texture and flow. The pipa's wood grain is clearly visible, its color warm and rustic, and the body is full in the shape of a pear. The neck is inlaid with exquisite mother-of-pearl decorations, the strings are taut, the pegs are made of dark brown wood, edged with white trim, and the headstock slightly raised. The overall shape is elegant and dignified, full of classical charm. The background is a dense, deep green forest with interwoven branches and leaves, and light filters through the canopy casting dappled shadows. This creates a soft, hazy blur effect, creating a tranquil and deep atmosphere. The composition uses medium to near and close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the pipa slanting across the chest, occupying the visual center, then extending to the upper right to the pipa's head, creating a natural and smooth visual flow. The overall color tone of the painting is mainly cool, with teal tones running throughout, soft and evenly distributed light and shadow. The main light source comes from the front side, outlining the character's outline and the folds of clothing, while creating a contrast of light and shadow in the background, enhancing spatial depth and creating a tranquil and far-reaching atmosphere. It carries the poetic beauty of Eastern classical art, as if time has frozen in this moment, with only the sound of the zither quietly flowing through the forest. The entire composition exudes an artistic atmosphere that transcends the mundane world and is ethereal and beautiful—like a meticulously colored ancient painting or a moment captured by a movie lens. It combines the realism of everyday photography with the refined aesthetics of professional imagery. The details are meticulously detailed, from instrument materials to the expressions of the characters, all reflecting a high level of artistic expression and emotional tension.",
          "description": "",
