        {
          "id": "krea2-f174a5575f4b5ad13f753067",
          "alias": "单女制服沙发害羞倚靠",
          "prompt": "A female student dressed in a classic Japanese school uniform: a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue pleated skirt, a black bow tie at the collar, and a pair of slim brown-rimmed glasses. Her expression is slightly shy or thoughtful, her hands gently lifting the hem of her skirt, her posture natural relaxed yet tinged with a hint of unintentional teasing, as if tidying clothes or avoiding the camera, revealing the subtle emotions and body language unique to youth; The foreground focuses on her lower body and hand movements, with the skirt gently lifting to reveal the lines of her long legs, with soft light and shadow outlining her leg contours; The center frame shows her complete upper body and arms, with neatly arranged shirt buttons, clearly visible fabric texture, subtle brand logo on the cuffs, and a black bow tie creating a strong visual contrast over the white shirt; The background is a cozy indoor environment, with a brown fabric sofa behind it. The sofa's backrest is simple, with natural folds along the edges. Behind the sofa is a large wooden window frame, with greenery faintly visible outside. Light streams through the window panes, creating soft, diffused glows, and the window frame lines guide the viewer to focus on the subject. The composition uses medium to near and close shots, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. The window frame serves as a natural frame to enhance the sense of layering, while the plants in the background and the scenery outside the window create spatial depth, creating a semi-open atmosphere; Drawing viewers' attention to the interaction area between the legs and the hem of the skirt, forming a complete emotional flow pathway; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with a slight shadow on the left side enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme leans toward a transition between warm brown and light gray, creating a lazy and tranquil afternoon home atmosphere. It has a slight film grain texture, as if shot with an old digital camera or entry-level DSLR. There is slight noise and color overflow at the edges of the frame, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The overall style combines the casual nature of everyday photography with the refinement of artistic portraiture, conveying the sensitive, reserved, and vibrant emotional state of adolescence. Capture a moment of privacy and innocence in a tranquil environment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
