          "id": "krea2-a7baa6c34cfa0f71963b1fa5",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫雪地困倦过肩",
          "prompt": "In a dreamy and warm night scene image, a woman is the subject of the painting, naturally draped over her shoulders, glowing with a healthy glow under the warm light, as if immersed in falling snowflakes. Her right hand is gently raised, palm facing upward, as if catching or feeling the light drifting snowflakes from the sky, her posture gentle and poetic. She wore a delicately textured off-white turtleneck knit sweater, with clearly visible cuffs and body textures. Under the warm light, the garment displayed a soft creamy tone, creating a visually harmonious tone with the surrounding environment. In the foreground, a cluster of pine branches covered with artificial snow is displayed. The needles are densely green, with sparkling snow particles scattered on the surface. A few warm yellow string lights shine through the branches, creating a sense of depth and festive atmosphere up close, while cleverly framing the figure's right shoulder and arm to form a visual guiding path. The central area consists of several beautifully decorated Christmas trees, their canopies covered with dense golden bulbs. After the lights are blurred, they form dreamy circular light spots that layer upon layer encircle the figures. In the background, a large carousel structure can be faintly seen, its ornate carved frame outlined by warm yellow lighting, its misty outline. The top extends with cloud-like ornaments, also covered with artificial snow. The overall composition is distributed diagonally, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the painting. The distant view is the city night sky, with deep blue ink mixed with scattered urban architectural silhouettes and neon signboard afterimages. Above, fine snowflakes continuously drift, forming dynamic vertical lines that infuse static images with flowing vitality. The entire image is composed with shallow depth of field, with background elements treated with soft focus to create a \"creamy\" hazy beauty. The use of light and shadow is highly layered: warm yellow light from the Christmas tree and carousel shines from the sides and back, while the background sky is in a cool, dark area that sharply contrasts with the foreground warm light, creating a strong temperature contrast and emotional tension. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, with a strong sense of fairy tale and festive ritual, as if you are on a winter night shrouded in magic. The air is filled with the scent of candy and cedar. The colors are mainly warm gold, cream white, dark green, and deep blue, with moderate saturation, realistic grainy texture and slight color shifts reminiscent of film cameras. The edges of the frame have a slight soft-focus blend, simulating the nostalgic aesthetic of old film and conveying a sense of tranquility, innocence, and a touch of melancholy romance, reminiscent of winter fairy tales. Silently embracing their own beautiful moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
