        {
          "id": "krea2-7da3adf27e709129ce46f005",
          "alias": "单女粉外套街道微笑坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a taxi on the streets of Tokyo, wearing a fluffy, soft, and richly textured pink long-plush coat. The coat's fur is fine and layered, shining warmly under soft indoor lighting, forming a sharp contrast with the black beret she wears. The edge of the hat is slightly curved, and the triple camera lens on the back of her phone is clearly visible. Her fingers are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, and she is focused on taking selfies or recording videos in front of the mirror, wearing a playful and satisfied smile. In the foreground, her arms and coat occupy the center of the frame, with the plush texture magnified in the foreground, each strand clearly visible, creating a strong tactile sensation and visual focal point; The middle ground shows the city street reflected through the car window glass. Outside, neon signs flash with the green \"MOS BURGER\" sign and large red letters. Pedestrians hurry through the street, blurred silhouettes intertwined with flowing light and shadow, creating the bustle and vitality of the city's night; In the background, towering modern buildings rise into the clouds. Glass curtain walls reflect the afterglow of the sky and city lights, while distant traffic lights glow red, adding a cool industrial tone to the scene; The entire composition uses a slightly tilted, low-angle shot, extending outward from the inside of the car, cleverly blending the figures with the external environment to create a dialogue between the interior and exterior spaces; The visual guide naturally leads from her phone to the bustling street scene outside the window, then connects the spatial depth of the entire scene through reflections and reflections from the car window; The lighting atmosphere presents a warm atmosphere at dusk or dusk, with soft and even lighting inside the car, while outside, the cool glow of neon lights and the warm glow of sunset are mixed, creating a contrast of light and shadow, creating a cozy, romantic, and slightly lonely city traveler atmosphere; The overall visuals are rich in Japanese street fashion, combining the casual nature of daily life with artistically refined compositions, like a narrative image casually captured on a regular phone during travel. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and emotions are full, conveying a modern female aesthetic of seeking moments of tranquility and self-expression in the fast-paced city.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
