        {
          "id": "krea2-9d0e1e97f6e83dedfd9b4f25",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫舞台困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A female musician wears a loose off-white long-sleeved shirt with soft drapes, the cuffs naturally rolled up, presenting a relaxed and focused stage posture. Her left hand elegantly presses on the acoustic guitar fretboard, while her right hand hovers above the strings, ready to pluck or just finish a chord. The classical folk guitar has a warm cherry wood hue and a deep brown gradient lacquer. Under warm light, it reflects delicate wood grain and metallic frets. The body curves smoothly, the round sound holes are clearly visible, the microphone stand has a black metallic texture, and the slender stand firmly supports the microphone. A thin line extends from the microphone to the blurred equipment area at the bottom right of the screen, hinting at the realism of the live performance. The background is a pure and rich orange-red tone, like the twilight sky or the warm smoke cast by stage spotlights, with no distractions—only gradient colors to create a dreamy, immersive atmosphere. The entire composition uses a mid-to-low angle downward angle, placing the figure in the lower middle of the frame, leaving ample negative space at the top to enhance the sense of loneliness and sanctity. The visual guide line runs vertically through the center of the frame via a microphone rod, while the guitar extends diagonally to create a diagonal balance. The light and shadow treatment is highly dramatic, creating sharp contrasts of light and shadow, soft shadow transitions, and edges blending with film graininess. The overall atmosphere is filled with the texture of a vintage film movie. The color saturation is moderate but warm, with slight noise and color shifts, simulating the effects of old cameras On the right side of the image, the outlines of other instruments or the musician's silhouette can be faintly seen, but these are blurred to emphasize the protagonist's isolation and focus. The entire image exudes the private, gentle, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere unique to late-night Live House or independent music festival backstage, as if capturing a moment undisturbed by the noise, full of emotional resonance and storytelling. The image is full of breathing and a realistic tactile feel, like shooting with an old-fashioned digital camera in low-light conditions, preserving natural exposure noise and slight chromatic aberration. presenting a non-commercial, personalized visual aesthetic of the creator.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
