        {
          "id": "krea2-6b9f5a2379b46b98acf1722c",
          "alias": "单女街道俏皮自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman took a selfie in front of an indoor mirror, wearing a light blue Manchester City football club jersey with a clear \"CITY\" logo and team badge printed on the chest. The sleeves featured an inverted \"WAYS\" lettering. The fabric was soft and naturally pleated, reflecting the authenticity of everyday wear; Slightly curled, it shines with a warm luster under soft light; She held a pink phone case in her right hand, covered with cute cartoon animal stickers, and the camera module had a purple frame. The right background features a plain light gray wall, creating a clean yet lively space; The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the character occupying the center to the right, while the phone naturally blocks part of the line of sight to create an interesting visual guide, while a slight tilt creates a sense of dynamic balance. Light and shadow come from the soft light source on the left front, creating delicate transitions between light and dark, while the background area shows slight shadows, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and private, evoking the comfort of late-night home or lazy afternoon moments. The color palette mainly features light blue, pink, and warm brown, accented by metallic headstocks, presenting a real, friendly, and highly personalized lifestyle aesthetic. It feels like capturing an ordinary girl relaxing in her own room. It is both sweet and thoughtful, while also revealing a street-style attitude toward a love for football. The image texture closely resembles the real graininess and slight noise of amateur equipment, emphasizing a pure, non-commercial aesthetic for recording. rather than an overly refined, idealized image.",
