        {
          "id": "krea2-d04786b9a40f512a6019b98d",
          "alias": "单女外套市场困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "In the city's Christmas market at night, a woman is the absolute focal point, wearing a fluffy, soft white lambswool Chinese-style frog-button jacket. The collar and cuffs feature delicate plush edging, with black buttons accented throughout, creating a warm and vintage visual focal point; She paired a dark green A-line short skirt with light gray-white fine plaid patterns, with the hem naturally falling above the knees, revealing slender, long leg lines. She wore pure black over-the-knee socks at the ankles, combining sweetness with winter fashion vibes. Her expression is lively and natural, as if immersed in the joyful atmosphere of the holiday. Her body slightly turns to the side, arms spread wide in an embrace pose, her left hand gently rests on a Christmas tree trunk beside her decorated with warm yellow bulbs and red round ornaments, while her right hand hangs naturally at her side, her movements relaxed and relaxed, full of the spirit of everyday life. The foreground is composed of her unfolded body silhouette and the ground beneath her feet. The ground is a slightly damp, reflective gray cement floor that reflects the soft glow of surrounding lights, with a few fallen leaves faintly visible on it, adding a touch of seasonal and authentic touch. The center of the camera is occupied by a vibrant orange-red vintage sedan. The front end is rounded and retro, with chrome bumpers and round headlights glowing metallicly under warm light. The wheels are silver steel wheels paired with black tires. On the side, faintly blurred light and shadow mottles can be seen from the side, cleverly positioned to the left of the figure, creating visual balance and enhancing the sense of depth in the image. The background features a dreamy Christmas-themed decoration: on the left, dense golden circular light spots (known as the \"out-of-focus imaging\" effect) flow like a galaxy, creating a strong festive atmosphere and dreamy hazy atmosphere; On the right stands a huge red-and-white gift box-shaped building, with a smooth surface and small decorative lights dotted on top. In the distance, the silhouette of another tall Christmas tree appears faintly against the night sky, with the sky in deep indigo tones, hinting at dusk or early night. The composition uses a left-centered third-section layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the central axis. The gaze naturally flows toward the Christmas tree and the background buildings on the right, while the large bokeh on the left creates visual buffering and atmospheric effects, enhancing the prominence of the subject. The story then extends along her outstretched arm to the decorative details on the Christmas tree on the right, then traces back to the romantic background formed by the light spot on the left, and finally converged by the gift box architecture in the background, forming a circular narrative rhythm. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light sources come from the warm yellow string lights and building illumination in the background. The light is soft and even, shining from behind and from the sides, creating subtle transitions of light and shadow in the materiality of her clothing. The white coat surface reflects delicate halos, while the shadows transition naturally without obvious harsh shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm, dreamy, and full of fairy-tale quality. The color palette is dominated by warm yellow, complemented by the pure cool tone of the white coat, the intense contrast of the red car, and the calm accent of the green plaid skirt, creating rich and harmonious color layers. The visuals present an almost cinematic soft-focus aesthetic, with slight graininess and slight motion blur, simulating the real atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting. It emphasizes emotional expression rather than perfect technical performance, conveying a relaxed, free, and immersive festive joy, making viewers feel as if they are on a magical and warm winter night.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
