        {
          "id": "krea2-9b7706308d8a33dc90216a1e",
          "alias": "单女湿身外套忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the lakeshore, wearing a dark, thick coat paired with a coarse knit scarf, gazing into the camera as if immersed in some thought or emotion; Behind her is a shimmering wide lake, its surface reflecting intense sunlight, countless tiny white spots flickering in deep blue tones. In the distance, the blurred outline of the city and rolling mountains can be seen. The sky is a deep blue and cloudless, with three seagulls soaring freely in the air, each in a different posture, their wings spread, adding dynamism and vitality to the scene. The foreground features rough lakeside rocks with a grayish-white color, some areas soaked by water, with scattered fallen leaves or debris along the edges, enhancing the sense of realism in the natural environment; The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, with the figure positioned in the right two-thirds of the frame, occupying the visual focus. The lake and sky form a large area of blank space and extended space on the left, creating visual tension; The camera is slightly tilted to create an unstable yet emotionally charged atmosphere, while shallow depth of field rendering blurs the city and mountains in the background, highlighting the main character's presence; Light comes from the upper left, creating a dramatic contrast of light and shadow. Shadows fall on her neck and collar, enhancing the sense of depth. Meanwhile, reflections from the lake surface and the sky's highlights create a clash of warm and cool tones, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and slightly lonely. The film-like grainy noise and slight fading give the visuals a retro cinematic aesthetic. The visual guidance line is constructed from the flight trajectories of birds, ripples on the lake surface, and the gestures of figures raising their hands, which then spread throughout the entire natural scene; The color saturation is moderate, with main tones of deep blue, gray-black, and beige-brown, complemented by the pure white of seagulls and the bright blue of the sky, creating a calm, restrained yet poetic emotional tone. The entire image feels like it was taken in the afternoon with an old digital camera or film player, capturing the realism and emotional warmth of an amateur photographer. The details are rich yet never overshadowed; each frame feels like a frozen emotional moment in a story fragment, evoking thoughts of a lonely traveler, unspoken thoughts, or a brief pause during the changing seasons.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
