        {
          "id": "krea2-ddebe743d2436c84da4885f9",
          "alias": "单女山野忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways at a high point overlooking the ancient village, revealing a calm yet slightly melancholic contemplative expression. She wears a loose, simple white cotton top, made of soft fabric that fits her figure, with faint faint orange threads at the cuffs and neckline, adding a touch of everyday life. Her posture was relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning forward, as if immersed in the thoughts brought by the scenery before her. The fabric folds reveal delicate textures due to light and shadow changes, with the composition using medium to near shots close-ups, placing the figure in the right two-thirds of the frame, leaving a broad background space on the left to create visual balance, creating a sense of depth and spatial expansiveness. The central view features a traditional village building complex built along the mountain, with gray tiles and white walls layered in a staggered array. The roof's lines gently undulate and interspersed with dense green vegetation. The trees and leaves are lush, and under the sunlight, they reveal a rich green hue. The distant view features rolling hills shrouded in mist and a blurred city outline in the distance. The overall color scheme blends warm yellow and gray-green, presenting a soft, scattered light effect at dusk or early morning. Light enters diagonally from the upper left, casting soft shadows between the background buildings and thickets, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall atmosphere of the image is tranquil and gentle, featuring the grainy texture and slight fading characteristic of film photography. The color saturation is low but layered, with natural transitions between light and shadow, soft light and shadow that are soft and not harsh, creating a nostalgic, poetic, and slightly artistic visual experience. It feels like capturing a moment of pause and gazing during a journey, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It combines the delicate expressiveness of professional-grade art photography with the authentic warmth and breathing characteristic of everyday shooting equipment. It evokes precious memories casually recorded on a mobile phone or portable camera during travel. The composition is restrained yet emotionally expressive, with every element serving to create a resonant artistic conception of \"people are within the scenery, and the scenery is in the heart.\"",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
