        {
          "id": "krea2-64241c7bd331681c5cda848c",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙水边冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in light blue Hanfu sits sideways quietly on a creek stone. Her dress flows gracefully, the hem of her skirt as white as clouds, with a waist tie faintly visible. The cuffs are embroidered with intricate blue-green cranes and floral patterns. Under the soft light, the colors appear gentle and full of life. Her right hand gently strokes the hem of her skirt, her posture elegant and composed, as if immersed in nature's embrace, leaning forward slightly. Forming a subtle dynamic balance with the flowing water behind, the foreground shows the delicate folds of her robe's hem touching the bluestone, and several lush green maple leaves hanging from above. The veins of the leaves are clear, gently swaying in the breeze, partially obscuring the frame to form a natural frame. In the middle is the full silhouette of the woman and the reflection of flowing water. The water surface shows a hazy mint green tone, shimmering without obvious ripples, suggesting a tranquil and far-reaching atmosphere. The background is a blurred forest and distant mountain silhouettes, with layers of green in a balanced light. It creates a sense of depth and vastness of space. The entire composition uses the golden ratio, with the figure positioned at the right-left two-thirds of the frame. The light and shadow are soft and even, resembling diffused light at dawn or dusk, without strong shadows, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin and the soft texture of the fabric. The overall color scheme is mainly teal-green, accented with white, orange, and blue, creating a harmonious and unified visual rhythm with warm and cool contrasts. The atmosphere is tranquil and ethereal, full of Eastern classical aesthetics, like a landscape figure painting in light ink wash. With a slight film graininess and retro filter effect, it simulates the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The details are rich yet never overpowered, conveying a relaxed mood and delicate expression of inner emotions away from the hustle and bustle, immersed in nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
