        {
          "id": "krea2-54958141fd10a5656fe4f90e",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙山野冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in a soft, pale yellow long dress stands atop a rolling wild grassy slope. Her skirt flutters gently in the wind, and the shoulders are adorned with delicate ruffle designs, shining with a healthy sheen in the sunlight. She gently tilts her head back to gaze at the sky, her expression calm and full of thought, gently embracing a bouquet of vibrant, full orange-red flowers. The petals bloom layer upon layer, green stems entwining within, creating a strong and harmonious color dialogue with the warm yellow of her dress. In the foreground is low, dry wild grass thickets, interwoven with golden brown and withered yellow. Some grass stems are dotted with tiny white or pale yellow petals, gently swaying in the wind, creating a truly natural floor texture and sense of spatial depth; The middle shot shows the woman standing at the edge of the hillside, with the grass gradually extending into the distance with distinct layers, visually guiding the gaze upward to focus on the main subject; The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, pure and deep as if washed. Above floats a huge, fluffy white cumulus cloud, soft as cotton, its edges outlined by sunlight, and a few thin strands of cirrus clouds faintly visible beneath the clouds. The sky and clouds form the most grand visual framework of the scene; The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly to the lower left of the frame. Large expanses of sky and clouds occupy the upper half of the frame, creating a strong negative spatial contrast that highlights the character's small yet free soul posture; The visual guide line naturally converges from the foreground grass to the central figures, while the curved edges of the clouds subtly guide the gaze upward; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is presented as a clear afternoon with intense natural light, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right of the figure, casting soft, transitioning shadows on the left side of the body, enhancing the sense of depth and warmth of emotions; The overall color scheme is dominated by a contrast of warm and cool tones—the cool blue of the sky and the warm yellow of women's dresses and flowers create a dramatic collision, yet the harmony and unity of natural light create a harmonious unity; The image features a slight film grain texture and soft-focus edge treatment, simulating the delicate dynamic range and atmosphere of professional camera shooting, rather than the coldness of excessive digital sharpening; The setting is set in open, deserted meadows on plateaus or mountain slopes, far from the city's noise. The environment is quiet and vast, conveying a state of life of freedom, innocence, poetry, and introspection. It seems as if time stands still at this moment, with only the faint sound of wind passing through grass and bouquets, and the silent dialogue deep within the characters' souls toward the sky and nature; The image style blends fresh Japanese art with French pastoral romance, combining realistic details with surreal imagery. Like a film still, it has narrative tension and emotional depth, making it suitable for artistic portraits, travel photography, or emotional posters, conveying themes of \"embracing nature,\" \"spiritual freedom,\" and \"self-expression.\"",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
