        {
          "id": "krea2-ba9b7a37d8dc466349a0dbb9",
          "alias": "单女白短裙博物馆忧伤泼洒",
          "prompt": "Dressed in a vintage sailor-collar short-sleeve top with dark blue and white stripes, paired with a white pleated mini skirt, she sat barefoot cross-legged at a light brown wooden counter, looking relaxed yet elegant. Her left hand rested naturally on the back of her head, her expression tinged with a touch of playfulness and thoughtful gentleness. Her makeup was exquisite, and the overall look was full of youthful campus vibes and artistic vibes. In the foreground, various daily necessities are casually placed along the edge of the counter: a bag of cereal printed with \"KIRKLAND,\" several boxes of colorful cereal breakfasts, a pink beverage, a small jar of honey, several glass cups, a white mug with text, a red cherry tomato, a few carrots, two stacked red quilted tin boxes, and a brown basketball half-exposed in the lower left corner of the frame. These items are colorful yet not cluttered, creating a warm atmosphere reminiscent of real life. In the middle shot, the woman's body occupies the center right of the frame, with long leg lines and fair and delicate skin, showing a natural glow under soft light. Her toes are slender, her nails neatly trimmed with light-colored nail polish, and her body proportions are well-proportioned, full of artistic beauty. On the left side of the feature wall is a natural cork board, on which multiple black-and-white photos, colored postcards, a calendar piece labeled \"February\" is hung, and a handwoven white tassel ornament hung by clips and ropes. On the right is a pristine white wall featuring a large poster for Van Gogh's \"Wheatfield and Cypress\" exhibition, mainly in warm yellow tones, clearly written \"VAN GOGH EN PROVENCE,\" with exhibition information in French below. This creates a strong visual contrast and cultural imagery. Above hangs an orange bamboo chandelier, its light pouring diagonally downward, casting soft shadows on the shoulders and tabletops, with clear layers of light and shadow that create a three-dimensional effect. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, making the figures appear more intimate and approachable. Objects are balanced on both sides of the painting, with the main subject centered and prominent, forming a stable and rhythmic visual structure. Then, by guiding the gaze to the Van Gogh poster in the background, a narrative sense of spatial depth is formed. The overall color scheme is warm and soft, mainly natural wood, off-white, navy blue, and cream yellow, complemented by bright accents on food packaging, creating a comfortable, nostalgic, and life-filled artistic photography atmosphere. It feels like being in a small studio or private study filled with personal memories and artistic sentiment, blending the everyday warmth of daily life with the poetic beauty of tranquil times. Suitable for amateur photography, it presents professional-level texture and emotional depth. Every detail is carefully arranged yet not forced, conveying a tranquil, free, and slightly melancholic youthful aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
