        {
          "id": "krea2-73dccf2752b626496c473dcf",
          "alias": "单女竹林忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty dressed in flowing pale yellow Hanfu stands sideways by the lake with her back to the camera. In her right hand, she gently holds a rustic bamboo lantern, from which warm yellow light shines through the lantern, softly blending on the semi-transparent sleeve edge, creating a warm and mysterious light source on the twilight lakeshore. Her posture is elegant and reserved, her head slightly lowered as if gazing into the distance, as if lost in thought or waiting, her expression serene yet tinged with a touch of melancholy, a poetic beauty. In the foreground are several blurry reeds and wild grasses, their branches and leaves swaying gently in the wind, creating a hazy blur effect in shallow depth, adding natural layers and a sense of breathing to the composition; The middle ground is a broad and calm lake surface, with a faint blue-gray hue reflecting the outlines of distant mountains. The ripples are delicate and soft, occasionally ripples gently rippling, as if silently telling a story; The background features rolling distant mountains with soft contours, shrouded in mist, presenting deep blue-gray and dark green tones. The layered mountains create a sense of profound spatial depth, while the sky is a gradient twilight blue, transitioning naturally from the lake surface to the mountain peaks, with no clouds or stars, only the faint afterglow of daylight. The composition uses classic third-division rule and diagonal line guidance, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the painting, the body facing forward to the left, creating a sense of visual flow; As the sole light source, the lantern becomes the focal point and emotional anchor point of the composition, forming a strong contrast between its warm tones and the cool-toned background, while drawing attention to the core emotional expression of the figure. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is highly dramatic and poetic: the overall light comes from naturally scattered light at dusk or dawn, soft and even, but the lantern's warm glow becomes the only artificial light source, creating strong contrasts of light and shadow in local highlight areas, enhancing the emotional tension and narrative depth of the painting. The atmosphere is tranquil, ethereal, solitary, yet full of anticipation, imbued with a rich sense of Eastern classical aesthetics and the texture of ink painting with blank space. Like an unfinished landscape portrait, full of storytelling and philosophical meaning—it is a solitary shadow amid the lake and mountains, a touch of tenderness in the everyday life, a poetic presence at the intersection of time and space. The entire painting exudes Zen, loneliness, and eternal beauty, like a silent poem, constructing a visual world full of imagination and emotional resonance between nature and humanity. It features cinematic compositional aesthetics and a cinematic artistic feel, as if a professional photographer uses a high-end DSLR combined with a large-aperture lens to capture moments at prime moments. The image has moderate color saturation, soft contrast, and rich details, faithfully reproducing the texture, materials, and light and shadow layers of the scene. It offers the depth and atmosphere of artistic photography while retaining the realistic and delicate texture achieved by everyday amateur equipment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
