        {
          "id": "krea2-a4a43f01542505f1a5ea4471",
          "alias": "单女外套公寓忧伤站立自拍",
          "prompt": "Under the dim yellow, warm indoor lighting, a woman stands before a half-open glass door, her figure cut into a geometric composition by the door frame, creating a strong visual framing effect; She wears a dark jacket over a light-colored shirt, with the texture of the fabric faintly visible in the dim light, and the white fabric peeking out at the cuffs creates a subtle contrast with the dark coat; Add a touch of mystery and privacy; She was holding up her phone to take a selfie at a mirror or glass door. The screen reflected cool light, creating a thermal tension with the warm yellow light in the environment; Making a \"shh\" silent gesture, her expression playful yet tinged with a hint of melancholy; The foreground features a thick black door frame edge, with vertical lines dividing the frame to enhance the sense of spatial depth; The middle ground depicts the main figure and the narrow corridor space they occupy. On the right side, an orange-yellow vintage phone booth or self-service device can be faintly seen. Its vintage shell glows softly under warm light, becoming one of the background elements; The background is blurred wall and ceiling light strips, with light slanting from above, casting soft light gradients on the walls, creating a warm yet somewhat oppressive spatial atmosphere; The entire shot uses an extremely narrow depth of field technique, with the background and door frame edges naturally blurred; In composition, the door frame is used as a natural frame, with the figure positioned slightly centered to the right, creating an asymmetrical and balanced aesthetic; guiding the audience's attention to the characters' expressions and postures; In terms of lighting, the main tone is low-saturation warm yellow, with light sources from the top and sides creating a soft, diffused light effect that enhances the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, carrying the loneliness and artistic vibe of a city night, as if capturing an unintentional moment in life, full of narrative and emotional tension; The image texture mimics the effect of a film camera, with obvious graininess, slightly faded colors, and slight edges overflowing, presenting a nostalgic, hazy, and artistic style, as if casually captured in the hallway of a late-night apartment using an old digital camera or portable film player, capturing a sense of real life and emotional depth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
