        {
          "id": "krea2-23cbf9e8d8861380c92e114e",
          "alias": "单女长裤书店忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman, the absolute subject of the scene, wears vintage round glasses, her expression slightly contemplative and reserved. She wears an off-white high-neck lace long-sleeve top with delicate fabric and three-dimensional patterns, paired with dark pants, giving the overall look a blend of artistic flair and vintage vibes; In the foreground are several old books and photo albums spread out or stacked, with yellowed spines and worn-out covers. One open album reveals the edges of the faded photos, creating a nostalgic atmosphere; In the middle of the frame, she leans forward, her hands lightly touching the tabletop, her body slightly leaning forward, forming a natural visual focal point; The background is blurred, with blurred figures and dark clothing outlines faintly visible, suggesting she is in a crowded secondhand bookstore or antique market, with people moving but not noisy; The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective and a compact frame, placing the figure slightly to the right center of the frame. The foreground book creates a sense of depth and layering, with a visual guide extending from the book's edge to the character's arm and line of sight, enhancing narrative and immersion; The light and shadows are soft and have a film-like texture, with the main light source coming from the front slightly left, while the background falls into darker shadows, creating a contrast of light and dark that highlights the subject; The overall atmosphere is filled with tranquility, nostalgia, and intellectual temperament, as if time has frozen in this moment, with the air filled with the scent of paper and ink; The color palette leans toward warm brown and cream white as the main tones, complemented by dark gray and navy blue backgrounds, creating a warm yet slightly melancholic mood; The image style highly simulates film camera effects, featuring slight grain noise, slight fading marks, edge smudges, and light spots, presenting a sense of realism and humanistic warmth reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, like an old photo forgotten in a drawer corner, being revisited, evoking viewers' resonance with past times and knowledge accumulation.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
