        {
          "id": "krea2-929a85ba1a41132aabf4fc96",
          "alias": "单女浴袍窗边冷淡坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty dressed in a simple white Hanfu sits serenely and gracefully in the center of a traditional Japanese tatami room, legs cross-legged on the floor, and the soft hems of her robe hang down like mist, enveloping her figure. The fabric is delicate and soft, with natural pleats flowing along her body's curves. The cuffs and hem are slightly raised, as if gently brushed by a gentle breeze. The bun is simple yet exquisite, highlighting a gentle and cool temperament. Revealing a contemplative or introspective mood, she gently holds an unrolled scroll of ancient paintings in her hand. The edges of the scroll are dark brown, and the paper is painted with light ink landscape lines, faintly revealing the outlines of mountains, flowing water, and trees, symbolizing the leisurely mood of scholars and literati. In the foreground are her exposed ankles and calves, which glow naturally warm under soft lighting, creating a visual contrast with the white robe. The floor is covered with light palm tatami mats with clearly visible grain, adding a sense of life and authenticity. The center features her entire body and a scroll, with the composition center-right. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the space, forming a stable center of gravity. To the left of the background is a large ink landscape hanging scroll, using light ink to render distant mountains and nearby waters, with hazy colors; On the right is a dark wooden bookshelf with neatly arranged books and scrolls, some spines featuring blurred text, creating a scholarly atmosphere; At the back is a typical Japanese lattice sliding window, with soft daylight streaming in outside. The window frame lines are clean and orderly, dividing the interior space into clear layers. The entire scene is composed in a diagonal line, with light slanting in from the upper left. The contrast of light and shadow is subtle but not abrupt, creating a tranquil, ethereal, and slightly Zen-inspired atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm gray-white, complemented by dark brown wood and light ink green accents, presenting a low-saturation, high-quality cinematic film aesthetic, as if an amateur is shooting with a medium format camera in the afternoon. The lens is slightly out of focus, with slight noise and motion blur, enhancing the documentary feel and emotional immersion. The painting's atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, filled with the \"blank space\" artistic conception of Eastern philosophy. The expressions of the figures and the surrounding objects together create a state of solitude, introspection, and poetic living. It seems as if she is the spiritual embodiment of ancient literati, savoring the beauty of calligraphy and painting alone in the quiet, conveying the tenderness and resilience accumulated by time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
