        {
          "id": "krea2-e7070922dc93f17db74220cb",
          "alias": "单女红外套严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, wearing a thick, fluffy, bright red plush hooded jacket, with the collar and cuffs trimmed with soft, pure white lambswool trim. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the left central position, the right side blank to create a sense of breathing, and the visual guide naturally extends from her downward gaze to the blurred ground below, forming a stable and emotionally charged triangular composition; The middle ground is the light brown clay ground where she stands, with a faintly discernible grainy texture that transitions into layers with the background blur treatment; The background is completely shrouded in hazy mist, with gray-white distant views blurred like ink washes, faintly visible outlines of trees or architectural silhouettes in the distance, enhancing spatial depth and dreamlike atmosphere; The light and shadow come from soft natural light from the upper side, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow, while the shadows naturally blend into the background mist without strong contrast. It combines cinematic storytelling with authentic emotional expression, evoking the blend of nostalgic film tones and fresh Japanese aesthetics, creating a highly immersive emotional resonance.",
