        {
          "id": "krea2-193f01d26d8990926d6a33bd",
          "alias": "单女灰西装街道害羞站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A vibrant Japanese-style high school girl stands on a quiet campus path, dressed in a classic dark gray school blazer layered with a white hooded sweatshirt, the hem showing the edge of a plaid pleated skirt, a burgundy striped scarf at the neckline, and a delicate school emblem embroidered in the left breast pocket. The overall uniform design is simple yet full of academic flair. She slightly turned to glance back, as if silently communicating with the audience off-camera, displaying an innocent, slightly shy yet vibrant aura. She carries a dark blue canvas travel bag on her right shoulder, with a light gray striped strap. On the side of the bag hangs a pink bear charm and a small keychain, adding cute and everyday details to the understated school uniform. The foreground focuses on her upper body and backpack, with a slightly tilted perspective to blend the figure naturally into the street environment. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background into soft light spots and blurred outlines of greenery, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The middle ground is an asphalt pavement extending into the distance, flanked by neatly trimmed shrubs and low stone walls. Sunlight pours diagonally down from the upper left of the frame, casting long, warm shadows on the ground and creating a visual rhythm of interplay of light and shadow. The background is completely blurred, with distant outlines of buildings and tree branches faintly visible, but all details are softened by the soft focus effect, preserving only color layers and transitions of light and shadow, which enhances the main figure's presence. The overall composition is balanced and stable, with the figure positioned slightly to the center to the right. The diagonal line structure of the backpack breaks vertical symmetry, adding dynamic beauty. The use of light is extremely delicate, with warm lighting during the \"golden hour\" of early morning or evening, outlining soft high-gloss edges and enhancing depth and realistic texture. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and full of the romantic vibe of a Japanese youth campus. The color palette mainly features gray-blue, off-white, and deep red, complemented by golden tones from sunlight, creating a fresh, natural, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. It seems to capture the most authentic campus moments after school or during breaks. It combines exquisite artistic photography composition with the authenticity and warmth of amateur equipment, allowing visitors to feel the beauty of youth and the poetry of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
