        {
          "id": "krea2-65494bee1d26dbb2d63b3445",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣厨房沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a creamy yellow vintage kitchen counter, legs hanging naturally, wearing a black spaghetti strap bra and high-waisted denim shorts, paired with pure white cotton stockings, arms crossed over her chest, her expression slightly relaxed and contemplative, wearing a simple silver ring necklace around her neck, with a delicate bracelet faintly visible on her wrist. Her overall posture is relaxed yet full of storytelling; The foreground focuses on her long leg lines and the details of her white socks, as well as the smooth texture of the beige cabinet below. Next to the left sink are red cans and transparent glass bottled drinks, with a gold-tall faucet gleaming with metallic luster under the cold light; In the middle is the large countertop where she sits, scattered with vintage-style items: a green mocha pot, a small copper pot, a basket of fresh green grapes, several boxes of cereal cereal with colorful packaging (from Kellogg's), and a woven basket beside it holding baguettes. On the right side is a set of off-white vintage drawer cabinets with dark gray metal handles, keeping the cabinet neat and orderly; The background is pure white tiled walls, above which hangs a white carved wooden closet, and inside, exquisite ceramic tea sets are displayed. A round porcelain plate decorated with figures, a small glass jar, and dried flower decorations. Below the closet hangs a vintage round strainer strainer, creating a clean, bright, and warm space with soft, warm colors; The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center. Vertical lines enhance the kitchen structural stability, while the countertop extends to form a visual guiding line; The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural diffused light, with light strips from the left front window or ceiling lighting softly and evenly illuminating the entire scene. The countertop reflects delicately, creating a warm and tranquil home atmosphere. The color tones are mainly cream yellow, milky white, light blue, copper, and black, accented with a touch of red to create a classic retro aesthetic. The image texture is delicate and authentic, with a slight film graininess and a simulation of amateur equipment, as if captured by an old digital camera or phone under soft indoor lighting. Preserving the breath of life and an unintentional sense of nature, the entire image exudes a narrative tension that blends nostalgia, everyday life, and gentleness. It combines the convenience and comfort of modern living with the classic charm of mid-century American homes.",
