        {
          "id": "krea2-c413f40d0d4c7b50794905cc",
          "alias": "多人摄影棚冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "The slightly tilted shooting angle gives the image a sense of dynamism and intimacy. The camera occupies two-thirds of the right side of the frame, naturally drawing the viewer's gaze into the frame and hinting at the footage to be recorded; In terms of lighting atmosphere, it uses soft side backlighting, with the light source coming from the upper left of the frame, creating a delicate transition between light and dark. The camera body has a cool-toned metallic sheen due to reflective materials; Enhances three-dimensional and realistic tactile feel; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and full of narrative tension, featuring the grainy texture and warm colors unique to film photography. It resembles a scene of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice, falling into the corner of the studio. It feels both like a professional photographer's creative scene and an amateur recording poetic moments of daily life with an old camera, radiating a nostalgic, gentle, and artistically expressive emotional tone.",
          "description": "",
