        {
          "id": "krea2-0f7a1589eb90c56525526e66",
          "alias": "单女棕泳装舞台冷淡倚靠伸展",
          "prompt": "On a clay tennis court gently touched by sunlight, a woman leans lazily and confidently against the edge of the net. She wears a dark brown tie-up bikini that outlines smooth and dynamic curves, with a delicate necklace gently accentuating her neck. Her body is half-lying and half-seated, her left hand lightly supporting herself on the ground, her right arm gracefully extending back, and her fingertips lightly touching the net rope, as if conversing with the boundaries of movement. At her feet lies a black-framed, white-edged tennis racket, with a striking red brand logo printed on the racket. As if silently declaring: this is not just a sports field, but her private and free stage. In the foreground is the focal point of her exposed legs and racket, with her knees slightly bent, stretching out a dynamic curve; The middle ground is the visual divide formed at the junction between her upper body and the net, where the black grid and white top edge form strong geometric lines that draw the viewer's gaze toward the subject; The background stretches into the distance on a clay court, with white boundaries as clear as if carved by a knife, and in the distance, the blurred outline on the other side of the net can be faintly seen, creating a sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, making viewers feel as if they are standing behind her, maintaining intimacy while keeping a moderate distance. The focus of the frame is at the intersection of her waist and racket, creating a visual balance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and realistic, with natural sunlight pouring from above to the right, casting light shadows on her skin while creating highlight-reflecting reflections within the racket frame to enhance the sense of depth. The overall tone leans toward warm tones, with saturated red clay harmoniously contrasting with the deep brown of the bikini, while white sneakers and the top of the net serve as cool accents, creating a visual rhythm. The scene is filled with a sense of \"rest in motion,\" combining the fierce marks of the arena with the softness and spontaneity of youth, like a photo taken with everyday amateur equipment yet full of artistic appeal—not a staged commercial shot, but a genuine moment of quiet and self-expression on an empty afternoon when she enjoys a moment of solitude. The air still seemed to carry the fresh scent of sweat and earth, along with the faint sound of tennis racket strings being blown by the wind. The entire scene exuded a unique charm that lies between professionalism and life, seriousness and laziness, both visually and emotionally. It makes one imagine she has just finished a fierce match or is preparing for the next match, but at this moment, she just wants to lie quietly on this red land of her own, telling a story of passion, freedom, and beauty through her body and racket.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
