        {
          "id": "krea2-e138a3ad56ab721534eabf9b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern, minimalist chair with black hollowed-out designs, wearing a loose white shirt with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists. She pairs a black short skirt with semi-transparent black stockings, her barefoot posture relaxed and natural. Her right leg rests elegantly on the left black wooden grain desk, while her left foot lightly taps the ground, creating a tensiony diagonal composition; Her overall temperament combines professional competence with a lazy sexy vibe; The foreground focuses on her exposed ankles, calf lines, a silver-gray laptop on the desk, a black magazine with the words \"PRINCIPLE OCT 18\" on the cover, and a black-and-white pen. These items are presented in low-angle close-ups, enhancing the realism of everyday office scenes; The middle shot is the torso of her body: the shirt collar is slightly open, the shoulder line is smooth, arms naturally hang by the chair, and her fingernails are neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored manicures, creating a striking contrast with the black stockings. The background features a simple black-and-white wall, with the upper half in pure white and the lower half in deep black. In the corner, the edge of the projection screen can be faintly seen, suggesting the space may be a home theater or multifunctional studio, creating a minimalist visual tone; The painting uses a slightly downward tilted angle, placing the figure in the right two-thirds of the frame to create dynamic balance; The lighting is soft and even, with diffused light from the front side outlining her three-dimensional silhouette, while casting delicate shadows on the desk and legs to enhance layering; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, combining the refined lifestyle of urban white-collar workers with a hint of privacy and allure. The color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, presenting a unique aesthetic that blends sophistication and everyday life. It looks as if a regular digital camera was shot indoors under natural light, with slight noise and realistic color reproduction, avoiding excessive post-processing and preserving the original image texture.",
