        {
          "id": "krea2-c2bb366df3ee98c43f309b3b",
          "alias": "单女米西装公寓专注坐阅读",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman wearing a loose beige blazer and matching wide-leg pants sits on a black metal-framed chair in a modern minimalist café. She leans slightly to the side, leans forward, hands folded and resting lightly on her knees, her posture relaxed and focused, as if immersed in a moment of quiet work or reading; She wears a pair of slender, exquisite black-rimmed glasses, with a small and unique gold hoop earring hanging from her left earlobe, shining brilliantly under soft light; She wore a pair of matching suede flat loafers, with delicate textures and hand-stitched details visible on the uppers, presenting a Japanese commuter aesthetic that blends sophistication and comfort; In the foreground are the dark metal chair legs and table edge where she sits, along with a silver-gray laptop and a white paper cup coffee with a simple pattern printed on the table. The tabletop is made of matte dark gray marble texture, reflecting the faint light and shadow of the surrounding environment; In the middle of the frame, she displays her extended legs, crossed wrists, a gold thin chain bracelet on her wrist, and a light gray fabric sofa behind her. Several soft cushions are dotted on the sofa, and the wall behind the sofa is inlaid with two round mirrored decorations, reflecting the blurred outlines of indoor greenery and warm yellow lighting, creating a sense of depth and layering in the space; The background features slightly blurred walls and distant green potted plants. The walls are covered with light gray cement paint with irregular spotted textures, while the floor is paved with antique-style cement tiles made from small white stones, each stone edge clearly visible, creating a rough yet refined visual contrast; The entire composition uses a slightly overhead diagonal angle, with the main figure positioned on the right third of the frame, forming a stable visual center before returning to her relaxed posture; The light comes from soft natural light in the upper left of the frame, creating bright highlights and delicate transitional shadows on her arms, legs, and desktop, enhancing the sense of depth and realistic touch; The atmosphere is tranquil and warm, carrying a healing and artistic vibe of urban life, as if capturing a unique moment from an ordinary afternoon. The entire scene exudes understated luxury, a lazy, and comfortable everyday aesthetic, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in natural light. The color palette is mainly earth tones, supplemented by a touch of metallic sheen and green plants. The image has moderate color saturation and soft contrast, delivering cinematic narrative tension and immersive experience.",
          "description": "",
