        {
          "id": "krea2-125a8d0c1bc0391bc29f1d57",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣雪地微笑躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies comfortably on a patch of pure, flawless snow, looking straight at the camera with a pure and warm smile, outlining soft contours and natural transitions of light and shadow. She wears a thick, soft deep blue coarse knit sweater with clearly visible texture. The knit's three-dimensional and warm texture is strong. This contrasts sharply with the white lace or cotton thread scarf wrapped around her. The scarf drapes lightly over her chest and shoulders, with some fibers loosening like snow, blending seamlessly with the snowy background. The background gradually blurs, with blurred snowfields stretching into the distance. Where undulating snow hills meet the sky, the sky appears pale blue, clouds thin and light, light slanting down from above, creating a contrast of highlights and shadows, while the lower body and sweater folds form soft shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, with the gaze naturally tilting downward and then extending to the vast snowfield background, creating a visual progression and a sense of spatial depth. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, with blue sweaters, snow-white ground, and pale blue sky as the main color scheme. However, the warm tones of the characters' skin and the vitality in their smiles give the painting a strong sense of warmth, creating a visual tension with contrasting cool and warm. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a sense of tranquility and vitality. The sunlight is bright but not harsh, with soft and layered light, like warm afternoon sunlight filtering through thin clouds and falling to the earth. The entire scene exudes a tranquil, pure, and carefree winter fairy tale atmosphere, as if time has frozen in this moment, leaving only beautiful moments of harmony between humans and nature. The image style pursues an artistic aesthetic that combines high realism with film texture. The images feature slight grainy noise and soft focus effects, simulating the delicate textures and color transitions of vintage film cameras. The color saturation is moderately cool and presents an overall soft and dreamy cinematic feel, as if it comes from the cover or stills of a literary youth movie. It has strong narrative and emotional resonance, while preserving the realism and everyday atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting, avoiding the artificiality caused by excessive post-processing. allowing viewers to feel a truly tangible moment of happiness under the warm winter sun.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
