        {
          "id": "krea2-d82875921ab6106447cc30f3",
          "alias": "城市冷淡持包",
          "prompt": "White and pink pieces are faintly visible in the dim environment, with bright lights shining through gaps above creating a strong contrast between light and dark; The entire composition uses a low-angle, slightly upward shot to enhance the character's presence and the sense of pressure from the seats; The light mainly comes from the upper right, casting heavy shadows on the ground and background, creating a dramatic atmosphere; The overall color scheme is mainly black and gray, complemented by the cool silver sheen of metal rivets and the dazzling reflection of the rhinestone handbag, creating visual layers; The visuals are filled with a mysterious, rebellious, yet refined urban fashion vibe, combining the rugged texture of industrial ruins with a delicate and fragile feminine feel. Like a private moment on the edge of a bustling city, quiet and full of tension, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue, it possesses strong storytelling and artistic expression. It is suitable for shooting with professional cameras or high-end smartphones under controlled lighting conditions, pursuing ultimate detail restoration and emotional expression.",
