        {
          "id": "krea2-c66200016910d96ca3b32b5f",
          "alias": "单女金和服樱花困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright atop a simple stone steps, dressed in a soft and warm pale yellow kimono. The fabric is light and flowing, covered with delicate white and pink cherry blossom patterns. The branches stretch vigorously in all directions, some branches hang obliquely, petals trembling in the wind, creating a romantic and dreamy atmosphere; The background is a clear, deep blue sky without a single cloud. In the distance, the outlines of undulating blue-green mountains can be faintly seen. The lush vegetation and distinct layers add depth and a broad perspective to the painting; The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the subject appear tall and upright, while cherry blossom branches and leaves cleverly serve as natural frames around the figure's head and shoulders, creating a visual focal point; The painting is bright and transparent, with sunlight slanting down from above, creating delicate shadows that are delicate but not harsh, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and the texture of the materials; The overall color palette is dominated by warm yellow and vibrant pink, complemented by a cool blue sky and calm gray-brown stone steps. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, full of spring vitality and poetic beauty; The atmosphere is tranquil and distant, infused with the charm of Eastern classical aesthetics, combining sweetness and innocence with the vitality and eternity of natural beauty; Forming a layered emotional connection; The details in the image are rich and delicate, from the texture of the kimono fabric to the clear veins of the petals. The subtle and natural transitions of light and shadow present a style that is both close to reality and artistically processed. It seems as if a high-end digital camera was taken on a clear afternoon, combining professional photography composition awareness with the authentic texture of everyday shooting, evoking a tranquil and peaceful mood in spring and a cherishing of beautiful moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
