        {
          "id": "krea2-a0056479eba3383009b46945",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市忧伤倚靠躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman peeks out halfway through the narrow gap between two dark gray, rough cement walls, wearing a fluffy, off-white lambswool coat. The fabric has delicate and soft textures, presenting a warm yet slightly hazy texture in the light and shadow; A strong contrast of light and shadow is formed. In the foreground are two vertical dark concrete columns, their surfaces covered with fine particles and mottled marks, forming a natural frame composition that frames the figure naturally at the center of the composition. The middle ground features her bare shoulders and the edges of her coat, where light penetrates the sheer, gauze-like plush material, casting fine highlights and shadow stripes on the fabric surface, enhancing the texture's realistic tactile feel. The background features a blurred light orange wall and a deep blue glass window, with faint reflections of indoor objects visible inside. The colors blend warm and cool but are rendered blurred to avoid overshadowing the main space, serving only as a backdrop for the ambiance; The entire composition adopts minimalism, dividing space with vertical lines to create a dramatic tension of being watched or secretly observed, while high light ratio and soft focus effects enhance emotional depth; The light source comes from the upper right corner of the image, simulating natural light filtering through the gaps in the building during the afternoon sunset, creating a sharp and warm side light effect. At the same time, clear geometric shadows are cast on the walls, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the scene; The overall color scheme leans mainly toward cool gray and blue, with interplay of light and shadow creating a tranquil, lonely yet vibrant urban street corner atmosphere, as if capturing a moment of daily life yet imbued with poetry and storytelling; The image texture is delicate and lifelike, featuring the unique grain noise and slight chromatic aberration typical of film cameras, simulating the natural imperfections of amateur equipment rather than excessive sharpening or post-processing. The composition follows the rule of third-division principles: the subject occupies the visual center on the right, while the blank space on the left forms a sense of pressure and breathing space with the wall, drawing viewers into her hesitant gaze; The atmosphere is tranquil, private, and slightly melancholic, like a silent urban poem quietly blooming in the cracks of steel and concrete, revealing the gentleness and fragility of human nature. It possesses the documentary power of street photography and the emotional depth of portrait art. Between light and shadow, it tells a story of waiting, curiosity, self-exposure, and inner monologue.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
