        {
          "id": "krea2-d08fee99fa76a77d9e7783ea",
          "alias": "单女礼服摄影棚坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "The petals were delicate and soft, shimmering softly under the soft light; The lace gown she wore hugs her figure, outlining smooth curves. The hollowed-out design on the back subtly reveals the lines of her skin, and the hem of the dress falls to the floor, with a delicate and layered texture of the fabric; In the foreground is the vintage chair she sits on, with a graceful curve of the chair backrest, intricately carved armrests, and a slightly aged cushion that exudes a sense of time. The legs are slender and sturdy, standing firmly on the warm wooden floor; The middle frame is the main subject formed by her and the chair, with the figure positioned in the left third of the frame, naturally guiding viewers to focus on her expression and costume details; The background is a wide wall of floor-to-ceiling window sheer curtains, with layers upon layers of sheer fabric hanging like waves, casting a hazy yet even warm yellow light. Sunlight outside filters through the curtains, forming soft vertical light and shadow stripes, creating a dreamlike atmosphere; The entire composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the figure leaning to the left and leaving plenty of space on the right side for the background curtain, creating a visual balance and sense of breathability; The visual guide line is formed by the direction the figure lowers their head, the fingers lightly touching the hem of the skirt, and the draping lines of the curtain, ultimately drawn by the soft texture of the curtain; In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the window behind the right of the figure, creating a backlighting effect that gives the edges of the figure a soft golden halo, while the subtle transitions of light and shadow on the sides of her body enhance the sense of depth and depth; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and poetic, as if frozen in the moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room, carrying a subtle nostalgic and romantic vibe, like a movie still or a high-end fashion magazine cover; The main color tones are off-white, light brown, and cream yellow, with overall low saturation, presenting a warm, jade-like soft-focus texture; The details in the painting are rich yet not chaotic; every element serves to convey the overall mood—whether it's the delicate lace patterns, the natural folds of curtain folds, or the classical lines carved on the chairbacks, all silently tell a story; This image style combines the refinement and control of professional studio shooting while retaining the casual realism and sense of life found in everyday amateur photography. It's like capturing a beautiful moment indoors under natural light with a phone or small camera, but after post-processing color grading and compositional enhancement, it gains strong artistic appeal and emotional depth. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the painting; all focus is on the emotional expression of the figures and the fusion of the ambient atmosphere, creating an immersive visual experience that makes one reluctant to leave.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
