        {
          "id": "krea2-df451804b191057017c5004c",
          "alias": "单女内衣厨房忧伤坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits with her back to the camera, sitting at the edge of a stainless steel kitchen sink, her body slightly turned to the side. Her left hand gently touches the round metal handle of the dark green cabinet above. She wears a semi-translucent off-white loose long-sleeve top paired with matching low-rise underwear. The fabric is thin and soft, revealing skin contours under natural light. The back lines are smooth and curvaceous, and the overall posture exudes a lazy, private, and slightly contemplative atmosphere. In the foreground is the sink countertop and stove area. On the left side of the stove sits a stainless steel cookware with a glass lid, beside which are bottles of mineral water and several Korean alcoholic beverages. The labels on the bottles are clearly visible. On the right is a curved metallic faucet, and the inner wall of the sink below shows slight water stains. The overall countertop looks somewhat cluttered but authentically natural. In the middle is the female figure and the edge of the sink where she sits, with the window area in the background. In front of the window hangs a white curtain adorned with fine lace patterns, sunlight filters through the gaps, casting dappled shadows on the floor and objects. Two pots of green plants are placed along the windowsill, their leaves spreading full of vitality. Next to the plants is a bottle of Graham's liquor packaging, adding a lively touch to the details. The composition uses a medium to near perspective, with the figure occupying the center-right position, naturally guiding the gaze to focus on her back and hand movements, while the plants by the window and stove objects create visual extension, creating a sense of spatial layering. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from soft daylight outside the window, slanting into the room from the front left. It creates a warm transition of light and dark on women's backs, shoulders, and clothing folds. The shadows are soft and not awkward. The kitchen lighting is relatively dim, with only the countertop and sink area reflecting metallic sheen. The overall atmosphere evokes the tranquility and privacy of home in the afternoon. The color tones are warm brown, off-white, and deep green, with moderate saturation, and the grainy texture and soft focus characteristic of film photography. The image appears to have been shot by an old digital or film camera, with slight noise and color shifts, conveying a genuine beauty captured unintentionally in daily life. It is both artistic and retains the roughness and realism of everyday scenes, evoking a gentle, lazy, and slightly lonely everyday aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
