        {
          "id": "krea2-ee0c89e4ff04ce7b0fe685d5",
          "alias": "外套城市冷淡坐自拍",
          "prompt": "Vertical lines guide the gaze upward, while its soft, misty, semi-transparent texture provides a hazy yet elegant backdrop for the figure, avoiding overshadowing the main focus. The overall composition uses compact medium and close-up shots, with the figure's head slightly tilted and body center of gravity shifted to the left, creating a slight asymmetrical balance that enhances visual tension; Finally, it is scattered in the texture details of the background curtains; The lighting uses soft, diffused indoor light sources from the front left of the frame, while also creating localized shadows to enhance drama; The ambient tone is both cold and gentle, combining the proud beauty wrapped in winter chill with the quiet mood of urban nighttime privacy; The color scheme is dominated by black and gray-white, creating strong contrasts without being jarring; The entire scene resembles a selfie art piece taken with amateur equipment, carrying a realistic texture with a sense of everyday life—the fur fibers appear rough and authentic when shot up close, and the curtain folds are not perfectly smooth but carry subtle imperfections from daily life, without excessive post-processing, instead making the scene feel more intimate and immersive; This image retains studio-level precise compositional awareness while possessing the casual warmth of a casual phone shot. It is a unique visual language between professional aesthetics and personal expression, evoking the fragile yet resilient inner state of oneself sitting alone by the window late at night, tightly wrapped in a coat and gazing into the mirror.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
