        {
          "id": "krea2-6d5f80c022a2cb841ccc2382",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣城市忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of a high balcony, adding a lazy yet natural sense of movement; She wears a thick, warm brown knit sweater with clearly visible patterns, sleeves slightly rolled up, gazing into the distance, her expression calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy or gentle reverie, as if she is about to speak or has just sighed; Her right hand naturally rests at her side, while her left hand gently rests on the balcony railing, her posture relaxed yet graceful; On the black metal railing beside her sat a delicate bouquet of roses, with flowers mainly in creamy white and soft pale yellow. The petals are layered and full in bloom, some slightly drooping, as if gently kissed by the wind, exuding a soft and sweet fragrance; The background is a distant city shrouded in misty gray-white tones, with building outlines blurred and hazy. The sky appears a cool pale blue-gray, with thin clouds and soft and even light, without strong direct sunlight; The entire composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, with the figure occupying the main position, the composition leaning to the left, leaving space on the right side to hint at the distance and imagination; Creating a sense of depth and emotional extension; The light and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with a slight backlighting effect. The sweater's surface creates delicate transitions between light and dark, with a faint glow at the edges of rose petals. The overall tone leans toward low-saturation warm brown paired with cool gray, creating a subtle emotional contrast; The image quality is delicate and realistic, as if taken at dusk or early morning with amateur equipment such as a phone or a small digital camera, with slight noise and natural color deviations to enhance realism and realism; Background blurring is obvious, highlighting the subject's emotional expression; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, and slightly lonely, evoking both the alienation of urban life and the softness and romance of personal hearts, like an unfinished story frozen in time, full of narrative tension and emotional depth reminiscent of an art film.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
