        {
          "id": "krea2-73c5cf100c628c5074ef3095",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服摄影棚愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her slender fingers gently grasped the stem, and at her fingertip wore a simple silver ring, the lines of her hand graceful and smooth; She wore a black lace strapless gown made of multi-layered sheer fabrics and three-dimensional pleats, with irregular ruffled edges. The hem hugged the skin and outlined graceful curves, while the exposed shoulders and neck were smooth and delicate, with light and shadow creating a soft transition; The foreground focuses on her arm holding flowers, the rose, and the skin of her shoulders and neck. The background is a pure white wall, on which shadow patterns like branches and leaves are cast—perhaps silhouettes from trees or artificial installations outside the window—creating a hazy, poetic spatial layer; The center is her upper body silhouette, with clear lines from shoulders to waist. The black dress creates rich contrasts of light and shadow under light and shadow, and the hem is partially obscured, but its flowing texture is easy to imagine. The long view is limited to walls and shadows, keeping it simple and clean, and enhancing the subject's presence; The composition uses a slightly slanted third-division method, with the figure's body at a 45-degree angle diagonally to the right side of the painting, AND the head turned to the left. The word \"MOONLIGHT\" is displayed in bold white font at the lower left of the image, accompanied by the English poem \"WHEN I MET YOU I KNEW WOULD FOREVER BE BY YOUR SIDE FOREVER YOUR PARTNER AND FOREVER YOUR LOVE,\" with the label \"HEMA\" in the lower right corner IMAGE”； The visual guide line is constructed by the position of the rose, the direction of the characters' gaze, and the arrangement of text. The handling of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, casting large areas of varying shade on the background wall, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and dramatic tension. The light is warm but not glaring, with a soft golden tone reminiscent of dusk or dawn; The atmosphere is tranquil yet emotionally profound, blending romanticism with modern art photography styles. It has the exquisite feel of a fashion magazine cover while also carrying a tone of solitude and contemplation, as if telling a story about encounters, love, and eternal promises; The entire image presents professional studio shooting standards, while deliberately preserving the texture of everyday amateur equipment — slight noise, natural color transitions, and non-fully sharpened processing to make the image feel more authentic rather than cold and perfect; The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, with red rose as the only highly saturated color element, standing out and full of vitality in cool environments, symbolizing love, passion, and undying emotions; The overall mood conveys gentleness, mystery, restraint, and power, allowing viewers to feel a heartfelt confession and soul-resonance that transcends words.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
