        {
          "id": "krea2-1957af4588a7d37f39618ba0",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地忧伤行走书写",
          "prompt": "On a snowy plain gently shrouded in a cold night, a woman becomes the absolute visual focal point of the scene. She wears a fluffy, thick off-white plush coat with a cloud-like texture, the hem hanging down to her knees. On the right side of the foreground is the trunk of a sturdy, old tree, with cracked and mottled bark and deep grain, covered by a thin layer of frost and snow. The branches stretch upward, and the exposed branches outline the sky like black ink lines, echoing the equally withered branches on the left, forming a natural visual framework that frames the figure and enhances the depth of the composition. The middle ground features a snowy path illuminated by artificial lighting, with the ground covered in fine snow, evenly distributed with several round warm white light sources, like scattered stars, breathing a warm breath into this cold space. Light and shadow cast soft halos on the snow, reflecting hazy patches of light that enhance the layers of the image; The background is a deep night sky and distant blurry silhouettes of woods. The outlines of trees are faintly visible in the darkness, with a few wooden signs or road markers faintly visible. The writing on them is indistinct, but enough to suggest that this is the edge of a park or scenic area with signs of human activity; In the distance, a blurry figure is walking, dressed in dark clothes and wearing a light-colored scarf. The figure is elongated and deformed, creating a slight motion blur effect, creating a sense of time passing and spatial depth, while cleverly crafting a \"bystander\" perspective that makes the subject appear more lonely and real; The entire composition uses an almost symmetrical style, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, and trees on both sides forming visual guidelines, naturally focusing on her; The light mainly comes from embedded light strips on the floor and scattered street lamps in the distance. The overall atmosphere leans toward a cool tone, with deep blue and gray as the main tone, accented by warm white light sources. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not jarring, creating a cold, lonely, yet gently comforting winter night atmosphere; The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with plush garments showing rich transitions of light and shadow, natural snow reflections, and deep tree trunk shadows, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality; The overall style leans toward artistic everyday shooting, with slight film graininess and soft focus effects. Like casually capturing moments with a phone in cold nighttime, the carefully composed and color-matched scenes convey a strong cinematic feel and emotional tension, conveying the inner world of city dwellers alone in the cold winter—both a silent resistance to the cold and a gentle emotional reflection of one's own emotions.",
          "description": "",
