        {
          "id": "krea2-e34f81b253a0fefec25eb380",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市严肃坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly at a black metal table on a city high-rise terrace, draped in a luxurious, fluffy, off-white long silk fur coat. Her fur is dense, soft, and glossy, glowing with a warm hue in natural light. Paired with her light brown lace camisole and matching high-waisted shorts, she creates a harmonious earth-tone look, combining sophistication with urban fashion. She gently held a tall glass filled with golden liquid in her right hand. The wine was clear and bright, with tiny droplets forming on the rim from the heat. Her fingertips were long and fair, and wearing a simple ring, her whole posture relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a peaceful and pleasant afternoon. In the foreground is a corner of the black metallic desk where she sits; the smooth surface reflects lightly, faintly outlining the silhouette of her arm and the cup's shadow; The center frame shows her complete upper body and leg lines, the fluffy texture of the fur coat and the details of the garment pleats clearly visible, and the skirt naturally drapes over the dark round seat edge. In the background, the city's buildings are seen through large transparent glass railings. The buildings in the distance appear slightly blurred to highlight the main figures. The composition adopts a medium-near portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, the body slightly tilted, creating a natural dynamic balance; The glass railing is diagonally cut across the screen, with just the right amount of blank space on the left, giving the image a strong sense of breathability. In terms of lighting and shadow ambiance, the overall lighting is soft and even, naturally diffused, possibly from cloudy days or scattered light sources obscured by clouds. The plush texture of fur coats is refracted by light, creating rich transitions of light and shadow and a sense of three-dimensionality; The background buildings feature a slight ambient halo to enhance spatial depth; The overall color scheme blends warm and cool tones, with off-white, brown, and gray-blue intertwining to create an urban dusk atmosphere that is both modern and retro, luxurious yet everyday. It has a cinematic sense of sophistication while retaining the authentic grainy texture and slight noise of amateur equipment, giving the image a more everyday feel and emotional warmth, as if capturing a quiet poetic moment amid the city's noise.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
