        {
          "id": "krea2-40648f11859de04623996884",
          "alias": "单女白T恤沙发自信倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wore a sheer white camisole featuring a vintage floral pattern in orange, purple, and light green, edged with delicate lace trim, paired with puffy, lightweight white shorts with pleated cuffs that revealed her long, fair legs. Layer it with a loose, soft mint green knit cardigan with a noticeable plush texture. The cuffs are casually rolled up, and the hem naturally drapes over the armrest, creating a soft visual layer. On her feet, she wears a pair of white cut-out knit socks, adding a touch of homely comfort. In the foreground are her raised arms, part of the cardigan's sleeve, and the white pom-pom cushions along the edge of the sofa; in the middle is the rattan sofa she's leaning on, with light beige curtains behind. The fine curtain texture lets in the dappled sunlight outside, casting warm, soft light on her shoulders, neck, and clothing. The background features bright windows, with wooden window frames and blurred architectural silhouettes faintly visible outside. Light streams in from the right side, creating a tranquil atmosphere for early morning or afternoon. The overall composition is a close-up shot, with the figure occupying the left central position, and a slightly upward-looking angle enhances the gentle elegance. It then extends to the light outside the window, creating a sense of spatial depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm tones, with sunlight filtering through the curtains creating soft, diffused light, while subtle contrasts of light and shadow in the folds of the clothing enhance the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is fresh and elegant, harmoniously composed of mint green, cream white, beige, and floral warm tones, presenting a gentle, healing, and lifelike everyday scene. It feels like a real moment shot with amateur equipment, yet possesses professional-level compositional beauty and emotional expression, capturing moments of relaxation in a private space, full of artistic vibe and youthful vitality, allowing one to feel the peaceful and beautiful emotional resonance when sunlight pours into the room.",
