        {
          "id": "krea2-567c2bcf741b33f04b8964c3",
          "alias": "单女新娘连衣裙摄影棚忧伤拥抱",
          "prompt": "Her neck lines are graceful and smooth, and her overall look exudes the refined beauty of a classical oil painting; In the foreground is the bride's bust and the hem of the dress. The wedding dress fabric is smooth and crisp, hugging the curves of the body. The skirt naturally drapes from the waist to the floor, with slight pleats and flowing edges, hinting at the fabric's light texture; The medium focuses on the bride's upper body, head, and flowing veil, forming the core visual focal point of the scene. The veils layer upon layer like rippling water, creating spatial depth and dynamic beauty; The background is a pure and minimalist dark gray tone, with no unnecessary decorations or distracting elements. This minimalist background reinforces the main figure's presence and highlights the bride's flawless white wedding dress and veil through color contrast; The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the bride positioned slightly above the center of the frame, with the gaze naturally extending down to the hem of the skirt, creating a stable and rhythmic visual rhythm; The visuals use shallow depth of field, with just the right amount of background blur, keeping the audience's attention fully focused on the bride; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with light sources coming from the front and sides, creating subtle transitions between light and dark, while casting soft shadows on the sides of the body to enhance three-dimensional effects; The overall color scheme is mainly white and gray-white, complemented by a dark gray background to create a warm and cool contrast, creating a serene, sacred, romantic, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere; The image texture is delicate and realistic, with the high-end feel of professional studio shooting, as if it came from a top fashion magazine cover or an art photo book; The bride's posture and expression convey a sense of serene happiness, combining the solemn ritual of a wedding with the poetry and freedom of her own heart; The entire scene is filled with the subtle charm of Eastern aesthetics and the classic aesthetics of Western wedding photography, combining modern simplicity with classical elegance, like a frozen dream painting; The cinematography is restrained yet precise, capturing the bride's softest and most genuine moments, which are highly emotional without much embellishment; The overall atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and far-reaching, as if time has frozen in this moment, leaving only her gentle dialogue with light and shadow, veils, and dreams; The entire image exudes a beauty that transcends reality—neither a noisy wedding scene nor a casual snapshot of daily life, but a highly artistic work born from careful planning and lighting design; It evokes the mist outside the church at dawn, the garden under the moonlight, or the metaphors of love and promise in poetry—every detail silently tells her unique story.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
