        {
          "id": "krea2-839db024a9830c9ab029f998",
          "alias": "单女和服庭院害羞坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Japanese kimono sits elegantly cross-legged on the wooden floor, her posture relaxed and natural, legs crossed, barefoot touching the ground, toes slightly curled, displaying a serene yet slightly shy Eastern aesthetic. Her kimono is pure white in color, covered with intricate hand-painted floral patterns, mainly dark blue, emerald green, and pink. The petals are layered and smooth, delicate in line, as if the fabric is bursting with the vitality of the four seasons; A bright vermilion obi belt is tied around her waist, creating a striking visual contrast with the white background and outlining her slender, graceful waistline. Her fingertips are long, her nails neatly trimmed, glowing with a faint pink sheen. The space she inhabits is a traditional Japanese wooden building corridor or tatami room, flanked by wide glass sliding doors made of dark brown natural wood, with clearly visible grain that exudes a rustic and steady atmosphere; Outside the door was a lush courtyard, lush and green. Sunlight filtered through the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the floor and creating a soft halo effect. The floor is a smooth, dark wood surface, with damp or reflective surfaces reflecting the figures' reflections, blurred and dreamy, like reflections on water, adding depth and poetry to the scene. The entire composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The background is blurred, and the green vegetation outside the window becomes a soft color transition, which neither overshadows the main focus nor reinforces the atmosphere of \"indoor tranquility and outdoor vitality.\" The light comes from naturally scattered light outside the window, slanting into the room from the right side, soft but not glaring, creating a lazy, tranquil, and peaceful afternoon atmosphere. The overall color scheme is fresh and bright, with blue, green, white, and red intertwined, full of the freshness of a Japanese courtyard and the elegance of kimono art; The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, offering both the transparency of bright areas and the flexible texture of shadowed areas, enhancing the three-dimensionality and realism of the image. The image conveys a Zen beauty that escapes the hustle and bustle and returns to inner peace, as if time has frozen in this moment, with only the wind passing through the bamboo curtain, the rustling of leaves, and the delicate breathing of a woman gently brushing the fan surface—this is a cherished moment of tranquility in daily life, a moment where art and life merge, and a genuine and emotionally rich Eastern aesthetic scene captured by amateur photographers with ordinary cameras, full of respect and delicate expression of tradition, nature, and inner emotions.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
