        {
          "id": "krea2-80a74c495b6a3ceb8ae9bea8",
          "alias": "室内媚态手持物",
          "prompt": "The headboard is a pure white upcycling design, and on the right side, a warm yellow headlamp emits a soft halo, illuminating parts of the wall and bedding; The sheets and bedding are slightly messy and naturally wrinkled, suggesting a casual state from a recent rest or before a shoot; The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying a dominant visual position. At the same time, layered shadows are cast on clothes and bedding, enhancing the sense of depth; The atmosphere is tranquil and comfortable, carrying the laziness and spontaneity of a private space. It combines the casualness of daily life with a subtle artistic beauty, as if capturing the most authentic moment when afternoon sunlight streams through the curtains into the room, evoking a sense of tranquility, warmth, and a subtle sensuality that is barely noticeable.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
