        {
          "id": "krea2-8c2f9c00581ac29372918f46",
          "alias": "单女门忧伤倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "The exposed skin on her left shoulder glowed softly under the glow; In the foreground, the slightly slanted contour of her head and the edge of her sleeves form a visual guide converging toward the center of the composition; In the middle is the wooden door frame she leans on. On the left is a translucent glass window lattice, faintly revealing a faint greenery outside; on the right is a dark brown wooden frame divided into regular geometric patterns, creating a sense of spatial depth; The background is completely hidden in heavy shadows, with only faint warm light left behind the figure, outlining a hazy human figure and emphasizing the subject's prominence; The composition uses an asymmetrical third-division method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, the left window frame extends to the edge to form a stable frame, and the blank space on the right side enhances the sense of breathability; The use of light and shadow is extremely restrained, with only soft natural light slanting in through the left window, while the rest of the area is enveloped in low-saturation, cool-toned shadows. The overall atmosphere is as tranquil and secluded as an ink painting, carrying the wabi-sabi feeling and poetic loneliness found in classical Eastern aesthetics; The image tones are mainly dark brown, gray-blue, and dark red. The color saturation is relatively low but rich in layers, presenting the unique grainy texture and slight noise typical of film cameras. It feels like shooting with an old-fashioned rangefinder on a cloudy afternoon, capturing a realistic life atmosphere and hand-graded color grading traces. It avoids excessive sharpening or post-processing retouching, emphasizes true texture and emotional expression under natural light, and creates a gentle melancholy and eternal serene artistic atmosphere hidden in corners forgotten by time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
