        {
          "id": "krea2-7b29f4a4a704ba52e8426f11",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the spacious hall of a modern transportation hub, wearing a delicate and elegant off-white vintage-style dress with puffy puff sleeves on the shoulders, a square neckline, and a delicate silver embroidered butterfly and vine patterns on the chest. The skirt is light and flowing, layered with a soft plush texture that glows gently under natural light. adding a touch of liveliness and playfulness. She wore a simple yet exquisite pearl pendant necklace, a small, three-dimensional floral design that perfectly complemented the overall outfit. Her hands gently held a small smartphone, with colorful cartoon patterns printed on the case, creating an interesting contrast with her elegant attire. It's as if waiting for a moment to capture or a silent conversation. In the foreground is her slightly bent arm and the phone tightly gripped in her hand. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background and environment, highlighting the clarity and presence of the subject. In the background is a large indoor space, with smooth gray marble tiles on the floor reflecting the soft glow of the ceiling lights. In the distance, blurred glass curtain walls, metal frame structures, and faint silhouettes of people can be seen, creating a tranquil atmosphere amid the city's bustle. The composition uses a diagonal guide, with light from above and the front side, soft and even, without strong shadows. The subtle pink blush adds a touch of touch. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, creating a fresh, pure, and slightly artistic visual experience. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and tranquil, as if capturing a gentle moment of brief rest in a busy city, combining the casual feeling of daily life with the delicate emotional expression reminiscent of artistic photography. The entire scene feels as if shot with a regular digital camera under natural light, preserving authentic texture details and slight noise rather than the overly perfect professional studio shoots. It presents a real, intimate, and lifelike image quality, allowing viewers to feel the protagonist's inner softness and tranquility, as well as the unique atmosphere of enjoying a moment of tranquility in a bustling world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
