        {
          "id": "krea2-0c7bf9aa802dba29550f362c",
          "alias": "单女灰外套雪地坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black sofa in the corner, her makeup exquisite, her right shoulder slightly tilted, and her left hand gently clutching a fluffy, thick gray-white faux fur coat. The coat's surface is fine and soft with deep gray spots, like a lazy arctic fox in winter snow. The layers of fur on the cuffs and neckline are distinct and three-dimensional. She wears a bright red turtleneck bodysuit underneath, creating a strong color contrast with the fur coat. She wears black fishnet stockings, with tiny, shiny decorations faintly visible around her ankles. A corner of black pants peeks out from the edge of the sofa beside her, with a pale yellow directional particleboard wall facing two vertically intersecting sides. The wood shavings are clearly visible, creating a rustic industrial atmosphere. In the corner, a white power outlet quietly fits into the wooden structure, with soft light streaming down from the upper left of the frame, casting subtle shadows between the folds of the fur coat to enhance the texture layers. The overall composition uses a close-up perspective, with the figure occupying most of the space, standing slightly to the right and leaning forward slightly toward the camera. In the foreground is her fur coat and some fishnet stockings on her legs; in the middle is her torso and the edge of the sofa; in the background, a complete wooden wall forms a simple and powerful spatial framework. The light and shadow are soft and directional, and the warm tones create a cozy, lazy, and slightly fashion-forward atmosphere. The entire photo presents a daily yet highly artistic effect, as if capturing real moments of life in a minimalist studio or creative space, with a casual street fashion vibe. It retains the refined makeup and styling that brings a sense of sophistication, giving a sense of relaxed yet carefully crafted lifestyle.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
