        {
          "id": "krea2-5babaddb8ec8161ad2c42828",
          "alias": "单女全裸床害羞躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up photo of a gentle and intimate indoor scene features a woman lying on her side on the bed, her head slightly tilted back against a soft, fluffy white pillow. Her fingers stretch naturally, nails neatly trimmed and painted with pale pink or nude nail polish, fingertips slightly curved, presenting a vivid posture of wanting to speak but holding back, shyly hiding a smile—both hiding a secret surprise and enjoying the sweet awkwardness of being captured. She wore a loose black-and-white geometric homewear made of soft and comfortable fabric, composed of fine lines and abstract elements like diamonds and waves. Under soft lighting, it created an elegant visual rhythm and harmoniously unified with her serene expression. Rich in detail and tactile; and some shoulder and neck lines, with shallow depth of field treatment to blur the background, thereby highlighting the emotional expression of the subject; The background is a blurred white bedding and walls, with a single and pure color tone, free from cluttered elements that distract the view, creating a sense of tranquility, safety, and privacy. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle to create a strong sense of intimacy and immersive experience, while diagonal clothing patterns guide the visual flow toward the center. Then it naturally transitions to her hands that hide her smile, extending to her relaxed shoulders and collar, and finally returning to the soft white light in the background, forming a smooth and layered viewing flow. The lighting atmosphere is presented as soft and even natural light or indoor soft lighting, with the light source coming from the left front of the figure to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality, while avoiding harsh highlights or heavy shadows. The overall light is as warm and delicate as dawn, giving the image a warm, healing, and tranquil atmosphere. A touch of pink nail polish creates a fresh, clean, everyday yet artistically beautiful look. The entire image exudes a sense of realism from \"amateur equipment\"—without excessive sharpening or post-processing filters, as if captured casually with a phone but full of emotional tension. It combines the warmth of daily life with subtle psychological states and aesthetic value, allowing one to feel the characters' inner joy, shyness, and ease, like a gentle portrait frozen in time.",
