        {
          "id": "krea2-d7ccd6f92d94d1844fb262e9",
          "alias": "单女白T恤沙发俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a wooden armchair, wearing a white printed T-shirt and light blue denim suspender shorts, her posture relaxed and relaxed, fingertips slightly raised, revealing a playful and serene expression unique to youth; Add a touch of softness and vividness; The foreground focuses on her legs and feet, with delicate and fair skin that appears warm and translucent under soft light. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, naturally overlapping the edge of the chair, with her toes slightly curled, hinting at a relaxed homely atmosphere; The center features the seats themselves, with a dark brown solid wood frame paired with an off-white suede cushion. The cushion is covered with a plush blanket featuring blue and white striped star-dot patterns. The blanket edges are fluffy and soft, with clearly visible grain, creating a warm and comfortable home feel. The background is a bright and transparent indoor space. On the left is a white sheer curtain with lace trim, with sunlight filtering through the curtain gaps forming soft diffused light spots. On the right is a light-wood cutout grille side table, on which sits a classic-style metal desk lamp. The lampshade is made of off-white cotton-linen material, with a finely carved lamp base and a vintage copper-gold lamp post, giving the overall design elegance without being ostentatious. The entire composition uses a medium to close-up angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, body slightly angled to the side but head facing forward, forming a stable visual center. The foreground legs extend to the bottom of the frame, with extremely delicate light and shadow treatment. The main light source comes from the left front, creating natural transitions of light and shadow on the sofa, floor, and clothing. The floor is made of light gray marble tiles that reflect faint light and enhance the sense of spatial depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of life and a sense of homely happiness. The color palette is mainly warm white, accented by denim blue, wood brown, and metallic gold, creating a harmonious and unified color without losing subtle details; The visual guidance path starts with the slippers, naturally ascends along the legs to the waist, creating a layered emotional resonance; The visuals present a realistic texture reminiscent of \"everyday amateur equipment shooting\"—slight noise and natural depth blur are not deliberately pursued for professional effect, but rather enhance the authenticity and intimacy of life documentation. It is neither an overly retouched commercial blockbuster nor a cold, mechanical AI-generated image. Instead, it quietly freezes the poetry and beauty of ordinary life into this frame, allowing viewers to feel the tenderness and ease of moments belonging to youth, home, and self.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
