        {
          "id": "krea2-eec06bd545542167de669cc7",
          "alias": "单女灰衬衫街道忧伤蹲持包",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted on a damp asphalt surface, wearing a loose light gray-blue short-sleeved shirt paired with light blue denim shorts, white platform sneakers with beige soles and white mid-calf socks, and a cream-white quilted handbag on her shoulder, adorned with gold metal fasteners. The overall look presented a fresh and natural street casual style. She leaned forward slightly, her right knee bent to support the ground, her left hand gently gripping a slender dry branch. The tip of the branch lightly tapped into a small puddle ahead. The water surface rippled concentrically from the disturbance, reflecting the sky and the blurry shadows of the surrounding trees, with a few fallen leaves floating in particular. The foreground shows her half-squatting body, shoes, and the edge of the water touched by the dry branch in her hand. The composition is shot from a slightly overhead angle, placing the figure slightly to the left of the center of the frame. The background consists of a gray asphalt road extending into the distance, dotted with several round manhole covers, and the outline of vehicle tires faintly visible in the distance, suggesting this is a city street corner or parking lot setting. It then extends to the open road in the background, creating a sense of spatial depth. In terms of light and shadow, the light is soft and even, like scattered light from cloudy days or after rain, without strong shadows, and the wrinkles and textures of the clothes are clearly visible. The atmosphere presents a sense of tranquility, a touch of melancholy, yet poetic in life, as if capturing a moment of an ordinary afternoon encounter on the street. It features the grainy texture and warm tones unique to film photography, balancing the casual realism of everyday life with artistic compositional beauty and emotional tension, evoking youth, loneliness, exploration, or momentary pauses in philosophical moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
