        {
          "id": "krea2-0e356211bdb92ad76cfb6d80",
          "alias": "单女和服摄影棚严肃倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman is the absolute subject of the painting, dressed in a traditional kimono with a pure white base and deep blue abstract floral patterns. In the foreground, she grips the handle tightly with both hands, her left thumb lightly resting on the handle, while her right hand steadily supports the lower end. Her fingers are long and fair, her nails neatly trimmed, and red string tassels hanging in front of her belt, forming a focal point; The middle shot focuses on her shoulders, neck, and kimono collar, where the fabric naturally drapes along the body's lines, with light and shadow forming interplay of light and shadow on its surface, highlighting the garment's three-dimensional effect and texture; The background is a blurred outdoor shaded environment, where dense green trees appear and disappear in soft out-of-focus light spots, forming a hazy green-toned space. In the distance, faint tree trunk outlines and mottled light and shadows can be faintly seen, creating a sense of depth and a natural atmosphere; The entire composition uses a close-up perspective, with the figure occupying most of the space. The slightly right-leaning body posture creates a dynamic balance with the direction of the gaze. The visual guide line extends vertically down from the umbrella handle to the hand, then stretches horizontally through red string tassels to the belt area. The light and shadow treatment is meticulous: diffuse natural light from the upper left filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a soft and warm overall light with a slight backlighting effect, creating a golden halo around the edges of the figure's silhouette, enhancing the sense of depth and dreamlike atmosphere. The atmosphere presents a tranquil, poetic, and slightly nostalgic Eastern aesthetic, combining the solemn elegance of classical kimono culture with modern people's longing for a leisurely lifestyle. The overall color palette is mainly white, blue, and green, complemented by red cord as color contrast, creating a fresh and elegant yet vibrant visual experience; Image texture pursues realistic and delicate film graininess or the soft focus effect of digital cameras simulating film, avoiding excessive sharpening. The style leans toward everyday amateur equipment rather than professional studio work, featuring asymmetrical composition, natural imperfections, and random light and shadow, emphasizing realism and a sense of life rather than flawless commercial photography; The overall image conveys a narrative sense of a \"spring courtyard encounter,\" evoking scenes from classical poetry such as \"holding an umbrella to listen to the rain\" or \"resting among flowers,\" full of Eastern charm and humanistic warmth. It is suitable both for art photo collection display and as cultural aesthetic sharing content on social media platforms.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
