        {
          "id": "krea2-1df05880d57da912e7e8e5eb",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道专注持相机",
          "prompt": "A female photographer, dressed in a loose off-white cotton shirt and a dark green scarf, is focused on holding a black DSLR camera in the distance, steadily supporting the camera body with both hands. The brown leather strap naturally hangs over her chest, and the camera is equipped with a large-aperture telephoto lens with the lens cap removed, presenting a photographer who embodies both professionalism and passion; The foreground focuses on her arms, camera, and camera details. The cuffs are naturally wrinkled, the camera's metallic texture contrasts warmly with leather straps, while the background features mottled, aged alley walls, yellowed and faded, faintly showing peeling poster marks and rough brick textures. Wooden beams or barbed wire structures stretching diagonally above create a sense of depth in soft light, while the ground is a path scattered with rubble and dust, adding a rough and authentic atmosphere. The composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, with the figure occupying two-thirds of the right side of the frame, the body in a diagonally tilted posture, and the camera lens pointing directly to the outside of the frame, creating suspense and imaginative space; At the same time, shallow depth of field is used to blur the background to enhance the subject's presence. Light and shadow come from natural light from the upper side, softening the shadow edges and illuminating her shoulder and neck lines and the materiality of her clothing. The warm yellow tone dominates the image's atmosphere, giving the scene a nostalgic film texture. The entire image exudes a unique charm that blends artistic retro vibes with street documentary aesthetics, as if capturing a moment of pause during a trip. It combines the everyday life atmosphere with the poetic tension of artistic creation. The image is delicate and gentle yet powerful. It conveys a state of life where free exploration coexists with inner tranquility.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
