        {
          "id": "krea2-f62ad49257d3d53bb7999bb7",
          "alias": "单女制服庭院困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A figure wearing a classic Japanese sailor-collar school uniform stands with his back to the camera in the courtyard, his hands elegantly crossed above his head, as if welcoming the first ray of morning sunlight or relieving the fatigue of the day, his posture full of youthful energy and a sense of serene ritual; She slung a dark brown vintage leather backpack across her shoulder, with exquisite accessories. The pleats are clear and natural, presenting delicate texture layers under soft light; In the middle shot, her upright body silhouette and school uniform details are shown: a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a navy collar and skirt is vividly contrasted and harmonious, with the fabric texture clearly visible; The background features blurred wooden traditional Japanese architectural eaves and lush, lush green trees. The leaves create mottled light spots against the backlight, creating a warm and hazy atmosphere; The entire composition uses medium to long shots, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, naturally guiding the gaze to her raised arm and the bright light source above her head, creating a strong visual focal point and emotional resonance; Light comes from behind the figure, with strong backlighting outlining her silhouette and creating a dreamy \"Jesus light\" effect. The overall color scheme leans toward a mix of warm yellow and cool teal-green, with strong contrasts of light and shadow that are gentle and not glaring; The atmosphere is tranquil and healing, filled with the lazy summer afternoon campus vibe, combining the pure beauty of youthful campus life with the delicacy and storytelling unique to Japanese art photography; The image style simulates the realism of amateur equipment, with slight noise and motion blur. Color saturation is moderate yet still layered, edges transition naturally, without excessive sharpening or AI compositing, presenting an immersive and tangible emotional expression that makes one feel as if they are in a quiet Japanese town courtyard, experiencing poetic moments where youth, freedom, and nature intertwine.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
