        {
          "id": "krea2-1292290bc0d7064c8fd6e0c3",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤厨房愤怒跪伸展",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a light gray fabric sofa, her body slightly turned to the right side of the frame, arms raised high above her head, hands clasped behind her head, stretching her body as if just waking from sleep or stretching in the morning on a lazy afternoon. She wears a simple pure black round-neck short-sleeve T-shirt, paired with washed blue denim shorts, white cotton socks, legs naturally bent in a kneeling position, right knee lightly touching the edge of the sofa, left knee slightly forward, overall posture full of life and youthful energy; The sofa's soft suede texture with slight folds and natural hanging edges, and the front floor is paved with vintage patterned tiles, featuring yellow-brown geometry and flowers intertwined, adding a cozy home feel. The center is the kitchen countertop area, with a neat and clean wooden countertop, displaying everyday items such as stainless steel kettles, glass cups, ceramic mugs, and wooden cutting boards. Below, white cabinets have black metal handles, and the cabinet door gaps reveal internal storage space. On the left, the built-in white microwave oven is clearly visible, and small items like tissue boxes and seasoning bottles are scattered across the countertop. On the background wall hangs a row of black wrought iron hooks, neatly covered with spatulas, strainers, wooden spatulas, soup ladles, and other utensils. Below the hooks is a white checkered tile wall. reflecting soft light; Further away, on the feature wall, there are multi-layered natural wood-colored open shelves, arranged with dried bouquets, ceramic jars, glass bottles, coffee machines, decorative letters \"S\", vintage photo frames, books, small ornaments, and more, creating a strong aesthetic atmosphere for everyday living; Two exposed bulb-shaped chandeliers hang from the ceiling, emitting a warm yellow glow. In the right corner stands a vintage bronze desk lamp, its gentle light casting light on the shoulders and tabletop, creating a contrast between light and shadow. The entire composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear more upright and elegant. The composition uses the figure as the central line extending into the depths of the background, using the edge of the sofa to guide the gaze upward to the raised arm, then naturally transitioning into the chandelier and shelves in the background, with the visual focus gradually increasing; The use of light and shadow is delicate and soft, with warm glow from the ceiling chandelier and desk lamp intertwining, creating a natural transition of light and dark on the skin, clothing folds, and furniture surfaces. The shadows are soft and not glaring, creating a warm atmosphere as if morning or afternoon sunlight streaming through the window into the room; The color palette is mainly low-saturation warm brown, off-white, and gray-blue, accented with a touch of deep black and metallic copper, presenting an overall Japanese artistic style of home scenes. It combines the authentic warmth of everyday life with refinement and artistry. The visuals are peaceful, healing, and full of ritual in life. You can almost hear the faint sound of water, wind chimes, or birds outside the window, allowing you to feel the beauty and composure of ordinary days. It captures the authentic texture and humanistic warmth of amateur equipment photography. The camera captures a moment of comfort for an ordinary girl at home, without any filters, yet full of emotional tension and visual poetry.",
