        {
          "id": "krea2-22a29b1d41f6de0839ba46b3",
          "alias": "单女公寓困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "She slightly turned her body, her right hand gently resting on her waist, her left hand naturally hanging at her side. Her posture was relaxed and confident, her legs long and well-proportioned, her skin fair and delicate, and her overall body proportions well-proportioned, radiating a charm that blended youthful energy with mature charm. In the foreground is the white marble floor where she stands, smooth and flat, reflecting a soft reflection of the surrounding environment. A golden metal decorative strip along the edge of the floor visually contrasts with the dark gray counter; The middle view features a multi-tiered glass display case extending behind her, displaying a dazzling array of desserts including macarons, cupcakes, cream puffs, and more, arranged in vibrant colors like a rainbow. Each dessert is placed on a separate tray with clearly visible labels, and light casts upward from inside the cabinet, giving the desserts an enticing sheen. The background is the interior space of the store, with walls decorated with light beige marble textures, topped by a black menu board with simple and modern fonts. In the distance, you can faintly see the outlines of professional equipment such as coffee machines. The overall color scheme is mainly warm gray, off-white, and gold, creating a warm and elegant atmosphere; The composition uses the rule of thirds, with figures positioned on the right third of the canvas, and display cabinets running horizontally through the center of the image, forming a stable visual support; then extending to the background spatial layers; The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents soft, evenly diffused indoor light, with the main light sources coming from the ceiling and the built-in display cabinet light strips. Light shines simultaneously from above and sides, creating soft transitional shadows on the figure's back and legs. The floor reflection enhances the sense of spatial depth. The overall color scheme leans toward warm pastels, creating a dreamy and sweet afternoon atmosphere. It feels like being in a quiet corner full of healing and lifestyle aesthetics. It combines the refined order of commercial space with the relaxed and comfortable daily life. The entire scene resembles a real life photo taken with amateur equipment, yet it contains meticulous composition and artistic aesthetics, capturing extraordinary beauty in an ordinary moment—a gentle moment of pause and gazing into the world of desserts, both a visual delight and an emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
