        {
          "id": "krea2-6fdcb130ac8dd609546400df",
          "alias": "单女灰外套机场沉思站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an open area outside the modern airport terminal. She wears a thick dark gray long wool coat layered with a light gray knit sweater underneath, and a classic black beret. Her hands elegantly hold a pair of black sunglasses and a smartphone, her fingertips painted with delicate white nail art, and a simple silver ring on her left ring finger; At the waist slung a small square bag with a black diamond pattern chain, featuring the Chanel double C metal logo, with the strap naturally hanging down one side of the leg. Her expression carries a hint of contemplation and gentle anticipation from a journey, as if she is waiting for a flight or has just arrived at her destination. In the foreground are several white metal railings, forming simple lines on the left side of the painting to guide the viewer to focus on the subject. The floor is paved with light-colored concrete, reflecting sunlight and creating a contrast of light and shadow. In the middle of the ground, blurred vehicle outlines and distant waiting area seats are visible, while the background features towering, complex steel roof trusses and translucent glass skylights. Sunlight filters through the structural gaps from above, creating a backlit halo behind the figures, while casting clear and layered shadows on the ground. The entire composition uses a center-to-right composition, with the figures occupying the golden ratio area. The shallow depth of field blurs background details and strengthens the main visual focus. The light is strong natural light in the early morning or afternoon, entering the frame diagonally from above and behind the figure, creating a backlighting effect that creates a warm, tranquil, and slightly urban atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray, black, and white, accented with warm yellow and sunlight. The color saturation is moderate, presenting a low-key, sophisticated yet lifelike visual beauty. It combines cinematic storytelling with the delicate texture of fashionable photography, as if shot by an amateur DSLR under natural light, capturing a quiet and storytelling moment on a modern journey.",
