        {
          "id": "krea2-4adb7fb18e44e7fa80ac08f2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公寓困倦坐盘发",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on a pure, white salt flat or snowy ground, wearing a light, flowing white ballet dress whose hem layers and clouds spread out like clouds. The translucent sheer fabric glows softly in the sunlight, and the skirt is adorned with delicate ruffles and pleated details, adding a dreamy softness; At the top of the bun is a large white bow, creating a striking contrast and harmonious unity with the overall look; She lowered her head and gazed at her own hands, as if carrying a serene melancholy aura; She wears a pair of light pink ballet flats, adorned with delicate bows, with the edge of her flesh-colored stockings faintly visible at the ankles. Her posture is naturally relaxed yet full of artistic tension. Her legs are slightly crossed and curled, her body leaning forward, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility or immersed in her own world; The foreground is the white salt flats or snowy ground where she sits, with a rough surface with fine grains and reflections, and under sunlight, bright highlights appear, subtly contrasting with the shadows of her skirt; The middle shot shows her complete figure and costume details, clearly visible from her feet to the top of her head, with dynamic lines and rich light and shadow variations on the dress; The background is a vast, highly saturated blue sky, with no clouds or other distractions. This pure blue not only enhances the visual impact of the painting but also creates an ethereal, surreal, and even slightly lonely atmosphere; The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly above the center of the frame, using strong color contrast—pure white versus deep blue—to create a visual focal point, while the large blank background enhances spatial and depth impressions; The visual guide naturally extends from the curved edge of the skirt, the lines of the legs, and the shadows of the ground, then flows down from the head to the feet, forming a complete narrative loop; In terms of light and shadow, intense sunlight pours in from above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow around the figure's body. The illuminated edges of the skirt appear crystal clear, while the lower body and the floor are projected clearly, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality; The overall atmosphere combines fairy-tale dreaminess, ballet-like elegance, and a touch of lonely poetry, as if she were a fairy stepping out of a fantasy story, or a soul searching for a moment of tranquility in the modern city; The image texture leans toward professional studio-level delicate processing, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, natural exposure transitions, and uneven light distribution. This gives the entire image cinematic artistic expression while maintaining a warm, everyday warmth. The color tone is mainly cool tones, creating an emotional tone that is calm yet warm, conveying a sense of tranquility, purity, and freedom.",
