        {
          "id": "krea2-c76785aa2e57a7684ce1161d",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫商店冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner seat of a ramen shop full of retro Japanese charm. She wears a loose, fluffy off-white turtleneck knit sweater and soft pink-purple wide-leg pants. In front of her was a rounded wooden dining table, white as snow, edges wrapped in a warm natural wood tone. On the table sat a large white bowl filled with cold noodles, its rim painted with traditional red patterns. Beside it was a small dish of dark brown dipping sauce, a plate of golden crispy fried foods, and several bottles of Japanese-style seasoning in various colors—red, green, and white lids arranged in staggered fashion, forming a visual focal point. The red leather high chair she sits in has smooth lines, a soft glow on the surface, and a slightly tilted backrest that naturally interacts with her posture. The background is the interior wall of the shop, made from light brown wooden panels joined together. On the wall are several yellowed-bordered Japanese menu papers, clearly written with words like \"Gomoku Cold Chuka Soba\" and \"decorative characterしdecorative characterそば\" and the prices. In the upper right corner, there's also a sign reading \"Otsumami please!\" Below, faint signs of power outlets and old-fashioned switch panels can be seen, revealing the store's years of operation. The left window is fitted with red and white shutters, allowing sunlight to stream through the gaps and cast diagonal striped light and shadows on the floor and tabletop. A small sink is embedded below the windowsill, adding a touch of life. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, and the empty chair in the blank right area visually balances with the extended line of the tabletop. The light mainly comes from natural light outside the window, supplemented by soft indoor ceiling light. The fluffy details of sweaters and the folds of pants are delicately presented; The food is rich and tempting, the cold noodle broth is translucent, the fried items glisten with oil, and the seasoning bottles reflect a glossy sheen. The atmosphere is warm and healing, combining the lively and nostalgic atmosphere of a Japanese shop, while the relaxed expressions and soft tones of the characters convey the relaxation and beauty of everyday life. The entire scene resembles a film photo gently touched by time, with a slight grainy texture and warm filter, as if it came from an artistic short about the slow-paced life of city dwellers. It is both authentic and full of artistic appeal, evoking the mood and story of her current moment, and feeling the simple happiness and everyday warmth that food brings.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
