        {
          "id": "krea2-b84e74e05ebd38301a246559",
          "alias": "单女灰内衣摄影棚愤怒蹲戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman squats naturally and relaxedly at the edge of a wooden windowsill, her body slightly turned to the side, her head slightly raised to look back at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer; She wore a simple yet figure-hugging light gray lingerie set. The top featured thin straps to outline a full and flexible bust line, while the bottom was high-waisted, low-slit underwear that highlighted her long, well-proportioned legs and rounded hip curves. The overall material had a matte cotton texture, which was non-glare and glaring in soft light. Faint shadows can be seen in the hollows of her abdomen and waist, enhancing the sense of depth; In the background is a large window, outside which is a lush green landscape with a blurred effect. The window frame is made of dark brown wood that spans the upper part of the frame. The window glass lets in abundant diffused sunlight, bathing the entire scene in a uniform and warm golden glow. Meanwhile, the window area is slightly overexposed by strong light, creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere; The composition uses a mid-to-close angle, with the main subject positioned to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left so the gaze naturally extends to the greenery outside the window, creating visual balance and a sense of breathability; The lighting and shadow atmosphere blends soft indoor light with outdoor natural light. Sunlight slants from the upper left, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow on her back, shoulder blades, and hips. The overall color scheme leans toward warm off-white and light gray, low-saturation combinations, creating a quiet, private, and slightly artistic home afternoon scene; The image texture is as delicate as film photography, with slight grainy noise and color gradation, simulating the realism of amateur equipment rather than overly sharp or flawless professional studio shoots; The air seems to be filled with a faint floral scent and the scent of wooden furniture. The entire image conveys a serene, gentle, and slightly shy everyday aesthetic, preserving the natural curves and sensual charm of human beauty, while conveying a lifelike poetry through environment and posture that requires no artificial adornment.",
