        {
          "id": "krea2-1308fea2935151afe658e81c",
          "alias": "单女米西装室内愤怒倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman elegantly leans on a modern metal-framed chair, wearing a loose camel wool blazer paired with a black off-shoulder knit tank top, matching shorts, and platform black loafers paired with black mid-calf socks. The black sock edges at the ankles contrast visually with the metal buckles on the upper, while the chair's red leather cushion and silver metal legs form a geometric structure interwoven with warm and cool tones. The right wall and the edge of the door frame are faintly visible, further defining the space and enhancing the sense of depth in the composition. The composition combines the rule of thirds with diagonals. The figure's body extends diagonally across the right half of the painting, while the left side is blank to create a sense of breath. The metal chair legs and the wood grain on the floor form a stable visual baseline. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft natural light slanting in from the left front, while subtle shadow transitions are created on the right. The wood grain on the floor and the wall joints also show delicate light and shadow variations. The overall lighting is warm but not glaring, giving the painting a quiet, private, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by camel, black, off-white, and natural wood tones, complemented by a red cushion as a visual focal point. The low-saturation color scheme creates a premium texture and a calm atmosphere; Metal chair legs and wall lines serve as auxiliary guiding lines, presenting a professional studio-level texture while retaining the real graininess and slight noise typical of everyday equipment. It simulates the delicate performance of real film or high-sensitivity cameras in low-light indoor environments, giving the images both exquisite and lifelike artistic appeal.",
