        {
          "id": "krea2-cddc909018161036219e0752",
          "alias": "单女紫西装雪地困倦自拍",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman taking a selfie on a snowy plain, wearing a white ski helmet and wide pink reflective goggles. The glasses clearly reflect the outline of her phone shot against the surrounding snowy scene. She wears a purple ski suit with an iridescent sheen, showing a dreamy gradient in the sunlight. The fabric shimmers with a metallic sheen of purple, blue, and pink as it refracts light, with the backdrop being a vast, boundless snowy field. In the distance, rolling snow hills and snow-covered rock outlines can be seen. The sky is a clear, pure blue with almost no clouds. Sunlight pours in from above, creating soft, even, diffused light. The overall composition adopts minimalism, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. The middle scene features snowy terrain and clothing details, while the far view features blurred snowy hills and the skyline, creating an immersive spatial atmosphere. The light and shadow atmosphere is cold yet bright, with strong sunlight reflecting the snow creating highlight areas. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones. However, by introducing a warm contrast through iridescent materials and the pink-purple tones of the goggles, the image is given a modern and fashionable feel. The image style strongly features a personalized photographic aesthetic, reminiscent of amateur equipment shooting, with rich details yet artistic expression. The images convey the freedom and vitality of winter outdoor sports, while also revealing the urbanites' integrated attitude toward fashion, protection, and self-expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
