        {
          "id": "krea2-f273b6a68ec9124706e4892a",
          "alias": "单女绿西装水边专注坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone quietly on a mossy stone bank by the stream, dressed in a soft olive green loose suit. The fabric drapes naturally, with delicate pleats at the cuffs and waist. Her bare feet lightly touch the damp riverbank, her posture relaxed and focused. The flesh is bright and juicy, with slight dirt marks along the rim, hinting at natural wildness and the sense of life; In the middle is a slippery stone bank covered with thick moss, lush and lush green, mixed with scattered fallen leaves and tiny wild grass. The stone surface has a warm luster from long-term soaking, and the edges show a smooth curve formed by water flow; The background is a wide and deep stream, with shimmering water reflecting the blurred outlines and mottled shadows of the trees along the shore. The shadow edges transition smoothly, without harsh cuts; The overall atmosphere is serene and far-reaching, full of poetry, featuring the grainy texture unique to film photography and natural tones with low color saturation, presenting a visual experience where Japanese artistic aesthetics and Eastern Zen blend together. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, accompanied only by the wind brushing over the water and the rustling among the leaves. The images are filled with the poetry of everyday life and the accumulation of inner spirit, evoking a moment of inner clarity and self-dialogue away from the noise.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
