        {
          "id": "krea2-6f9680359b10b7eaf8bdf6b8",
          "alias": "单女庭院戏谑行走注视",
          "prompt": "As if immersed in the joy of interacting with the little animal before them, her hands gently stretched forward, as if teasing or preparing to pet the kitten beside her. In front of her is a brightly furred orange tabby cat, its back to the camera, tail raised high and slightly curved, walking lightly toward the left side of the frame. Its posture is lively and lively, its four paws resting on the slightly weathered concrete ground, leaving a faint shadow. The ground is an old-style cement with a greenish hue, covered with mottled light and shadows cast by dense tree canopies, resembling a flowing green watercolor painting. The interplay of light and shadow adds layers and a serene poetic charm to the entire scene. On the left side of the foreground is a vintage wire flowerpot filled with greenery, with thick, vibrant leaves that look vibrant in the sunlight; A little farther away, an electric bike covered by a pink awning was parked, with a yellow plastic storage box beside it, hinting that this was a courtyard or alley corner in an ordinary residential area. In the background, faintly visible are several gray-white-walled old buildings, a half-open iron door, and a clothesline hanging by the wall. In the distance, there are blurred outlines of motorcycles and scattered household items. These elements together create a real, simple, and lively everyday space. The composition uses a slightly overhead perspective, placing the girl and cat slightly to the right of the center to form a focal point. Meanwhile, plants and shadows in the foreground guide the viewer's gaze slowly from left to right. The light comes from the upper left afternoon sun, warm and bright but not glaring, cleverly illuminating the figures and cats, while casting varying shadows of trees on the ground, creating a lazy and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. The overall color saturation is moderate, mainly warm yellow tones, paired with turquoise backgrounds and dark shadows, presenting a fresh, natural, slightly film-like visual style. It feels like everyday moments captured with an old camera, carrying a touch of nostalgia and tenderness, capturing the purest and most innocent interaction between humans and pets, conveying a simple yet profound resonance and healing power of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
