        {
          "id": "krea2-eb16847b0cc8337b232fa3d0",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地冷淡坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone on a snow-covered seaside bench, wearing an off-white plush knit cardigan adorned with pale blue snowflakes and pink diamond patterns, paired with a pure white turtleneck underneath. She wears a dark gray-green pleated skirt and paired with thick-soled brown snow boots covered in snow, creating a look that is gentle and warmth for winter. Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of delicate pink and white flowers, the flowers just about to bloom but already showing the spirit of spring, forming a subtle contrast with the surrounding cold; She tilts her head slightly back to gaze at the boundless blue sky, as if silently embracing the moment when sunlight and wind and snow dance together; In the foreground is a snowy field glistening with sunlight, with delicate, fluffy snow layers slightly indented. The edges of her boots and the hem of her skirt are stained with fine snow foam, and beside her leans an elegant off-white canvas handbag, the strap hanging naturally, adding a touch of everyday life to the scene. In the center is a dark wooden bench, its surface showing mottled rust from years of wear, the legs partially covered by snow, a simple yet storytelling of the chair; In the distance, the vast blue sea stretches endlessly, shimmering where sea meets sky. In the distance, the rolling silhouettes of snow-capped mountains can be faintly seen, appearing especially sacred against the clear sky; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame, with the vast sky as a visual extension to emphasize the character's small yet free spirit; The visual guide extends upward from the direction of the character's head up to the sky, then naturally transitions from the bouquet in the hand to the lower right to the handbag, forming a soft and smooth narrative flow; The light comes from the upper right, representing bright daytime natural light, with soft shadows and a cool highlight, while preserving the authentic texture of the material. The overall atmosphere presents a \"winter healing\" tranquil beauty, combining the chill brought by biting ice and snow, yet full of vitality and hope through the characters' warm smiles, soft fabrics, and blooming flowers, like a silent poem blooming gently in the extreme cold; The color scheme is extremely meticulous, with large areas of pure sky blue and snow white setting the tone, and pink and gray in the characters' costumes as accents, which neither feel out of place nor balance the mood of the scene; The image quality pursues a realistic feel similar to amateur equipment shooting, with slight noise and film graininess, moderate color saturation with slight softening treatment, natural edge transitions, avoiding over-sharpening or post-processing retouching, creating a \"casual shot yet full of stories\" everyday aesthetic style, evoking the image of an ordinary girl strolling alone by the sea on a cold morning, capturing a precious moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
