        {
          "id": "krea2-c9d1c50a14a32cb2f656a414",
          "alias": "单女白T恤商店忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a simple and clean white short-sleeved T-shirt, her shoulder and neck lines soft, looking especially pure under the warm golden sunlight slanting in through the window, as if draped in a hazy glow. She lowered her head slightly, her fingers gliding lightly, her expression calm and immersed, as if completely immersed in a fleeting moment of tranquility in the digital world. The earphone cable gently slipped, hinting that she was building her own private space through music or sound. A stripe of red and white striped fabric drapes casually over her knees, possibly a garment or blanket, with softly pleated edges, visually echoing the beige woven round pouch in her hand, adding a sense of life and layers of detail. The foreground features a small reflection of her body and the phone screen, guiding the gaze to her focused expression; In the middle are the blue seat backrest she sits on and the light-colored armrest of the seat next to her on the right, with vague labels on the armrest and a blue fabric storage bag with cartoon patterns placed nearby. These everyday items together create a real, slightly messy yet lively public space atmosphere; In the background, the city street view seen through the car window is divided into several sections. The outlines of distant buildings blur, and faintly visible street shop signs with the words \"MELK\" and food patterns are faintly visible. The traces of vehicles are soft-focused, creating a dynamic, blurred sense of depth, as if time quietly passes outside the window, while she remains motionless. The entire composition uses a slanted composition, with the figure slightly offset to the right, combined with the geometric lines formed by the window frame, giving the scene a subtle sense of instability and narrative tension. Light comes from the upper left window, creating a strong backlight effect while casting soft shadows to create a warm yet slightly melancholic afternoon atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, balanced by cool tones like blue, white, and gray, presenting a film-like grainy texture and slightly overexposed edge blends, enhancing the poetic beauty of nostalgia and everyday life. The visual guidance path is clear: from hand movements in the foreground and phone screens, it ultimately leads to the blurred urban outline in the background, forming a spatial narrative rhythm that moves from near to far, from real to virtual. The entire image exudes a quiet, introspective, and slightly lonely aesthetic of life, like a snapshot of daily life forgotten in a corner of time, recording the moments modern people find a moment of peace amid the hustle and bustle of the city. It combines the genuine noise and color distortion of amateur camera photography with a sense of intimacy, while also embodying the atmosphere and emotional depth required for professional imagery.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
