        {
          "id": "krea2-0111888d2c5a28320810b72c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣竹林倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against an open vintage brown leather suitcase, wearing a loose, soft white knit sweater with a natural sliding shoulder revealing one side. She pairs a brownish-yellow plaid pleated mini skirt, white socks trimmed with delicate lace on her feet, and a fluffy, soft pink plush beret on top. She gently supports the edge of the suitcase with both hands, legs naturally folded and stretched, her posture relaxed yet full of youthful energy. The foreground focuses on her long, fair legs and sock details, as well as the pleated decorations draped over the deep blue-green velvet lining inside the suitcase, creating a visual focus and a soft transition; The middle ground shows her complete sitting posture and the structure of her suitcase, with metal rivets and wear marks clearly visible on the edges, hinting at a sense of time and travel memories; In the background, a corner of a Japanese-style tatami room is set with neatly laid light palm bamboo mats, edged with dark green geometric fabric strips. In the distance, you can faintly see the outlines of dark wooden furniture and vintage black radios or TVs. In the corner, a warm yellow beverage bottle is placed, creating a nostalgic and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, making viewers feel as if they are gazing at this person from above, while the suitcase frame forms a natural frame-like composition, with leg lines extending downward to enhance the sense of depth in the image. The visual guide is constructed by her raised arms, slanting body curves, and crossed leg directions, reinforcing the subject's presence. The lighting atmosphere presents a soft, warm indoor light, with the light source coming from the left front, casting subtle shadows on the right side of the suitcase and the floor to enhance the sense of depth; The overall color palette leans mainly toward warm gray and cream white, accented by pink hats and teal linings, creating a tranquil, healing, and slightly artistic retro atmosphere; The image texture is delicate and realistic, with a natural graininess and slight noise reminiscent of amateur equipment photography, rather than over-sharpened or perfectly polished smoothness in post-processing. It preserves the warmth and breathability of everyday life, as if capturing the moment when afternoon sunlight streams through the window lattice, just as you are about to set off or just return, resting briefly in your suitcase, filled with the poetry of everyday life and a gentle imagination of distant travel.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
