        {
          "id": "krea2-90ea4fbc2b184329cdd12ec7",
          "alias": "单女白制服室内微笑跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels in the center of an indoor scene filled with a strong Chinese New Year atmosphere. She wears a simple white short-sleeved school uniform top paired with a bright red pleated skirt, black stockings wrapping her slender legs, a gentle and sweet smile as she gazes back at the camera. Her right hand gently holds a string of bright red candied hawthorns, the crystal-clear sugar balls glistening enticingly under soft light. Her left hand rests naturally at her waist, her posture elegant yet slightly playful. Their surfaces are carved with traditional dragon and phoenix motifs and intricate geometric motifs. Under warm light, they reveal a hazy yet textured glow and shadow. Nearby, a small wooden tray holding golden ingot-shaped pastries, a partially hidden corner of a red sofa, and the edge of a wooden low table add a sense of life and depth to the space. The floor is covered with a deep red carpet featuring white triangular geometric patterns, harmonizing with the overall color scheme. The entire composition uses medium to near shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the visual center. At the same time, a foreground candle and background wall stickers form a richly layered three-dimensional spatial structure from front to back. The light comes from a soft, slightly left-leaning front source, while subtle shadow transitions between the hem, stockings, and the floor enhance the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and bright, with moderate saturation but strong color contrasts—the red and white tones contrast sharply against the light blue background, accented with orange fruits, highlighting the festive theme while retaining a touch of elegant artistic flair; The image texture is delicate and authentic, with rich and full details, resembling high-quality everyday portraits taken with a high-end digital camera or professional phone, combining artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life, conveying a unique emotional expression that blends youthful vitality with traditional culture.",
