        {
          "id": "krea2-26eac814a3957709e03b7cbc",
          "alias": "单女城市忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "Under the intense afternoon side light, a clear and dynamic silhouette is cast, with shadows extending from her body to the right, outlining the three-dimensional lines of her legs and the folds of her clothes; The middle ground is a blurred urban edge behind her, with sparse trees, low buildings, and faint industrial outlines visible in the distance. The colors are soft-focused into warm brown and gray-blue tones, creating a sense of spatial depth without overshadowing the main focus; The background is a vast, boundless pure blue sky, with no clouds or impurities, presenting a clear, ethereal, and slightly cool visual atmosphere that harmonizes with the cool tones of the characters' costumes; The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the character positioned slightly to the left of the frame, and the overall shot at a slightly upward angle, enhancing the character's youthful vitality and sense of freedom; The visual guide line naturally extends from the character's gesture of raising their hand to shield the sun, while the shadow lines on the ground cleverly guide the viewer's gaze downward, creating a visual rhythm that echoes the top and bottom; In terms of lighting and shadow, the strong direct afternoon sunlight creates a sharp, high-contrast effect. Light shines diagonally from the right front of the figure, casting thick, sharp shadows behind the figure and the ground, enhancing the spatial layers and drama of the scene; The atmosphere blends the pure romance of a youthful campus with the lonely poetry of the urban edge. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, complemented by red bows as visual anchors, creating an aesthetic that is both fresh and bright with a touch of melancholy. It feels like a photo taken with amateur equipment yet has a professional-grade texture, featuring slight film grain noise and soft-focus bokeh effects, simulating the warm mood captured by a real camera lens under natural light. The whole scene exudes the everyday story of \"sitting alone on the city wall after school.\" It combines the exquisite composition of artistic photography with a casual, everyday feel, making the figures seem to quietly emerge from an ordinary afternoon, carrying a touch of unspoken secrets and endless imagination.",
