        {
          "id": "krea2-c2da1587edb476e9adaf7e42",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林困倦躺摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman lying playfully and lazily on the floor covered with shiny iridescent plastic film, wearing a red, green, and white plaid Christmas-themed dress paired with white plush trim, wearing a matching plaid Christmas hat with a soft, fluffy brim, delicate and gentle makeup. Her left hand rests lightly on her chest, her right arm supports her body, her bare feet pressed together and raised high, toes slender and adorable, her overall pose full of youthful energy and festive charm. In the foreground is a large translucent plastic film with folds and undulating refracting, refracting a dreamy rainbow luster. Its surface reflects light with flowing, shifting blue-green and purple light spots, with a texture as crystal-clear as ice crystals or sheer gauze, adding a fairy-tale-like fantastical atmosphere. In the middle shot, she occupies the center of the composition, extending from the lower left corner to the right. Her body is slightly tilted to form a natural dynamic composition. The left leg is partially obscured by the foreground plastic film, while the right side reveals the lines of the arms and shoulders. On the left side of the background is a beautifully decorated white artificial Christmas tree, its branches and leaves covered with a delicate frosty texture, adorned with several blue transparent spherical ornaments that emit a faint glow under cool-toned lighting; On the right is a pink Christmas dwarf doll, dressed in a sequin-studded gown and wearing a pointed hat, smiling adorably against a blue backdrop, adding a warm and cute touch to the scene. The entire background is a light blue curtain printed with repeated patterns of snowflakes and pine silhouettes, evoking the tranquility of a winter forest or a snowy wonderland. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the characters appear more intimate and full. The lighting and shadow treatment are soft and even, with the main light source slightly from the front and above, and the shadow transitions naturally avoiding harsh contrasts. The overall atmosphere is warm and dreamy yet still childlike and fun. The color scheme is mainly cool blue, paired with warm-toned plaid clothing and pink dolls for a striking contrast, creating a Christmas fairy tale world that is both cold and sweet, as if you are in a carefully arranged indoor photo studio or festive theme set. All these elements together form a daily video work full of festive atmosphere, youthful energy, and artistic beauty, offering a strong immersive visual experience and emotional resonance.",
