        {
          "id": "krea2-4e3a94b6ccf607aaa45840cf",
          "alias": "单女毛衣雪地俏皮蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in a corner of an indoor space filled with a retro industrial vibe, draped in a thick knit shawl with an off-white base and deep blue geometric patterns, paired with a red sports top and a plaid shirt collar. She wears white socks and light-colored sneakers, tilting her head slightly up, as if lost in thought or longing, her expression calm and full of storytelling; The background of her space is weathered wooden walls, covered with faded, torn, and overlapping colored posters and graffiti marks, creating a nostalgic atmosphere steeped by the passage of time; On the left is a deep blue metal stair railing, with a thin layer of artificial snow covering the edges. On the right wall hangs a rusty old blue mailbox or storage box, with several potted plants below, adding a touch of life; The ground is covered with a fine layer of artificial snow, intertwining with the smoky airflow on the walls, creating a hazy visual layer; The entire composition uses vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, the line of sight naturally extending upward. The light and shadow are soft and layered, creating a contrast of light and shadow, while the shadowed areas in the background deepen the sense of spatial depth. It is both lively and emotionally resonant, suitable for expressing youth, loneliness, dreams, or romantic moments on the edge of the city.",
