        {
          "id": "krea2-5e4eac543e84b22d83c32f87",
          "alias": "单女竹林躺持花",
          "prompt": "She gently holds a blooming bright yellow sunflower in front of her chest, with the other hand naturally resting on her knee. Beside her lies a woven grass basket in matching colors, filled with several plump, brilliant sunflower bouquets. The petals are layered and brightly colored, creating a strong visual focal point against the lush green background. On the left side of the foreground are climbing vine plants, with dense and lush green leaves, some branches winding around wooden fence posts. On the right side, lush bamboo leaves grow thickly, with slender and verdant leaves, and the interplay of light and shadow reveals a natural ecological texture; The central shot centers on the main figure and a bouquet of sunflowers, forming the visual center. The figure's posture is relaxed and relaxed, with the body slightly turned to the camera. The composition uses close-ups in medium and close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-right position. The background is a vintage fence structure made from horizontally arranged wooden boards, with clearly visible wood grain. The surface has a gentle patina due to the passage of time, with faint green plant shadows in the gaps, creating a sense of depth and a realistic atmosphere. Light shines from the upper left angle, creating a transition between soft highlights and natural shadows, enhancing depth and warm texture. The overall image tones are mainly warm, with off-white, light brown, pale yellow, and dark green interwoven and blended. The color saturation is moderate, presenting the subtle grainy texture and soft focus unique to film cameras, simulating the natural blur and motion blur seen in everyday mobile phone or small digital camera shooting, creating a fresh, healing, and lazy summer afternoon atmosphere. It feels as if you are in a corner of a private garden or courtyard—peaceful and full of vitality Then flows down to the bouquet in the basket, finally framed and surrounded by lush greenery on both sides, forming a closed-loop compositional aesthetic. The details are rich yet not chaotic; every leaf, every fabric fold, every inch of light and shadow carries emotional expression, conveying a poetic aesthetic of returning to nature and embracing the essence of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
