        {
          "id": "krea2-00bee5554fb56d247a53bb05",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道戏谑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "This is a street documentary-style image full of life and youthful energy. The subject is a woman standing on the steps in front of an old-fashioned barbershop, striking a playful and lively pose, arms raised in a victory gesture, her expression confident yet a bit mischievous. She wears an off-white short-sleeved knit top paired with loose wide-leg jeans and white casual shoes, carrying a light gray canvas backpack over her shoulder. The overall outfit is simple, comfortable, yet full of personality. Her dynamic posture—one foot on tiptoe, body slightly leaning— Gives the painting a strong sense of movement and rhythm; In the foreground is the silhouette of another figure, holding a smartphone and photographing the woman in front. The phone's screen emits a soft glow that reflects on fingers and clothing. Its blurred silhouette and focused posture cleverly construct an interactive relationship between \"photographer and subject,\" naturally guiding the viewer's gaze to the main subject; The middle view consists of a glass door at the barbershop's entrance, hanging blue semi-transparent sheer curtains, and rows of neatly hung orange-red dried fish on the drying rack on the right. The dried fish glow warmly under the sunlight, contrasting with the cool-toned sheer curtains, while the city's reflections on the curtains add spatial layers and an urban feel. In the background, mottled red brick walls and wooden rolling shutters hang a green broom and a green rag, rich in detail and bearing traces of daily life. In the distance, faint signs of other shops or building silhouettes can be seen, creating a realistic yet somewhat chaotic urban street corner atmosphere; The composition uses over-the-shoulder angles and shallow depth of field, with blurred background shots reinforcing the 'viewer' identity, locking the visual focus firmly on the central figure. At the same time, tilted angles and asymmetrical layouts break conventional balance to enhance visual tension; The visual guide line extends from the foreground phone screen to the main character's gestures, then from their body posture to the dried fish and the curtain behind, forming a smooth visual flow path; In terms of lighting and shadow, natural daylight enters the scene diagonally from the side, casting soft shadows on the floor and walls. The transitions are natural and delicate, enhancing the sense of depth and texture; The overall atmosphere combines the everyday life of everyday life with the refinement of artistic photography. It features film-like grainy noise and warm tone shifts evoking retro nostalgia, as well as the freedom and joy of self-expression found in ordinary street scenes. The image is moderately saturated, with blue, white, and gray as the main colors, accented by the orange-red of dried fish and the warm red of brick walls, creating a peaceful yet vibrant afternoon street photography aesthetic, as if freezing a vibrant and beautiful moment in an ordinary day.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
