        {
          "id": "krea2-7ca3f26c09021636c99776f2",
          "alias": "单女棕西装室内忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a classical indoor setting, wearing a dark brown vintage collegiate blazer and a matching pleated skirt, paired with a pure white stand-collar shirt and a delicate, oversized bow collar. The garment drapes delicately, with soft shoulder lines and a white lining at the cuffs. A small metal badge is pinned to the chest, giving the overall look elegance and calmness. Next to the piano is a corner of an old-fashioned leather suitcase, hinting at a journey or farewell; The walls are light beige, illuminated by warm golden sunlight slanting in from the upper left. Light filters through the window lattices or curtains, casting mottled geometric shadows, creating a contrast between the walls and the shoulders and backs of the figures, creating a warm yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere; The composition adopts a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, maintaining a stable visual focus, and the left blank space accommodating light and background elements; The audience's attention naturally focuses on her expression and the withered flower in her hand; The use of light and shadow is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the upper left, creating a combination of backlight and side lighting. The shadows transition naturally, and the wrinkles of clothing and bouquet textures create rich layers of light and shadow depending on the lighting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, and slightly melancholic, with warm brown, off-white, and dark brown tones as the main palette, complemented by earthy yellow tones from withered flowers. The colors are harmoniously unified, presenting a texture reminiscent of Japanese Renaissance or classical oil painting, as if an image gently frozen by time. It combines the simple realism of daily life with the depth and emotional tension of artistic photography. The details are rich yet not cluttered, with every element serving emotional expression and aesthetic construction, conveying the eternal themes of youth, farewell, memory, and beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
