        {
          "id": "krea2-eb66e99a61f213559f17ef43",
          "alias": "单女蓝浴袍车内忧伤坐持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone in a bunk inside an old carriage, wearing a light, flowing light blue robe. The fabric hangs as soft as silk, naturally wrapping her body. The cuffs and hem of her skirt wrinkle slightly with each movement, presenting a lazy and serene posture; She sits barefoot cross-legged on a blue-and-white striped bedsheet, her toes slender, as if immersed in her own world, exuding an unrefined innocence and introspective temperament; Behind her was a wide car window, with bright yet soft light outside. Through the translucent white curtains, sunlight left traces of dust in the air, creating a warm and hazy atmosphere; The window frames are made of dark wood, with edges marked by years of wear, echoing the old wooden furniture inside the carriage. The headboard is carved with intricate patterns, faintly showing traces of vintage craftsmanship; On the left wall, several pale yellow fabric garments hang casually, casually draped on hooks or windowsills, adding a sense of everyday life; The mirror's reflection area clearly reflects the outline of her silhouette, forming a subtle symmetry between the image in the mirror and her real-life self, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure appear taller and more presenceful, emphasizing their elegant posture; The light and shadow treatment is delicate and realistic, with strong contrasts of light and shadow highlighting the subject. The window area is a highlight area, while the corners of the carriage gradually transition into shadow zones, forming a natural visual focal point; The overall color palette leans toward cool tones but still warmth, with blue, white, and brown as the main tones, accented by yellow fabric, creating a nostalgic film-like texture; The image features noticeable film grain noise and slight fading, simulating the aesthetic features of vintage film cameras and imparting a gentle mood that lingers over time; The background blur is well handled, and the scenery outside the window is blurry, with only the silhouettes of city streets or buildings being recognizable, further highlighting the main subject; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, lonely, yet poetic, as if capturing a brief moment of rest during a journey. It carries the narrative quality of a film still and contains the tender moments forgotten in daily life, conveying a deep emotional resonance of \"when travelers return, the heart returns to tranquility.\" Every detail in the frame is carefully designed, from clothing textures to lighting and shadow directions, reflecting the photographer's ultimate pursuit of atmosphere, allowing viewers to feel the eternity of fleeting moments in the passage of time and the free breathing of the soul.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
