        {
          "id": "krea2-f9c080868e8abe4a5f031196",
          "alias": "单女绿外套城市坐吃",
          "prompt": "A female student sits outdoors on the weathered concrete steps, sunlight slanting in from the side, casting soft, layered light and shadows on her and her surroundings. Wearing a pair of simple transparent glasses, she is intently biting into a golden, crispy bread roll, as if immersed in a moment of afternoon tranquility and deliciousness; She wore a retro-style green collared sports jacket with white stripes on the collar and cuffs, a small badge or embroidery faintly visible in the chest pocket, paired with light-colored shorts and pure white sneakers. A small piece of sock showed at the ankle, giving the whole outfit a youthful campus vibe that was casual and casual; Her left hand rests gently on her knee, her posture relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned toward the camera, creating a sense of everyday life being casually captured; At the edge of her left rear staircase sits a black backpack. The body is simple and unadorned, with slight wear from sunlight. The brand label on the backpack is clearly visible but not out of place, quietly leaning against the corner, becoming an indispensable element of daily life; In the background is a faded green wooden door or iron fence, with peeling paint revealing the marks of time. Next to it is a rough, off-white wall, with a few tiny weeds growing in the corner, and scattered leaves and dust on the ground. These details together create a slightly worn yet authentic and vivid urban street corner atmosphere; The entire composition uses a slightly top-down horizontal angle, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. In the foreground is her cross-legged posture and the bread in her hands; in the middle is the transitional area between the backpack and the edge of the steps; and in the foreground, the mottled green door and walls form a sense of spatial depth from near to far; The viewer's attention is first drawn to her eating movements, then guided back by the backpack and steps; The light comes from the upper left, representing the warm afternoon sunlight, while on the other side, it creates delicate shadow transitions that enhance the sense of depth and authenticity; The overall color palette is mainly green, off-white, and black, complemented by a warm yellow glow from sunlight, presenting a fresh, nostalgic, and slightly artistic film texture. It looks like it was casually taken with an old digital camera or phone under natural light, with slight noise and low-saturation graininess, making the images closer to real life rather than perfect retouching, conveying a youthful moment frozen with a \"click\"—that carefree, free, and everyday life full of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
