        {
          "id": "krea2-97be96df38c229d864fb8aa1",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a huge cardboard box, capturing her playful yet warm smile from a low-angle perspective, her expression radiating innocence, joy, and carefree happiness. She wore an off-white handmade knitted sweater covered with three-dimensional floral embroidery patterns. The petals were bright orange-red and tender yellow, with stamens accented with green. The collar was decorated with pearl buttons, with delicate and soft textures. The cuffs were tightly tied to fit the wrist, giving the overall look a vintage yet full sense of style. She leaned forward slightly, her hands naturally resting on the edge of the cardboard box's inner wall, her posture relaxed and casual, as if she had found her own joyful corner in this \"little world\" of cardboard. The box is made of typical brown corrugated paper, with clear embossed lines and creases visible on the surface. The edges show slight wear marks, adding a sense of life. The box forms the main framework of the painting, enveloping the figure and creating an intimate yet slightly restrictive sense of space. In the foreground, the edge of the cardboard slanted downward at the box opening, occupying about one-third of the lower part of the image, its rough texture contrasting with soft lighting; The middle frame features the woman's upper body and the inner wall of the cardboard, with interplay of light and shadow outlining her silhouette; The background is completely obscured by the inner walls of the cardboard box, with only a small dim area visible above, reinforcing the intimate atmosphere of the enclosed space. The composition uses an extremely low camera angle, making viewers feel as if they are outside a cardboard box looking downward. This perspective gives the image a strong sense of immersion and drama, while highlighting the petite, adorable, and central figure of the characters. Her gaze shifts slightly upward, creating a subtle interaction with the camera and enhancing the narrative quality of the image. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, with light sources coming from the top or upper side of the frame, creating a Rembrandt-style effect with strong contrast of light and dark, while the left side incorporates shadow transitions to create a sense of depth and warmth; Most of the interior of the box is shaded by deep brown, with only a few areas illuminated by warm light, enhancing the depth of the space and the cozy and tranquil home atmosphere. The overall image presents a sweet moment captured by chance in daily life, featuring a slight film grain texture and soft focus effect, simulating the realism of a mobile phone or small camera. The tone leans toward warm yellow, with moderate saturation, full of emotion yet restrained. It combines fairy-tale-like childlike imagination with the authentic atmosphere of everyday life, conveying a healing power to find happiness in ordinary corners and embrace one's inner self. The images are peaceful, warm, and poetic, full of youthful vitality and inner freedom.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
