        {
          "id": "krea2-018645dfa8c502f20520df13",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern bride sits in a corner of the courtyard bathed in soft natural light. She wears a delicate white wedding dress with lace embroidery and hollowed-out designs. Light comes from the diffused natural light in the upper left, soft but not glaring, while the shadowed areas maintain a very subtle transition, presenting a fresh atmosphere of creamy white and teal tones; The atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, full of ritual yet retaining the gentle warmth of everyday life. It feels like a private moment alone on the eve of a wedding or in the afternoon. The air is filled with the fragrance of grass, petals, and sunlight blending together. The entire scene exudes an artistic beauty of \"unadorned yet perfect,\" like a film still shot with a film camera at dusk. The color saturation is moderate, the graininess is fine, and there is a slight soft-focus effect, giving the image more emotional intensity and memory quality, without deliberately pursuing commercial perfection. Instead, it conveys a real, pure, and desirable state of life.",
