        {
          "id": "krea2-3e082a87d78dbaf2d944503e",
          "alias": "单女和服海滩忧伤持包",
          "prompt": "A Japanese woman wears a traditional kimono with a deep blue background featuring a white chrysanthemum pattern, a wide bright red belt tied around her waist, and red and black wooden clogs. Her left hand gently holds a small cloth pouch with a red cord drawstring, embroidered with orange-red auspicious clouds and bat patterns. Beside her are layers of gray-white sea eroded boulders, while the distant sea glimmers with a silvery sheen under the soft sunlight. The sky appears in a pale golden gradient. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the right side of the visual center. In the foreground is the cloth bag in her hand and part of her skirt. The middle ground is the transition zone between the breakwater and the rocky beach. The background is a blurred coastline and the distant sea, with light and shadow coming from the upper right side, forming a soft backlit outline. The folds of the clothing have delicate shadow layers, creating a peaceful and poetic atmosphere, blending the wabi-sabi feeling of traditional Eastern aesthetics with the fresh texture of modern photography. The color contrast in the image is strong yet harmonious, with a blue-and-white kimono and a red obi. Budai forms the visual focal point, while the sea-sky backdrop creates a sense of expansive and distant space. The composition follows the rule of thirds, evoking a tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly lonely artistic mood, as if capturing a summer afternoon at dusk as it nears its end. It carries the lively atmosphere of daily life while also containing a deep expression of ritual and cultural symbols. The entire image presents a grainy texture and soft-focus effect reminiscent of film cameras, rich in details without overpowering the main focus. The color saturation is moderate, avoiding excessive brightness or dullness. Emphasizing authenticity and emotional resonance, the artist carefully combines character expressions, costume details, and environmental elements to create a Japanese seaside cultural portrait with narrative and artistic tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
