        {
          "id": "krea2-985f1c1db093c6859fee4eb5",
          "alias": "单女全裸绿长裤厨房摆拍",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white vertical striped knitted long-sleeve top with slightly rolled cuffs, made of delicate and soft material, creating a gentle contrast with the deep olive green high-waisted wide-leg pants. The waistband design elegantly claws the waistline, with a strong drape that naturally unfolds with the body's posture; Her left hand gently rests on the edge of the window frame, fingertips brushing the wood grain, while her right hand naturally hangs over the windowsill, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light nude polish; On the left side of the windowsill is a potted green plant with lush branches and leaves. The clay pot features delicate relief patterns on its surface, with leaves reflecting bright green against the backlight; On the right side is the kitchen countertop area, where the silver-gray gas stove and oven are clearly visible. The countertop is clean and tidy, cabinets are natural wood color with metal handles, the walls are covered with light beige wood grain trim, and wooden shelves hang above, making storage simple and orderly; Outside the window are blurred green vegetation and distant ridge outlines. Sunlight pours in from the upper left, casting sharp geometric shadows on the backs of figures, folds of clothing, and the floor. The wooden grain of the window frames is outlined in the sunlight to appear especially three-dimensional; The entire composition uses medium to near shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. The light comes from natural outdoor sources, soft yet layered, while the shadowed areas retain details without stiffness, creating a warm and peaceful afternoon home atmosphere; The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and olive green, with moderate saturation and a delicate and realistic visual texture, as if shot by a high-end digital camera or professional film camera. With slight noise and film graininess, it presents poetic moments captured unintentionally in daily life—quiet moments full of storytelling without deliberate posing, full of life and artistic beauty, allowing people to feel the warmth and peace brought by sunlight filtering through glass, as well as the subtle yet rich emotional fluctuations within the characters.",
