        {
          "id": "krea2-150a2aff9186873f857bb924",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫小巷忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a quiet old alley, wearing a thick, soft deep blue turtleneck sweater. The sweater is puffy, with clearly visible patterns, and the cuffs and neckline hang naturally, as if silently conveying some reserved emotion or secret. She turned her body slightly and leaned against a weathered wall marked by the passage of time. The wall was quietly covered by moss and vines, presenting a texture of gray-green and brownish intertwining, adding a touch of natural wildness and a sense of weariness. In the foreground is the wide hem of her sweater and part of the street edge; the ground is a gray cement road marked with white markings, and faintly green curbstones can be seen beside the road, with lines guiding the viewer deeper into the scene. The middle ground depicts her complete figure and the blurred city streets behind her; distant architectural silhouettes transform into hazy blocks of color under shallow depth, with utility poles and sparse branches interspersing to create a subtle atmosphere where city and nature blend together. The background is completely blurred, with only the grayish-white sky and the outlines of distant buildings recognizable, reinforcing the subject's sense of presence and loneliness. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned on the left third of the canvas, leaving space on the right side for the street to extend out, creating a visual balance and sense of breathing. The visual guide line consists of white lines on the ground, the direction of the subject's line of sight, and the vertical lines of the building in the background. Light comes from the upper right of the painting, a soft, cloudy diffuse light evenly casting over the figures, without strong shadows. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a cool tone. The blue sweater contrasts calmly with the greenish-brown wall, conveying a cool, lonely, gentle, and slightly artistic emotional tone. It resembles a city corner after an afternoon rain, time seemingly standing still, with her alone lost in thought at the street corner. The entire image presents the unique grainy texture and slight color shifts typical of film cameras, with low color saturation, soft transitions between light and dark, and slight soft-focus edges, giving the visuals a retro cinematic narrative and emotional depth. It feels like a quiet moment captured from a youth art film, full of storytelling and emotional tension—both everyday and extraordinary, both real and rich in artistic imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
