        {
          "id": "krea2-4b855270e4e881a79287ff77",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服车厢愤怒站立持包",
          "prompt": "A person dressed in a dark blue Japanese school uniform stands in a crowded, somewhat worn tram carriage. Her left hand gently grips a black leather crossbody strap, adorned with a small yellow flower, while her right hand gently supports the white ring-shaped hanging ring above her head. Three golden stripes faintly appear on the sleeves under soft light, a red bow tie gently flutters under the deep blue uniform, black over-the-knee socks and simple shoes, and her overall posture is naturally relaxed yet full of youthful energy. In the foreground is the orange velvet seat on the right side, its surface showing a warm texture due to years of wear. The seat edges contrast sharply with the metal armrests, and beside the seats are transparent glass window frames. The blurred city street view and flowing light outside shine through the glass into the cabin, creating an atmosphere where dynamics and tranquility intertwine. The middle view is the standing position, and behind her is a white wall covered with Japanese notices and ticket information, with posts like \"March 30 (Sat)\" and \"New 500 yen coins.\" The font is clear but slightly faded, revealing traces of daily tram operations; On the left, you can see the tram's internal devices such as emergency buttons, handrails, and hanging pull tabs. The white plastic rings reflect a cool glow under the lights, while the background shows urban street scenes extending through the windows. Distant building outlines and road signs blur into a blue-gray hue, and the sky faintly shows clouds or dusk light, suggesting the time is near evening or dawn. The entire space is confined to a cramped carriage, yet the outside world is introduced through the windows, creating a narrative that blends inside and out. The composition uses a slightly slanted third-section layout, located in the left half of the painting, forming a visual extension path; The large area of blank space on the right side is occupied by seats and windows, enhancing the main subject's presence; The vertical lines of the hanging ring in the upper right corner of the painting intersect with the horizontal lines of the window, forming a stable and rhythmic geometric framework while creating a sense of spatial depth. In terms of light and shadow, the light source comes from the top of the cabin and natural light outside the window, creating a soft diffuse effect. The shadow transitions are delicate, and there is a slight highlight reflection between the leather bag and seat edges, highlighting the material texture. The cool-toned light streaming in from outside the window creates a subtle contrast with the warm yellow lights inside the carriage, giving the image a rich and non-glaring layer. The overall atmosphere combines the documentary feel of daily life with the poetic expression of artistic photography. It combines the practical function of the tram as a public transportation vehicle, while the quiet posture combined with the flowing scenery outside the window conveys the emotional tension of loneliness, anticipation, and self-reflection on youthful journeys; The color palette is mainly dark blue, orange-brown, and gray-white, complemented by a red bow tie and yellow flowers as visual focal points, maintaining overall harmony while retaining detailed highlights; The image style leans toward realistic shooting rather than excessive retouching, preserving the wear marks of the tram interior, the folds of poster paper, and the blurred handwriting, giving the images a lifelike, authentic texture. It's as if a regular phone captures moments while moving, yet through composition and lighting treatment, it presents a cinematic visual language, conveying the aesthetic depth and emotional warmth embedded in everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
