        {
          "id": "krea2-c01031724363a4f2c702a61e",
          "alias": "单女毛衣公园冷淡坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the grass of an autumn park, with a background of dense and brilliant autumn leaves. The thick knit texture was clearly visible, creating a layered look with the jacket's material; Her posture is lazy yet full of storytelling; In the foreground are the lower half of her body and scattered dead leaves around her; the color of the fallen leaves echoes the background, the ground is mottled with green grass, and some areas are covered by fallen leaves, forming a natural texture of the ground; The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The camera slightly tilts down to enhance the character's presence. Light and shadow come from soft natural light in the upper left, with delicate transitions between light and shadow in the folds of clothing, and background leaves appearing semi-transparent due to backlighting; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and the gentle touch of autumn. The color scheme is mainly warm tones, with the cool tones of the characters' clothing creating a subtle contrast, creating a lifestyle aesthetic of \"quiet solitude on an autumn afternoon.\" The image style pursues a realistic and delicate everyday photography feel, as if shot by a mid-range digital camera under natural light, retaining slight noise and color graininess, without excessive sharpening or filtering, emphasizing authentic emotional expression and environmental integration; All these elements together create a narrative autumn scene, allowing people to feel moments of peace and inner turmoil amid the changing seasons.",
