        {
          "id": "krea2-590b32f678f171e7e2189d93",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute focal point of the scene, wearing a lightweight, fluffy white puff-sleeve dress with delicate lace trim at the neckline. A light gray turtleneck inner layer adds layers, and a white quilted fabric bag is slung across her left shoulder. The overall look is fresh and gentle, full of Japanese flair; In the foreground, she is slightly turned to the side, with part of her skirt hem and backpack outline. In composition, she is positioned in the left third-division position, with her body slightly tilted to create a sense of dynamic balance. The right side is left with a circular traffic mirror, creating visual symmetry and guidance. The central area is surrounded by lush tropical greenery, including broad-leaved monstera, slender, pinnate-leaf palm plants, and potted shrubs. The floor is paved with gray cement bricks and red and black stripes, creating a realistic urban atmosphere; The composition uses a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figures occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The circular mirror is cleverly embedded on the right edge, and its reflected image not only enriches the visual layers but also suggests a sense of spatial depth—the mirror reflects pedestrians across the street, a white car, and a shop storefront. The color saturation is slightly lower but the details are clear, reinforcing the artistic tension where reality and illusion intertwine; The visual guide line is constructed from the direction of the character's gaze, the curve of the mirror's edge, and the extension paths of plant branches and leaves, then descends to the feet and ground environment, forming a circular narrative rhythm; In terms of lighting, soft afternoon oblique light is used, with light filtering through the gaps between leaves from the upper left, while natural shadows are cast behind and the ground to enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm, healing, and full of storytelling, as if captured in a lazy summer afternoon street encounter. It features film camera grain noise and a slight color shift filter, simulating the realistic texture of a home phone or small digital camera. The main tones are cream white, olive green, and earthy yellow, accented by red frames and orange metal seat backs. It creates a retro, nostalgic, and lively Japanese street style aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
