        {
          "id": "krea2-e1025ca9768c7ff8dc3e639d",
          "alias": "单女和服神社忧伤站立回眸",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman dressed in a traditional Japanese kimono stands in the rustic corridor of a rustic shrine. She slightly turns to look back at the camera. The kimono is based on deep green, adorned with intricate floral patterns interwoven with orange and white. The sleeves are wide and flowing, and the belt is tightly fastened, highlighting the elegant curves of Eastern women. She stands perfectly under a beam of warm golden sunlight slanting into the corridor. The light and shadow outline a three-dimensional silhouette, casting mottled light spots and shadows on the floor and stone steps, creating a strong sense of depth and dramatic atmosphere. In the foreground are several sunlit bluestone steps, with clear edges and delicate textures, extending deeper into the painting and naturally guiding the viewer's gaze to the main figure. The middle feature features the sturdy wooden columns supporting the corridor, whose surfaces retain natural texture and traces of time. Some columns are bathed in warm light, while others blend into a shadowy background, creating layers of contrast between light and shadow. The background features a blurred outline of the shrine complex, layered wooden eaves, and in the distance, faintly visible blue neon lights dyed with modern city lights. The blurring makes the space appear more profound and full of narrative tension. The entire composition uses an asymmetrical three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the painting. The left side is blank and extends with stairs to create visual balance. The diagonal wooden beam at the top forms a geometric line frame, enhancing the sense of spatial structure. The visual guide line is constructed by the upward trend of steps, the direction of light, and the posture of the figure looking back, creating an overall atmosphere rich and nostalgic. The warm-toned main light source comes from natural daylight, complemented by cool-toned ambient lighting, creating a color collision of \"warm gold\" and \"cool blue,\" creating a quiet, slightly lonely yet poetic dusk moment. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot by an old film camera or phone in low-light conditions. Grain noise is subtle but not abrupt, color saturation is moderately low, presenting a cinematic retro filter effect, presenting a strong Japanese aesthetic atmosphere—combining the solemnity of a traditional shrine with the hazy light and shadow of a modern city. The characters and environment blend seamlessly, like a meticulously crafted ukiyo-e painting, carrying the warmth and contemplation of time, prompting viewers to imagine the time and space she is in. The state of mind and the untold stories behind it.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
