        {
          "id": "krea2-f1dab8a06d248b5cf47edae7",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙船上困倦站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of the deck of a cruise ship in transit, wearing a delicate pale yellow long dress with a naturally flowing hem and voluminous cuffs. She wears a soft fisherman's hat with a brown-white plaid pattern on her head, the brim slightly tilted, and her right hand holding a compact smartphone high, taking a selfie. The screen reflects soft light, giving her a relaxed yet full sense of charm. In the foreground is a close-up of the cruise ship's white metal railings and glass window frames. The window frames have clean, modern lines, and the glass reflects her blurred silhouette and parts of the hull, creating subtle spatial layers and mirror reflections; The middle ground features the silhouette of her standing body and the distant water surface; the railing slopes from the left side of the painting toward the lower right, guiding the visual flow and directing the viewer's gaze toward her phone and the distant open water; The background is a vast, calm lake or inland sea, with clear light blue-green water and fine, even ripples. In the distance, the shoreline is faintly visible on gentle slopes covered with vegetation. The mountain outlines are soft and hazy, and the sky is covered by clouds in a uniform gray-blue tone. Without strong direct sunlight, the overall environment appears peaceful and distant. The composition adopts a slightly slanted diagonal layout, with the main figure positioned on the right third of the canvas. The railing and window frame form a natural separation, creating a sense of depth and space; The visual guidance path is clear, starting from the foreground railing and passing through the movement of the characters' arms raising, forming a narrative rhythm of \"movement—stillness—point\"; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with the overall color scheme balanced between creamy yellow and mint green. Light comes from the upper sides, with no harsh shadows, only subtle soft light transitions, creating a dreamy afternoon atmosphere; The entire image exudes youth, freedom, travel, and self-expression. It features the refined composition and color control of professional photography, as well as the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. It feels like precious moments casually captured from an ordinary journey, full of life energy and artistic beauty. The details are rich yet never overshadow the main theme. And the inner peace and joy of facing the vast world alone.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
