        {
          "id": "krea2-44aae7a3ee76bf69bc163598",
          "alias": "单女透视礼服摄影棚困倦站立交叠",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman wears a pure white, multi-layered sheer gown, as flowing as clouds, with the hem layered across the floor, light and dynamic, like chiffon wings fluttering in the breeze; She sat slightly sideways on the wooden floor, her posture calm and natural, legs crossed, wearing exquisite off-white pearl-lace high heels, the delicate sheen of the shoes highlighting her gentle temperament; Her hands gently held a bouquet of freshly bloomed yellow tulips and fine yellow flowers; the flowers were tender and dripping, the green stems upright, and the colors bright and lively, forming a soft contrast with the posture she held lightly in her hands; Add a touch of casualness and authenticity; It feels as if immersed in some beautiful memory or longing, with a calm expression full of storytelling; The foreground focuses on her slender fingers, floral details, and the wrinkled texture at the edge of the skirt, clearly revealing the transparency of each layer of sheer fabric and the flow of light and shadow; The middle ground features the layered transitions between her long legs and the hem of her skirt, and the warm-toned reflections of the wooden floor beneath her feet, creating a sense of spatial depth; The background is a blurred outdoor greenery scene, with faint glimpses of tree branches and dappled sunlight. Light filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft halos and bokeh effects around the figure, making the subject stand out even more; The overall composition adopts a close-up perspective, with a slight upward angle to enhance the character's nobility and spatial layers; Then, the curve of the skirt naturally guides the shoes and floor below the canvas, forming a complete emotional narrative path; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with the soft glow of afternoon sunlight filtering through the woods. The light slants from the upper left, enhancing the sense of depth and realism; The entire scene presents a dreamy and realistic poetic atmosphere, combining the meticulous artistic beauty of professional studio lighting with the natural breath and life atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The color palette is pure white, complemented by bright yellow flowers as visual focal points and emotional warmth. The green plant background provides a fresh and natural setting. The entire scene is filled with the romance and tranquility of spring weddings, early summer celebrations, or important life rituals, as if time gently stands still at this moment. It allows people to feel pure beauty and the light rhythm of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
