        {
          "id": "krea2-8c84c0822b5589d7d92fc21f",
          "alias": "单女金衬衫车厢俏皮倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a white train carriage, wearing a light brown beret with a slightly slanted brim, adding a touch of playfulness and liveliness. She wore a delicate pale yellow puff-sleeve shirt with a subtle wrinkled texture, presenting a warm and slightly vintage tone under soft light, with sleeves naturally rolled up to reveal slender wrists. It's as if you're drawn to something interesting in the distance, revealing the unique innocence and curiosity of youth. Her body turned slightly, her left shoulder pressed against the surface of the carriage, and her right hand naturally resting on the edge of the window—her posture relaxed yet full of everyday life. In the foreground is the side of the white carriage she leans on, with a striking royal blue stripe running across the body. Below, faint traces of yellow paint can be seen, hinting at the train's sense of years and the weariness of the journey; The cabin surface is smooth, reflecting faint ambient light and creating soft highlights. In the middle shot, her upper body occupies the main position, with a slightly tilted perspective to create dynamic tension between the figure and background. The background features a transition of cool gray-blue tones and off-white, and the wide aperture creates a soft blur effect outside focus, making the subject stand out more. The entire image is composed with a cinematic shallow depth of field, while the background gradually blurs, guiding the viewer's attention to the expressions and expressions of the characters. In terms of light and shadow, natural soft light from the front side evenly casts a gentle transition between light and dark, without strong shadows, giving the image a fresh and transparent feel. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of stories, blending the liveliness of youth with the loneliness and anticipation of travel, like a moment frozen in time—maybe waiting for a bus, maybe sneaking a glimpse of the scenery outside the window, or simply wanting to capture a cute moment. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, complemented by cool blue stripes as visual focal points, creating a subtle balance between temperature and calm. The image saturation is moderate, retaining the graininess and color tendency of film photography, simulating the texture captured by real camera lenses. There is slight blurring and noise at the edges of the frame, suggesting that ordinary digital cameras or phones were used for shooting rather than professional equipment, enhancing the authenticity and familiarity of everyday life. It is a documentary-style portrait of life full of emotional tension and visual beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
