        {
          "id": "krea2-62031b501c285e1586c1f230",
          "alias": "单女金睡裙卧室困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a light yellow polka-dot spaghetti strap nightdress with orange-yellow woven straps, making the material light and breathable. The skirt is naturally pleated, fitting the body's curves. Her fingers are slender and long, fingertips slightly curved. The background is covered with white sheer curtains or bedding covering the entire scene. The texture is light and flowing, featuring natural folds and light and shadow changes. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating a warm and soft backlight effect. Light passes through the sheer fabric, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, head slightly tilted, and gaze directed toward the lens, creating a strong visual direction. The background is blurred to highlight the subject. The colors are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and pale pink, accented with a touch of orange-yellow, creating a warm and soft overall tone. Full of the lazy atmosphere of a summer morning, with rich layers of light and shadow, bright and transparent highlights and natural transitions in shadows, presenting a grainy texture and slight overexposure reminiscent of film photography, as if shot with an old film camera, with a retro filter texture. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting and bokeh to enhance spatial depth. The overall style combines Japanese photography with lifestyle aesthetics, conveying a peaceful, comfortable, and healing everyday moment, as if recording a sunny afternoon. Enjoy a moment of relaxation and beauty in the bedroom, with a faint floral scent and warm scent filling the air. The scene is full of vitality and youthful energy, evoking a pure sense of happiness and a love for life",
