        {
          "id": "krea2-c9c512ca0cf3a93b55f19f87",
          "alias": "单女外套公园微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in an autumn park, wearing a dark coat and a beige tasseled scarf draped over her shoulders. Her hands gently hold an orange-red maple leaf, its edges slightly curled to show a natural gradient color, ranging from bright orange-red to warm golden yellow. The veins are clearly visible, the branches are slender yet resilient, her fingers slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, carrying a gentle smile. Her head is slightly raised, as if savoring the breath of autumn. The overall silhouette is soft and delicate, and the composition uses a medium close-up. The figure is positioned on the right side of the painting, occupying about two-thirds of the space, while the left side leaves a large negative space. The background is a blurry autumn forest, with leaves showing rich orange-red tones, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The light and shadows are soft, with light filtering through the gaps between the leaves, creating mottled shadows on the ground and clothing. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of autumn warmth and romance. The tones are mainly warm orange, beige, and dark brown, creating a cozy and nostalgic feeling. The painting has a strong visual guiding effect, extending to the brilliant autumn colors in the background. It is as if you can hear the rustling of leaves in the wind and feel the faint coolness in the air. This is a photographic work full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty, like capturing a moment with an old film camera. It has a slight graininess and the unique color saturation of film. The lens focus is well controlled, the subject is clear while the background is blurred, the composition is balanced and layered, the posture of the person is natural and relaxed, the expressions are genuine and captivating, and the entire image exudes a quiet and beautiful emotion. It reminds one of those simple yet precious moments of youth, as if time stands still at this moment, leaving only the warmth and beauty of autumn.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
