        {
          "id": "krea2-4db50f024c3aa1dac9cc870f",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边沉思站立注视（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the window, wearing a loose white cotton-linen camisole nightgown. The garment drapes naturally, with delicate pleats, exuding a soft texture and the lazy vibe of daily life. Her body leans slightly forward, head slightly raised, her expression calm and contemplative, as if immersed in the tranquility of morning or dusk. In the background is a rectangular window with a white frame, clearly visible and the glass surface with a slightly matte texture. Uniform and soft diffused light is transmitted, creating a bright backlight effect. The figure's outline is hazy yet layered, presenting a semi-silhouette-like artistic beauty. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the center-right position of the composition. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned in the right third, with ample blank space on the left side, creating a sense of breath and spatial expansiveness. The middle ground features geometric lines reflecting the window frame structure and glass, forming a regular grid pattern that enhances the sense of order and depth in the painting. The background is entirely composed of strong light from outside the window, presenting a pure, bright white with almost no details, existing only in the form of highlights, making the subject stand out more. The overall composition is simple yet dynamic. The visual guidance starts with the subject's hand movements, then turns to the direction of their gaze, and finally stops at the distant blurry world outside the window, forming a clear line of sight. Light comes from behind, a typical backlit shoot. The main light source is soft and diffuse, without obvious shadows, but a slight halo appears at the edges of the subject. It enhances the sense of depth and airiness, with mainly cool gray and warm white tones. The white clothing has a slightly yellowish warm hue against the backlight, creating a subtle contrast with the cool white background. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and introspective, carrying a subtle nostalgia and intimate poetry, like a snapshot of daily life taken with an old film camera. The lens may be a prime 50mm or 85mm portrait lens with a slower shutter speed, capturing natural dynamic moments, precise exposure control, and preserving details in highlight areas. At the same time, it maintains sufficient texture in the shadows, presenting a low-saturation, high-contrast cinematic texture with a strong Japanese style that emphasizes realism and emotional expression. It does not pursue perfect retouching but captures the most natural state of the subjects, as if recording an unknown early morning solitary moment. The air is filled with tranquility and peace, and the entire scene exudes an unsculpted authentic beauty, like a morning in memory where sunlight streams through the curtains into the room. She stands by the window, her thoughts drifting far away. Time becomes slow and precious at this moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
