        {
          "id": "krea2-f7ef49ffbfa4d05f75fd10c6",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣镜前戏谑蹲自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is taking a selfie in front of an indoor mirror, showing a slightly teasing and cute expression. She wears a white semi-transparent knit cardigan with fine vertical textures and a slightly reflective texture. She wears light-colored clothing underneath, with an open neckline revealing her collarbone. The sleeves are long-sleeved and naturally drape, made of soft material that hugs her curves. She wears black high-waisted shorts with a slim fit that fits the hips and thighs. The fabric is smooth and has a slight sheen, and she wears black platform wedge sandals. The upper features a simple single-strap design with a thick sole that clearly increases height. The heel is chunky, giving the overall look a stylish and casual look. She squats on a gray carpet, her right leg bent and raised, her left leg supporting the ground, body slightly leaning forward. She holds a black smartphone in her right hand, with a round magnetic phone stand on the back. The camera module is clearly visible, fingers naturally grip the phone, arms stretched straight to shoot in the mirror, and her left hand rests lightly on the white wall or cabinet edge behind her, looking relaxed and natural. The background is a modern office or home environment. On the left is a gray-white office piece of equipment, possibly a printer or copier, with a smooth surface and clean edges. Behind is a glass door or partition with a white frame, the glass letting in faint outdoor light. On the right is a white wall with an orange-red decorative line or door frame edge. The floor is covered with a gray short velvet carpet, soft in texture and reflecting subtle light and shadow. The entire scene is evenly lit, with natural light streaming in from the left side. This creates a warm side lighting effect, with soft shadows and clear layering. The composition uses a mirror-reflective perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, presenting a diagonal posture. The background elements are appropriately blurred to highlight the subject. The colors are primarily black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of orange-red, creating a clean, fresh, yet distinctive atmosphere. The overall style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, as if capturing high-quality life moments with a regular phone. It captures moments of youthful energy and self-expression, with images full of life atmosphere, rich details, natural light and shadow transitions, and harmonious tones, presenting a relaxed, joyful, confident, and composed emotional state",
