        {
          "id": "krea2-28d6f37caa433d343ecace66",
          "alias": "单女红和服城市困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways under a deep blue twilight sky, wearing a bright red kimono printed with white and light yellow floral patterns. The edges of the pattern are finely black, presenting the refined beauty of traditional Japanese kimono. The fabric is soft and drapes, with natural pleats, and light and shadow create a gentle transition of light and shadow. The contours are soft, revealing a calm yet slightly contemplative expression. She gently holds a burning firework stick in her right hand. Bright golden sparks burst from the tip, the sparks scattering in a radial pattern, forming dense and shimmering points of light. The light is warm and soft, casting a warm orange-yellow glow on the kimono, creating a strong contrast with the cool blue tones of the background, creating a powerful visual impact. The foreground features a female subject, with a medium close-up. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the right side, while the left side leaves a vast expanse of deep blue sky as the background. The background is simple yet profound, with no unnecessary elements, only a gradient deep blue night sky. From deep blue above to slightly light blue below, it presents a tranquil atmosphere at dusk or dawn. In the distance, a blurred horizon outline can be faintly seen, possibly the city skyline or mountain silhouettes, but details are blurred to make the subject stand out. The classic rule of thirds is used in composition: the figure is positioned near the right golden ratio point, with the gaze facing left, creating imaginative space. The spark's light becomes the most striking focal point in the painting. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a tranquil, dreamy, and slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere. The strong contrast between warm and cool tones enhances the emotional tension of the image. The warm light source comes from fireworks, symbolizing fleeting warmth and hope, while the cool background represents the loneliness and vastness of the night. This contrast not only enriches the layering of the image but also imparts profound emotional connotations. The overall style combines the refinement of artistic photography with the realism of everyday shooting, as if captured by a professional camera at dusk, with the background slightly blurred The depth of field is well controlled, the details are clear, the color saturation is moderate, and the image is both realistic and idealistic. The composition is simple yet deep, and the use of light and shadow is skillful, creating an atmosphere that is both romantic and slightly lonely, allowing people to feel the brevity and beauty of time, as well as the smallness and contemplation of individuals in the vast world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
