        {
          "id": "krea2-6dd24d9245cb959028a7b5b9",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣室内忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm indoor setting, wearing a light brown knit beret with a slightly lowered brim, giving off a gentle and elegant vibe, carrying a hint of melancholy and contemplation, presenting a natural pink. She wears an off-white and light brown plaid shirt, with a matching silk scarf tied at the collar, adding a touch of vintage elegance. Over it, she wears an off-white coarse knit sweater vest with clear texture, with slight floss trim at the edges, giving off a casual and comfortable vibe. Her left hand holds a cloth tote bag with green and white stripes and orange stripes, printed with blurry text patterns. Her right hand holds a black smartphone, the screen lit up, displaying some content. Her posture is relaxed, her body slightly turned to one side, head slightly tilted, expression focused and calm, as if deep in thought. The background is a blurry indoor space where yellow chairs or sofas and scattered items can be seen. Light enters from the left side of the frame, forming a bright beam. Soft light and shadow effects are created, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow and beige, creating a cozy, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the character positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to focus the visual focus on the subject. At the same time, shallow depth of field is used to blur the background and highlight the subject. In terms of lighting and shadow, backlighting softly outlines the character's outline, while the shadows are softer. The overall image has a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, and rich details. It presents a fleeting beauty in everyday life, like real photos taken with an old camera, with slight noise and graininess, enhancing realism and a sense of the times. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, allowing people to feel the gentleness and depth of youthful years",
