        {
          "id": "krea2-92940749a3fd96ae40986121",
          "alias": "单女灰外套山野忧伤倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a light gray loose coat layered with dark garments underneath. The hem of the coat hangs naturally, with soft lines. The overall look is simple yet textured, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting, occupying about one-third of the space and forming the visual focal point. The background features layers upon layers of distant mountains, their silhouettes shrouded in mist, showing a blue-green gradient from near to far. The ridges undulate and distinctly layered. The nearby hillside is covered with low vegetation, with colors leaning toward dark green and brownish-yellow, giving a slight wilderness. The sky is gray and white, with thick clouds that emit faint light, creating a tranquil atmosphere on cloudy days or early mornings. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is on the right, leaving a wide space on the left to showcase the magnificent mountain scenery, creating a dynamic contrast. In the foreground, some blurred grass and shrubs can be seen, with details slightly blurred to enhance depth of field. The middle ground is the transition between the figure and the foot of the mountain, while the background is a mountain range extending into the distance, with soft and even light and shadow. There is no intense direct light, and the overall tone is cool, mainly blue, gray, and green, with a slight grainy film texture and retro filter effects. The image has a slight color shift, reminiscent of vintage camera footage, extending to distant mountains and then returning to the subject's body, forming a circular sight path, emphasizing the harmonious relationship between humans and nature. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, and contemplative, carrying a poetic melancholy and yearning for freedom, as if recording a brief yet profound moment during a journey. Shot with a 35mm lens, It simulates the perspective of everyday amateur equipment, with moderate focal length and well-controlled depth of field, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental details. The image texture is delicate, colors are realistic yet restrained, presenting a lifelike artistic beauty, similar to impromptu snapshots in travel photography, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
