        {
          "id": "krea2-29abf568952fc96da01ba465",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a quaint town street, wearing round glasses and a white hollow-out knit cardigan paired with a blue dress. On her right wrist is a bright red wrist strap, gently embracing a pure white lamb. A small red ornament is tied around the lamb's neck, echoing the bracelet. Behind her is a typical Chinese ancient town architectural complex. On both sides of the bluestone-paved streets are traditional wooden houses, with upturned eaves, mottled tiles, red lanterns and green signs hanging on the walls, inscribed with words like \"Baisha Ancient Town.\" In the distance, several tourists leisurely stroll around. The entire scene is bathed in warm afternoon sunlight, with light slanting down from above, casting soft shadows on the ground and buildings, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center, highlighting the intimate interaction between the figure and the lamb in the foreground. The middle ground shows the depth and architectural details of the ancient alley, while the background extends the continuity of the street. The visual guide converges from the buildings on both sides of the street into the depths, drawing the gaze into the distance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, with sunlight streaming through the eaves to create a light spot effect. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, accented with white, blue, and red, creating a tranquil, harmonious, and lively pastoral atmosphere. It feels like capturing everyday moments casually with a lightweight digital camera on a sunny day. With a slight film texture and natural noise, the edges of the frame are slightly out of focus, presenting an authentic humanistic documentary style, while retaining enough detail and color layers to allow viewers to feel the warmth between humans and animals, as well as the simple yet beautiful passage of time in a traditional village",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
