        {
          "id": "krea2-2fd620bd48decda0e4d99a52",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣咖啡厅俏皮坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table indoors, holding a silver spoon in her right hand. She wears an off-white knit cardigan paired with lace-trimmed inner layers and a red-brown plaid pleated mini skirt. She carries a small woven bag slung over her shoulder, adorned with pink tassels and blue decorations. The overall look is sweet and cute. The main figure is this woman, positioned slightly in the center of the left side of the frame, her body slightly tilted, her posture natural and relaxed, clearly prominent. The center is the tabletop area, where a pink butterfly-shaped cake is placed on top, sprinkled with glitter and crumbs. Next to it is an open white packaging box with neatly arranged metal knives. On the right side is a lit small desk lamp with a white matte cover and a golden base. The lamp is printed with the words \"TEENIE WEENIE\" and \"Tiv Cafe COFFEE.\" The lamp emits a warm, soft yellow light. In the background, you can see a teddy bear plush wearing a dark blue hooded sweatshirt. The sweatshirt has a white brand logo, leaning lazily in a chair. Behind are light-colored walls and some door frames, with light wood flooring and faint outlines of white furniture visible in the distance. The composition combines close-ups with medium shots, with the figures occupying the main part of the frame and forming the visual center. The diagonal perspective enhances the sense of space and realism, especially the cake and desk lamp, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The light and shadows come from the lamp's warm glow and indoor ambient lighting, creating soft and even lighting with delicate and natural shadows. The overall color palette mainly features warm yellow, off-white, and light brown, accented with pink and red. It creates a relaxed and joyful atmosphere in daily life, as if filmed with a regular phone, featuring slight graininess and authentic color transitions, presenting a friendly and natural documentary style. The images are rich in detail and authentic in texture, combining sweetness with a sense of warmth and authenticity in everyday life",
