        {
          "id": "krea2-6ec435538fc589bbfc57ee21",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣车厢冷淡站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a subway station, wearing a black slim-fit knit cardigan adorned with several white buttons. The collar and cuffs reveal the collar and cuffs of the plaid shirt, which are woven from beige, gray, and dark brown. The hem naturally peeks out over the black pleated skirt. The dress is well-tailored with distinct layers, exuding youthful energy. Her right hand rests gently at her waist, while her left hand carries a fluffy light brown lambswool handbag. The bag is soft and fluffy, with a warm texture. She stands slightly sideways, Full of approachability, the background is the interior environment of a subway station. On the right is an upward escalator, with metal handrails and steps reflecting a cool metallic sheen under the lights. On the left is a white wall with signs labeled \"Next Station\" and the English \"Next Station.\" Next to it is a green emergency exit sign. The floor is paved with gray tiles and edges with anti-slip metal stripes. The overall space is well-lit but slightly cool, and the ceiling lights emit a uniform white glow illuminating the entire scene. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with a mid-angle perspective that highlights the main subject while preserving details of the surrounding environment. The visual guide extends from the character's body to the escalators and stairs in the background, creating a sense of depth. Light and shadow are distributed naturally, shadows are soft, and subtle light and shadow changes appear in the folds of clothing, creating a realistic and three-dimensional effect. The atmosphere blends urban daily life with youthful fashion, combining the modernity and functionality of a subway station with sweetness and a sense of everyday life. Overall, it presents a relaxed, natural, and life-close documentary style, as if captured casually with a regular camera or phone. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm checkered tones and the purse's brownish-yellow tones. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, with rich details and clear layers, creating strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
