        {
          "id": "krea2-daaa598893576a669c98e1ed",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the stairwell, looking directly at the camera, her expression calm yet confident and composed. She wears a white cropped collared shirt with sleeves rolled up to her elbows, featuring black letters \"RLIE\" and \"A\" on the chest. The hem reveals a slender waistline, paired with light blue washed denim shorts. A bright magenta wide leather belt is tied at the waist, adding a splash of color to the overall look. On her feet are off-white platform canvas shoes, slightly worn uppers, presenting a casual everyday vibe. Her posture is elegant and full of tension. The left leg is raised and straightened backward, with toes touching the steps. The right leg stands to support the body, the left hand gently supports the wall, and the right hand hangs naturally. The body turns slightly to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a rough gray cement-textured wall with irregular textures and mottled marks. On the left is a metal grid-like protective fence or decorative wall with diamond-shaped patterns, reflecting a faint cold light. The floor is light gray cement steps, each step with clear edges, and light slanting down from above. Soft shadows are cast on the walls and steps, creating a spatial atmosphere where industrial style blends modernity. The composition uses the center-right position of the main figure, with the staircase's diagonal lines guiding the line of sight upward. The metal mesh contrasts with the vertical lines on the wall, enhancing the structural sense of the image. The extended lines of the legs and the horizontal lines of the steps form a dynamic balance, with rich layers of light and shadow. The main light source comes from the upper left, with natural transitions in the shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly gray-white, accented with pink and blue. The color contrasts are sharp yet not jarring, the atmosphere is calm, stylish, and full of street style, as if captured with a regular phone. With slight noise and realistic ambient lighting, it presents a daily yet artistically beautiful imaging style. The details are rich, the composition is full but not crowded, and the sense of space is strong, giving a sense of casual yet carefully designed. It's like a snapshot capturing the lives of urban youth, combining the professional posture of a model with the authentic texture of everyday everyday wear",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
