        {
          "id": "krea2-04a5b01e633e5830198bd44e",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣商店坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the counter of a cozy ice cream shop. She wears a white long-sleeved cardigan and a white short skirt printed with a bear pattern, paired with platform white sneakers paired with white socks. Her overall look is sweet and fresh, holding a brown teddy bear plushie, her posture naturally relaxed. Her body leans slightly back against the freezer, her left hand gently resting on the edge of the freezer, her right leg bent and left leg straight, showing off her long, slightly wavy leg lines, as if she were immersed in a peaceful afternoon. The main subject of the image is this woman. She is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. In the foreground is a wooden high stool she sits on and her body. In the middle is a light-colored wooden counter with neatly stacked plates and paper cups. On the wall hang a hand-drawn cartoon poster and a wall lamp. Next to it hang three pink and white paper lanterns of various sizes, adding a touch of childlike warmth. The side of the counter features a cute cartoon bear pattern, with a coffee machine, shelves, and various kitchen utensils in the background. On the right is a large white freezer with ventilation openings above. The walls are light-colored, with industrial-style pipes and metal structures. On the left wall, there are several hand-painted graffiti-style decorative paintings. The overall space is dominated by natural wood tones and white, creating a simple yet comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, making the scene more dynamic and full of life. Following her body lines, it extends to the doll in her hands and the shoes underfoot, then spreads into the surrounding environmental details. Light and shadow come from the wall lamp on the left and indoor lighting, soft and even, creating a warm yellow tone. Shadows delicately outline the outlines of objects, creating a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere full of the everyday life vibe, like a real scene photo taken by an amateur camera, with slight noise and natural color transitions. The camera feels authentic, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment. The image texture is delicate and detailed, combining the sophistication of a modern city with the warmth of everyday life. Overall, it presents a healing aesthetic style that lets people feel the beauty of youth and the simple joys of life",
