        {
          "id": "krea2-bf1958f25367368ed9d02e46",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙室内温柔站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a light green tight dress made of knitted fabric with delicate vertical textures and pleats. The shoulders are designed off-shoulder, with one shoulder strap tied in a bow pattern at the chest. The sleeves are short-sleeved with subtle ruffle decorations. The overall cut fits the figure, highlighting slender curves and elegant silhouettes. Her left hand hangs naturally, her body slightly turned to the side, head slightly tilted, creating an atmosphere that is both intimate and slightly distant. In the foreground, you can see a corner of a bed: a white sheet is soft and fluffy, with slight wrinkles at the edges. Beside the bed is a dark gray nightstand with a charger and a white charging cable. In the background, there is a light gray wall and a window framed in black. The light outside the window is bright but blocked by curtains, creating a soft, diffused light. The curtains are made of multiple layers of fabric, including dark gray, light gray, and blue stripes, with clear layers and rich texture. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots where the subjects occupy the main position. Light and shadow enter from the right window direction, creating a natural side lighting effect. The light is soft and even, with delicate shadow transitions, creating a warm and tranquil indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly green, gray, and white, with harmonious and unified color combinations. The visual experience is fresh and comfortable, with rich image details and a realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera under natural light. It offers a strong sense of realism and artistic beauty, while preserving the casualness and authenticity of daily life, presenting a visual experience that blends fashion and a sense of life",
