        {
          "id": "krea2-258c4ada60376a6ff947089e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙雪地微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors in a warm festive atmosphere, wearing a gentle smile and a slightly shy yet expectant expression. She wears a black lace strapless dress with a heart-shaped neckline, highlighting the graceful lines of her collarbone and bust. The dress is made of delicate texture that fits her figure, showcasing feminine softness and nobility. Her right hand gently rests on the table, Her fingers are long, and on her left wrist is a slender silver bracelet. Her arm posture is naturally relaxed, and her body leans slightly forward, presenting a friendly and alluring pose. In the foreground are several carefully packaged Christmas gift boxes. At the very front is a white gift box adorned with a huge red sparkling ribbon bow. The satin surface reflects a soft sheen, and next to it is a striped gold and white gift box, paired with green ribbons and golden snowflake patterns, looking luxurious and elegant. Behind the gift box, a wooden candlestick can be faintly seen, with a lit white spiral candle inserted on it. The flame flickers, emitting a warm orange-yellow glow that illuminates the surroundings. In the background is a beautifully decorated white Christmas tree, its trunk covered in a snow-like effect. Golden spherical ornaments, red ribbon bows, and transparent crystal balls are dotted between the branches and leaves. The tree is also adorned with twinkling warm yellow bulbs, creating a dreamy festive atmosphere. Light streams in through the right window, creating a soft side glow. At the same time, a slight backlighting effect is created in the background, giving the Christmas tree and the edges of the figures a layer of gold edging. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with black, white, red, and gold as the main tones, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait method, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, and the gaze meeting the viewer's gaze, creating a strong visual direction. The gift box and candle holder in the foreground add depth and a sense of life to the scene. The Christmas tree in the background is used as the main element with a blurred effect to highlight the main subject. Using a large-aperture lens with a shallow depth of field and a soft bokeh effect in the background, the overall image is filled with holiday warmth and romance, with a professional studio-level texture yet still a familiar everyday feel. It feels like shooting a high-end camera in a private residence, with rich details, moderate color saturation, warm tones, and natural light and shadow transitions, conveying a quiet, beautiful, and slightly anticipatory holiday feeling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
