        {
          "id": "krea2-b23c19ab3b3afdc4ba2eca85",
          "alias": "单女白T恤摄影棚微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an indoor art studio, wearing a white camisole and light blue jeans. The hem of the vest reveals part of her waist. The jeans are loose and low-waisted, with natural hanging legs. There are slight wear details in the pockets. The overall look is simple and casual, with a casual everyday feel, naturally draped over her shoulders, with a hint of smile. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly leaning to the side. Her left hand gently rests on the wooden easel, fingers resting naturally on the edge of the board. The board bears some traces of blue paint, and the easel is natural wood color, with a simple and stable structure. The background is a soft white curtain, with light and flowing fabric, naturally pleated, letting in bright natural light. Light streams in from the right window edge, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In the back right of the canvas is an unfinished oil painting, with abstract blue and white brushstrokes on the canvas. The colors are hazy and dreamy, as if depicting a water or sky. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right to display background elements. The movement follows the body lines to the easel and painting, creating a natural visual flow. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, full of artistic flair. The lighting is mainly natural light, soft and even, without strong shadows. The color tones are mainly neutral tones like white, light blue, and beige, creating a fresh and clean feeling. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, with high resolution and clear details, while retaining slight film graininess to enhance realism. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main figure. Distant paintings and curtains gradually blur, with clear layers. Overall, it presents a tranquil moment of an artist's creation in daily life, combining a sense of authenticity with artistic beauty. The composition is balanced and harmonious, color combinations are harmonious and unified, and the light and shadow are soft and natural, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and creative emotional atmosphere",
