        {
          "id": "krea2-f9266e39be2644602b96ecf5",
          "alias": "单女透视灰毛衣城市微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans elegantly against the corner of a pure white wall, wearing a form-fitting gray sleeveless knit top made of delicate, soft fabric with a subtle sheen, perfectly outlining her long silhouette. She pairs a high-waisted black pencil skirt with a high waist, made of stretch fabric that hugs the hip line and highlights a smooth waistline and full curves. She wears sheer stockings, her legs long and straight, her posture naturally relaxed yet sexy. She wears slim metal-framed glasses, clear and transparent, A slight upward tilt forms a subtle smile. Her right hand gently holds a green transparent phone case, with subtle textures and reflections on the case. Her left hand naturally hangs at one side of her body, fingers long and fair. The overall look is simple and modern, full of urban fashion. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, slightly tilted and head slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The background is a minimalist interior space, with smooth white walls. On the left wall is a set of black smart switch panels. The square design is clean and neat, adding a touch of technology to the image. Light comes from the upper left of the image, softly and evenly casting on the figures, creating a natural transition between light and dark. Shadows fall on the right wall and floor, creating clear layers and consistent lighting directions, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with the bright green phone case, creating a striking but not jarring visual contrast. The image presents a clean, fresh, and modern texture, as if it were everyday portraits taken with a high-end professional camera, while preserving the natural details and realism of real life, with strong visual guidance. It then moves down along the body's curves to clothing and posture, and finally notices the phone in hand and background details. The overall composition is balanced, with a slightly overhead perspective that enhances the character's three-dimensionality and approachability. The atmosphere is tranquil and charming, resembling a carefully planned fashion shoot. It also seems like a moment of life captured unintentionally, conveying a confident, independent, elegant, and slightly mysterious temperament. The images are rich in detail, all conveying a high sense of realism and artistic beauty, presenting an overall sophisticated, minimalist, and modern aesthetic style, as if shot from an urban apartment or studio, full of the charm and strength of modern women",
