        {
          "id": "krea2-d32c684801481ca8aab89dc7",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚微笑过肩",
          "prompt": "The neckline features a classic lapel design, the front placket adorned with a row of silver buttons, and the long sleeves are made of semi-transparent black lace embroidered with exquisite floral patterns, forming a striking contrast with the smooth black dress. Slightly curled over her shoulders, she wears a gentle smile, looks directly at the camera, and her right hand naturally rests on her waist, her posture composed and expressive She wears a pair of white pointed high heels, with the toes adorned with pearls and rhinestones, giving her a noble and elegant look. Her legs are long and straight, crossed and stacked, toes pointing downward. Light and shadow cast clear reflections on the floor. In the background is a large window, outside which are blurred green plants and a wooden fence. Sunlight streams through the glass into the room, creating soft light spots and bokeh effects, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The entire composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective to highlight their posture and costume details. Light shines from the side and front, making the contours of the figure clear and the shadows soft. The color scheme is mainly black and white, paired with white high heels as a visual highlight. The overall style combines fashion and artistic beauty, presenting a high-end, refined, and modern photo effect. It feels as if you were shooting in a private home or a high-end studio, captured with a professional camera and large aperture lens. It offers strong visual guidance and emotional expression, with delicate texture, rich details, and fresh and natural tones. It features a slight film graininess and realistic transitions of light and shadow, presenting an aesthetic that is both everyday and transcendent",
