        {
          "id": "krea2-b7141bef15e0a6a649a390ff",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman looks especially lively. She wears an off-white turtleneck sweater with fluffy, soft white fur decorations at the cuffs, delicate to the touch and warm texture. Her right hand gently holds a red lollipop. The candy is spherical, smooth and crystal-clear, reflecting soft light. The green plastic stick is slender and straight, forming a sharp contrast with the bright red, forming one of the visual focal points of the painting. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with a body slightly tilted to the camera and head tilted slightly, as if gazing into the distance or immersed in thoughts. The composition uses close-up shots to highlight their expressions and details. The foreground features the character's hands and lollipops, clearly visible, while the background is blurred, presenting a deep gray tone that is almost completely blurred, with only faint shadows and lines visible, creating a strong depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out more. The left side of the frame leaves a large space, forming an asymmetrical composition that increases visual tension. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with sunlight filtering through windows or obstructions. Highlights are bright and soft, shadows transition delicately, enhancing three-dimensionality and realism. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a touch of youthful innocence and romance. The tones are mainly warm white, beige, and pale pink, accented with red candy and green sticks. The color scheme is harmonious and layered, with a slight film texture and graininess, simulating everyday phone photography, as if capturing everyday life moments with ordinary devices. Overall, it presents a natural, authentic visual experience full of artistic beauty",
