        {
          "id": "krea2-a786a1b6c7657671d39cb8e1",
          "alias": "单女米西装街道站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, presenting a casual yet elegant posture full of confidence and approachability. She wears a beige blazer with a well-tailored cut and smooth lines, a classic lapel design, three black buttons at the cuffs, and a black low-cut slip dress underneath. The tight cut accentuates her slender figure, and in her right hand she carries a black leather handbag, adorned with gold metal fasteners and the \"Christian Dior PARIS\" logo, giving the bag a full shape, with a high-end texture, the left hand naturally hanging down, a delicate gold necklace on the wrist with a star-shaped pendant hanging from it, and a pair of gold earrings. The look is simple yet refined, and on the feet are black socks printed with the letters \"CHRISTIAN DIOR,\" paired with light-colored high heels. The overall outfit is fashionable and layered. The figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head turned to the rear right, creating a dynamic visual balance. The foreground is the main subject. Occupying the main position in the composition, the composition uses a slightly upward angle to emphasize the figures' height and presence. The background features a row of retro-style gray brick-walled buildings, built from dark gray bricks with slightly weathered surfaces that convey a sense of historical depth. The building features wooden balconies with traditional windows, some half-open, revealing a blurred interior scene. On the right, a corner of the red tiled roof can be seen above the building, adding a touch of Eastern charm. In the distance, pedestrians can be faintly seen but blurred out. Highlighting the main figure, the sky appears grayish-white with soft and even lighting, suitable for cloudy or scattered light environments. Light and shadow shine from the upper left, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion with nostalgia, combining the independence and confidence of modern women with a touch of everyday life. The color palette is mainly neutral, with beige, black, and gray echoing each other, creating a calm yet stylish visual effect. The composition emphasizes spatial layering, with a clear foreground, clear architecture in the middle ground, and a moderately blended background. A good depth of field relationship is formed, with visual guidance extending from the subject's line of sight to the background buildings and returning to the person themselves, creating a closed-loop visual flow. The entire scene resembles a street photo taken on an ordinary afternoon, captured using amateur equipment such as a phone or portable camera, with slight noise and realistic color reproduction, presenting a genuine and natural aesthetic of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
