        {
          "id": "krea2-dde6f1587eccf33d4ac54569",
          "alias": "单女白T恤摄影棚专注坐持乐器",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light-colored wooden indoor step, wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt and loose army green cargo pants, wearing classic black-and-white canvas shoes. Her left hand gently presses the guitar neck, while her right hand rests above the strings, as if preparing to play or just paused. She holds a natural wood folk guitar, with smooth body lines, black guards around the soundholes, and clearly visible frets and brand logos on the neck. The overall posture is relaxed and focused, presenting a casual, casual musical atmosphere. In the foreground is the complete body of the character and guitar. occupying the left center of the painting, the composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is fully presented from knee to head, with the body slightly turned to the side, creating a natural dynamic balance. The background is a minimalist, modern indoor space. On the left side is an off-white multi-layer open bookshelf with some compartments for books or decorations. In the distance, blue paintings or posters can be faintly seen. The right wall is light gray with subtle textures. The overall environment is clean and tidy, with soft tones, creating a quiet and comfortable home or music studio atmosphere. Light comes from the front left of the painting. Softly and evenly spread over the figures, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, with delicate shadows that highlight a sense of depth. Meanwhile, the background wall and bookshelf are lightly influenced by light and shadow, enhancing spatial layering. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, army green, and dark gray. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, with a slight retro filter texture, giving the image a warm, nostalgic, yet fresh visual feel. The composition uses diagonal guidance, and the figure's sitting posture extends diagonally with the guitar to create visual flow, creating a strong emotional connection. It creates a warm and authentic everyday scene, with a quiet and peaceful lighting atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil moment under the afternoon sun. The entire scene is both artistic and close to everyday life, like a real moment captured with an amateur camera. The details are rich, emotions are full, and it is full of youthful energy and musical poetry",
