        {
          "id": "krea2-4727a024245ee3039810491d",
          "alias": "单女高领衫沙发沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, presenting a soft sheen. Looking directly into the camera, she wears a pair of round metal fine-framed glasses. The lenses are transparent and non-reflective, with slender and elegant frame lines that highlight her fresh temperament. She wears a dark turtleneck knit sweater in pure black, with a delicate texture and clearly visible vertical rib texture, hugging the figure and showing natural curves. The sleeves are slightly loose. There are slight pleats at the cuffs, and she pairs the lower half with a plaid skirt woven from deep brown, beige, and dark red, creating a vintage and warm feel. The hem edges have a slight curled edge, adding a touch of casual and lazy charm. Her hands rest gently on her knees, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, her right hand slightly bent, and her left hand naturally resting on her right, her posture relaxed and natural. Her body is slightly turned to the camera, and her head is slightly tilted, creating a subtle dynamic balance. The composition uses medium shots for close-ups. The figure occupies the center left of the composition, fully visible from the chest up to the thighs. The background is a blurred indoor environment. On the left is a corner of a light gray fabric sofa, soft in material with fine fabric textures. The right side is a partial wooden furniture, possibly a bookshelf or cabinet, on which colorful items such as books, toys, or decorations are placed. The colors are mainly orange, blue, and pink, but due to the blurring treatment, they appear hazy. The background is overall in a shallow depth of field, with the focus on the figure. Highlighting the main subject, the composition uses visual guiding lines. The sofa edge on the left and the outline of the furniture on the right form a symmetrical framing effect, enhancing the stability and depth of the composition. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the light source coming from the front slightly left, simulating natural or indoor lighting without strong shadows, creating a comfortable and tranquil atmosphere. The wrinkles and textures of the clothing appear rich in texture under the light, and the background colors appear soft and not harsh under diffused light. The overall tone is mainly warm yellow and brown. Accented with a few cool color elements, creating contrast and harmony, the image feels intimate and realistic from everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera, with slight film grain and natural noise that enhances the authentic texture. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, conveying a quiet, focused, and intellectual atmosphere",
