          "id": "krea2-0a815fe745ebe537d358e75f",
          "alias": "单女泳装泳池忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a tight swimsuit in deep blue or black, made of lightweight material that fits her body curves. Her shoulders are smooth, arms naturally extended, her right hand gently resting on the edge of the pool, fingers slightly bent, palm facing downward. The back of her hand and wrist show faint ripples and reflections, with a hint of greenish hues. The background is a vast expanse of turquoise blue pool, clear and pure, showing gradient layers from shallow to deep, transitioning from bright blue nearby to deep green in the distance. The surface is dotted with numerous tiny white bubbles, varying in size and distributed in a well-arranged manner. Some gather in the upper left of the painting to form a hazy cloud-like area, while others are scattered throughout the painting. As the water slowly rises, it creates a floating, light, and dreamlike visual effect. Some bubbles produce bright highlights due to light refraction. This enhances the image's sense of depth and dynamism. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left in the lower half of the frame, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze slightly off-center to create subtle visual guidance. At the same time, a large amount of upper space is reserved to showcase the vastness and ethereal underwater environment. On the right edge of the image, a faint number \"20\" can be seen, possibly a magazine page number or design element, but it does not interfere with the subject's expression. The overall composition is balanced and full of tension, with the foreground showing details of the character's body and hands. The background features layers of blue water and floating bubbles, creating a clear sense of spatial depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly cool tones, with the main light source coming from above the water, presenting natural light slanting into the water from above. As the light passes through the water layer, it refracts and scatters, creating a soft and even diffused light. The shadows transition naturally, without strong contrasts of light and shadow. The underwater light has a distinct blue-green tone, giving the entire scene a calm, tranquil, and even slightly melancholic poetic temperament. The color saturation is moderately high on the slightly high side. The blue-green tones dominate, forming a sharp contrast with the dark clothing of the figures and enhancing visual impact. The overall visual style is both realistic and artistic, combining the authentic texture of everyday photography with a surreal dreamlike atmosphere, as if capturing a moment frozen by time. Like images taken by a film camera, the graininess is slight, colors slightly fade, presenting a retro yet warm filter effect. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance central focus, creating an immersive and highly immersive underwater world experience. All these details together create an image full of emotional tension, breathability, and serene beauty, evoking the gentle embrace of water and a brief escape of the soul",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
