        {
          "id": "krea2-c6b7771c98c636c48e04d99b",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor street, wearing a loose light gray hooded sweatshirt and a soft gray knit beret adorned with a white webbing on the hat. Her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative. She carries a pink and black backpack with blue plaid patterns and a small charm. In her left hand, she holds a white garment or a small quilt, her body slightly turned to the side, presenting a casual yet slightly lazy posture. The background is a blurred city streetscape, with mottled walls, trees, and roads. Sunlight slanted in from the left side of the painting, creating a warm backlight effect and a faint halo that creates a tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or evening. The overall tone of the painting leans toward a cool tone, mainly gray-blue and off-white, but the warm yellow sunlight injects a touch of warmth. The contrast of light and shadow is sharp, with figures standing out in the foreground. The middle is a blurred street and buildings, while the background is fully integrated into bokeh. The composition uses a rule of thirds: the figure is on the right side, leaving space on the left side to enhance visual balance. The background blur is well handled. It highlights the subject's presence, and the overall style carries the texture and artistic vibe of everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or phone. It features slight film graininess and natural color distortions. The details are rich, from the folds of clothing to the texture of backpacks, all clearly visible. Light creates soft highlights and shadow transitions on the figures, enhancing depth and realism. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of storytelling, evoking an ordinary yet unforgettable moment in youth. The image presents a serene beauty, combining the alienation of a modern city with gentle humanistic care. The composition is compact but not crowded, extending to the blurred elements in the background, forming a smooth visual path. The use of light and shadow cleverly shapes the character's emotional state. The combination of warm light and cool tones makes the image both warm and slightly lonely, presenting an overall low-saturation, high-quality photographic style, like a private photo recording fragments of life, full of authenticity and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
