        {
          "id": "krea2-be23a7004047f54d10fcfbb8",
          "alias": "单女门俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a modern, minimalist indoor space, wearing a loose yellow Los Angeles Lakers basketball jersey printed with purple \"LAKERS\" and the number \"77.\" The hem naturally drapes down to mid-thigh, showcasing a casual yet energetic style. She smiles, showing off her neat, white teeth. Her overall expression conveys a relaxed and cheerful mood, raising both hands. The index and middle fingers make two \"V\" gestures, and on the wrist are tiny bracelets and wristbands, reflecting personal taste in the details. The background is a light gray marble textured wall, smooth and delicate with natural white veins, presenting a premium texture. On the left, you can see some beige door frames and wall structures. The floor is paved with matching marble tiles, reflecting a subtle sheen. The space layout is simple and orderly, with light evenly distributed from recessed downlights at the top, creating a soft and bright indoor lighting effect. The light source projects from above, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figures. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, with rich light and shadow layers but not excessive contrast. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium shot with the figure positioned slightly to the center, occupying the main visual area. The vertical lines on the background wall guide the line of sight upward, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Meanwhile, the diagonal lines formed by the left door frame break monotony, adding dynamic elements to the image. There are no obvious obstructions in the foreground, and the figure's posture is open and natural. Raising both hands high creates a symmetrical composition. The visual guidance is clear and distinct, blending sports and leisure, youthful energy, and the warmth of everyday home. The color scheme is a warm yellow, paired with a cool gray background for a striking contrast that highlights the main subject. A touch of pink is added as accents to enhance the visual appeal and feminine qualities. The images evoke a sense of impromptu capture from real life, as if shot with a regular phone or home camera, with slight motion blur and natural noise, preserving a realistic feel of everyday life without excessive post-processing. The image's mood is positive and uplifting, conveying confidence, optimism, and a love of life. Details are rich but not complicated, with every element serving the theme. From clothing to accessories to environmental arrangement, they together create a complete and vivid visual narrative scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
