        {
          "id": "krea2-ba74594cf7d9c74a54376bba",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市自信比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in the driver's seat of a luxury car, her makeup natural and translucent, her overall aura elegant and sexy. She wore a white lace cutout dress with a deep V-shaped neckline and tie decorations. The chest and waist were adorned with delicate lace trim. The dress was short, accentuating her long legs. She leaned slightly forward, her right hand resting gently on the brown leather seat, her left hand naturally resting on the edge of the car door, and a delicate silver bracelet on her wrist. Her nails were neatly trimmed and painted with white nail art, her posture relaxed and confident. The legs stretch out naturally, and the knees are slightly bent, showcasing graceful leg lines. The interior mainly features brown leather seats with black stitching on the edges. The headrests are made of red leather, giving a premium feel. The center console and inside doors show some control buttons and storage spaces. Outside the windows, the outlines of city buildings are faintly visible. The background is blurred, presenting a gray-blue urban scene. Light enters diagonally through the windows, mainly from the left front, creating a three-dimensional effect. The overall composition uses close-ups. The figures occupy most of the frame, with a slightly upward angle highlighting their figures and clothing details. The background blur enhances the subject's striking effect. The color scheme mainly uses white, brown, and black to create a warm and sophisticated visual contrast. The atmosphere is quiet and private, as if capturing a tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight streaming into the car. The entire scene has a strong cinematic and fashionable feel, like high-quality portraits shot in a professional studio, while preserving the authentic and natural texture of everyday life. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, simulating camera effects. The image quality is delicate and clear, with rich details, well-controlled noise, and a warm tone, presenting an artistic style that blends sophistication with everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
