        {
          "id": "krea2-6d21483497d828d2d2690125",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍室内害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, with the main figure wearing an off-white modified qipao with black floral patterns. The qipao features a traditional Chinese stand collar and frog button, with sleeves available in short-sleeved or sleeveless styles. The fabric is delicate and presents a natural cotton-linen texture. The black floral patterns are painted in an expressive style, with flowers and leaves of various shapes arranged in a harmonious manner on the body. The lines are smooth and artistic, blending traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion elements, with the figure's posture natural. Both hands gently grip the shoulder straps of the light blue backpack. The straps are made of nylon webbing with black plastic adjustment buckles, appearing practical and minimalist. The expression is gentle yet slightly shy, presenting a quiet and reserved temperament. The middle shot extends to the middle of the figure's body, showing him wearing black bottoms, which contrasts sharply with the light-colored top. The background is a simple indoor space, with pure white walls and a smooth surface. At the right rear is a white curtain or partition, made of thin material with natural pleats, and part of the ceiling structure visible at the top. Including embedded lighting fixtures and metal frames, the lighting is soft and even. The diffused light from above makes the entire scene bright but not glaring. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure centered slightly to the left and the head slightly tilted, creating a friendly and natural visual impression. The viewing angle is close to level and slightly upright to enhance the person's approachability. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, creating a strong sense of interaction. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is calm and warm, with tones mainly off-white, light gray, light blue, and black, harmoniously and unified. Overall, it presents a realistic and beautiful moment from everyday life, as if taken with a professional camera in high-quality indoor photos, with a delicate texture and slight graininess like film photography, while preserving natural light and shadow transitions and color layering, creating an atmosphere that is both modern and nostalgic. The composition is compact but not crowded, with a moderate sense of space, suitable for creating personal images or cultural themes. The image style combines documentary and artistic qualities, conveying a sense of quiet, elegance, and a sense of everyday beauty",
