        {
          "id": "krea2-e599a2d5130e9393152036f1",
          "alias": "单女白T恤户外困倦坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on an outdoor stone steps, slightly turning her head to look back at the camera. She wears a simple white short-sleeved T-shirt. The fabric is thin and breathable, with natural pleats. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, showcasing a casual and natural style. Her body leans slightly forward, her right arm resting naturally on her knee, and her left hand gently supporting the green vines beside her. Her posture is relaxed and elegant, with dense green vines and leaves in the foreground. Some leaf edges are yellowed, presenting the early autumn seasonal feel. The leaves are rounded, veins are clearly visible, and the branches are intertwined and entwined. A natural frame structure is formed. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned slightly lower to the left of the frame, with her head slightly tilted to create a visual focal point. The background is a dark forest, tall and dense with layers of branches and leaves. Light streams through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow effects on the ground and figures. In the distance, blurred tree trunks and shrubs can be faintly seen, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition uses an asymmetrical golden ratio layout, with the subject leaning to the left and leaving plenty of space on the right for vegetation and background. It enhances the sense of breathability in the painting, while using vines in the foreground as guiding lines, making the visual flow smooth and natural. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by soft, scattered light, with a cool overall tone. Green and white form a sharp contrast yet remain harmonious. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating spots of light that add a dreamy and poetic feel. The overall scene presents a tranquil, fresh, and artistic atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil moment on a summer afternoon or early autumn morning, with a film shooting texture and moderate color saturation. With a slight retro filter effect, rich details and clear layering, it has a strong sense of everyday life and realism, like images taken with an old film camera under natural light, full of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
