        {
          "id": "krea2-26c84bb7f35636a69019f21b",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤博物馆微笑倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "Exuding youthful energy, she sat slightly to her side, leaning slightly forward. On her wrist was a purple wristband and a blue-and-white exhibition admission pass printed with the words \"Day 1.\" She wore a loose light gray-green short-sleeved T-shirt with yellow patterns on the chest, the hem casually tied around her abdomen, revealing a flat belly and a slender waistline. She wore a black spaghetti-strap bra underneath, white denim shorts with slightly rolled legs, creating an overall look that was casual yet fashionable. She is facing the camera with a gentle and sweet smile, carrying a touch of playfulness and approachability. The background is a blurry outdoor scene, with faint black and yellow railings, distant silhouettes, and some activity facilities, creating a lively and authentic exhibition atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position, the lower body naturally extending to the lower part of the frame, creating visual balance. The view is slightly overlooked, enhancing intimacy and immersion. The light is soft natural light, streaming from the upper right. Shadow transitions are natural, with an overall fresh and bright color scheme, mainly light green, white, and gold, accented by red ribbons and blue wristbands. The color combinations are harmonious and layered, with a warm and vivid lighting atmosphere, as if capturing a summer afternoon relaxing at a comic convention. The image texture is authentic and delicate, with slight film graininess and the spontaneity of everyday shooting, presenting a lifelike authentic beauty. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the details and expressions of the main characters. The entire scene is filled with youthful energy and a relaxed, joyful atmosphere, like a casual snapshot capturing the most natural and beautiful moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
