        {
          "id": "krea2-42a38d1c211d0c54bb4d06ce",
          "alias": "单女全裸白连衣裙公寓害羞站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a bright indoor window, wearing a light, flowing white sleeveless dress with a high neckline, naturally cinched waist, and an A-shaped hem made of semi-transparent chiffon or organza, featuring delicate pleats and layering. The hem edges curl slightly, presenting a soft, flowing texture. She crosses her arms over her chest, her left hand gently resting on her right, her posture elegant yet slightly shy. On her right ring finger, she wears a simple silver ring and a slender silver chain necklace around her neck. The legs are long, wearing nude-colored stockings. The right leg is slightly bent and raised, with the toes touching the ground, while the left leg stands upright supporting the body, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background features large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, with faint green plants and metal mesh railings visible outside. Light streams in from outside, creating a soft backlighting effect. The window frame is white, with clean and modern lines. The floor is a light-colored wooden floor with clear textures. In the lower right corner, there is a potted green plant with broad leaves in deep green, contrasting with the overall bright tone. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. Vertical lines and horizontal frames from windows serve as guiding lines to enhance the sense of depth in the painting. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and fresh, dominated by natural light, which is soft and even, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, off-white, light gray, and light green, with pure and harmonious colors. The details are rich and layered, giving it the realism of everyday photography with a regular camera, as if captured in a quiet apartment balcony or living room. The image texture is delicate, presenting an aesthetic style that is both artistic and close to life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
