        {
          "id": "krea2-0dccc2da7d74c53cd57e11c5",
          "alias": "单女毛衣雪地忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a frozen lake, wearing a knit cardigan in light green and white, adorned with elegant floral patterns. The dress features a loose high neckline, with natural faux edges at the cuffs and hem, presenting a warm yet lazy feel. Underneath, she wears a pure white dress whose hem gently spreads over the ice, creating soft pleats. Her legs are slightly bent, knees naturally raised, and off-white long socks on her feet. The overall look is fresh and sweet, with a hint of winter coolness. She lowers her head, her expression calm and slightly melancholic, as if immersed in her own thoughts, revealing a faint blush that adds a lively touch. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the composition, with her body in an oblique pose, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The foreground is an ice surface covered with fine ice crystals, with irregular textures and fine cracks. Some areas emit a faint blue-white sheen due to light refraction, and fine snow particles and frost flowers scattered across the ice, adding texture and realism. In the middle of the frame, the woman's body and clothing form a strong visual contrast with the ice. The light-colored clothing stands out in a cool-toned environment, and her posture subtly echoes the direction of the ice. The background is a vast frozen lake, with the distant ice gradually blurring, revealing a gradient cool blue tone. There are faint ripple marks at the edge of the water, suggesting the ice is not yet fully frozen and the sky is not in the frame, but the overall atmosphere reveals the soft light of a cloudy or dusk day. The composition combines close-ups with extended distant shots, creating a contrast between the subject's parts and the vastness of the environment, enhancing the sense of space and layering. The light naturally extends along her line of sight to the distant ice surface, guiding viewers to feel the stillness of time and the vastness of space. The light and shadow are delicate and soft, with light sources coming from the upper and side to simulate the diffuse effect of natural light. There is no strong contrast between light and dark, but the overall effect presents a cool, warm glow. The light reflects faint highlights on the ice surface, enhancing the transparency and texture of the ice. The atmosphere is tranquil, ethereal, and slightly poetic, carrying the unique chill and loneliness of winter. At the same time, the presence of the characters injects a touch of gentleness and vitality. The entire image resembles a photo taken with an old-fashioned film camera, with slight graininess and color shifts. The tone is slightly less saturated, presenting a vintage film texture. The lens focal length approaches 50mm, with a shallow depth of field, focusing clearly on the subject. The background blurs naturally, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall style blends Japanese artistic style with cinematic feel. It offers a dreamlike visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
