        {
          "id": "krea2-12d67c09f683f688ed31e5ee",
          "alias": "单女衬衫沙发沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on the edge of a dark brown leather sofa, wearing a loose shirt with a light gray-green linen texture. The collar is slightly open, revealing the outline of the dark undergarment, appearing casual and authentic. The cover is printed with black Chinese characters and simple illustrations, as if immersed in a world of words. Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful, her overall posture relaxed yet full of inner focus, rich in detail. The light and shadow are soft. In the middle is the backrest and armrests of a dark leather sofa, with a slight sheen and texture that presents a warm leather texture. The curved lines of the sofa echo the posture of the figures. The background is a blurred view outside the window. Through the glass window, you can see faint greenery and wooden structures. Faintly visible white hollowed-out railings or decorations are visible. Light streams in from outside, creating soft natural light, casting light on the sofa. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame. Turning your gaze to the right creates a visual guide. The overall image presents a quiet, warm, and poetic atmosphere. The tones are mainly warm yellow, brown, and light green, with low color saturation, creating a vintage film-like texture. The light and shadow transitions are natural, the contrast between light and shadow is soft, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality and layering. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and life, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The lens is slightly tilted, bringing a casual and authentic documentary style. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and distant. Like a corner of a café bathed in afternoon sunlight, or a moment of tranquility by the window at home, it is filled with artistic atmosphere and a sense of inner monologue",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
