        {
          "id": "krea2-bd3e4f2359d86b3be4527d6a",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤坐吸烟",
          "prompt": "On a city street as night falls, a woman sits on a vintage bicycle. She wears a fluffy, soft white long fur coat. The coat is finely textured and full-plush with a luxurious yet lazy feel. It naturally drapes over her shoulders, as if about to whisper softly. Her left hand gently supports a cigarette, fingers slender and neatly trimmed, her right hand naturally resting on the handlebars. She wears black fishnet stockings, crosses her legs, and drapes her right leg over her left. On her feet are a pair of shiny black ankle boots with high heels. The lines are sharp, and the overall form is full of contradictory beauty—both gentle and rebellious. She leans slightly to the side, leaning forward slightly, her posture relaxed yet elegant. The background is a bustling Japanese cityscape, with neon lights flashing in vibrant colors, Japanese signboards, and advertising light boxes. The lighting creates a soft halo and bokeh in the dark. In the distance, building silhouettes blur, greenery dots the streets, several bicycles park by the roadside, and the ground is a dark stone pavement reflecting faint light. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly lower in the center of the frame, with the gaze focused on her. The foreground features bicycle wheels and parts of the vehicle, with clear details. The middle shot blends the subject with the surrounding environment, while the background gradually blurs, creating a strong sense of spatial depth. The camera uses a shallow depth of field effect to make the subject stand out, while the background blurs into flowing spots of light. Light and shadow come from multiple neon sources, mainly projected from the right and back, creating soft side and backlight effects, but with slight contour light at the edges to enhance the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly dark, with the white coat as the visual focal point, forming a strong contrast with the black clothing and background. The atmosphere is tranquil and mysterious, with a cinematic narrative quality, as if capturing a moment forgotten by time. It has a strong Japanese photo style, while also incorporating the casual and realistic feel of street photography. The shooting angle is slightly below level sight, enhancing the character's presence and presence. The overall image texture is delicate, retaining the graininess and color gradation of film photography, with a cool tone and a slight bluish-gray tone. It simulates the noise and dynamic range of high-ISO nighttime shooting, creating a sense of solitude, freedom, and a touch of melancholy urban poetry—like a silent poem blooming alone in the bustling city.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
