        {
          "id": "krea2-81935a6058acd04a8f9d065b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙沙发忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange-red leather sofa, exuding a natural healthy glow. She wears a fluffy, soft white long-sleeve plush top made of faux lamb wool or rabbit fur, warm and comfortable to the touch. She wears a light gray-blue multi-layered sheer semi-transparent long dress. The layers of mesh are light and flowing, subtly revealing the leg lines. The hem naturally drapes down the sofa, creating soft pleats. Her body leans slightly forward, right arm bent, elbow supported on knee, right hand gently gripping left wrist, posture relaxed and elegant With legs crossed, bare feet naturally resting on the edge of the sofa, toes slightly exposed, giving a realistic and everyday feel. The background is a deep blue wooden grain wall, with wooden boards arranged horizontally, featuring subtle textures and natural wood grain patterns. The colors transition from deep blue to navy blue, creating a calm and restrained atmosphere. Light comes from the upper left side of the image, softly and evenly casting on the figures, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The fiber details of the plush clothing are clearly visible, and the transparency of the tulle skirt intertwines with light and shadow to create a hazy beauty. The shadows are delicately integrated into the background, with the overall color scheme contrasting warm orange and cool blue to highlight the subject. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying about two-thirds of the space. The left blank space is left to enhance visual balance. The camera angles slightly overhead, capturing the upper body and part of the legs. The background is moderately blurred, presenting a shallow depth of field effect. The foreground features the sofa's curved armrests and cushion edges, with natural reflections and fine scratches on the leather surface, adding a realistic texture. The middle ground shows the entire body and parts of the sofa. The background is a blurred blue wall, which extends into the surroundings through body postures and clothing lines. The layers of light and shadow are rich, combining the three-dimensional effect of the main light source with the soft transition of ambient lighting. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, with a touch of artistic flair, as if it were a private indoor photo shoot. Using professional photography equipment such as full-frame cameras paired with large-aperture prime lenses, post-processing is done on a low-saturation color grading basis to preserve original details while enhancing color harmony, giving the image a film-like texture. With a slight graininess, faithful color reproduction, rigorous and storytelling in composition, it conveys a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic youthful mood, making it suitable for magazine covers, personal photo books, or emotion-themed poster designs",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
