        {
          "id": "krea2-c920c8816970f1eab6fb8e14",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤户外忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in an outdoor scene on a city street, appearing natural and relaxed, revealing a calm yet slightly melancholic expression, as if deep in thought. She wears a light blue striped sleeveless tank top, with smooth back lines and clearly visible shoulder straps. She carries a green backpack, with a transparent water bottle pocket on the side containing a bottle of mineral water with a white cap. The backpack appears to be made of durable nylon fabric with fine textures, and the shoulder straps are wide and thick, with adjustable buckles. The overall design is both practical and stylish. Her right hand gently grips the handle of her backpack, her fingers long, her posture relaxed, and her body slightly leaning forward, creating a sense of movement while walking. The foreground focuses on the upper body and backpack details, while the background features blurred city streets, including buildings with orange walls, modern buildings with glass curtain walls, metal fences, and some greenery. The windows of the buildings reflect light from the sky, creating soft light spots. In the distance, there are also outlines of utility poles and billboards, but these are blurred due to shallow depth of field. The composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned slightly in the center left of the frame, leaving space on the right to enhance visual extension. The camera angle is slightly down, creating an intimate and realistic viewing angle. Light and shadow come from the upper right, sunlight filtering through the leaves. The warm yellow light contrasts with the cool-toned buildings, enhancing the layering and warmth of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of life, like a real street photo taken with a regular digital camera or phone, with a slight film texture and natural noise, and moderate color saturation. It preserves real-world details and flaws, while slightly darkening the edges of the frame simulates the optical effects of vintage cameras. The line of sight extends to the lower left of the frame, then returns to her body and backpack, forming a subtle loop. The background blur further highlights the subject, drawing the viewer's attention to the characters' emotions and states. The entire image exudes a beauty intertwined with youth, loneliness, and everyday life, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
