        {
          "id": "krea2-c99777bd360828b86073dad4",
          "alias": "单女外套街道沉思站立交叠",
          "prompt": "In front of a gas station at night, she wears a dark loose coat, arms crossed over her chest, head slightly raised, her expression contemplative and distant, as if gazing at some invisible summons deep within the city, adding a touch of movement and gentleness to the image. She is positioned at the lower right of the frame, her body slightly tilted, forming a natural and unforced posture that forms the foreground center. In the background, a towering electronic price display is vertically stacked to occupy the left central position, each screen illuminated with a dazzling red LED number, clearly displaying fuel price information such as \"13.99\" and \"14.59\". Some screens also display \"Super\" and \"Plus\" letters. These glowing numbers and text pulse like veins in the dark, exuding a strong sense of industrialism and modernity. Meanwhile, reflected light spots and light mist on the glass surface add layers and realism to the entire scene. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figures appear more upright and enhancing the price tag's sense of pressure and visual impact. Highlights have a metallic texture, while shadows penetrate into the details. Long shadows cast on the floor enhance the sense of spatial depth. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is full of cyberpunk tones, blending the coldness of futuristic technology with the absurdity and fatigue of daily life. The air is filled with damp night air and a faint gasoline smell, as if time has frozen at this moment. Only those constantly flashing numbers tell the rhythm of the city. The image tones are mainly deep red, dark black, and cool gray, dotted with white halos to create strong emotional tension. The lens simulates amateur photography equipment, with slight granular noise and dynamic range compression to enhance realism and life. Using wide-angle lenses to capture broader scenes while retaining the clarity and focus of the central figure, the composition uses vertical lines of price tags to guide the gaze upward, inspiring reflection on identity, existence, and meaning. The entire image presents a hazy state somewhere between reality and fantasy, resembling a casual street snapshot or a carefully crafted visual narrative, conveying the confusion and self-reflection of urban youth in a consumer society.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
