        {
          "id": "krea2-b4017a33d8ee7b8716e63684",
          "alias": "单女黑背心沉思倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a wooden railing, her head slightly tilted back, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her black sleeveless top fits her body perfectly, outlining her slender shoulder line and collarbones. She wears loose pants with white stripes, creating a simple yet lively look. Her left hand rests lightly on the rough wooden railing, fingers relaxed naturally, while her right arm hangs casually at her side, her posture lazy yet elegant. The background is a blurred city street or indoor space. Shelves, lighting, and architectural outlines are faintly visible. The blur treatment makes the subject stand out. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position, creating a dynamic visual flow. The camera angles slightly downward, capturing the graceful curves of the character's neck and shoulders. Light and shadow come from the upper right, creating a tranquil atmosphere at dusk or dusk. The delicate transitions of shadows enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and texture. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and dark brown, complemented by strong contrast created by black clothing. The image presents the grainy texture and low-saturation colors unique to film photography, as if capturing a moment under natural light with an old-fashioned film camera. The slight outfocus and vignetting at the edges add a nostalgic and hazy poetic feeling. The composition emphasizes blank space and breathability, and the blurred background is rich in layers but does not overshadow the main focus, highlighting the characters' emotional states and inner worlds. The entire frame is filled with the warmth of everyday life and an artistic, tranquil beauty, like a genuine moment casually recorded. Yet it contains profound narrative quality and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
