        {
          "id": "krea2-985786576cd6ce99a03b8274",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙咖啡厅温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in a Japanese restaurant, wearing a pair of square glasses with transparent frames, a small butterfly tattoo on her right shoulder, and a white lace hollow-out strap dress with a deep V neckline that highlights her elegant curves. On her left wrist is a thin gold bracelet, her fingers are long and lightly painted with nail polish. Her right hand rests gently on the table, palm facing down, fingers naturally relaxed. On the table sits a plate of golden sushi rolls, wrapped in orange-red crab sticks and breadcrumbs. On the side are green wasabi and ginger slices, and another plate is a Japanese rice bowl served in a blue-and-white patterned ceramic bowl, topped with plenty of beef, vegetables, and a whole raw egg yolk, sprinkled with chopped seaweed and chopped scallions. Next to it is an empty white porcelain plate and a pair of bamboo chopsticks. The warm indoor environment is set against the backdrop, with several warm yellow lanterns hanging from the wooden walls and ceiling. In the distance, you can see a blurry bar counter, high chairs, and some decorative paintings. The overall lighting is soft and warm, creating a cozy and comfortable dining atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The foreground shows food and tabletops, while the center frame shows the person and part of the dining table. The background gradually blurs, and the visual guide starts with the food in the foreground, passing through the subject's hands. Light and shadow come from warm lights above and on the sides, creating soft shadows and highlights, emphasizing the character's outline and clothing texture. The entire scene presents a realistic and artistic moment from everyday life, as if it were a sample shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions. It has a slight film texture and natural noise, with warm and rich layers of tones, a slight retro filter effect, and a slightly overexposed background that enhances the subject's three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is both intimate and full of everyday life, like a documentary photo capturing beautiful moments",
