        {
          "id": "krea2-a3fa2ceca13444ae7e032979",
          "alias": "单女灰西装雪地冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a dark gray suit jacket with a white shirt and a light pink bow tie is standing slightly to the side in a snowy field bathed in soft light. Her right hand is wearing a pure white plush glove gently gripping the neck of a white violin, while her left hand is also wearing matching gloves to support the violin. The bow spans the strings, as if about to play a melodious melody. Her overall posture is elegant and composed. The main focus is the performer and the white violin in their hands, with the composition focusing on medium and near shots. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the frame, with the head slightly tilted. The body is slightly turned to one side, creating a subtle sense of dynamic balance. In the foreground is a clearly visible violin and hand details. The body is smooth and white, the strings reflect a faint sheen, the bow lines are smooth, and the white gloves are fluffy and soft. The middle is the upper body and part of the arms, while the background is completely blurred into a hazy gradient of white and light gray. Faint distant outlines of buildings or silhouettes of trees are faintly visible, creating a spacious and quiet winter atmosphere. Light comes from the upper or rear side, creating a soft backlight or side backlight effect. A golden halo appears around the edges of the figure, creating rich and delicate layering of light and shadow. The colors are mainly cool white, gray-black, and pale pink, accented with a small amount of warm yellow halo extending from the lower right to the upper left, enhancing the depth and artistic tension of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, cool, and tinged with a touch of romantic poetry, like a film-style portrait shot with a professional camera, with a strong cinematic feel and emotional expression. The image texture is close to high-resolution digital photography, while retaining slight graininess and natural exposure control. It presents a sense of authenticity and surreal beauty, suitable for artistic posters, music album covers, or emotional-themed photography. The overall tone is warm yet restrained, with natural transitions of light and shadow. The composition emphasizes symmetry and blank space, with visual focus on the interactions between the characters' expressions and instruments, conveying complex emotions of loneliness, focus, elegance, and inner world. The images have no obvious watermarks or text interference, maintaining pure artistic value and visual appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
