        {
          "id": "krea2-cfdb905019d3861b3e371bdb",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道忧伤站立注视（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways on a city street at night, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She appears especially clear in the night, revealing a thoughtful calm and a faint melancholy, as if about to share the secrets deep within her heart. She wears a black off-shoulder dress with simple yet elegant straps, outlining slender shoulders and graceful neck curves. The fabric has a slight matte texture, fitting the body's contours and showcasing natural curves. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with a slight tilt. The posture is relaxed yet full of tension, with the head slightly turned to one side, forming a layered side profile. The foreground features blurred metal railings and some reflections from the car body, presenting soft curved lines that add depth and realism to the image. The middle ground features the main subject, clearly prominent, while the background is a blurred city night scene, composed of countless circular light spots varying in size, mainly cool white and light blue, interspersed with warm yellow lighting, creating a dreamy bokeh effect. The light spots are arranged in a well-balanced manner. Some edges are softly blended, while others have slight starlight, enhancing the layering of light and shadow. The overall composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure occupies the right third of the frame, leaving plenty of negative space on the left to guide the gaze into the distance. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect completely blurs the background, making the subject stand out more. The visual guide starts from the blurred lines in the foreground, flowing upward along the contours of the figures, forming a smooth emotional path. Light comes from behind and above, combining backlight and side backlighting. This allows the character outlines to be softly outlined, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and presenting a delicate transition between light and shadow. The shadows naturally blend into the background without feeling abrupt, creating an overall atmosphere that is quiet, romantic, and slightly lonely. The color palette is mainly cool blue, paired with a small amount of warm yellow light sources, creating a contrast between cool and warm tones. It preserves the sense of detachment of urban nights while injecting a warm humanistic atmosphere. The visuals have a strong cinematic and film-like feel, with rich but not overly sharp details, presenting a hazy yet realistic beauty. It feels like a real scene shot at night with an amateur camera, with slight noise and graininess. The lens is slightly out of focus, making the entire frame closer to capturing moments from everyday life rather than deliberately staged. The overall style combines realism and artistry, conveying a quiet, introspective, gentle yet slightly melancholic mood that inevitably evokes youth, memories, or an unfinished story.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
