        {
          "id": "krea2-65d57db85a39f54d5a67abd7",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣雪地忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window, gazing out through the wooden frame. She wears a thick red knit sweater, adorned with fine colored fibers, giving off a warm and rustic feel. Underneath, she wears a knit scarf in alternating off-white and light brown, with natural tassel designs at the edges, soft and fluffy draping over her chest. She slightly lowers her head, As if softly speaking something, her hands rested softly on the windowsill, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, fingertips slightly curved, as if sensing the cold outside or waiting for something. Tiny snowflakes drifted outside, gently falling in the air, forming a thin layer of frost that added a touch of winter tranquility and purity to the scene. In the background was a beautifully decorated Christmas tree, adorned with red spherical lights and golden ornaments, the lights flickering softly, emitting a warm glow. At the top of the tree, there is a shining star, and beneath it is a large bow. The whole scene is filled with a warm festive atmosphere. The wooden window frame is dark brown, with clear grain, giving it a rustic yet textured feel. Snow is piled on the windowsill, not thick but even, contrasting with the warm tones inside. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, almost running through the entire frame from left to right. The lines of the window frame divide the scene into multiple areas, forming a visual guide. The foreground features snow on the window frame and windowsill; the middle is the upper body and her movements; the background features a Christmas tree and a blurred indoor environment. The light comes from inside, soft and warm. The main light source enters from the left, while shadows are gently distributed on the other side, creating a three-dimensional effect. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and warm, with a nostalgic cinematic feel. The colors are mainly red, white, and brown. Creating a harmonious image with a slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, it simulates the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The background is moderately blurred to highlight the subject, presenting an overall tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic winter atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet emotionally rich moment",
