        {
          "id": "krea2-77bf6388c865fc06896c9d26",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣广场俏皮站立阅读",
          "prompt": "Wearing a warm brown sweater and loose gray pants, her legs crossed, her right hand gently holding a book with a yellow cover. Her posture was relaxed and natural, as if she were immersed in reading on a leisurely afternoon and suddenly caught a moment of ease and joy; In the foreground is a dark wooden chair behind her, with a clean and smooth backrest and rounded armrests. The legs stand firmly on the dark wooden floor, and beside it is a small square table covered with a blue-and-white checkered tablecloth. Several books are neatly stacked on the table, and a black-and-white checkered slipper peeks out from the lower right corner, hinting at the casual and comfortable home life; In the middle is a vintage black stove to her left, topped with a white enamel pot. Below the stove is a control panel with knobs and indicator lights, and beside it is an off-white gas canister. These everyday details create a nostalgic and authentic kitchen atmosphere; In the background is a large area of wooden framed glass windows. Soft light outside, faintly visible tree outlines, sunlight streaming in from outside, creating warm light spots on the floor and furniture surfaces. The entire space is bathed in soft natural light, with rich layers of light and shadow—including bright highlights and deep shadow transitions—creating a tranquil, cozy, and lively indoor scene. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted, gazing toward the camera, creating a warm and interactive feel. At the same time, vertical lines from windows and horizontal lines from tables and chairs are used to create a stable visual structure, enhancing the narrative value of the image. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, gray, blue, and white, harmoniously and unified, presenting a tranquil Japanese artistic aesthetic. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet retains the natural authenticity of daily life. It has a strong sense of life and artistic atmosphere, making it suitable for expressing the theme of modern urbanites seeking inner peace and spiritual comfort. The lighting is soft and delicate, details rich, layers distinct, full of storytelling and warmth",
