        {
          "id": "krea2-1da19e5bd6a4a6a25a56c004",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose black coat made of soft and textured material, with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish. Her left hand rests naturally on her leg, clutching a bag with a metal chain The posture is relaxed and elegant, with a leather handbag with a brown plaid pattern slung across the shoulder. The bag features a classic diamond pattern design, edged with gold hardware. The clasp details are clearly visible, exuding a subtle sense of luxury. The background is city streets at night, with damp reflective surfaces showing a deep gray tone. The yellow traffic markings on the road stand out under the lights, and in the blurred distance, you can see the light trails left by the vehicles, creating a sense of movement. The outlines of buildings are faintly visible. Warm light streams through the windows, creating a contrast between light and dark. The entire scene is in the transition from dusk to night, with the sky gradient from deep blue to orange-yellow. Light pours down from the upper left of the frame, creating a strong backlight effect. Sunlight passes through the fine dust in the air, producing distinct lens halos and beams, creating beautiful contour light. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with figures standing out clearly in the foreground, streets and some buildings in the middle ground, and the background gradually blurring. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, head slightly tilted. Looking toward the camera, the overall atmosphere is quiet yet slightly melancholic, full of the loneliness and poetry of urban nightlife. The tones are mainly warm yellow, deep brown, and black, with a strong contrast of warm and warm tones, creating a feeling that is both warm and distant. The image features high resolution, delicate detail, and realistic light and shadow rendering, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining a natural, everyday feel, like a moment captured with amateur equipment. It is authentic and full of storytelling. The lens is slightly out of focus, and the background has a soft bokeh effect. This enhances the depth and artistic appeal of the visuals, presenting an overall cinematic narrative style that is both fashionable and authentically everyday",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
