        {
          "id": "krea2-561408f18f7ce61ba3e134ac",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫商店冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands next to a shopping cart in a supermarket parking lot. She wears a blue and white plaid shirt, loosely cut open, revealing a yellow knitted camisole underneath. The vest is decorated with gray-white fine-trimmed trim, and she wears red pants, gently holding the green handle of the shopping cart. The shopping cart's metal frame gleams coldly under the sunlight. The body structure is clearly visible, the wheels stationary, and the background is a blurred supermarket complex. The light-colored exterior walls are paired with brown decorative stripes, with green plants scattered in the distance. The parking lot floor is made of gray asphalt with white parking lines painted above. The sky appears pale blue, sunlight pours down from the upper right, soft and bright light, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figures. The right side is in a slight shadow, creating a sense of depth. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field photography. The focus is on the figures, with background blur that highlights the main contours and details. In composition, the figures are positioned slightly to the left of the frame, and the shopping cart extends diagonally from the lower right corner to the center, forming a visual guide line that draws the viewer's gaze to the figure. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and light blue. The golden halo under sunlight contrasts with the cool-toned sky, creating a lazy and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. The image has a slight film grain texture, moderate color saturation, and a slight retro filter effect, giving the overall style a fresh and natural feel. Full of life, like everyday moments casually captured with an old film camera, capturing a quiet and beautiful moment of life. The streetlights, parked cars, and distant building outlines in the background all blur due to defocus, enhancing the layering and spatial sense of the image. The shadows in the folds of clothing are clearly visible, and the entire scene is filled with a leisurely, gentle, and slightly artistic everyday beauty",
