        {
          "id": "krea2-1931b7e6480c320674a32a03",
          "alias": "单女雪地忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She bows her head slightly, hands clasped in front of her chest, her posture elegant and devout, her expression serene and serene, as if praying or meditating in the snow. This contrasts sharply with the snowflakes falling behind her. The background is a winter forest covered in vast white snow, with indistinct outlines wrapped in thick snow, presenting a hazy gray-white tone. The sky is gloomy, and snowflakes flutter down from above, creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The composition uses close-up shots. The figure occupies the main position in the composition, with the head slightly tilted and the gaze downward. The overall composition is simple yet layered, with a clear foreground featuring the main subject, the middle ground featuring falling snowflakes and some sleeve details, and the background a blurred snowy forest, creating a strong contrast of depth of field between front and back. The lighting is soft and even, diffused from cloudy days without obvious shadows, giving the entire composition a pure and cool-toned beauty. Light and shadow are naturally distributed, with snowflakes slightly reflecting under the light, enhancing the three-dimensional and dynamic feel of the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet and beautiful A touch of melancholy, as if frozen in a moment on a winter morning, with a strong artistic atmosphere and Eastern aesthetic conception. It resembles a lady in a classical ink painting, or a nostalgic image shot with an old film camera, with slight grainy texture and color shifts, as if from a forgotten era. Natural vignette effects at the edges of the frame enhance visual focus and emotional immersion. The color palette is mainly white and gray, accented with a touch of red decoration to create a visual focal point. The composition follows the rule of thirds. The figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side to extend the gaze into the distant snowy landscape, creating a sense of openness. The camera uses a wide aperture with a high degree of background blur, highlighting the main subject while preserving the details of drifting snowflakes. Overall, it presents a surreal romantic style—both real and dreamy, as if time has frozen in this moment, filling the scene with poetic loneliness and longing for beautiful things",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
