        {
          "id": "krea2-74b48244688f087206fee9f5",
          "alias": "单女米T恤微笑倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "She wears a light beige tight sleeveless tank top, revealing her slender arms and long neck. She pairs it with light blue denim shorts with delicate colorful embroidery on the hems. The overall style is casual and comfortable, yet fashionable. She looks straight at the camera with a radiant smile, her white teeth clearly visible. She gently places an open book on top of her head with her right hand, the pages fanning out in a fan shape, with an orange-red spine. The pages are yellowed and show signs of time, the body leans slightly forward, legs crossed together, posture relaxed and natural. The background is an indoor home environment, with a light blue wall on the left and a dark brown wooden bookshelf on the right. Several books and glass bottle decorations are placed on the shelves. The overall layout is simple and modern, with soft light streaming in from the front left of the painting, creating a warm side lighting effect that creates a cozy and comfortable home atmosphere. The composition centers on the figures, using a medium perspective to highlight their expressions and movement details. The background is slightly blurred, making the subject stand out, then extending to the hands to form a complete narrative chain. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, accented with bookish orange-red and denim blue. The color combination is harmonious and natural, presenting a relaxed and joyful sense of realism in daily life. It feels like a casual snapshot, infused with the atmosphere of life and artistic beauty. Shot with professional photography equipment, high resolution, rich detail, well-controlled depth of field, clear clothing textures, and natural light and shadow transitions. The overall composition has strong visual appeal and emotional resonance, conveying a positive attitude of loving reading and enjoying life",
