        {
          "id": "krea2-9117e9751cc0967e8277d597",
          "alias": "单女透视黑高领衫椅上自信坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wears a pale pink lipstick. She wears a black turtleneck, tight-fitting long-sleeved top, the fabric hugging her figure, showing smooth curves and full bust contours. She pairs light blue denim shorts with a slim fit, and the hem edges have slight wear, revealing a small section of thigh. She wears black sheer stockings with a smooth texture that reveals a subtle glow through her skin She sits on a chair framed with a wooden frame. The chair's backrest is made of several parallel thin wooden strips, with a beige cushion on the surface. Behind it is a square throw pillow in the same color family. In the background is a wooden partition wall with geometric hollow patterns, composed of triangles and diamonds forming a regular grid texture. The wall is made of light-colored natural wood, preserving the natural grain and warm texture of the wood. On the right side, there is a piece of gray plush fabric as decoration, possibly part of the curtain or sofa. The overall space is soft and warm. The light source comes from the front left of the image, creating natural side lighting. The shadow transitions are smooth, while the right side shows some shadows, creating a sense of depth. The wooden structure in the background presents rich layers of light and shadow under light and shadow. The composition uses close-ups: the figure occupies the center slightly to the right of the frame, with their heads slightly tilted and gazing directly at the camera, creating direct emotional exchange. The foreground shows the figure's body and part of the seat, the middle ground shows the overall posture of the person and seat, and the background features wooden partitions and blurred wall details. At the same time, the lines and body contours of the clothing guide the gaze down to the waist and legs, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere with a sense of everyday home life. The color palette is mainly black, brown, and gray, accented with a touch of blue, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image presents a realistic and delicate photographic texture, as if shot indoors with a professional camera, yet with the realism of amateur equipment capturing life's moments. The image details are rich, from the wrinkles of denim fabric to subtle changes in wood grain, all clearly visible. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, creating a quiet, private, and approachable visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
