        {
          "id": "krea2-e9cd72a5be1aec7027dbc9b5",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙镜前戏谑自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman took a selfie in front of an indoor mirror, wearing an off-white fitted spaghetti strap dress. The dress was tailored to fit her curves, highlighting her full bust and slender waist. The fabric had slight pleats and a sheen, giving it a soft and elastic texture. The hem length and mid-thigh accentuated her long legs, slightly curled and naturally draped down, adding a touch of laziness and sexiness. She wore a pair of large gold hoop earrings that reflected a soft metallic sheen under the light. On her wrist is a delicate gold bracelet, made of small beads strung together, forming an elegant decoration on her arm. She holds a smartphone with a white marble-patterned phone case in her right hand. The case surface has a natural gray texture, the camera module is clearly visible, her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored polish. She is turning sideways facing the mirror, her head slightly tilted, light and shadow shining down from the upper left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow that enhances the sense of depth. The background is a dark wall or door panel. The surface has subtle textures and reflections. On the right edge, you can see the outline of a door and the door handle. The overall environment is simple and private, with close-ups in composition. The figures occupy most of the space, and the angle of view is slightly tilted, creating an intimate yet slightly teasing atmosphere. Through light and clothing folds, the gaze flows, with warm tones as the main color scheme enhancing visual impact. The overall atmosphere combines the privacy of everyday life with a rich artistic beauty. It feels like capturing a moment in a private space—realistic yet meticulously designed—soft and layered lighting, rich details, and realistic texture, presenting an image style that combines the atmosphere of everyday life with aesthetic pursuits",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
