        {
          "id": "krea2-cfe381e8ff4dfb907e2f93cc",
          "alias": "单女米外套广场害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone pavement on a winter night, wearing a thick beige-gray woolen coat with distinct knit patterns at the collar and cuffs. The coat loosely wraps around her body, giving off a warm and lazy vibe. She tilts her head slightly toward the camera, adding a touch of gentleness and casualness. Her hands are folded on her knees, fingers slender, and her nails neatly trimmed, glowing warmly under the dim yellow light. She wears a dark plaid scarf with tassel decorations on its edge, casually draped over her shoulders. The scarf material looks soft and textured, forming a layered look with the coat. Her expression is slightly shy yet tinged with a hint of laughter, revealing a restrained yet sincere emotion. The background is a blurred brick wall or building facade, rough and marked by years of time, presenting a warm yellow tone that creates a retro and nostalgic atmosphere. The floor is paved with square stone bricks, with clear gaps, and some areas shaded, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. Fine snowflakes drift in the air. Under the light, these snowflakes appear as hazy white patches of light, like stars scattered in the air, adding a dreamy and poetic feeling. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying the main position, heads slightly tilted, bodies forming an S-shaped curve, forming a natural visual guideline. The light and shadow come from a warm yellow light source slightly above the right, possibly a streetlamp or streetside decorative lamp, with soft and directional light, while the other side is in semi-shadow, creating a contrast of light and shadow that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The background blur is handled very naturally, using a shallow depth effect to make the subject stand out. The snowflakes in the foreground are presented in varying sizes and brightness; some are blurred due to varying focusing distances, while others are clearly visible, adding realism and dynamism to the image. The entire scene is enveloped in warm dusk tones, with golden and brown intertwining to create a quiet, cozy, and slightly melancholic winter night atmosphere. It seems to capture an ordinary yet story-filled moment. The image texture is delicate with a slight graininess. It simulates the effect of film camera shooting, with warm tones, moderate saturation, natural color transitions, and no excessive sharpening or distortion. Overall, it presents a kind of beauty that is unintentionally frozen in everyday life, like a photo taken with an old-fashioned camera, full of realism and human warmth. The composition is balanced without being rigid, the subject's posture relaxed, emotions expressed naturally, and although there are few background elements, they are sufficient to support the environment. The use of light and shadow is clever, emphasizing the subject while enhancing the atmosphere. The entire image conveys a sense of quietness and warmth. A touch of nostalgia in winter lets you feel the most precious warmth in the cold season",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
