        {
          "id": "krea2-f99edea6a7abed76fb39ac27",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市冷淡坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A girl sits on the steps of an escalator, turning sideways to gaze into the distance. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt, black leather shoes, and white long socks. Her expression is calm and focused, as if lost in thought or waiting. Her body leans slightly forward, hands naturally resting on the handrail, her posture relaxed yet elegant. The entire scene is presented in a low-angle downward composition. The escalator extends from the foreground into the background, forming strong perspective lines that guide the gaze upward, creating a sense of depth and spatial tension. The escalator's metal structure and transparent glass railings are clearly visible in the dark-toned environment, with rich details and a realistic texture. Light shines diagonally from above, forming a bright beam while casting heavy shadows around it, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The layers of light and shadow are rich, highlights are delicate and soft, and shadow transitions are natural. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if time has frozen at this moment. The background is the dark interior of the building, with walls and stairs arranged geometrically. The color tone is unified and cool, giving an industrial feel and a modern urban atmosphere. No unnecessary decoration, highlighting the relationship between subject and environment. The composition uses diagonal lines and repeated stepped lines to enhance visual dynamism. Characters are positioned near the golden ratio of the image, becoming the visual focus. The light is like a stage spotlight focusing on the girl, emphasizing emotions such as loneliness, contemplation, and growth. The image presents a cinematic cinematic texture, as if stepping out of a quiet moment in an art film. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with blue skirts and warm yellow halos, creating a striking contrast that enhances visual impact. The lens uses medium telephoto to compress depth of field, blurring the background and highlighting the main subject, while preserving enough environmental information to create a realistic sense of space. The overall style combines everyday life with artistry, like a spontaneous candid yet story-filled moment, as if recording a moment of self-discovery and gazing into the future in the city's cracks. The visuals are full of narrative and emotional tension, making one imagine where she is headed or looking back at her journey. The light and shadow are poetic, the atmosphere dreamlike. Every detail carries emotion and memories.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
