        {
          "id": "krea2-559b177eda05f4942434bc4b",
          "alias": "单女小径忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, presenting a dynamic beauty with a slight sheen that creates a flowing texture. Looking directly at the camera, she wears a pale red lipstick, adding a touch of sexiness and mystery. She wears a black semi-transparent top with loose sleeves, the fabric light and pleated, subtly revealing the outline of the inner garment. A small patch of skin is revealed on the shoulder, creating a simple yet layered look. The body is slightly turned to the right side of the frame, the head slightly turned toward the camera, and the posture is natural and relaxed. It's as if capturing an unintentional moment: the foreground is the main subject, occupying the main spot in the frame. The background is a blurred green vegetation, presenting a soft bokeh effect. The colors are mainly shades of green, mixed with some shadows and light spots, creating a richly layered background. The middle ground is the transitional area between the figures and the background, enhancing the sense of space. The composition uses a third-part layout slightly to the center, with the figure on the right side, leaving space on the left to balance the visual view and emphasize the character's presence. The overall composition is vertical. Emphasizing the figure's slender figure and dynamic beauty, then returning to the contours of the figure, forming a cyclical visual path. Light and shadow come from above, soft and directional, creating a sense of three-dimensionality. Light filters through the gaps in the leaves, forming mottled points of light that enhance the image's realism and atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, tinged with a touch of melancholy and romance. The tones are cool, mainly black, green, and gray, creating a warm contrast and giving the image the texture of film photography. It features slight graininess and color shift, simulating the effect of vintage camera shooting. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting, enhancing the retro feel. The overall style is both realistic and artistic, like a spontaneous snapshot of youth, capturing an emotional moment on a quiet afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
