        {
          "id": "krea2-8efaaa86c1b5c90a77144956",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a side profile in front of an indoor mirror, wearing a form-fitting black spaghetti strap dress that clings to her curves, outlining a graceful silhouette. The straps are thin and narrow, extending from the collarbone to the waist. The hem reaches the mid-thigh, and the fabric has a slight sheen and natural pleats, showcasing the softness and elasticity of the material. She wears a pair of black fine-rimmed glasses with transparent lenses, The camera reflects a slight glare, with delicate and natural makeup. She holds a dark gray smartphone in her right hand, with three cameras arranged in a triangular shape on the back. She is taking a selfie with the phone, her arm slightly raised, fingers naturally bent as she grips the phone, and her left hand resting gently on her waist, her posture elegant and relaxed. The main subject is on the left, occupying about two-thirds of the space and forming the visual center. On the right side, there is a rectangular mirror with a purple border, clearly reflecting parts of the wall and light. The background is a light blue flat wall. The color tones are soft and even, with no obvious textures or decorations. The overall environment is simple and clean. The composition uses medium shots, with the person fully visible from head to knee. The angle is slightly elevated, creating a sense of intimacy and realism in daily life. Light comes from the front slightly right, soft and even, with delicate shadows cast on the wall behind, presenting a natural transition of light and shadow. The direction of light and shadow is stable with no strong contrast, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere, carrying the independence and confidence of a modern urban woman. The overall style blends the authentic texture of everyday photography with artistic visual beauty. It's like casually capturing moments at home with an ordinary phone, yet capturing the character's inner composure and charm. The color scheme mainly uses black, light blue, and purple, creating a cool and harmonious visual system. The visuals are clearly layered: the foreground features the person and the phone, the middle ground shows body and clothing details, and the background is the wall and mirror. The reflection of the mirror also expands the depth of the space, making the entire scene full of life and personal expression. It presents a tranquil yet storytelling atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
