        {
          "id": "krea2-0673609a59ad9fa04ad34949",
          "alias": "单女毛衣户外微笑摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in a half-body close-up under natural outdoor lighting, wearing a radiant smile and neat, white teeth. She wears a white plush Christmas hat that adds a festive and playful touch. She wears a thick knitted striped sweater in orange, blue, and gray. The yarn is fluffy and soft, with warm and layered colors. Her right hand is raised and waved forward, palm open, and the movement is natural and lively, as if greeting or saying goodbye to the camera, creating a strong visual direction. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the composition The head is slightly tilted, the body is in a slightly dynamic pose, creating a relaxed and casual moment. The foreground clearly shows hands and some sweaters. The background is blurred, presenting blurred dark tones of plants and stone walls, highlighting the subject and enhancing depth of field. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, with the background in black, white, and gray tones to enhance color focus and visual impact. The lighting is soft and even, coming from natural daylight and shining from an upward angle, with natural shadow transitions creating a warm and pleasant atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess and a retro filter effect. It adds a sense of realism and nostalgia, with a slightly low shooting angle and a low-angle perspective enhancing the person's affinity and presence. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment from everyday life, like a snapshot of real life with a phone or portable camera, full of youthful energy and warm emotions, with a strong sense of life and artistic appeal",
