        {
          "id": "krea2-bee890a82c1a2d1b7d05c2ef",
          "alias": "单女白制服街道忧伤行走注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a white sailor-collar school uniform, with a black bow tie featuring intricate plaid patterns and two black stripes on the cuffs. Her expression is calm and focused, her hands taking out or organizing items from a black leather backpack. The backpack's shoulder straps are slung diagonally in front of her, smooth and fitted with metal fasteners. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right in the foreground, with close-up shots of the figure. The head and upper body are clearly visible, with a blurred night scene in the background. Warm yellow light shines from the upper left, creating a soft backlight effect. The light penetrates the fine dust in the air, creating a hazy halo and bokeh. In the distance, you can see the blurred outlines of tree trunks in light brown. The blur effect creates distinct background layers, and the overall color scheme is mainly warm golden with dark black and white, with strong contrast between light and shadow. The visual guidance is formed by the direction of the light source and the characters' gaze, creating a quiet and story-rich atmosphere, as if walking alone on the street after school, capturing everyday moments of youthful campus life. It has a strong cinematic and film-like feel. The lens uses a large aperture for shooting, with obvious background blur, shallow depth of field, moderate color saturation, and preserves real light and shadow transitions. Overall, it presents a lifelike, documentary amateur photography style, much like capturing real moments on a street at night with a regular camera. The edges of the frame have slight noise and dark compression to enhance realism and immediacy. The subject's posture is naturally relaxed, arms slightly bent, and body slightly tilted, creating an unintentional dynamic beauty that creates halos and highlights. Enhancing three-dimensionality, the overall composition is asymmetrical yet balanced, using diagonal lines and interwoven light and shadow to create visual tension, creating a gentle yet slightly melancholic youthful atmosphere. It is suitable for themes such as urban night returns, music companionship, and solitude. The visuals are rich in detail, from school uniform textures to earphone materials to the leather sheen of backpacks, all clearly distinguishable, conveying a delicate sense of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
