        {
          "id": "krea2-7dec03cd75e6e7bbb160379c",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤街道冷淡站立持乐器",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a white long-sleeve sweatshirt with a black-and-white plaid T-shirt underneath. She is dressed in a dark gray pleated short skirt, off-white over-the-knee socks, and a dark baseball cap with the brim slightly lowered. She is holding a black electric guitar, gripping the neck and body of the piano with both hands, her body slightly tilted, her expression somewhat lazy and confident. Her overall posture is full of youthful energy and rock vibes. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center-left position of the frame, and the composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is fully presented from head to knee. The guitar's body spans the front of the body, forming a visual guideline. In the background is a somewhat messy storage space, behind which is a row of dark gray metal lockers. The cabinet doors are decorated with multiple stickers and labels, and the top is piled with helmets, cardboard, and other miscellaneous items. One box is printed with the word \"XADO,\" and nearby several hockey sticks leaning against the wall. One stick bears the \"COLD\" brand logo, and a blue poster or sign hangs on the wall, faintly showing letters CAI\"—the entire scene is illuminated by an artificial light source slightly on the left above, presenting a warm yellow tone. The light and shadows are soft and slightly shadowed, but the surrounding environment has obvious dark areas, creating a dim and intimate atmosphere. The color palette is mainly gray, black, and white, accented with a few red and blue elements. The overall color scheme is calm and layered, with a texture similar to everyday handheld device photography, with slight graininess and low-resolution characteristics, as if casually recorded at a gathering with friends. The composition is compact yet detailed. The visual focus is on the interaction between characters and musical instruments. Through expressions, clothing styles, prop selection, and environmental arrangement, a street rock style that combines youthful rebellion with everyday realism is created. Everyday objects in the background, such as helmets, hockey sticks, and cardboard boxes, enhance the realism and storytelling of the scenes. This not only gives the visuals artistic beauty but also conveys a sense of personal freedom and individuality. The overall atmosphere is quiet yet restless, and everyday life contains passion. It was as if she had captured a moment of tranquility just before heading to the stage.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
