        {
          "id": "krea2-de87aa16412bff74e1cb96e5",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤床温柔侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lounged leisurely on a soft bed, wearing a form-fitting pink camisole jumpsuit made of delicate luster and slight pleats, outlining her smooth body curves. Her makeup was delicate and natural, with a hint of blush. Around her neck were two thin chain necklaces: one was a slender silver chain with a small floral pendant, and the other was a thicker black knot design adorned with a vintage-style metal ornament Her arms naturally stretch out at her sides, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and her posture is relaxed and relaxed. The background is part of the bed, with a light gray sheet with a faint geometric texture, soft and fluffy. Beside the bed is a grayish-white plush blanket with slightly curled and fuzzy edges. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the left center of the frame, the head slightly tilted, creating an intimate and intimate atmosphere. Light comes from the front slightly above, creating a natural transition of shadows. Highlighting the delicate texture of the skin and the three-dimensional contours of the clothing, the bedding and blankets in the background are slightly blurred, enhancing the visual focus of the subject. The colors are harmonious and unified, the layers of light and shadow are rich, and the atmosphere is warm and tranquil, as if capturing a quiet afternoon or a private moment at night. The images are rich in detail, possessing a strong sense of reality and the atmosphere of life, while still retaining artistic beauty, presenting a carefully recorded moment from daily life, like real photos taken with an old camera. It has a slight graininess and film texture, with a slightly warm tone, making the overall image full of storytelling and emotional tension",
