        {
          "id": "krea2-e299d2619c34abf0405e8dd1",
          "alias": "单女红浴袍雪地专注坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a bright red traditional robe sits on the snow, slightly tilting her head up, her expression calm and focused, as if sensing the falling snowflakes or deep in thought, adding a touch of movement and softness. The red robe she wears is made of thick fabric, with natural pleats, wide cuffs, and a matching belt tied at the waist. The overall look is elegant and full of classical charm. She sits on a pure white plush blanket, its edges slightly curled, blending into the surrounding snow and forming a warm visual focal point. In the foreground, Countless tiny white snowflakes dance in the air. Some snowflakes appear as soft circular light spots due to halo effects, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The middle ground features the snowy area where the woman stands and parts of the ground, covered by a thin layer of snow, faintly revealing the outlines of rocks and soil. The background features blurred mountains or rocky terrain, with a darker tone, mainly gray-black, creating a strong color contrast that highlights the brightness and vividness of the main figure. The composition uses a right-centered diagonal angle, with the figure occupying the main position in the composition. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze extends upward, presenting a sense of spatial layering from bottom to top, from near to far. Visual guidance is completed through the characters' postures, hand movements, and falling snowflakes, forming a flowing path from the ground to the sky. In terms of light and shadow, the light source comes from above and behind, sunlight penetrates the clouds, while natural shadows are cast on the sides and behind the body, enhancing the sense of depth. Light reflects off the snow, making the entire scene appear transparent and bright, creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. It carries a strong artistic and cinematic feel, like a moment frozen on a winter morning. It combines the warmth of everyday life with surreal romantic fantasy. The color palette is mainly red and white, complemented by a gray-black background. The color contrasts are strong yet harmoniously unified, and the details are rich. From clothing textures to snowflake shapes, everything is clearly distinguishable. The overall style is both realistic and beautiful, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in natural light, with strong visual appeal and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
