          "id": "krea2-8cddd0b2bf263845c04304f3",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣厨房自信站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a modern-style kitchen mirror for a selfie. She wears a black wide-strap sports bra and beige high-waisted skinny shorts. Her figure is full and rounded, with smooth and natural curves with a slight glow. On her right arm is a delicate plant tattoo, giving her a confident and gentle expression. She holds a silver-gray smartphone in her right hand, with a circular camera module on the back of the phone facing the mirror. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly tilted, showing graceful silhouettes. The foreground is a clear subject, and the center is the kitchen environment in the mirror. It includes light gray tiled floors, white cabinets, dark gray countertops, stainless steel faucets, and built-in stoves. The background is a simple modern home design, with walls in light gray-white and recessed downlights on the ceiling, providing soft and even lighting. The overall composition uses a symmetrical mirror image, with the figure centered to form the visual center. The mirror reflects the complete spatial layout, enhancing depth and realism. Light and shadow come from the ceiling downlights, creating a warm indoor lighting atmosphere, with light shining down from above. A soft shadow transition forms on the figure, highlighting the body outline and the materiality of the clothing. The overall color scheme is mainly neutral, with black, white, gray, and beige combined, creating a clean, minimalist, yet warm atmosphere of daily life. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, as if casually recorded with a regular phone. The details are rich, the texture delicate, both fashionable and approachable. The composition is balanced, visual guidance is clear, and the gaze flows naturally, presenting an authentic, natural, and life-oriented aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
