        {
          "id": "krea2-4b53a861bf2eb6915eec2e85",
          "alias": "单女外套雪地忧伤站立侧头（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the snow, adding a touch of liveliness and gentleness, carrying a hint of melancholy and contemplation. She slightly tilts her head toward the camera, her expression calm and slightly detached. She wears a plaid wool coat in pink and brown, layered with a soft, fluffy pink knit scarf. The edges of the scarf have natural floss details, giving off a warm and lazy vibe. In her right hand, she wears a bright red glove and holds a slender wooden stick or branch. Her hand posture is naturally relaxed, blending the warmth of winter with innocence The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The background features vast snowfields and the rolling outlines of snow-capped mountains in the distance. The sky shows a gradient from pale blue to light purple, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right, soft and bright, with clear directions of light and shadow, creating a contrast of warmth and cold in the early morning or evening. The snow reflects the sky's light, presenting a subtle pinkish-purple hue. This adds a dreamy feel to the image. The snowy texture in the foreground is clearly visible, some areas glow faintly under sunlight, the middle is where the characters' bodies connect with the surrounding environment, the background gradually blurs, and the distant mountain outlines become blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Visual guidance naturally follows the character's gaze and head posture to the right side of the frame, while the hands holding objects form a diagonal line, together creating a stable visual flow. The overall atmosphere is quiet, cool, yet warm, with a cinematic film texture. The colors are mainly cool tones, accented with warm pink and red elements, creating a strong visual contrast. The image presents a realistic feel reminiscent of amateur or film camera shooting, with rich details but not overly sharp, retaining slight graininess and soft out-of-focus imaging, as if capturing a winter moment by chance. Full of poetry and storytelling, the composition is simple yet layered, with harmonious integration of characters and environment, conveying an emotional tone of solitude, tranquility, and self-reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
