        {
          "id": "krea2-422b36f3c1f8f0b5f581f3e8",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣户外忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in autumn, wearing a thick red chunky knit sweater. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and textured visual effect. The collar and cuffs feature distinct ribbed designs, adding layers and dimension to the garment. The fallen leaves are intact, with slightly curled edges and clearly visible veins, presenting the warm tones unique to autumn. Looking directly into the camera, there is a faint sense of melancholy and contemplation. Harmoniously paired with the red sweater, her left hand gently supports the fallen leaf, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, hand posture natural and relaxed. The background is a blurry autumn forest, sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Light streams in diagonally from the right side of the frame, creating a soft backlight effect, enveloping the figure's outline in a golden halo, enhancing the dreamlike feel. In the foreground, you can see some low green vegetation and scattered leaves. The middle shot features a female subject, with close-ups placed on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to highlight the background blur. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with tones dominated by orange-yellow, reddish-brown, and green, creating a nostalgic and poetic autumn atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions, simulating the authentic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting, with slight lens distortion and shallow depth of field effects, enhancing the photo's sense of presence and everyday life. The overall composition is simple yet emotionally dynamic, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic autumn mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
