        {
          "id": "krea2-143b88cc9ffd9060e0dee835",
          "alias": "单女床俏皮躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies half-prone on a soft light beige bed, her body forming an S-curve, her head slightly turned toward the camera. She wears a white, semi-transparent long-sleeve top and a pair of gray-green high-waisted tight sweatpants. The clothes fit her body and outline smooth curves. The hem of the top is slightly lifted, revealing the skin of her waist. The sweatpants have subtle textures, giving a knitted feel and slight pleats. She is sticking out her tongue in a playful expression. The background is an indoor environment, and the wall is soft off-white with subtle textures. On the left, you can see the edge of a dark gray door frame, with faint dim light filtering through the door gap to create a sense of spatial depth. The overall composition uses a close-up perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, and the body extending from the lower left to the upper right, forming a dynamic diagonal line to guide the gaze. The foreground features the delicate fabric texture of the bed, while the middle shot focuses on the subject. The background blur emphasizes the main contour, with light coming from the front slightly above, and the shadows transitioning naturally, creating a warm and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray-green, and light brown. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving the image a sense of intimacy and authenticity from everyday life, reminiscent of intimate moments taken with a regular phone, preserving slight noise and natural light and shadow changes, presenting a casual and authentic aesthetic style. The details are rich and full of life's atmosphere, conveying a relaxed and joyful mood",
