        {
          "id": "krea2-6ded43dcd7e2dc6ad5aade53",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裙害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite Hanfu stands before a lush cluster of roses. She wears traditional garments in light blue and white, with a light white long-sleeved cross-collar top over the outer layers. The cuffs are wide and flowing, and underneath is a pale blue-green hundred-fold skirt. The skirt is layered and drapes softly. Around her waist is a deep green ribbon with geometric patterns, embroidered with delicate cloud patterns. The collar is adorned with delicate embroidery, giving the overall look elegance and layers. She tilts her head slightly to gaze at the camera, revealing a calm yet slightly shy expression. Her right hand gently holds a cluster of blooming pink roses. The blossoms are full and vibrant, with layers of petals layered and the color gradient from deep pink in the center to pale pink at the edges. Against the backdrop of green leaves, she looks even more vibrant. Her left hand hangs naturally, holding a round plain noodle fan. The fan is beige-yellow and has a warm texture, with a dense rose vine in the background, its branches and leaves intertwined, lush and green Countless pink roses bloom on the branches, forming a sea of flowers. Dappled light and shadow fall on petals and leaves, creating a hazy, dreamlike atmosphere. In the foreground, a few roses are clearly visible, echoing the figures. The middle ground is a main combination of a woman and a cluster of flowers. The composition is center-left, using contrast between solid and void to highlight the figure. The leaves in the background gradually blur, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The painting uses a low-angle downward view, making the figure appear more upright and elegant. The light is soft and even, resembling scattered light on a cloudy day or early morning. It creates a tranquil and serene atmosphere, with mainly green, pink, and white tones harmoniously unified, presenting an overall classical poetic beauty. It resembles a freehand spring painting in Jiangnan, rich in Eastern aesthetic charm, rich in image details, and authentic texture. It looks as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the breath of nature and everyday life, full of artistic and romantic charm. There are no obvious artificial traces in the image, and all elements blend naturally. Forming a static portrait work full of vitality and emotional warmth",
