        {
          "id": "krea2-5c10ad3c48ddde86bc79b1ec",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫门忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the tunnel entrance, appearing casual and genuine, looking directly at the camera as if in a silent conversation with the viewer. She wears a loose beige linen shirt with clearly visible texture, featuring slight wrinkles and natural wear marks, presenting a rustic sense of life. She wears a simple pair of earrings; although the details are not prominent, they add a touch of refinement to the overall look. In the foreground, her figure occupies the main position of the frame, her head slightly turned and her body slightly tilted. This forms a natural dynamic posture, with the background being the deep interior of the tunnel. Light streams through distant exits or light strips above, forming a bright band that sharply contrasts with the surrounding dark environment. The tunnel walls are grayish-white, with fine textures and reflections, suggesting a damp or well-used texture. A car's red taillights flicker faintly behind, adding dynamism and urban life to the scene. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The space on the right side is reserved to enhance visual guidance, creating a sense of spatial depth from near to far. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, with the main light sources coming from above and in front, while the surrounding environment is shrouded in deep shadows, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, carrying a sense of urban nighttime loneliness and contemplation, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue. The image has a film-like texture, with moderate color saturation and slight graininess and fading effects. It simulates the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The lens is a 50mm prime lens with an aperture of f/1.8, achieving a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject clear and prominent, while the background blurs naturally. The overall image presents a private, delicate, and emotionally charged style, like a silent shot in a movie, making one imagine what the girl has just experienced and where she is headed. The entire scene is filled with a faint sense of nostalgia and gentle sadness, as if time has frozen in this moment. Only light and shadow and breath remain.",
