        {
          "id": "krea2-5b9003c91d5bc8660359fab0",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙森林困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a winter forest covered by thick snow, wearing a bright yellow multi-layered ruffled tulle dress, paired with a light yellow hollow-out knit cardigan and a white lace inner layer, draped over with an off-white lace scarf. Her hands are gently folded over thick white knit gloves over her chest, as if feeling the warmth of the winter sun. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her head slightly tilted, exuding a sense of tranquility and joy. The background is a bare branch completely covered in snow, its branches intertwining to form a complex network structure. Some branches are covered with crystal-clear icicles, shimmering faintly under the sunlight. Distant trees gradually blur, creating a soft blurred effect. The sky is a clear pale blue with no clouds, bright and pure. The overall color palette is mainly white, pale blue, and yellow, creating a cool yet warm contrast. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned about one-third to the right, leaving a large left space to display the snowy landscape and sky, with a slightly upward view. It enhances the character's elegant temperament and sense of spatial depth. Light and shadow come from the upper left, with soft natural light streaming through gaps in the leaves, casting light shadows on the snow to create bright highlights and soft transitions. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, dreamy, and poetic, with a slight film texture and warm filters, simulating the natural realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The color saturation is moderately high, highlighting the vitality of yellow clothing while retaining the cool tone of the snowy scene. There is a slight vignetting effect at the edges of the frame to enhance visual focus. The snow in the background has delicate textures, with visible footprints and wind erosion marks. The frost flowers on the branches are rich in detail and distinct layers, giving the overall composition a strong visual guidance. The viewer's attention is first drawn to the figures' bright yellow clothing, then spreads to the surrounding snowy landscape. The composition is balanced and rhythmic. In the foreground, the clothing textures are clearly visible, with knitted patterns, lace trim, and tulle skirt folds all rendered in detail. The branches in the middle are complex but not chaotic, and the background blur is well handled. It maintains the authenticity of the environment while highlighting the main subject, presenting an overall picturesque romantic atmosphere that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. It feels like a warm moment captured in the cold winter, allowing one to feel the subtle emotional changes during the changing seasons",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
