        {
          "id": "krea2-d9b9f5a502b1d269f225bfe0",
          "alias": "单女红浴袍雪地忧伤跪持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in red Hanfu kneels in the snow, turning to look back at the camera. She holds an unfolded red oil-paper umbrella, its surface slightly tilted, the ribs clearly visible, and the handle decorated with a small golden pendant. The edge of the umbrella is slightly curved, presenting a traditional craftsmanship feel. The woman wears a deep red silk robe with thick and lustrous fabric. The skirt is wide and embroidered with golden dragon patterns, with smooth and delicate lines and distinct layers. Tassel decorations are on the cuffs and hem. As her body moves naturally, her robe spreads across the snow, forming graceful curves. A long red ribbon extends from the hem of her skirt, winding and coiling through the snow like a red silk snake, finally narrowing naturally in the foreground to form a visual guideline. The woman's posture is dignified and elegant, knees slightly bent, hands gently clasped in front of her, as if meditating or waiting for someone to return. The background is a forest covered in heavy snow, the outlines of trees blurred, branches intertwined, snow weighing down the branches. Distant mountains are faintly visible, the sky grayish-white, with fine snowflakes drifting down. The entire scene is enveloped in a tranquil and desolate atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, leaving ample space on the right to convey a sense of emptiness. The ribbons and part of the skirt in the foreground occupy the lower area of the frame, enhancing depth. The middle ground features a woman and snowy terrain, while the background is blurred woods and distant mountains, creating a strong sense of depth. The light is softly diffused, with diffused light from cloudy days evenly illuminating the entire scene. There are no obvious shadows, but subtle changes in light and shadow can still be observed in the folds of the clothing. The red clothing stands out against the white snowy ground, with strong color contrast forming a visual focal point. The overall palette is mainly cool white, complemented by warm vermilion and gold, creating a contrast that is both tragic and luxurious. The image has a poetic beauty reminiscent of classical ink painting, while also having a photographic realism texture, as if shooting outdoors with a professional camera. The focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/ 2.8, capturing delicate details and soft background blur, with soft ambient lighting, accurate exposure, and well-controlled noise, presenting high-resolution, high-dynamic range image quality. The entire image is full of Eastern aesthetic charm, combining the weight of traditional costume culture with the expressiveness of modern photographic art, creating a solitary, tranquil, and aesthetic atmosphere that evokes the ancient poetic phrase \"A thousand mountains where birds disappear, ten thousand paths where no one is found,\" while also conveying a sense of romance and melancholy that transcends time and space. It was as if time had frozen at this moment, with only snowflakes quietly falling. The woman's figure was poetic and picturesque, eternally frozen in this silver-white world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
