        {
          "id": "krea2-8db7e57cfa87bc96857ad0b3",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙坐出神",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman sits on an old concrete step, her body slightly leaned back, head raised, as if gazing at the sky or lost in thought. She wears a light-colored sleeveless dress with dark plaid and floral patterns, the hem trimmed with lace trim. Her legs are naturally crossed, and she wears a pair of pure white mid-calf socks. There is a small green circular spot on her right ankle. One hand gently rests on the rough wooden railing beside her, whose surface is covered with weathering and moss. It appears old and weathered, with mottled gray cement walls as the background. The walls have fine grainy textures and faint water stains. Large green leaves hang down from above, forming a natural green dome. Sunlight filters through the layered leaves, creating soft and mottled light and shadow, casting interwoven light and shadow on the figures and walls. Some leaves appear semi-transparent under the light. The overall color palette is mainly fresh green and warm off-white, creating a tranquil, The atmosphere is lazy yet slightly artistic. The composition uses a slanted diagonal line to guide the visual, extending from the railing at the lower right to the green leaves at the upper left, placing the figure slightly to the left center to form a visual focal point. The foreground features blurred vines and leaves, the middle ground features figures and railings, and the background features walls and farther greenery. The layers are distinct, and the composition has a strong sense of depth. Light and shadow transition naturally, with light entering diagonally from above, creating a clear contrast between highlights and shadows, highlighting the contours of the figures and the texture of clothing. The overall style resembles real-life scenes shot with everyday amateur equipment, featuring a film texture and slight graininess. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, full of life and poetic beauty, emphasizing the harmonious coexistence of people and the environment under natural light, capturing moments of tranquility and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
