        {
          "id": "krea2-a07674cdc577be386e05a60a",
          "alias": "单女黑挂脖摄影棚媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a black silk halter gown, elegantly leaning sideways against a dark wooden wall. Her posture was full of sensuality and calm tension. She lowered her head slightly, her expression thoughtful. Her right hand gently touched the wall, her fingers slender and long, while her left hand rested softly at her waist. On the back of her hand was a simple ring, with golden geometric earrings hanging set with dark gemstones that shimmered with understated luxury. The black gown she wore was smooth in texture, with a high neck design that accentuated the neckline. The hollowed-out back outlines a smooth ridge line, and the overall clothing fits the body perfectly, showcasing a mature and captivating curves. The foreground features a figure, occupying the left central position. The background is a dim indoor environment, with warm yellow light emitted from the vintage wall lamp, creating a soft and layered glow effect. In the distance, there are also blurred light sources, creating a hazy depth-of-field space. In the middle of the scene, the wooden wall has clear textures with vertical wood grain patterns. This increases the depth and texture of the composition. The composition uses an oblique angle, with the figure's body extending diagonally to guide the gaze from the lower left corner to the upper right. At the same time, the light and shadow contrast highlights the main contour. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with light mainly coming from the wall lamp on the upper left, creating a strong sidelight effect with strong contrast between light and dark, while the other side is hidden in shadow, enhancing the sense of depth and mystery. The overall tone is dark, but local highlights highlight key areas, making the scene both dramatic and delicate. The background blur makes the subject stand out, presenting professional studio-level lighting techniques, as if shot in a private hotel corridor or high-end club, with a strong fashion blockbuster feel. The overall image conveys a cool, noble, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, reminiscent of classic cinematic shots, full of storytelling and artistic atmosphere. Shot with an 85mm prime lens, large aperture f/1.4, camera set to ISO 200, shutter speed 1/125 second, precise control of exposure and dynamic range, presenting realistic and expressive visual effects; the entire scene seems frozen by time, with power hidden within the tranquility, and the interplay of light and shadow telling the story of female independence and elegance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
