          "id": "krea2-d58106b0aeb64cfafde1c9e9",
          "alias": "单女紫T恤广场微笑注视",
          "prompt": "Her posture is relaxed and elegant, smiling and showing her white teeth, showing a natural and friendly charm that adds a touch of liveliness. She wears a loose light purple short-sleeve T-shirt printed with black English text and a blurred cartoon pattern. She pairs it with dark blue denim shorts with slightly worn hems, presenting a casual and casual style. On her feet is a pair of unique denim-patchwork boots. The boot shaft is made of denim with irregular flicked edges, and the sole is black thick. The overall look combines fashion and personality. On her left wrist, she wears a red thin cord bracelet, giving a fresh and natural look. The background is a beige stone wall made of large square stone slabs with clearly visible textures. In front of the wall is a row of black metal railings, arranged in vertical strips with clean and neat lines, and the floor is paved with light gray square tiles. There are fine gaps between the tiles, some edges slightly worn, showing signs of daily use. Below the stone steps grows a small patch of green plants, with dense leaves and bright colors, contrasting with the surrounding environment. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, body slightly tilted, gazing toward the camera, creating an interactive feel. The foreground shows the lower body and the ground, the middle ground is the main body and railing, and the background is the wall and distant plants, creating clear layering. Visual guidance is guided by the figure's posture and gaze direction. Light and shadow come from the left, with soft natural light evenly illuminated the figure, creating a contrast of light and shadow that makes the outline clear. At the same time, a soft shadow is cast on the floor and walls, creating a quiet and warm atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly pale purple, blue, gray, and green, with harmonious unity to present a genuine and beautiful moment in daily life. The image has a slight film texture, with a faint graininess and a retro effect with low color saturation. It looks like street photos taken with a regular camera, rich in detail, full of everyday life, balanced composition, moderate blank space, with both focus and a sense of space. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, conveying youthful energy and a sense of freedom",
