        {
          "id": "krea2-02040935add22667fe4b90ab",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor bed, looking lively and dynamic. Her hands are naturally placed behind her head, fingers slightly apart, presenting a relaxed yet slightly lazy pose, as if speaking softly or just exhaling. Her expression carries a hint of surprise and curiosity, yet also a touch of playfulness and authenticity. She wears a loose white short-sleeved T-shirt, with colorful abstract patterns and text printed on the chest. The design is made of bright colors such as red, yellow, blue, and green, featuring street graffiti-style design elements. The lower half is paired with light-colored high-waisted denim shorts, with slightly worn details at the hem edges. The overall look is casual and casual, full of youthful energy. The foreground shows the lower half of the figure's body, with bent knees and legs naturally apart. The leg lines are soft, and light streams in through the left window, creating a soft side glow with natural transitions. The background is a simple indoor environment, with walls in light beige or white for a smooth texture. In the upper right, a half-open window with a white frame lets in bright natural light outside. It creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The middle shot is the main subject, occupying most of the frame. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, and gaze directed directly at the viewer, creating a strong visual direction. The camera angle is slightly lower, shooting from below upward, enhancing the person's affinity and presence. The overall color palette is warm white and beige, complemented by colorful patterns on the T-shirt as visual highlights. The color contrast is vivid but not abrupt, with soft and even light and shadow, without strong shadows. It creates a realistic moment captured unintentionally in daily life, with a relaxed and natural atmosphere, as if on a lazy afternoon, sunlight streaming through the curtains into the room. The movements are natural and unpretentious, and the entire scene exudes a sense of everyday life and authenticity. The images have a film-like texture, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation, preserving the original light and shadow layers and details, presenting an effect similar to amateur camera shooting. There are no obvious artificial touch-ups in the footage. It feels more like a snapshot of a real record: the overall composition is compact but not crowded, the background is well handled to highlight the subject, while retaining enough environmental information to enhance spatial sense. It then follows the body's contours to the hands and legs, finally returning to the overall posture, forming a complete visual loop. The overall atmosphere is warm, authentic, and full of vitality, like a private photo from a friend's phone album, recording ordinary yet touching moments of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
