        {
          "id": "krea2-fffc8eb64e15d826ed87a906",
          "alias": "单女外套街道忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a city street, wearing a dark pilot jacket with a turtleneck sweater over her shoulders, a white shoulder strap slung across her shoulder. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, as if gazing into the distance or immersed in her own thoughts. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned and her head slightly raised. Sunlight pours down from the upper right of the frame, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and poetic. The foreground features a blurred lens halo effect, presenting warm orange-yellow circular light spots and rainbow-colored scattered light, simulating the optical characteristics of real camera lenses. This enhances the film's texture and nostalgia. The middle shot features the female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the visual center but not entirely centered, creating a dynamic balance. The background is a typical Japanese city streetscape, including multi-story residential buildings, utility poles, intersecting wires, balcony railings, and distant architectural silhouettes. The buildings are mainly gray-white, with slightly blurred details, creating a shallow depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out more. The sky appears as a mix of pale blue and white clouds. The lighting is bright but not too harsh, with an overall warm tone with a slight fading and grainy texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle to emphasize the figure's upright posture and sense of openness. Backlight and side backlighting are used to outline the character's outline in a soft halo. The lighting atmosphere is warm and gentle, with the lazy feeling of afternoon sunlight. The overall image is filled with the tranquil beauty of daily life and a subtle artistic vibe, with tones mainly warm yellow, off-white, gray-blue, and dark brown. The color saturation is moderate, presenting a restrained yet elegant visual impression. The image has a strong film photography style, simulating the graininess, slight noise, and color shifts of 35mm film, while preserving realistic light and shadow changes and environmental details. The composition emphasizes emphasizing blank space and spatial sense, with well-handled background blur that highlights the emotional expression and storytelling of the characters. The visual guide starts from the glow in the foreground and extends to the urban elements in the background, forming a clear visual path. Overall, it presents a quiet, gentle, Moments of slightly melancholic urban life are like freeze-frame shots in an independent film, capturing a poetic touch in ordinary daily life.",
