        {
          "id": "krea2-3eca7a10f8af67f0e8531a0b",
          "alias": "单女户外微笑侧头",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman appears relaxed and cheerful in a sunny outdoor setting. She slightly tilts her head, her smile natural and sweet, revealing her neat, white teeth, appearing lively and natural. The glass is transparent, containing ice and fruit pieces, with a brown straw inserted into the rim. The background is a vast, deep blue sky, with not a single cloud in sight—pure and bright. The overall composition centers on the figure, occupying most of the space, arranged slightly above the center, with the head slightly tilted to create a sense of dynamic balance. The middle shots showcase the upper body and clothing details. The background is a simple blue sky, extending along the smiling arc and gaze to the cup in your hand, then upward to the open sky, creating a free, sunny, and vibrant atmosphere. Light and shadow come from a slightly forward position, soft and even, with clear contours and delicate shadows. The folds of clothing show natural transitions of light and dark. The colors are mainly white, blue, and orange-yellow, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity, presenting a vivid and beautiful moment in daily life. Youth portraits that seem to be taken casually with a phone or portable camera, featuring a slight film texture and warm tones, with slight soft-focus edges that enhance the image's affinity and sense of life. The composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, conveying themes of exploration, freedom, happiness, and a love for life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
