        {
          "id": "krea2-1c7310a5c6224bd55b90d8a6",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市忧伤坐注视（2）",
          "prompt": "In a dimly lit and hazy corner of a bar, a woman sits at a wooden bar. She wears a white shirt and a plaid skirt, paired with a black blazer. She gazes directly at the camera, as if gazing into some distant memory or unknown future. Her gaze glows faintly red, revealing a mix of vulnerability and stubbornness. Her legs are crossed, one foot gently resting on the other, her posture elegant yet a touch of rebelliousness. Beside her, a glass holds amber-colored wine, with ice cubes glimmering faintly under the lights. Fine droplets of water condensed on the glass wall, with a wine cabinet filled with bottles and old books in the background. Above hangs a vintage crystal chandelier, its warm yellow light reflecting mottled shadows through the crystal, casting shadows on the figures and surroundings, creating a warm yet oppressive atmosphere. In the foreground are two men in dark suits, their figures blurred yet sharply defined, creating a strong visual contrast that draws the viewer's gaze to the central female subject. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figures positioned at the center of the frame. However, some of the foreground figures are obscured, creating a sense of voyeurism and narrative tension. The overall tone of the image leans toward a cool tone, mainly deep green and ink black, accented by warm yellow light sources, creating a striking contrast between warm and cool tones. The layers of light and shadow are rich, while other areas gradually transition into deep shadows, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The image has a distinct film texture, with fine and natural graininess, with slight light leakage and scratches at the edges, simulating the realism of vintage camera shooting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, melancholic, and nostalgic, as if capturing a forgotten moment. Time freezes at this moment, emotions flow silently, like an unfinished poem, an untold story, a lonely aesthetic belonging to urban nightlife, full of cinematic narrative tension and poetic beauty. The visuals are rich in detail, from the folds of characters' clothing to the bubbles in wine glasses, from the labels on the background wine bottles to the reflective textures of chandeliers. Every detail stands up to scrutiny, presenting a visual language that is both authentic and surreal, bearing traces of daily life and the refined pursuit of artistic creation. It makes one wonder who this woman is, why is she here, what her thoughts are? The whole scene is dreamlike yet within reach, as if music will play at any moment, someone will approach, and the story begins.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
