        {
          "id": "krea2-3dce1ca458a16926d39f7179",
          "alias": "单女公园忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a white railing outdoors, wearing a light, flowing white long-sleeved top with semi-transparent fabric and light blue floral embroidery. The sleeves are wide and soft, naturally falling with her movements, revealing soft folds and light and shadow effects. Her expression is slightly contemplative and melancholic, adding a touch of tenderness. She slightly turns her body toward the camera, her right hand gently resting on the white railing, fingers naturally bent. On her wrist is a delicate beaded bracelet, graceful and relaxed, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility. In the foreground is a white, smooth railing surface, with clear edges and delicate texture, reflecting a faint ambient light. In the middle is dense trees with lush branches and leaves, showing leaves of varying shades of green and autumn's unique pink tones. Some leaves have turned yellow or withered, creating rich color layers. The canopy is tall, and the branches intertwine, creating a rich natural atmosphere. The background is a grayish-white sky with heavy clouds. The lighting is soft and even, without strong direct sunlight, enveloping the entire scene in a unique cloudy haze. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side of the painting, occupying about one-third of the space, while the left side leaves plenty of space for the background plants, creating visual balance and tension. The angle of view is slightly upward, highlighting the figure's body lines and making the background trees appear taller. The visual guide line is formed by the character's arm and the direction of the gaze, extending from the lower right corner to the upper left. At the same time, the pink flowers in the background also serve as accents, attracting attention. The lighting and shadow are delicate, and the overall lighting is diffused, with no obvious shadows. The details are rich, with colors mainly white, light blue, pink, dark green, and gray. The tones are harmonious and unified, creating a quiet, restrained, and slightly poetic atmosphere. The image texture resembles everyday amateur equipment shooting, with a slight graininess and realism, preserving everyday details and enhancing authenticity and immersion. The overall style combines artistry and everyday appeal. It conveys a tranquil, gentle, and story-filled moment, as if capturing a private moment of solitary contemplation in an afternoon park, with the air filled with the coolness of autumn and the scent of flowers, making time slow and precious",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
