        {
          "id": "krea2-02c8a116757e1f4b181b32d4",
          "alias": "单女外套码头忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue, thick woolen coat with a soft and fluffy texture featuring subtle textures and natural pleats. The collar is wide and folded, with obvious stitching and button details at the cuffs. The coat material appears soft and matte under light, the scarf is fluffy and soft, with fine tassels at the edges that hang naturally, partially hidden by the coat. The scarf color contrasts softly with the coat's cool tones, creating a visual effect where warmth and chill intertwine. She wears a small pink earring, adding a bright touch to the otherwise cool tone. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying most of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera, creating strong visual guidance. The background is a pure blue gradient, gradually transitioning from deep blue above to light blue below. The background is simple and free of any distractions, highlighting the main subject. The light and shadow come from the left side of the front, soft and even, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, cool, and slightly melancholic, as if on a winter afternoon with sunlight filtering through the clouds and shining on her. She stands quietly by the window, holding warmth in her hands, yet harboring untold stories inside. The image has a strong cinematic and artistic atmosphere, like a carefully photographed fashionable portrait, using professional equipment such as the Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R IV, paired with an 85mm prime lens, and f/ Shooting with a 2.8 aperture while maintaining background blur to create depth, with color tuning leaning towards cool tones, highlighting the contrast between blue and white, making the overall image harmonious and unified, full of modernity and sophistication, while preserving the authentic and delicate emotional moments of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
