        {
          "id": "krea2-41b4083c5c4673a4b8d44760",
          "alias": "单女黑牛仔森林温柔持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a black denim jacket with a white long-sleeved shirt underneath, a black polka-dot skirt, and a gray knit skirt. The scarf is made of thick, soft gray coarse yarn with long tassels. The overall look is simple yet warm. The bench is made of light brown wood boards, with clearly visible wood grain, fixed at the joints of the boards. The floor is covered with golden and orange fallen leaves, with a blurred autumn forest in the background. The leaves display rich warm tones, ranging from tender yellow to deep orange to reddish-brown, with distinct layers. The light is soft and warm, and sunlight filters through the canopy, casting dappled shadows, creating a peaceful and peaceful autumn atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right for extended view. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background to highlight the subject, creating a natural visual guide. Light comes from above and shadows are soft. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, orange, and brown, accented with black and gray, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. With a film-like graininess and slight overexposure, it feels like shooting with an old-fashioned camera, carrying a retro nostalgic atmosphere. The images are full of life and poetic beauty, conveying the unique tranquility and gentleness of autumn",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
