        {
          "id": "krea2-8b8c698d0ca1d928a629b6f7",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman is beaming with a radiant smile, appearing natural and vivid, full of sunshine-like energy and innocence. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt made of lightweight and breathable fabric, with mesh patchwork on the shoulders adding a touch of casual fashion. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, with the figure occupying the main visual space. The composition uses diagonal lines to guide the view, extending from the upper left corner to the lower right. On the left, you can see part of the metal mesh fence structure, whose geometric lines add a modern urban feel to the image. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, clear and almost cloudless. In the distance, the silhouettes of city skyscrapers can be faintly seen, forming a simple yet layered background. The overall light and shadow come from the intense direct midday sunlight, bright and clearly oriented. Falling diagonally from above, it creates a warm and transparent texture. Details are clear, shadows transition naturally, and the main colors of the painting are blue and white, with a striking contrast of warm and cool tones. The blue sky is pure and profound, and the white clothing is clean and bright, creating a strong visual impact. At the same time, it is harmonious and unified, with a composition full of movement and tension. The figure's posture is slightly tilted, the body leaning forward, as if interacting with the camera, conveying a relaxed and joyful mood. The overall atmosphere is sunny and free, full of youthful energy, like a moment frozen in a summer afternoon. It has the realistic film texture and slight graininess of real filming, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The edges of the frame have slight natural halos and slight lens distortion, enhancing the sense of presence and experience. The tone has been slightly adjusted. It preserves the saturation of colors under the original sunlight, avoids excessive embellishment, presents natural and authentic light and shadow changes, captures beautiful moments in life, and conveys a simple and pure joy and hope",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
