        {
          "id": "krea2-61d7e41fa59f0e94da6aa49c",
          "alias": "单女白外套户外冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on an outdoor stone steps, slightly tilting her head to look at the right side of the frame, revealing neat, white teeth. She wears an off-white loose coat with an open neckline, revealing a blue denim shirt underneath and a light-colored scarf with fine patterns. The coat's shoulder design features prominent lapel and button details. The material looks soft and thick, and sunlight streams in from her left front, creating a natural transition of light and shadow that creates a warm and bright atmosphere. The background is a blurred urban public space, with gray architectural structures and columns faintly visible. In the distance, a figure in a red jacket is walking, his figure blurred to create a slight dynamic blur. The ground is paved with dark gray stone pavements, casting clear tree shadows and figure outlines on the surface. The composition uses a mid-shot close-up, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to guide the viewer. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, with moderate background blur, preserving environmental information without interfering with the visual focus. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, accented with cool blue and gray tones, creating a striking contrast. The light comes from low-angle afternoon sunlight, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and lively everyday scene. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation. With a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and natural exposure gradation, it feels as if a professional camera paired with a standard lens captures a genuine and beautiful moment, conveying a sense of relaxation and the happiness of enjoying personal time. The entire image is filled with youthful vitality and gentle healing power, like a quiet scene in an art film, allowing people to feel the poetry and beauty in ordinary life",
