          "id": "krea2-61c56b4d7ae710fb221e29ab",
          "alias": "单女粉睡裙厨房困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dim kitchen corner, wearing a light pink silk spaghetti strap nightdress over a loose white silk robe. The sleeves hang down naturally, the straps slip down to reveal one shoulder, and her expression is slightly tired and melancholic, as if she has just woken from a dream or fallen into deep thought. Her hands are folded on her knees, her left ring finger wearing a simple silver ring, her right hand holding a blue pill between her fingers, her body slightly leaning forward, legs cross-legged on the floor, barefoot naturally extended, toes relaxed, In the foreground are scattered medicine bottles and jars, including white plastic medicine bottles, transparent glass medicine bottles, and tablets scattered on the dark gray cement floor. The label on the medicine bottle is blurred, with some caps open and some tablets rolling around. In the background is a row of old kitchen countertops, with several gray-white ceramic cups and dishes placed on top. Behind it are dark wooden cabinets and a semi-transparent pink velvet curtain. The curtains are naturally folded, and light streams in from the left, creating a soft side glow while casting deep shadows on the walls and furniture. The overall color tone is cool, mainly gray-blue, off-white, and pale pink. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a quiet yet oppressive atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, and the perspective is slightly overhead to highlight the character's emotional state. The visual guide is from a medicine bottle in the foreground to the character's hand. The whole scene resembles a real, everyday moment shot, with slight graininess and film texture, simulating amateur camera effects. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened, color saturation is low, and details are rich but not overly sharpened. It presents a private, fragile, lonely, and story-filled atmosphere, as if recording a real moment of someone facing illness and emotional lows alone late at night",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
