        {
          "id": "krea2-cfc00fad726dffb811176b2c",
          "alias": "单女冲浪牛仔海滩微笑倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "With a sweet smile, she looks directly at the camera, exuding youthful energy and innocence. Her left hand is raised, holding a huge bright blue surfboard. The surfboard has a crocodile leather texture, and the side of the board has a long black strip hole. She leans slightly to the side, her posture naturally relaxed, and her right shoulder and arm lines are smooth. Light and shadow create a soft gradient on the skin. The background is a vast, deep blue sky with almost no clouds, and in the distance, the outline of green hills can be faintly seen. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space on the right side of the frame. The left side leaves a large area of blue surfboards as a visual guiding element, creating strong color contrast and visual tension. The overall tone is dominated by blue, ranging from deep sky blue to bright surfboard blue, and then to indigo on denim, with rich and harmonious layers. Light comes from directly above to the left. This is typical daytime strong light, with light shadows concentrated under the body and the edge of the surfboard, creating a clear and three-dimensional light and shadow effect. The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of summer vacation vibes, as if you can feel the warm touch of the sea breeze and sunlight. The image has a strong everyday photography feel, like real moments captured with a regular phone or portable camera, preserving natural details and slight noise texture, presenting a genuine and approachable lifestyle aesthetic. The overall image is simple yet detailed. The colors are highly saturated but not exaggerated, combining artistic flair with a sense of everyday life, conveying a free, happy, and unrestrained youthful state. The composition is compact, the main subject prominent, with a close-up of a surfboard in the foreground, a full-body posture of the person in the middle, and a wide sky and distant mountains in the background. The layers are distinct, forming a smooth diagonal movement that enhances the image's dynamism and appeal. The overall style combines fashion and everyday appeal, resembling a carefully designed model portrait or a genuine travel record. It perfectly captures the beauty of summer seaside moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
