        {
          "id": "krea2-1c644cbfc8df48283b40aba5",
          "alias": "单女米外套忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a thick beige coat with an orange-brown ribbed lining at the collar, adding a warm touch. Her fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and the back of her hand is covered with a layer of white plush gloves with delicate stitching along the edges. Around her neck is a black-and-white plush scarf, soft and fluffy, creating a feeling that is both warm and fashionable. The background is a vast snowy field, with the ground covered in thick snow, reflecting the faint light from the sky. The distant outlines of trees are blurred, presenting dark silhouettes. The sky gradually transitions from pale purple above to pink and orange-yellow near the horizon, creating a beautiful gradient. The thin clouds present a soft layered effect. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium and near shots for close-ups. The figure occupies the main part of the frame, with the head slightly tilted and the body slightly leaning forward. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, creating a strong visual guiding effect. The light and shadow come from the slanting sunset, soft and cool tones. The main light source shines from the upper right, while natural shadows are cast on the left, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly melancholic, filled with the poetic beauty of a winter evening. The image texture is delicate, with cinematic film graininess and slight noise, simulating professional camera shooting The color saturation is moderate, leaning towards cool tones, emphasizing the cool tones of blue and purple. Warm orange-brown and pink accents create a contrast of cool and warm tones, enhancing visual impact. The details are rich, from the texture of clothing to the reflections in snow, all clearly visible, presenting a realistic yet dreamy atmosphere. Like a daily photo taken with amateur equipment, it preserves natural imperfections and imperfections but contains profound emotional tension and artistic beauty",
