        {
          "id": "krea2-c4846ef6eeaf3f90f0404446",
          "alias": "单女和服庭院俏皮行走持扇",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a kimono with a deep blue background featuring white floral patterns, adorned with delicate white flowers and green leaf motifs, presenting the elegant charm of traditional Japanese aesthetics. She wore a wide purple obi around her waist, with a striking and harmonious color contrast that added a touch of classical and modern beauty. She stood barefoot in the wooden corridor, her right leg slightly raised, the sole lightly touching the ground, her posture natural and lively, as if she had captured a fleeting moment while walking. Her left hand gently holds a round round fan, painted with colorful flowers and butterfly patterns. The details are vivid and rich, showcasing a strong Japanese style. She looks directly into the camera, exuding a serene and serene aura. The overall design blends traditional attire with modern aesthetics, elegant yet approachable. The foreground features the edge structure of a wooden corridor; on the left, a reddish-brown wooden frame meets the white wall; on the right, thick dark wooden pillars create a symmetrical framing that guides the viewer to focus on the subject. In the middle is an extended wooden floor and railing. The wood panel's grain is clearly visible, with colors transitioning from light brown to dark brown, creating a warm and rustic texture. In the distance, the background reveals a blurred patch of green vegetation through the corridor gaps. The dense branches and foliage and mottled light and shadow create a soft bokeh effect, enhancing the spatial depth of the composition. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure standing slightly to the left center, the body slightly tilted, creating a natural dynamic balance. The contrast between solid and void between foreground and background highlights the main contour, while the corridor's lines guide the visual extension deeper. Enhancing spatial layers, natural light streams in from outside the corridor, creating a soft, diffused glow. Shadows are delicate and even, without strong contrast, creating a tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or evening. The overall color palette mainly features blue, purple, white, and brown, blending warm and cool for a harmonious unity. The image is filled with the tranquil poetry of a Japanese courtyard, featuring slight film graininess and subtle vignetting, simulating the realistic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting. It carries a slight retro filter effect and enhances the artistic ambiance. The greenery in the background and the architectural structure together create a realistic and tangible traditional Japanese scene, making one feel as if they are inside an ancient temple or garden in Kyoto. The entire scene presents a peaceful, gentle, and vibrant Eastern aesthetic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
          "_classification": {
