        {
          "id": "krea2-0de304f6195faf10eb86393b",
          "alias": "单女短裙森林神秘躺跳舞",
          "prompt": "Her wide sleeves and skirt unfold gracefully with her movements, forming a smooth arc. Red ribbons hang down from her waist, dancing like flames in the sunlight, creating a striking visual contrast with the pure white fabric. The Hanfu is embroidered with delicate blue patterns, delicate and refined, faintly visible with her movements. Her posture is relaxed and restrained, as if performing a silent dance, or as if in a dialogue with nature. On the left side of the painting is a dark brown wooden pillar. The surface texture is clear, with slightly worn edges revealing traces of time. Behind the pillars lies a blurred stone wall and dense forest, with mottled shadows and interwoven branches and leaves forming varying shades of green. Sunlight pours down through the gaps in the leaves, forming golden beams that pass through the dust in the air, illuminating the woman's figure and the ground. The light is soft and warm, showing the unique warm yellow tones of early morning or evening. The ground is paved with blue-gray stone slabs, with a bit of moss growing in the gaps, adding a touch of rustic charm. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the painting, leaving ample space on the left to highlight the sense of extension between light and shadow and the environment. The background is blurred to make the subject stand out even more. In the foreground, you can see a corner of a wooden bench, with simple lines that harmonize with the overall atmosphere. The visual guide moves from left to right, with light streaming in from the left and extending along the pillar to the right, ultimately focusing on the woman, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and a sense of dynamic flow. The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil and mysterious, combining classical poetic elegance. It also carries a touch of Zen tranquility. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and dark brown, accented with bright red, creating an atmosphere that is both solemn and lively. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, enhancing realism and nostalgia. Overall, it presents a transcendent Eastern aesthetic that lets people feel the flow of time and the rhythm of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
