        {
          "id": "krea2-ae1f0bcf0e1968a308bdf783",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫户外害羞站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an outdoor stone railing, wearing a deep blue beret and a loose white short-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar and sleeves rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms. Her right hand is raised, her expression slightly shy and curious, her left hand clenched at her side, and a green and white cloth bag slung across her shoulder. The bag features geometric patterns, the shoulder strap is patterned with blue and white checks, and the background is a lush tree with leaves gently swaying in the breeze, presenting rich green layers. In the distance, a red brick building can be faintly seen. The building's outline is blurred, windows are neatly arranged, and the overall tone is cool. The sky appears gray-blue, with soft and even lighting, like natural light on a cloudy or evening day. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground, there is a rough-textured beige stone railing with fine grains and spots, adding realism and tactile feel. In the middle ground, the figure and part of the railing are clearly prominent, while the background gradually blurs, creating a shallow depth of field effect. Extending along her line of sight into the distance, it creates a sense of interaction and storytelling. The light and shadow are soft, without strong contrasts of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, artistic, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing a fleeting everyday mood. The image style is close to everyday amateur equipment shooting, featuring slight noise and low color saturation, presenting a lifelike documentary aesthetic. The tone is mainly cool, with a white shirt and dark hat forming a sharp contrast, accented by green plants and red brick buildings. It enriches the color layers of the painting, balances the overall composition, features natural postures of the figures, and delicate details that convey a youthful innocence and restrained emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
