        {
          "id": "krea2-a38285b08ff6be806c23ce0c",
          "alias": "单女白T恤摄影棚俏皮侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the subject of the image, exudes a casual yet refined beauty, appearing delicate and alluring. She wears a simple white crew-neck T-shirt paired with blue denim overalls, with the straps naturally hanging down. The overall look is casual yet stylish. Her right hand tightly holds a silver spray paint can, with a black label and barcode on the can, forming an intimate and playful interactive gesture with light blue, purple, and green spots, like an unexpected surprise during the creative process. It adds an artistic sense of spontaneity and playfulness, occupying the main visual focal point of the painting. The metallic texture of the spray paint can subtly reflects under the light, details are clearly visible, and the background is a pure, pale white wall—simple and clean, with no cluttered elements obstructing the view. However, a pink heart-shaped pattern can be faintly seen in the right rear, adding a touch of warmth and romance to the scene. The composition uses a close-up approach, placing the figure slightly lower in the center of the painting, with the head slightly tilted. It creates a strong visual impact and emotional connection. The proportions of the images are close to the format of vertical mobile wallpapers, then extend along the lines of the spray paint can to her hand movements, forming a complete visual flow path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and even, with light coming from the front and above, and shadow transitions are natural without obvious hard shadows. The white wall in the background also reflects some light, enhancing the overall brightness and transparency. The color scheme mainly features white, blue, and pink tones, presenting a fresh and The lively and slightly artistic visual effects make the entire scene feel as if it was shot in a minimalist indoor space, possibly a studio or a private room. The natural lighting and clean environment give a sense of authenticity and warmth, like a casual snapshot taken with everyday hobby equipment, capturing the beautiful moments where youth and creativity intertwine",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
