        {
          "id": "krea2-eaa2cf5ca590e1bdd44ebab8",
          "alias": "单女和服小径沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, radiating a semi-transparent sheen. She tilts her head slightly back, her expression calm and focused, as if gazing at something distant and beautiful. Her right hand is raised, fingers gently together, fingertips bent slightly, as if catching a dust or a ray of light floating in the air. Her left hand hangs naturally, wearing a traditional kimono with a light blue background and elegant chrysanthemum patterns. The fabric is delicate, with slight pleats and natural drape. The sleeves are wide, with the edges revealing a pale pink fabric lining. A wide white belt is tied around the waist, elegantly tied into a bow. The overall clothing colors are soft and layered, with a pure black background without any distractions, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. Light shines from the upper rear of the figure, creating a distinct backlighting effect. The light source presents a warm golden hue, passing through tiny particles in the air, forming clearly visible beams and floating light spots, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The main subject is positioned on the right side of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head tilted back. In the foreground, the middle ground features the figure's body and kimono, whose patterns appear three-dimensional and vivid under the light. The interplay of light and shadow creates rich layers, the background is completely dark, emphasizing the subject in a minimalist manner to form a smooth diagonal. At the same time, the light flows along this path, enhancing the sense of dynamism. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil. Filled with poetry and Zen, as if time has frozen in this moment, the figures seem to be silently praying or contemplating. The surroundings are filled with an ethereal atmosphere that transcends reality. The images possess a high artistic sense and emotional expression, resembling a carefully conceived film photographic work, shot with professional equipment. The lens focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/1.8, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 400, presenting a delicate depth of field effect. The background blur is clean and crisp, and the subject is sharp and clear. It retains the unique grainy texture and color gradation of film, with a warm tone and a slight retro filter effect, giving the image a nostalgic and gentle emotional tone. The overall style blends Japanese aesthetics with the refined feel of modern portrait photography, conveying a restrained, elegant, and philosophical Eastern atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
