        {
          "id": "krea2-cc758cb97329d7f0336a53c3",
          "alias": "单女竹林沉思站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant white Hanfu slightly tilted her head and gazed ahead, her expression tinged with calm and contemplation. She gently held a bamboo lantern that emitted a soft, warm glow. The lantern was cylindrical, woven from fine bamboo strips into a diamond grid structure, emitting a warm golden glow inside. Light filtered through the gaps in the bamboo strips, creating a mottled effect that illuminated the back of her hand and part of her sleeve. The top of the lantern was secured with a white cord, giving the overall look a simple and elegant look. The woman's Hanfu sleeves flowed with wide sleeves, and the fabric was light and soft. It presents natural pleats and drapes, with a delicate texture and a silky sheen. The collar and cuffs have smooth lines, showcasing the elegant silhouette of traditional attire. The background is a blurred eaves of an ancient Chinese building, with dark wooden structures and tiles faintly visible in dark tones, creating a strong historical atmosphere. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The lantern serves as a visual focal point in the foreground, forming an interactive relationship with the figure. The composition has a strong sense of depth and layering. The background blur makes the subject stand out, and the use of light and shadow is clever. The main light source comes from inside the lantern, creating a combination of backlight and side lighting, illuminating the outlines of the figures and details of clothing. The background is in darker shadows, enhancing contrast and three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, complemented by deep gray and black backgrounds, creating a tranquil, cozy, and slightly mysterious Eastern atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, with a slight film graininess and vintage filter effect, making it feel like shooting with an old-fashioned camera. The lens has a focal length of about 85mm and an aperture of f/2.8, capturing natural depth of field and soft bokeh. The edges of the frame are slightly out of focus, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of poetry and Zen charm. It resembles a courtyard deep in the evening, with a woman sitting alone under the lamp, lost in thought, time standing still. The scene resembles a classical ink painting, or a dream spanning a thousand years, full of the charm and philosophical charm of Eastern aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
