        {
          "id": "krea2-741a755c4913ddce4ef5d63d",
          "alias": "单女短裙森林站立持伞",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman dressed in flowing white Hanfu stands in an autumn forest lined with golden ginkgo leaves. She gently holds an off-white oil-paper umbrella in both hands. The handle is made of natural bamboo, with a slightly slanted surface that curves softly. The sleeves are wide, and the fabric feels delicate. With natural folds and drapes, the hem of the skirt gently flutters in the wind, creating an elegant and poetic overall look. The background is layered ginkgo leaves, golden and brilliant. Sunlight filters through the branches, casting mottled shadows and creating a dreamlike halo effect. The leaves sway gently in the breeze, creating a tranquil and warm atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, head slightly raised, enhancing the figure's sense of sanctity and presence. In the foreground is the woman's oil-paper umbrella and part of her sleeve. The background is a blurred golden canopy, creating strong color contrast and layering. Finally, it falls into the sky overhead, forming a complete visual loop. The light is soft and warm, with backlighting from above making the figure's outline clear. At the same time, the gauze creates a subtle translucent effect, creating a hazy yet beautiful atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white and golden, harmoniously unified and full of Eastern aesthetic charm. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, rich in detail and clear texture. With a strong artistic atmosphere and cinematic visual expressiveness, it is like a flowing classical painting, allowing one to feel the serene, far-reaching, gentle, and poetic beauty of autumn. The scene is set in the early morning or evening, with fresh air, a gentle breeze, and leaves drifting down. The entire scene is filled with a subtle sense of nostalgia and romance, as if time stands still at this moment, with only the golden leaves telling the story of the seasons. This is a photographic work that blends traditional and modern aesthetics, combining the elegance and subtlety of ancient style, combined with the delicacy and delicacy of modern photography, perfectly presenting a stunning moment of an Eastern woman in the autumn scenery, full of storytelling and emotional tension, leaving a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
