        {
          "id": "krea2-dad1f1fbd4f8c4bb6d427d3c",
          "alias": "单女蓝长裤广场忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a concrete floor, leaning against a pale gray wall. She wears a blue long-sleeved top and black pants, black shoes, hands folded on her knees, head slightly lowered, her posture calm and contemplative. Her figure is cast by sunlight on the wall, forming a clear silhouette. The wall is covered with mottled leaf shadows, showing varying shades of green and brown, various shapes—some like palms, some like feathers, with intertwined light and shadow. This forms a natural abstract pattern, with a dense background of trees. The leaves are thick and the branches are lush, some branches stretching to the top, blocking part of the sky. Behind the tree, a faint white building can be seen. The structure is simple, with a few windows and roof lines, but the details are blurred and blurred. The middle is the area between the woman and the wall. The ground is paved with square cement bricks in gray-brown color, with clear cracks between the bricks. At the base of the wall, there are some wear and stains, adding a touch of everyday life. The foreground shows the woman's lower body and feet, as well as the ground in front of her body. The slightly overhead perspective makes the figure appear more realistic and close to the ground. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. A vertical line runs through the entire image, extending from the ground to the wall and then to the treetops, creating a stable and balanced feeling. Visual guidance is mainly achieved through contrasts of light and shadow, with strong light and shadow drawing the attention to the figure, especially the tree shadows behind her and her own silhouette. This forms a visual focal point. Light comes from the upper left, with sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. The direction of light and shadow is clear, giving the scene a sense of depth and spatial layering. The atmosphere is tranquil, leisurely, and slightly lonely, as if it were an afternoon or evening, with time standing still and the world quiet. The color palette mainly contrasts warm and cool. The walls and floor display cool gray-white and brownish tones, while the leaf shadows carry warm yellow-green and orange hues. The light transitions are natural, and the color saturation is moderate. Not too bright nor too dull, the overall style is close to the realism of everyday amateur photography. For example, moments captured with film cameras or vintage digital cameras have slight graininess and noise at the edges, simulating film texture while retaining enough detail and clarity. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, foreground and middle shots are clear, background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject. The aspect ratio is square, matching the common format of mobile photography or social media sharing, giving an overall nostalgic, artistic, The sense of quiet fragments of life seems like a tranquil moment in an ordinary day, prompting reflection on time, loneliness, and self.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
