        {
          "id": "krea2-4174d1f68070d2c4636066e2",
          "alias": "单女和服商店沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a kimono with a light blue base and deep blue floral patterns sits upright on a low stool in front of a traditional Japanese wooden shop. She turns to look back at the camera, her expression calm and slightly thoughtful, holding a cup of amber tea. Her body leans slightly back against the wooden wall, her left hand casually resting on her knee, and her right hand steadily supporting a teacup, creating an unintentional sense of relaxation. In the foreground is a rough cement floor and several stone steps On the ground, there are dappled sunlight casting shadows. On the right side sits a small folding wooden table, with a stand for displaying menus or flyers. Nearby are a few books and a small green bottle. In the corner of the table is a potted white flower with vibrant green leaves, full of vitality. In the center is a typical traditional Japanese wooden building, with clear textures on the dark brown wooden walls. Under the eaves hang several red and white cloth banners inscribed with Japanese, and by the door frame are several brightly colored posters. The glass doors and windows reflect blurred images of the surrounding environment. Inside, you can faintly see the furnishings. On the right side hangs an orange-red triangular flag printed with white Japanese characters. In the distant background is a row of striking vermilion torii gates, layer upon layer extending to the edge of sight. Between the gates are green vines and leaves, giving a rustic yet Zen-like atmosphere. The sky is obscured, but soft natural light streams through the gaps. The overall lighting is a warm afternoon side backlight, with sunlight slanting in from the left side of the frame, The folds of clothing and the floor create delicate transitions of highlights and shadows, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the main subject located about one-third to the left of the composition. The gaze naturally flows toward the deep space of the torii gate on the right, using architectural lines and road directions to enhance perspective. At the same time, tables, plants, and architectural details in the middle ground enrich the composition's layers. The contrast between solid and void is obvious, the background gradually blurs, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The color palette is blue, brown, and orange as the main tones. The contrast of warm and cool is harmonious, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. The image texture is close to film photography, with slight graininess and low saturation processing, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, nostalgic, and full of everyday life. It carries the subtle charm of Eastern aesthetics while maintaining the leisurely pace of modern urban life, like a gentle daily picture frozen in time, evoking a sense of poetry and tranquility in slow-paced living",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
