        {
          "id": "krea2-1b68c9e327912afda0f4d8b3",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣广场微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a large white granite stone, slightly glossy, looking straight at the camera with a gentle smile. Her overall aura is gentle and elegant. She wears a white short-sleeved knit top with a heart-shaped hollowed-out neckline, made of soft and fluffy material that presents a delicate plush texture. She pairs a black high-waisted A-line short skirt with a natural hem and smooth lines. Black stockings wrap her long legs, smooth and slightly reflective, and she wears black platform sandals. The upper is decorated with pleated ruffles and a row of pearls, giving off a vintage yet refined look. She slung a simple off-white handbag diagonally over her right shoulder. The straps are slender, the body is compact, and the material is leather or canvas, giving a soft matte finish. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning forward, hands resting lightly on her knees, legs crossed to form a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a dense patch of green plants, including ferns, shrubs, and some broadleaf greenery, with rich leaf layers. The colors transition naturally from tender green to deep green, full of vitality. In the background, you can faintly see the glass curtain walls and metal frame structures of modern architecture, reflecting the light blue of the sky and the surrounding environment. The ground is paved with light gray square tiles, with clear gaps and a hard texture. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space. The foreground is a close-up of circular granite, rough and mottled with natural textures and fine graininess. The middle ground features the main figure and some greenery. The background features farther vegetation and building silhouettes, creating a clear sense of spatial layering. The light comes from the natural light from the front, soft and even, without strong shadows. Details are clear, and reflections on clothes and stockings are natural. The overall color palette is mainly white, black, green, and gray, with sharp contrasts yet harmonious unity. The atmosphere is tranquil and everyday, resembling a leisure corner in a city park or commercial district. The shooting style resembles everyday phone or portable camera shooting, with a realistic sense of life and a slight depth blur effect. The slightly blurred background enhances the subject's prominence, and the overall image presents a fresh, clean, and elegant urban lifestyle aesthetic, with a slight film texture and a filter effect that slightly lowers color saturation, creating a warm and realistic visual experience",
