        {
          "id": "krea2-64d501028fdeb07dca12ddc9",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫楼梯微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the indoor stairwell, smiling, appearing casual and lively. She wears a white turtleneck sweater over a loose brown and yellow jacket with a soft and fluffy texture, giving off a lambswool texture. The yellow parts are for the lining and placket design, with several neatly arranged black buttons. The cuffs and pocket edges feature color-matched details. She pairs it with blue straight-leg jeans and white sneakers. The overall style is simple yet warm, full of everyday vibes. Her body is slightly tilted, one hand in her coat pocket, the other naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and friendly. The background is a rough gray cement wall with a fine grainy texture. A black metal handrail runs across the wall, and below is a gray staircase with striking yellow warning stripes along the edge. Light shines from the upper left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the wall and figure. The light comes from the indoor lighting, presenting a warm yellow tone that creates a warm and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The slightly slanted body lines guide the gaze to the upper left, forming a natural visual flow. The foreground shows the main body and some steps, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and handrails, and the background features walls and distant stairs, with distinct layers. The colors are mainly brown, yellow, blue, and gray, warm and harmonious, with a slight film texture. The edges of the image are treated with natural vignetting, giving the overall image a sense of capturing an unintentional moment in daily life. It feels like a real life scene captured by an old camera under dim yellow lights, featuring the graininess and low contrast characteristics of vintage film photography. The details are rich, from clothing textures to wall mottling, all clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is quiet and healing, like an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon in a city corner. The light and shadows are soft, the tones are warm, full of the warmth of life and youth, with a strong sense of documentary and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
