        {
          "id": "krea2-5088f4c6d456010d84798544",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫雪地忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the rain, holding a transparent umbrella. The canopy surface tilts slightly, and the rainwater forms fine droplets and flowing water marks on the surface. The handle is black, with clean yet powerful lines. She wears a loose white long-sleeved shirt, light and soft, gently swaying in the breeze. The cuffs hang naturally, appearing somewhat casual, presenting a moist sheen that adds a touch of layering. She stands sideways, her body slightly leaning forward, carrying a faint melancholy and contemplation. Her contours are soft, and her right hand holds the umbrella handle. Fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, left hand naturally hanging down, the back slightly curved, posture elegant but unpretentious. In the foreground, a close-up of a transparent umbrella is clearly visible, the umbrella ribs are clearly visible, the edge of the canopy surface slightly curved, raindrops dripping from the edge, forming tiny water lines. The background is a blurred patch of green vegetation and blooming white flowers, possibly cherry or pear blossoms. The petals are as white as snow, branches intertwine, forming soft blurred light spots, creating a hazy, dreamlike atmosphere. The middle ground shows the woman's whole body and surrounding environment. She is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, leaving space on the right side for the line of sight to extend. The composition uses a third-division method, with the subject at the left golden ratio point, creating visual balance. At the same time, the umbrella in the foreground serves as a guiding element, directing the viewer's gaze toward the figures. The light and shadows are soft and even, with scattered light from cloudy days giving the entire painting a cool tone, mainly blue-green with a hint of grayish-white coolness. Light shines from above and from the sides, but without strong shadows, creating a peaceful and serene atmosphere. Raindrops trace fine diagonal lines in the air. It adds a sense of dynamism and realism, making the overall image full of poetry and romance, as if a moment frozen in an afternoon rain. It has a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, low contrast, rich details, and delicate textures. The image has a slight graininess and retro filter effect, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slight vignetting and noise, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The overall image conveys a state of loneliness, gentleness, and introspection, as if telling a story about youth, A story of growth and self-exploration",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
