        {
          "id": "krea2-c197690d57aa1486f2f10a4e",
          "alias": "单女巫女红短裙神社困倦站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Japanese shrine maiden costumes stands with her back to the camera in the depths of a forest. She wears a white wide-sleeved top and a bright red skirt, with a red cloth belt tied around her waist and a black quiver slung over her shoulder. She slowly raises a volley of burning arrows, flames flickering in the night, and the orange-red glow illuminates her arms and sleeves, creating a warm and mysterious layer of light and shadow. Countless tiny sparks and spots of light drift in the air, spreading like a shower of stars, creating a supernatural and sacred atmosphere. In the foreground, a close-up of a woman's hand holding an arrow, flames shoot from the tip of the shaft, illuminating half her body and the surrounding air. In the middle is the woman's complete figure, slightly turned to the side, head lowered, with a focused and calm expression, as if performing some ancient ritual. The background is a blurred outline of a forest, with trees faintly visible in a dark red glow, faint light filtering through the branches and leaves. The entire composition presents a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition uses a golden ratio slightly to the right center, with the figure occupying the main position. The flames extend upward, guiding the gaze, creating an upward momentum. The visual guide starts with the flames in the hands, ascending along the arrow's trajectory to the top of the head, then spreading to the swirling sparks around them, forming a circular flowing visual path. The light and shadow are mainly warm tones, with the light source coming from the burning arrow, creating a strong backlighting effect that makes the character's outline clear and three-dimensional. The background is enveloped in a deep dark red tone, with a strong contrast of warm and cool tones, enhancing dramatic tension. The overall atmosphere blends religious ritual elements. Eastern mysticism and poetic beauty create a delicate and realistic texture, with slight graininess and film texture, simulating the realism of amateur photography equipment. Color saturation is moderate yet impactful, with red and black as the main tones throughout, accented by golden flames to create visual focal points. The background blur is treated naturally, bokeh spots vary in size and are evenly distributed, enhancing the interplay of dreamy and real elements. The overall image presents a sense of power hidden in tranquility and sacred daily ritual in the ordinary. It was as if capturing a forgotten ancient moment, evoking the solemnity and gentleness of frozen time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
