        {
          "id": "krea2-14a6136e3d0f369e3842ccb5",
          "alias": "单女黑外套舞台沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the seat of a small off-road motorcycle, wearing a blue, white, and black color-blocked racing jacket. The jacket has a smooth and glossy surface, giving it a texture similar to leather or high-performance synthetic materials. The jacket is printed with the word \"RACING\" along with multiple brand logos and patterns. The design is full of dynamic and competitive energy. Underneath, she wears a dark gray tight short-sleeve T-shirt and a blue denim mini skirt with slightly irregular hems, showing wear and distressed details. She presents a casual yet fashionable street style, wearing black over-the-knee boots with slightly layered shafts revealing gray sock edges. The overall look blends motorcycle elements with a blend of everyday outfit aesthetics. Her hands wear black racing gloves with blue accents, fingers naturally bent, as if deep in thought or preparing to speak. Her posture is relaxed and expressive, revealing a thoughtful or playful mood. The rest is tied up for a clean and crisp look, with a simple light gray wall as the background. In the upper left corner of the wall is handwritten \"SUBO\" and a heart-shaped symbol. The font is casual yet warm, adding a touch of everyday play. On the right edge of the painting, you can see another woman's silhouette, dressed in a white knit top and a light blue pleated mini skirt, holding a fluffy white doll. Her body leans forward slightly, as if watching or interacting but not fully in the frame, creating a sense of realism and social atmosphere within the scene. The composition centers on the main figure. Using a medium shot to capture the entire body and the main parts of the motorcycle. The motorcycle itself is a black metal structure equipped with rugged off-road tires, a complex wheel design, and clearly visible engine components. The \"Orion\" brand logo is printed on the body. The overall shape is compact yet powerful, with smooth body lines and rich mechanical details. The foreground shows the front wheel and part of the frame, the middle ground shows the main figure and her sitting posture, and the background shows the wall and partial view of the person on the right, forming a clear spatial layer. Following her line of sight beyond the frame, the motorcycle's tilt angle and leg posture guide the viewer's gaze down and forward, enhancing the dynamic balance of the image. Light and shadow come from the front slightly above, with soft and even lighting with almost no strong shadows, making the contours of people and objects clear. The color saturation is moderate, and the blue jacket stands out against the gray-white background, creating a striking contrast. The overall atmosphere is fashionable, energetic, and everyday, as if it were a relaxed moment at an indoor shoot or a fan meeting. It features a slight amateur camera texture, such as camera noise, slight defocus, and natural color transitions, creating a realistic and welcoming visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
