        {
          "id": "krea2-5deaea0e0d3424efbdd88355",
          "alias": "单女全裸白高领衫雪地俏皮坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a snow-covered hillside, wearing an off-white turtleneck down jacket. The jacket design is simple yet warm, with a slight quilted texture on the body and a slightly flared hem. Paired with a matching short skirt, the overall look presents a fashionable feel that is light and warm in winter, naturally draped over the shoulders, forming a sharp contrast with the white hat and clothing. The hat is made of soft plush material with slightly puffed edges, adding a playful and cute touch. She wears light beige knitted thickened boot covers with thick soles, The surface has clear woven patterns, and part of the nude-colored stockings peek out at the ankles, adorned with tiny snowflake patterns, making it both everyday and refined. She sits sideways on the snowy slope, leaning slightly back, one hand supporting herself on the snowy ground, the other naturally hanging down, legs bent, one foot on the snow, the other raised, her posture relaxed and casual, her expression slightly lazy, revealing an unintentional tenderness and warmth. In the foreground is the snow-covered area where she sits, the surface uneven and uneven. Natural pits and folds formed by stepping and sitting posture, with fine snow particles reflecting a soft cold light. In some areas, faint ice crystal luster can be seen. There are slight melting marks at the edges of snow piles, hinting at sunlight and temperature changes. In the middle of the scene, a vast snowy slope stretches into the distance, with flat snow but covered with traces and rutting-like marks, presenting a natural sense of flow. The snow layer is unevenly thick, with some places piled into small hills, others flattened. In the distance, a few bare deciduous trees can be faintly seen, their branches interlaced in gray-brown color. A small amount of unmelted snow remains on the branches, with the background being a distant hill outline. The mountain is covered with sparse woods, mostly a mix of coniferous and deciduous forests, with a darker color, presenting a unique bleakness of winter. At the foot of the mountain are scattered clusters of houses, roofs covered in snow, walls mainly light gray and earthy yellow. The road winds through the village, the surface covered in white snow. The sky is pale blue, the clouds thin, and light pours in from the upper right, creating a soft backlight effect. Sunlight penetrates the tiny moisture in the air. A faint halo and scattering are created, enveloping the entire composition in a cool yet warm interwoven atmosphere. The composition uses a figure positioned slightly to the center, using the slope's slanting lines to guide the gaze upward. At the same time, the figure's posture echoes the curves of the slope, creating visual balance and flow. The snowy details in the foreground, the open space in the middle ground, and the progression of background layers together create a strong sense of depth. The color scheme is mainly white, supplemented by low-saturation tones such as off-white, light gray, and brown. The overall color tone is calm and unified, with delicate light and shadow treatment. The illuminated side is bright, shadows are soft in the backlight, and snow reflections enhance the overall brightness without being overly harsh, creating the unique tranquility and tranquility of a winter afternoon. The image texture closely resembles real camera shooting, with slight graininess and natural depth transitions, as if a professional full-frame camera is capturing outdoor natural light. The medium focal length lens provides a moderate sense of compression and clear subject details. The overall atmosphere combines the casual nature of daily life with the serene beauty of artistic photography. It conveys a lifestyle attitude that remains warm and elegant even in the cold season",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
