        {
          "id": "krea2-a390b0abb62efd271e357651",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场沉思坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair, wearing a white short-sleeved dress with a square collar and puff sleeve details on the shoulders. The fabric features delicate textures and natural pleats, presenting a light and breathable texture. The dress fits her figure, with a smooth waistline and knee-length hem. The overall style is elegant and simple, paired with semi-transparent white lace knee-high socks. The socks are covered with delicate diamond mesh patterns, revealing the soft tones of the skin. The leg posture is naturally overlapping, and the right hand gently holds a cup of blue-and-white coffee paper. The cup body bears the brand logo, fingers painted with red nail polish, creating a subtle contrast with the overall white tone. The left hand rests naturally on the knee, with slender lines, neatly trimmed nails, slightly curled and hanging over the shoulder. The head slightly tilts toward the camera, expression gentle yet slightly thoughtful. The background is a light gray brick wall with clear textures, neatly arranged bricks, and slightly rough joints, adding a rustic feel. On the left stands a tall glass vase holding a cluster of dried brown branches, naturally intertwined and extending. On the right wall hangs a mounted painting framed in dark wood. The content is blurry, but the word \"Lair\" is faintly visible. Next to the painting is a pot of bright red Christmas flowers, with full petals and vivid colors, creating a strong visual contrast with the surrounding understated tones. Below is a white fireplace stand with decorations, and next to it is a metal mesh storage box containing candles and other small items. The floor is covered with a dark gray carpet, soft in texture and delicate texture, and the lighting throughout the scene is soft and even. Natural light or soft light from the left front creates a warm and bright atmosphere, with soft shadows. The composition centers on the figure, using a central perspective where the figure occupies the main subject, with the body slightly tilted to create dynamic balance. The foreground highlights the lower body and the coffee cup in the hand. The middle shot includes seats and some background decorations, while the background presents walls and furnishings, with clear layers. The view extends along the line of sight to the coffee cup in the hand, then diffuses to the background decorations, forming a circular observation path. The overall color palette is white, Beige and gray are the main colors, accented with red and brown, creating a harmonious and unified color that exudes a sense of everyday life and artistic beauty. The image texture is realistic and delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, while retaining the casualness and comfort of daily life, presenting a tranquil, warm, and stylish indoor scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
