        {
          "id": "krea2-a252831804e8500c2adb5d9c",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍摄影棚忧伤持花",
          "prompt": "She wears a plain white wide-sleeved Hanfu, made of light and soft fabric, with naturally falling pleats. A matching cloth belt is tied around her waist, forming a simple waist cinch. The garment's surface glows with a soft sheen under the light. Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of withered white roses, the flowers have lost moisture, their petals curled and shrunk, their color tinged yellow, presenting a sense of the passage of time. The bouquet is carefully held at the chest, creating a subtle contrast with the pristine white robe. The background is pure black with no unnecessary elements, creating a strong visual focus. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space. The head and upper body are clearly visible, the body slightly tilted, posture elegant and relaxed. Light streams in from the upper right, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, creating a dramatic atmosphere. The light source comes from a small softbox or single lamp, simulating professional studio lighting effects, but retains slight graininess and imperfect details, making the overall look more like real scenes shot with everyday amateur equipment. The camera angle is slightly above head-on and slightly down, enhancing the elegant temperament of the subject. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to strengthen the central subject. The color scheme is primarily black, white, and gray, supplemented by a faint warm yellow halo, highlighting a warm and tranquil emotional tone. The entire composition is filled with a poetic sense of lonely beauty, conveying a nostalgia for bygone times and a persistent pursuit of beauty. The composition is balanced and full of tension. A smooth S-shaped movement line is formed; although the background is dark, it is not completely empty. Faint subtle noise and film textures can be seen, suggesting this is a real shot rather than digital rendering. The overall style blends Eastern aesthetics with modern photographic art, combining classical charm with contemporary feel. Like a tranquil portrait, it captures the eternity of a moment, with emotions restrained yet profound, allowing one to feel a beauty and sorrow that transcends language",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
