        {
          "id": "krea2-15d5774844a1cf97918c7e13",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a damp street corner steps, wearing a loose pink hooded raincoat. The red zipper lines peek out in soft pink, wrapping her like a soft cocoon. She holds a transparent, pale blue umbrella, its surface glowing faintly from the rain. Water droplets slide down the umbrella ribs, tracing fine traces in the air. She gently holds the handle in her right hand. His posture was lazy yet thoughtful. Beside him was a vintage-style yellow bicycle with a graceful lemon yellow frame. The front was fitted with a metal mesh basket, empty inside. On the handlebars hung an orange mailbox-style box with a few blurry notes attached. On the back seat hung a white plastic bag containing miscellaneous items. The rim of the wheel was stained with mud, showing traces of its use on city streets. The ground was a dark gray cement surface, with rainwater casting a thin reflection on the surface. Reflecting the grayish-white sky and the outlines of the surrounding buildings, a few clumps of wild grass grow along the edge of the steps, lush yet contrasting with the cold, hard cement. In the background is a row of old Japanese-style houses, the walls mottled, window frames dark brown, one window half-open, faintly revealing the dim yellow light inside. A white wall lamp hangs on the wall, emitting a faint warm glow. The distant street stretches into the distance, flanked by low houses and dense trees, with a utility pole on the right. Above hangs a red triangular traffic warning sign reading \"decorative characterまれ\" (Japanese: decorative characterまれ). The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned in the lower right and the bicycle in the upper left to create visual balance. The camera is shot at level with a slight downward tilt, creating a warm and realistic perspective. The light comes from diffuse light on a cloudy day, giving the overall cool tone, but the pink of the raincoat and the yellow of the bicycle inject warm hues. The light and shadow are soft and delicate, without strong shadows. It highlights the unique hazy texture of rainy days. Raindrops continuously fall from the sky, creating continuous dynamic details on the umbrella surface, ground, and car body, enhancing the scene's realism and immersion. The entire scene presents a quiet, lonely, yet gentle atmosphere, as if capturing a poetic moment in ordinary daily life. It has a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight color shifts. The tone leans toward a cool green tone, with moderate saturation and rich layering. The composition emphasizes emphasizing blank space and echo, with the umbrella and raincoat in the foreground forming a visual focal point. The bicycles and characters in the middle set form the narrative core, while the buildings and streets in the background provide environmental information, guiding the viewer's gaze from near to far, allowing them to feel the depth of space and the stillness of time. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, introspective, and slightly melancholic, yet it contains the warmth and beauty of life, like a freeze-frame in a silent film, capturing the most authentic moments in the city's corners",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
