          "id": "krea2-c7b0f3523b9c2cbc7f982ec2",
          "alias": "单女制服樱花忧伤坐出神",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Japanese school uniform sits sideways by a white metal railing. She wears a white stand-collar shirt paired with a dark plaid pleated skirt, a red bow tie accented on her chest, and a dark gray shoulder bag. She leans relaxedly against the railing, as if lost in thought or admiring the scenery. Her silhouette is outlined by soft light, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The main subject is in the lower right corner, forming the visual focal point. The cherry blossom tree occupies most of the space, with tender pink flowers blooming densely. In the foreground are blooming cherry blossom branches, with delicate and clear petals. Some of the branches cover the figure's head, creating a sense of layering and spatial depth. The middle ground features the figure and railing, whose lines are simple and modern, contrasting with the softness of nature. The background features rolling distant mountains with a pale blue hue, shrouded in mist. The sky is a gradient of light blue and white, with thin clouds. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot. Highlighting the flourishing cherry blossoms and the petite figures, light and shadow come from the upper left, sunlight streaming through the gaps, creating a soft backlighting effect. There is a slight halo around the edges of the figure, and the petals appear semi-transparent under the light. The colors are mainly pink, white, and light blue, with a fresh and elegant tone that carries the unique hazy beauty of Japanese photography. The overall image is full of poetry and youthful energy, as if capturing a tranquil spring afternoon. The lens simulates 35mm film shooting, featuring slight graininess and natural exposure. The color saturation is moderate, with highlights slightly overexposed, creating a warm and nostalgic atmosphere. The details are rich, featuring the delicate texture of cherry blossoms and the blurred outlines of distant mountains, presenting an artistic sense that is both realistic and dreamy, as if a frame has emerged from the depths of memory, full of nostalgia and reminiscence for beautiful times",
          "description": "",
