        {
          "id": "krea2-937a44ee3c63bfede595db63",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫室内俏皮站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor setting, wearing a white turtleneck knit sweater layered with a fluffy leopard-print faux fur coat. The coat is mainly brownish-yellow, mixed with dark brown and black spots. The fur is layered and soft to the touch, presenting a natural texture and sheen, gently draped over her shoulder. She holds a pink phone whose case is covered with cute cartoon stickers, including images of a bear, rabbit, cat, and more. The phone camera is clearly visible as she takes a selfie in front of the mirror. Her expression is slightly playful and contemplative. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, arms raised as she grips her phone, forming an elegant curve. In the foreground is her main image, occupying the main position in the frame. The background is the interior of a modern clothing store, decorated simply and stylishly. The walls are in light purple tones, and recessed spotlights are installed on the ceiling, providing soft and even lighting. In the distance, you can see clothes displayed on racks and the back of another customer. She wears a light-colored jacket, appearing blurrily in the middle of the scene. On the right side of the background is a large mirror reflecting part of the shop's structure and text signage. The mirror's edges are framed with metal, creating a realistic and delicate reflection. The left corner is dotted with green plants with broad, natural leaves. The floor is covered with smooth tiles that reflect the surrounding environment. The overall composition combines close-up and medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The mirror's reflection enhances spatial depth, then turns to background details to create a daily life atmosphere, with light coming from above, warm and soft, creating a natural transition of shadows. The color palette is mainly warm white and light purple, complemented by leopard print brown contrasting with the white sweater. The colors are harmoniously unified, creating a relaxed and cozy atmosphere full of modern urban life, as if taken casually while shopping. It feels realistic and intimate. The image style closely resembles real photos taken with a phone in daily life, rich in details and clear layers, presenting a natural and authentic texture and warmth",
