        {
          "id": "krea2-6542c9f916bba4fe7f5d3939",
          "alias": "单女白和服走廊神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white kimono stands with her back to the camera in a narrow corridor made up of countless orange-red torii gates. Her kimono is embroidered with a bright red lotus pattern, with a wide light-colored belt tied around her waist. She leans slightly to the side, her right hand gently touching the torii pillars beside her, as if feeling the warmth of the ancient building and the depth of history. Her posture is both devoutly worshipping and quietly admiring every detail of this sacred space. In the foreground are layers upon layers of torii gates, arranged in a regular geometric pattern extending into the distance, creating a strong perspective effect. Each torii pillar is engraved with black Japanese characters, recording the donor's name and date of prayer. These words densely cover the columns, adding a strong cultural atmosphere and sense of time to the scene. The middle is the area where women reside, positioned at the center of the passage, surrounded by the neatly arranged torii gates on both sides. The floor is paved with stone slabs, slightly mottled, with slight wear on the edges. Showing the erosion of time, at the end of the passage, a distant torii gate and faint light can be faintly seen, creating a deep and mysterious sense of space. The background is an infinitely extending array of torii gates, which gradually narrow as the distance increases, eventually disappearing into a hazy halo. The sky is obscured, with only a faint natural light filtering throughout, enveloping the entire scene in a warm golden tone. The composition uses a classic central symmetrical style, with the figure positioned at the center of the frame, guiding the gaze to extend deeper along the passage. It creates a strong sense of depth and visual guidance, using repeated torii structures to create rhythm and rhythm, enhancing the orderly beauty of the composition. At the same time, low-angle shots make the torii gate appear taller and more upright, enhancing the sense of oppression and sacredness in the space. In terms of light and shadow, the main light sources come from above and in the distance, presenting a soft warm yellow tone. Sunlight filters through the gaps between the torii gates, casting slender shadows on the ground and pillars, creating a visual effect of interwoven light and shadow, with rich layers of light and shadow. There are both bright highlights and deep shadows, enhancing the image's sense of depth and realism. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and solemn, carrying a transcendent sense of Zen and religious ritual. The colors are mainly warm orange-red, off-white, and deep black, harmoniously unified to create a classical and poetic Eastern aesthetic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, offering high resolution and rich detail expression, while retaining the natural feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting. For example, slight noise and realistic transitions of light and shadow make the images more lifelike and authentic. The overall style blends traditional Japanese cultural elements with modern photographic techniques, conveying a tranquil, devout, nostalgic, and poetic emotional experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
