        {
          "id": "krea2-e340ef9af3507f8f7e9bc3d8",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙镜前微笑坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the floor in front of a mirror, wearing a black-and-white vertical striped spaghetti strap dress. The material features delicate knit patterns, and the tight cut outlines a smooth figure. The hem naturally drapes to the floor, presenting soft folds and light and shadow effects, adding a touch of laziness and casual beauty. She gently tugs at the hem with both hands, her posture naturally relaxed, carrying a gentle yet confident smile. The overall composition is presented as a reflection in the mirror, with the subject positioned slightly below the center of the frame, forming a strong visual focal point In the foreground is the white border of the frame, with clean lines drawing the gaze into the world inside. The right side of the frame connects with the background wall, forming a symmetrical composition. In the middle is a woman's body and dress, her legs naturally apart, knees slightly bent, leg lines long. On her left wrist, she wears a slender silver bracelet, with exquisite details adding a touch of elegance. The background is a light beige wall, smooth but with subtle textures and mottled textures. In the upper left corner is a white power switch panel. Next to it is a dark brown wooden door or cabinet, with slight reflections and wear marks on the door panel, hinting at a daily living space. The floor is paved with light gray tiles, with clearly visible edges reflecting faint light. The entire scene layout is simple yet realistic, with no unnecessary decorations, creating a private and everyday atmosphere. The composition uses a classic mirrored selfie perspective, using mirrors as picture-in-picture structures to enhance spatial layering, visually guiding the space from the edge into the mirror. Extending to the details and environmental elements of the dress, it creates a visual flow from outside to inside. Light and shadow come from the natural light source on the left, possibly from windows or indoor lighting. The light is soft and even, casting subtle transitions of light and shadow on the figure. The overall tone leans toward warm gray with a vintage film texture, moderate color saturation, and slight grainy noise and color shifts, simulating vintage camera shooting. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the sense of center focus. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, evoking the warmth of everyday life. It also contains a serene aesthetic tension, as if capturing an unexpectedly real moment, with a strong documentary style and artistic atmosphere, like a casual shot at home with an old 35mm film camera, preserving the warmth of time and emotional depth",
          "description": "",
