        {
          "id": "krea2-c951428350607d6d26aa51b4",
          "alias": "男女黑内衣健身房冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A well-fitted woman stands in front of a gym mirror, her back to the camera, dressed in a black sports bra and black shorts, showing off a long, well-proportioned back and firm hip curves. Her right hand rests gently on her waist, while her left hand is slightly raised, her posture elegant and confident, as if adjusting her breathing or preparing for the next move. Her overall aura combines strength and beauty. In the foreground are neatly arranged dumbbell racks, with weight labels like 8 and 16 on the dumbbell plates. The dumbbell surface is smooth, reflecting a sharp metallic sheen. Some dumbbells are blurred to create a shallow depth effect, highlighting the main figure. The middle frame shows the gym's interior, where you can see treadmills, strength training equipment, and another man wearing a mask working out. He wears a black T-shirt, his arm muscles prominent, focused on his training. The background is gray walls and ceiling, with industrial-style ventilation ducts and long strip lighting. The cool white tones are evenly distributed throughout the space, creating a bright yet slightly oppressive atmosphere. The entire shot uses a low-angle angle, with the view extending from bottom to top, enhancing the visual height and presence of the characters. The composition centers on the characters, using mirror reflections to create dual images, creating symmetrical and asymmetrical visual tension, guiding the viewer's gaze from the dumbbells in the foreground to the figures in the middle and extending to the fitness environment in the background. The light and shadow distribution is delicate, with the main light source coming from a fluorescent tube at the top, casting soft shadows on the ground and equipment, while the mirror reflects the profiles and surrounding environment. It adds depth and dimension to the image, with the overall color scheme mainly black, gray, and white, complemented by metallic silver and a touch of red, presenting a cool, rational, and powerful modern fitness aesthetic. The image has a strong sense of everyday realism, as if shot by a regular camera, with slight noise and natural exposure control. It doesn't pursue excessive sharpness or perfect filters, retains authentic details and subtle color shifts, creating an atmosphere that is both professional and close to life. Suitable for showcasing the true state of fitness life and the power of personal growth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
