        {
          "id": "krea2-3a6eec57d171f20e144aff04",
          "alias": "单女黑制服冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black sailor uniform sits on the fuel tank of a deep blue Kawasaki KZ1000 motorcycle. Her left hand wears red-and-white racing gloves draped over her chest, her right hand hangs naturally, wearing black stockings and black leather shoes. Her legs are crossed, her posture elegant and relaxed, showcasing a beauty that blends youth and strength. The front of the motorcycle is clearly visible, the fuel tank is printed with the word \"KAWASAKI,\" and the body bears the \"KZ1000 MK.II\" badge. The front headlights and rearview mirrors, Details such as handles and exhaust pipes are clearly distinguishable. The car's paint surface is smooth, reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. The background is dense greenery, including ivy and pine. The leaves in the sunlight present rich layers, and the light pours down from above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on both the figure and the motorcycle, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, the motorcycle occupying the center and right side, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the details of both the figure and the motorcycle. The middle view showcases the overall vehicle and the posture of the figures, while the background is complemented by shaky greenery to enhance spatial depth. This extends to the motorcycle's lines and brand logo. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the upper left, forming natural shadows on the right side to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is deep blue and black, creating a warm and cool contrast that creates a retro and fashionable atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural feel of daily life, with a strong Japanese photo style. At the same time, it incorporates the rugged elements of motorcycle culture, presenting a unique aesthetic that combines temperament with masculine strength. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, like a brief rest on a summer afternoon, allowing people to feel the intertwining of youth, freedom, and passion.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
