        {
          "id": "krea2-679d23d433889eab877c6ae3",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a soft, warm-toned indoor setting, wearing a white lace long-sleeve shirt with elegant floral patterns. The fabric is light and flowing, with delicate ruffled designs at the neckline and cuffs. The pleated details on the chest add layers and dimension to the garment, giving the overall look a vintage yet gentle vibe, appearing lazy and authentic. She leans slightly to the side, gently resting her right hand on a dark brown wooden cane or chair back. The cane's surface is smooth and has a warm sheen, contrasting with her fair fingers. The makeup is clean and natural, with a single beige or light camel wall background. The surface has subtle textures, creating a peaceful, warm, and intimate spatial atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, head slightly tilted, creating direct visual communication with the viewer. Light comes from the left, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The light and shadow distribution is evenly and layered, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light brown, creating a nostalgic, cozy, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. It seems to capture a tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight, with delicate texture and rich details. It combines the sophistication of professional photography with the authenticity and naturalness of everyday shooting. It feels like shooting with an old-fashioned film camera in low-light conditions, with slight graininess and color shifts, adding a sense of time-accumulated beauty. The overall image is full of storytelling, as if telling a small fragment of youth, loneliness, and self-reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
