        {
          "id": "krea2-538bb5ca56c9fc52561bf2cd",
          "alias": "单女白连体衣船上坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of the bed, her body slightly leaning forward. She wears a white floral spaghetti strap jumpsuit adorned with small red and blue floral patterns. The thin strap design reveals the graceful lines of her shoulders and neck. Her legs are long, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her right hand rests gently on a striped sheet, while her left hand hangs naturally, her expression revealing a sense of tranquility and shyness. In the background is a room full of vintage atmosphere. On the left side is a wooden-framed window from which soft natural light filters in, and a curtain with reddish-brown patterns hangs on the windowsill Light filters through the curtains into the room, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. On the wooden cabinet by the window is a rudder ornament and a delicate model of a sailing ship. Above the cabinet hangs a small clock. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and brown, creating a cozy and nostalgic atmosphere. The walls are light green, contrasting with the wooden furniture. The composition is shot in a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, the body extending diagonally. The light and shadow are soft and layered, and sunlight streams in from the left side. Warm halos are cast on the figures, while delicate shadows are cast on the sheets and floor. The entire image presents a texture reminiscent of everyday life, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, featuring slight graininess and slightly lower color saturation, creating a realistic and warm atmosphere. The details are rich, from the folds of clothing to the texture of the bedsheets, all clearly visible. The overall style leans toward Japanese photography, emphasizing naturalness, authenticity, and emotional expression. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the images. All elements serve to convey the main character's emotions; the composition is balanced and full of tension, with natural transitions of light and shadow, and harmonious colors evoking a sense of tranquility, comfort, and a touch of nostalgia",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
