        {
          "id": "krea2-2941c6e954b5c613d744c0fe",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装椅上温柔坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a blue wooden bench, wearing a deep blue tight-fitting swimsuit with white edges. The swimsuit is designed to fit her figure, showcasing graceful curves. The straps are slim and sturdy, the neckline is V-shaped, accentuating the neck and collarbones. The lenses reflect light, and the frames look slightly heavy, naturally draped over her head. Her makeup is exquisite, looking fresh and natural. Her right hand gently rests on the wooden slats of the bench, fingers long. The left hand naturally rests at one side of the body, relaxed and elegant. The background is an indoor shooting scene, with a light gray cement floor with slight mottled marks. On the left rear is a white chair with red trim on the back. Next to it is a small wooden table with some miscellaneous items, including a black bottle and several wires. In the distance, a wooden dining table and several chairs can be seen. The overall environment is somewhat messy but realistic. On the right side is a large white reflector for fill lighting, with a black border on the edge. Its surface reflects soft light, and the composition uses a high-angle overhead view. The figure is positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The bench's diagonal lines extend from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a strong visual guide that draws the gaze toward the subject. In the foreground, the wooden strips of the blue bench are clearly visible, presenting varying shades of blue that echo the color of the swimsuit. The middle shot shows the entire figure, slightly leaning forward, knees bent, leg lines smooth, and feet not fully visible. Background elements such as chairs, tables, and reflectors are blurred, creating a clear depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out. Light and shadow come from the soft light on the right, with soft and even lighting and delicate shadows, no strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh, with a sense of realism for everyday photography. It feels as if the photographer is capturing a moment in an informal setting. The tones are dominated by blue, paired with white, brown, and gray, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image is full of life and natural beauty, with rich details. The overall style combines artistry and documentary, presenting a relaxed yet slightly intimate atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
