        {
          "id": "krea2-1348d1af13bee0282f1199e9",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a golf cart, wearing a white Adidas sports short-sleeve T-shirt. The black collar and sleeves have three visible black stripes, paired with a black skirt and over-the-knee socks decorated with white stripes, giving the overall look a sporty and fashionable vibe. She wears a white sun hat printed with \"GOLF GATES\" and the brand logo. She smiles, wearing a black golf glove on her right hand and a natural left hand resting on the cart's armrest, looking relaxed and elegant. The interior of the golf cart features beige seats and a metal frame structure. The seat surfaces feature mesh anti-slip mats, with lush green vegetation and a blurred sky in the background. In the distance, the outlines of trees can be faintly seen. The sky is pale blue, clouds thin, and the light is soft and even. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and pleasant. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, the body slightly turned to the right, forming a natural visual guide that connects to the car's structural lines, creating a coherent visual flow and delicate light and shadow handling. Natural light shines from the upper left, highlighting the sense of three-dimensionality and material details. The background blur is well handled to make the subject stand out, while preserving environmental information and enhancing spatial layering. The overall color scheme is mainly white, black, and green, accented with a few pink seats and red club grips. The color combination is harmonious and vibrant, presenting a relaxed and joyful moment in daily life, as if taken with an amateur camera or phone. It feels realistic and approachable, capturing leisure moments in golf and conveying youthful and lively energy. The atmosphere of health and freedom is stable, with a stable composition focusing on the characters' expressions and postures. Although the background is blurry, it retains detail, enhancing the storytelling and immersion of the image. The overall style combines everyday life with artistic beauty, like a tranquil outdoor portrait, evoking warmth and comfort under the summer afternoon sun",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
