        {
          "id": "krea2-65c10a2edb5a95b657c81065",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She stands slightly to the side, her head slightly tilted, carrying a hint of playfulness and gentleness, revealing her neat, white teeth, full of youthful energy. She wears a light blue denim jacket with a loose fit and slightly wide sleeves. The jacket's surface shows obvious signs of washing and distressing, with irregular wear and rough edges along the edges. The front and cuffs of the jacket are patched with off-white and light pink plaid fabric, with clear plaid patterns. The material looks like tweed or blended fabric. The jacket's buttons are silver metallic with a smooth, reflective surface. The collar and cuffs have stitching details with neat lines. Underneath the jacket is a white knit sweater, with a faint texture visible and a fine ribbed structure. Her right hand gently tugs at the collar, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, painted with light pink nail polish. She wears a gold round earring, simple and delicate, smooth and reflecting light, while the other hand hangs naturally. Partially covered by a jacket, she wears dark blue jeans with the legs exposed below the frame. The pants fit the leg curves, with slight pleats and a faded finish on the pants. The overall outfit presents a casual and fashionable feel. The background is a pure white wall with no texture, even, soft lighting without obvious shadows, creating a clean and simple visual effect. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head positioned slightly above the frame, and the body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic balance Extending along the line of sight to the jacket's texture details, then transitioning downward to the joints of hand movements and the garment, light and shadow come from the left side of the front, with soft and even light sources and delicate shadows. The jacket surface has slight transitions between light and dark, highlighting the fabric's texture and layers. The overall atmosphere is fresh and natural, carrying a casual feeling of daily life and the refined feel of a fashion magazine shoot. The image is high-resolution, richly detailed, true-to-life, and warm and comfortable tones, presenting a relaxed and pleasant visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
