        {
          "id": "krea2-903d6ab6a0744f2b4b5f96b7",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways in the warm indoor light, creating a serene and poetic visual effect. Her expression is calm and gentle. She wears an off-white coarse knit sweater with clearly visible patterns, delicate twisted patterns on the cuffs, and the fabric feels thick and warm. She is gently holding a golden British Shorthair cat with both hands. Gently stroking the cat's head and neck, the gesture is full of love and care. The foreground is the interaction between the woman and the cat, with close-up shots focusing on intimate moments between the two. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with warm yellow walls and soft halos creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere. Natural light streams through blinds or grilled windows, forming parallel stripes of light and shadow. These lights not only illuminate the scene but also enhance the sense of layering and depth in the space, with light coming from the sides and rear, a typical backlight or side backlight shooting that gently outlines the character's outline. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light brown, creating a comfortable, healing, and lively home scene. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and soft out-of-focus blur, resembling a daily family photo taken with an old-fashioned camera. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject's emotional expression, with the composition leaning toward the center and right. Leaving space on the left side allows light and shadow to extend naturally, enhancing the balance and breathability of the painting. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and healing, filled with a sincere emotional connection between people and pets, as if time stands still at this moment, with only sunlight, warmth, and love flowing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
