        {
          "id": "krea2-bec8051755fac05050092bde",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装冷淡戏水",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue spaghetti-strap swimsuit. The top features a knit texture, and the bottom features lace-up details. Water droplets slide down her skin, reflecting the outline of her lower body, creating a visual effect of interplay of solid and void. In the foreground, tiny ripples and sparkling droplets appear on the water's surface; below the water, the curves of her body submerged can be seen. In the middle is her upper body and arms, slightly moist and glossy. Pearl earrings and rings on her fingers. The background is a deep blue blurred environment. On the right, a warm yellow light emits a soft halo, creating an atmosphere of contrast between warm and cool tones. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left. Reflections from the water surface and vertical flowing lines enhance the sense of depth in the image. Light and shadow come from a warm source in the upper right, creating a natural shadow transition. The overall lighting is soft and layered, with colors mainly blue, white, and warm yellow, presenting a fresh yet slightly sexy summer atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot by a professional camera, featuring high resolution and low noise, capturing the moment when underwater and above water spaces merge. The image is filled with tranquil beauty and intimate emotions, while preserving casual natural moments from daily life, presenting an artistic style that is both refined and full of life's atmosphere",
