        {
          "id": "krea2-a788c2a0f4d4254017ac2534",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉T恤床温柔坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with white sheets, with a hairpin pinned with pink sequin letters reading \"LOVE.\" Her right hand rests gently on her shoulder, while her left hand rests naturally on her leg. Her fingers are long, her nails painted with transparent glitter nails. She wears a pale pink lace camisole lingerie layered over a loose white knit cardigan, casually draped over it. The sleeves of the cardigan are pulled down to reveal her shoulders, and in front of her is a fluffy, soft white plush cushion with a delicate plush texture. It presents a warm and comfortable visual effect. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The composition uses a medium perspective, with a simple indoor environment in the background. Behind it is a light gray cement-textured wall with clear texture and a slightly rough feel. In the left background, you can see white kitchen cabinets and an old-fashioned white stove. The stove has two knobs and a control panel, creating a clean and neat overall layout. Light comes from the window on the right side of the image. Soft natural light is created, with light shining from the sides, creating rich layers of light and shadow and creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The color palette is mainly white and beige, accented with pale pink and brown. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere, as if capturing a daily moment of morning or afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The image presents a sense of everyday realism while retaining the refinement and beauty of artistic photography, featuring a slight film grain texture and slight motion blur edges, simulating amateur camera shooting, enhancing realism and intimacy. The image shows no obvious post-production traces, preserving original light and shadow details and textured materials. The overall composition is balanced, with the visual guide natural. Then, the movement follows body lines to the pillow and background elements, forming a smooth visual flow. The entire scene is filled with gentleness, laziness, and homely comfort, like a private album photo recording life moments, radiating youthful and innocent energy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
