        {
          "id": "krea2-25dd7f447a1eebc7e77fdec1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a pure white long dress stands with her back to the camera in the middle of a quiet Japanese residential street, head slightly lowered, hands naturally placed at her sides, as if gazing at the cherry blossoms scattered across the ground. Her figure is bathed in soft light, appearing especially peaceful and lonely. In the foreground is a vast expanse of blurry pink cherry blossom branches, petals gently swaying in the breeze, forming a hazy sea of flowers. Some petals are clearly visible, with slightly transparent edges, creating a strong sense of depth and a dreamy atmosphere. On both sides of the street are typical Japanese-style residential buildings, with red brick walls alternating with wooden structures, sloped roofs, and faintly visible clothes drying under the eaves. On the right side of the road, a row of orange traffic cones is lined up neatly along the sidewalk. Yellow metal railings stretch across the lower frame, separating the foreground from the middle view. The ground is covered with pink and white cherry blossom petals, forming a soft carpet. The road surface features a speed limit sign marked \"30\" and the Japanese word \"decorative characterまれ\" (stop), clearly visible, with the sky showing a pale blue hue. With a slight mist, the overall lighting is soft and even, like diffused light in the early morning or evening. Sunlight pours down from above but without strong shadows, creating a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure at the very center of the painting and the road extending into the distance, creating a strong sense of perspective that guides the gaze deep into the frame. The cherry blossom branches and architectural lines on both sides further enhance this sense of depth, with the visual focus concentrated on the figure. The blur treatment in the foreground makes the subject stand out even more The colors are mainly soft pink-white, light blue, and gray-green, accented with orange traffic cones and yellow guardrails, creating a subtle color contrast. The overall tone is cool with a slight teal tone, enhancing the image's ethereal and poetic beauty. The entire scene resembles a carefully shot film photograph, rich in Japanese aesthetic style, full of nostalgia and romance, as if capturing a fleeting spring moment, making one feel the passage of time and the brevity of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
