        {
          "id": "krea2-97f2ada57f0a497e5fb9e1c9",
          "alias": "单女绿制服室内害羞跪侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a dark green school uniform jacket with a white collared shirt underneath, tied a blue-green plaid bow tie, and a gold school badge on her left chest. The emblem was printed with the words \"TOUMIGAKU\" and a red pattern. She squatted in the bright indoor space, her expression gentle yet slightly shy, hands naturally resting on her knees, wearing white over-the-knee socks and platform white sneakers, legs slightly bent together, posture relaxed and natural. The background was a simple white wall and several large windows, outside which faintly visible green plants and pale purple flowers. The lighting is soft and even, shining from the front and sides, creating delicate shadow transitions. The overall image presents a fresh and clean Japanese campus atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, the body slightly leaning forward, and the head slightly tilted. The gaze communicates directly with the viewer, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The light and shadows are soft and layered, with subtle reflections on the ground, enhancing the spatial realism. The overall style combines a sense of everyday life with artistic beauty, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera. At the same time, it preserves the natural atmosphere of life, presenting a unique charm where youthful energy coexists with tranquil elegance",
