        {
          "id": "krea2-558e7a22e9735d6344f8ac06",
          "alias": "单女室内忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways in a warm indoor setting, wearing a light pink high-neck long-sleeve top made of soft and fitted material, showing delicate pleats and natural drape. Her hands are raised above her head, her posture relaxed and lazy, as if immersed in the tranquility of morning or dusk. The slight blush reveals a subtle melancholy and gentleness, adding a touch of casualness and authenticity. The background is a blurry warm yellow tone, with faint striped fabric textures—possibly a bed sheet or cushion—creating a cozy home atmosphere. The foreground occupies most of the space, with close-ups in composition. The middle ground is the extension of the person's body and arm, while the background is completely blurred, creating a strong depth of field effect. Light streams diagonally from the right side of the painting, creating soft backlighting and contour light, creating a golden halo at the edges of the figure. The light and shadow layers are rich, the transition between light and shadow is natural, and the overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture. A slight graininess and low-saturation colors enhance realism. The background blur is delicate, the composition leans toward a diagonal layout, and the body forms an S-shaped curve before turning to the distance, creating a smooth visual flow. The overall style combines the casualness of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if shooting with an old-fashioned camera at dusk, with slight light leakage and exposure shift, simulating the texture of real shooting, emphasizing the drama of light and shadow and emotional expression. The images are full of storytelling and privacy. It evokes a quiet and gentle moment, as if time has frozen in this moment, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
