        {
          "id": "krea2-ddad5a5339509d92934bdce7",
          "alias": "单女米长裤森林微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden railing in the forest, wearing a warm smile and exuding a natural and approachable aura. She wears an off-white long-sleeve lace-trimmed top with delicate ruffle designs on the cuffs, loose khaki wide-leg pants, and black shoes. The overall look is simple yet full of artistic flair. On her left shoulder is a canvas bag with a blue and white plaid pattern, with a white woven strap adding a touch of handmade touch and a sense of everyday life. Her body leans slightly forward, her right hand resting gently on the railing. Her left hand hangs naturally, her posture relaxed and elegant, as if taking a short break after strolling along a forest path. In the foreground is a dark brown wooden railing, slightly rough with natural grain and traces of time. The railing runs across the lower part of the frame, forming a stable visual baseline. In the middle is the woman's full-body figure, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, her body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. Her clothing and backpack details are clearly visible, with a background of dense green woods and layers of leaves. Layers of green tones are presented, with sunlight streaming through gaps in the canopy, creating mottled light and shadow effects on the leaves. Some areas feature soft halos and bokeh, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Distant trees gradually blur, creating a natural depth transition. The composition uses low-angle shots to make the figure stand out more, while also bringing the audience closer and enhancing immersion. Her gaze is directed directly at the viewer, attracting attention, while her hand movements guide the gaze toward the railing and the surrounding environment. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural light, with soft and even lighting without strong contrast between light and dark. The overall tone is warm with a slight retro filter effect, moderate color saturation, rich green tones that are not glaring, while yellow and beige tones are warm and comfortable, creating a peaceful, cozy, and slightly nostalgic summer afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, combining the casual feel of daily life with the refined beauty of artistic photography. The overall style resembles film photography or authentic records taken with everyday amateur equipment. Full of the atmosphere of life and cultural warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
