        {
          "id": "krea2-9f372a3538decaf093dade7e",
          "alias": "单女白短裙樱花坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the bow of a small blue boat, wearing a white long skirt and a loose white knit cardigan, slightly curled. She turns sideways and gazes into the distance, as if immersed in a spring dream of blooming cherry blossoms. Her hands gently fold on her knees, her posture elegant and serene. Her figure occupies the visual center of the frame, forming the foreground. The wooden deck of the boat shows a warm brownish-yellow hue, the blue hulls and oars glow softly in the sunlight, and the hull is slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The background is a winding river, its water crystal clear, reflecting the pink and white cherry blossom branches and the pale blue sky. On both sides of the riverbank are dense cherry trees, their branches drooping low and blooming like a brocade. The pink petals overlap like clouds, covering the entire river surface. In the distance, several small boats of the same color glide slowly, with people sitting or standing on board, enjoying the beautiful spring time. In the middle ground, you can see more cherry trees and lush green slopes, with mottled light and shadow and rich color layers. The composition adopts a low-angle downward view. Extending forward from the bow, the gaze is guided through layers of cherry blossom branches, creating a strong sense of depth and space. The visual guide line is formed by the lines of the hull, ripples in the water, and the direction of the branches. The light is soft and bright, with slanting sunlight from early morning or evening enveloping the entire scene in a warm golden halo. The sky appears a faint blue-blue, sharply contrasting with the pink and white of the cherry blossoms, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, blue, and green, with moderate saturation. With a slight film texture and vintage filter effect, it feels like a photo taken with an old-fashioned camera, with a natural realism like everyday leisure equipment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
