        {
          "id": "krea2-2d91482f5b3f09713245ebea",
          "alias": "单女米外套乡村忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera at a rural train station covered in thick snow. She wears a beige hooded wool jacket with a fluffy light brown plush at the collar, a plaid skirt below, brown knee-high boots, and clutches a red square gift box hidden in her sleeves. The box is tied with a white bow slightly curled, her posture serene and slightly expectant. Her body is slightly turned to the right, head slightly tilted, as if gazing at the distant approaching train. In the foreground, the edge of the snow-covered wooden platform canopy and a sturdy metal support column are covered with the marks of time. Snowpiles accumulate at the junction of beams and columns, forming thick snow piles. Some snow blocks appear semi-transparent, revealing the grain of the wooden structure below. A vintage round iron signal light hangs beneath the ceiling, with a cross-shaped hollowed-out lampshade covering the surface with a thin layer of snow, giving a cold industrial feel. The middle is where the girl stands, with trampled snow beneath her feet, leaving clear footprints and tire tracks The snow surface shows different layers of luster due to temperature changes. In the distance, a white old tram slowly approaches, decorated with orange-yellow stripes. The front of the car is fitted with a windshield and wipers. The windows reflect faint light, and the car body has Japanese markings that are blurry. The background is hillsides and forests completely covered by heavy snow, with branches bent by heavy snow, forming a pure white hazy world. The sky is grayish, clouds hang low, and the entire scene is enveloped in a cold and tranquil winter atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned on the right third of the frame, with the gaze directed to the train at the upper left, creating a narrative of waiting and anticipation. The foreground canopy structure forms a natural frame, drawing the viewer's gaze toward the main subject. At the same time, the use of depth of field blur creates a soft bokeh effect on the train and distant mountains, highlighting the focal point of the character and the gift. The lighting is diffused on a cloudy day, with a cool overall tone, mainly white and gray, accented by beige coats, red gift boxes, and orange-yellow carriage bodies as visual highlights, with soft and even light and shadow. Without strong shadows, the snow reflects faint light, creating a quiet, cool, and slightly melancholic winter atmosphere. The image has the grainy texture and slight overexposure effect of film photography, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. Color saturation is low, contrast is moderate, details are richly preserved, especially the snow's texture and clothing folds, presenting an overall lifelike, documentary artistic style, like a winter moment captured by chance, full of poetry and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
