        {
          "id": "krea2-7308f0c1b2aef5d59bc999d9",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣樱花俏皮站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a cherry blossom tree in the night, naturally draped over her shoulders, appearing gentle and lively, with soft contours and an overall fresh and refined temperament. She wears a light blue knitted cardigan layered with a white top. The knit texture is clearly visible, with delicate lines and a warm texture. The cardigan is slightly open, revealing the neck and collarbone, adding a touch of lazy and casual beauty. She stands slightly to the right of the center of the frame, her body slightly tilted, her posture naturally relaxed, one hand gently placed at her side. The other hand seems to be gently touching a cherry blossom branch beside him, moving gracefully and subtly. In the foreground is a blooming white cherry blossom, with layers of petals and slightly yellow stamens. The branches crisscross, some flowers close to the frame, creating a slight blur effect and a strong sense of depth. The middle ground features a female subject, her expression calm yet tinged with thought. The background is a deep black night sky with almost no stray light, making the subject and cherry blossoms stand out even more. The composition uses a classic center composition, with the figure centered and surrounded on both sides by cherry blossoms. It creates a visual balance of symmetry and asymmetry, while using blurred foreground and dark background tones to enhance the sense of depth in the composition. Light comes from the upper side, simulating artificial nighttime light sources—possibly streetlights or flashes—creating subtle contrasts of light and shadow. The lighting atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, tinged with a touch of loneliness and poetry. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones, dominated by blue and white. The black background further reinforces this calm and pure feeling. There is no unnecessary decoration in the painting, only a quiet dialogue between people and flowers. It conveys a poetic sense of solitude on a spring night and the hazy beauty of youth. The shooting style resembles everyday amateur equipment such as phones or portable cameras, with slight noise and realistic light and shadow transitions. Without pursuing excessive sharpness or perfection, it preserves the authentic texture of life, as if capturing a fleeting moment that slips away unnoticed. It allows people to feel the gentleness of time and the brevity of life. The entire scene is full of artistic flair and emotional tension, combining realistic details with abstract artistic conception, making it a visual poem that combines reality and dreaminess",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
