        {
          "id": "krea2-215bd6c5665910620deaa0a9",
          "alias": "单女白袜子健身房沉思坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black training bench in the gym, leaning slightly forward, holding a smartphone with a pink bow case in her right hand for a selfie. She wears a white off-shoulder long-sleeve top with a slightly low neckline, revealing her collarbones and shoulder lines. She pairs it with high-waisted pink tight sweatpants that fit her body and accentuate her curves. On her feet, she wears white over-the-knee socks with vertical stripes, giving a clean and sharp look. The overall look uses a pink-and-white color scheme, creating a visual effect that combines sweetness and strength. In the foreground, her hand and phone occupy the center right of the frame. The pink bow decoration on the phone case is clearly visible, and she wears a pink bead bracelet on her wrist, adding a touch of atmosphere. In the middle is the black fitness bench she sits, smooth and reflective. Next to it is a silver metal barbell bar spanning the frame. Behind the bar is a black multifunctional training machine with dumbbell plates hanging from it. One piece is marked with the number \"70,\" with clear details. The background features a wide floor-to-ceiling window, and outside the window is a modern cityscape filled with skyscrapers. The glass reflects indoor light, creating a blend of solid and void light effects. The window frames are white, echoing the minimalist interior style. The floor is made of dark gray non-slip rubber mats with fine grains, with some local wear marks to enhance realism. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered, with balanced blank space up, down, left, and right. The view is slightly upward, highlighting the main body while also showcasing the gym space. Visual guidance starts from the foreground hands and phones, naturally extends to the entire figure, then transitions to equipment and the view outside the window. This creates a sense of layering from near to far, with light and shadow from outside natural light softly and evenly onto the figure, enhancing the sense of depth. Indoor lighting assists the illumination, making the overall brightness moderate and the atmosphere bright and fresh, with a touch of casual everyday life. It feels like an ordinary fitness record, with images that feel like real photography. The camera parameters simulate the effects of a regular smartphone camera, with slight noise and slightly lower color saturation, preserving a sense of everyday life. The overall image blends modern urban life, fitness culture, and personal aesthetic expression. It presents a visual experience that is both everyday and artistic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
