        {
          "id": "krea2-2d2e540eb43e076b47f47507",
          "alias": "单女白西装椅上沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor metal mesh bench, naturally resting on her shoulders, gazing at the coffee cup in her hand. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, her overall demeanor gentle and elegant. She wears an off-white textured suit jacket with a black turtleneck knit sweater underneath, a black high-waisted pleated long skirt, and off-white ankle boots. Her legs are crossed, right leg in front and left leg behind. Her right hand holds a coffee with a green label on the takeaway, while her left hand gently rests on the cup, her posture relaxed and natural. On the bench to her left rests a bouquet of golden chrysanthemums with full petals. The colors are vivid, contrasting with the scattered withered yellow leaves. The ground is covered with layers of autumn leaves, including ginkgo and maple leaves, with colors ranging from light yellow to deep brown. Some leaves are illuminated by sunlight, giving a semi-transparent texture. The background is a blurry corner of a park or campus, with faint outlines of tree trunks and buildings visible. Light comes from the sides and rear, creating a distinct backlight effect. Sunlight penetrates the air, creating delicate halos and spots, creating a warm and soft golden atmosphere. The entire composition uses a medium shot. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a bench running horizontally across the frame, forming a stable visual structure. The foreground features scattered leaves and parts of the bench, while the middle is the main subject and bouquet. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, and visual guidance is drawn from the person's downward posture and gaze to the coffee cup in their hand, then extending to the bouquet nearby. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the contrast of light and shadow is strong, warm tones dominate, and orange-yellow harmonizes with off-white and black. The overall style is realistic and natural, with a touch of life and artistry. It feels like everyday moments shot with a professional camera, with moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, clear details, authentic texture, and a quiet and cozy atmosphere—like a lazy autumn afternoon, full of poetry and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
