        {
          "id": "krea2-0619309bfeacd2ade872e2b7",
          "alias": "单女女仆装家中困倦站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic Rococo-style maid outfit stands in the center of a modern minimalist kitchen, wearing thin-rimmed glasses and gently lifting the front of her skirt with both hands, as if organizing or showcasing clothing details. A white lace lace apron paired with a black pleated maxi skirt, with ruffled embellishments on the chest and pleated cuffs designed exquisitely and vintagely. The high-waisted design highlights a slender waistline, with delicate white lace trim along the skirt edge. The black-and-white color contrast is strong yet harmonious, white over-the-knee socks wrap her long legs, and she is paired with black patent leather Mary Jane shoes. The upper features a silver buckle, perfectly recreating the classic image of a Japanese maid. She is positioned slightly to the right in the frame, her body slightly angled to the camera, her head slightly tilted, creating a natural visual direction. The foreground features an extension of the light wood floor, the left side shows a partial outline of a white cabinet, and the right side features a natural wood open shelf with transparent glass cups, blue wine bottles, red canned drinks, and a pink vase holding dried orange-yellow flowers. In the background is a large window with a semi-transparent white sheer curtain. Soft and even light pours into the room from outside the window, creating a bright and transparent atmosphere. The ceiling is fitted with two black track spotlights and a surveillance camera. The walls are pure white, making the space clean and tidy. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figures appear more upright and elegant. The camera focuses on the subject, with a slightly blurred background highlighting details. The light and shadows come from natural light outside the window, shining from the upper left, creating soft shadow transitions. The folds of the clothing show delicate light and shadow variations, and the overall color palette is black and white Beige is the main color, accented with blue, red, orange, and other colors. The image is filled with the warmth of everyday life and the artistic atmosphere of role-playing. It has a slight film grain texture and slight motion blur, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting, presenting a realistic yet dreamy everyday scene, like a moment frozen in a Japanese photo album. It retains the dramatic cosplay while blending in the warmth and authenticity of a home environment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly playful, as if a family service session has just ended. Preparing to embrace a new normal.",
