        {
          "id": "krea2-cf0d6948ec48dbda4d50557b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩沉思站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the seaside, wearing a white spaghetti strap dress and a cream-colored woven straw hat. The edge of the hat is wavy, with a wide, slightly drooping brim. In her right hand, she holds a vintage film camera. The camera body has a silver metallic texture, the lens protrudes, and a black leather strap hangs down at her side. Her fingers gently grip the camera body, her posture natural relaxed, her expression gentle yet slightly contemplative. Overall, her posture presents a leisurely traveler's state. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly raised. This forms a visual focal point: the foreground is the main subject, clear and prominent, while the background is a vast blue sky and a distant blurred sea and beach. The sky occupies the upper half of the frame, presenting a pure, gradient blue, transitioning from deep blue to light blue from top to bottom. The sea surface forms a white waterline at the horizon, clear and transparent, shimmering with waves, but details are blurred, creating a sense of spatial depth. The middle ground depicts the lower body and surrounding environment, with clear body contours, natural clothing folds, soft light and shadow, and a low-angle downward shot in composition. This makes the figure appear tall and upright, while also stretching the sky's proportions to enhance the sense of openness. The composition leaves a lot of blank space, with large areas on the left and above to highlight the subject, then turns to the distance to form a circular visual path. The lighting is bright daytime natural light, with sunlight shining from the upper right creating soft shadows. The shadows beneath the straw hat form natural shadows, and the contrast between light and shadow in the folds of the clothing is clear. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, the atmosphere is peaceful, fresh, and warm, full of summer vacation vibes. The color tones are mainly blue and white, harmoniously unified. The image has a film shooting texture, fine grain, moderate color saturation, and a slight overexposure effect, simulating the style of real camera shooting. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance the retro feel. The background is naturally blurred, and the large-aperture lens is used for shooting effect. The depth of field is shallow, the subject is clear, the background is blurred, and the subject is emphasized. The overall image is like shooting with everyday amateur equipment, authentic and natural, full of life atmosphere, rich in detail, distinct layers, balanced composition, and visually comfortable, conveying a tranquil, free, and beautiful emotional experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
