        {
          "id": "krea2-f47b9a85f4f569739dd75d7d",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫小径困倦躺",
          "prompt": "On a rainy night, a girl dressed in a white short-sleeved shirt and a black pleated skirt lies on a damp asphalt road. Beneath her lies a deep blue electric guitar decorated with white spots. The guitar body reflects a faint light, the neck stretches diagonally toward the lower left of the frame, the head facing the upper right, forming a diagonal composition with the girl's body. The earphone cable hangs naturally, her expression calm yet slightly tired, as if asleep in the rain. The transparent umbrella was half-open, with the ribs clearly visible. The umbrella surface was slightly tilted, partially covering the girl's body. The handle pointed toward the upper left corner of the frame, and raindrops continuously dripped from the edge, creating ripples on the ground. The puddles reflected the blurred sky and surrounding environment, with delicate ripples presenting a dynamic visual effect. The background was a blurry city street, and the warm yellow glow of distant streetlights could be faintly seen. The light filtered through the rain curtain, becoming soft and diffuse, creating a hazy atmosphere. The overall tone leaned toward a cool tone, using gray-blue, deep black is the main theme, accented with white clothing and headphones for a strong visual contrast. Light and shadow come from distant streetlights and diffused light from the sky, soft but not glaring, creating local highlights that highlight the subject and use shadows to enhance three-dimensionality. The shot is taken at a low angle, close to the ground, making viewers feel as if they are in the rain, feeling the coldness and oppressive emotions. In composition, the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying about one-third of the space, with more blank space on the left, creating an asymmetrical sense of balance. The electric guitar serves as a visual guiding element, extending from the lower left corner to the center, attracting attention before turning toward the girl, forming a smooth visual path. The trails of raindrops and ripples in the water add dynamism to the image, while also intensifying the dampness and lonely atmosphere of rainy days. The entire scene is filled with a youthful sadness and serene poetry, like a freeze-frame shot in a movie, capturing the fragility and stubbornness of a moment of disappointment. The texture of the image is close to film photography, with slight graininess and a retro style with low color saturation. It feels like a real moment accidentally captured on a rainy night with an old-fashioned camera, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
