        {
          "id": "krea2-f0804b73a785c5bb2cbd5447",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚神秘坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dark brown leather armchair, wearing a black sleeveless dress paired with uniquely designed black stockings. The stockings display a translucent texture pattern resembling bone structure on her thighs and calves, creating a surreal visual effect. She wears black high-heeled sandals with woven textures on the upper and fine ribbon decorations around the ankle, giving the whole look a fashionable and artistic feel. The background is heavy deep red velvet curtains, delicate in texture and rich in folds, creating a strong color contrast with the foreground. The chair is covered with a fluffy white long plush cushion. The soft white plush contrasts sharply with the dark leather and red background, adding warmth and comfort. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the body slightly turned to the right, legs crossed—one bent and the other extended—forming a stable triangular composition. Light comes from the front to the left, soft and even. At the same time, subtle light and shadow changes are created on the semi-transparent pattern of the stockings. The red curtains in the background create rich layers under the lighting, with a gradient from deep red to dark red adding depth to the image. A corner of the carpet with traditional patterns can be faintly seen on the floor, adding a touch of vintage atmosphere to the scene. The overall color palette is dominated by black, white, and red, with high color saturation and strong contrast, creating an atmosphere that is both modern and classical. The image clearly features studio shooting characteristics, but through detailed processing and authentic materials, It presents a texture similar to everyday amateur equipment shooting. The camera uses a medium lens with a moderate focal length and well-controlled depth of field, making the subject clear and prominent. The background is moderately blurred, enhancing the spatial and three-dimensional feel of the image. The overall composition is balanced, visual guidance is clear, light and shadow are delicate, and the atmosphere is mysterious and elegant, resembling a carefully conceived artistic portrait",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
