        {
          "id": "krea2-2e3d4f3edb44d717be8c30f8",
          "alias": "单女竹林冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant white ancient-style clothing wore a finely woven bamboo bamboo bamboo bamboo hat. She stood quietly among a lush patch of lush plants, with blurred green leaves in the foreground of various shapes, veins clearly visible, some oval with slightly curled edges, creating a natural blurred effect. As if glimpsing her figure through the gaps in the leaves, the center features a woman as the main subject, dignified and slightly tilted up, making the overall silhouette softer and more hazy. The composition uses close-ups, emphasizing the sacredness and distance of the figure through low-angle shots. Visual guidance uses leaves in the foreground as natural frames, naturally directing the gaze toward the central figure. At the same time, shallow depth of field is used to highlight the subject and enhance layering. The light is softly scattered, coming from the upper left, simulating natural morning or evening light, while the shadowed areas appear deep and not abrupt. The overall color scheme is mainly cool white and gray-green, accented with red floral ornaments. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of Eastern aesthetic conception. The texture of the image is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and a retro style with low color saturation. It feels as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slightly dark corners, rich details, and clear layers, exuding a strong artistic atmosphere and poetic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
