        {
          "id": "krea2-de3adc4cf781eaf3911493bd",
          "alias": "单女束缚白内衣床害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with white sheets, her expression slightly shy and calm, presenting a quiet and reserved aura. Her body lines are smooth and graceful. She wears a white lace-trimmed bra on top, with thin straps and delicate lace trim outlining her chest. She pairs it with matching lace underwear on the bottom, with thin straps at the waist and thighs. She wears white fishnet stockings with cuffs reaching the top of her thighs, and the surface of the socks features a regular diamond-patterned pattern, giving a light and see-through feel. Her hands are folded over her chest, her wrists gently tied by a white ribbon, the ends naturally hanging down to form a soft bow. The hand posture appears both reserved and somewhat ceremonial. The background is a simple light gray wall, flat and unadorned. Light streams evenly from the left side of the frame, creating a soft, diffused glow that makes the entire scene bright but not glaring. The light and shadow create delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figures' bodies, highlighting the texture of the skin and the layers of the clothing. The bedsheet surface has slight wrinkles. This enhances the realism and sense of everyday life in the image. The overall atmosphere is fresh, pure, with a hint of ambiguity and privacy. The tones are mainly white and light gray, with low color saturation, emphasizing the realistic texture under cool lighting. The image has the texture of everyday amateur camera photography. Subtle noise and natural exposure control give the images a more realistic and everyday feel. The details are rich but not over-embellished, highlighting the natural beauty of the subjects and the authenticity of the scene. The photography style leans toward a blend of realism and Japanese aesthetics, focusing on soft light and shadow and the conveyance of characters' emotions. The camera captures a quiet and intimate moment, as if recording a moment of solitude in the early morning or afternoon. The overall image is clean, pure, and full of storytelling, like an unfiltered snapshot of everyday life. It gives a gentle and genuine sense of intimacy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
