        {
          "id": "krea2-8a3e315bf6815e3a25390ba8",
          "alias": "单女白制服公园忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A girl dressed in a white school uniform jacket and plaid skirt sits on a park swing, wearing white long socks and black leather shoes, carrying a backpack, gently grasping the swing's rope with both hands, as if lost in thought or reminiscing about something. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, legs together, toes lightly touching the ground. The red bow tie of the school uniform jacket stands out against the green background. On the other swing nearby sits an off-white teddy bear plush doll, sitting quietly, its fluffy texture clearly visible. It looks both cute and somewhat lonely. In the foreground is a sunlit grassy field with dense leaves, some areas shaded, creating a contrast between light and dark. An orange-red metal railing stretches across the lower part of the frame, adding visual layering. In the middle are two swings, a girl, and a teddy bear. The metal structure of the swings is gray, with clear details at chains and connections. The background is dense green vines, layered over barbed wire, forming a natural green wall. The leaves vary in size and shape, Some leaf edges are slightly curled, others smooth surfaces. Light and shadow filtered through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light spots to create a soft, scattered effect. The sky is blocked by dense canopies, leaving only a faint glimmer of daylight. The overall tone is cool, mainly dark green and gray-green, accented with white school uniforms and orange-red railings. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the girl and teddy bear positioned on either side of the canvas to create visual balance. The text \"MY FRIEND AND ME\" is elegantly handwritten AND centered. The font is smooth and graceful, with small text below reading \"LOOKING THROUGH THE BOX OF MEMORIES.\" All these elements together create a scene full OF nostalgia. The light comes from the upper left, simulating an afternoon sunset. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting tiny light spots on the ground and the figures. The light and shadow are soft and layered, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic, like a photo taken with an old film camera, with slight graininess and color fading. The camera has a moderate focal length and a shallow depth of field, focusing on the girl and the teddy bear. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the subject. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance the retro feel. The color saturation is low, presenting a cinematic color grading style, similar to the aesthetics of Japanese art films. Overall, it feels like a private memory captured in a city corner on a summer afternoon—strong realism, delicate emotion, and strong narrative quality. You can almost hear the rustling of leaves and the distant murmurs of the market. The entire scene exudes the melancholy of youth and a tender recollection of past friendships",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
