        {
          "id": "krea2-695c96692187abe5eba6f359",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙樱花困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a cherry blossom tree, wearing a light beige long-sleeved dress with a thin black belt at her waist. She tilts her head slightly back, holding a vintage-style film camera in both hands, focusing intently on photographing the cherry blossom branches above. Her expression is gentle and immersive, as if capturing the most beautiful moment of spring. In the background is a dark metal railing forming a clear horizontal divider that divides the scene into upper and lower parts. The middle ground shows the woman and nearby cherry blossom branches, dense with pink and white petals, their petals glowing softly in the sunlight The branches intertwine to form a natural mesh structure. The background is hazy distant hills and trees, shrouded in a faint pink cherry blossom mist, creating a blurred layered effect. The sky is a bright pale blue, with sunlight streaming from above the frame, creating a backlit effect. Light passes through the branches, casting soft contour light on the figures. The overall color scheme is mainly pink, white, and light beige, creating a warm and dreamy spring atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the interaction between the figure and the cherry blossoms. Visually, the visual guide extends upward from the lower railing to the woman and the flower branches above her head, forming an upward dynamic trend. Light and shadow are distributed naturally, and backlighting gives the petal edges golden edges, making the details clear. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation and a slight graininess and fading effect, as if it were a daily record from an old film camera. It presents a lifelike, authentic, and poetic beauty. The distant mountains and architectural outlines in the background are blurred, enhancing the spatial depth of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, filled with cherishing and nostalgia for beautiful times",
