        {
          "id": "krea2-257a75393a0df0640a97ce6e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a sunflower field, wearing a white pleated puff-sleeve dress, with a pale yellow thin-striped canvas bag slung over her shoulder, and a blue pleated long-sleeved shirt underneath. She wears a radiant smile, showing her neat, white teeth. She stands slightly to the side, gently holding a tall sunflower in her right hand. The flowers are large, with golden, plump petals that spread outward in layers. At the center is a dark brown flower head, covered with fine seeds. The green leaves are broad and thick, veins are clearly visible, and the stems are thick and sturdy. It feels as if you are nestled closely with the flowers. The background is a vast sea of sunflowers, with countless sunflowers blooming in the sunlight, rising and falling to form a golden ocean. The distant sky is clear and cloudless, with bright sunshine. Light shines from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with warm-toned sunlight shining on petals, leaves, and figures, presenting a warm and bright texture. The composition uses close-up shots, with the main figure occupying about two-thirds of the left side, and the sunflowers in the foreground on the right. This creates visual balance, with background blur treatment highlighting the subject. Using shallow depth of field shooting techniques, it creates a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color saturation of the image is moderate, with golden yellow and blue as the main tones, accented with white and green. The color combination is harmonious and unified, creating a strong visual impact. The composition is full of tension, and the figures' postures are natural and relaxed, full of youthful vitality. It conveys a positive feeling of innocence, happiness, and a love of life. The image has a slight film graininess and soft bokeh light spots. It simulates the realistic texture of everyday handheld camera shooting, with natural and authentic lighting without excessive embellishment, presenting a lifelike beauty. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, allowing people to feel the tranquility and beauty of a summer afternoon, like a pastoral painting, full of vitality and hope",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
