        {
          "id": "krea2-62029656d61f8797de5232e9",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the top of an outdoor metal slide, wearing a loose white short-sleeve T-shirt and beige striped shorts, black and white striped socks and white sneakers, wearing a gentle smile. Her left hand is raised above her head into a fist, while her right hand gently strokes the back of her head. Her posture is relaxed and full of energy, radiating youthful energy and confidence. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the image, occupying the visual center. In the foreground are a smooth metal slide slope and silver stainless steel railings, with clean and flowing lines reflecting soft sunlight. This creates a delicate metallic texture and dynamic light and shadow effects. The middle ground features dense green trees with lush branches and leaves, which display rich light and shadow layers under sunlight. Some leaves are outlined by backlighting to create bright contours. The background is a modern high-rise residential building, with light gray exterior walls and neatly arranged windows. The architectural structure is clearly visible, but due to the slightly blurred depth effect, it creates a sense of spatial depth. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered and a slanted slide guiding the viewer's line upward to the figures. The horizontal railing parallel to the ground stabilizes the image, presenting a strong visual balance. The viewing angle is slightly upward, enhancing the character's uprightness and presence. Light comes from the upper left, representing warm natural daylight. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows, creating soft scattered light and local highlights. The shadows transition naturally, with bright light spots reflected on the slide surface and slight reflections on the background building facades. The overall atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of the life of a summer afternoon. The color tones are mainly white, beige, green, and gray, with moderate color saturation. While preserving realism, it also carries a slight film texture. The image details are rich, from clothing folds to metallic textures to leaf veins, all clearly visible, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment. It feels like a simple yet touching moment casually captured with a camera. The image style combines documentary and artistic beauty, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and free urban lifestyle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
