        {
          "id": "krea2-53ec402a1275c351e1273437",
          "alias": "单女制服摄影棚戏谑注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a typical Japanese sailor uniform: a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a dark gray pleated skirt, a pink bow tied at the collar, and two fine stripes on the shoulders. Her hands naturally rest on either side of her knees, fingers are long and slender, wearing black stockings, with part of the ankle cuff visible. On the left side of the painting, a hand dressed in dark clothing is gently stroking the top of her head, gentle yet intimate, seemingly soothing or teasing her. On the right edge, another person's legs are seen wearing gray-brown pants and blue-red-white striped socks, hinting that others are present in the scene, creating a private and cozy interactive atmosphere. The floor is a traditional tatami mat with a beige woven pattern clearly visible, and the green fabric edges are neatly arranged. Geometric patterns are formed, with faint outlines of wooden furniture and a painting hanging on the wall in the background. The frame is orange, and the interior features abstract patterns in light green tones, adding a touch of artistic flair. The overall lighting is soft and warm, coming from natural indoor light sources or warm-toned lighting. The shadows are delicate and not abrupt, and the light and shadow shine slightly to the left from above, highlighting the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, a faint shadow is cast on the tatami mat, enhancing the sense of realism in the space. The composition uses a center-offset layout, with the main figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze is directly at the camera, creating a strong visual guide that attracts the audience's attention. The high-angle shots enhance the intimacy and sense of control from above. The details of the figures in the foreground are clear and sharp, the background gradually blurs, the depth of field is shallow, and the subject is highlighted. The colors are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and gray-black, accented with pink and green, harmoniously unified. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a hint of intimacy with everyday life, as if capturing the moment of gentle interaction among friends as the afternoon sunlight pours into the room. It features studio-level delicate texture and a lifelike documentary aesthetic, like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture, presenting rich layers and natural transitions of light and shadow. The visuals are delicate and refined, full of storytelling and emotional tension, like a quiet moment in a youth film, evoking a sense of pure tenderness and companionship.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
