        {
          "id": "krea2-0f68bf716403fe160c17e391",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣室内微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor gray striped carpet, wearing a bright red chunky knit sweater dress. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, featuring a classic twisted pattern with cinched cuffs and hems, highlighting a slim silhouette. She kneels with legs together, knees slightly bent, black stockings wrapping her long legs, toes lightly touching the ground, posture elegant and natural. She wears a gentle, sweet smile and looks directly at the camera. Her left hand is raised in front of her chest in a heart-shaped gesture. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, her right hand naturally resting on her thigh, wearing a gold ring set with red gemstones on her ring finger. Around her neck is a delicate gold necklace. The pendant is a small star or flower shape, with vivid colors and a strong contrast between red and black. The background is a simple white wall with vertical seams, soft and even lighting. From the left front position, it illuminates the main figure, with subtle and natural shadows. Simulating the light and shadow transitions and detail preservation of real camera shots, presenting a simple yet authentic aesthetic",
