        {
          "id": "krea2-e1db23a69ed090cb382e24ed",
          "alias": "单女森林害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a sun-dappled forest, slightly tilting her head toward the camera. Her expression is gentle yet slightly shy, fingers naturally bent, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a bright red long-sleeved top with black patchwork on the cuffs and shoulders. The fabric looks soft and fitted, presenting natural folds and light changes. Under soft light, it appears especially clear. The background features blurred green leaves and bokeh spots, with sunlight streaming through the gaps to form warm golden halos and dreamy circular light spots, creating a peaceful and romantic atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to display text information, emphasizing emotional expression and detail texture. Light comes from above, creating a soft transition between light and dark, while shadows naturally blend into the background. The colors are warm orange-red and fresh green, creating a striking yet harmonious unity. The image has a strong Japanese magazine style, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture, presenting a shallow depth of field effect and delicate out-of-focus blur. At the same time, there is a slight grainy film texture and natural exposure, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, warm, and full of youthful energy, like a moment captured in a park on a summer afternoon, evoking pure beauty and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
