        {
          "id": "krea2-bad3282a13bc843ea743486c",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣街道专注坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways at the edge of an old stone arcade, wearing a loose beige knit sweater with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists. On her wrist is a simple black smartwatch, paired with slim dark blue jeans that show smooth and natural leg lines. She is focused on holding a retro-style black film camera, her hands steadily gripping the body, the camera pointed forward, seemingly capturing a moment. She carries a brown-yellow canvas backpack on her left shoulder, the strap crossing over her chest. The body of the bag is partially hidden by her body, revealing only a corner. The background is a weathered stone wall and a towering stone arch structure. The walls are covered with traces of time, with clear moss and weathered textures. The archway curves upward, creating a sense of depth and space. Light streams through the distant opening of the arch, forming a bright band that illuminates parts of the walls and floor, casting soft, warm shadows onto the figures. The overall composition presents a low-saturation vintage tone, with a warm yellow tone. It has a slight grainy texture and vignette effect, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned about one-third on the left side of the frame, with the line of sight facing the right front, creating a visual guide that emphasizes the theme of observation and recording. The foreground features rough stone railings with obvious wear and weathering on the surface; the middle ground features the main figure and the stone platform she sits on; the background features layered stone arches, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. Light enters from behind and sides. This creates a combination of backlight and side lighting, making the character's outline slightly glowing to enhance three-dimensionality. Shadows are soft and transitions naturally, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and nostalgic, full of artistic vibe and the ritualistic feel of photography. It feels like a quiet creative moment in an ancient building on an afternoon. The image has a strong film-like texture and everyday aesthetics, rich in details and sincere emotion. It feels as if you can hear the soft sound of the shutter and feel the slow flow of time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
