        {
          "id": "krea2-70b6b9de6ac2cbcdc4bbab69",
          "alias": "单女浴袍竹林神秘站立持械",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently grips an ancient bronze sword hilt, the blade hidden within a wide sleeve, as if ready to be drawn at any moment. The Hanfu is made of light and flowing material, with a sheer outer robe embroidered with faint white calligraphy patterns. The lines are smooth and rhythmic, and the hem flutters gently in the breeze, revealing the softness and liveliness of the garment. The woman wears plain white cloth shoes, their upper embroidered with simple embroidery. Complementing the overall style, the main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the body slightly turned to form a natural S-shaped curve, creating an elegant dynamic beauty. In the foreground is a dirt path covered with dead leaves and fine bamboo branches. The ground is dappled with light and shadow, sunlight streaming through the gaps in the bamboo leaves, creating interwoven light and shadow spots that illuminate parts of the ground and the skirts of the figures, creating a strong visual contrast. In the middle is densely arranged bamboo poles, with bamboo joints clearly visible, colors gradient from light gray to deep green, rich in layers, and the bamboo forest extending into the distance. This creates a sense of depth, with a blurred bamboo shadow and gap between the sky and a faint glimmer of blue sky. Light streams in from above, creating a soft backlight effect that creates a faint halo at the edges of the figure's outline, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall view uses a low-angle downward angle to highlight the figure's upright posture and presence. The composition is simple yet full of tension. The visual guide line is formed by ground light and shadow, bamboo pole arrangement, and character postures. The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil and mysterious, carrying the poetic mood of classical martial arts. The color palette is mainly cool green and gray-brown. Complemented by warm yellow sunlight, it creates a tranquil moment in the early morning or dusk. The image texture is delicate and authentic, like using a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, capturing the most authentic details and emotions under natural light. It carries a strong Eastern aesthetic charm while also retaining the realistic texture of modern photography, resembling a realistic image from ancient heroine legends, full of storytelling and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
