        {
          "id": "krea2-b0a8f22e80c17f863f091f8f",
          "alias": "单女紫衬衫窗边俏皮持械",
          "prompt": "The sandwich is made of two whole wheat slices sandwiched between pink ham and green lettuce. She holds the sandwich in her right hand and a sheet of sheet music filled with staff notation in her left. The sheet tilts slightly, revealing the notes clearly visible, as if she's just stepped out of music practice. She wears a light purple cotton-linen shirt with a slightly open collar and a white T-shirt underneath, featuring simple black stripes. The overall style is fresh and artistic. The background is a light beige wall, with a softly colored abstract painting hanging on it. The main colors are blue, green, and red, depicting shapes resembling plants or flowers. The frame is simple, and nearby are several hand-drawn white icons, including pencils, hearts, stars, and dashed trails. These elements float lightly in the air, adding a touch of childlike playfulness and fantasy to the image. The composition is vertical, with the figure positioned slightly to the left in the lower half of the frame. A large amount of blank space above creates a balanced visual structure, creating a strong sense of interaction. Light comes from the left side of the frame, warm natural light, creating delicate shadow transitions that evoke the feeling of morning or afternoon sunlight streaming through the window indoors. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not abrupt, and the overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of life energy. It carries the clean, pure, and healing feeling unique to Japanese photography, with a texture close to that of medium format film cameras. The slight graininess and soft out-of-focus effects enhance realism and artistry. The color palette is dominated by low-saturation cream tones, complemented by light purple, light blue, and warm yellow tones. The color combination is harmonious and unified, presenting a quiet and beautiful everyday moment, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious moment that lets people feel the gentleness and poetry of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
