          "id": "krea2-0330e40ea623dc3d63a23f7d",
          "alias": "单女白短裙街道沉思行走持包",
          "prompt": "A woman walking through a city street, wearing a black short-sleeved top and an off-white high-waisted midi skirt. The hem of the skirt gently lifts with each step, presenting a natural dynamic pleat and flowing feel. She wears a pair of bright blue stiletto heels, the smooth and glossy uppers, forming a striking contrast with the overall soft color scheme. In her right hand, she carries a light gray handbag, with a simple and modern shape and delicate material. On her wrist, she wears a gold fine chain bracelet, and on her earlobes are small pearl studs. Her posture is elegant, her body slightly turned to the left side of the frame, head lowered, expression focused and calm, as if contemplating or contemplating the path beneath her feet. Her figure is illuminated by sunlight, which shines from the upper right, casting clear and soft shadows on the ground. The wall is made of light gray concrete and yellow brick walls, with obvious cracks and signs of age, adding a rough texture. In the background, some architectural structures and street details can be seen. The overall composition adopts a diagonal perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame. The space on the right side is reserved to showcase the extension of the environment. The camera captures the dynamic beauty of the characters' movements, focusing on the entire body. The background is slightly blurred, emphasizing the main silhouette and clothing details. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, with bright but not harsh sunlight, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The colors are harmonious and unified, with black, white, and gray as the main tones, accented by blue and brown tones, emphasizing movement trajectories and rhythm. The overall style combines fashion and a sense of life, reminiscent of real street scenes shot with a daily portable camera. Strong realism, rich in detail, full of the poetic and composure of urban life",
