        {
          "id": "krea2-93d98422b82420f44f577e67",
          "alias": "单女白短裙城市自信站立吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a modern-style bar called \"SUGE BAR,\" wearing a dark blue tight strapless top and a white mini skirt, paired with over-the-knee white knee-high socks and white pointed high heels adorned with cross patterns. Her makeup is exquisite, her posture elegant and confident, lightly holding a cigarette in her right hand and a minimalist bracelet in her left. The overall look is full of fashion and urban flair. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, occupying the visual center. In the foreground are gray concrete steps and the floor, with fine wear marks and mottled stains on the surface The edges of the steps are somewhat rough. On the right side, scattered on the ground are a black phone and a pair of flats with blue and white stripes. In the middle is the bar's facade, with white lines hand-painted on the glass windows of wine glasses, bottles, bread, and other patterns. Inside the window, you can see wine racks and green bottles. On the left stands a small sign labeled \"SUGE BAR.\" The door frame is made of metal that reflects the surrounding environment. Above is a unique concrete eave, featuring irregular drip-like patterns and a rugged feel. The background features the building's exterior walls and leafy greenery. Above, lush branches and leaves partially block the roof, creating an atmosphere where nature and city blend harmoniously. The composition uses standard portrait proportions, with the entire figure in the frame, standing slightly sideways with the body's center of gravity shifting to one side to create dynamic balance. Attention is drawn through details of clothing and accessories. Light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall color palette is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with blue and green. The color contrasts are sharp yet harmonious, creating an atmosphere that combines the coldness of a modern city with the casual vibe of street life. The image texture is similar to everyday amateur camera shooting, with slight graininess and realistic light and shadow, as if capturing an ordinary yet distinctive moment. The scene is authentic and believable, rich in detail, full of life atmosphere, stable composition, clear layering, prominent subject, and well-distributed background elements, presenting a visual effect that is both fashionable and down-to-earth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
