        {
          "id": "krea2-ddf5affbdc086cf100f66b2d",
          "alias": "单女微笑站立比耶",
          "prompt": "On a clear summer afternoon, sunlight bathed the entire football field, the sky appeared a pure and deep blue, and a few fluffy white clouds drifted leisurely, as if gently pushed forward by the breeze, adding vibrancy and poetry to this open green field. The main figure was a woman standing in the center of the field, wearing a white long-sleeved Real Madrid jersey with the sponsor emblem \"Fly Emirates\" printed on the chest, and black and red stripes on the shoulders of the jersey. It looks simple yet sporty, fluttering gently in the breeze with a faint smile. Facing the camera, she makes a relaxed victory gesture. Her right hand is raised, and her index and middle fingers are spread out, forming a classic V-shape. She wears a thin black wristband on her wrist, with exquisite details. Her overall posture is natural and relaxed, exuding youthful energy and confidence. In the foreground is a delicate green artificial turf with clearly visible textures. Each blade of grass shows different layers of light and shadow under the light. The lawn surface is smooth, with white edges extending straight out. Outlining the boundaries of the course, the middle is the farther field area, where a few blurry figures can be seen moving—some running, others training. They wear different colored sportswear, with orange training cones scattered across the field, forming an orderly arrangement. In the background is a row of tall trees, lush and green. Behind the trees, a tall stadium lighting tower can be faintly seen. The metal structure reflects a cold glow in the sunlight, and nearby are some flagpoles with multiple small national flags hanging. Gently drifting in the breeze, two distant goals stand silently, white nets sway gently in the sunlight, filling the scene with dynamism and order. The composition uses a central composition, with figures positioned slightly below the center of the frame, background elements extending to both sides, forming a symmetrical yet varied spatial layout. The visual guide naturally extends from the grassy lines in the foreground to the active crowds and forests in the distance. The line of sight progresses step by step, creating a profound sense of space. The light and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, with the sun slanting down from the upper right. This creates soft side lighting, while the right side leaves a faint shadow to enhance the sense of depth. The light and shadow on the grass intertwine; some areas appear bright green due to direct sunlight, while others appear slightly darker, creating rich color transitions. The overall color palette is mainly blue, green, and white, fresh and natural. The black and red accents of the jersey create a visual impact. The image texture is similar to everyday phone photography, with slight motion blur and real noise, as if captured casually. It captures moments of youthful campus life, without excessive embellishment, yet full of genuine emotion and warmth. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of vitality and hope, allowing people to feel the joy and freedom that sports bring.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
