        {
          "id": "krea2-99200485769f52c8601eb081",
          "alias": "单女棕外套公园困倦站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a thick light brown plush coat made of fluffy and soft material, with delicate plush texture. The collar stands high and wraps around her neck, her hands folded over her chest, fingers long, nails painted in deep blue, and a silver ring on her ring finger. The background is a blurred wooden fence and dense greenery, built from sturdy logs, presenting a natural brownish hue. Some areas are illuminated by light, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The greenery appears deep in the night, with faint halos at the edges of leaves. In the distance, several warm yellow streetlights can be seen, casting soft light on the scene and creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The sky is deep blue, tinged with a hint of twilight The overall composition centers on the figure, using close-ups that occupy most of the space. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly leans forward, creating an intimate and relaxed posture. The light and shadow mainly come from the warm yellow light source slightly to the left in front, with distinct contours. The folds of clothing also create subtle light and shadow changes due to the light. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while preserving the layered environment. The overall color tone is warm and harmonious, full of a fairy-tale romantic atmosphere, as if immersed in a dreamy amusement park at night. The image quality is delicate, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The lighting is natural, noise is minimal, colors are authentic, details are rich, and the characters' expressions are natural, their movements relaxed, giving a close, enjoyable, and story-rich visual experience",
