        {
          "id": "krea2-5b58dc5e3f51c413540f5e9e",
          "alias": "单女和服森林站立吃",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a kimono with a pink base featuring vibrant floral patterns—including pink, purple, blue, and red flowers, as well as curled vine patterns. The kimono sleeves are wide and flowing, with delicate floral details at the neckline and edges. At the waist is a wide white obi with gold metal buckles and ornaments, presenting the elegance and refinement of traditional Japanese attire. She holds a small white petal in her mouth, as if gently biting or savoring it. Her right hand is gently raised, her posture elegant and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing the smooth lines and three-dimensional folds of a kimono. In the foreground, several blooming cherry blossom branches extend from the left side of the painting, with pink and white cherry blossoms densely blooming, green leaves dotting the space. The branches curve naturally, with some flowers and branches slightly obscuring the figure's outline, creating a sense of layering and space. In the middle is a blurred cherry blossom forest, with a vast sea of pink flowers forming a soft background. The blurring makes the subject stand out even more. In the distance, the outlines of stone steps or paths can be faintly seen, scattered petals on the ground, and the background is a hazy, pale pink sky with sparse tree shadows. The overall color scheme is soft pinkish-white, with bright and warm light. Sunlight filters through the petals onto the figures, creating a mottled light effect. Light and shadow shine down from the upper right, creating a soft natural light atmosphere for morning or afternoon. The composition uses the center-left position of the main figure, with cherry blossom branches in the foreground as a guiding line. Drawing the viewer's gaze toward the figure, the shallow depth of field effect blurs the background to highlight the subject's clarity. The overall composition is filled with a springtime atmosphere, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and poetic artistic conception. It has a strong Japanese aesthetic style, with delicate texture and saturated, soft colors, presenting a dreamlike visual effect. It resembles a tranquil spring portrait with a subtle nostalgia and romantic mood. The overall atmosphere is fresh and refined, allowing one to feel the harmonious beauty of tradition and nature. There are no obvious modern elements in the image. It emphasizes the fusion of classical and natural elements, offering an immersive experience where one can almost smell the faint fragrance of cherry blossoms and hear the rustling of the breeze on the branches. The entire scene is like a silent poem, telling the story of spring",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
