        {
          "id": "krea2-c5f8e3cfb646b1ddd1b200ba",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上坐（2）",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white long-sleeved shirt with a light and soft texture, slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists. She pairs it with light blue jeans with irregular flicked hems, appearing casual and fashionable. She sits cross-legged on a simple gray round stool, feet together. On his feet are white sneakers with loose laces, the overall posture relaxed and natural. In the foreground, the figure occupies the main position of the composition, fully visible from above the waist to the head. The composition centers on the figure, slightly shifting to the left, creating an asymmetrical sense of balance. The background is a bright yellow wall, smooth in texture but with subtle textures, and the colors are highly saturated but not too harsh. On the right side, there is a large window with a white frame. Outside is a blurred cluster of city buildings, with tall buildings standing among the sky. The sky is pale blue, casting soft light from early morning or evening. Sunlight streams in from outside, illuminating the entire space and creating a warm golden halo. The left wall is dyed golden by sunlight, while the right side is shaded by subtle gradient layers. Faint shadows cast in front and below the figure's body enhance the sense of depth. The composition uses close-ups with a camera angle slightly overhead. Extending further to the window behind her and the distant scenery, it creates a sense of spatial depth from near to far. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and cozy, full of life's atmosphere, as if a moment in daily life is frozen in time. The light is soft and layered, the colors harmoniously unified. Yellow and blue form a striking contrast yet harmonize, creating a warm, comfortable, slightly artistic visual feel. It feels like a real scene shot with an ordinary home camera in natural light, without excessive embellishment, preserving authentic texture and details. It gives a sense of familiarity, authenticity, and close to everyday art",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
