        {
          "id": "krea2-cf9f5c666b1ba189344aa49a",
          "alias": "单女竹林忧伤奔跑注视",
          "prompt": "Gazing into the camera seems to tell an ancient story, the overall silhouette is soft and three-dimensional. Her right hand gently holds the handle of a bamboo oil-paper umbrella. The umbrella surface is light green, the ribs clearly visible, and the slightly tilted surface blocks some sunlight, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. In the foreground, The umbrella handle runs diagonally through the frame, extending from the upper left corner to the lower right, forming a strong visual guiding line. Meanwhile, the blurred treatment at the edge of the umbrella enhances the layering and depth of the composition. The middle scene shows the woman's body and part of her sleeves. The fabric is light and flowing, with natural folds that emit a subtle sheen. The cuffs are decorated with fine subtle patterns, adding a touch of classical charm. The background is a hazy green, possibly dense woods or bamboo groves, with light filtering through the gaps in the leaves, forming mottled points of light. It contrasts with the overall cool-toned green background, creating a quiet and mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space to highlight the main subject. The diagonal lines from the umbrella handle add movement and strong emotional resonance. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the left side of the image, simulating the slanting sunlight of morning or evening. The light is soft and warm, creating a contrast between light and dark. At the same time, delicate transitions of highlight and shadow on the sheer curtain and clothing create a sense of depth and texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, carrying a touch of classical poetry and a hint of melancholy. The colors are mainly cool teal-green, paired with warm yellow sunlight, creating a contrast of warm and cool tones that enhance the artistic appeal of the image. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if taken with a professional camera, creating a high-quality work that feels like a high-quality work taken with a professional camera, while still retaining the realism and everyday atmosphere under natural light. Like a beautiful moment captured by chance in daily life, the entire scene is filled with Eastern aesthetic conception, combining the elegance of traditional clothing with the refinement of modern photography. It conveys a beauty and tranquility that transcends time and space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
