        {
          "id": "krea2-abac563d6bdc4e47ca4bfef9",
          "alias": "单女窗边冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman's half-length portrait appears casual and layered, adding a touch of authenticity and natural texture that sharply contrasts with the overall dark tones. She wears a black lace long-sleeve top with delicate and intricate lace patterns, presenting a classical and romantic style. The neckline is paired with a wide white lapel, creating a striking contrast between color and material. The edges of the white lapel are neat and crisp, injecting a retro collegiate vibe into the overall look. The composition centers on the figures, using close-ups that occupy most of the space. Their heads are slightly tilted, bodies slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a simple light gray wall with a smooth surface without obvious textures. Light streams in from the right, creating a soft transition between light and shadow, while natural shadows are cast on the left, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and space. The light and shadow effects are delicate and layered, creating a quiet, private, and story-filled atmosphere. The overall color tone is cool but accented by warm light. It presents a tranquil and gentle visual experience. The images feature high-resolution detail expression, delicate skin with clearly visible pores, distinct clothing textures, and natural and realistic lighting treatment, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the realism and sense of life from everyday amateur equipment. The overall image presents a cinematic texture, combining artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life. The composition is compact and full of tension, highlighting the expression of inner emotions. The lighting atmosphere is tranquil and profound. Like afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice, it captures a moment of tranquility. The entire scene is filled with poetry and emotional tension, evoking a subtle sense of solitude and a beauty of self-reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
