        {
          "id": "krea2-ac081c011efd6d5130ce85de",
          "alias": "单女透视黑短裤城市忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style blue carved wooden chest, wearing a gray striped long-sleeved top with delicate white lace embroidery on the sleeves. She pairs it with black shorts and sheer stockings, standing barefoot on the surface of the box, legs crossed and curled up, hands hugging knees, head slightly tilted, expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her makeup is exquisite, and soft light streams in through the right window, creating a contrast of light and shadow that creates a serene and story-rich atmosphere. In the foreground, the blue box's surface is mottled and peeling, revealing the wood grain The edges feature golden decorative lines, with intricate and elegant carvings that carry the charm of classical furniture. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the composition, with a relaxed yet tense posture, her body slightly leaning forward, presenting a restrained yet striking visual focal point. The background features a tall floor-to-ceiling glass window framed with metal frames, somewhat aged. The glass surface has some dust and reflections, and the outside scene is blurred, with faint distant trees, fences, and a hazy sky. The overall tone is cool, mainly blue and gray. It presents a sense of loneliness, nostalgia, and even a slightly decadent urban ruin aesthetic. The composition combines close-ups with the environment, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The vertical lines of the window guide the view, while the shallow depth of field blurs the background to highlight the subject, then extends beyond the window into the distance, creating emotional extension and spatial depth. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with the main light source coming from the right front, simulating natural daylight to create soft shadows and highlights transitions. The wrinkles and lace details of the clothing are clearly visible. The blue wooden box under light presents rich texture layers. The overall image has a strong cinematic and artistic photography style, as if shot with a professional camera in an abandoned building. It features film graininess and slight noise, moderate color saturation, emphasizes a cool atmosphere, and the composition is stable yet dynamic. The characters and environment complement each other, conveying a beauty and fragility found in solitude. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil, detached, and slightly poetic modern urban mood, like a classic shot from an independent film. It captures moments of individuals maintaining self-expression even in barren environments, full of narrative and visual impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
