        {
          "id": "krea2-f9140face4a00c586423e9a4",
          "alias": "单女透视灰连衣裙公寓困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a bright indoor window, wearing a light gray sheer strapless dress. The layered ruffled short skirt is light and flowing, presenting a dreamy texture and layering. Her hands are folded in front of her neck, leaning slightly against the window frame, her posture gentle yet slightly shy. She wears sheer stockings and off-white high heels, her legs long and well-proportioned. The fine textures on the stockings are clearly visible, the pointed design of the high heels and stiletto heels highlight feminine soft curves. The overall look blends sweetness, sensuality, and nobility. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, occupying the visual center. The foreground shows the full contour of the subject, fully presented from feet to head. The middle ground features window frames and glass, with simple white metal frames. The glass reflects the blurred blue sky and the city's architectural silhouettes, while the background is pure white walls and floors, which are smooth and flat. The floor is paved with marble tiles with light gray textures, creating a clean and modern overall space. The composition uses vertical style, with the figure's standing posture naturally stretched out, the body slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The light mainly comes from the large floor-to-ceiling window on the right, which is soft natural light. Sunlight streams through the glass into the room, creating even, diffused light that illuminates the sides and front, creating a bright and clear atmosphere. The shadowed areas are delicate and soft, with almost no strong contrast. The overall color palette is mainly cool white and light gray. A harmonious contrast of cool and warm is formed, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a strong sense of air. The image presents a fresh, pure, dreamy, and slightly intimate atmosphere, as if capturing the tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight. It has the texture of professional photography in everyday life, rich and realistic in detail, while retaining artistic beauty. It is suitable for expressing themes of youth, beauty, and elegance. The image contains no unnecessary decorations, and the minimalist spatial layout highlights the charm of the characters themselves. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed fashion portrait, blending the atmosphere of everyday life with artistic aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
