          "id": "krea2-92c853c622075c10e4546cfb",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣公寓温柔倚靠",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is delicate and natural. Her body leans slightly forward, her left shoulder slightly lowered, her right hand naturally resting on the white drawer cabinet behind her, and her left hand resting gently near her knee. Her posture is relaxed and elegant. She wears a loose pink knit sweater made of soft and fluffy material, with clearly visible texture and an irregular asymmetrical shoulder design, revealing one shoulder and collarbone line. The sweater sleeves are wide and naturally drape, with slightly ripped details adding a touch of casual and fashionable touch. Underneath, she wears a white thin strap with faintly visible shoulder straps. She wears a black pleated short skirt with a well-tailored cut, adorned with two gold buttons at the waist. The hem is layered and dynamic, and she sits cross-legged, wearing black stockings with smooth texture and delicate reflection. The toes are pure black, matching the color of the stockings for a visually unified look. In the background is a white classical-style drawer cabinet, with a flat surface and simple line decorations. The top features silver round handles arranged neatly. Above the cabinet are some vague items, including glassware and photo frames, but the details are unclear. The floor is a light beige carpet or floor, soft in texture and uniform colors. The overall environment is clean and tidy, with light coming from the front slightly left, soft and even, without obvious shadows, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and occupying the main position. The background is simple and highlights the main subject, creating a smooth visual flow. Light and shadow are evenly distributed, shadows transition softly, and the color scheme uses pink, Black and white are the main colors, with harmonious tones and sharp contrasts. The overall image presents a warm and intimate atmosphere of everyday life, as if shot with a regular home camera. It features slight noise and natural depth of field, with a moderate focal length focusing on the subject. The background is slightly blurred, enhancing the sense of space and layering. The image is delicate and detailed, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, giving a genuine and approachable feel",
