        {
          "id": "krea2-bef2b458ed629c2fc6865e44",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣山野神秘站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera atop a plateau mountain, wearing an orange-red knit sweater with loose sleeves fluttering in the wind. A white scarf drapes from her shoulders down to her waist, soft and voluminous, contrasting sharply with warm-toned clothing. She wears a red and black plaid mini skirt, the hem gently flowing, showcasing youthful vitality. Her right arm is raised high, tightly clutching a bouquet of bright orange-red roses. The flowers are in full bloom, petals layered and warm, rich and warm. Her left arm hangs naturally, fingers spread, as if embracing heaven and earth. The entire posture is full of freedom and release. The foreground features clear outlines of the figures, while the middle is a rolling snow-capped mountain range. The mountains are steep and steep, with exposed rocks. Some peaks are covered in pure white snow, with mist swirling between the mountainsides, sometimes gathering and parting, creating a mysterious and unpredictable atmosphere. In the distance, the sky is a clear blue as if washed clean, with a few wisps of white clouds drifting by, creating a strong visual layer with the mountains. The composition uses the figure positioned slightly to the center, with the left side left exposed to highlight the sense of space, creating a contrast between the figures and the mountains. To enhance the depth of the image, visual guidance begins with the bouquet in the character's hand, extending along the arm to the distant snowy mountains, then converging upward into the blue sky, forming an upward dynamic arc. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with bright sunlight shining on the figure's back and right side, creating soft shadow transitions that sharpen the body's contours. At the same time, the interplay of light and shadow on the snowy mountain is created, with light penetrating the clouds and casting dappled shadows on the mountain, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere blends tranquility, vastness, warmth, and hope. It combines natural grandeur with humanistic emotional warmth, presenting a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday travel photography. It feels like shooting with a medium format camera or professional DSLR, rich in detail, colors saturated but not exaggerated, with slight film graininess and realistic exposure. The lens focal length is about 85mm, with natural background blur and precise depth control. The overall image presents high resolution, high dynamic range, delicate textures, and realistic material reflections, with strong artistic appeal and a sense of life, like a precious photo recording life's moments, full of poetry and philosophical reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
