        {
          "id": "krea2-898a694678d0c396f00ebe0d",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙户外忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She stood slightly to the side, gently holding a bouquet of white daisies, her overall posture elegant and natural. Her dress top was designed with long black sleeves, featuring delicate lace trim and pearl embellishments at the collar and cuffs. A slender pearl necklace hung down her chest, and the hem was a pure white long skirt, forming a sharp contrast with the black coat. She stood by the outdoor steps, with blurred green plants and architectural silhouettes in the background. Sunlight slanted in from the left side of the painting, creating a soft backlight effect. Tiny spots of light and dust particles float in the air, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. In the foreground, you can see a section of green metal railing and white tiled steps. The composition uses a central left-leaning position of the main figure, emphasizing the shallow depth of field. The visual guide is directed toward the viewer by the direction of the person's gaze and the bouquet in their hands. The light and shadow create a contrast between warm golden tones and cool blue tones, with some areas illuminated by sunlight bright and transparent. The shadowed areas display a soft blue-gray tone, with a fresh and elegant overall tone, reminiscent of film photography and a slight graininess, resembling graduation commemorative photos taken with vintage cameras, full of youthfulness, nostalgia, and poetic atmosphere. The scene is set outdoors on campus, possibly along the tree-lined paths or courtyards in front of teaching buildings, surrounded by dense greenery and faintly visible architectural structures. Distant scenes are soft-focused to enhance spatial layering, while nearby railings and steps add realism and a sense of everyday life. The entire image exudes a peaceful, beautiful, and slightly sorrowful farewell emotion, like a tender moment of growth and farewell frozen in time. The image quality is delicate, details rich, colors harmonious and unified, possessing strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance",
