        {
          "id": "krea2-e324eb1c0ca51ff7b35d2cd0",
          "alias": "单女透视白T恤小径忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light-colored wooden floor, leaning slightly back against a pure white wall, striking a quiet and slightly contemplative posture with a hint of melancholy and introspection. Her expression is neutral yet somewhat distant, wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt with bright red trim at the collar and cuffs, creating a striking color contrast. She wears black sheer stockings, legs crossed together, knees bent, arms crossed over calves, her posture elegant yet restrained, leg lines smooth and long. Under the light, the surface of the stockings has a slight sheen, showing a semi-transparent texture. The background is a minimalist pure white wall with no decorations or clutter, creating a clean and open space. The floor is a light wood grain floor, with horizontal planks arranged horizontally, clear grain, and tiny edges. The overall environment is simple and bright, with a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the visual core and forming a strong focal point. The camera angle is slightly down, shooting from a slightly elevated position. This makes the figure stand out more while preserving complete body proportions and posture details. Light comes from the upper front, a soft, diffused light, with soft and subtle shadows, mainly concentrated behind the figure and on the ground, forming a slight shadow that enhances three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The light and shadow transition is natural, without strong contrasts, and the overall atmosphere is quiet, cool, and slightly private. The tones are mainly white, black, and red. The white background is pure, the black stockings are deep, and the red accents are lively. These three elements form a simple yet dynamic color combination, presenting an overall sense of capturing moments from everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or mobile phone. It has a slight film texture and a tendency toward low-saturation colors. The details are rich but not overly retouched, emphasizing authenticity and emotional expression. The figures' postures are natural and relaxed, without any deliberate staged shots, conveying a quiet, lonely, and slightly gentle mood. The blank background further amplifies the character's presence. This draws the viewer's attention entirely to her expressions, posture, and clothing details. The overall image has a strong visual guiding effect. Through central composition and clear foreground-middle ground-background layering, returning to the overall posture, a coherent visual path is formed. The use of light and shadow highlights the transparency of the stockings and the curve of the legs. There are no unnecessary distractions in the frame; every detail serves the expression of the subject, creating a unique atmosphere between artistic photography and everyday life, combining aesthetic refinement. It also feels close to everyday life, with an overall style that is realistic and emotionally dynamic, suitable for expressing themes such as youth, loneliness, and restraint, with high artistic appeal and visual appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
