        {
          "id": "krea2-d2ccfc345c10ad031bb7480d",
          "alias": "单女棕外套俏皮坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A scene shows a woman sitting on a white vintage toy car. She wears a brown corduroy jacket with plush decorations at the collar, a light blue shirt underneath, loose khaki work shorts, and black lace-up leather shoes, draped slightly messily over her shoulders. Her body leans forward slightly, gripping the toy car handlebars with both hands, presenting a playful yet slightly exaggerated pose. Her legs are bent, knees close to the ground, as if about to start or just stopped. The whole scene is full of childlike fun and youthful energy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, occupying the visual center. The foreground is a rough cement floor with mottled yellow and gray marks, featuring obvious graininess and texture. The ground is scattered with fine dust and debris, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The center features figures and a toy car. The toy car is made of white plastic with a simple design, featuring a black circular opening at the front. The car is low and equipped with four small wheels. The structure is simple but the design is cute. The background is a white wall that looks somewhat old. There are stains and water stains. Above are several dark green glass windows with metal frames arranged neatly, reflecting the blurred sky and surroundings. Two air conditioning units are installed on the wall, one on the left and one on the right, both white, with fan blades and brand logos. There are also two vertical rectangular vents or maintenance doors on the wall, with slight rust on the edges. The overall composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered slightly to the left, and the toy car forming a visual extension that guides the viewer to the right. At the same time, the slanted lines on the floor and the horizontal lines on the walls enhance the sense of space. The view is slightly overhead, creating a familiar feeling for everyday snapshots. The light and shadows come from diffused light from cloudy days, soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The overall tone is cool, mainly gray, white, and brown, accented with a touch of blue and green. The color saturation is low, presenting a film-like texture with slight grainy noise and vignetting, simulating the retro style of old photos. The atmosphere is relaxed, pleasant, and slightly nostalgic. It seems to capture an ordinary yet joyful moment, rich in life atmosphere and artistic beauty, like everyday images taken with an old camera, rich and authentic in detail",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
