        {
          "id": "krea2-ea25a7db3cc289ba535b93bf",
          "alias": "单女森林忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant white Hanfu leans sideways against an old wooden doorframe, adding a touch of softness and laziness. She slightly tilts her head back to gaze into the camera, carrying a faint melancholy and contemplation. Her calm expression reveals a hint of detachment. Her right hand gently rests on the rough wooden door, fingers slender and long, fingers neatly trimmed, her hand posture naturally relaxed. The sleeves are wide and flowing, the fabric has a delicate texture with slight wrinkles and texture, presenting the natural drape of cotton-linen material. The clothes are in off-white or light gray colors. The colors carry a gentle tone tinged with age, with delicate subtle textured embroidery details at the collar and cuffs, faintly revealing traditional patterns. The overall costume style is elegant and vintage, full of Eastern classical charm. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the painting, with a slightly tilted body forming an elegant S-shaped curve. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the main body occupying the left half of the painting, leaving space on the right side to enhance breathability. The foreground features a clear wooden door frame with weathered marks, and the wood grain is rugged and deep. The door panel has mottled paint peeling and fine cracks, giving it a tangible texture. The edges of the door frame are slightly worn, reflecting a sense of ancient history. The center shows the woman's full body and partial body contours. She sits with her legs together, knees slightly bent, feet not fully visible, holding a string of dark brown prayer beads. The beads are smooth and rounded, with the chain hanging naturally. The presence of the beads hints at some religious or spiritual belief element. The background is blurred, presenting a hazy outdoor forest scene with intertwined trees and leaves. The lush green is lush but the layers are blurred. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows to create a soft halo effect. The colors are mainly green and brown, creating a tranquil and natural atmosphere. The light comes from the upper right, belonging to natural diffuse light. The overall illumination is soft and even, without strong contrast. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, unified under warm lighting in the early morning or evening. The tone is cool yet slightly warm, and the overall image is mainly low saturation. The colors are restrained and subtle, highlighting texture and emotional expression. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting effects that simulate the film feel of vintage camera shots, while retaining a certain graininess to enhance the retro feel. The composition emphasizes blank space and balance, using door frames as natural frames to guide the viewer's focus on the figure, creating a strong visual center. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and poetic, infused with strong Chinese traditional culture and Zen aesthetics, resembling a tranquil ink wash freehand painting or a frozen moment in an ancient-style film. It combines the refinement of artistic photography with the simplicity and authenticity of everyday life, making it suitable for expressing the gentle temperament and inner spiritual world of Eastern women. The overall composition presents a transcendent, reflective mood that lingers with a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
