        {
          "id": "krea2-a362aabb0f8d95b46d7015ac",
          "alias": "单女和服屋顶忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "On an autumn evening, a woman dressed in traditional kimono stands before a rustic Japanese building. Her kimono is white with elegant blue-purple patterns, an orange ribbon tied around her waist, and wide, flowing cuffs. The overall look is elegant and full of Eastern charm. She stands slightly to the side, gently holding a falling maple leaf with her right hand, her posture graceful and composed, as if in a silent dialogue with nature. In the foreground, several golden maple leaves gently tremble in the breeze. The intertwined branches form a natural frame, cleverly framing the figure into the center of the composition. In the middle of the scene, a row of dark brown wooden pillars supports the eaves, beneath which is a dim porch space. Light streams in from above, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The roof is covered with grayish-white tiles, neatly arranged with slightly raised edges, showcasing a typical Japanese traditional architectural style. The background is layered forests, with leaves showing a gradient from golden to deep red, some of which have already drifted down in the wind, creating a rich autumn atmosphere. The sky is obscured by dense tree canopies, revealing only a small patch of deep blue sky, adding a touch of mystery. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the grandeur of the building and the upright posture of the figures. At the same time, the natural framework formed by branches guides the gaze to focus on the figure. The visual guide extends from the maple leaves above to the fallen leaves in the figure's hands, then down to the stone steps beneath her feet, forming a smooth visual path. In terms of light and shadow, the sunset's afterglow filters through the gaps in the leaves, forming mottled and dazzling points of light. Illuminating parts of the kimono and falling leaves, creating a warm and soft golden tone, while the interior of the building is in shadow, creating a strong contrast that enhances the layering and depth of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of Zen and seasonal beauty, as if time has frozen in this moment, capturing moments of harmonious coexistence between humans and nature. Shot with professional photography equipment, the lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/2.8 aperture, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 100. White balance is set to sunset warm, simulating real camera imaging effects. Details are clear, color saturation moderate, and rich highlights and shadow transitions are retained, presenting a film-like texture with slight graininess and natural lens distortion, enhancing the image's realism and artistry. The composition is stable, the subject is center-right, leaving ample upper space to accommodate branches and the sky, creating a sense of openness. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, ochre, and dark brown, supplemented by cool tones from the kimono for visual balance, forming a harmonious color scheme, the image possesses a high artistic appeal, like a flowing classical painting, allowing one to feel the unique romance and melancholy of autumn",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
