        {
          "id": "krea2-bf2b969f5a00b358746ad7ed",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣户外沉思躺喝",
          "prompt": "Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, slowly sipping a hot drink. She holds a delicate off-white ceramic coffee cup with intricate patterns, her fingers long, and on her wrist is a black watch with a thin black strap. Her clothing is a thick brown knit sweater with a warm texture and naturally smooth shoulder lines. The composition uses close-ups, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal line guiding the view. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred indoor environment. Under the warm yellow light, the outlines of wooden furniture and glass window frames can be faintly seen. The middle shot features soft interplay of light and shadow inside the café. Cool blue light filters in outside the window, creating a contrast with the warm yellow light source indoors, creating a lazy autumn afternoon atmosphere. Light enters the room diagonally from the right, creating soft side lighting. The shadow transitions are delicate, and the overall tone interweaves warm yellow and cool blue, with a retro film texture. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich but not overly sharpened, and slight vignetting at the edges enhances the sense of center focus. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame. The blank space is used to hold magazine headlines and text layout, while being drawn in by the text information, forming a multi-layered visual flow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, warm, artistic, and full of life, as if shot in a café corner with an old-fashioned film camera, capturing a real and intimate moment of daily life. It has a strong sense of narrative and emotional resonance, presenting a natural texture that lies between professional photography and amateur handheld shooting. The light and shadow layers are rich, with moderate noise and graininess, simulating real camera imaging effects. The window in the background reflects the blurred outdoor scene, adding depth to the space. The overall composition resembles the cover of a carefully designed fashion lifestyle magazine, combining aesthetics and storytelling, conveying a gentle gaze and poetic appreciation of ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
