        {
          "id": "krea2-16648970de2a0c877beeb46d",
          "alias": "多人海报持书",
          "prompt": "The black-and-white fashionable portrait photography uses minimalist composition and strong visual contrast, occupying the center of the image. The texture is delicate and layered, presenting soft contour transitions and natural skin textures. The lines are smooth and have strong visual penetration. The foreground features blurred shoulders and necks, creating a contrast between solid and void. The background is pure white, clean and simple, with no distractions, creating a minimalist sense of space. This rectangular frame is positioned slightly above the center of the image, reflecting a faint light source and expressing strong emotion, creating a clear depth of field. At the top of the painting is the word \"FOCUS\" in modern sans-serif font, with clean and sharp lines, outlined with thin white lines, semi-transparent overlaid above the figure's head, creating a fusion of text and image. In the lower right corner, there is a barcode image and date and time information \"07/10/2025 05:06 PM\", simulating magazine cover design elements to enhance the documentary feel and authentic atmosphere. For lighting and shadowing, high-contrast lighting is used, with the main light source coming from the front slightly left, providing soft and even light and natural shadow transitions, forming a three-dimensional contour and enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color tone is black and white, with rich gray gradation. The transition from pure white to deep black is delicate, creating a calm, rational, and artistic atmosphere. The overall image presents a modern, refined, slightly detached visual style, reminiscent of a commercial commercial or fashion magazine cover shot with a professional camera, delivering strong visual impact and aesthetic value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
