        {
          "id": "krea2-bdd0587c6a0b58728a11c5a4",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A pregnant woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie. She wears a white slip dress with delicate textures. The dress fits her figure perfectly, highlighting the soft curves of her baby bump. She wears a beige knit cardgan over it, with sleeves naturally falling to her wrists, presenting a relaxed yet warm homely style. She is turning sideways toward the mirror, holding a white phone in her right hand. The back of the phone has a camera module, and she gently holds the phone with her fingers The posture is natural, revealing happiness and anticipation. The background is a deep brown wooden door panel with clear wood grain on the surface. The door features a square silver switch panel, simple and modern. The door frame edge is decorated with metal strips, creating a clean and crisp overall environment. The soft warm light from the room shines from the left side of the frame, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figure. The shadow is cast on the door panel, appearing three-dimensional and realistic. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, slightly leaning to create dynamic balance. The mirror reflects her complete silhouette, creating a sense of spatial layering. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of maternal radiance and the breath of life. The main tones are white, beige, and brown, paired with warm lighting, presenting a sense of everyday and authentic beauty. It feels like a private moment taken with a regular phone, preserving natural details and texture without excessive embellishment, conveying a genuine sense of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
