        {
          "id": "krea2-e3d6fd024dd7e02a49c2caf8",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫图书馆站立阅读",
          "prompt": "Between the wooden bookshelves in the library, a woman stands beside the shelves. She wears a light blue short-sleeved shirt and a striped skirt, white canvas shoes, and a beige bag slung over her shoulder. Her overall look is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy. The background is a neatly arranged bookshelf filled with various books. The text on the spines is clearly visible, and some shelves bear classification labels, such as \"Japanese History\" and \"19 Elegant History.\" The bookshelf is made of light wood, with a warm and smooth texture. The book colors are diverse, forming a rich color layer. The edges of the bookshelf and book details in the foreground are clearly visible. In the middle ground, the female subject is positioned on the right side of the frame, her body slightly tilted to the camera, her posture natural and relaxed. Her hand movements are delicate, and her fingers gently turn the pages to capture the moment of reading. The composition uses a center-to-right visual layout, using the vertical lines of the bookshelf to guide the viewer's gaze and create a sense of spatial depth. The arrangement of the bookshelf combines symmetry and asymmetry. This enhances the rhythm of the visuals. The visual guide starts with the red circular title \"【ひらめき】on the left, then moves through the large titles \"Ipmeme\" and \"Tamura Yasuno,\" and finally focuses on the female figures, forming a clear visual path. The light and shadows come from soft natural indoor light, evenly casting light on the characters and bookshelves without strong shadows, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and light blue, complemented by wood brown and colorful book accents, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The images present a tranquil beauty of everyday life, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious moment of reading. It has a slight film texture and graininess, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. Some Japanese text can also be faintly seen in the images, such as the photographer \"Takeo Dec.\", the magazine title \"SHONEN SUNDAY SPECIAL FOCUS,\" and \"from Sakurazaka46.\" These elements enhance the realism and storytelling of the scenes, creating an overall quiet atmosphere. Warm and healing, like a classic scene from a youth film, it lets people feel the power of knowledge and the beauty of youth. The visuals are rich in detail, from book binding to the textures of characters' clothing, all clearly distinguishable. The composition is exquisite, the lighting and shadows are soft, and the colors are coordinated, presenting an artistic style of everyday imagery",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
