        {
          "id": "krea2-834b2274d8326342ebd58120",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑浴袍媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits against a deep, dark night backdrop, her elaborate black hair piled into a towering classical updo, adorned with intricate gold and silver jeweled hairpieces, a central jade ornament, phoenix and lotus motifs, ruby bead tassels, and jade earrings. Her forehead bears a vermilion bindi, her eyes are sharply lined with smoky purple-red shadow, piercing and cold, lips painted vivid red. She wears a sheer black velvet robe, open to reveal her bare breasts, the fabric clinging to her curves, its gold-thread cloud embroidery catching light. Over her shoulders drapes a lush white fur shawl, the soft fluff resting against her exposed skin. Her hands hold a silk fan half-covering her face, golden bangles and rings on her fingers. The composition is a medium close-up, her face and bare bust centered, head slightly above midline, exuding a haughty, commanding presence. The foreground blurs into white fur, the background is pure black with deep blue-violet gradient, no distractions. Lighting comes from upper left, casting cool blue-violet side light across her face and jewelry, creating sharp contrasts and soft shadows, enhancing her sculpted features and bare skin. The palette is black, white, gold, with jade green and purple-red accents. The style is hyperrealistic, blending classical Chinese elegance with modern erotic photography, a cold, majestic, and sensual queen from an ancient court.",
