        {
          "id": "krea2-69d7479cd136592370171346",
          "alias": "单女橙连衣裙街道戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a retro street-style indoor space, her shoulder-length reddish-brown hair falling in soft natural waves, makeup exquisite, lips painted pale pink, skin fair and smooth. She gazes into the lens with a warm yet confident and slightly teasing look. She wears a vibrant orange satin slip dress with a plunging heart-shaped neckline that reveals the swell of her breasts and a cinched waist that highlights her slender figure and long legs. The dress is printed with large deep crimson rose motifs, its hem well above mid-thigh, showing off her toned thighs. On her feet are gold strappy stiletto sandals with metallic ankle wraps. She layers multiple gold necklaces and bracelets for a luxe touch. Her right hand rests lightly on a colorful cartoon-patterned helmet. Behind her, several surfboards in blue-white, orange wood-grain, and yellow-white stripes stand on wooden racks. Beside her is a white-and-blue vintage scooter with graffiti and the text “THE WING FOR AVERAGE,” its headlight clear. A green palm frond droops from the upper left, adding tropical flair. On the right, a metal frame holds glowing neon tubes forming blurred text, evoking a nightclub or trendy store. The rough concrete floor shows mottled light and reflections, enhancing realism. Distant walls feature vibrant, abstract graffiti. The space is brightly lit by strong side-backlight from a window on the right, casting sharp shadows and warm highlights, while soft diffused light evenly illuminates her. The composition is symmetrical with her centered as the focal point, layered from scooter and helmet in the foreground, to woman and surfboards in the midground, to wall decor and neon in the background. Dominant orange, blue, and yellow create high-contrast, summer-infused urban energy. Every detail is crisp and lifelike, as if shot with professional gear yet retaining an intimate everyday feel. The mood is playful, sensual, and inviting—perfect for a fashion-ad or lifestyle editorial with a daring, NSFW edge.",
