        {
          "id": "krea2-1ed3a9f01ad218d616fbcd12",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙舞台媚态坐托腮",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a black director's chair, her thick, dark brown long curly hair cascading loosely over her shoulders and chest, strands brushing her face for a lazy, sensual look. Her fair skin is flawless, her features sharp and striking, with deep, slightly melancholic eyes locking onto the lens. Her lips part, revealing a calm yet defiant confidence. She wears a sleeveless black leather-look dress that fits tightly, the material glossy with subtle sheen, an A-line skirt with white stitching, and a wide belt with a metal buckle and circular eyelets. She rests her left hand under her chin, long fingers adorned with multiple silver rings, her wrist carrying a wide metal bracelet and a thinner one. Her arm is elegant, body leaning slightly forward, right arm hanging naturally. The scene is an indoor shoot: to the left, a large professional film light with a metal mesh guard, marked \"24/20kW,\" stand complex with screws and joints; to the right, part of a car with a five-spoke alloy wheel and thick tire. Gray concrete floor shows wear. Warm light from the upper left creates soft side lighting, highlighting her face, hair, and body contours, with smooth shadow transitions. The composition is a medium close-up, center-left, head slightly tilted, eyes meeting the viewer. The background suggests a professional set, evoking a behind-the-scenes music video or fashion shoot. The palette is black, gray, silver with skin tones and metallic gleam, cool and edgy. The overall feel is both intimate and public, capturing a star's genuine moment on set. Details are crisp: hair shine, metal reflections, fabric texture, light modulation—like a high-res low-light film photo with grain and dynamic range, narrative, blending fragility with on-stage poise, modern fashion with industrial grit, a portrait of individual and professional spirit.",
