          "prompt": "A young woman with silky deep brown hair cascading over her bare shoulders sits at a wooden restaurant table, her blue-white checked shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her shapely breasts and a black square-neck tank top pushed down to frame her cleavage. She holds a pair of glossy black chopsticks horizontally just in front of her lips, a playful, inviting look in her large brown eyes as she tilts her head toward the camera. Her expression is soft, curious, with a hint of daring. Her fingers are long and relaxed around the chopsticks. The scene is a half-body close-up, framing her centered left-of-frame, with a warm, dimly lit interior. Behind her, a pale beige wall shows red decorative text (in English: “Authentic Chongqing Taste – Affordable”) and a hand-drawn sketch; to the right, a large window reveals a blurry night cityscape with neon lights bleeding into colored bokeh. A wooden chopstick holder stands on the sill, and a warm yellow pendant lamp with an orange-tinged shade casts a soft glow across the table and her face, creating intimate highlights and gentle shadows. The image feels candid, slightly tilted, with subtle grain and motion blur, capturing a relaxed, sensual moment of everyday life—the woman's toplessness natural and unforced, her pose a quiet tease.",
