          "alias": "单女白挂脖舞台媚态站立托腮",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands backstage against a metal truss structure, wearing a white halter dress densely covered in tiny sparkling rhinestones that form a delicate grid pattern, shimmering under cool blue lights. The dress is cut low, revealing the full curve of her breasts and deep cleavage. Thin spaghetti straps trace her elegant collarbones. Her long hair falls softly over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her cheek and neck, adding a lazy, sensual feel. She turns slightly, left hand resting under her chin, fingers long and slender, a simple silver ring on her ring finger, and geometric silver earrings at her ears. Her gaze is tender, looking into the lens, lips a natural pale pink with a faint, knowing smile. Her posture is calm and confident, as if just finished a performance, immersed in a moment of backstage tranquility. The background features dark stage equipment cases and intersecting metal beams, creating an industrial coldness. Blue-toned side lighting casts cool, dreamy illumination, highlighting her facial contours and body curves, creating soft highlights on her skin and sparkles on the dress rhinestones, adding visual depth. Close-up composition, subject slightly right of center, head tilted, making intimate eye contact with the viewer. Foreground sharp, background blurred with shallow depth of field, guiding focus to her face and hand. Strong light and shadow contrast, cool blue tones mixed with warm skin, creating striking color collision. Overall, a fusion of fashion and intimacy—like a high-definition candid portrait captured by a professional camera, rich in detail, with a slight film grain and natural lens distortion, evoking a real, amateur-captured behind-the-scenes moment full of narrative and emotional tension. The diagonal metal lines in the background enhance spatial depth while balancing her vertical pose, the overall composition stable yet dynamic. Her posture is relaxed, arm crossed lightly, hand under chin, expressing a blend of thoughtfulness and softness. The entire scene emanates a quiet, elegant, and slightly weary beauty, as if time has frozen, leaving only her silent dialogue with the light.",
