          "prompt": "A young female model, topless, wearing a black-and-white checkered tweed mini skirt with a black wide waistband, black high heels adorned with large bows, and black floral-patterned stockings. She strides confidently down a red carpet in an indoor corridor with gray marble walls and floor reflecting soft light. Her bare breasts are fully exposed, nipples visible, as she holds a small ornate handbag with metal chain in one hand. A masked male photographer in a black suit kneels in the background, aiming a professional camera. Side lighting creates deep shadows on her face and torso, emphasizing her curves and confident expression. The scene is a high-fashion red carpet moment, elegant and sensual, with sharp focus on her body and blurred background.",
