          "id": "krea2-871c62160256c73ed1381a89",
          "alias": "单女全裸棕外套街道媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside a concrete staircase on a city street, her thick, fluffy light-brown fox fur coat hanging open to reveal her bare chest and erect nipples, the soft fur cascading in layered gradients from creamy white to warm beige, collar and cuffs extra dense. Her black hair falls in loose waves, glossy under the light, straight bangs framing her face, a simple metal hairpin adding a touch of elegance. Her right hand cups her cheek, fingers long with pale pink nails, left hand resting on her hip, pose relaxed and inviting. She stares directly at the lens, eyes sultry, makeup natural—defined eyeliner, nude-pink lips, fair skin with soft shadows. Behind her, gray concrete steps with rough texture and black metal railings create strong diagonal lines. On the wall, large white letters “RE” and “E A” in industrial font, with a convenience store shelf and blue awning visible. A brown leather handbag with metal buckle sits at the lower-left corner. Medium close-up, subject slightly right of center, background blurred for focus but retaining environment. Lighting from above mixed with indoor light, soft and warm, suggesting early afternoon. Color palette of grays, browns, blacks with hints of blue and skin tone. The scene feels like a candid fashion street photo, 85mm f/2.0 shallow depth of field, smooth bokeh, sharp details, blending urban style with intimate sensuality, conveying a lazy yet confident attitude.",
