        {
          "id": "krea2-744760f577b0233865595da5",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫舞台沉思坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a pale beige modern single sofa, her long jet-black hair falling naturally over her shoulders with soft, glossy waves, a few strands brushing her cheek, giving her a gentle yet vibrant look. Her delicate features are refined—slender, arched brows, clear bright eyes gazing leftward with a thoughtful, focused expression, lips slightly pursed in quiet composure. She wears a small gold earpiece and a simple gold earring, adding a professional touch. Her blue-and-white vertical striped long-sleeve shirt is unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing a dark brown sleeveless dress underneath, its edges trimmed in gold-brown piping, buttons neatly aligned—elegant and intellectual. Her hands rest folded on her lap, a simple gold ring on her left ring finger, right hand gently over left, posture dignified and natural. Her legs are together, the dark brown skirt covering her knees, and she wears tall dark brown leather boots, smooth and reflective. The sofa has a wide, soft backrest with smooth lines, exuding modern comfort. The background is a LED screen of red and white horizontal stripes, varying widths, gradients from deep red to pale red to white, creating a strong visual rhythm. Light from front and side illuminates her, casting soft, even shadows on her face, highlighting the delicate skin texture and fabric details, with subtle highlights on her hair and shoulders enhancing three-dimensionality. The composition is a mid-shot, her body slightly turned, head facing right, gaze extending off-frame, creating dynamic viewing. Foreground is her and the sofa’s sharp outline, midground is her body and partial stripes, background blurred colorful stripes, layers distinct. The visual flow guides viewer’s eye through her gaze and body language to the left, forming an open narrative space. The light is warm with a subtle theatricality—bright like stage lighting yet preserving her inner stillness and contemplation. Overall tones: warm brown, light blue, off-white, accented with red and gold, harmonious and cohesive, evoking a professional yet artistic TV interview setting. The image has highly realistic detail and cinematic quality, as if shot on professional photography equipment, yet retains the intimacy of everyday life, filled with story and emotional tension, inviting curiosity about her thoughts.",
