        {
          "id": "krea2-977e039f2e676bf4272137b0",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰连衣裙微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a three-quarter profile, her black hair pulled into a high ponytail with a few strands framing her face. She glances back at the camera with clear, soft eyes, lips slightly parted in a subtle knowing smile, skin fair and smooth, delicate features. She wears a deep gray metallic-strapped slip dress, thin shoulder straps revealing her long neck and bare shoulders, the dress body gathered with a ruffled trim on the right shoulder, adding an elegant touch. Her left arm hangs naturally, a silver chain bracelet on her wrist, fingers slender, left hand lightly touching her right wrist, poised and graceful. A large blue-green canvas tote bag hangs from her shoulder, the fabric textured, with drawstring closure and pearl embellishments, the word \"ROBINMAY\" embroidered below a black-and-white line drawing of a kitten, plus two cute stickers—a red five-petal flower with a smiley face and a pink cloud-shaped letter \"Q\" with white outline. The background is a light gray-white wall, a bright vertical light strip from the right creating a warm directional glow. The shot is a medium portrait, subject left, three-quarter turn with head turned back, gaze engaging the viewer. The lighting from the right sculpts her face and body with soft shadows, emphasizing her curves and the subtle sheen of the dress against her skin. Her outfit is slightly pulled down or loose, hinting at a braless look, nipples faintly visible through the thin fabric, giving a sensual yet artistic vibe. Her bare shoulders and collarbones are emphasized, the dress clinging to her waist and hips. She appears comfortable and confident, the overall image clean, modern, with a mix of casual and high-fashion glamour.",
