        {
          "id": "krea2-f5deb2cd510cf68c1e4fa786",
          "alias": "单女粉内衣卧室媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a pink desk, wearing only sheer pink lace lingerie beneath an open lavender denim shirt, her blue denim skirt hiked high, white thigh-high stockings, and pink stiletto heels. She crosses her legs, one hand resting on a silver laptop, the other casually grazing her bare thigh, her gaze direct, confident, and slightly defiant. Her dark hair tumbles over bare shoulders, a delicate necklace and bracelet catching the light. On the desk: the laptop, a colorful pencil case, and a book titled \"NOW LIFE.\" Above, a pink shelf holds colorful books and stuffed toys, including a teddy bear in red-and-yellow and a blue-green bear. Behind her, a pale lavender wall displays three framed prints: a sunset seascape, a pastoral scene, and a smaller abstract. A large white window on the right lets in soft natural light, filtering through sheer white curtains, casting gentle shadows across her face, arms, and the desk. The floor is pale gray wood with faint reflections. The whole scene is bathed in pink and purple tones—sweet yet rebellious, intimate and sensual. Her pose, the lingerie, and the hint of bare skin are explicitly adult, exuding a confident, seductive charm in a dreamy, youthful bedroom setting.",
