        {
          "id": "krea2-49ff395baba9896f49e3169c",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙市场媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A blonde female model poses in a sleek black V-neck long-sleeve dress with a deep slit revealing her toned thigh, seated on a futuristic black streamlined modern chair. She crosses her legs, right over left, wearing black platform high-heel sandals with thin, sharp stilettos. Her left hand rests casually on the chair back, right hand placed on her knee, adorned with multiple gold jewelry pieces—bangles, rings, and a chunky necklace—creating a luxurious, powerful look. Her posture is relaxed yet tense, leaning slightly forward, head tilted, eyes locked on the lens, lips parted, expression cool and confident, exuding a high-fashion magazine cover presence. The background is pure vibrant red with high saturation, extending from wall to floor, creating an immersive closed space. At the top left, large black artistic text reads \"Harper's BAZAAR SINGAPORE,\" below it white italic \"Red Hot ROSE.\" The composition is centrally symmetrical, with the model slightly right of center, forming the focal point. Foreground emphasizes the chair and her silhouette, midground shows pose and accessory details, background amplifies red thematic atmosphere. Lighting from front above produces soft, even front illumination, with subtle shadows on floor and chair base, enhancing dimensionality. Clean, professional studio lighting. Color palette dominantly red and black, accented with gold, creating strong harmonious contrast. The scene exudes high-fashion and dramatic tension, like a meticulously planned commercial shoot. Captured with a high-resolution camera and standard lens, slight film grain texture, crisp detail. Perspective slightly low, level, tight framing, giving the subject presence and power. Overall vibe: hot, sensual, avant-garde, artistic, akin to a top fashion magazine cover.",
