          "alias": "单女露胸灰毛衣市场媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the middle of a bustling ancient market street, topless, her bare breasts fully exposed under a loosely slipped-off gray off-shoulder sweater that now bunches around her elbows. She wears only black wide-leg jeans, a small black bag slung low on her hip, and holds a black smartphone in her left hand while her right hand casually tousles her dark wavy hair. Her skin is pale and smooth, her face softly contoured with subtle makeup, her gaze directly at the camera with a lazy, confident expression. The background is a historic Turkish stone-arched market—black awnings, signs reading “FABRİK SATIŞ MAĞAZA,” hanging sausages, packaged foods. Crowds of pedestrians: elderly man in jacket, shoppers, tourists in heavy coats. Mid-ground cobblestone street extends into the distance, metal drainage edges, blurred passersby enhancing depth. Further back, layered buildings with balconies and windows, a minaret with gold trim under a cloudy grey sky. Soft diffuse overcast light, no harsh shadows. Wide-angle slightly tilted composition, the woman occupies the right third, creating asymmetrical balance, leading the eye from her naked torso down the street. Color palette of gray, black, brown with small accents of green, red, yellow from signs and packaging. Natural, documentary style with slight noise and low saturation, gritty everyday aesthetic. Detailed textures: cracks in stone, weathered walls, fabric folds, skin pores. A street-photography moment blending personal eroticism and urban observation—a traveler’s immersive, unposed instant in a foreign culture.",
