          "prompt": "A young woman in a selfie perspective, wearing a white Hello Kitty eye mask with a red bow, her long black hair cascading naturally with strands falling over her bare shoulders and onto her exposed breasts. She wears a tight white cropped T-shirt, now pulled up to reveal her full bare chest with pink nipples visible, the shirt printed with a pink heart containing a kitten in a pink bow. She pairs this with pink high-waist pants featuring drawstrings and red heart patterns, unbuttoned slightly to show her toned midriff. She holds a black smartphone with its flash activated, casting intense white light and lens flares across the frame. Her fingernails are painted pink, with a yellow-and-pink ring on her right hand and a thin silver ring on her left ring finger. She tilts her head slightly, gazing into the lens with a dazed, inviting expression, lips slightly parted, face soft and languid. The background is a pink wall with embossed floral decorations, retro and sweet, with light brown wooden flooring and a black chair leg barely visible. The close-up composition focuses on her face and the glowing phone, creating strong light contrast, radiating beams, and a dreamy, intimate, warmly erotic atmosphere. The scene is awash in pink tones with white and black accents, high saturation, vivid visual impact, capturing a hyper-realistic selfie moment in a bedroom or dressing room—a blend of commercial aesthetic and raw, personal allure, with rich detail and youthful, sexy confidence.",
