          "id": "krea2-b08ab6b410df024ae6f7dc32",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙椅上微笑坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman with light brown medium-long hair, blunt bangs, and soft waves sits indoors, her hair glossy with subtle highlights and a few strands falling beside her cheeks. Her large bright eyes have deep brown pupils, meticulously applied eye makeup with clear eyeliner, thick curled lashes, and naturally shaped eyebrows. Lips painted in vivid orange-red, full and slightly curved in a warm smile showing white teeth. She wears a tight low-cut red sleeveless dress, deep V-neckline revealing a generous expanse of cleavage, no inner shirt, the smooth shiny fabric hugging her curves. A thin chain necklace with a simple round metal pendant hangs from her left wrist. Her right hand makes a victory sign, fingers long with purple gradient glitter nail polish. She sits on a black chair, body slightly forward, left leg crossed over right, smooth leg lines. On the table in front, a pink book titled \"BETWEEN\" with a signature, edges worn, surface reflective. The black matte table and background show a black metal rack with professional audio equipment, mixing console, amplifiers, knobs, indicator lights, red cables, and a large black flight case with metal locks and handles, white lettering. Deep gray wall with vertical texture, a cream-colored pillar at the corner. Lighting from front-right, soft and even, highlighting her face and body, with slight highlights on hair and shoulders; equipment area is darker, creating depth. Composition: close-up portrait, head in upper third, gazing directly into the camera, foreground book and table add narrative, midground shows her body and chair, background equipment and wall. Warm, realistic atmosphere with red, black, gray, and accents of blue and orange. Detailed textures, candid moment like an impromptu backstage photo, slightly downward camera angle mimicking handheld phone shot, edges slightly blurred. The overall mood is relaxed, youthful, and inviting, with a subtle sensual edge from the exposed skin and confident pose.",
