          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a lavishly decorated vintage interior, wearing a cream fluffy fur coat that hangs open to reveal her bare breasts and toned stomach, paired with a black velvet off-shoulder top pushed down, a black high-waist leather mini skirt, and sheer black stockings. Her long black hair falls naturally, strands brushing her face, with precise makeup—dark-rimmed eyes and a soft nude-pink lip. She gently pulls the coat's lapels open wider, striking a lazy, confident pose, tilting her head down, gazing at the lens with a mysterious, sensual expression. Above, a massive crystal chandelier with transparent glass globes glows with warm golden light, casting soft highlights across her skin. Dark brown wooden walls with arched doorways, black-and-white checkerboard floor tiles, blurred figures and warm lights in the background suggest a bustling social event. Symmetrical composition, the woman centered slightly lower, foreground sharp, midground chandelier and walls, background depth with light bokeh. Warm top-light from chandelier creates smooth shadows on her face and body, enhancing curves and the glossy texture of the leather and stockings. Cinematic film quality, shallow depth of field, fine grain, high resolution, natural light, capturing a blend of high-fashion elegance and intimate, seductive atmosphere.",
