          "prompt": "A young woman takes a sultry selfie in front of a mirror, her glossy black hair styled into a high messy bun with soft strands framing her forehead. Her porcelain skin glows with a flawless, dewy finish, smoky eye makeup accentuating her intense gaze as she looks directly into the lens, full lips curved in a teasing, confident smile. She wears a sleek black off-shoulder dress with a wide white satin bow at the shoulder, the fabric hugging her curves and revealing a generous amount of cleavage. Around her neck hangs a vintage pearl choker with multiple strands, featuring a black enamel oval pendant engraved with gold filigree and bordered by tiny sparkling crystals. Her hands hold a smartphone with a green case dotted in white, a circular mirror charm with diamond border attached; her slender fingers with pale pink nails rest lightly on the device. Her free hand subtly tugs at the edge of her dress, hinting at nudity underneath. The background shows a large mirror reflecting the room, a beige window blind with soft natural light seeping through, and a pale gray wall with subtle texture. The close-up composition emphasizes her face and chest, the phone and hand anchoring the lower right corner. The overall mood is intimate, softly lit, capturing a candid yet seductive moment of modern elegance and allure.",
