          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a street along the Shanghai Bund, wearing a tight white cropped sleeveless top that barely covers her breasts, paired with a dangerously short white pleated miniskirt that reveals the curve of her hips, sheer white thigh-high socks, and a white diamond-quilted chain bag with a plush bear keychain. Her long hair falls naturally, her makeup is flawless, and she gazes directly into the lens with a sultry, confident expression, slightly turning her body and glancing back over her shoulder, showcasing a blend of fashion and youthful allure. In the foreground, a black road barrier with yellow warning stripes sits at the lower right corner, creating a leading line. The midground includes pedestrians and traffic, among them a red-haired woman in a blue denim skirt, a few passersby, and a white sedan. The background features a classic Shanghai cityscape: historic European-style buildings on the left, modern high-rises on the right, and the iconic Oriental Pearl Tower towering in the distance under a clear blue sky dotted with white clouds. Shot from a low angle, the woman occupies the center-left of the frame, enhancing depth. The lighting is bright natural daylight from above, casting soft shadows that emphasize her curves, with high contrast between light and dark. The palette is dominated by white, gray, and blue, with the red sphere of the Oriental Pearl Tower as a focal point. The overall image exudes urban chic and classic architecture, delivering a powerful visual impact, as if captured by a professional camera — rich in detail, layered, and brimming with contemporary life and sensual energy.",
