        {
          "id": "krea2-f9eb820bac2170ccd504fd46",
          "alias": "单女露胸红短裤公寓微笑站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against an indoor wooden wall, wearing a vibrant red racing-inspired outfit—now topless for an explicit NSFW look. She wears a red high-waist short shorts with silver \"ZENT\" belt and side lace-up details, along with a red baseball cap with a white logo, her long hair flowing naturally, some strands caught in a gentle breeze. She stands slightly tilted, left hand touching the brim of her cap, right hand resting at her side, red mesh gloves on her wrists, fingers long and elegant. Her eyes look softly into the lens, a confident and friendly smile on her lips. She wears high silver patent leather boots with thick soles and red accents, hugging her legs, emphasizing their length. Her body leans gracefully, creating an elegant curve. The background is a light wood panel wall with clear grain, warm tones, white vertical wainscoting below, and dark brown wood flooring with subtle reflections. The composition is a mid-shot, subject slightly right of center, simple background. Light comes from front-left, soft and even, illuminating her face and body, creating delicate shadow transitions, bright and warm. Metallic boots and outfit surfaces catch light specks. Overall color palette red, silver, white, high contrast and saturation. The atmosphere is energetic and modern, as if during a casual photo shoot—professional yet approachable. The image is highly detailed, from the shiny fabric texture to skin texture, realistic photography quality. Flat eye-level view, focusing on her overall look and expression, guiding the gaze to her face and outfit details. The mood is fashionable with a playful, cute charm, radiating youthful vitality and confident allure.",
