        {
          "id": "krea2-3e77c80128c239c7b9450b8e",
          "alias": "双女赛车女郎黑短裤媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "Two young women in matching race queen uniforms stride side by side on a wide asphalt track. The foreground woman dominates the frame, her glossy black hair cut in a straight fringe, dark eyes locked forward, lips slightly parted with a cool, seductive expression. She wears a tight black-and-red cropped top that leaves her midriff bare, her full breasts pressed against the fabric as if about to spill out. High-waisted black shorts hug her curved hips, a red diamond pattern on the side drawing the eye to her toned thighs. Black patent leather thigh-high stiletto boots cling to her calves, the polished surface gleaming with faint water residue. In her right hand she holds a closed white umbrella with a black handle, forming a clean vertical line. Behind her, a second woman stands at a slight angle, her long hair falling over her shoulders, wearing the same revealing red-and-black outfit, her side profile elegant as she glances toward her companion. The background blurs into track fencing and billboards with faint blue-and-white text. Gray asphalt, red caution strips, and white lane markings ground the scene. Low-angle shot emphasizes their elongated legs and commanding presence. Soft overcast lighting casts no harsh shadows, enhancing the natural sheen of skin and the glossy texture of the latex-like boots. The color palette is dominated by black, red, and gray with white and blue accents, creating a sharp, high-contrast visual. The overall mood fuses fashion, speed, and a professional yet intensely sensual atmosphere, as if captured by a high-end camera during a live racing event, with subtle film grain and rich detail. Every element—from the leading woman’s confident gaze to the subtle interplay between the two figures—exudes raw allure and commanding presence.",
