        {
          "id": "krea2-1da1f786cb4969f6fd63bdb3",
          "alias": "单女红旗袍城市忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman in a flowing red silk cheongsam sits sideways on an outdoor wooden bench, her black hair slicked back, exposing her long neck and delicate collarbone. Her deep, melancholic eyes lock onto the camera, lips slightly parted, exuding a cold, sensual beauty. The cheongsam is high-slit, rich wine-red satin with gold-and-black embroidered phoenixes and butterflies, thin black shoulder straps that reveal her bare back and shoulders — the top is unbuttoned, baring her breasts, the fabric draped loosely around her waist. She bends one knee up onto the bench, the other leg dangling, a black patent leather stiletto with ankle straps on her foot. One hand rests on her knee, the other lies gently on her thigh. Behind her, a weathered wooden pavilion with a sloping roof, beams casting shadows, dried leaves and gravel on the ground, distant blurry trees. Mid-shot, she is slightly right of center, body in an S curve, head turned toward the lens. Golden sunlight streams from the left through a gap in the roof, illuminating the right side of her body and face, creating strong chiaroscuro — warm yellow light against cool shadows. Foreground details sharp, background soft. Tone warm, colors red, black, brown with golden halos, high-contrast film grain aesthetic. No extra clutter, focus on her expression and curves, evoking vintage urban legends or wuxia cinema, with a mood of abandoned, mysterious sensuality.",
