          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a red velvet chair, wearing a beige short-sleeved T-shirt with its buttons undone, exposing her full breasts and a playful orange-yellow cartoon print on the fabric. She has on a green plaid miniskirt, white thigh-high socks, and black sneakers. Her dark hair is styled in two thick braids tied with white ribbons, and she wears round black-rimmed glasses, a professional wireless mic on her ear, a silver chain necklace, a bracelet, and pink-and-black nail art. She leans forward slightly, arms crossed and resting on her knees, hands gently clasped, gazing directly at the camera with a contemplative, soft expression, lips slightly parted. The background is blurred with partial figures—a woman in a striped sweater on the left and someone in a pink camouflage jacket on the right—and blue-and-red stage lights. Medium shot, warm tones, shallow depth of field, soft overhead lighting, film-grain aesthetic, giving a candid, backstage idol vibe.",
