        {
          "id": "krea2-23a5598b5755d285bf54c329",
          "alias": "单女全裸制服商店微笑蹲演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman squats naked in the refrigerated food aisle of a Japanese convenience store, her silky silver-gray hair cascading over her shoulders, bangs neatly covering her forehead, catching a cool metallic sheen under the fluorescent lights. Her bare skin is smooth and flawless, with subtle shadows from the side lighting accentuating her curves. She holds a transparent pack of instant food with Japanese labels and red promotional stickers in both hands, her nipples visible as she leans forward, a gentle smile playing on her lips. Her clean, natural makeup includes soft coral lipstick and subtle silver earrings that glint in the light. The close-up composition shows her from a slightly low angle, her body tilted to create a dynamic, inviting feel. Behind her, rows of chilled shelving display boxed bentos, rice balls, and pre-packaged foods with clear labels and prices. The lighting strips along the shelves cast a uniform cool white glow, illuminating the beige tiled floor, which reflects the light in soft patches. In the distance, a male customer in a black top and jeans walks past with a backpack, adding everyday authenticity. The image has a slight grain and desaturated filter, simulating a phone snapshot, with sharp focus on her face and hands, a shallow depth of field blurring the midground and background. The cold light creates a high-contrast rim light on her hair edges, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall tone is cool—silver, white, black—with accents of red from the packaging and warm food tones, balancing realism with a sensual, artistic atmosphere.",
