          "prompt": "A young woman stands with elegant confidence indoors, wearing a luxurious long light-brown fur coat, fluffy and soft, opened to reveal her nude torso—her bare skin smooth and pale under the coat's warmth. A silver sequin mini dress lies discarded at her feet, replaced by nothing but a shimmering pair of high-heeled sandals. Her neck is adorned with a multi-layered necklace of crystals and pearls, large geometric earrings catching cold light. She crosses her legs, one foot planted, the other bent at the knee, posing sensually and leisurely. Her right hand rests on her hip, left hand lightly lifts the fur sleeve, showing off her arm. Dark hair falls naturally, makeup sharp with defined eyeliner, full red lips, chiseled features, pale skin—a cold, alluring expression. She dominates the foreground from bottom left to center-right, placed on the right third of the frame, head slightly turned, gaze directly at the camera, creating strong visual pull. The background is a classic European interior: white wall with a fireplace mantel holding framed paintings (one of green plants and birds, another still life), dried flower vase, antique candlesticks. Above the fireplace hangs a bronze-framed mirror reflecting part of the room. A crystal chandelier hangs from the ceiling, gold frame with clear crystal drops, warm golden light bathing the space. To the right, a white louvered door with vertical slats and metal hinges. To the left, a white classical chair and table set, chair with vertical back slats, table covered with light cloth, papers or books scattered. Floor is light wood parquet with slight reflections, a gray-blue patterned rug. Overall lighting from chandelier and side wall sconces, soft warm yellow tones centered on her body, making her the focal point, background slightly blurred. Color palette: off-white, light brown, silver-gray, touches of gold and red; noble, elegant, slightly mysterious. Composition stable, perspective balanced, strong depth and spatial layers, rich detail, realistic texture, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, subtle film grain, natural depth of field, amateur-style authenticity with artistic sophistication, capturing a moment of luxurious life. Light and shadow transition naturally, colors harmonious, powerful visual impact.",
