          "id": "krea2-1e880471982c85b50da013c0",
          "alias": "单女白西装镜前沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a slick white reflective floor, wearing a sharply tailored white blazer completely open, revealing her bare chest—only a thin silver chain necklace adorns her skin. Her golden hair is pulled back into a high ponytail that cascades over her shoulder, glowing in soft light. She has precise eyeliner and full red lips, her gaze direct and aloof, exuding cool confidence. Her legs are crossed: one foot in a bright fuchsia satin stiletto heel with a mirror-metal finish and a sparkling silver crystal buckle, the other foot lifted slightly with toes pointed, creating an elegant line. Her hand rests casually on the floor, nails neat with clear polish. The background is a pure pale blue-grey gradient sky with faint clouds, like dusk. Light falls from above and the side, creating soft, diffused illumination. The entire scene feels surreal and dreamlike, shot from a low angle that accentuates her stature and presence. The foreground highlights her feet and heels, the midground her body and blazer, and the background the vast sky—building strong depth. The color palette is dominated by white with the bright pink shoes as the focal point; cool tones contrast with warm skin and shoes. The viewer’s eye is drawn first to the vivid heels, then up to her face, then outward to the sky. Shadows are soft, reflections crisp, with the floor perfectly mirroring her figure. Details are rich: the fabric folds of the suit, the glossy satin of the shoes, the texture of her skin, the smoothness of her hair. The overall style blends high fashion with effortless chic, as if a fashion influencer’s curated daily look, clean and minimal, emphasizing her confident, independent elegance. Suitable for a luxury editorial or personal brand image.",
