          "id": "krea2-d389efead99e2703c41eddd9",
          "alias": "单女橙连衣裙公寓困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a smooth white circular platform, her long, silky pale blonde hair glowing under soft pink-violet light. Her fair, flawless skin and delicate, sculpted features catch the dreamy glow; her eyes are half-lidded and hazy, staring directly at the lens, lips parted in a lazy, enigmatic expression. She wears a tight, sleeveless orange dress that clings to every curve, cut low at the neckline to reveal the swell of her breasts and the outline of her nipples through the thin fabric. The dress is short, barely covering her thighs, emphasizing the length of her bare legs. Her right leg is bent, left leg extended, both bare and smooth. She wears orange strappy stiletto heels with thin, elegant straps crisscrossing her ankles. Her left hand rests lightly on her knee, fingers long and graceful, a simple ring on one finger; her right hand lies flat on the platform, palm open, in a relaxed, inviting pose. Her body tilts slightly, creating a dynamic balance. The entire scene is bathed in a dreamy pink-purple hue, with a pure pale pink wall behind, no distractions. The floor is a deep purple reflective liquid, like ink or mirror water, perfectly reflecting the figure and platform in a symmetric mirrored composition. The subject is placed off-center left, the circular platform guiding the eye, while her seated pose and extended leg create a strong diagonal visual line, adding depth. Lighting comes from above and front, soft and even, with no harsh shadows, unifying the warm orange and cool pink-purple tones. The atmosphere is futuristic yet romantic, with an artistic, high-fashion aesthetic, but also the raw, honest feel of a casual indoor shot captured with a simple camera—rich in detail, realistic, and sensual. The overall mood is quiet, ethereal, and deeply alluring.",
