        {
          "id": "krea2-0d6e7cb785f6865abc860604",
          "alias": "单女米浴巾困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the deck of a boat, loosely wrapped in a soft beige towel that barely covers her bare skin, her long black hair slightly damp with strands clinging to her forehead and cheeks. She wears black sunglasses pushed up on her head, revealing clear eyebrows and deep, dreamy eyes looking slightly distant at the camera. Her lips are slightly parted, expression calm with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her shoulder is slightly tilted, head resting on her arm, relaxed and casual as if immersed in the tranquil sunset atmosphere. The towel slips precariously, exposing one bare shoulder and the upper curve of her breast, adding a subtle erotic tension. Foreground: half-body close-up occupying the lower right corner, strong visual focus. Midground: wide sea surface deep blue with sparkling reflections of golden sunset light, slight ripples giving dynamic feel. Distant horizon shows silhouette of a small sailboat faintly visible, adding depth. Background: gorgeous twilight sky, sun slowly setting emitting intense orange-red light, clouds colored in gradients of golden, orange, purple, with soft light transitions. Colors transition from bright orange near horizon to gray-blue above, creating warm yet slightly melancholic dusk mood. Composition uses rule of thirds, figure at lower right, gaze toward upper left, leading viewer's eye from figure to distant sunset and sea-sky meeting point. Lighting from low-angle sunset, typical rim light and side-back light, face softly lit with warm halo on edges, skin texture detailed, with slight film grain and minor overexposed highlights to enhance realism. Overall warm tones: orange, gold, brown, deep blue contrast, romantic, quiet, slightly nostalgic atmosphere with film-like quality, moderate saturation, noticeable grain simulating real phone or camera capture, emphasizing everyday recording style without perfect lighting, preserving natural imperfections like water droplets, hair strands, fabric folds to highlight real life. Overall style combines artistry and documentary feel, like an accidental capture during a trip, full of emotional tension and story, conveying tranquility and freedom away from noise.",
