        {
          "id": "krea2-cf606b2c908002411a89de33",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝背心节庆困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands barefoot on the wet ground of an outdoor music festival, her blue sports vest discarded, leaving her completely topless—her pert breasts slick with rain and sweat, nipples hardened. She wears only a white bikini bottom and frayed denim shorts, her long black hair braided into two strands adorned with gleaming silver chains that rest against her bare chest. Transparent goggles sit atop her head, her gaze locked directly at the camera with parted lips and bold red makeup, flawless pale skin dotted with faint freckles on her right shoulder. A blue wristband circles her left wrist, and she holds a blue water gun with a yellow nozzle, the barrel glistening wet. Her pose is relaxed, body angled slightly toward the lens, water droplets on her skin catching the stage lights. In the background: a vibrant festival scene with flashing stage lights, a massive LED screen displaying colorful patterns, complex scaffolding covered in lighting rigs and speakers, distant rolling hills under a heavy gray-blue sky, damp reflective ground, a dense crowd in summer attire—some holding pink water guns, others with pink backpacks. The overall atmosphere is energetic and wild, with a central composition placing her slightly left of center, foreground sharp and clear, midground filled with crowd and partial stage, background full stage and distant mountains. Visual flow starts from her face, moves down to the water gun in her hand, then to the distant stage. Lighting mixes stage beams and natural twilight, creating a cool-warm contrast with blue light illuminating her skin and the scene, producing a dreamy yet dynamic night vibe. The image feels intensely realistic and documentary-like, as if shot with a professional camera, rich in detail, high color saturation, moderate sharpness, evoking the authentic texture of amateur gear while employing artistic lighting to heighten visual impact and emotional intensity.",
