          "prompt": "A blonde woman poses in a luxurious black velvet gown with a large bow on one shoulder, the neckline plunging deep to reveal her bare breasts, nipple subtly peaked. She wears a delicate tiara studded with pink and clear gemstones, a heart-shaped ruby at its center; her smile is bright, eyes sparkling with joy, lips parted as if in song. Her golden hair cascades in soft waves, small diamond earrings catch the light, and a pearl necklace with silver accents rests on her collarbone. She wears a white inner dress beneath an open black coat, a pink \"Happy Birthday\" sash draped across her chest, one hand holding a handwritten letter, the other a decorative magic wand topped with a heart-shaped gem. Black long gloves cover her arms, a red gem ring adorns her right ring finger. The warm orange room features round white ceiling lights, a single red balloon floats at upper right, blurred festive decorations and potted plants in the background. Soft, even lighting from front and above casts a gentle glow on her skin, natural shadows sculpting her form. Medium shot, upper body, she stands slightly left of center, head tilted, gaze directed up and to the right, creating a dynamic, interactive feel. Rich tones of black, white, pink, gold, and orange blend in a dreamy, celebratory scene. Photorealistic with subtle film grain and fine detail, capturing a moment of sensual festivity.",
