        {
          "id": "krea2-6b3e3d894083beec10d6c880",
          "alias": "单女半褪蓝外套海报媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female model with dark, silky hair stares confidently at the camera with a cool, piercing gaze. Her sharp eye makeup and warm brown-red lips enhance her fierce expression. She wears a white cami top pulled taut across her full breasts, the thin straps sliding off one shoulder, revealing the smooth curve of her collarbone and the glint of a diamond choker. Her blue-and-white baseball jacket is unzipped and pushed back, exposing her bare midriff and the soft skin of her toned stomach. High-waisted ripped jeans sit low on her hips, the fabric frayed and torn to reveal the inner thigh. Her right hand lifts in an elegant gesture, silver rings catching the light, a delicate chain bracelet at her wrist. Multiple layered necklaces—a diamond choker, a heart pendant, and a crystal strand—rest against her décolletage. In the foreground left, a blue-purple gradient flower glows with soft edges; a retro blue film camera sits at lower right, surrounded by scattered pearls that curve diagonally across the frame. The dark gray gradient background features bold white \"FASHION\" text, with \"SUMMER 26 02 JAN 2026 MAGAZINE 01\" and \"FASHION MAGAZINE COVER 01\" at the top. \"PRESENT BY FELIX NAVINDA\" with stars appears mid-left, and a blue Gothic box reads \"Bold Unstoppable.\" A blue star with \"01\" sits on the right. The model stands off-center, body slightly tilted, with dynamic tension. Light falls from front-left, creating soft shadows that accentuate her curves, the wet sheen on her lips, and the gleam of skin under the open jacket. High saturation, high contrast, a blend of streetwear cool and seductive editorial glamour.",
