        {
          "id": "krea2-4a84d35f3680a6ce4d0289c6",
          "alias": "单女露胸街道困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a half-body portrait, centered slightly left, her long black wavy hair cascading naturally, with a few strands brushing against her cheek and shoulder. Her eyes are clear and deep, staring directly into the lens, lips slightly parted in soft coral pink. Her makeup is refined but natural, highlighting her skin texture and sculpted facial features. She wears simple white pearl earrings, adding an elegant touch. She is completely topless, her bare shoulders and chest exposed, the smooth curve of her collarbone and the soft swell of her breasts catching the low-key light. Her pose is relaxed and confident, body slightly turned, head tilted, exuding a languid yet alluring vibe. The foreground centers on her as the main visual focus, against a deep black background with grain and slight noise, creating a retro film-photography texture. In the midground, abstract geometric shapes and layered text overlay the scene, including the massive bold sans-serif word \"CELEBRITY\" in weathered, distorted letters, stacked and misaligned. Some letters are partially obscured or blurred by circular light flares, adding depth. Multiple dark muted green circular patterns appear, textured like faded poster stains, some containing faint letters or symbols. Black-and-white spiral wave patterns radiate from behind her like sound waves or visual ripples, adding motion and mystery. Tiny white speckles and scratch marks are scattered across the background, simulating the wear of an old photo. The composition is asymmetrical, with the figure and text elements interwoven for dynamic balance. Her direct gaze pulls the viewer in, while the \"CELEBRITY\" text arcs around her, guiding the eye around the frame. Lighting is low-contrast and soft, from the front right, evenly illuminating her face and torso, with gentle shadows and no harsh contrast. The overall tone is cool, with a slight blue tint, evoking a mood of cool detachment and melancholic distance. The color palette is primarily black, white, and gray, punctuated by muted green highlights, modern and unified. The image blends pop culture, street art, and retro aesthetics with strong visual storytelling and emotional tension—like a professional medium-format portrait shot under dim light, with slight lens distortion and bokeh, mimicking real photographic depth and detail. Multiple text elements are embedded: at the top, \"IU CELEBRITY GRAPHIC POSTER\" and \"@SCORPIOBB\"; upper right \"IU8\"; lower left a mix of Korean and English lyrics \"OUTSIDER (UH, HUH)\" and \"You're my CELEBRITY\". These texts vary in font, size, and transparency, creating a collage effect that enhances layering and information density. The overall atmosphere feels like a meticulously designed album cover or a personal artistic statement, exploring themes of identity, self-perception, and public image.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
