        {
          "id": "krea2-f999c2aae380432bbc7433e2",
          "alias": "单女全裸米靴子电梯媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with short pink hair and blunt bangs sits on indoor marble steps, her pale skin glowing under warm yellow light. She is completely nude except for chunky beige combat boots with metal studs and lacing, and layered silver bracelets and necklaces. Her legs are slightly parted, one hand resting on her inner thigh, the other propping up her chin with fingers splayed. She stares directly into the camera with a lazy, confident smirk, red lips parted. The marble steps have metal edges; behind her, a beige wall with simple geometric lines, an elevator door, and a circular clock. Dark green marble floor with natural veins. The composition is centered, slightly looking down, with soft shadows and highlights on her face, arms, and thighs. The overall tone is warm amber and muted green, creating a sensual, fashion-editorial feel with raw, intimate realism.",
