          "alias": "单女全裸黑西装广场冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on classical stone stairs, wearing a black velvet blazer left open over a deep V-neck black satin crop top that reveals her full breasts, paired with high-waisted black leather slim-fit pants and cream pointed-toe stiletto heels with sparkling crystal chain ankle straps. Her long straight black hair falls naturally over her shoulders; her makeup is refined with defined eyeliner and nude lips. She wears silver diamond-studded necklace, earrings, and rings. In her right hand she holds a square diamond-encrusted clutch with a metal chain, while her left hand rests casually on her knee. Her body leans slightly, head tilted, eyes locked on the camera with cool, confident seduction. The background features warm-toned marble steps with fine texture and natural gloss, evoking vintage architecture; a white stone pillar is visible on the right. Soft light streams from the upper left, creating chiaroscuro that highlights skin, leather, silk, and metallic reflections. Mid-shot composition with the figure slightly left of center, legs crossed and extending downward, guiding the eye from heels upward. Black dominates, accented by cream and silver. The image has professional studio clarity and depth, blending luxury with everyday urban fashion. Atmosphere is cool and captivating, a frozen moment of elegant allure.",
