          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a sensual side pose indoors, her body leaning back, head tilted up, eyes closed, lost in private reverie. Her long, thick black curly hair cascades to her waist, glossy and voluminous. She is topless, revealing full bare breasts and smooth, pale skin, with only a few lifelike red rose decorations artfully placed on her chest and back. Her face is refined with subtle makeup and full red lips. A deep red velvet backless dress is partially undone, draped around her waist, with thin red ribbon straps tied in bows and trailing sashes. The dress features intricate red velvet roses along the back and waist. Her right arm hangs naturally, hand resting on a white marble table; she wears a simple silver ring, a gold spiral bracelet, a wide silver bracelet, and small silver earrings. The foreground is a smooth white marble tabletop with gray veins. She is framed on the right side of the composition, looking left, creating dynamic balance. Background: a light gray wall and a white door with a silver handle. A warm recessed light from above casts soft shadows, accentuating her bare skin and the dress’s texture. The atmosphere is warm, intimate, and luxurious, with dominant red tones against cool white and gray. The view is slightly from above, with visual flow from her hair to the rose decorations on her back, then along her arm to the table. Overall, a poetic, cinematic, and elegant yet explicitly sensual scene, blending modern femininity and independence.",
