          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long golden blonde hair with blunt bangs framing her sharp, intense eyes. Her lips are slightly parted, wearing a black headset microphone, exuding commanding performer energy. Her skin is pale and flawless, face sculpted with high cheekbones and a defined jawline. Heavy layered eye makeup with deep eyeliner and shimmering eyeshadow creates a captivating gaze. She wears a black leather-tight bodysuit, but the V-neck is cut deeply down to her navel, exposing her bare breasts with nipples visible, the fabric only covering the sides and waist. The bodysuit is studded with metal rivets and chains, with exaggerated spiked shoulder pieces. The waist is cinched tight, emphasizing her hourglass figure. The overall look is punk futuristic. Background is a dark stage with faint horizontal white light bars creating geometric lines. Medium close-up, she stands slightly to the left, body angled slightly toward the camera, arms relaxed at her sides. She exudes confident poise. Lighting comes from above front, casting smooth highlights and shadows that accentuate her skin texture and the metallic details on the black outfit, creating subtle reflections. The mood is cold and mysterious, powerful stage presence and high fashion. The image resembles a professional studio shot for a fashion magazine cover or a concert still, rich in detail, balanced black-gold tones with skin and blue background accents. No distractions, all focus on this charismatic performer, her every detail from hair to makeup to outfit telling a story of courage, confidence, and self-expression. The close framing makes the viewer feel the rhythm of her breathing and the pulse of her heart, as if present in the electrifying moment of a live performance.",
