          "id": "krea2-f0744445602b5b9faa395ce2",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣广场媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands centered in the frame, her long black hair pulled into two high pigtails tied with massive black satin bows, strands naturally falling and brushing against her cheeks, adding a lively yet tender touch. She stares directly into the lens with a deep, focused gaze, her makeup impeccable—crimson lips slightly parted, exuding a cold, seductive allure. She wears a black velvet strappy bodysuit featuring a heart-shaped neckline trimmed with gold chain accents, a row of gold circular clasps adorning the chest; the waist is cinched by a wide black belt with ornate gold filigree buckle and layered gold chain fringe. The bottom is a pair of shorts edged with glittering gold sequin trim, blending gothic fashion with contemporary style. Around her neck is a black choker set with a square crystal pendant; black stud earrings with sparkling gems adorn her ears; rings grace her fingers, her hands relaxed and slightly curled. The background is a blurred indoor space with a large circular arch behind her, from which warm orange-yellow light spills, surrounded by scattered light orbs and halos that create a dreamlike atmosphere. Backlighting casts a soft rim light around her figure, producing strong chiaroscuro in the foreground and making her stand out. The overall palette is black and gold, complemented by warm orange lighting, delivering powerful visual impact. The composition is symmetrical, with the subject dominating the frame; the background is defocused to emphasize her presence. The viewer's eye is drawn along her gaze and posture toward the center. The interplay of backlight and side light enhances depth and texture, evoking a mysterious, elegant, futuristic fashion-show or virtual-world character. The image is finely detailed, highly artistic, with cinematic quality, yet retains a slight natural grain and smooth depth-of-field transitions that balance refinement with realism. Color saturation is moderate, light transitions smooth, presenting a unique aesthetic that fuses high-end fashion with everyday authenticity.",
