        {
          "id": "krea2-a2454b349b0e1e8ed03942eb",
          "alias": "单女露胸白西装广场媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a modern white spiral staircase, her short black hair neatly styled with soft inward-curled ends and natural bangs. Her facial features are clear, eyes gazing at the camera with a gentle, slightly lazy look, lips parted in a relaxed, natural state. Her skin is fair and delicate, makeup refined but not overstated, emphasizing her bone structure and natural beauty. She wears a tailored white blazer—single-breasted with simple lapels, slightly tightened cuffs, and an A-line hem—paired with a matching white mini skirt that ends mid-thigh, revealing long, toned legs. A wide black silk ribbon wraps around her waist, falling to one side, creating sharp contrast and adding a sense of fashion and layering. On her feet are high black leather boots with a glossy finish, thick block heels, and square toes, the shafts hugging her legs for an elegant yet powerful silhouette. Her right hand rests lightly on the metal handrail of the staircase, fingers long with light nail polish; her left hand hangs naturally at her side, her posture calm and confident. Her body turns slightly to the side, right leg bent and lifted with toes touching a step, left leg supporting her weight, forming a graceful S-curve. The entire body is well-proportioned, exuding the polished charm of a modern urban woman. In the foreground, the spiral staircase's silver metal handrail and partial steps curve upward, connecting to white posts and balusters; the steps are light wood with clean edges. In the midground, the woman occupies the left side of the frame, her pose natural and fluid. The composition uses the spiral staircase's curves to guide the eye upward, creating dynamic visual flow. The background is a large pure white wall with subtle vertical texture, lending a clean, minimalist space. Light is even and soft, diffused from above and front, making the scene bright and airy, shadows gentle, no harsh contrasts, naturally highlighting her figure and clothing details. The atmosphere is peaceful and elegant, with an aesthetic of modern minimalism. The overall palette is mostly white with black accents, forming a classic black-and-white contrast that is both visually striking and refined. The image is sharp and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera but retaining a natural, everyday photographic feel. The lens is an 85mm portrait lens at f/1.8, focus precisely on her face, background slightly blurred for a shallow depth-of-field, enhancing subject prominence. The composition follows the rule of thirds, placing her at the left golden point, leaving space on the right for the staircase to rise, resulting in a balanced and dynamic layout. The overall vibe blends artistry with a sense of real life, like a captured moment in a high-end apartment or art gallery—authentic and captivating. The image is in high-definition photo-realistic style, color saturation moderate, rich details: skin texture, fabric folds, leather sheen all visible. It conveys a cool, confident, independent female image, suitable for fashion magazine covers, personal portraits, or brand promotion, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance. To make it NSFW: The woman is now topless, the white blazer left open and pushed aside, revealing her bare breasts, nipples hard against the cool air. Her skirt remains, but hiked up slightly, exposing the upper curve of her thighs and the edge of black lace underwear. Her pose has shifted—one hand on the railing, the other lifting a breast slightly, head tilted back with a sultry, confident expression as she looks down the lens. The lighting catches the sheen on her skin and the leather of her boots, the white suit fabric crumpled around her torso. The scene retains its minimalist elegance but now carries an explicit, sensual charge, blending high-fashion allure with raw eroticism.",
