          "alias": "单女半褪粉毛衣椅上沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal bar stool in an industrial-style café, leaning forward slightly, hands clasped under her chin, gazing directly at the camera with a contemplative, tender expression. She has shoulder-length dark brown hair with neat bangs resting on her forehead, fair skin, refined natural makeup, and soft rose-pink lips. She wears a light pink high-neck tight knit top, the collar pulled down just enough to reveal her collarbones and a hint of cleavage, the fabric clinging to her elegant curves. She is paired with a high-waist black mini skirt, a slim black belt cinching her waist, and matte black suede thigh-high boots with a moderate chunky heel, hugging her legs. She sits at a corner table of dark gray metal, on which sits a plain black ceramic mug and a small white decorative object (possibly a candle or ornament). The background is a mottled cement wall with green stripe accents, some areas showing raw texture and stains, and a dark gray metal panel screwed to the right. Another empty metal chair is visible on the left. The floor is terrazzo with fine chips and wear marks, creating a vintage, authentic atmosphere. Side natural light softly illuminates her face and body, producing subtle chiaroscuro, with shadows concentrating behind her and on the floor, evoking a quiet, warm mood. The composition is a mid-shot with the subject positioned slightly left, leaving room for the table and background elements, enhancing depth. The foreground highlights her pose and clothing details, the mid-ground includes the table and chair, and the background shows the wall and farther environment. The color palette is dominated by gray, black, and brown, with the light pink top as a visual accent. The light comes from the upper left, casting soft shadows on her face and arms, enhancing dimensionality. The atmosphere is serene and slightly artistic, capturing a brief moment of solitude in an afternoon café. The image has a documentary-style quality with rich detail and layered storytelling.",
