          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a seaside rock, topless, her bare breasts exposed, wearing only red-and-yellow striped bikini bottoms that cling to her hips. She sports a cream-white baseball cap with a dark brown brim, her dark hair tied back with loose strands falling across her forehead. She wears a black half-finger glove on her left hand, while her right hand lifts in a playful V-sign, her bright eyes locked on the camera with a warm, inviting smile. In her left hand she grips a black fishing rod with a silver reel, the line curving slightly. Her feet are in classic red canvas sneakers, white laces and toe cap contrasting. She leans forward slightly, legs crossed, knees bent, showing off her toned, healthy body. The foreground captures her face, torso, and the rod, which cuts a diagonal line upward. The midground shows rough gray-brown rock dotted with sand and pebbles, a bit of seaweed. The background opens to a clear blue-green sea sparkling under sunlight, distant green hills, a small building with a blue wavy roof, and boats. Sky is clear blue, light from upper right creates a soft backlight, rimming her silhouette and casting subtle shadows on her cheeks, collarbone, and arms. The warm, bright tones give a natural, candid feel, like a casual snapshot—intimate, joyful, and sensual, capturing the essence of a carefree seaside summer day.",
