        {
          "id": "krea2-5bf318d1b203521c76358c2e",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤广场戏谑自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a selfie pose fills the frame, her jet-black bob with straight bangs framing a face with bright, focused eyes and a playful smirk. Her right hand lifts, index finger gently pressing against her nose in a teasing gesture. Skin is pale and luminous under soft lighting, with precise eyeliner and shimmery eyeshadow; lips are a soft pink. She wears a black, one-shoulder cropped top that barely covers her chest, studded with tiny silver rhinestones that catch the light, leaving one shoulder and collarbone fully exposed. Around her neck, two silver chains—a chunky link and a fine chain with a tiny pendant—add a cool edge. Her lower half is clad in high-waisted black vinyl shorts, glossy, with metal rivets and a prominent buckle, hugging her hips. A small earring (pearl or crystal) glints on her left ear. The background is a dark gray indoor space with large square tiles showing scuffs and reflections; blurred black equipment suggests a backstage or rehearsal area. The shot is tight, from above chest to below knee, with a slightly tilted camera for a casual feel. Light comes from the front-right, casting soft shadows across her face and body, emphasizing curves and the hint of cleavage. The overall palette is black, gray, silver, with bright highlights on her makeup and outfit, creating a modern, cool, slightly edgy atmosphere—as if a pop star caught mid-grin after a performance, sensual and confident.",
