        {
          "id": "krea2-1089e6a00cad6ec509359080",
          "alias": "单女黑连帽衫街道困倦行走躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman walks down a city street, her natural light-green hair cascading with a cool-toned sheen, a straight fringe brushing her forehead as strands drift in the breeze. Her sharp side profile shows a high-bridged nose and lips parted slightly, her expression focused yet tired. She raises her right hand to touch the corner of her eye, adjusting makeup or shielding the light, a fluid gesture of casual elegance. She wears a loose black velour hoodie, zipped halfway open to reveal a black lace bra, cleavage visible, the soft matte fabric moving as she walks. The hem of the hoodie lifts slightly, exposing the edge of a brown miniskirt with subtle wrinkles, hinting at the line of her black thigh-high stockings that cling to her long, straight legs. On her feet are dark brown chunky boots with a mid-calf shaft, the leather showing slight wear and a vintage texture, rounded toe, sturdy heel. Over her shoulder hangs a black leather tote bag with classic embossed pattern, zipper detail crisp, the thick strap resting on her arm; inside, a white earphone case and a red card peek out, adding color contrast. She strides across a crosswalk of white stripes on gray concrete, with yellow tactile paving tiles texture visible, the background a blurred cityscape of modern white columns and smooth walls, pedestrians with suitcases in the distance. The sky is pale blue, soft overcast light like morning or evening, creating a quiet everyday atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, she is slightly left of center, body in motion with one leg forward, one back, weight shifting, the camera slightly tilted for dynamism. The parallel lines of the crosswalk guide the eye toward her, with the yellow tiles in foreground and blurred crowd in background building depth. Light falls evenly but with subtle shadows in fabric folds and on skin, enhancing realism. The palette is black, gray, white, with touches of brown and red, giving a documentary street-photo feel, rich in detail, narrative, and emotional tension, capturing a confident yet understated personal style.",
