          "alias": "单女红制服酒店微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman in a deep red high-neck long-sleeve uniform blazer stands at the reception desk of a luxurious hotel lobby. She has long, straight black hair falling over her shoulders, a clear and dignified face, gentle and focused eyes, a polite smile, and hands folded lightly over her abdomen, posture elegant and composed. The uniform blazer is form-fitting and fully open at the front, leaving her bare chest and erect nipples exposed, the high neck still framing her throat and collarbone. A gold badge and name tag remain pinned to one lapel. The scene is centered on her from waist to head, with the wooden reception desk edge and a white-shaded floor lamp in the midground, soft warm light spilling across her skin and the desk. The background features marble-textured wall panels and vertical striped beige curtains, with a gold-framed mirror or frame visible on the right. The composition is symmetrical, drawing focus to her body. Lighting comes from a warm yellow source on the left, creating gentle chiaroscuro on her face, arms, and breasts, enhancing three-dimensionality and texture. The overall color palette is red, beige, gold, and dark brown, evoking a luxurious and cozy hotel ambience. The image has a strong sense of amateur realism, as if captured with a mid-range consumer camera under indoor light, with slight noise and natural color shifts, presenting an intimate and authentic snapshot. Details are rich and layered, balancing professional composure with raw sensuality. The atmosphere is quiet, warm, and elegant, embodying modern urban sophistication.",
