        {
          "id": "krea2-920db9887c8455a147f6815e",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服家中媚态注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a low-cut black velvet evening gown, the bodice barely covering her breasts, with delicate black ribbon bows at the shoulders and long sleeves. She wears a silver tiara studded with sparkling crystals and diamonds, her hair softly curled and falling naturally with a few strands brushing her forehead. Heavy makeup with plump red lips and smoky eyes, her gaze slightly dazed and seductive toward the camera. Her left hand is clad in a black velvet long glove, elegantly holding a flute of golden champagne, tiny bubbles rising in the clear glass. Left side: white venetian blinds, sunlight streaming through to create sharp light and shadow lines. Right side: a pale beige wall with fine cracks and peeling patches, next to a dark brown wooden furniture edge with smooth surface and vintage carved details. Medium shot, woman slightly to the left, body turned slightly, head facing the lens, natural visual flow. Light from the left creates warm backlighting, casting shadows on the wall and behind her, enhancing volume and depth. Background blurred to emphasize her. Color palette: black, gold, beige with cool-warm contrast, merging luxury and everyday intimacy as if an elegant photoshoot in a private home. Cinematic texture, artistic atmosphere, rich details: soft velvet sheen, crystal sparkle, glass transparency. Overall mood: romantic yet mysterious, full of narrative and emotional tension, like a visual poem of a modern independent woman. Style blends fashion photography with lifestyle aesthetics, with slight low-light film grain and natural noise for realism. Tones warm but with preserved shadow details, clear silhouette, delicate emotion. Balanced yet dynamic composition, using light to combine her noble aura with homely warmth, creating a dreamy yet grounded unique beauty. NSFW: dress is deeply plunging, with one shoulder strap slipped down, hinting at bare skin; the champagne glass slightly tilted, a drop on her gloved hand.",
