mera, with natural grain and slight exposure variance, preserving authenticity. Color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, accented by the drink's brownish-yellow and the background's pink-purple glow. The composition is stable, emotions restrained, conveying a carefree, self-possessed yet slightly lonely urban woman's lifestyle—now fully nude and sexualized for NSFW context.",
