          "alias": "单女舞者白衬衫舞台冷淡站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "In the center of a brilliantly lit stage, a female dancer wearing a see-through white blouse and a black mini skirt strikes a powerful pose, showcasing the energy of her performance. Her hair is tied in a high ponytail, with loose strands falling naturally across her face, adding softness and motion. She slightly turns her body and glances back, her eyes radiating confidence and seduction, lips parted as if lost in the rhythm of the music. Her left hand rests on her hip, right hand hangs naturally, and her body forms an elegant S-curve. Her right leg is lifted high, foot clad in a black stiletto heel pressing sharply into the floor, revealing strong, toned leg lines. Black lace thigh-high stockings stretch from upper thigh to calf, accentuating her long legs and contrasting with the short skirt, blending sexy and stylish. Behind her, another dancer in a white top and black skirt stands with back to camera, hands on hips, creating a dynamic interaction. On the right side of the frame, an arm reaches into the shot, seeming to coordinate with the dance, enhancing the live-performance feel. The background is a large black curtain with bold white graffiti reading \"BLACK,\" strokes sharp, street-art style. Above, a row of red LED strips glow softly in rhythm, mixing with cool reflections from the floor, creating strong warm-cool contrast. The stage floor mirrors the dancers and lights, deepening the space and visual layers. The shot is mid-angle, focusing on the foreground dancer's figure while keeping background elements intact. She occupies center-left, tilted to guide the eye rightward, forming a flowing visual line. The large lettering on the left enriches the composition and reinforces brand or theme recognition. Lighting comes from overhead spotlights from front and side, making facial features and body details crisp, while shadows are skillfully used for depth. The overall mood blends modern pop, sexy allure, and street rebellion. Colors are mostly black-and-white accented with red, creating strong visual impact. The image texture is sharp yet slightly grainy, like pro photography with subtle film noise, mimicking a live-camera capture that feels both refined and authentic. The whole scene resembles a choreographed K-pop performance, brimming with energy, passion, and fashion aesthetic, making viewers feel as if they're at a loud concert, experiencing the perfect fusion of music and body language.",
