          "id": "krea2-b411bba50a59066f5275e8a6",
          "alias": "单女黑西装城市媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a white door in an indoor hallway, wearing a fitted black blazer open over a black lace bustier that hugs her curves, paired with high-waisted black trousers—the look fuses professional with provocative, exuding a cool, mysterious urban femme-fatale vibe. Her dark hair is swept into a sleek bun with a few loose strands falling across her forehead, adding a touch of careless allure. Thin-rimmed glasses catch faint light, her eyes locked on the lens with a calm, distant expression. Her lips are dusted a pale pink, elegant yet vibrant. Her right hand rests lightly against the doorframe, arm lines smooth; her left hand is tucked into her trouser pocket, posture relaxed but charged with tension, radiating effortless confidence and control. The composition places her slightly off-center in a close-up foreground, emphasizing facial features and the delicate lace of her bustier. The background is minimal: a white door panel with subtle grain, a metal handle, pale gray smooth walls, dark gray floor tiles with a faint reflective edge, shallow depth of field blurring the door and wall. The doorframe acts as a natural frame, vertical lines contrasting with her body’s curves. Lighting comes from the front side, soft and even, washing over her face and upper body, casting soft shadows on the doorframe and wall—cool-toned, evoking a modern urban stillness. The overall mood is reserved, introspective, storytelling—a private moment captured, blending everyday casualness with curated fashion. The image has fine detail, a monochrome palette of blacks, grays, and whites, punctuated by the warm hint of lipstick, style akin to contemporary urban photography with a strong personal aesthetic—independent, confident, slightly enigmatic feminine allure. Subtle film grain texture adds realism and warmth, as if shot with a professional camera in low light, preserving natural light-and-shadow depth.",
