        {
          "id": "krea2-5ee97df3c8eba417af2bc683",
          "alias": "单女露胸金短裤家中微笑站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman with a shoulder-length bob and blunt bangs, her hair tied into twin pigtails with blue ribbon bows and yellow tassel earrings, stands topless except for a black wide belt with gold ornamentation and low-rise gold shorts. Her body is bare, revealing smooth skin and subtle muscle definition; her arms are adorned with yellow tassels and metal clasps at the shoulders. She flashes a sweet, bright smile, lips parted slightly, eyes clear and inviting. She strikes a high-kick pose: right arm raised high overhead, left arm relaxed at her side, right leg lifted in a dynamic kick, left foot planted in black flat shoes with small white floral details. Her torso leans forward slightly, forming an elegant S-curve. The background is a rich dark brown heavy curtain with fine texture; behind it, a red fabric sofa is faintly visible. The floor is light wood planks with natural grain. Soft, warm light streams from the left, illuminating her left side and face while casting gentle shadows on the right. The composition is a medium shot from a low angle, adding power to her stance; the background is blurred, focusing on her. The overall atmosphere is intimate, lively, stage-like—a candid moment captured in a home photoshoot or cosplay setting. Color palette centers on gold, blue accents (from the hair ribbons), warm red, and brown. Skin texture is detailed, shadows natural, giving a professional studio quality with a friendly, personal touch.",
