        {
          "id": "krea2-7f5c9b215f7cc7d58be92d68",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙摄影棚微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a revealing red velvet Christmas dress with plunging neckline, fluffy white fur collar, and sheer black feather arm sleeves that extend from her shoulders, standing before a frosted glass door with tan window frames. Her long dark brown hair falls straight with blunt bangs, perfect makeup with sharp eyeliner and soft lips. She wears a black velvet choker and small earrings, smiling warmly directly at the camera. Mid-shot portrait, body slightly turned, hands raised to show off the feather sleeves, dynamic pose. Soft foreground blur of pale pink table edge. Background shows frosted glass panes with hints of yellow curtains, warm lighting from front-left creating even illumination and gentle shadows, rich texture of velvet and feathers. High color saturation with classic red, white, black palette. Elegant, sweet, playful Christmas theme, studio-quality yet intimate home setting. Her dress is unbuttoned to reveal bare cleavage, hinting at nudity beneath, expression inviting and confident.",
