        {
          "id": "krea2-547f9baa8861e229e3f15f43",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑礼服广场微笑站立持花",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a black graduation gown, its shoulders trimmed with orange, worn open over a naked chest, her breasts exposed with perky nipples, a white strapless dress crumpled at her waist. Long hair falls naturally, delicate features, eyes soft and inviting, a serene smile on her lips. She stands under a Gothic stone archway, holding a bouquet of colorful flowers—pink roses, white daisies, yellow gerberas, orange bird-of-paradise, deep red branches—wrapped in translucent white tulle and pale pink ribbon, the bouquet tilted naturally. Her left arm cradles a white plush teddy bear, her right hand gently supports the bouquet base. Foreground: full figure centered, strong visual focus. Background: heavy beige stone arch, pointed vault, smooth solemn lines. Flanking dark oak doors with intricate geometric carvings, metal hinges and handles. Through the arch, a tall Gothic stained-glass window in blue, yellow, orange, emitting soft light. Below the window, dark wooden door, gap showing green trees outside. Ground: reddish-brown square bricks, rough texture, dappled shadows. Midground: corridor inside the arch, strong depth. Backdrop: distant architecture, blurred outdoor environment. Warm backlight from behind the arch and stained glass, rim lighting her silhouette, soft shadows on skin, highlights on nose and cheekbones, golden glow on hair edges. Overall lighting warm, solemn, memorial. Eye-level shot, stable composition, arch as natural frame, enhancing ritualistic and narrative feel. Color harmony: black, white, orange dominant; floral pinks, yellows, reds as accents against brown, yellow, gray background. Fine detail like professional camera, yet retains natural everyday feel—slight film grain, true color reproduction. A formal yet intimate graduation moment, sincere, peaceful, joyful.",
