          "alias": "单女军人银制服沙发媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired woman in a black military uniform sits on a deep blue velvet sofa trimmed with metal rivets, her hat adorned with a gold emblem. She wears a high-collared black top with gold trim and tassels, now partially unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest and erect nipples, paired with a transparent lace-trimmed short skirt that rides high on her thighs. Black gloves cover her hands; her right hand grips a black leather whip, while her left hand adjusts the brim of her cap. She sits sideways, legs crossed—right leg bent, left extended—wearing black high-heeled boots. Soft light from the front left highlights her silver hair, gold accents, and the glossy leather of her uniform, casting sharp shadows across her face and body. The background is a dark gray gradient wall, slightly blurred. Her gaze is sharp and commanding, turned slightly toward the viewer. The scene exudes a tense, sensual authority, with every detail—from the sheen of her hair to the folds of her skirt—rendered in vivid, realistic texture. The palette is black, gold, and blue, creating a cold, regal atmosphere that blends fantasy and reality in a moment of poised, erotic power.",
