        {
          "id": "krea2-67a44de5aa937e4e6fe03feb",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits at a wooden office desk, slowly unbuttoning her white long-sleeve shirt to reveal her bare chest and soft cleavage, paired with a tight black high-waist leather skirt and sheer black stockings that cling to her crossed legs. She holds a vintage black telephone receiver to her ear, her head turned slightly, eyes locking onto the camera with a mysterious, confident gaze. Her golden hair falls naturally over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her face, and transparent thin-rimmed glasses sit on her nose, catching the soft window light. A black leather choker wraps around her neck, adding a dark edge. One hand rests on the desk, fingers long and manicured, the other grips the phone. Sunlight streams through venetian blinds, casting striped shadows across the room. On the left, two yellow chick plushies with orange beaks and eyes sit—one on a green book, the other next to a gray box—beside a potted plant with slender leaves. A silver desk lamp glints in the background. The composition centers on her, slightly angled body and crossed legs creating dynamic balance. Mid-shot, subject dominant, foreground items frame the scene. Natural light from the upper left creates soft chiaroscuro, detailing fabric wrinkles, leather shine, and her skin's texture. Tones of white, black, brown, with pops of yellow and green. The atmosphere is still, cinematic, capturing a private moment of office sensuality—professional yet intimate, as if she's waiting for a crucial call while subtly inviting the viewer into her space.",
