        {
          "id": "krea2-b84b5d38f0ed1d6ba0457d07",
          "alias": "单女白短裙办公室媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern office, her brown wavy hair cascading over her shoulders, thin round glasses perched on her nose. She gazes forward with a focused, contemplative expression, her head slightly tilted. She wears a deep black V-neck long-sleeve top that reveals a hint of cleavage, paired with a tight white high-waist pencil skirt that hugs her curves and a black leather belt cinching her waist. In her arms, she holds a stack of vibrant colored folders—orange, pink, blue, green—with bright tabs and papers peeking out from the edges. Her left hand grips a silver pen. Her posture is relaxed yet purposeful, as if she has just finished a meeting or is about to head to her next appointment. Framed in a medium shot from the waist up, she occupies the left-center of the composition. Behind her: a gray wall and a closed gray door, a pink abstract painting on the right wall, a large screen or projector on a metal stand in the right background, a small white round table with a blue coffee cup and a pink cup near a gray office chair to the left, and light gray floor tiles. The lighting is bright and even—natural light mingling with indoor fixtures from the right, casting soft shadows and smooth transitions, creating a fresh and quiet office atmosphere. The palette is mostly gray and white, punctuated by the vivid colors of the folders, drawing the eye. Shot with an 85mm lens, shallow depth of field keeps her sharp while the background blurs slightly, enhancing her as the subject. The style is realistic with a commercial photography feel, rich in detail and moderate color saturation, plus a slight film grain and real-camera noise to mimic amateur equipment, lending an authentic, intimate quality. The composition is balanced; her gaze and the stacked folders lead the eye out of frame, inviting curiosity about her identity and story. The overall vibe is both professionally strict and gently intellectual, perfect for capturing the essence of a modern urban career woman at work—and the subtle sensuality of her form beneath the sleek office attire.",
