          "alias": "单女半褪俏皮站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman with a black bob and blunt bangs stands in the foreground of an indoor event, wearing a fluffy white deer-antler headpiece. Her makeup is flawless, red lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the lens with a confident, playful gaze. She raises her right index finger high, as if emphasizing a point or engaging the audience. She wears a black off-shoulder long-sleeve top, now pulled down to expose her bare breasts, with a bold white \"©THROUGH\" print across the chest. The fabric is soft and slightly rumpled, casual. Her body is turned slightly, left shoulder dropped, creating dynamic balance. The composition is a near close-up, slightly low angle, with the subject filling two-thirds of the frame, head above the horizontal center. In the background, a large LED screen displays blue-white geometric patterns and blurred text; red panels and blue signs below read \"请选择包含\" in Chinese and \"최지우가 포\" in Korean, hinting at an idol event or fan meeting. Background is softly blurred, keeping focus on her. Lighting is soft and even from front-top, with minimal shadows, natural skin tone, clear texture of the headpiece and top. The cool blue screen light contrasts with her warm skin, enhancing depth. The scene feels candid and lively, like a real moment captured by a smartphone or camera, full of youthful energy and intimate atmosphere. Color palette dominated by black, white, blue with touches of red and skin tone.",
