        {
          "id": "krea2-ec5f40967926ac6016041ca6",
          "alias": "单女半褪女仆女仆装媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a delicate maid outfit, wearing a cat-ear headpiece trimmed with white ruffled fabric and soft pink inner fur; her long black hair falls over her shoulders with straight bangs, her gaze meets the camera with clear, gentle eyes. She has pale pink heart-shaped blush on her cheeks, full rose-red lips, and refined makeup in a Japanese kawaii style. She holds a glass of milk tea with ice and fruit pulp, a transparent straw inserted. Her slender fingers are painted with light pink nail polish; on her left ring finger is a black diamond ring, and on her right index finger a simple silver ring. The black-and-white maid uniform features a white lace collar with a black bow, puffy white lace sleeves, and a black ribbon cross detail over the chest, in a Lolita-inspired sweet and vintage style. She stands slightly left of center, body turned slightly toward the camera, head tilted, pose elegant and natural. The background is a warm dimly lit room with rough stone walls in beige and tan, partly cast with shadows of deep green leaves. Light enters from the left, creating soft chiaroscuro, focusing on her face, hands, and the drink. The background is blurred, making the subject stand out. The composition is a close-up on her upper body and hands holding the drink, guiding the eye from her face to the cup. The color palette is warm yellow, cream, black, and pink, with a slightly grainy texture as if shot on a regular camera, giving a realistic yet artistic feel. The lighting is gentle but layered, creating a tranquil, intimate, slightly mysterious night scene. The atmosphere is both warm and dreamlike, capturing an ordinary yet special moment. Skin is partially exposed: the maid dress is unbuttoned just enough to reveal a hint of cleavage and bare shoulders, with the white lace edge slipping slightly off one shoulder, and her skirt is slightly hiked up, showing a bit of black lace thigh-high stocking and bare thigh. The overall mood is sensual and inviting.",
