        {
          "id": "krea2-d6ab299790eb2aef8d7cd915",
          "alias": "单女空姐黑制服机场媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant in a black tailored uniform sits sideways on a modern white leather sofa, her dark hair pinned in a sleek low bun with a few strands framing her elegant jawline. She tilts her head slightly upward, gaze soft and focused to the right, lips parted in a quiet, professional serenity. Her uniform jacket is unbuttoned, revealing bare skin beneath—the white blouse replaced by nothing but a red-and-gold printed silk scarf tied in a bow at her neck, her chest partially exposed. One hand rests under her chin, fingers long and delicate, a simple pearl earring and a red-strap watch adorning her wrist. The double-breasted jacket falls open, hinting at her curves. A wide red belt cinches her waist, engraved with traditional motifs. A gold badge and nameplate gleam on her lapel. Behind her, the bright interior features blurred blue abstract paintings on the wall. Soft natural light from the left creates warm, even illumination across her face and bare skin, highlighting her collarbones. The composition is a medium close-up, subject placed left of frame, background softly blurred. The color palette is black, red, and white, with a realistic, candid feel like a quiet moment in an airport lounge, radiating professionalism and sensual grace.",
