          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙屋顶媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman with silver-white long curly hair stands on a city rooftop at dusk, wearing a form-fitting black dress with a thigh-high slit that reveals her long legs in black sheer stockings and black stiletto heels. The dress blends gothic and futuristic styles; a black metal-buckled belt cinches her waist, and a loose black jacket drapes over her shoulders. She wears no top underneath—her bare chest is visible through the open jacket, her nipples slightly hardened in the cool twilight air. Her left hand lifts her hair seductively, while her right hand hangs naturally, fingers tipped with bright red nail polish. Her makeup is flawless: metallic smoky eyeshadow, red lips slightly parted, sharp cheekbones, and pale flawless skin. She stares directly into the lens with a confident, provocative gaze. The background shows a grey-yellow concrete wall with stains and peeling paint, metal pipes and valves along the top edge. In the distance, green hills and several high-rise apartments rise under a twilight sky shifting from deep blue to light purple, with thin clouds. The light is soft and cool, casting a subtle chiaroscuro—her left side brighter, right side darker. Medium shot composition, subject slightly off-center right, body turned to create dynamic lines. Foreground rough ground with debris and small stones. Visual flow leads from her face down along her exposed thigh and leg, then into the background. Atmosphere combines urban decay and dramatic roleplay, evoking a cyberpunk secret guardian appearing at dusk. The image maintains the realistic feel of amateur device photography: slight grain, cool white balance, natural depth of field, as if captured spontaneously by a phone or ordinary camera, enhancing credibility and immersion.",
