          "id": "krea2-fdbfb4b6ad8ef0039aff6a31",
          "alias": "单女全裸粉束身衣公园戏谑坐自抚",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a stone railing at Disneyland, wearing a revealing pink-and-white Rococo off-shoulder corset dress adorned with intricate 3D roses and lace, the cascading ruffles catching soft sunlight. Her bodice is cut low, exposing the full swell of her breasts, with a large white embroidered rose pinned at the center. A pink satin ribbon cinches her waist. She wears a Minnie-style pink plush bunny-ear headband studded with sparkling rhinestones. Her long black hair falls naturally, makeup sharp with bold eyeliner and nude lips. Her right hand cups her chest teasingly, fingers grazing her nipple, while her left hand rests on a gold-wrought railing. A subtle cartoon tattoo peeks from her arm. Pose elegant but hinting at shy arousal, gaze lowered to the side. Background features the iconic gray-pink fairy-tale castle with blue-glazed spires and gold trim, a large \"50th Anniversary\" medallion on the central clock face. Blue-and-white banners and ribbons flutter around. A vintage black iron lamppost radiates warm orange light against the bright blue sky with fluffy clouds. Distant visitors in red or floral T-shirts, some pushing strollers, create a lively yet orderly theme park atmosphere. The composition is center-symmetrical with the woman offset left, dominating the foreground, the castle’s grandeur contrasting her petite, exposed figure. Metal railings and stone pillars frame the view, guiding focus to her. High noon sunlight casts crisp, soft shadows across her face, dress, and castle surface, highlighting textures. Dominant colors: pink, blue, gold, with white and gray accents. The scene exudes a dreamy, warm, slightly nostalgic mood with a polished photographic quality, blending fantasy and reality—a moment of innocent yet sensual allure, evoking dreams, growth, and bittersweet memories.",
