          "prompt": "A blue-haired woman in a revealing sailor-style cosplay: a silver corset cinching her waist, blue high collar open at the chest showing deep cleavage, a massive light blue bow with a dark blue gem at its center, white stripe trim on the exposed neckline and cuffless sleeves, a micro shiny blue pleated skirt barely covering her ass, tall blue patent leather boots reaching mid-thigh with chunky heels, white sock tops visible, white gloves, blue wristbands. She crouches half-standing, left leg forward, right leg back, body leaning forward, right fist pressed against her chest, left hand behind her, head turned slightly, eyes locked on the camera with a focused, fierce expression. Foreground: rough cement floor with cracks and scuffs, reflecting her shadow. Midground: her body dominates the left-center frame, low-angle shot. Background: grey corrugated metal wall with horizontal/vertical supports, a black window/door frame on the right, crossed metal beams above, a bright spotlight in the upper right casting a starburst lens flare, strong backlight creating a rim glow on her hair, outfit, and boots, and a long shadow stretching across the floor. High contrast lighting, bright highlights on her blue hair, the shiny corset, and the boots, deep shadows in the floor cracks and wall recesses. The overall tone is a blend of sci-fi fantasy and gritty industrial realism, with a blue-silver-white-gray palette, slightly grainy and natural noise like a DSLR shot in an abandoned warehouse. The pose, the revealing outfit, and the dramatic lighting create a powerful, sexually charged hero-vibe.",
