        {
          "id": "krea2-9aefe4b33441edf2c2007809",
          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙楼梯媚态坐招手",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the wooden stairs indoors, her long black hair smooth with blunt bangs falling naturally, strands catching soft light with a subtle sheen and slight waves at the ends, some casually draped over her shoulder and chest, adding a lazy, effortless allure. Her delicate features are sculpted, with elongated, flowing brows, sultry smoky eye shadow, and a direct gaze into the lens that carries a cool, distant sensuality. Full lips are painted with light pink gloss, looking petal-soft and moist. Her pale, fine skin has a natural flush, blending innocence with raw sex appeal. She wears a black lace cami dress made of sheer leopard-print fabric, edged with delicate black lace trim, the neckline and straps highlighting her collarbones, and a fitted waist accentuating her slender curves. The short skirt hugs her hips, showcasing her shape. Her legs are together with knees slightly bent, hands folded on her thighs, fingers long with clear or pale nail polish; a simple ring adorns her left ring finger, and a small tattoo—like a butterfly or vine—peeks on her right arm, adding an edgy detail. She wears leopard-print stiletto heels with thin straps crisscrossing her foot, a metal buckle at the ankle, and translucent soles that match the gathered sheer stockings at her ankles, emphasizing the length and line of her legs. She sits on dark brown solid wood stairs with smooth, grainy treads, matching handrails with white metal balusters in a clean, modern style. The wall behind is beige with a subtle texture, like unpolished cement or paint, with slight wear marks at the corner. Light pours from upper left, casting warm golden tones, natural or warm indoor lighting, creating an intimate, cozy atmosphere. Shadows play naturally across her face, arms, legs, and the stairs, deepening on her right side and on the floor, enhancing three-dimensionality. The composition is a mid-shot, with her slightly left of center, sitting diagonally, leaning forward a little, head tilted up, eyes meeting the lens, drawing focus to her face and torso. The stair railing runs from lower right to upper right, forming a diagonal, adding depth and dynamic balance. The foreground shows her and the stairs clearly; midground includes her lower body, more steps, and rail; background blurs into wall and staircase end with a layered sense of space. Visual flow from her posture, gaze, and the railing directs attention to her center. The atmosphere feels warm and private, with a retro-modern blend of fashion, and a palette of black, brown, beige accented by leopard spots, harmonious and refined. The image feels crisp and realistic, like a professional photo, yet retains the casual, spontaneous vibe of a captured moment—intentionally framed for beauty and emotion, with strong visual impact and artistic expression.",
