        {
          "id": "krea2-88d578c3553ed4cddb677d16",
          "alias": "单女透视黑西装街道媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a metal roll-up door outside a modern building, dressed in a black cropped blazer and a white high-waist mini skirt, with pink sheer stockings and black platform boots—her look is stylish and provocative. Her long hair falls naturally, she wears thin-rimmed glasses and round earrings, and she flashes a bright, open-mouthed smile of pure delight. Her right hand rests on the metal door, while her left hand pulls a rainbow gradient suitcase; her body leans forward, right leg lifted as if about to leap, exuding energy and anticipation. The background features silver-gray vertical ribbed metal walls and glass windows, with indoor furnishings faintly visible, and light gray concrete steps at her feet. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly left, suitcase balancing the right. Natural daylight floods the scene, soft and even, casting clear but gentle shadows that define her curves and clothing details. The color palette is predominantly black, white, and gray, with pink stockings and the suitcase's iridescent reflections creating striking focal points. 85mm portrait lens, shallow depth of field keeps her sharp while the background blurs softly, enhancing depth and realism. This feels like a spontaneous, vibrant travel moment captured by a pro street-style photographer, radiating sexual confidence and playful allure.",
