        {
          "id": "krea2-f4f52c292aae1465f72008e6",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙废墟忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully atop a pile of golden hay, wearing an elegant white satin dress with a deep V-neckline that plunges to reveal the soft curve of her breasts, the fabric clinging to her slender frame. The dress features a high collar with delicate pleating at the front, but the neckline is cut daringly low, exposing her décolletage. A wide-brimmed off-white hat sits atop her head, its edge slightly upturned, adorned with a sheer net veil that drapes like mist over her face, partially obscuring her melancholic expression. Strands of long black hair escape from beneath the veil, contrasting with her pale skin. At her ears, pearl drop earrings gleam softly. Her eyes are lowered, gaze cast downward, her mood contemplative and introspective. The background is a mottled red wall, peeling paint revealing aged textures and patches of dark brown, with exposed metal pipes and rusted iron sheets, evoking an abandoned warehouse or old farm. In the foreground, coarse golden hay is piled, some stalks jutting out, creating a natural, textured surface. She sits slightly forward, arms resting loosely at her sides, posture relaxed yet ritualistic. The composition is a close-up, with the figure occupying the left side, right side left open for balance. The camera focuses on her face and upper body, background blurred to emphasize her silhouette and the dress's satin sheen. Lighting comes from the side-front, a warm, soft glow illuminating her cheek, shoulders, and the glossy folds of her dress, while shadows merge into the dark red background, creating a warm, nostalgic chiaroscuro. The image has a filmic quality, medium saturation, subtle grain and film noise, as if captured with an old camera. The viewer's eye is drawn first to her veil and eyes, then follows her downward gaze to the hint of a decorative object in her hand. The scene blends romance, mystery, and industrial vintage aesthetics, producing a surreal narrative tension—part high-fashion editorial, part intimate moment in a forgotten corner. A quiet sense of loneliness and fragile elegance pervades, as if time has frozen, leaving only the white figure in contemplative stillness against the red-brown backdrop, her bare shoulders and exposed skin adding a subtle, sensual vulnerability.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
