        {
          "id": "krea2-d9971baeb3c4b1183132d629",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙舞台媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an unzipped black leather dress that hangs open to reveal her bare breasts and toned stomach, wearing a wide-brimmed black hat with white polka dots, her right hand in an elbow-length black leather glove gently touching the hat brim, pose elegant and mysterious. Her brown hair falls naturally, strands caught by a light breeze. Makeup is sultry with deep smoky eyes and soft lips, her gaze intense and direct into the lens. Around her neck, a black rose choker; small sparkling earrings at her ears. The overall look blends vintage and modern fashion, full of dramatic tension and artistic flair. Foreground is the subject, midground a close-up of her body, background a shimmering curtain of tiny silver sequins reflecting dense light spots like a dreamy starry field. Light slants from the right, casting strong chiaroscuro on her face and body, highlighting contours and volume, with a pronounced lens flare and scattered light effects in the lower right corner, creating a stage spotlight atmosphere. Composition is a half-body portrait, subject slightly left, head tilted, eyes straight ahead for strong visual guidance. Lighting layers distinct: highlights on face, hand, and hat brim; soft shadows transition to body sides and background. Overall tone is black and white with silver reflections and warm skin tones, blending cool and warm. Image is richly detailed, fine-textured, resembling high-end fashion photography captured in a professional studio with premium camera and lighting, yet with an accidental amateur feel from a phone or portable camera. The entire scene freezes a carefully staged stage performance, combining a professional model's expertise with natural, everyday authenticity, offering both glamour and intimacy.",
