        {
          "id": "krea2-6a6d9b0d7d3cf34271b0bc21",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑连衣裙广场微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an outdoor sidewalk, her waist-length deep brown hair cascading smoothly over her shoulders and back, with blunt bangs and a few strands brushing her cheeks, giving a soft, approachable look. She is slightly turned sideways, body tilted, head gently angled toward the camera, a faint smile on her lips, eyes clear and bright, gazing softly at the viewer—an elegant, natural pose capturing a moment of quiet beauty. She wears only a black-and-white plaid tweed sleeveless dress, the fitted bodice cinching her narrow waist, the A-line skirt with uneven raw edges, but the dress is unbuttoned and pulled open, revealing her bare chest: full, erect nipples exposed, the white long-sleeved shirt underneath discarded, leaving the oversized white bow tied loosely around her neck, its voluminous layers now framing her naked breasts. Her right hand hangs naturally, long fingers with a simple silver ring on the ring finger; her left hand holds a small black crocodile-textured handbag slung across her side, contrasting with the outfit. High black patent leather boots hug her calves, thick block heels adding height, legs crossed—right in front, left behind—creating dynamic balance. The ground is gray square stone tiles with a metal grate near the foreground, its diamond pattern visible. In the background, lush green shrubs frame the right edge, with dark brown metal fencing behind, trees with yellowing autumn leaves, and a pale building outline in the distance. Soft gray-white sky, diffused light from above front, no harsh shadows. Mid-shot composition from knees up, figure centered slightly left, her bare torso and the bow drawing the eye from her face down to her nipples, the dress, the bag, the boots. Textures: realistic skin, fabric folds, leather shine. Color palette: black, white, with touches of green and tan. Overall, an urban street style scene with a sensual, explicit twist, resembling a professional photo with subtle grain and natural exposure.",
