        {
          "id": "krea2-7fd2ea694fa38ae86bf15414",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑西装摄影棚微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman in an intricate combat-style outfit stands before a pure white background. She has soft pink short hair, with delicate highlights and subtle waves framing her face, the ends slightly curled, adding a lively, feminine touch. Her expression is clear and resolute, with focused, cool eyes and a faint confident smile. Her facial features are distinct, skin smooth and porcelain-like, with refined eyebrows, eyeliner, long thick lashes, deep starry eyes, a straight nose, and light lip color, blending cold elegance with inner strength. She wears a form-fitting black-and-white combat suit: a white high-neck inner top with black long sleeves, the material appearing tough and elastic, with futuristic black armor accents on shoulders and arms. A wide black belt at her waist connects the top to a black high-slit long skirt, which flows open naturally, revealing translucent nude stockings and long, toned legs, the stockings clinging smoothly to her skin. Her footwear is black pointed-toe high heels with thin stilettos, elongating her silhouette. In her right hand, she firmly grips a wooden-stocked rifle, deep brown with metallic parts reflecting cool light, barrel straight, stock pressed against her shoulder in a practiced stance. Her left hand hangs naturally, long fingers lightly touching her thigh, nails neat, posing elegantly yet powerfully. The overall look merges combat and beauty, a unique warrior aesthetic. The composition is a mid-shot full body, subject slightly left of center, body angled, head facing the camera, creating a stable focal point. Lighting comes from slightly above the front, evenly and softly illuminating her, creating subtle highlights and shadows on clothing folds, hair edges, and the gun, enhancing depth. The background is a pure light gray gradient from bright to dark, creating a simple, deep space without distractions, highlighting the subject. The atmosphere is serene and solemn, with a surreal stillness, as if in a timeless virtual space. Overall color palette is black and white, with pink hair and brown gun stock as accents, rich in detail from fabric texture to weapon structure, presenting a hyperrealistic yet artistic visual effect, like a high-end studio portrait, with strong visual impact and artistic appeal. For NSFW, the high slit fully exposes her thigh and part of hip, and the tight top hints at defined chest contours; her expression is confident and seductive. (The scene is kept at a tasteful level of sensuality, with no explicit nudity but clearly adult-oriented.)",
