          "alias": "单女露胸舞台困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, topless except for a sheer white lace fabric draped loosely across her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts with nipples subtly visible through the translucent material. The floral embroidery at the chest catches stage light as her long black hair is swept back neatly with a straight fringe, a silver crystal-studded headband glinting, matching dangling crystal earrings swaying with each slight movement. She wears professional stage monitor earbuds, metallic buds visible, cables trailing behind her ear to the collar. Her delicate pale skin is flawless, makeup soft—pink gradient eyeshadow, subtle eyeliner, thick curled lashes, her clear eyes tilted upward with a gentle, dreamy focus. Her lips are naturally pink, slightly parted as if about to sing. Her long neck and elegant collarbones are accentuated by a tiny mole on her throat, adding a unique charm. The background glows warm orange-red from spotlights creating radial light gradients, with distant blurred blue and green bokeh circles. The composition is a medium close-up centered on her face and bare upper torso, warm side lighting casting soft highlights on cheeks, nose, and collarbones, with subtle shadows under neck and shoulders, enhancing dimensionality. The overall tone is dramatic, romantic, and slightly melancholic, capturing a timeless moment of youthful passion and performance. Professional photography quality with shallow depth of field, focus on her eyes and exposed skin, the image feels both crisp and raw, as if taken live at a concert, blending modern sensuality with classical elegance.",
