          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table in a Japanese izakaya, her red-and-blue plaid sweater unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, revealing her bare chest and the curve of her breasts. Her sleeves are trimmed with fluffy black faux fur, and her hair is tied up with blunt bangs, small gold earrings glinting. She stares directly into the lens with a clear, seductive gaze, lips parted as she brings a tall glass of golden draft beer with a thick white foam head to her mouth, about to take a slow, sensual sip. The foreground holds a black ceramic bowl of tofu in broth, a white porcelain spoon, a lighter bowl with sauce and chopped green onions, a dark blue bowl of stir-fried minced meat and vegetables, chopsticks resting on the edge, a metal condiment bottle, and another empty beer glass. The background is softly blurred with warm indoor lighting, hints of a window frame and wall art, creating a cozy atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, slightly low angle, direct eye contact. Soft, warm lighting from the right and overhead, rich tones of red, brown, beige, and deep brown. Subtle bokeh and slight grain evoke a candid, documentary feel, capturing a moment of relaxed, warm indulgence—sensual and intimate.",
