        {
          "id": "krea2-5bf6a17b2a5d89d61f0cecc5",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙浴室神秘站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young, topless woman stands before a luxurious bathroom mirror, her black deep-V dress shrugged down to expose her full, bare breasts, draped in a fluffy white faux fur coat that hangs open. Her dark hair is swept into an elegant low chignon, with a few loose strands framing her face. She wears a sparkling silver necklace and long earrings. Her reflection in the mirror captures her direct, mysterious gaze as she slightly tilts her head, one hand caressing the edge of the fur coat, the other hanging loosely by her side. Her pose is poised and regal, emphasizing her exposed chest. The frame includes her left profile and the heavy texture of the fur, each fiber naturally curled. Light from a wall sconce on the left casts soft highlights and shadows across the fur’s surface, enhancing its plush warmth. In the midground, a large gold-framed mirror reflects the entire room, showing her face in detail—red lips slightly parted, defined eyeliner. The mirror also reveals another wall sconce, marble tiles, and part of the vanity. The background features beige marble walls with delicate natural veining and vintage metallic wall lamps with cylindrical shades emitting warm yellow light. Below the mirror, a black marble countertop holds a white ceramic sink with silver double-handled faucets. On the right, a pot of white orchids with green leaves adds freshness. The composition is centrally symmetric, with the woman slightly left and her reflection slightly right, creating visual balance. The mirror’s reflection adds depth, making the space feel expansive. The camera angle is slightly below her eye level, giving an immersive, upward gaze that starts at the fur coat, follows her body lines to the mirror image, then through the reflection to the wall lamps and walls, finally returning to her face. The lighting is warm yellow, soft and focused, creating a private, intimate, and luxurious atmosphere. The overall palette blends black, white, and gold, evoking elegance and ritual. The image captures a candid, high-end photograph—rich in detail, realistic texture, yet retaining a sense of everyday life, like a private boudoir portrait full of narrative and emotional tension, merging artistic beauty with tangible warmth.",
