          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a nighttime city street, her jet-black shoulder-length hair with neat air bangs, bright blue eyes clear and striking in the dark, pale smooth skin, soft nude-pink lips curved in a gentle, inviting smile. She turns slightly toward the camera, right hand raised in a subtle wave—fingers long, nails painted deep purple, a simple silver ring on her ring finger, a delicate diamond necklace sparkling faintly at her throat. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, nipples hardened in the cool air, the white strapless dress discarded or pushed down to her waist, revealing the curve of her chest and the soft shadow between her breasts. The dress’s structured folds and cross-bindings now frame her bare skin, the waist cinched, the layered skirt flowing ethereally around her hips. Background is a blurred city nightscape with gray concrete pillars, black metal grille structures, faint yellow streetlamp lines in the distance. Mottled light and patches of withered grass on the ground. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly right of center, focus on her face and bare upper body. Light from the right creates soft sidelight that illuminates her face, highlights her bare skin and the dress’s details, with natural shadow transitions. Cool, elegant mood. Background soft blur isolates her. Color palette is black, white, gray, with the bright white dress and her blue eyes providing stark contrast. Visual emphasis on her expression and pose, conveying both sensual allure and urban elegance. High-resolution, film-grain texture, realistic night photography feel, capturing the refined yet romantic atmosphere of city nightlife.",
