          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on an indoor stone floor, wearing only white lace panties and a light blue skirt bunched around her hips. She is posed sideways, arms wrapped around her knees, one hand gently resting on her bare thigh, the other trailing on the stone. Her deep brown hair is braided in a side plait, falling over her shoulder, with small silver earrings catching the light. Her gaze drifts softly to the right foreground, lips slightly parted in a subtle, knowing smile. The room has a Mediterranean simplicity: pale beige stone walls, a dark wood-framed window letting in warm natural light that casts strong, soft shadows across her body and the floor. To the left, a dark wooden shelf holds a neat row of scenic postcards. The palette is dominated by blues and whites, with a warm glow from the right highlighting the curves of her silhouette and the delicate texture of lace and fabric. Medium shot, subject just right of center, with the wall edge and shelf creating depth. The lighting is smooth and cinematic, giving the image a high-end photographic quality—intimate, sensual, and quietly romantic, as if capturing a private, tender moment in a Mediterranean retreat.",
