        {
          "id": "krea2-83bbb38dc9edead559dc351a",
          "alias": "单女黑西装窗边媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by a bright window in a minimalist interior, her shoulder-length dark brown hair with slight waves and straight bangs framing her delicate, high-cheekboned face. Her makeup is precise—sharp eyeliner and soft coral lips—her gaze direct, coldly confident. Her right hand lightly touches the back of her neck, left hand on her hip, body slightly turned to emphasize her elegant curves and sensual silhouette. She wears a black tailored blazer, unbuttoned, revealing a white lace bra with intricate patterns and metal clasp details, barely covering her breasts. High-waisted black trousers hug her hips and thighs. A white label on the left chest pocket reads \"THE STYLE THAT ACCEPTS MUCH FEELING WITH WITHOUT LIMITATIONS SUPPORT A COMFORTABLE LIFE LET'S HAVE A DREAM\". The foreground shows a blurred edge of a photographer's finger or device, creating a candid, voyeuristic feel. Mid-shot composition, the woman occupies center-right. Behind her, a large window with soft backlighting creates a warm rim light on her hair and subtle shadows across her body. A pale gray window frame reflects blurred green foliage. Below the window, a wooden bookshelf holds heavy books in black, gray, with gold or silver titles; a magazine leans sideways. The room is modern minimalist—light gray-white walls, pale wood floor. The lighting is strong from behind, producing clear edge light and gentle shadows, high contrast yet soft. The overall palette is black, white, gray, with the white bra and warm skin tones standing out. The scene feels like a high-end fashion editorial, a film still—cool, elegant, modern, with a hint of mystery. The lens focuses on her upper body, background slightly blurred, guiding the viewer from her face along her posture and clothing to her full figure, then to the books and window beyond. A moment of real, sensual confidence captured in natural light, as if shot with a full-frame camera and wide aperture.",
