        {
          "id": "krea2-f4143824fb97e45c5485fa10",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙室内媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a soft indoor setting, wearing a vibrant red floral tight dress with a strapless neckline that accentuates her elegant shoulders and cleavage. The dress is covered in large red and pink roses, rich in color and texture, with a slightly fitted hem highlighting her slender waist. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, left hand lightly over right, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, exuding an elegant and relaxed pose. She wears a pair of colorful rabbit ears made of red-and-black plaid fabric, one ear detailed with a green leaf pattern inside, secured with a black headband. Her natural brown hair is slightly wavy, falling over her shoulders, with strands brushing her cheeks, adding a soft, lazy charm. She smiles gently, her eyes warm as she looks at the camera, lips in light pink lipstick, makeup delicate but not overpowering. A matching floral bow tie wraps around her neck, perfectly complementing the dress. The sleeves are white and short, with gold button details. She wears black fishnet stockings with fine glitter particles that shimmer faintly in the light, adding a mysterious and seductive texture. The background is a bright white curtain, sheer and translucent, with light streaming evenly from behind, creating a soft backlight that outlines her silhouette and casts subtle halos on her hair and skin, evoking a dreamy atmosphere. The mid-shot composition places her slightly left of center, body turned slightly toward the camera, head tilted naturally, gaze meeting the viewer directly. The foreground is soft, light-colored bedsheet or sofa cushion with subtle folds and texture, adding realism. The background curtain is blurred, making the subject pop. The warm, even backlighting creates a soft rim light around her edges, enhancing the airy, transparent feel. The overall color palette is warm white and red, with black and green accents, harmoniously romantic and intimate. The image feels like a natural casual afternoon shot with a professional camera and soft lighting, rich in detail and texture, blending fashion photography with a homey, candid sensuality.",
