        {
          "id": "krea2-6828d43b7a52e7f8f0125477",
          "alias": "单女露胸牛仔街道戏谑站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long straight black hair and blunt bangs, her locks gently tousled by the breeze, stands topless before a classical European stone building. Her porcelain skin glows in the natural daylight, delicate features sharp, deep eyes sparkling with playful confidence. She pouts her full lips teasingly at the camera, one hand resting on the edge of her high-waisted denim mini skirt—its uneven fringe and ripped hem adorned with silver rivets, the waistband low on her hips. Her other arm hangs loosely, body tilted in a relaxed stance, bare breasts fully exposed, nipples firm in the warm sunlight. Behind her, a beige stone wall with squared blocks, an ornate green metal lantern with glass panes and a carved scroll pattern, and a half-open dark brown wooden door with diamond-pane windows and brass handle. Gray flagstone pavement with visible gaps. Soft daylight from upper right casts warm highlights across her face and shoulders, creating natural chiaroscuro on her left side. Medium shot, she occupies left-center, the architectural details framing her. Warm tones of ochre, denim blue, and verdigris green blend vintage elegance with modern sensuality. The scene feels like a candid street-style capture, rich in texture and intimate allure.",
