        {
          "id": "krea2-4ab1e041357c5c16fd0767a1",
          "alias": "单女外套雪地忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits regally indoors, her body partially bared beneath an opulent open fur coat of fluffy gray-white that drapes over her shoulders and arms, revealing her full breasts with erect nipples catching the warm light. She wears a lavish pink-and-black hanfu top pushed aside, the crimson trim at the collar and sleeves framing her pale skin. Her jet-black hair is coiled into a classical bun adorned with an intricate silver crown, dangling beaded tassels and a golden ribbon that flutters softly. Her delicate face, fair skin, and deep, melancholic eyes gaze into the distance, lips slightly parted in contemplative resolve. Her right hand grips an ancient sword with a dark wooden hilt and a scabbard engraved with dragon motifs, the blade's cold metallic sheen angled toward the floor, creating a strong leading line. Low-angle shot emphasizes her tall, commanding presence—she stands center-left in the frame, with the foreground featuring the plush fur texture and her bare legs partly visible. Midground shows her upper body and sword grip. Background hints at an Eastern classical interior: a wooden screen, a hanging pipa, and antique furniture silhouettes. Warm yellow light from above and right front illuminates her face and exposed skin, casting soft shadows that accentuate her curves and the fur's volume. Tiny glowing dust motes float like stardust, enhancing the dreamy atmosphere. The palette blends warm yellow, pink, gray-white, with accents of black and gold. Shot with an 85mm lens, shallow depth of field blurs the background, edge vignetting adds cinematic feel. The scene exudes quiet, solemn artistry—a warrior-poetess lost in thought under a snowy night sky, poised for an crucial duel, part realistic, part poetic, charged with sensual narrative tension.",
