        {
          "id": "krea2-5a457a0805891d970c543db9",
          "alias": "单女黑束身衣公寓媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her light blonde curly hair topped with a black lace bunny ears headband, the strands falling in soft, tousled waves. Her makeup is flawlessly seductive: earthy brown eyeshadow with a sharp winged eyeliner, thick curling lashes, rose-pink lips, and luminous fair skin. She turns her body slightly toward the camera, gazing with tender, inviting eyes and a sweet, teasing smile as her hands form a delicate heart shape in front of her chest. Her fingers are long and elegant, a simple silver ring on her left ring finger and a thin chain bracelet around her right wrist. She wears a tightly cinched black satin and lace corset bustier top, the sheer lace panels revealing the upper swell of her breasts, with ruffled straps and a deep neckline that exposes ample cleavage. The top is unbuttoned slightly at the center, hinting at the creamy skin beneath. A high-waist black skirt with layered ruffled hem sits just below her hips, barely covering the top of her thighs, and is tied with narrow black strings at each side. Her long legs are encased in sheer black lace over-the-knee stockings, the intricate floral patterns visible just above her ankles. Around her neck, she wears a black velvet choker, a silver chain, and a dangling lock pendant. Small earrings glitter at her ears. The overall look blends gothic elegance with cute, vintage sexiness. The indoor background shows beige textured wallpaper, a white mantelpiece on the left holding a warm-toned framed painting and two gold ceramic vases. On the right wall hangs a white flat luminaire. A light wood floor stretches beneath her, with the edge of a round white side table visible in the bottom-left corner. Soft side lighting from the front-right sculpts her body, casting gentle shadows and highlighting the curves of her chest and waist while leaving the background dim and intimate. The mid-shot portrait frames her slightly off-center, her head tilted just enough to create a sense of direct, personal eye contact. The overall ambiance is warm, private, and sensual—colors of black, beige, brown, with hints of gold and skin tones. The image has an authentic, amateur-camera feel with subtle grain and natural bokeh, the background softly blurred to draw all attention to her relaxed yet expressive pose and the inviting, playful mood.",
