        {
          "id": "krea2-73645196fd1bc1267eab1d98",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙舞台媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at center stage during an indoor event, wearing a tight blue-and-white cheerleader-style mini dress with a cinched waist and flared A-line skirt, the fabric featuring white stripes and bold blue lettering \"CH\"—the top is sleeveless and cut low to reveal a deep cleavage. Her long, wavy dark brown hair cascades over her shoulders, glossy and voluminous; her makeup is heavy and sultry with smoky eyes, long lashes, and soft pink lips parted in a knowing, seductive smile as she gazes directly at the camera. She holds a white card with black text reading \"THE 40TH golden disc AWARDS uPbit\" between her manicured fingers, silver tassel earrings dangling and swaying with her subtle movements. To the left, a transparent glass globular candy machine filled with yellow balls sits on a metal retro base. Behind her, a large gray display panel bears white letters \"DISC AWARDS\" and logos including \"golden disc\", \"uPbit\", \"NAVER\", \"ABEMA\", \"KOFCA\", \"BESSIE'U\", with geometric line decorations and soft lighting from overhead fixtures. The overall lighting is bright and even, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background while keeping her face and chest sharply in focus. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, with balanced negative space, guiding the eye from her face to the card and then to the brand logos. The mood is celebratory yet provocatively intimate, with a professional studio feel, high detail, and a crisp, almost candid realism.",
