          "alias": "单女露胸白浴袍庭院媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing, sheer white silk robe sits gracefully on an intricately carved wooden bench, her robe fully open and draped off her shoulders, exposing her bare breasts and smooth skin. Her black hair is styled high in an elegant updo, adorned with delicate gold ornaments and red beaded tassels that gently brush against her collarbone. Her face is refined, eyes deep and half-lidded with a sultry, dreamy expression, lips slightly parted as her right hand trails gently to her mouth, fingers grazing her plump lower lip. The thin, translucent fabric of her robe shifts with a soft breeze, revealing her toned, bare legs—one bent, one extended—creating an elegant S-curve. She sits slightly turned, centered in the frame, with low-angle perspective emphasizing her presence. Behind her, dark silhouettes of traditional Chinese architecture with curved eaves fade into the night, while a massive full moon hangs in the upper-left sky, its blue-gray surface textured with craters and shadows. Cool moonlight casts soft rim lighting along her figure, highlighting the contours of her breasts, the curve of her hip, the smooth skin of her thighs. The scene is bathed in a cold palette of whites, pale grays, deep blues, and blacks, with ambient mist or thin haze adding a poetic, ethereal layer. Photorealistic, film-grain quality with natural depth of field, capturing every detail: the gauzy texture of her robe, the glossy shine of her hair, the subtle shadow of her areolas, the faint reflection of moonlight on the carved wooden bench. The atmosphere is quiet, sensual, and timeless—a secret moment in a moonlit courtyard, blending classical Eastern elegance with modern erotic allure.",
