          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on a luxurious pink satin sheet spread over lush green grass, completely nude except for a pair of small silver earrings and a simple ring on her finger. Her sleek black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, with a straight fringe covering her forehead. Her deep eyes stare directly into the camera, exuding a cold, confident allure. Her red lips are slightly parted, makeup flawless and layered. Her right hand rests gently beside her, while her left hand grazes her thigh, fingers adorned with the ring. The pink satin is rumpled beneath her, creating rich folds and soft reflections that contrast sharply with the vivid green grass. The viewpoint is from above, slightly angled, placing her off-center left, her body extending diagonally across the frame, guiding the eye along her curves from her face down to her legs. The lighting is soft and even, coming from above right, casting delicate highlights and shadows across her skin and the satin. The color palette is dominated by pink and purple tones with green accents, creating a dreamy yet realistic atmosphere. The scene feels like a spontaneous outdoor fashion shoot with professional equipment, blending artistic sensuality with everyday life.",
