        {
          "id": "krea2-f10ba141491349dd13413d12",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙摄影棚媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman with light pink hair and precise makeup sits before a black backdrop, her lips bold red, eyes half-lidded and lazy as she gazes at the camera. She wears a short, colorful floral-print dress—red base with blue, yellow, white, and green blooms—cut in an asymmetrical off-shoulder design; one strap has slipped, baring her left breast fully, skin pale and smooth. The dress is layered with ruffles at the sleeve and hem, revealing long, toned legs. A black leather belt with a gold heart-shaped buckle cinches her waist, adding retro elegance. Her right hand rests lightly at her side, left hand hangs naturally. Behind her, a heavy dark curtain with subtle folds creates a studio atmosphere. To the right, the backrest of a wooden chair is visible—light brown, rounded edges, warm grain. The concrete floor is gray, textured with fine grit and faint stains, lending raw realism. Composition is a mid-shot portrait, her body slightly off-center right, head tilted, eyes locked on the lens. Light from front-left soft and even, illuminating her face, bare skin, and dress fabric, with shadows transitioning naturally on the right, enhancing depth and skin glow. The mood blends high-fashion and intimate, a captured backstage moment—vivid red flowers pop against black, balanced by soft lighting and her sensual, relaxed expression, creating warmth and story. The scene is artistically powerful, like a modern urban portrait full of detail, layers, and emotional tension.",
