          "prompt": "A woman in a tight red satin mini dress and black high heels, one leg hitched over a classical stone pillar, exposing her thighs and the curve of her ass. She grips a futuristic sci-fi rifle with a complex metallic frame, glowing red energy core, and ring-shaped components. Both hands hold the weapon, her sharp gaze locked on the camera. Her short black hair is slightly messy, makeup precise and cold, red lips parted, eyes radiating danger and confidence. A black choker circles her neck, black decorative straps over her bare shoulders. The pose is dominant, low-angle shot emphasizing her power and intimidation. Background: dark Gothic interior with arched doorways, carved stone pillars, niches creating depth. Left side: burning white candles on golden candlesticks, warm glow. Right side: intense red light source from behind, creating eerie mystery. A massive blood-red moon hangs in the sky, clouds rolling, casting deep crimson and black shadows. Lighting: side light from red source and candlelight, strong chiaroscuro, sharp outlines on face and body, rich fabric folds and metal reflections, deep shadows. Tones: dark red, black with gold and silver accents. A blend of cyberpunk and gothic aesthetics, dramatic, tense, visually striking. Film-like quality with subtle grain, lens distortion, natural light transitions, giving a hyperreal yet slightly amateur-shot feel. Overall mood: gloomy, mysterious, dangerous, powerful, sensual.",
