          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a clean light gray backdrop, her long jet-black hair tied in a low ponytail with a dark gray ribbon, a few strands softly framing her face. She wears thin round wire-rimmed glasses, lenses catching a gentle sheen, her eyes clear and focused, lips parted in a faint, knowing smile. Her top is a thick charcoal gray knitted sweater with an off-shoulder cut, baring one smooth shoulder and the elegant line of her collarbone, the fabric’s textured weave visible, sleeves loose and naturally wrinkled for a relaxed, sultry vibe. She pairs it with a matching high-waisted pleated miniskirt, the crisp folds accentuating her slender thighs. She holds a dark blue hardcover book pressed tightly against her chest, spine reading \"CHRISTIAN DIOR\" and \"DESIGNER OF DREAMS\" in white serif. The composition is a mid-shot, her body slightly turned, face straight to camera, creating an intimate yet detached allure. Light from the front-left casts soft, even illumination, enhancing her facial contours and the tactile details of the knit, glasses, and hair. The mood is cool gray-blue, quiet, elegant, and modern, with a refined sense of fashion and art. The sweater’s neckline dips low, hinting at more skin beneath, while the skirt rides up as she hugs the book, revealing the upper curve of her thighs. Every texture—from the yarn’s loops to the metal of the frames—is sharp, the palette subdued, exuding a poised, intellectual sensuality.",
