        {
          "id": "krea2-381d564f1ea02c82bc6ac8b8",
          "alias": "单女灰连体衣健身房害羞坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the gym floor before a mirror, wearing a sheer, skin-tight gray athletic bodysuit that leaves little to the imagination—her nipples clearly visible through the thin fabric, body glistening with a light sheen of sweat. She poses with her legs together slightly bent, clad in deep gray thigh-high socks that hug her calves tightly. Her left wrist sports a black smartwatch, right wrist a vibrant red bead bracelet. She holds a white phone with a clear textured case in her right hand, pointing it at the mirror for a selfie. Her hair is a sleek black-brown with straight bangs, white wireless earbuds snug in her ears. She gazes at the phone screen with a focused, calm expression, lips slightly parted, cheeks flushed, skin pale and luminous. The gym floor is black rubber matting with visible seams; behind her stand various fitness machines—a weight rack, bench press, cable pulley—with yellow and red accents like \"MARACO\" branding. Overhead, a crystal chandelier casts warm golden light, mixing with cold white industrial lamps to create sharp contrasts. The mirror reflects her body and the room, emphasizing depth. She is positioned slightly left-center, captured in a close-up from a slight overhead angle, foreground dominated by her hands and phone, mid-ground her torso and gym equipment, background extending into the gym space. The scene feels both real and artistic, like a professional yet candid selfie with subtle film grain and natural color tones—grays, blacks, whites punctuated by red and gold. Highlights catch her face and arms, shadows soften, giving a three-dimensional feel. The entire composition is clean, detailed, and charged with a sensual, self-contained energy.",
