          "alias": "单女露胸丝袜舞台媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, topless, wearing only a black pleated miniskirt, sheer striped stockings, and a dark knit cardigan draped off her shoulders, a loose ribbon tied around her bare neck. Her breasts are fully exposed, nipples erect, as she grips a branded microphone with one hand, the other hand sliding down her thigh. Her makeup is natural with pink lips, round pink earrings, and her curled hair is messily pinned up, revealing her profile. Soft front lighting highlights her skin, casting subtle shadows across her body and skirt. The deep blue stage backdrop features a red 'Snapdragon' logo with flame graphics and 'powered by' text above, blurred into a gradient of blue-purple. The mid-shot composition is slightly tilted, as if captured by an old portable camera, with gentle grain and slight focus shift. Her confident gaze meets the lens, lips parted, the scene blending professional stage lighting with raw, intimate sensuality.",
