        {
          "id": "krea2-c6b2d8b9c8dc49bd768ed14c",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙舞台媚态站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands center stage, wearing a backless black mini dress and sheer black fishnet stockings covered in tiny sparkling rhinestones. Her thick, wavy black hair falls naturally over her shoulders. She turns sideways, looking back over her shoulder at the camera, red lips slightly parted, eyes exuding confidence and allure. Her right hand, gloved in black, rests on her hip; her left hand hangs loosely. High-gloss black patent leather pumps. Her legs cross in an S-curve pose, body leaning slightly forward, waist twisted into an elegant arc—the silhouette is both sensual and noble. The woman occupies the left-center of the frame. Foreground details are crisp: face makeup, hair texture, fabric quality, and the glittering reflections on the stockings. Midground shows faint reflected stage light and partial prop edges. Background is deep dark tones, with a faint ornate crystal chandelier hanging on the left, casting warm yellow light through smoky air, creating soft halos and scattered effects. In the distance, blurred red diagonal beams cut through the darkness, producing dramatic chiaroscuro contrast. Composition uses the rule of thirds: subject on the left third, gaze line leading from her face to the chandelier, creating visual flow. Camera angle is slightly low, emphasizing her height and presence. Lighting is cool-warm contrast: main light from the left chandelier and stage spotlights, creating sharp chiaroscuro; her right side is shadowed, highlighting contour lines. The red light band in the background adds a modern, dynamic feel. Overall atmosphere is high-fashion runway or concert stage, with strong visual impact and artistic expression. Image texture is fine and detailed, as if shot by professional equipment in low light, with film grain and realistic light transitions. Color saturation is moderate, with black and gold interwoven, creating a mysterious, luxurious, and seductive ambiance—capturing a fleeting yet unforgettable moment on stage, balancing reality and artistry.",
