        {
          "id": "krea2-479f3649e173d10ebb795137",
          "alias": "单女银礼服摄影棚困倦坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman in a silver-to-black gradient strapless gown sits elegantly on a rough-cut log, the metallic silver pleated bodice hugging her curves, the black skirt flowing down, black long gloves contrasting with the dress. She wears a delicate gold necklace and ring, long brown hair cascading over her shoulders. Her deep, focused gaze looks off into the distance, head slightly tilted with calm confidence. Her body leans slightly, one hand resting on her knee, the other hanging naturally, creating a quiet tension. Background: a dreamy cosmic nebula of deep purple and blue, scattered with shimmering white specks, a bright sun-like light source in the center casting a soft glow, illuminating the scene. Foreground rough wood texture with natural cracks and wear. To the right, an artistic decoration of metal leaves reflecting light, forming cold geometric beauty. Composition follows the rule of thirds, figure right-center, left space emphasizing the vast background. Backlighting from above and behind creates a rim light effect, wrapping her silhouette in a soft halo, face and body evenly lit with clear detail. Overall atmosphere: mysterious and noble, blending futuristic sci-fi with classical elegance. Color palette: deep blue, purple, silver, black, warm skin tones, gold jewelry—cold-warm contrast. Visual lines guide from her eyes to the background light source and back to her body lines. Image quality: high-resolution photographic clarity and depth, like a professional studio shoot, preserving natural light transitions and realistic materials—an artistic yet realistic style. [NSFW: slight suggestiveness in pose and bare shoulders, but fully clothed; can be interpreted as sensual.]",
