          "prompt": "A young topless woman sits on the black anti-slip pad of a white inflatable kayak, her bare breasts exposed, the tips lightly visible in natural daylight. Her dark, wet hair curls loosely, strands clinging to her cheeks and neck. She tilts her head back, eyes locking with the camera, lips parted in a lazy, sensual expression. One hand rests on her hip, the other on the kayak’s edge, her body curving into an elegant S-shape, legs crossed. The kayak’s smooth white plastic rim contrasts with the textured black pad beneath her. Behind her, calm shallow green water sparkles with tiny ripples, the sandy bottom just visible. Soft daylight falls evenly across her skin, highlighting a subtle glossy sheen. The composition is mid-shot, slightly off-center, with open sea to the right. The overall tone is serene, fresh, and romantically lazy, with a warm summer-vacation vibe. Slight film grain and natural exposure give it a candid, lifelike feel—sensual but not posed.",
