          "alias": "单女灰短裤门媚态坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of the open trunk of a light blue car, wearing a white sleeveless basketball jersey with red \"SHOHOKU\" and number \"10\"—the jersey is pulled up, exposing her bare midriff and the lower swell of her breasts, with one nipple peeking out from the side. She wears extremely short gray shorts that ride high on her hips. Her right hand casually runs through her hair, while her left hand holds a standard orange basketball with visible hexagonal texture and glossy highlights. Her soft gaze meets the camera with a playful, flirtatious smile, radiating youthful energy and sensual confidence. The background is a blurred outdoor setting with greenery and ground, creating a casual everyday vibe. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left, with the deep black trunk interior contrasting against the bright car paint. The car door is open, showing sleek design lines. Natural sunlight from upper right casts gentle shadows across her face, arms, and the basketball, enhancing the film-grain effect with slight desaturation, mimicking a candid amateur photo. Focus is sharp on her and the ball, with soft bokeh behind. Balanced composition, visual flow from her eyes to the basketball, evoking a slice-of-life scene with an explicitly NSFW, intimate twist.",
