        {
          "id": "krea2-a8d7bee2820992a1f7c1484f",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服忧伤跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an opulent ancient Chinese Hanfu, her black hair piled high in a regal bun adorned with an intricate gold crown, red pearl tassels, and pink petal-shaped ornaments, a small gold forehead piece and a red flower mark at her brow. Her makeup is exquisite: long, upturned eyeliner, warm orange-gradient eyeshadow, full red lips, flawless pale skin, and a delicate, ethereal face. She gazes deeply and wistfully into the lens, her right hand raised, fingers slightly curled as if brushing the transparent gauze curtain or drifting silk ribbon beside her. She wears a layered, semi-transparent pink-to-orange gradient gown with multiple sheer, sparkling tulle layers, a unique shoulder cut that reveals her collarbone and part of her breasts. Two thin gold chains adorn her neck—one with tiny red beads, the other shorter—and long gold tassel earrings hang from her ears, matching gold bracelets on her wrists. The overall look is sumptuous, elegant, and classical. The composition is a close-up, with the subject slightly right of center, emphasizing her face and costume details. The foreground shows her profile and upper body; the middle ground includes her figure and flowing skirt; the background is a blurred, dark space with faint wooden structures and hazy smoke. Light streams in from the upper left, creating a strong backlight effect as sunlight penetrates the gauze, producing soft halos and star flares that illuminate her silhouette and hair, evoking a dreamy, luminous atmosphere. The color palette is warm and soft—pink, orange, gold, with black and white contrasts—rich in light and shadow, with natural gradations. The texture mimics film photography with grain and a vintage filter, as if shot on an old film camera. The focal length is moderate, depth of field controlled, with crisp focus on her face and a soft blur in the background, yielding cinematic visual quality. The style blends Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion, merging the solemn elegance of tradition with contemporary refinement and romance, like a meticulously painted classical beauty or a dream fragment transcending time, full of poetic narrative. It evokes a peerless court lady from ancient palaces or a celestial being descending to earth. The scene is quiet and mysterious, as if time has frozen, leaving only light and beauty dancing, with faint sandalwood and floral scents in the air. The viewer’s gaze is drawn by her eyes and posture, extending to the flowing light and drifting curtains, forming a dynamic balance. The image conveys an otherworldly beauty—both real and illusory, with tangible texture and artistic transcendence.",
