          "alias": "单女风衣城市冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired woman in a deep navy double-breasted short trench coat stands in a low-angle shot, her white chin-length hair lifting in a slight breeze. Her sharp, cold features are highlighted by dark red lipstick; her gaze locks directly at the viewer with intense, predatory focus. She extends a silver pistol in her black-gloved right hand, the muzzle aimed straight at the observer—a pose of taut, oppressive tension. She carries herself with dangerous elegance, body slightly tilted, left leg forward, right leg braced, caught in a moment of imminent action. Her coat is slightly open, revealing a black high-neck top clinging to her curves, and the transparent black stockings accentuate her long legs. She wears scuffed black pointed-toe ankle boots. The foreground is a wet gray cobblestone sidewalk with metal railing and glossy green shrubs, suggesting recent rain or humid air. The midground holds her figure—the coat fabric shows fine texture and subtle reflections, with details at cuffs, collar, and pockets. Background: a modern building of brown brick and glass, windows reflecting a blurred cityscape, a retro black cylindrical streetlamp with a security camera on top, the wall slightly weathered for urban realism. Wide-angle lens makes her appear taller and stretches depth; the gun arm and barrel direct visual focus to the center. Overcast natural light is soft and even, with fine highlights on her face and clothing, enhancing volume. The color palette leans cool—blues, grays, greens—creating a calm, tense, slightly detached urban atmosphere. The image has a snapshot realism, with simulated camera noise, slight blur, natural color shifts, film-grain texture, and slightly low contrast, as if snatched from a street encounter. Rich layers from foreground ground to distant architecture, composition full but not crowded, fusing figure and environment to convey a suspenseful secret action about to unfold.",
