          "alias": "单女露胸外套公寓坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a beige velvet sofa in a lavish interior, her colorful tweed jacket draped open, revealing bare chest and nipples. She wears pink lace stockings and pale blue satin flat shoes adorned with pearl beads and tassel ties. Her hair is pinned up with blunt bangs, makeup flawless, eyes half-lidded and lazy as she gazes into the camera, head slightly tilted with a faint smirk, legs crossed in an S-curve stretching toward the foreground. One hand casually holds a black embroidered handbag covered in floral patterns and metal embellishments. Behind her, a large floor mirror reflects her side profile and the room, showing a black abstract sculpture twisting upward, a dark wooden door, recessed wall lights, and a modern black cylindrical pendant lamp. To the right, a large window with wooden frames lets in soft natural light through half-drawn curtains, casting warm side lighting with delicate shadows. The brown carpet, smooth sofa lines, and warm beige-brown tones punctuated by pink, blue, and black create a luxurious, private, high-fashion atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly left of center, depth of field blurred background, sharp details, subtle film grain, high-resolution realistic style.",
