        {
          "id": "krea2-edf830c3558986a9bdd4cd13",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑手套闺房媚态坐自抚",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an ornate white-upholstered sofa, completely topless except for a sparkling silver crystal crown on her head and long black lace gloves that extend past her elbows, the intricate pattern leaving her fingers exposed. Her plump bare breasts are fully visible, nipples erect, as she raises one hand to touch her cheek while the other rests provocatively on her inner thigh. She wears sheer black thigh-high stockings and black leather ankle boots with metal buckle details, her legs crossed. Her glossy red lips and dark eye makeup contrast with her pale skin and sleek black hair with bangs. The background is a dramatic wall of sculpted white ceramic roses arranged in a geometric pattern, softly lit from the left. The scene is shot with a mid-angle lens, slightly overhead, capturing the luxurious, intimate boudoir atmosphere. The lighting is soft and warm, emphasizing the texture of the gloves, the shine of the crown, and the curves of her nude torso. The overall mood is elegant, seductive, and high-fashion, with a touch of gothic romance.",
