        {
          "id": "krea2-6bb2b560ae725292ea8a8d66",
          "alias": "单女白西装舞台媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her dark brown long curly hair cascading over her shoulders and chest, catching soft purple light with subtle glints. Her face is sharply defined, pale smooth skin, heavy layered eye makeup with deep blue-violet gradients, sharp eyeliner, a sultry, almost cold gaze directly into the lens, lips slightly parted, natural pink, a confident smirk. She wears a small round microphone fixed near her cheek, large silver hoop earrings, multiple necklaces—a black choker and fine chains with tiny beads. Her outfit: a white sleeveless strapless top with glossy fabric, dense silver sequins at the shoulders and neckline, a wide silver chain belt at the waist, and a white vertical-stripe blazer hanging open, its shoulders and cuffs also trimmed with sequins. A high-waisted white short shorts with matching silver chain detail at the waist. Her hands rest naturally at her sides, black nails, multiple silver rings on fingers, elegant relaxed pose. Background is solid deep blue with purple and blue front/top lighting creating a soft gradient and dreamy stage atmosphere. Medium upper-body close-up, sharp focus on her face and cleavage, background blurred with bokeh and color gradients. Lighting from front and above casts gentle shadows, highlighting her curves, the shimmer of her skin, and the glossy fabric. The vibe is cool, futuristic, artistic, with strong visual impact and an air of restrained sensuality.",
