        {
          "id": "krea2-79cdaebc1e97f0d9c8a9ce49",
          "alias": "单女白T恤广场微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a beige fabric sofa, her legs elegantly crossed and stretching onto the brown tile floor. She wears a white short-sleeved crewneck T-shirt, pulled up and tied beneath her full breasts, exposing her nipples; the shirt's front shows pink handwritten letters and small gold star print. She pairs it with a high-waisted A-line skirt in a light gray-white base with red and blue gingham pattern, the skirt fluffed and lifted slightly at one hip to reveal the curve of her thigh. A wide gray belt cinches her waist. On her feet are white square-toed chunky heel sandals with layered crisscross straps and a thin buckle at the ankle. Her long black hair falls naturally over her shoulders in soft waves. Her face is delicate, with a gentle smile and bright, warm eyes that look slightly toward the camera, expression relaxed and pleased. Her left hand rests lightly on the sofa back, her right hand hangs by her side, posture open and comfortable. To her left sits a bouquet wrapped in white kraft paper, holding pink roses, small white flowers, and green leaves. To her right is a pink cream cake decorated with small photo insert toppers; one reads \"Jangmi\" clearly. The background shows an indoor room with a large window behind, outside visible green plants and a stone wall. Soft natural light pours through the window, evenly and warmly illuminating the scene, creating a cozy, birthday celebration atmosphere. Composition is centered on the woman, mid-shot, with the bouquet and cake forming a balanced frame around her. The light casts subtle shadows and rich texture, with a color palette of white, pink, beige punctuated by green and gray, giving a candid, film-like quality full of youthful vitality and happiness.",
