          "id": "krea2-77c05410a75079449fdbab81",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉毛衣雪地沉思站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a brightly lit indoor room, her long, jet-black wavy hair cascading naturally over her shoulders and chest, soft curls with a subtle sheen. Her delicate features are perfectly proportioned, with fine arched eyebrows, light natural eye makeup with a hint of pearlescent shimmer, clear and focused eyes staring directly at the lens, lips slightly parted in a gentle, serene expression. Her fair, smooth skin has a faint blush on her cheeks, exuding an elegant yet sweet aura. She is topless, her pink knit cardigan unbuttoned and slipping off her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts with perky nipples. The cardigan has delicate vertical texture and lace trim, with a white lace-collared shirt underneath unbuttoned and pushed aside, adding a vintage romantic feel. She wears a white multi-layer ruffled mini skirt, puffy and lightweight, with lace edging and a slightly sheer fabric. Her arms are slightly raised, hands resting naturally at her sides, slender fingers, pose elegant and relaxed. Behind her stands a tall Christmas tree, thick trunk, lush branches covered in artificial snow, creating a winter atmosphere. The tree is adorned with silver ball ornaments of varying sizes, smooth and reflective, light blue ribbons and white bows fluttering gently, along with small bells and crystal pendants catching light. To the left is a large glass window, black metal frame, with some condensation or frost indicating cold or humid weather outside, blurry tree outlines visible. To the right is a modern interior corridor, light gray walls, smooth tile flooring, a glass door in the distance with a green emergency exit sign above. Natural light pours in from the window and door, soft and diffused, with the main light source from the front left, evenly illuminating the woman's face and body, soft shadows. The Christmas tree is backlit, creating bright outlines and strong contrast, enhancing depth and spatial hierarchy. The composition centers on the woman, mid-shot, with the tree positioned behind to the left for visual balance. Foreground branches and her hand gestures guide the eye to her face. The color palette is pink, white, and pale blue, creating a fresh, sweet atmosphere. The overall tone is soft and harmonious, highly visually appealing, with rich details and realistic texture, resembling a professional photo taken in natural light with a slight amateur feel, smooth light transitions, subtle grain, high color accuracy, conveying a warm and tranquil holiday spirit.",
