          "alias": "单女短裤广场俏皮站立持杯",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor space, her long brown hair with bangs pulled into two braided pigtails tied with black ribbon bows. She wears a tight black sleeveless crop top with transparent mesh panels across the chest, exposing her nipples through the sheer fabric, and silver metal buttons at the center. Her bottom is a dark camouflage mini shorts with uneven raw hems, riding high to reveal the curve of her ass. She lifts a pink ceramic mug to her lips, about to drink, while her right hand hangs naturally, holding a pair of black chopsticks. Her pose is relaxed, eyes cast to the side with a playful, focused expression. Full body from head to knees, centered slightly left, filling the frame. In the foreground, her clear silhouette and action details are sharp. The background is a light wood wall covered with white square posters featuring red logos, pink cartoon bears, and hearts. On the right, a huge red-and-white circular decorative structure dominates the visual focus. On the left, a wooden table holds a black portable gas stove with a silver pot, a yellow knitted blanket draped nearby, and a phone placed on a chair. These props create a lived-in, reality-show-like atmosphere. Midground includes furniture and props: table, chair, stove, blanket. The background extends to the wall and large decoration, layered clearly. A flat eye-level angle with focus on her, background slightly blurred to emphasize her. Lighting is soft, even, from front and side, no harsh shadows. Overall warm bright tones, with pink cup, yellow blanket, red decoration adding lively color accents. The scene feels like a candid capture from a variety show or livestream, realistic yet artfully composed. Skin is smooth and natural, clothes texture visible, blending everyday authenticity with professional photographic beauty.",
