          "prompt": "A silver-haired young woman with a short bob cut, wearing a tight black high-neck sleeveless bodysuit that clings to her curves, paired with a textured black leather miniskirt featuring metal buckles, black thigh-high stockings, and a black beret with a gold bow. Her makeup is flawless, red lips slightly parted, eyes sharp and focused, fair skin glowing. She grips a long black polearm in her right hand, arm raised, body slightly tilted in a powerful dynamic pose. Low-angle shot from the left foreground, emphasizing her commanding presence. Dim indoor industrial space with gray cement walls, overhead pipes and lamps. Strong backlight from the right creates dramatic rim light and lens flare, dust particles visible in the air. Hazy background reveals vague objects and red glowing devices, adding mystery. Overall cool blue-gray palette, high contrast, rich chiaroscuro. Her silhouette is outlined by harsh light with soft edge glow. Visual lines from her pose and weapon lead to the light source in the upper right. Deep depth and cinematic tension. Fine texture, sharp details, as if shot with professional full-frame camera and fast lens in a controlled studio. Blend of sci-fi cyberpunk and Japanese anime aesthetics, modern with a retro-futuristic feel. Cool, stylish, story-driven—like a keyframe from a film capturing a tense moment. No clutter, all elements serve the subject. Leather matte texture contrasts with metal reflectiveness; pearl necklace catches light. The scene suggests an impending fight or crucial event. Highly artistic, realistic yet fantastical.",
