          "alias": "单女半褪白连衣裙酒廊微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman reclines on a beige fabric chaise lounge, her light brown hair with blunt bangs falling softly around her face, a delicate white hairpin tucked in the strands. She turns slightly, resting her chin on her hand, her gaze warm and inviting as she looks toward the camera with a serene, knowing smile. She wears a white off-shoulder dress with a subtle purple and yellow floral print, the neckline trimmed with black lace, the wide, ruffled sleeves slipping off one shoulder to reveal the curve of her collarbone and the swell of her breast. The short, flouncy skirt rides up her thighs, showing off long, bare legs - one knee bent, foot resting on the cushion, the other leg extended gracefully. Her bare feet press into the soft velvet of the chaise, ankles slender. The chaise itself is tufted with button details, brass nailheads along the edge, and carved wooden legs. She sits slightly off-center, with a tall floral arrangement of white, pink, and pale yellow blooms and greenery creating a vertical wall to her left. The background is a pure white wall, the floor a smooth light gray concrete. Soft, natural light streams from the left, illuminating her skin, catching the delicate fabric of her dress, and casting gentle shadows that emphasize the contours of her body. The warm, intimate atmosphere feels like a stolen moment of stillness, her expression relaxed yet subtly seductive, the pose unhurried and elegant, inviting the viewer into a quiet, sensual fantasy. The focus is sharp on her face and the soft texture of her skin, with the background and flowers gently blurred, framing her as the sole object of desire.",
