her face, follows her body contours, the falling fringe, and the stair lines, converging into the depth of the frame. Lighting is even, highlighting the fabric texture and her skin. The palette is primarily black and white, accented by silver fringe and pink tips on some strands, giving a clean yet striking contrast. The atmosphere is urban fashion with a mysterious, icy sensuality. The image is hyper-real, like a high-end photograph frozen in a candid moment between editorial art and everyday grit.",
