          "alias": "单女礼服室内冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty in an exquisite Hanfu sits gracefully in a warm-toned indoor scene. She wears a pale pink, off-shoulder long gown with delicate purple floral embroidery, the silk fabric flowing smoothly with a lustrous sheen. The wide sleeves drape naturally, creating an elegant, fluid silhouette. Her hair is styled in a high bun, with long black hair cascading over one shoulder. On her head rests an ornate black crown adorned with golden motifs and bead strings, exuding noble elegance. Her bangs are neatly arranged, her makeup refined and natural—thin arched brows, soft eyeshadow, and pale lips against luminous fair skin. Around her neck, a simple silver pendant adds a cool, delicate touch. Her hands gently hold a round silk fan, white with purple floral embroidery and lace trim, the slender handle ending in blue tassels that sway slightly. Her gaze is calm and deep, looking forward with a contemplative expression, as if lost in memory or anticipation. The foreground focuses on her upper body, framed in a medium shot slightly left of center. The background features orange-red drapery with faint calligraphy, creating a rich cultural atmosphere. Several white paper lanterns hang behind, casting soft warm light that forms hazy halos, enhancing the interplay of light and shadow on her figure. The main light source comes from the right and above, producing natural chiaroscuro that softly defines her face and the folds of her gown. The lanterns are arranged in balanced asymmetry, adding depth, while pink cherry blossom branches bloom in the distance, infusing the scene with spring vitality. The composition is centrally symmetrical, with the figure centered and lanterns flanking, evoking stability and harmony. The visual flow is guided by her eyes and the fan’s direction toward the viewer, while the background elements strengthen the spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is serene, gentle, and poetic, rich in classical Eastern aesthetics. The color palette combines warm orange, pinkish white, and muted purple, with unified tones. The lighting and shadow effects are detailed and realistic, resembling professional photography with cinematic quality—rich textures, translucent skin, natural fabric folds, and a blurred background that highlights the subject. This highly artistic image blends traditional charm with modern aesthetics, full of narrative and emotional tension, as if transporting the viewer to a tranquil ancient courtyard steeped in time and culture.",
