          "alias": "单女棕外套街道忧伤蹲自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches by a window indoors, her brown curly hair falling naturally with soft shine and subtle highlights, bangs gently brushing her forehead, hair in warm brown tones with layered highlights of light gold and deep brown, strands fine and bouncy, slightly wavy texture appearing fluffy and three-dimensional under the light. She wears a vintage-style brown suede jacket, soft with a slight nap and natural wrinkles, smooth shoulder lines, cuffs revealing a black-and-white striped knit top underneath, fine even stripes, the neckline slightly open, revealing her collarbone and neck. Her pose is relaxed, knees together, body leaning forward slightly, holding a dark-shell phone with a star pattern on the back, camera module visible, taking a selfie. Her gaze is focused and a bit contemplative, eyes on the phone screen, lips slightly pursed, expression calm with a hint of melancholy. Her skin is fair and delicate, facial features soft, nose straight, eyebrows natural, eyelashes long, makeup light, highlighting her natural beauty. She wears black stockings, long legs, and orange short boots that appear leather, round toes, low heels, with white fluffy trim around the boot tops, adding warmth. The background is an indoor space near a large glass window, showing a blurred city street scene with building outlines, utility poles, parked cars, and distant traffic lights. Bright window light creates a soft backlight effect, while indoor light is warm, mixing natural light from the window with indoor lighting, creating a cozy and slightly hazy atmosphere. The floor is gray carpet, walls light beige, doorframe metal, door handle simple modern. The composition is a close-up, with the subject occupying most of the frame, slightly left of center, her body forming an S-curve, her gaze guiding the viewer's eye to the phone screen, creating a focal point. Lighting is natural, main light from the left window, creating soft chiaroscuro on her face and hair, shadows delicate with no harsh edges. Overall color palette warm browns, beige-yellow, gray-black, harmonious, with a slight film grain effect. The image is rich in detail, from hair strands to fabric textures to building lines in the background, with a realistic daily snapshot feel, as if capturing a quiet afternoon moment, full of youthful languor and private self-expression. The atmosphere is quiet and warm, blending artistic quality with lived-in texture.",
