        {
          "id": "krea2-05401be1d88e77e9cbf70cff",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套雪地微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a snowy urban street, her long black wavy hair with blunt bangs, beaming a bright smile with white teeth and lively eyes. She wears a vibrant royal blue double-breasted wool coat, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal her bare chest and black lace bralette, the tailored hem at knee-length. A thick cream chunky knit scarf is loosely draped around her neck. She wears black stockings and high black leather boots, hands casually slipped into the coat pockets. Behind her, a giant pink flower art installation with layered petals, soft gradient edges, and an orange-yellow center, set against a glass facade reflecting surrounding buildings with \"Bakery\" visible. Grey stone pavement with patches of melting snow. Overcast diffuse light, soft and even. Center composition with the woman as main focus. Warm, vivid, everyday urban atmosphere blended with public art, capturing a candid moment — intimate and alluring.",
