        {
          "id": "krea2-530635d9a89f8eb9875817dc",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫舞台叛逆站立张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage in a sheer white long-sleeve blouse, tight black corset-style mini skirt, black lace thigh-high stockings, and black stiletto heels, exuding a powerful stage presence. Her dark hair falls with blunt bangs, strands shifting with movement; her face is heavily made-up, lips parted red, eyes locked intently on the lens with a confident, almost defiant gaze. Her left hand dangles loosely gripping a microphone, right hand resting at her hip, body slightly forward, legs apart in a firm dance stance. The mid-shot composition focuses on her torso and legs, the deep blue stage background lined with vertical red LED strips and blurred white graffiti-style text, creating stark modern contrast. The foreground shows silhouettes of audience heads, enhancing the live concert feel. Lighting comes from above and front spotlights, casting sharp chiaroscuro—her face and body evenly lit, subtle shadow folds in her clothing. Background lights diffuse softly. Overall cool blue-black tones with warm red accents, generating a sexy, edgy atmosphere. Dynamic tension in her pose, leading lines from her limbs into the background depth. The scene captures a high-energy live music moment, with professional photography quality yet raw, improvisational realism. Rich detail, layered composition, moderate saturation—an aesthetic blend of artistic and documentary style.",
