        {
          "id": "krea2-06eecf502bb5bc5e00ea1e72",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙室内媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a brightly lit indoor set, wearing a vivid red sleeveless deep-V dress, the neckline plunging to reveal generous cleavage, with two elegant black bows at the waist creating a striking color contrast. Her long, dark brown hair falls naturally in soft waves over her shoulders, catching the light with a healthy sheen. Small gold earrings glint subtly, adding a touch of refined sensuality. She offers a warm, self-assured smile, her eyes clear and inviting, lips slightly parted, as she raises both hands with palms open in a welcoming, playful gesture—almost tempting the viewer to step closer. Her body is slightly angled toward the camera, emphasizing her curves, with the red dress hugging her hips and thighs. In the foreground, she occupies the left-center of the composition, balanced and layered. The background is a modern kitchen set with pink-toned walls featuring grid textures and geometric patterns, white shelves lined with silver cookware, stainless steel bowls, and a black pepper mill—all adding realistic domestic warmth. Above, a large electronic screen displays the blurred word \"you\" and partial brand logos, bordered by vintage ornamentation, blending fashion with tech. The lighting is soft and uniform from above and front, casting gentle shadows that accentuate her figure without harsh highlights. The scene is saturated with red, pink, white, black, and metallic tones, creating vivid visual impact. Shot mid-frame, full-body, at eye level, with her gaze and hand gestures directing attention center-frame. The mood is cheerful, intimate, and professionally polished—like a behind-the-scenes moment from a talk show or a brand campaign, but with an unmistakable erotic undertone. The image feels crisp, detailed, and artfully commercial.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
