        {
          "id": "krea2-b490469af4ebed01df9b2a15",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑外套街道微笑站立整理头发",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a wet city street, wearing only an open black tweed jacket with double-breasted detailing, frayed cuffs and hem, her bare breasts exposed, black V-neck top discarded, black shorts low on her hips, black stockings, and thick-laced combat boots, her foot resting on the gray stone pavement with yellow tactile paving blocks. Her long hair falls naturally, right hand gently brushing her hair, she gazes at the camera with a soft, confident smile, left hand holding a small black leather shoulder bag slung over her shoulder. To the left, an orange traffic cone printed with Korean text \"주차금지\". In the background, a white van with glossy reflective surfaces, headlights slightly on, parked in front of a light-colored stone or tile building with vertical lines, distant glass high-rises visible under an overcast gray sky, soft even light, no harsh shadows, the scene is post-rain, ground wet and reflective, mirroring the figure and van. Center composition, subject slightly right of center, focal point on her face, layers from cone in foreground to her and van in midground, then buildings and sky in background, realistic urban street photography, slight grain and natural color reproduction, cool muted tones with the orange cone as a bright accent, capturing an unposed, candid, sensual moment of everyday city life.",
