        {
          "id": "krea2-187c4cc08d38edd08293c0b7",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服摄影棚媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A stunning woman in a glamorous black sequin gown sits gracefully on an antique carved black wooden chair. Her long, wavy black hair cascades over her shoulders, catching soft light with a subtle sheen. Her face is refined and sculpted, with high-fashion layered makeup—intense eyeliner defining her deep-set eyes, full red lips. She gazes at the camera with calm, confident allure. Her right hand holds a golden abstract sculpture trophy with intricate metallic texture; her left wrist wears a minimalist watch and fine chain bracelet, while long tassel gold earrings dangle, casting delicate light shifts with her slight movement. She wears a black sequin slip dress with a dramatic deep V-neckline, thin spaghetti straps highlighting her collarbone and the soft curve of her breasts. The dress is covered in dense tiny sequins that shimmer gold under the light. A high slit runs up her thigh, revealing her long, toned leg. Her right leg extends slightly forward, left leg crossed over, and she wears black pointed-toe stiletto heels also dusted with sequins. The background is a pure black gradient backdrop, creating a minimalist, deep space. Side light from the upper left casts a soft, sensual glow on her face, arms, and the edges of her dress, producing strong chiaroscuro and depth. Natural shadows fall on the floor and under the chair. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, slightly off-center left, her pose relaxed yet noble, directing focus to her expression and the trophy. The atmosphere is elegant, luxurious, and modern. Tones of black and gold dominate, warmed by studio lighting for a rich, sensual effect. The image feels like high-end commercial photography with artistic impact.",
