        {
          "id": "krea2-a11043798ba19d77521c6c1e",
          "alias": "单女半褪黑长裤健身房专注坐张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits centered on a Pilates reformer, legs spread in a full split, torso leaning slightly forward, her right hand holding a white smartphone with a small yellow flower on the case as she takes a selfie. Her long hair falls naturally over her bare shoulders, strands catching soft light. She wears only a light pink sports crop top (pulled down to expose her breasts) and tight black leggings, white socks on her feet. A dark circular pattern is faintly visible on her left knee. She smiles gently, eyes clear and focused on the phone screen, expression relaxed and confident. In the foreground, the metal frame of the Pilates machine—silver-gray bars and uprights—is clearly visible, with several black training straps and gray fleece grips hanging from it. The machine’s surface reflects ambient light. In the midground, a wooden Pilates assist chair and the edge of the reformer show warm natural wood tones. The background features a large window with horizontal blinds, letting in soft natural light; vague building outlines are visible outside. The ceiling is white with grid-pattern panels, recessed lights and a pendant lamp casting warm white glow from above and side, creating even illumination on floor and walls. The overall space is clean, bright, with a modern fitness studio atmosphere. The composition uses a mirror-reflection perspective; the figure is positioned left of center, leaving ample space on the right to showcase machine details, achieving visual balance. A slight downward camera angle enhances depth. Visual lines from the woman’s pose, machine structure, and window lines guide the eye from foreground to background, evoking a quiet, focused workout moment. Lighting is delicate and soft, without harsh contrast, producing a natural indoor photography texture. The color palette is cream, light gray, wood, black, and pink, with an overall warm and cozy feel, blending everyday realism with artistic serene beauty. Captured as a quiet, disciplined fitness moment, the scene is rich in detail yet uncluttered, showcasing a minimalist yet refined lifestyle aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
