          "alias": "单女露胸牛仔舞台戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage under bright lights, her long black hair tied high with a vivid red ribbon. Her fair skin glows, delicate features framed by soft eye makeup and pale pink lips curved in a teasing, sensual smile. She wears a black off-shoulder top pushed down to expose her bare breasts, one sleeve slipping off her shoulder, revealing her slender arm. Dark skinny jeans hug her hips. In her hands, she holds a giant realistic bread pillow, its golden crust and brown inner layers prominent, the pillow positioned to partially conceal but also highlight her exposed chest. A dark braided bracelet adorns her wrist, a thin gold necklace rests on her collarbone, and small earrings catch the light. Behind her, a colorful LED screen shows blurred cartoon patterns in pink, blue, green, creating a dreamy atmosphere. A white booth with a blue floral pattern and \"TAN\" text sits beneath it. Stage lighting from above front casts even illumination, soft shadows, and colorful reflections on her skin. The medium-shot composition centers on her, with the bread pillow in the foreground as a focal point. Slight low angle makes her appear taller. Warm, bright tones, high saturation, with subtle noise and motion blur mimicking casual real-photo style. She exudes confident, playful sensuality, as if at a fan event.",
