          "alias": "单女舞者束身衣舞台媚态摆拍",
          "prompt": "A female dancer in a tight leopard-print bustier bodysuit and matching high-waisted shorts performs passionately on a dark stage, her arms raised high above her head, body arched back in a powerful, confident pose. Her long hair cascades freely, catching the movement as she smiles radiantly with a headset microphone near her lips, her expression focused and lost in the performance. The outfit includes a black leather belt cinching her waist, tassels along the hem of the shorts, sheer fishnet stockings, and high black patent leather boots. Her hands are covered in long leopard-print gloves with metal buckle accents at the wrists, and multiple layered silver chain necklaces hang around her neck. The entire look is fiercely sensual and wild. The background is pure black, sharply isolating her silhouette and every detail. Stage lighting from below casts strong chiaroscuro, concentrating on her upper body and face, creating dramatic shadows. A low-angle shot intensifies her presence, with symmetrical composition: her raised arms drawing the eye upward, legs slightly apart forming a stable triangle. The foreground shows her full figure in crisp detail, midground highlights her dynamic pose and costume textures, while the background remains a void of black. The color palette centers on golden-brown leopard print accented by black, white, and metallic sheen, giving a warm, layered tone. The atmosphere is electric, brimming with energy, as if the music's beat and crowd's roar are palpable. The image is hyper-realistic, like a professional studio or large concert live shot, with cinematic visual quality. Captured with an 85mm lens, shallow depth of field keeps her sharp against a creamy bokeh, light soft yet starkly contrasty, combining fashion with artistic stage imagery.",
