          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways by an indoor window, her lustrous black hair pinned into an elegant low bun with a few loose strands framing her ear, adding softness and spontaneity. Her pale, flawless skin and delicate, sculpted features are accentuated by subtle earth-tone eye makeup, defined liner, full curled lashes, and a deep, contemplative gaze fixed on the distant view outside the window. Her lips are slightly parted, her expression serene and thoughtful. She wears a sleek black asymmetrical jacket with a wide, modern geometric collar, two symmetric square patch pockets with black buttons, and three-quarter sleeves revealing cuffs of a pale blue shirt underneath, the collar peeking out for layered texture. A flowing black pleated skirt completes the look, blending urban chic with vintage elegance. The indoor setting has a floor-to-ceiling window on the left, its glass misted with tiny droplets, letting in soft natural light. White sheer curtains and warm beige drapes sway gently, while a simple floor lamp on the right, with a white shade and dark wooden stem, casts a warm glow. The far wall is light gray, the floor dark wood. The medium-shot composition places her slightly off-center left, her body tilted, her gaze leading the viewer’s eye beyond the frame. Natural window light illuminates her face and clothes softly, with smooth shadows on her back and right side, creating depth. The intimate, warm atmosphere is captured as if by a high-end phone in early morning or evening, focusing on her face and outfit details with a slight background blur, giving a candid, artistic everyday moment. The jacket is slightly open, revealing the pale blue shirt and a subtle hint of cleavage, her bare collarbone and neck exposed, adding a sensual touch to the sophisticated look.",
