          "alias": "单女米连帽衫小巷微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the center of a narrow, lived-in alley. Her long, sleek black hair falls with straight bangs, and her pale skin glows softly. She gazes gently into the lens with a slight, natural smile—her overall vibe fresh yet subtly lazy. She wears an unzipped cream-colored zip-up hoodie with bold blue \"29\" print on the chest, now open to reveal her bare, full breasts. A black lace-trimmed ruffled short skirt hugs her hips, layered with gray thigh-high socks that accentuate her long, toned legs. In her right hand, she holds a black phone with a dark case, the camera module visible; her fingers are adorned with a few simple silver rings. A black leather shoulder bag hangs diagonally across her chest. Her pose is relaxed and casual, body slightly turned, head tilted—an effortless, sensual beauty. The composition places her slightly left of center in a close-up, emphasizing her face and the details of her exposed chest and clothing. In the midground, flanking walls: a white wall with blue stripes and black metal window bars on the left, a dark gray wooden door with stickers and number tags on the right, edges worn. The cement ground is rough, with a light stone path leading away. Details like piled clutter, pipes, and wires add realism. At the end of the alley, stairs rise upward, flanked by colorful brick walls—red, blue, yellow—bright light from the exit creating strong chiaroscuro and depth. The sky is mostly blocked, only a sliver of light at the far end. The alley's perspective lines draw the eye deep into the scene, with the woman at the golden ratio as the focal point. Natural light pours from the end, creating a soft backlight that outlines her silhouette in a faint halo. Her face is evenly lit, but the bright background produces a slight rim-light effect, casting long shadows on walls and ground, enhancing spatial depth. The atmosphere is quiet, everyday—urban street realness mixed with youthful sensuality. Colors: cream, blue-gray, black, with tiny warm accents; harmonious and understated. The image feels like a casual smartphone shot—fine grain and slight motion blur, focal length close to human eye, giving an intimate, natural documentary style. Background bokeh is moderate, keeping the focus on her while retaining enough environment to convey a serene, warm moment in a city corner.",
