          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern office, wearing a white blazer and matching miniskirt, her deep crimson bra visible beneath the open jacket. She wears sheer black stockings that cling to her long, shapely thighs, and striking white high heels with bright red soles that create a bold color contrast. She is seated sideways on a light gray fabric chair, her right leg bent and lifted, left leg dangling, body slightly leaning forward. Her right hand rests lightly on the keyboard of an open laptop, her eyes cast downward at the screen, expression focused and contemplative. Her long black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, makeup refined, lips full and red. The overall look is a blend of professional polish and raw sensuality. In the foreground, her legs and heels dominate the lower frame, the glossy stockings catching soft light, the sleek white heels and red soles drawing the eye. The midground includes a wooden desk with dark wood grain, a black laptop glowing faintly, a power outlet and switch plate nearby. The background is a pale lavender wall with built-in shelves holding books and decor, and a geometric gray-and-white patterned rug on the floor. Sunlight streams in from a window on the left, casting sharp shadows across the floor and desk, creating strong chiaroscuro. Low-angle shot emphasizes the elegant lines of her legs and heels while adding depth. She is positioned on the right, leaving negative space on the left for balanced composition. Visual flow moves from the heels up to her face, then to the laptop. Lighting is soft natural daylight with cool undertones, supplemented by indoor lights, producing a warm-cool contrast. Overall color palette is cool grays, white, and black, accented by crimson and wood tones. The image feels like a professional photograph taken in natural light, rich in detail, realistic texture, and potent erotic tension.",
