          "alias": "单女露胸黑丝袜山野媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern interior, her body turned slightly to the side, leaning forward with a magazine open in her right hand, her left hand brushing through her hair. She is completely topless, her bare breasts visible, with a graceful and sensual poise. Her long black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, her delicate face with high cheekbones and full lips, her eyes focused on the reading material, a hint of thoughtful arousal. She wears only transparent high-heeled sandals and black stockings that accentuate her slender ankles and long, straight legs, her outfit minimalist and erotic. The warm-toned home environment features a dark wooden floor with distinct grain and joints, reflecting soft light. In the foreground, a black open shelving unit holds an open laptop showing a majestic mountain wallpaper, along with two colorful gift boxes—one red, one green—tied with gold ribbons and red pom-poms, adding a festive touch. To the right, a light wood countertop hosts a retro green espresso machine with silver handles and a pressure gauge, next to a cream-colored toaster and a manual coffee grinder with a ceramic dripper, all rich in detail. The composition is a mid-shot with the woman on the left, creating a visual focal point, her curves contrasting with the straight lines of the background. A slightly low camera angle makes her appear taller while preserving the full environment. Natural light from the left window filters through vertical blinds, casting warm yellow lines of light and shadow across the walls and floor, creating a serene morning or evening atmosphere. Soft indoor lighting supplements the main source, keeping the scene bright but not harsh. The color palette is dominated by black, brown, and yellow, with bright red and green accents, offering a harmonious contrast. The image feels highly realistic and lived-in, as if capturing an intimate, candid moment at home. Professionally shot with high resolution, fine detail, and controlled noise, resembling a spontaneous snapshot from amateur gear. The lens has a moderate focal length with reasonable depth of field, keeping the subject sharp and the background slightly blurred, drawing attention to her naked form. The composition is balanced, proportioned, and full of artistic narrative, conveying a modern, independent woman enjoying a moment of self-indulgence, blending fashion with raw sensuality.",
