        {
          "id": "krea2-32878e408f24316484c6bfca",
          "alias": "单女礼服电梯沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a luxurious elevator, wearing a deep crimson velvet one-shoulder gown with fluffy fur trim on the shoulder, long velvet sleeves with fitted cuffs, and delicate silver crystal buckle details at the waist. The A-line skirt flares slightly, exuding vintage elegance. Her long dark brown hair with golden highlights cascades in natural waves over her shoulders, soft and layered. Her makeup is refined—sharp eyeliner, soft rose-pink lips, bright eyes locked on the camera. Her face is sculpted, skin fair and smooth. A small pearl earring dangles from her right ear. On her left hand, she wears a matching long velvet glove; her right hand holds a white woven clutch with black trim and a metal chain. The overall look is opulent and confident. She poses with arms spread, left hand lightly touching the mirrored elevator wall, body slightly turned to show her curves. The mirrored walls reflect countless blurred figures and warm golden lights, creating an infinite visual effect. The ceiling's circular fixture and warm downlights cast starburst highlights and soft glow on the reflective surfaces. The polished marble or metal floor captures her reflection and ambient light. The composition is symmetrical, placing her at center as the main subject. The foreground emphasizes her face and upper body, especially her gaze and dress details; the middle ground shows environmental reflections; the background is filled with soft bokeh and reflections, blending reality and surreal beauty. The lighting comes from above and around, creating gentle chiaroscuro with shadows beneath her and in the reflections. The atmosphere is warm, luxurious, romantic—like a high-end fashion editorial shot in a hotel or nightclub elevator. The image retains a slight everyday-camera feel (subtle grain, natural exposure) for authenticity. Colors are dominantly deep red, gold, and warm brown, accented by silver and white, giving a festive, celebratory vibe. Every detail—fabric texture, hair shine, reflection points—is crisp and realistic. This is a perfect frame for a fashion magazine cover, brand campaign, or personal portrait.",
