          "prompt": "A red-haired woman in a daring black nun robe with white lace lingerie underneath, a high slit revealing her legs, white lace stockings, and high heels. She wears a black headscarf, red hair cascading out, bangs, sharp makeup with dark eyeshadow and deep lipstick, a cold yet seductive gaze directly at the camera. She stands before an altar in a Gothic church, body slightly turned, left hand resting on a white carved railing, right hand hanging naturally, elegant and tense. A crucifix necklace rests on her chest. The scene is symmetric: foreground red-carpeted wooden steps flanked by tall metal candlesticks with unlit white candles; midground white stone railings; background towering pale gray Gothic arches, a large dark brown wooden cross above three pointed colored glass windows (purple, blue, red) casting soft, mysterious light. Lighting from the windows and natural light creates cool blue-white shadows, a sacred yet somber atmosphere. Center composition, the figure occupies the center, layers distinct, focus sharp on her. Light and shadow detailed, strong contrast, even illumination on face and body, soft shadows enhancing dimension. Dominant black and white tones with red and warm glass accents, creating a dramatic, artistic, narrative quality like a religious-themed portrait but with a candid, amateur photography feel. Medium format camera, visible film grain, moderate saturation, accurate exposure, rich details, natural bokeh, controlled depth of field, realistic and story-rich image.",
