        {
          "id": "krea2-6f8132859ada0cbe51f1285a",
          "alias": "单女粉西装车库媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young Asian woman in a light pink fitted blazer dress, deep V-neck with several front buttons undone, exposing her bare cleavage and the smooth curves of her breasts, the fabric hugging her waist and hips. She stands confidently beside a bright yellow sports car, one hand lifting her hair to reveal her neck, the other resting on her hip. A black chain bag hangs from her shoulder, a brown leather bracelet and gold rings on her wrist, a delicate floral necklace resting at her collarbone. Her makeup is flawless, red lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the camera with a cold, mysterious allure. The scene is an underground parking garage, white walls and gray concrete floor, overhead pipes and lights visible, warm yellow light casting soft shadows across her face, the folds of her dress, and the glossy paint of the car. The yellow car reflects the surrounding light, adding depth. Composition is a mid-shot, her body centered slightly left, the car's front extending to the right, creating balance. The foreground emphasizes her sensual figure and open dress, midground shows the car and partial space, background reveals architectural lines and blurred light sources. Dominant colors are pink and yellow, accented with black, white, gray, and metallic tones, high contrast yet harmonious. Natural shadows and highlights enhance texture and three-dimensionality, evoking a luxury fashion editorial with a voyeuristic, candid feel.",
