        {
          "id": "krea2-0c79367e6f0d2374d678d5b2",
          "alias": "单女湿身和服花园忧伤持伞",
          "prompt": "A pink-haired young woman in an elegant Japanese-style ensemble, her soft gradient pink hair flowing in silky strands under warm light, adorned with a bronze butterfly hair ornament, part of her hair tied into a high ponytail with drifting ends, blending grace and vitality. Her delicate makeup features sharp eyeliner emphasizing deep, thoughtful eyes, and a subtle red lip tint. Her clear facial contours and three-dimensional features carry a hint of melancholy and contemplation as she half-turns to glance back at the viewer with complex emotion. She wears a fusion of traditional and modern kimono-style clothing: a tight white inner top paired with a sleeveless black outer garment with a high slit, exposing one shoulder and the curve of her back. A red thin belt cinches her waist, metallic fastenings adorn her chest, and the layered black-and-white skirt hem is embroidered with gold patterns, rich in detail and texture. In her right hand, she holds a translucent red oil-paper umbrella, its canopy lightly open, revealing delicate ribs and faint traditional motifs; the wooden handle feels warm. In her left hand, she wears a long red glove, her arm relaxed and slightly bent, exuding an elegant, composed poise. The background is a hazy dark red, as if soaked by a sunset sky or burning flames, creating an intense, mysterious atmosphere. A few blossoming plum branches are faintly visible, their vivid red flowers layered and full of life. Warm yellow paper lanterns hang symmetrically on both sides, casting soft illumination that enhances the Eastern ambiance. In the distance, blurred architectural outlines suggest a traditional Japanese garden or shrine, adding depth and narrative. The composition is a medium shot, the figure slightly off-center left, body angled, head turned back toward the viewer, creating strong visual engagement. Foreground emphasizes her clothing details and facial expression; midground layers the umbrella, lanterns, and plum blossoms; background uses muted colors and light to build mood. Symmetrical yet dynamic, the red-and-black contrast heightens visual impact. Light primarily from upper right simulates natural sunlight, creating chiaroscuro on her face and garments, with soft shadows emphasizing volume. The lanterns provide secondary warm fill, resulting in an evenly lit, warm, and poetic atmosphere, as if in an ancient twilight legend. The overall aesthetic blends classical Japanese beauty with modern sensibility—fantasy anime character realism meets photographic texture, as if shot at night with a large-aperture lens, bokeh natural, colors saturated but not exaggerated, details sharp, noise controlled, evoking a premium film look.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
