        {
          "id": "krea2-3496f1b70e2ba27828beb060",
          "alias": "单女露胸白短裙教堂叛逆站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on the wide stone steps before Florence’s Santa Maria del Fiore cathedral at night, her bare breasts exposed, a white polka-dot skirt unbuttoned at the waist, black leather jacket hanging open off her shoulders, black stockings and high heels. One hand on her hip, the other holding a long black coat, she stares directly into the lens with a calm, defiant expression. The breeze lifts a few strands of hair. A small black bag with sparkling studs hangs from her shoulder. The gray stone steps are worn and ancient, leading upward diagonally, creating strong perspective lines toward the cathedral’s façade. To the left, a rough red-brown brick wall with a black-framed window and a tag reading “@originalsiena”. To the right, the massive black-and-white marble stripes of the cathedral glow under warm yellow lights, intricate religious carvings above the arch, central columns highlighted. A blurred pedestrian passes in the background near the entrance. Low-angle shot, the woman positioned left of center, steps cutting diagonally across the frame. The lighting is artificial, warm yellow on the church and steps, deep shadows around. The overall mood is romantic and slightly mysterious. The image has a phone-camera grain, natural exposure, a mix of deep gray, black, cream, and warm yellow tones.",
