        {
          "id": "krea2-20ed8b266c88fe2a27c2a646",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣街道媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a selfie on a nighttime city street, wearing a black high-neck sheer bodysuit with thin straps and cutouts at the waist, revealing patches of bare skin and her waistline, paired with a black zip-up jacket embroidered with white \"SMF\" letters on the left chest. Her deep dark hair falls naturally, slightly tousled; her makeup is bold with heavy eyeliner and dark lipstick, her eyes locked on the camera with a cold, confident expression. She holds a retro digital camera in her left hand, its screen reflecting her own image, creating a self-gazing effect. A thin chain cross necklace and long tassel earrings dangle, adding an occult allure. The background is a European stone wall of beige bricks with classical moldings, dark wooden grid windows, and a carved stone pillar to the right, with dark gray slate paving. Warm yellow streetlamp light spills from the side and above, while a red light panel casts dramatic shadows across her face and body, heightening the sensual contrast. The bokeh blurs the background, emphasizing her figure. The overall palette blends black, brown, and yellow, punctuated by red glows, evoking a gritty nightlife aesthetic with refined detail, as if captured by a professional camera but with a raw, instant-film realism—intense visual tension and erotic energy.",
