        {
          "id": "krea2-4ba1a5cde219ae967d6f5f32",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道媚态倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans seductively against a black metal railing at night in London, with the iconic Big Ben towering behind her, its Gothic spire and clock face illuminated in warm yellow light. She wears a tight black one-shoulder mini dress that hugs her curves, the hem ending mid-thigh, revealing long, bare legs. Her black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, her makeup is bold with heavy eyeliner and full lips, and she looks directly at the camera with a confident, alluring smirk. A small butterfly tattoo adorns her left arm. Her right leg is bent with foot on the ground, left leg straight, stance daring and provocative. She wears high-shine black patent leather thigh-high boots with metal buckles and straps, and carries a sleek black handbag. A delicate silver bracelet and sparkling earrings catch the light. The scene is shot from a low angle, making her appear taller and emphasizing the grandeur of the historic and modern architecture behind her. The mood blends urban nightlife with personal empowerment, the deep blue and black tones offset by warm yellow lights, creating a striking cold-warm contrast. The image feels like a cinematic street fashion moment, sensual and confident.",
