        {
          "id": "krea2-b098663d6abd0a30e681c436",
          "alias": "单女透视棕外套电梯忧伤站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a modern luxury architectural interior, wearing a thick brown shaggy fur coat with soft, layered texture and natural tan tones. The coat is slightly open, revealing a black high-waist tight mini skirt with vertical pleating that hugs her curves, paired with black sheer stockings and pointed-toe stiletto heels adorned with bow details. She holds a small black chain bag in one hand, the metal links catching cold light. Her deep brown wavy hair falls naturally, her makeup is striking with defined eyes and full lips. She stands slightly turned, body leaning forward, head bowed, eyes cast downward in a contemplative, melancholic mood. Her right hand gently touches the coat's shoulder, hinting at a sensual, languid pose. The background features gray marble walls with white veining, horizontal LED strips emitting soft cool white light, and a polished marble floor reflecting her image like a mirror. A transparent glass partition with metal trim is visible on the left, and distant elevator doors. Soft, even lighting from above and the wall strips creates rich contrasts through reflections. The composition is centered on her, medium shot, occupying two-thirds of the frame, with a balanced, high-fashion aesthetic. The overall palette blends gray, black, and brown, evoking a cold, elegant, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The image feels like a professional fashion editorial, intimate and narrative.",
