          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate blue-and-white bunny-girl cosplay kneels gracefully on grey paving stones outdoors. Her silky silver-blue hair cascades over her shoulders, framing a delicate, coldly beautiful face with light purple eyes that gaze intently at the camera. She wears tall blue-and-white bunny ears with dark blue inner stars and fluffy white trim. Her tight, shiny blue satin dress has a white standing collar with a layered blue flower brooch and pearl center, open shoulders with thin blue ribbon bow straps, and a deep V-neckline that exposes the full swell of her breasts, the fabric clinging to her curves. The hem is trimmed with ruffles and ribbons, and a wide blue sash ties in a large bow at her waist. Behind her, a large fluffy white tail curls softly. Her hands are clasped over her knees, fingers long and nails pale pink; she wears white short gloves with rolled cuffs. Blue patent flats with white bows and ankle ribbons complete the look. The background is a modern street with grey square tiles, black shadows, and a blurred black display wall with faint App Store and Google Play logos. To the left, a pale beige geometric structure. Mid-shot, slightly low angle, soft natural light from the right front highlights her skin and the sheen of the dress. The scene blends fantasy and reality, dominantly cool blue with white and grey. The NSFW edit: the dress is sheer or partially undone, baring her breasts fully, the nipples visible through the fabric or exposed, the deep V pulled wide to show her areolas, the bunny ears and tail accentuating her nakedness. Her pose is submissive yet inviting, her eyes holding a sultry, knowing gaze.",
