          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a modern gray velvet sofa, wearing only a sheer white sleeveless camisole and a short black leather mini skirt, with a light khaki trench coat draped off one shoulder, baring her breast and arm. Her long black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, her face is exquisite with a cold, seductive gaze towards the camera. She poses elegantly and confidently, right leg bent, left leg extended, wearing black pointed stiletto heels with bright pink heels and shiny embellishments, sheer stockings highlighting her long legs. A simple metal watch on her left wrist rests on the sofa back. The foreground shows the soft sofa texture and her full lower body. In the midground, behind her are black storage drawers with skull and crossbones prints, topped with two trendy figurines: a black bear and a gold robot. The background left is a modern kitchen with dark gray cabinets and built-in white appliances. The overall color scheme is gray, black, white, with the pink heels as a vibrant accent. The composition is a low-angle shot looking up, emphasizing her figure and presence, with her body slightly right of center. The diagonal line of her legs guides the eye from her feet up to her face, enhancing depth. Lighting comes from a soft indoor source on the right, casting smooth gradients and shadows on the sofa and floor, adding dimension. The atmosphere blends modern fashion with intimate life, like a high-quality professional portrait but with natural texture. The image is clean, detailed, with strong artistic impact and visual appeal.",
