          "alias": "单女露胸军人短裙沙发媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a cream curved sofa, wearing only a sheer pink ballet tutu that layers softly, revealing her bare breasts and nipples through the translucent fabric, the skirt pooling around her on the couch and spilling to the floor. Her light ballet shoes have ribbon bows at the ankles, her right leg lifted elegantly in a ballet pose, left leg dangling, the pose expressive and sensual. She cradles a traditional wooden nutcracker soldier doll in her arms, his red uniform, blue epaulettes, gold trim, black hat, and vivid face detailed. She sits slightly left of center, head turned, gazing directly at the viewer with a focused, thoughtful expression, her soft light-brown hair loose and shiny. Behind her stands a richly decorated Christmas tree with gold and silver ornaments, bells, wooden trinkets, a glowing star on top. Soft diffused light streams from a left window with sheer white vertical-stripe curtains, warming the scene. The floor is light parquet, a beige rug with geometric brown lines in front of the sofa. Medium shot, the woman dominates the frame, the tree adds festive mood. Diagonal lines from her eye contact and lifted leg create dynamic balance. Warm tones of pink, white, cream, with gold and green accents—dreamy, sensual, cinematic. Shot on a medium-format camera or high-end mirrorless, 85mm, f/2.8, low noise, rich detail, blending romantic fairy-tale elegance with modern Christmas warmth and a subtle, poetic eroticism.",
