          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a rough, pale gray concrete wall, wearing a form-fitting black velvet suit jacket with double-breasted buttons, unbuttoned to reveal her black lace bra and bare cleavage, the sleeves adorned with bows; matching high-waist shorts or a very short skirt with a side fringe detail. Her long, straight black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, glossy in the light. She wears bold eye makeup, full lips, and a confident, cool expression, staring directly at the camera. Her arms are raised high, hands pressed flat against the wall, fingers long with pale blue nail polish, a gold bracelet on her left wrist, a ring on her right ring finger, and a delicate gold necklace with a small pendant. She wears black sheer stockings, legs toned and elegant, stance powerful yet sensual. The background is a flat, textured concrete wall with subtle scratches, industrial style. Light comes from above front, creating soft shadows behind and below, a cold blue-gray tone overall. Center composition, slight high angle, full-body shot. The visual flow starts at her face, down her body to her hands and feet, forming a stable triangle. High contrast with highlights on forehead, nose bridge, and back of hands; shadows on chest and inner thighs. The image has a high-fashion editorial feel but with slight grain and natural color deviation, as if shot with a pro camera in a minimalist indoor space — cold, elegant, and full of modern female power and allure.",
