          "prompt": "A young woman reclines in a languid, elegant pose within a geometric space of gold and gray. Her black hair spills like silk over her shoulders and the background, a few strands brushing her face, creating dynamic beauty and mystery. She wears a glossy black ripped dress with satin or matte leather texture, now pulled down to expose her bare breasts, nipples visible, with light catching the curves. Her right hand rests lightly on her head, wearing a futuristic purple wristwatch with exposed mechanical gears. Her fingers are long, nails painted soft pink or nude. Her face is sharp, eyes deep and slightly hazy, staring into the lens, lips parted naturally, glossy. Makeup is refined but not heavy, highlighting bone structure and skin texture. The composition runs diagonally from bottom-right to top-left, using golden ratio, figure occupies two-thirds of frame. Foreground focuses on body and hand details, midground on head and torso. Background consists of large metallic gold brushed panels and matte gray walls, contrasting yet harmonious. Above, \"VOGUE KOREA\" in bold dark blue sans-serif letters, sharp and thick. Left side vertical text \"이하늬 LEE HANEE\" and below \"2024 WOMAN NOW\" in same style. Low-angle shot simulating high-fashion magazine cover. Light from upper-left combines hard and soft light, creating sharp shadows and highlights on face, arms, and watch, with smooth transitions into body curves. Overall mood: modern luxury, cool rationality, female power, with a relaxed yet tense stillness. Tones: black, gold, gray, with purple as accent. Low grain, high detail, studio-quality with slight film texture. Composition balanced yet asymmetrical, guiding eye from face to watch to logo. Conveys 2024 independent, confident, diverse, pioneering female spirit.",
