          "prompt": "A young woman sits bare-chested atop a vintage CRT television, her blue denim suspender jumpsuit unbuttoned and hanging open, the thin straps slipping off her shoulders, her small waist and bare breasts exposed. She wears only the lower half of the jumpsuit, the loose wide-leg cuffs pooling around her thighs. Her dark hair is pulled back in a low ponytail with a few strands falling across her cheek; her makeup is soft and natural, lips glossed, eyes staring directly at the camera with a playful, seductive gaze. In her right hand, she holds a retro orange portable radio/cassette player, its black power cord trailing to the lower right. Her left hand rests lightly on top of the TV, a simple silver watch on her wrist and a ring on her finger. She wears silver strappy heeled sandals on her feet, body leaning slightly forward, relaxed yet provocative. The TV sits on a deep blue carpet; its screen shows a blurred gray test pattern with \"14M\", \"4336\", and \"1A\" artifacts, the metal frame and buttons slightly worn. To the left, the corner of an orange-red fabric sofa contrasts with the cool tones. In the background, a clean pale gray wall, minimalist. The words \"'1999' Vintage\" in hand-drawn orange gradient lettering with subtle shadow float in the upper right. Front-left studio lighting casts soft highlights across her skin, nipples, denim, and metal, creating a nostalgic yet modern commercial-quality image. The composition is centered-left, with strong orange-blue complementary colors, evoking a sensual, timeless moment.",
