        {
          "id": "krea2-ee9d79a031c04a7eb0d51cb4",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside a phone booth on a city street, her dark hair in a blunt fringe, pale skin, flawless makeup with natural pink lips. She stares directly at the camera with a cool, confident, slightly rebellious expression. Her right hand, gloved in black leather, is raised high above her head with fingers splayed like claws; her left hand hangs naturally, fingers slightly curled. She wears a black leather jacket with bold red panels on the sleeves, unzipped to reveal a dark denim crop top with horizontal stitching, low neckline exposing her collarbones and a strip of her toned midriff. A white waistband with the red DIESEL logo sits high on her hips, visible above a tight high-waisted dark denim miniskirt that ends mid-thigh. The background is a graffiti-covered concrete wall with colorful tags, yellow spray paint, and a torn poster reading \"HICO JILI.\" The metal phone booth has a transparent glass door, visible internal equipment, and a blue \"PHONE\" sign. Side lighting creates soft shadows, sculpting her figure and enhancing the textures of leather, denim, and skin. The composition is centered, mid-shot, with her body slightly tilted and chin lifted, making strong eye contact. The color palette contrasts black, red, blue against gray-white wall; rich shadows and bright highlights give a realistic street-photography feel. The scene exudes urban rebellion and youthful sensuality, with every detail from clothing seams to wall grime sharply visible, capturing a moment of defiant self-expression.",
