          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a zebra crossing in a Japanese city street, wearing only an unzipped deep-brown leather cropped jacket and matching micro-miniskirt, revealing her bare chest beneath the jacket with natural nipples peeking out. The leather shines with subtle grain and creases under the midday sun; jacket zipper teeth glint metallic silver, skirt hem irregularly cut. She wears glossy black thigh-high over-the-knee boots that mirror the surroundings, stiletto heels adding sharp vertical lines. She turns sideways, looking back over her shoulder with a slight smile, eyes warm and confident. Her light brown-blonde hair flows softly in the breeze, resting on her shoulders with gentle gradient highlights. Background: typical Tokyo street with weathered gray building walls, faint signs and door numbers, a traffic signal pole and blurred pedestrians on the right. A convenience store sign and road sign are visible but out of focus due to shallow depth of field, keeping the woman sharp. Composition: medium shot, subject slightly right of center, body angled elegantly and relaxed. Eye line leads from her high-heeled boots up along her exposed torso to her face, creating a smooth visual flow. Lighting: bright but soft sunlight from just past noon casting clear yet gentle shadows, asphalt ground glistening, white crosswalk lines straight and strong, enhancing perspective. Overall mood blends the cool urban street with the woman's warm, approachable sensuality. Colors: deep brown, black, silver zipper and boot highlights. Image quality resembles a professional camera shot with subtle film grain and realistic lens optics, natural background blur, sharp focus on the woman, enough environmental detail for immersion. A candid street-style portrait that feels both artistic and candid, as if captured spontaneously by a photographer with a compact camera—real, natural, and story-rich.",
