          "alias": "单女露胸白短裙摄影棚沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a minimalist white cube, her body exposed, wearing only a white high-waisted ruffled mini skirt. Her deep brown hair is styled in an elegant half-up bun with loose curls falling around her face. She gazes directly at the camera with a calm, thoughtful expression, lips slightly parted, revealing her natural pink lip color. Her skin is fair and smooth, with a soft, sculpted facial structure. Her left hand rests on the white surface, fingers adorned with multiple silver and crystal rings that catch the light, while her right hand lies relaxed at her side. Beside her is a small light blue denim handbag with colorful graffiti-style lettering reading \"ROBERTO MANI\" and a pink \"9\", featuring a metal zipper and heart-shaped leather charm. The background is a simple gray-white interior with vertical black line divisions, a circular mirror reflection visible on the left. Soft lighting from the right creates gentle shadows and contrast, with a bright, clean atmosphere. Medium close-up framing, her body slightly tilted, head turned to engage the viewer. The composition emphasizes her bare torso, the handbag, and her hands, with a shallow depth of field enhancing the sense of space. The overall aesthetic blends high-fashion studio elegance with casual, intimate realism.",
