        {
          "id": "krea2-ea001c4582be4ec7819be289",
          "alias": "单女和服桌边忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an intricately designed kimono-style outfit, styled with double ponytails and pink-highlighted strands, wearing round thin-rimmed glasses, her gaze tender and melancholic as she stares into the lens. She wears a vividly colored modified kimono in teal and creamy white panels, with one shoulder bared suggestively, the broad flowing sleeves edged in red, yellow, and black stripes. A gold brocade belt cinches her waist, from which hangs a decorative short blade, while ink-wash motifs adorn the hem. Her right hand lightly grips a calligraphy brush, tip slightly raised, stance graceful; her left hand rests on her knee, clad in a white lace glove with frilled cuffs. Her long legs are sheathed in white stockings and black high-heeled shoes, with black strap details visible at the ankles. She sits before an antique wooden desk, body slightly tilted, left leg bent and raised, right leg stretched out—a relaxed yet charged pose. Behind her, a large circular moon gate or screen glows in soft warm orange tones, with faint ink-wash landscape paintings visible inside, creating a classical atmosphere. A cool blue halo encircles the moon gate, contrasting light and dark, adding mystery. Cherry blossom branches bloom at the top and right side of the frame, pale pink and white flowers swaying in dim light, petals drifting down, with a hazy mist effect spreading through the scene, giving it a dreamlike, poetic quality. Light falls from the upper left, casting a soft backlit rim that illuminates her hair and robe edge, while subtle shadows sculpt her face, enhancing depth. On the desk in the foreground, the Four Treasures of the Study are arranged: inkstone, scroll, and brush, all sharply detailed. The midground centers on her figure, composition balancing central symmetry and the golden ratio, the subject slightly below center, head angled, guiding the viewer's gaze to her eyes. The background is blurred to emphasize her, the overall atmosphere serene and poignant, rich in Eastern aesthetic charm, layered in light and shadow—warm ambient light paired with cool rim lighting—creating a quiet, slightly sorrowful poetic mood. The texture is exquisite, as if shot by professional photography equipment, achieving high artistic expression while retaining the realistic feel of amateur everyday equipment, yet with cinematic lighting control and color grading, rich in detail, layered, and immersive.",
