        {
          "id": "krea2-6abe8a39d95a6d0d03643661",
          "alias": "单女蓝内衣走廊媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor hallway before a pale wall, her body slightly turned and leaning against it as she gazes directly at the camera with a mix of shyness and quiet confidence. Her long, deep brown hair falls naturally, with neat bangs covering her forehead, soft highlights shimmering through the strands, giving her a look that's both polished and effortlessly tousled. She wears a deep blue lace bra with delicate cross-strap design that traces her elegant shoulders and neckline, intricate floral patterns and ruffled edges exuding a blend of grace and raw sensuality. Over it, an oversized fur coat hangs open, its interior a pure white fluffy lining, while the collar and cuffs show warm brown-gold tones; the dense, glossy fur drapes in natural folds and wrinkles. Her hands gently hold the coat's hem, posture relaxed, legs clad in sheer black stockings that gleam smoothly, revealing the subtle texture of her skin. Her long, straight legs are slightly bent at the knees, creating a poised dynamic balance. The background is a minimalist interior: a cream-white wall with fine texture, a modern electronic door lock on the right with metal frame and visible buttons, and a closed light-wood door on the left with a silver handle. Soft natural light mixed with warm indoor illumination comes from the front-left, casting clear, bright contours on her face and body, with gentle shadows highlighting skin texture and fabric details. The composition centers on her, a medium shot where she occupies most of the frame, her head in the upper third, body slightly tilted into an S-curve. The visual line rises from her feet up to her chest, then to her face, deepening the sense of depth. The foreground shows her figure and part of the fur coat; the middle ground captures her full body and the near wall; the background features the distant door and lock. The color palette is warm and cohesive—the blue bra contrasts with the brown fur, while the white inner lining brightens the overall scene. The lighting is intimate and cozy, evoking a daily-life portrait that blends fashion with a real, sensual presence, as if shot by a professional camera under indoor natural light, rich in artistic appeal and authenticity.",
