        {
          "id": "krea2-e708c2d003dc01cac1af2fc1",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in opulent ancient Chinese attire reclines gracefully against a misty void, her black hair piled high and adorned with an intricate golden crown and flowing tassels, the crown detailed with fine gold filigree and tiny jewel accents, with strands of hair falling naturally across her forehead and cheeks to soften her allure. She wears a white silk tube-top robe with golden dragon and phoenix embroidery at the shoulders and cuffs, the fabric sheer and shimmering like silk, revealing the curves of her breasts and the suggestion of bare skin beneath. Over this, a deep black wide-sleeved robe drapes open, embroidered with silver-gray cloud patterns, the contrast highlighting her form. Her right hand rests under her chin, fingers long and slender with light red nail polish, her pose languid and confident. Her gaze is clear and direct, meeting the viewer with a mysterious, cold seduction. Her lips are slightly parted, painted a deep red. Her features are delicately sculpted, her skin pale and flawless, with soft, diffused lighting. The background is a hazy warm-toned sky—blended shades of pale yellow, orange-brown, and deep brown—thick layered clouds evoking a celestial realm at dusk or dawn. Thick dark smoke swirls in the foreground, blurring edges and creating deep depth and dreamlike atmosphere. The composition is a low-angle upward shot, the figure occupying the upper center, her body diagonally positioned, forming dynamic balance, visual flow from her face to her hand, then through the lines of sleeves and hair ornament leading to the background. Light comes from above right, simulating natural light with a softbox effect, illuminating her face evenly, with subtle highlights on gold ornaments and fabric, emphasizing luxurious textures. The overall lighting is warm yet melancholic, with epic and dramatic overtones. The image quality approaches high-end commercial photography, rich in detail, moderate color saturation, harmonious tones, presenting a surreal aesthetic blending traditional Eastern beauty with modern digital art, evoking a painting of an ancient celestial noblewoman lost in time, gazing at the mortal world in a quiet, poetic dream.",
