          "prompt": "A female character stands in a side-profile, looking back over her shoulder against a pure white background. She wears a glossy black latex bunny suit that hugs her curves, with a low-cut front revealing her collarbones and cleavage, and a backless cutout. Her vivid red hair is sleek with blunt bangs, and twin braids rest on her shoulders. On her head sit shiny black rabbit ears with translucent inner tips. Her makeup is sharp and dramatic: winged cat-eye liner, shimmering gold eyeshadow, and soft rose-red lips. Her body arches slightly backward, left arm hanging naturally, right hand holding a white glove, while her left hand rests on her hip, accentuating her full curves. She wears black fishnet stockings that stretch along her long legs, and a fluffy white pom-pom tail at the back. The composition is a mid-shot, her body forming an S-curve, head turned toward the camera with a direct gaze. Lighting comes from front-left, soft and even, creating delicate highlights and shadows. The background is clean, light gray or off-white, with no distractions. The color palette is black, white, and red, high contrast yet harmonious. The image evokes a professional studio look with a natural, amateur touch, blending fashion and anime aesthetics. The subject is confident, sensual, and playful, with every detail from hair shine to latex texture crisp and realistic. Suitable for cosplay or digital art.",
