          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of the frame, her long black hair slightly disheveled and falling over her shoulders, a few strands lifted by the breeze, adding a sense of wildness. Her face is delicate yet melancholic, with deep, intense eyes staring straight ahead as if lost in thought, exuding a quiet, resilient strength after hardship. She wears a vibrant red outer robe, the fabric heavy and glossy, trimmed with exquisite blue borders and golden floral embroidery. The robe is deliberately left open, revealing a sheer, low-cut cream inner robe that hints at the soft curves of her bare breasts. Her waist is cinched with a pale green brocade belt adorned with small tassels and metal charms. In her right hand, she holds a translucent white oil-paper umbrella, its ribs visible, tilted slightly to cast soft shadows across her face and chest, highlighting the subtle sheen of her skin. The background is blurred, revealing a fragment of an ancient wooden wheel with rivets, bathed in warm golden sunlight that creates a dramatic, cinematic glow. The composition centers on her, with shallow depth of field focusing on her expressive face and the intricate details of her sensual attire. The atmosphere blends classical elegance with modern, filmic sensuality, rich in warm tones and poetic melancholy.",
