        {
          "id": "krea2-4634d39453772acc583f7f24",
          "alias": "单女露胸白外套街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a sensual selfie on a nighttime city street, standing beside a gray metal lamppost. She wears a fluffy white down jacket unzipped and hanging open, the collar and hood trimmed with soft white faux fur, revealing her bare breasts and toned torso underneath. A pair of grey-white gradient leggings cling to her hips. She raises her left hand to touch her ear, a simple silver ring on her finger, posing with relaxed elegance. Her eyes lock onto the camera lens with a clear, inviting gaze. Makeup is subtle, lips a soft nude pink, skin fair and smooth. Her hair is pinned up, showing a clean forehead and delicate features. Background: a typical urban night scene with a multi-story apartment building, warm yellow lights in windows, bare tree branches, trunks painted white, a white car parked at the curb with faint headlight reflections. Metal railings and ground reflections add realism. Composition centers her slightly left of frame, the lamppost on the left edge acting as a frame, leading the eye to her body. Midground includes the car and railings. Background blurred for shallow depth of field. Lighting from streetlights, car lights, and building interiors is soft and warm, highlighting her face and the exposed skin of her chest while creating chiaroscuro in the background. Atmosphere is quiet, intimate, with a touch of urban loneliness and poetry. The image has a snapshot feel, slightly grainy from high ISO, natural color reproduction, rich details but not over-sharpened. Overall tonal contrast: the white jacket glows against the warm yellow lights. Visual flow from the lamppost to her face, then to the buildings beyond. Composition stable and balanced, her expression calm with a hint of tender confidence, capturing a candid moment of city night life—both modern coldness and human warmth.",
