        {
          "id": "krea2-1d6c239aeb629d1b34a845a1",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑手套街道微笑站立举手",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street at night, her long jet-black hair cascading naturally over bare shoulders. Her skin is fair and smooth, with a gentle, sweet smile on her face—lips slightly parted, bright eyes looking down at the camera, cheeks flushed with a natural rosy hue. She wears delicate makeup: subtle pink and gold shimmer on her eyelids, thick curled lashes, overall fresh and clean. On her head, a light beige fluffy ear muff topped with cute pink bunny ears trimmed in white fur, adding a playful, warm touch. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, nipples peaky in the cool night air, while wearing a pair of black-and-white cat paw gloves—black plush material with white fluffy palms and pink gradient paw pad details, fingers clearly visible. She raises her hands in a playful cat-paw gesture, fingers slightly curled, mimicking a kitten's pose, lively and childlike. Around her neck hangs a thin chain with a small pendant that catches the light. The background is a bustling city street at dusk, deep blue sky, modern buildings on either side. To the right, a shop window glows warm yellow, displaying clothes and merchandise, a sign reading \"RS N°9\" in simple modern font, with spotlights above. On the left, scaffolding covers part of the building facade, hinting at renovations. In the distance, other pedestrians walk by, some in heavy winter coats, others carrying shopping bags, creating a daily urban atmosphere. The composition is a close-up, with the woman dominating the frame—face and upper body sharply in focus, the background softly blurred. Warm light from the shop and street lamps illuminates her from the front and side, casting natural shadows and rich tonal transitions, creating a cozy yet dreamy ambiance. The overall color palette is warm with moderate saturation, realistic texture, as if captured by a casual camera or phone—a slight grain and natural exposure enhance authenticity and intimacy. The scene radiates youthful vitality and cuteness, evoking the warmth and beauty of a city night.",
