          "prompt": "A young woman with long, silky pink hair sits on the trunk of a silver car, the gentle breeze lifting her strands—hair fades from light to deep pink with natural curls at the tips. Her skin is pale and luminous, features sharp with a cold, distant gaze directly into the lens. She wears a short beige work jacket, unzipped and pushed open to reveal a tight white T-shirt with visible black lettering (\"ESSIO APR\"), the fabric clinging to her breasts, nipples faintly outlined. Her jacket hangs off her shoulders, leaving her collarbones and upper chest exposed. She wears a high-waisted silver sequin miniskirt that catches the light. Her hands rest on her knees: one hand in a fluffy pink glove, the other bare. Her legs are spread open, left foot forward, right bent back, showing white fishnet stockings visible above the rim of thick beige fur-lined boots, the netting tight against her thighs. She leans back against the car, body slightly angled, expression cool and defiant. Background: rough gray concrete wall with cracks and stains, a red door with a window, a \"VIDEOSORVEGLIA\" sign. Sunlight from the left casts soft shadows across her face and torso, highlighting curves. The silver car reflects the scene. The overall mood is street-smart, sensual, with a raw amateur-photo feel—every detail sharp: fabric textures, hair shine, skin glow, the gap between her jacket and skirt emphasizing her bare midriff. The composition centers on her face and exposed skin, leading down her body to her spread legs and boots.",
