          "id": "krea2-489752cc2c357c249aff7228",
          "alias": "单女露胸米西装城市忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city bridge at night, her soft red-brown hair cascading naturally, strands gently brushing her cheeks as a light breeze stirs. Her skin is pale and smooth, her features delicate and refined, her eyes clear and luminous with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. She tilts her head slightly toward the camera, lips parted as if about to whisper. Her only garment is an unbuttoned cream double-breasted blazer with fine plaid texture and fur-trimmed cuffs, left open to reveal her bare torso—full breasts exposed, nipples hard in the cool night air. Her long legs are completely bare, and she wears chunky white platform sneakers with bow detailing and high white socks. A large light-grey leather shoulder bag with a striking blue geometric side panel hangs across her torso. Her pose is relaxed, body slightly angled, one hand in her pocket, the other hanging loose. In the foreground, her full figure is sharply detailed—every strand of hair, every curve clearly visible. Midground shows the asphalt bridge surface with faint reflections and white road markings stretching into the distance, metal railings neatly aligned. Background is a deep night sky in blue-black, city lights twinkling and blurred in the distance, street lamps and car headlights forming soft bokeh. Low-angle shot emphasizes her height and presence, her body positioned left-center, gaze directed up-right, drawing the eye from her face to the distant skyline. Lighting comes from street lamps and city glow, a soft front-left source creating smooth chiaroscuro on her skin and body, casting subtle shadows that highlight her contours, with gentle reflections on the ground and bag. The mood is quiet, modern, with a sense of independent urban femininity—confident yet slightly lonely. Color palette is cool blue and warm cream, creating a harmonious contrast. The image has a high-end photographic quality with refined light control and post-processing, yet retains the authenticity of a candid night street shot, full of narrative and artistic atmosphere.",
