          "prompt": "A young woman sits outdoors at night, her long black hair with bangs, fair skin, delicate features, bright big eyes, gazing at the camera with a playful and curious expression, lips slightly parted as if whispering or smiling. She wears a cream-colored high-neck knitted sweater unbuttoned to reveal a deep purple lace bra and cleavage, the sweater’s fine texture and natural rolled cuffs visible. Her right hand is raised near her cheek, fingers slightly curled, left hand naturally placed in front of her body, palm facing the camera. Her legs are crossed, wearing a white fluffy micro-shorts with fringed edges, exposing smooth thighs. Background is a blurred city nightscape with countless bokeh lights, soft circular halos in cool tones mixed with warm yellow and blue, dreamy atmosphere. On the left, a thin metal pole with a chain and ring decoration adds realism. Close-up portrait composition, subject centered right, head slightly tilted, direct eye contact. Foreground emphasizes facial and hand details, midground shows body posture and fabric texture, background blurred. Lighting from background point sources softly illuminates silhouette, natural chiaroscuro, side/backlight creates subtle highlights on hair and shoulders. Warm romantic urban nightlife vibe, authentic amateur camera feel. Simulated Canon 5D Mark IV, ISO 800, 1/60s, f/2.8, 85mm, handheld slight shake, slight grain, color shift. Tight focus on face, aesthetic blur, warm soft tones, rich details, realistic texture, youthful vitality and gentle charm with sensuality.",
