          "alias": "单女下裸米毛衣户外微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a nighttime outdoor scene, her long, straight black hair and blunt bangs framing her face. Her clear, bright eyes look slightly to the side at the camera, a gentle smile on her lips, expression natural and relaxed, as if sharing a silent connection with the viewer. Her fair, delicate skin glows softly under the lights, exuding a fresh, sweet charm with a hint of playfulness. She wears a loose cream-colored knit sweater with large red heart patterns, simple yet whimsical, paired with a thick red-brown plaid scarf with fringed edges that adds warmth and texture. Her lower half is clad in a short white skirt with lace trim detail, elegant yet cute. Her right hand casually brushes through her hair, a natural, effortless gesture that reveals an unintentional allure. The foreground shows her body and clothing in crisp detail—knit texture of the sweater, fuzzy feel of the scarf, folds of the skirt—all highly realistic. Midground is a blurred wooden bench and some metal structures, the bench's outline vaguely visible, adding depth. Background is formed by countless vertical rows of colorful light pillars, blue and warm yellow lights interwoven to create dreamy bokeh circles and ovals, rich in color and layered, evoking a romantic, enchanting atmosphere. Composition is center-focused, with the subject slightly left of center, visual focus on her face and upper body. Vertical lines of the background draw the eye upward, enhancing depth, while shallow depth of field completely blurs the backdrop, emphasizing the subject. Visual guidance comes from her direct gaze into the lens and the hand movement leading from face to body and clothing details. Lighting: main source from background lights providing soft rim light and ambient illumination, making her silhouette clear with subtle highlights on hair and shoulders enhancing three-dimensionality. The cool blue of the background contrasts with warm yellow bokeh, creating a cool-warm interplay. Overall mood is warm, romantic, festive—like a winter night city street or a light festival. The scene has strong artistic and storytelling quality, as if capturing a fleeting beautiful memory. Shot with professional equipment, camera settings: aperture f/1.8, ISO 400, shutter 1/60s, focal length 85mm, handheld, slight motion blur adds realism. Film-grain-like texture and color saturation, warm tone overall but retaining cool blue bokeh. Natural light transition, rich detail, balanced composition, layered depth, giving a refined yet intimate visual experience. For NSFW effect, the sweater is slightly unbuttoned or pulled off the shoulder to reveal one breast, the short skirt hiked up to expose her upper thigh and the curve of her hip, hinting at a lace garter belt beneath. She wears no panties, the skirt barely covering her bare mound. Her casual pose suggests she is fully aware of her nudity, enjoying the forbidden thrill of public exposure. The lights cast suggestive shadows on her bare skin, accentuating her curves.",
