        {
          "id": "krea2-bae8a7675da90fd276189fc8",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outside at night, her long deep brown hair falling naturally, strands gently swaying in the breeze with soft, fine texture and a hint of warm reddish-brown highlights. Her delicate, refined features are clear and slightly contemplative, her gaze angled away as if lost in thought or gazing into the distance. Her lips are parted, naturally full with a soft pink sheen, her face smoothly contoured with fair, luminous skin glowing with healthy warmth, exuding a cool yet tender aura. She wears an off-white oversized coat with a repeating geometric pattern, thick and soft with plush cuffs and collar, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal a white shirt beneath, unbuttoned deeply to expose bare skin and the curve of her breasts, showing her cleavage and the subtle swell of her bare nipples against the shirt's edge. The shirt's collar is casually turned back, highlighting her neckline gracefully. A gold ring adorns her right wrist, her fingers long and slender, hands crossed loosely in front of her. Her left hand holds a light gray leather handbag, smooth and premium, its interior a vivid blue in stark contrast, with a matching shoulder strap and signature metal hardware. The background is a blurred nightscape with scattered distant lights creating soft bokeh, dreamy and misty. The sky is deep blue, contrasting with her light clothing. In the foreground, several horizontal metal railings add clean lines and depth. The composition centers on her, slightly left, leaving negative space to the right, guiding the eye while maintaining balance. Lighting comes from behind and to the side, softly sculpting her silhouette and face with natural chiaroscuro, highlights on hair edges and shoulders, shadows on her torso and background, enhancing three-dimensionality. The overall mood is serene and elegant, filled with urban nighttime romance, with a slight film grain and desaturated color palette mimicking a professional camera capture, subtle lens distortion and bokeh adding realism and artistry. Every detail from hair strands to fabric folds is crisp, colors harmonious in off-white, gray, blue, and brown tones, creating a cool yet warm visual feel, blending fashion with natural everyday beauty as if a candid street shot by high-end photography equipment.",
