          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern interior, her brown blazer unbuttoned and falling open to reveal a pink high-neck knit top pulled low, exposing the curve of her breasts and a hint of a lace bralette. Her light blue skinny jeans are unbuttoned at the waist, revealing the top of her thong, and her black strappy heels dangle from one foot. She lounges with one hand propping her chin, fingers long and nails polished pale, the other hand resting on her inner thigh, fingers tracing the denim. Her deep brown hair cascades over her shoulders, strands framing her face, lips slightly parted, eyes half-lidded with a soft, knowing gaze. She sits on a modern metal-frame chair with a glass seat, her body angled left, creating a diagonal line through the frame. The wooden floor shows geometric parquet patterns in warm browns; behind her, a simple wooden storage unit holds a decorative vase. Soft side lighting from a window or lamp falls across her skin and clothing, casting gentle shadows and highlighting the texture of the blazer knit, the smooth gloss of her nails, and the cool metallic reflections. The camera is slightly elevated, capturing a mid-shot that focuses on her face and torso, with the background softly blurred. The mood is warm, intimate, and seductive, with muted earthy tones—brown, pink, blue—and a low-saturation, film-like quality, evoking a quiet afternoon of sensual self-possession.",
