          "prompt": "An elegantly exotic Eastern woman sits gracefully on an antique wooden chair, wearing a stunning red sequin cheongsam that clings to her curves, its front provocatively unbuttoned to reveal her bare cleavage and the gleam of her smooth skin. She leans sideways, hands gently cradling a simple grey-white ceramic teacup, her gaze soft and focused on the rising steam, her expression serene yet sultry. Her black hair is styled in an elaborate updo, adorned with a delicate blue butterfly hair ornament; silver tassel earrings dangle from her ears, a simple gold bracelet wraps her wrist, and silver strappy high-heeled sandals accentuate her crossed, shapely legs. Before her, a round wooden side table holds a white ceramic vase with a single blooming pink flower. Behind, two vermillion traditional Chinese lattice doors and windows cast deep shadows, revealing hints of interior furnishings. Countless tiny white petals or paper flakes drift through the air like snow, creating a dreamy, poetic atmosphere. The scene is framed in a medium shot, with the figure on the right and ample empty space on the left to showcase the background and environment. The visual flow follows her posture and gaze down to the teacup, then up to the falling petals. Lighting comes from the upper right, with warm, soft yellow light filtering through the lattice, casting dappled shadows across her body and the floor, highlighting the metallic sheen and delicate texture of the cheongsam. The overall palette is dominated by rich red, complemented by warm golden halos and cool white drifting particles, creating strong color contrast and harmony. The image is richly detailed, with a high-end artistic feel, capturing a quiet, ritualistic moment that blends profound Eastern aesthetics with modern sensuality—evoking a sense of time slowing down, elegance, and intimate allure.",
