          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, topless, her bare chest exposed beneath a loosely draped, fluffy burgundy coat that hangs open, its soft fur catching the warm stage lighting. Her shoulder-length dark brown hair falls neatly with bangs across her forehead, and she wears black in-ear monitors and delicate silver earrings. A thin black choker and a fine silver necklace adorn her neck. She leans slightly toward the camera, lips parted as if singing, her right hand resting near her side. Behind her, a pure black stage curtain contrasts with the warm orange-red light coming from front-left, illuminating her face, neck, and torso with soft highlights and shadows. A metal microphone stand with a black mic head angles toward her. The composition is a medium-close portrait, with the woman slightly left of center and the microphone occupying the right space. The coat reveals her nipples and the curve of her breasts, while the interplay of light and fur texture adds depth and sensuality. The scene exudes a cinematic, performance-driven atmosphere, capturing a live concert moment with filmic quality and professional lighting.",
