          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer, low-cut lavender bodycon dress with off-shoulder ruffled sleeves, the fabric glossy and textured like high-end satin, hugging her curves and cinching at the waist, showcasing her hourglass figure. Her long, jet-black hair falls in soft waves over one shoulder, shiny and healthy. Flawless makeup: sultry smoky eyes with precise eyeliner, thick lashes, full lips painted with nude-pink gloss. She wears layered gold and silver jewelry—a chunky chain necklace with sparkly gems, multiple bangles, and a mix of geometric and diamond rings on her fingers; white manicured nails. Her right hand gently touches her chest, fingers slightly curled, while her left hand rests on her hip, body turned in an elegant S-curve, staring directly into the camera with a confident, seductive smirk. The background is a soft lavender gradient fading from deep to light, creating a dreamy, intimate atmosphere. Typography at top left: \"杨紫\" and \"全球品牌代言人\"; at bottom center: \"apm MONACO\" in minimalist font. Medium shot, subject slightly right, head tilted left with a piercing gaze. Lighting from above front casts soft shadows, highlighting her décolletage, collarbone, and hands. Overall a luxurious, sensual, high-fashion aesthetic with a touch of everyday allure, shot on a professional camera with shallow depth of field, bokeh background.",
