          "prompt": "A young female figure skater in a seductive deep red tight dress with a plunging neckline and ruffled lace trim, lying gracefully on the smooth ice. Her legs are raised high, wearing white ice skates with gleaming blades. She wears matching red gloves, her hands gently cupping her chin, smiling sweetly at the camera with confident, joyful eyes. The dress is adorned with sparkling sequins, and her long black hair falls naturally, a few strands brushing her cheek. The pure red background creates dramatic visual impact. Low-angle shot emphasizes her curves and dynamic pose. Ice surface shows fine scratches and snow spray from her movement, adding a sense of stillness after action. Soft, warm lighting from above and front creates delicate highlights and shadows on her skin, dress, and ice. Color palette red, white, black, high contrast. Cinematic and theatrical style, like a freeze frame after a stunning performance, blending strength and tenderness. Photographic quality of professional sports photography with wide aperture, sharp subject, blurred background, natural grain, and slight overexposure for a candid, realistic feel.",
