          "alias": "单女露胸外套舞台忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, shoulder-length dark brown hair and neat bangs framing her pale, delicate skin. Her finely chiseled features are lit by a soft spotlight—focused, slightly melancholic eyes gazing upward, lips parted as if about to sing or lost in music. She wears black in-ear monitors and shimmering silver earrings, a black velvet choker and a thin metal chain around her neck. Completely topless, she drapes a thick, fluffy burgundy faux fur coat open over her shoulders, the plush texture glossy and dense, contrasting with her bare chest. A red ribbon is tied at one shoulder where the coat meets her skin. Her body twists slightly, elegant and natural, right hand resting on a professional stage microphone stand, the black metal rod cool in the dim light. The background is pure black darkness, distant blurred warm yellow spots suggesting an empty, intimate space. Vertical framing places her slightly right of center; shallow focus highlights her upper body and face, with her silhouette and layered coat in mid-ground, the backdrop a deep void. The visual line flows from her face up-left along her gaze, then back down to the microphone and her curves, forming a smooth S-curve. A warm orange-red spotlight from front-right bathes her skin and coat in soft highlights and delicate shadows, creating rich textures on the fur and a faint halo against the dark. Strong chiaroscuro and dramatic effect evoke an artistic, emotional moment—a private concert captured in cinematic realism. Color palette: deep red, black, white with silver accents, moderate saturation, refined and restrained aesthetic. Every detail is crisp, from fur fibers to the coat's sheen. The overall mood is quiet, focused, with a touch of romance and detachment, like a high-quality live concert photo that perfectly captures the raw allure of a stage performance.",
