          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a modern bedroom bed, wearing a black leather jacket with plush white fox fur trim at the collar and cuffs, the jacket hanging open to expose her bare, firm breasts. Beneath the jacket she wears only black sheer thigh-high stockings and gold strappy stiletto heels, a delicate metal chain wrapped around her ankle. Her long, straight black hair falls over her shoulders, her face refined with sharp features, eyes calm and slightly detached as she looks toward the camera. She poses gracefully with one leg crossed over the other, one hand resting lightly on her thigh, the other hanging naturally, her body leaning slightly forward to form an elegant S-curve. The bed behind her is covered with a beige knitted throw, adorned with white, deep green, and gray square pillows; the throw has fringed edges. The headboard is dark brown leather. On the wall hangs a black-and-white abstract landscape painting suggesting mountain textures. To the right, vertical blinds let in soft, warm yellow light. The floor is light brown wood with a dark gray rug. The color palette is neutral—cream, taupe, deep green—creating a warm, sophisticated atmosphere. Soft indoor lighting comes from the front right, casting gentle shadows that accentuate her silhouette and the jacket's texture. The composition is a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center-left, drawing the eye from her face down her body to her legs and shoes. The scene feels both fashionably luxurious and intimately cozy, like a high-end camera's private portrait, rich in detail and texture, with harmonious colors and artistic allure, embodying modern urban feminine sensuality.",
