          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a tree-lined path in an urban park, wearing a sheer pink oversized shirt completely unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, the fabric loosely tucked into a black-and-white paneled mini skirt with gold chain trim and FENDI branding, the hem riding high on her thighs. Her brown hair is pulled back into a low ponytail, a few loose strands brushing her cheeks. She holds a dark brown leather handbag with sleek metal hardware and logo, her fingers lightly gripping the strap. Her gaze drifts to the left, eyes half-lidded with a sensual, distant look, lips slightly parted. Behind her, two tall plane trees with textured bark and sparse yellow leaves frame the scene; scattered orange and brown leaves cover the gray stone path. Soft autumn backlighting from the upper left filters through branches, casting a warm rim light on her face and bare chest, highlighting every curve. In the blurred background, modern high-rises, glass facades, traffic signals, and faint pedestrians create an urban atmosphere. A classic black lamppost extends vertically on the right edge. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left of center, body semi-turned, head angled away. Foreground includes fallen leaves and low shrubs. Warm tones of yellow, pink, brown, black, and green dominate. The image feels like a candid snapshot from a phone or compact camera, with slight grain and natural color shift, capturing an intimate, stylish moment of solitude and sensuality in the city.",
