        {
          "id": "krea2-49e6e973f1ea52abbd4f349c",
          "alias": "单女白短裙城市困倦站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a tight white sports crop top and ultra-short white pleated skirt stands poised on the blue hard court of the 19th Asian Games in Hangzhou, her white visor shading her face as her long hair falls freely. She gracefully lifts a bright green tennis ball with her left hand while gripping a black racket in her right, her toned midriff and legs exposed, body slightly turned, eyes focused on the airborne ball. A black jacket is tied around her waist, white knee-high socks and white sneakers complete the sporty yet sexy look. The low-angle shot emphasizes her tall, athletic figure, the ball suspended in midair as the focal point. In the background, the vast blue court with crisp white lines, tall silver floodlights, and a fence reading \"19th Asian Games Hangzhou\" and \"Court 2\" set the official scene. A wooden bench to the right holds a \"FIGHT FOR DREAM\" sign and a black chain bag. Modern city skyline faintly visible under overcast gray skies, soft diffused light creating a dreamy, intimate atmosphere. The composition balances motion and stillness, exuding youthful vitality, sporty sensuality, and a quiet moment of dream-chasing.",
