          "alias": "单女紫T恤舞台微笑站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, wearing a loose purple T-shirt and black shorts, black thigh-high boots, and dark sunglasses. Her hair flows in dynamic motion with purple-red gradient highlights, bangs neatly across her forehead. She tilts her head, gaze angled upward, lips curved in a gentle, confident smile. Silver earrings and a delicate chain necklace adorn her. Her left hand hangs naturally, long fingers with pale nail polish; her right hand is hidden behind her back. The focus is on her upper body and legs, skin visible where T-shirt rides up, hinting at bare midriff and the curve of her breasts beneath the thin fabric. The background is a massive LED screen with flowing purple and pink abstract wave patterns, pixel-grain texture, futuristic and techy. Midground shows the black stage edge, contrasting with bright background. Composition uses rule of thirds, figure on right side, head slightly tilted, dynamic blur on hair emphasizes motion. Lighting from stage: dominant purple with soft pink halo, side-lit creating fine chiaroscuro on face, arms, and clothing, highlighting skin texture and fabric folds. Deep, natural shadows enhance three-dimensionality. Medium focal length, slightly low angle makes her appear taller and dominant. Subtle film grain, realistic yet polished. The scene captures youthful freedom and artistic expression, but the NSFW tone comes through in the implied partial nudity and sensual pose: her T-shirt is drawn tight across her chest, a hint of nipple visible through the fabric; her shorts ride high, exposing the inner thigh; she radiates a confident, sexually charged energy. The entire image feels like a freeze-frame from an electrifying performance, alive with movement and raw appeal.",
