        {
          "id": "krea2-a412329b0d4aab269519a942",
          "alias": "单女半褪棕外套室内微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair and blunt bangs stands in a warm holiday setting, her gentle eyes meeting the camera with a soft smile. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features delicate, with a light natural makeup that enhances her fresh look. She wears a thick, fluffy deep brown tweed coat, classic notched lapels, unbuttoned to reveal a cream-colored camisole top with subtle floral pattern, the fabric clinging to her breasts, hinting at the shape beneath. Her hands hold a red-and-green plaid Christmas gift box, tied with a shiny red ribbon bow, small sparkling particles on the edges. Her long fingers rest lightly on the bottom of the box, nails neatly trimmed, pose natural and inviting. Background: a wooden wall with a large Christmas wreath made of pine needles, pinecones, white snowflake ornaments, golden bells, red berries, and colorful lights. Below the wreath, several lit candles flicker with warm orange-yellow glow, illuminating the scene. To the right, two candles in red holders—one lit, one unlit. The composition is centered, the woman in the foreground as the main focus. Lighting from front and side simulates indoor warm light, casting soft highlights and shadows on her face, coat, and the gift box. Warm tones of yellow and red dominate, with green and gold accents. The atmosphere is cozy, intimate, festive. The image has a slight grain and natural depth of field, background slightly blurred, as if captured with a phone or casual camera. The overall feel is warm, inviting, and sensual, with a hint of expectation and love. She bites her lower lip slightly, her pose relaxed yet suggestive, the coat slipping off one shoulder, revealing more skin and the strap of the camisole.",
