          "alias": "单女黑内衣商店微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a striped bench inside a HOGAN shoe store, wearing only a black lace bra and a tiny black leather skirt, her feet in vibrant red suede sneakers with cream laces and a white H-shaped logo. She leans forward slightly, right hand cradling her cheek with fingers gently curled, eyes soft and inviting toward the camera, a subtle smile on her lips, exuding a relaxed and playful aura. Her long dark hair falls naturally, some strands brushing her bare shoulders, adding a touch of sensuality. The background features HOGAN's display area with soft pink walls and red-and-white striped awning, creating a retro-modern retail vibe. Several shoe posters hang on the wall—pink, brown, blue styles—alongside handbag displays. The floor is polished white marble, reflecting warm light from recessed ceiling fixtures, making the space feel bright and spacious. The composition is low-angle, emphasizing her exposed upper body and the store environment. She sits slightly left of center, drawing the eye. The striped bench and display wall form the midground, while deeper shelves extend into the background, giving depth. The visual lines lead from her gaze to the brand logo and products, reinforcing brand identity. The lighting is soft and textured, warm lamps contrasting with cool marble, creating an intimate yet upscale shopping atmosphere. The overall shot feels like a candid moment captured by a phone or compact camera, with slight grain and natural exposure transitions, enhancing realism and intimacy. Details are crisp—her bare skin, lace texture, skirt hem, sneaker material, shelf layouts. The color palette is harmonious: red, black, pink, white—highlighting focal points while maintaining balance. The scene exudes urban chic, blending artistic beauty with everyday eroticism.",
