          "alias": "单女露胸连帽衫街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a bright blue backdrop, her black short hair with blunt bangs tousled and natural, stray strands falling over her forehead—effortlessly stylish and refined. Her skin is fair and smooth, features sharply defined, eyes focused and intense, staring straight into the lens. Lips slightly parted, a playful, confident smirk. She wears nothing but the unzipped leopard-print hoodie hanging open, revealing her bare breasts and taut stomach. The hoodie features black, brown, and pink spots with furry brown trim; the word \"HUDIE\" printed across the chest in modern street-style font. Around her neck, a pink bead necklace with a tiny lock pendant dangles between her cleavage. Her left hand lifts gracefully, fingers long, nails deep crimson, making a sensual gesture. Her right hand rests casually on her waistband. She wears matching leopard-print athletic shorts with white drawstrings and side stripes, hugging her hips tightly. To the right, a professional camera on a tripod—matte black body, massive lens, monitor and buttons visible—signals a shoot in progress. Behind it, a blurry figure with long hair in dark clothing barely visible, out-of-focus. The scene is a studio with a clean, vivid blue backdrop, evenly lit from the front-right, soft shadows, highlighting her skin's glow and the texture of the faux fur. Mid-shot composition, body slightly angled, head facing the camera, gaze leading from her eyes to her hand gesture, then down her curves. Atmosphere blends high-fashion rawness with behind-the-scenes intimacy—a moment of posed vulnerability and sexual confidence.",
