        {
          "id": "krea2-3202e22423c29638935ffc1a",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰短裙椅上困倦倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a simple wooden chair, her body leaning back slightly, legs drawn up in front of her, toes lightly brushing the floor, a relaxed and languid pose. She wears a blue-and-white striped long-sleeve top, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal her bare breasts, paired with a deep gray pleated skirt and white lace-trimmed anklet socks. Her long black hair falls naturally, bangs lightly brushing her forehead. Her gaze drifts to the left side of the frame, her expression calm and contemplative, exuding a quiet, introspective atmosphere. The foreground focuses on her seated form, center-right in the composition. In the midground, a light wood circular side table holds a tall green dragon tree in a pale gray planter, its slender leaves drooping slightly, adding a touch of life and nature. To the right, an open bookshelf in natural wood displays a woven basket, detail-rich but uncluttered. The background is a simple white wall and a window that lets in soft, diffuse light, the window frame clearly visible. The overall color palette is white, light gray, and pale wood, creating a clean, bright, warm domestic setting. Light streams from the left window, casting gentle shadows on the floor and surfaces, enhancing depth and dimension. Shot at eye level, with a near-16:9 aspect ratio, slight film grain texture, and a subtly cool color tone, amplifying the quiet, serene mood. The balanced composition leaves generous negative space, with the subject's gaze extending the visual story to the left, evoking curiosity. The plant and furniture serve as tasteful accents, enriching the scene without distraction. The style blends Japanese minimalist aesthetics with a lived-in scene—a quiet, genuine, narrative-filled moment, as if capturing a solitary afternoon, tender and poetic.",
