        {
          "id": "krea2-8577213f3a12f04a8ef235c8",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙门沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the foreground of a city street, her silky pale golden hair glowing in the sunlight, strands brushing her cheeks. She has fair, smooth skin, delicate features, and clear eyes gazing directly at the lens, lips slightly pursed as she sucks a blue straw from a translucent plastic cup with gradient blue artwork and white letters \"EREWHO\". She wears a sheer, strapless lavender dress that barely covers her breasts, the layered fabric falling loosely from her shoulders, revealing the outline of her nipples and the curve of her hips. Her right hand grips the cup, fingers long with dark nail polish contrasting the light fabric; her left hand hangs naturally at her side, pose relaxed and confident. She stands barefoot on gray asphalt near a concrete curb, background a typical New York brick building with mottled beige walls, multiple floors of rectangular windows with dark brown wooden frames, some reflecting the blue sky. The entrance has an arched doorway and white stone steps, beside a vintage black iron streetlamp. To the right, a silver-gray SUV with reflective body and black alloy wheels, windows mirroring the scene. In the distance, a modern high-rise with dark gray stone geometric facades. Sky clear blue, sunlight from upper right casting sharp shadows, strong contrast and depth. Low-angle shot emphasizing her dominance, the building's height enhancing spatial depth. Visual lines from her body and gaze lead to the background. Atmosphere bright, vibrant urban life, captured in a candid moment with realistic texture, subtle phone-camera noise and motion blur. Tones of blue, purple, beige, and gray, harmonious and stylish.",
