        {
          "id": "krea2-b9a27ff4402d809999da5a76",
          "alias": "单女黑外套商店媚态站立脱衣（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a display counter at a HOGAN brand store, her short black puff-sleeve jacket unzipped and hanging open, revealing her bare chest and erect nipples. She wears a fluffy black mini skirt and bright red sneakers with white laces and gold metallic accents. Her shoulder-length black hair falls loosely, and she leans seductively against the counter, left hand resting on the edge, right hand hanging down. Her body is slightly turned toward the camera, head tilted, eyes locked forward with a confident, inviting gaze. The composition places her on the left third of the frame. In the midground, a hexagonal HOGAN display stand with a red-and-white striped awning like a street stall, the brand logo on the front, and several colorful sneakers (blue, pink, black-and-white) below. Next to it, a large poster shows a brown leather handbag with logo and stitching. The background is a gray textured wall with a fine stone-like finish, a light beige ceiling with recessed spotlights casting soft, even illumination that creates natural shadow contours on her body and the counter. Lighting is warm and bright, with a comfortable shopping atmosphere. Color palette features pink, red, black, with gray and white neutrals. The scene feels like a high-resolution commercial ad shot, yet retains a candid tourist snapshot authenticity. The jacket fabric texture, sneaker rubber gloss, metal shine, and wall grain are all crisp. Strong visual contrast and modern-revival style.",
