        {
          "id": "krea2-fd5c10fdfa7710895369b1dd",
          "alias": "单女白和服床闭眼躺",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies supine on a thick bed of dry autumn leaves, her traditional white kimono unbound and slipping open to reveal her bare chest and soft curves—the fabric embroidered with red chrysanthemums and tiny blue flowers, a wide crimson obi loosened at her waist. Her short black hair spills naturally across the crunchy foliage, face peaceful with closed eyes and a faint smile, as if lost in a warm autumn afternoon dream. Her right arm stretches out, palm resting on the crisp leaves; her left hand lies gently on her stomach. Shot from a high angle, the composition centers her slightly left, with foreground of dense curled maple leaves in shades of tan to deep brown, some cracked and spotted. Midground shows her body and the kimono's folded shadows, the white fabric catching soft creases, the red obi and embroidery vivid in the sunlight. Background blurs into forest floor with scattered leaves and twigs, creating depth. Diagonal leaf lines guide the eye to her. Warm yellow light from high right bathes her face, arms, and kimono, casting soft highlights and left-side shadows, with dappled light through the canopy. Earth tones dominate, offset by the red-and-white of the kimono, evoking a nostalgic, filmic quality with slight grain and natural color cast—a timeless, poetic moment of serene intimacy and connection with nature.",
