        {
          "id": "krea2-6c05678e180487c423d9bbe1",
          "alias": "单女红旗袍媚态站立持灯",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sensual red qipao with a plunging neckline that reveals her cleavage and a side slit extending to her hip, exposing her bare leg and the curve of her hip, stands before a pure red background. She smiles seductively, eyes bright with mischief, holding a red paper lantern in each hand—one pressed lightly against her chest, partially shielding her exposed skin. Her qipao is sleeveless, high-collared, and cinched at the waist, the glossy silk fabric shimmering with gold embroidery of clouds, flowers, and traditional meanders. Her hair is styled in a vintage updo adorned with red tassel hairpins, her makeup flawless with bold red lips. She wears red strappy high-heeled sandals with white bow ties at the ankles. One leg is raised, knee bent, toe pointed, body tilted in a dynamic, balanced pose. The white floor is scattered with additional red paper lanterns—some toppled, some upright—and two red spring couplets with black calligraphy lie unrolled. The composition is centered, with the woman slightly above center, soft overhead lighting casting gentle shadows, creating a warm, festive atmosphere. The overall scene blends modern fashion photography with traditional Chinese New Year elements, conveying celebration and sensuality.",
