        {
          "id": "krea2-323dfaf661cb52d88dab7050",
          "alias": "单女半褪浴袍媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman in a flowing ancient robe of pale cyan and gray sits sideways, her robe slipping off one shoulder to reveal bare, luminous skin. Her ink-black hair falls in silken waves, adorned with an intricate gold crown and white feather ornaments, delicate tassel earrings swaying. She gazes downward, eyes half-lidded and reverent, as a faint glow hovers above her upturned palm, fingers slightly curled as if cradling the light. Her other hand loosely grips the sheer fabric of her robe, the cloth gathered to expose a hint of her thigh. The background is a dark cave or cliff crevice, jagged rock textures and twisted roots barely visible, with a strong shaft of light from above casting a backlit halo around her, illuminating dust motes. Mid-shot composition, she is offset to the left, with negative space on the right for tension. Low-angle shot, dramatic chiaroscuro: bright highlights on her face and hand, deep shadows pooling across her body. Cool blue-gray tones with warm golden light accents, cinematic quality, sharp focus on her expression and the glowing hand gesture. The mood is serene, sacred, and sensually intimate, as if an ancient ritual of power and vulnerability.",
