        {
          "id": "krea2-b1051c78042f8433e50a54b1",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣桥媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors, her long black hair falling naturally, with straight bangs covering her forehead. She wears a loose blue-and-white striped sweater, unbuttoned to expose her bare shoulder and the soft curve of her breasts, with no undershirt beneath. Her hands gently cup her cheeks, fingers tangling in her hair, a simple silver ring on her left ring finger. Her eyes look slightly upward with a suggestive, pensive gaze, lips parted, face soft and skin smooth. Mid-close portrait composition, subject placed to the right, leaving negative space on the left for visual balance. Foreground details of face and hands are sharp; background is blurred—a pale gray wall and indistinct shelves with small objects and a potted plant, creating a cozy home atmosphere. The overall color palette is cool blue-gray, with soft natural light coming from the front left, creating smooth transitions across her face, subtle highlights on the bridge of her nose and cheekbones, and delicate shadows. Warm wooden furniture edges introduce a gentle contrast. Shallow depth of field focuses on her eyes and hands, with the background reduced to soft color blocks. The camera angle is slightly low, resembling a 50mm portrait lens. The style feels like everyday photography or a lifestyle portrait, with a slight film grain, moderate saturation, and natural skin and fabric textures. The mood is quiet, contemplative, yet charged with a subtle sensuality—a captured moment of afternoon solitude, artistic and emotionally rich, as if taken with a casual digital camera at home without staged lighting but with precise natural light and composition, resulting in an honest, understated aesthetic.",
