        {
          "id": "krea2-48bf26bc61dc9ec63f22ed80",
          "alias": "单女露胸模特白浴袍摄影棚困倦持械",
          "prompt": "A young blonde female cosplayer, topless and wearing only an elaborate white-and-gold priestly headdress with intricate gold patterns and a sapphire star motif, her natural golden wavy hair cascading over bare shoulders. Her makeup is refined, red lips slightly parted, eyes clear and bright with a mix of gentle warmth and determination. She holds a detailed staff topped with a gold cross and purple gem, blue tassels and gold spikes extending forward. Her body is slightly turned to the right, head facing the camera. The staff is in sharp foreground focus, showing metal shine, gem reflections, and fabric folds. The midground highlights her exposed breasts and the delicate gold armor-like accents on her shoulders and chest, the white robe open to reveal her skin. The background is a painted medieval European fantasy scene with wooden-frame buildings, stained glass, and complex rooflines in brown, cream, and soft blue. A green plant appears at the right edge. The composition is a close-up, focusing on her upper body and staff, with a slight background blur. Lighting comes from above and front, soft and even, casting subtle shadows for depth. The overall palette is bright white, gold, and blue, creating a sacred, elegant, and magical atmosphere. The image has a realistic, high-detail studio look with a touch of natural light and film grain. Camera settings: 85mm lens, f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 200, softbox fill light. The result feels cinematic, dreamy yet real, like a saint or goddess from a fantasy world radiating divine light — now fully sensual and exposed.",
