          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a dimly lit ancient alley, wearing a revealing red traditional Chinese outfit—her modified cheongsam top is unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, with delicate frog buttons at the collar and cuffs, and a loose red coat draped open over her shoulders. Her long black hair is braided high and falls over her left shoulder, adorned with small silver hair ornaments. Her face is delicate, her gaze soft and inviting as she looks to the right, a subtle smile of pleasure and anticipation on her lips. She holds a slender bamboo pole in both hands, from which hangs a vibrant goldfish lantern with shimmering orange, red, yellow, blue, and white scales, its fins spread realistically, crafted from layered paper. The lantern dominates the foreground with rich detail, drawing focus. She stands slightly off-center right, body turned naturally. The background is a rough dark stone wall with a string of warm yellow round lanterns above, casting a soft glow; some are blurred into beautiful bokeh, creating a dreamy atmosphere. Lanterns recede into the alley, forming leading lines. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the subject center-right, negative space on the left, light source and background on the right. Harsh but flattering light from behind and side outlines her silhouette with soft rim lighting, casting delicate shadows on her face and clothing, enhancing depth. The overall palette is strong reds and warm yellows against dark brown and black backgrounds, creating a festive, intimate mood—like a Spring Festival or Lantern Festival night, with a quiet yet lively contrast. The image is cinematic, shot with a professional camera, mid-range focal length, shallow depth of field, emphasizing the subject while blurring the background. It exudes Eastern poetic beauty and sensual tension.",
