        {
          "id": "krea2-73e09db6eb963a26a12ed99e",
          "alias": "单女浴袍庭院微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing pale-green hanfu stands in an ancient courtyard. Her glossy black hair is swept up in a high bun, adorned with delicate white flowers and slender silver ornaments, a few loose strands falling across her forehead. Her face is refined and elegant, with expressive eyes that hold a quiet, tender gaze, a faint, knowing smile on her lips. She wears a sheer, lightweight hanfu in a muted jade green, the fabric slightly parted to reveal the outline of her bare skin and the curve of her breasts beneath—the inner white shift is visible only as a whisper, the garment open at the collarbone and slipping low, suggesting seductive exposure. The outer robe is embroidered with subtle cloud patterns, the sleeves and hem decorated with darker tonal motifs. A wide sash of the same color cinches her waist, from which hangs a carved jade pendant and a string of beads that sway gently. Her hands rest clasped over her abdomen, long slender fingers poised gracefully. She looks off into the distance, as if lost in memory. The foreground focuses sharply on her, highlighting the details of her costume and her facial expression. In the midground, a blurred figure of another woman in pale pink hanfu stands vaguely behind her. The background reveals classical wooden architecture—beams and eaves partially visible, warm golden light spilling through gaps in the roof, casting dappled shadows on the floor and walls. An old-fashioned paper lantern hangs in the distance, its shade glowing softly. The composition is centered and symmetrical, the woman positioned in the middle, drawing all attention to her face and attire. The background is softly blurred to emphasize her. Natural light streams from the left, illuminating half her face and sleeve, leaving the other side in gentle shadow, creating depth and dimension. The overall color scheme is cool tones of green, warmed by the lantern's amber glow, blending cool and warm for a harmonious visual. The atmosphere is serene and timeless, evoking classical Chinese elegance and a sense of peaceful introspection. The image has a realistic yet poetic quality, like a high-quality photograph taken with a 85mm f/1.8 lens, achieving a shallow depth of field with a soft bokeh, natural color saturation, and a slight film grain suggesting genuine photographic capture. Every detail—from the exposed décolletage to the intricate embroidery—conveys both the weight of tradition and a modern erotic allure, celebrating the timeless beauty of Eastern femininity in a sensual, adult manner.",
