          "prompt": "A young female dancer performs an energetic dance on a futuristic stage, wearing a semi-transparent white mesh crop top with a bold red heart logo and horizontal stripes, paired with high-waisted black leather shorts, a wide belt studded with silver rivets and colorful pins, a shiny metal buckle hanging from the belt, a white medical patch on her right knee, and fluffy white faux-fur boots. Her long deep-brown hair with auburn highlights falls naturally, with heavy smoky eye makeup, full red lips, small earrings and a delicate necklace. She holds a dynamic pose: arms raised above her head, fingers spread wide, body arched slightly backward, left leg stepping forward, right leg bent back, conveying intense motion and tension. The background is a giant blue LED screen displaying flowing cloud-like light effects, gradient from light to deep blue with slight grain and pixelation, creating a dreamlike digital space. Medium shot, slightly low-angle, strong top spotlight casting sharp highlights and shadows on her body, with blue ambient light filling the scene. Cold blue tones dominate, contrasting with the red elements on her outfit. The composition leads the eye along her arms in an S-curve down to her legs. The image has rich detail, smooth textures, professional stage photography quality with minor noise and oversaturated colors, blending commercial precision with raw authenticity. The overall mood is electric, sensual, and futuristic, capturing a frozen moment of an electronic music festival.",
