          "alias": "单女白毛衣舞台困倦站立短发",
          "prompt": "A young woman with deep brown short bob hair and straight bangs stands center stage, eyes lowered, lips parted and nearly touching the microphone as if breathily moaning a soft melody. She holds the black mic with her left hand; her right hand rests loosely on the open front of a white chunky knit cardigan that hangs off her shoulders, revealing her bare chest and her erect nipples. She wears nothing underneath except a pair of white thigh-high stockings with delicate lace trim and large satin bows at the ankles, plus white flats. The stockings hug her toned thighs, emphasizing the exposed skin above. The stage is a surreal garden: a wall of oversized pink blooms and purple flowers, blue hydrangeas on the left, realistic green artificial turf underfoot. Vintage wooden crates flank the set, one topped with a small pink box. A large white spherical lamp ringed with tiny LED lights casts a soft glow, and behind her an electronic screen displays blurred, dreamy patterns. The composition is symmetrical, mid-shot, with the woman centered. Front-top spotlight illuminates her face, the texture of the knit cardigan, the lace of her stockings, and the subtle shadows on her skin. The atmosphere is warm, dreamlike, with a faint melancholy—a frozen sensual moment in a night garden. The image has high-resolution photographic clarity, with slight edge blur for a soft, artistic finish, rich in detail and saturated color.",
