          "id": "krea2-8a00335f24555383b19b61c6",
          "alias": "单女红挂脖街道媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor stairwell, her long jet-black hair and blunt bangs framing a cold, confident face with deep, alluring eyes. She wears a low-cut wine-red and black halter top with the zipper partially undone, exposing the upper curve of her breasts and taut cleavage. A slim waist is highlighted by the top's cut and her matching high-waist trousers with decorative black buttons at the hip. Her left arm is adorned with a red-and-black armband, a black wristband, and a silver chain necklace rests on her bare collarbone. She stands slightly sideways, one hand brushing through her hair while the other rests casually on her hip, her gaze direct and commanding. The setting is a gray-walled stairwell with metallic railings; a large window on the left lets in soft natural light that casts gentle shadows across her body and the stairs. The composition places her slightly right of center, with a subtle tilt adding dynamism. Foreground hints of red fabric add depth, while the background blurs into cityscape silhouettes. The color palette is dark red, black, and gray, with rich textures—shiny hair, fabric folds, metallic reflections. The image has a slight grain and motion blur, mimicking a handheld camera, capturing a candid yet posed street-style moment with an air of sensuality and urban cool.",
