        {
          "id": "krea2-77fac3658b79681e22ac0d87",
          "alias": "单女露胸紫长裤健身房媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A graceful long-haired woman sits side-splayed on a light wooden Pilates reformer bench, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed as she extends her body sideways. She wears only deep purple high-waist yoga pants and pink knitted leg warmers around her ankles. Her right arm reaches high with fingers splayed, left arm hangs naturally, lightly gripping the black trapezius training frame beside her. Her legs are in a full split – one foot plants firmly on the bench edge, the other straightens behind her, showcasing extreme flexibility and core strength. Her head tilts slightly downward, eyes cast to the floor, expression focused and serene as if absorbed in breath and movement. The background is a bright, minimalist interior: cream-white walls smooth and clean, soft slanted light from above casting subtle shadows. Floor is light gray wood-grain. On the left stands a black metal Pilates ladder frame with multiple round handholds and a gray cushion beneath. Faintly visible in the right distance is a corner of medical/rehab equipment. The entire scene reads as a professional fitness studio. Medium shot composition places the figure left-of-center, her body lines creating a strong diagonal from upper-left to lower-right, achieving dynamic balance. Foreground emphasizes her interaction with the apparatus; midground shows clear action detail and spatial layout; background empty space reinforces presence. Lighting from skylight or hidden fixtures is soft and even, creating a warm, still, self-disciplined atmosphere. Color palette: purple, cream, light wood, unified modern minimalist aesthetics. Shot simulates a real camera with 85mm f/2.8 lens, capturing delicate skin texture and fabric folds. Slight depth-of-field blur softens the background, enhancing subject volume. The image feels like a casual gym snap by an amateur photographer, yet maintains professional composition and emotional tone – a balance of strength and sensuality, everyday and refined, depicting an urban healthy lifestyle with explicit adult allure.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
