        {
          "id": "krea2-e81f405575a1378c2e11b7ff",
          "alias": "单女粉内衣室内微笑自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a selfie pose, long sleek black hair with straight bangs, a pink satin bow on top of her head, strands falling over her shoulders and brushing her cheeks. She wears a delicate pink lace bra with intricate scalloped edges, thin straps, and tiny pink buttons at the front, revealing cleavage and smooth skin. A silver chain necklace with a cross pendant catches the light. Her makeup is glossy and polished—soft pink eyeshadow, defined eyeliner, thick curled lashes, natural blush, and shiny pink lip gloss. She holds a white smartphone with a triple camera module in her right hand, fingers slender and clean-nailed. Her gaze is direct, playful, confident, lips slightly parted as if about to speak or smile. Indoor setting with a light beige wall behind, a glimpse of a bed with rumpled pale sheets on the left, and a pink pillow on the right near the headboard. Front-top soft, even lighting creates a warm, bright atmosphere, with subtle shadows enhancing skin texture. Slight background blur to emphasize her. Color palette of pink, white, black, and silver metal accents. The composition is centered on her face, with her phone drawing the viewer’s eye from face to phone and back. The image feels like a candid, everyday selfie but with meticulous detail—lace texture, skin glow, metal reflections—blending realism with a soft, sensual, and modern feminine aesthetic.",
