        {
          "id": "krea2-c3914563d95a463b0240ca19",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝短裤健身房戏谑坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits cross-legged on the green court of an indoor badminton gym, leaning forward slightly, holding a blue-and-white racket in front of her face, the mesh creating a circular frame through which her clear eyes and soft features are visible. Her long wavy hair falls naturally, some strands brushing her bare shoulders and neck. She is topless, using the racket to partially shield her breasts, the tension in her arms accentuating her curves. She wears only dark blue high-cut sports shorts with white stripes and light grey chunky sneakers with white socks. Her lips are slightly parted, a faint, teasing smile playing on her face as she looks directly at the camera with an intense, knowing gaze. The background is a softly blurred indoor badminton court with orange-red walls, white pillars, and a distant net. Low-angle shot, the racket as foreground creating strong depth of field, warm overhead lighting, slight film grain and a nostalgic, intimate atmosphere.",
