        {
          "id": "krea2-31ba06d884a892b1d248b70c",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装摄影棚困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate maid outfit sits on a simple gray wooden chair. Her long black hair is styled in an elegant updo adorned with white laurel leaf hairpieces, and she wears black cat ear headpieces with slightly perked ears, giving her a playful yet mysterious look. Her makeup is refined—sharp eyeliner, thick curled lashes, full red lips. Her gaze is dreamy and deep, head slightly tilted toward the camera. Her right hand, gloved in white lace, touches her cheek in a contemplative pose; her left hand rests naturally on her thigh, wrist adorned with a brown leather bracelet and metal charms. The maid uniform features a low-cut white satin bodice with large blue floral fabric inserts, revealing a black lace bra and ample cleavage. The sleeves are blue-green jacquard with gold embroidery at the cuffs, black suspenders and metal clasps at the shoulders. The lower part is a black high-waisted short skirt with ruffled hem, paired with black lace-top thigh-high stockings that accentuate long, shapely legs. Her posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, body leaning, legs crossed (right over left), creating a graceful visual balance. Background is a pure pale blue gradient from light to sky blue, clean and simple, highlighting the subject. Medium shot composition with the figure on the left, leaving breathing space on the right. Slight low-angle camera enhances her noble aura. Soft, even lighting from front-left sculpts facial contours with delicate shadows, highlights on forehead, nose, lips, and natural light variations in fabric folds. The light blue wall behind shows subtle scattered light, no glare, creating a clean, bright atmosphere. Overall palette is blue, white, black with gold accents, harmonious and striking. The texture is fine, like professional studio gear but with a natural amateur feel. Focus is on face and upper body, background gently blurred. Her gaze draws the viewer upward, creating emotional connection. The atmosphere is both dreamy and real, blending artistic beauty with lifelike vividness, capturing a quiet moment that invites imagination.",
