          "prompt": "A young woman with long pink hair, wearing white goggles and a red bow tie, poses in a red-white gingham and polka dot bikini that accentuates her curves. She sits in a large woven rattan hanging chair, her left hand gently touching her forehead, right hand resting casually at her side. Her expression is sultry and inviting, with a soft smile and direct, teasing gaze into the lens. The intricate rattan chair features a dome-shaped top, natural light brown weave, beige fabric cushion, and decorative tasseled pillows. In the background, white carved wooden furniture and blurred tropical foliage are visible, with a sunny outdoor courtyard under blue sky and clouds. Warm sunlight streams from the upper left, casting soft highlights and natural shadows across her body, emphasizing her toned skin and the wet sheen of her bikini. The composition is a medium shot, slightly off-center, with her body turned and head tilted forward for an intimate, welcoming feel. The scene has a casual, real-life amateur photography quality, rich in detail and warm tones of red, white, pink, and brown, evoking a lazy summer vacation vibe with a hint of romantic, carefree sensuality.",
