          "alias": "单女全裸城市俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with short brown hair and delicate makeup, staring directly at the camera with a playful, confident expression, clear facial contours, fair smooth skin, nude-pink lipstick. She wears a gray-and-white raccoon-print furry hat with black ears and eyes, cute and edgy. Her upper body is topless except for a sheer black leopard-print lace cami top with thin straps, completely see-through, revealing her bare breasts and nipples. A classic pearl necklace and matching pearl bracelet add vintage elegance. In her right hand she holds a transparent plastic cup of brown milk tea with black tapioca pearls and caramel drizzle, straw inserted. Her left hand gently touches her neck, pose natural and relaxed. Foreground: upper-body close-up focusing on her face, outfit details, and the drink. Midground: her body and background architectural elements like white curved pipes or railings, clean modern lines. Background: dark interior, possibly a nightclub or café, dim walls and ceiling creating a private warm atmosphere. Centered symmetrical composition, eyes drawn to her face and the tea, with depth via perspective. Lighting: soft key light from front-left, casting subtle shadows on her face and body, highlighting skin texture, the sheen of the lace and pearls, while background remains dark for contrast. Overall vibe blends urban nightlife chic, youthful attitude, and casual everyday ease, with slight film grain and amateur camera feel, warm color palette of browns, grays, blacks, whites, punctuated by creamy pearls and caramel tones, creating a harmonious, rich visual.",
