          "prompt": "A young woman with short black curly hair and blunt bangs stands topless in a warm indoor setting, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples hard against the soft light. She faces the camera with a bright, playful smile, body turned slightly, one hand raised above her head in a teasing gesture, the other gloved in black leather resting at her side. She wears loose orange-red cargo pants, a matching fabric tie at the waist, and a blue denim short bib top left open or pulled down, the red embroidery \"Eat it Up\" visible over her belly, revealing smooth shoulders, toned abdomen, and a healthy, energetic silhouette. Behind her, a pink-orange gradient wall, a gold-framed sconce, vertical wooden panels, and thick orange velvet curtains with soft folds create a retro, intimate atmosphere. A dark carpet with geometric edges and a faint black object at the bottom right ground the scene. Medium shot, subject center-left, head tilted, eyes locked on the viewer. Soft light from the left sculpts her curves, with shadows on her right and back adding depth. The image has a candid, filmic quality with slight grain, high yet natural saturation, merging street-style sensuality with everyday warmth—a private, playful moment full of confident allure.",
