        {
          "id": "krea2-49d3172748fe5a580a6b8aaf",
          "alias": "单女全裸雪地媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired fox-eared girl sits bare-chested on a soft bed covered in white fur, her upper body nude but for a delicate blue sapphire pendant hanging between her breasts, her pink fox ear headdress and red floral forehead ornament accentuating her elegant, classical Chinese features. She gazes at the camera with a mysterious, gentle expression, her long silver-white hair cascading over her shoulders adorned with small golden ornaments and red flowers. Her arms are wrapped in pink fluffy sleeves, red silk ribbons tied at her wrists and ankles, her bare feet with red-painted toenails resting on the snowy white fur. She sits cross-legged, hands folded in her lap, leaning slightly forward, exuding a poised yet playful aura. The warm orange wooden wall behind is draped with heavy red gauze, soft halos of light filtering through. Black plum branches with red blossoms extend from the left, while red strings with golden bells hang above. On the right, a dark brown wooden table holds a gleaming gold tea set. Soft warm light from the front-left illuminates her face and body, creating subtle rim lighting and highlighting the textures of the red silk and golden details. The composition is symmetrical, with the girl centered, white fur in the foreground blurred, and layers of curtains, branches, and wall in the background. The overall palette is rich red, gold, white, and wood tones, evoking a sensual, ceremonial atmosphere—a blend of imperial court elegance and mythical fantasy, like a cinematic still from an Eastern fantasy film, every detail crafted for visual impact.",
