        {
          "id": "krea2-03e8e7db88838ce52ed2b7e1",
          "alias": "单女透视黑外套媚态坐整理头发",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a red bicycle, her brown shoulder-length hair with bangs falling loosely, wearing only an open black down jacket that hangs off her shoulders, revealing her bare chest, with a dark sweater discarded, a plaid miniskirt, a gray-and-white knitted scarf draped around her neck, black over-the-knee boots, and sheer stockings. She turns slightly toward the camera, her right hand gently brushing her hair back, expression natural and relaxed, eyes soft and intent, pose elegant yet casual. The background is a blurred city street with pedestrians moving faintly, building outlines visible, a green sign in the distance. Sunlight streams from the upper left, creating soft halos and light spots in the air, warm and bright, evoking a quiet winter afternoon. Shallow depth of field keeps her sharp against the blurred background. The composition centers her slightly to the right, with the bicycle handlebars and red frame forming foreground elements. The red frame and white railing guide the eye to her face. Light and shadow are delicate, with smooth transitions; cool tones dominate, accented by warm sunlight. The image has a realistic, cinematic street-photography feel, as if shot with a professional camera and large aperture. Details are rich, textures lifelike — you can almost feel the breeze on her skin and the warmth of the sun. It captures a moment of everyday life infused with youthful energy and a hint of literary artistry. The low-angle shot emphasizes her presence, while background figures and building lines add urban dynamism. The overall atmosphere is quiet yet vivid, like a photograph that freezes a perfect, sensual moment.",
