        {
          "id": "krea2-effcd75f6bb0e1e6bd705d1f",
          "alias": "单女露胸摄影棚微笑过肩",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a young woman with deep brown wavy hair and blunt bangs, strands falling naturally over her shoulders with a soft sheen, slightly tousled and voluminous under the light, ends curving inward for an elegant yet relaxed look. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features delicate and well-defined—large bright eyes with light brown irises, a clear, gentle gaze tinged with quiet contemplation; precise eye makeup with long curled lashes, subtle shimmer eyeshadow, and fine eyeliner, plump lips with natural pink gloss, a faint smile suggesting calm confidence. She is topless, wearing only a strand of pearls with a dark oval gem pendant resting on her bare chest. Her arms are crossed in front of her, one hand cupping the opposite elbow, the other resting loosely, fingers visible, nails neatly trimmed. The composition is a medium close-up, centered on her, with a blurred indoor background showing warm amber lamps, wooden walls, and faint figures, creating an intimate, cozy atmosphere. Lighting comes from front-left, softly illuminating her face with natural shadow transitions and subtle highlights on skin and hair, enhancing texture. The warm background contrasts with the cool tones of her bare skin. Shot with an 85mm prime lens, mimicking a professional studio feel but with slight grain and noise, as if captured by an amateur camera, colors moderately saturated with a warm yellow cast. The scene feels intimate, quiet, and slightly mysterious, with rich light-to-dark gradations, crisp details, blending artistic beauty with a sense of modern urban elegance and calm sensuality.",
