        {
          "id": "krea2-ef1020cf47d4a2dd89ca5e2c",
          "alias": "单女红礼服桌边温柔坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits before deep crimson velvet curtains, bare-breasted, wearing only a high-neck red silk gown that slips off her shoulders, the sheer fabric revealing her nipples through the delicate lace. Her black hair is pinned up elegantly, exposing her long neck and exquisite earrings. Heavy makeup, red lips slightly parted, eyes downcast, she gazes at a single red rose held between her fingers. Her hands rest over her chest, a gold ring on one finger, a thin gold bracelet on her wrist. The scene exudes romantic mystery. Before her, a table draped in red silk holds a transparent crystal candlestick with a white spiral candle flickering warmly, casting soft shadows. Scattered around are fresh red roses with layered petals, and a glass dish of pomegranate seeds, their ruby crystals contrasting with the red fabric. On the right, an empty wine glass catches the faint light, adding a domestic touch. The background is thick, plush crimson velvet curtains with natural folds, some areas lit showing subtle gradients. The overall palette is deep reds and dark reds, accented by warm yellow candlelight and metallic glints, creating strong color unity and visual impact. Composition is centrally symmetric, the woman slightly left of center, gaze leading to her face and the flower, creating an emotional focal point. Camera angle slightly above eye level, capturing her upper body and part of the table. Shallow depth of field, foreground sharp while background gradually blurs, emphasizing the subject while preserving the intimate atmosphere. Lighting comes from the candle on the right and a fill light on the left, soft but directional, producing delicate chiaroscuro and highlights on her face, hands, jewelry, and fabric. Shadows are deep but not harsh. The whole scene feels quiet, ritualistic—a private candlelit evening or a monologue at a significant moment. The image texture is fine, with cinematic light treatment and high-end photography style, yet retains a casual intimacy, as if shot by a professional using a full-frame DSLR with a wide aperture in low light, capturing a real, moving moment. Colors are highly saturated but not distorted, balancing luxury and reality. The composition is full but not crowded, with just enough negative space. Visual flow leads from her eyes to her hands to the candle and flowers, building a complete, story-rich scene.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
