        {
          "id": "krea2-fe1bca787508446d7dde7069",
          "alias": "单女露胸白短裙摄影棚俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young topless woman sits gracefully in a pure white birthday party setting, her body bare from the waist up, a sheer white tulle skirt flaring around her with layered, airy volume. She wears white butterfly-heeled shoes adorned with sparkling crystals. Her long, slightly curled hair falls naturally, a white bow clip tucked in. Her makeup is flawless, eyes soft and gazing into the lens. Her left hand gently holds a black \"9\" balloon; her right hand rests on a black birthday cake with a smooth, glossy surface, lace trim, and white \"Happy Birthday\" frosting script. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, her body slightly turned in a poised, relaxed pose. In the foreground, a small round table with a white cloth and parts of the cake and balloon. Midground: her nude figure, skin gleaming, nipples visible. Background: clean white wall, with black letter balloons spelling \"MIN YOONGI\" hanging above, and scattered black-and-white round balloons creating strong contrast. The overall tone is black-and-white, high-end and pure yet warmly intimate. Soft, even lighting from front and side softboxes sculpts her facial features and body, with subtle shadows and no harsh transitions. The background is uncluttered, emphasizing her. A professional studio look with a candid, close-up feel. The balanced composition has ample negative space, guiding the eye naturally from her face to the balloon and cake, then to the letters and balloons, forming a circular flow. Rich but not overwhelming light and shadow enhance her three-dimensional form and the texture of the skirt. The atmosphere is serene and celebratory, both ceremonial and relaxed, perfect for marking a special moment. High-resolution detail: shine in her hair, transparency of the skirt, fine skin texture, reflections on the balloon surfaces. The style blends fashion editorial with lifestyle photography, artistic elegance with emotional warmth, ideal for themes of youth, growth, and joy.",
