        {
          "id": "krea2-3f629f2e70f5f239f5da3a1b",
          "alias": "单女米外套霓虹夜景媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the back seat of a luxury sedan, wearing a thick, fluffy cream-white fox fur coat with a wide, layered collar of dense, soft fur in natural light beige and pale brown gradients, the tips catching faint gloss in the dim light. Underneath, she wears a black lace-trimmed camisole, low-cut to reveal cleavage and elegant collarbone-to-shoulder lines, her hair falling in soft waves, makeup flawless with vivid red lips. Her eyes are deep, slightly hazy, locking onto the camera with a cool, confident expression. She leans slightly sideways, one hand resting on her thigh, the other hidden by the coat, posture relaxed and sensual. The black leather seat is textured with fine stitching, curved to fit the body. Through the window, blurred neon light trails in blue, white, yellow, and red streak past, creating dynamic bands of urban night speed. The close-up composition places her slightly left of center, the fur coat dominating the frame with its volume, background softly blurred. A slightly high angle suggests the view from the front passenger or driver seat, enhancing immersion. Warm yellow overhead interior lighting mixes with reflected neon, casting soft shadows that sculpt her facial features, while the fur’s surface shows rich highlights and shadows, each hair strand distinct. The overall mood blends nocturnal mystery, luxury, and personal allure, with a film-like, high-fashion quality—a captured moment of a city night ride where the protagonist pauses, gazes into the lens, exuding both casual intimacy and artistic expression. Shot with a professional camera at low light, slower shutter speed for motion blur while keeping the subject sharp, 85mm lens at f/1.8, ISO 400, exposure +0.3, adding gentle grain for realistic texture.",
