        {
          "id": "krea2-86775ee3419135c3a9e79024",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣摄影棚媚态比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a black bunny-themed outfit, wearing a velvet black bunny ear headband, her long hair tied into twin ponytails falling over her shoulders, with straight bangs across her forehead. Her eyes are clear with a hint of lazy seduction, staring directly at the camera. Soft facial features, pale and delicate skin, natural yet refined makeup with light pink lips—a mix of sexy and innocent allure. She wears a black high-neck tight bodysuit with a slight sheen, a corset-style front with lacing, and a white Peter Pan collar with a black bow. The sleeves are white short-shirt cuffs with black buttons, creating a sharp black-and-white contrast. Her body is slightly turned, right hand raised near her face making a peace sign, left hand hanging naturally, arms crossed in front. She wears black diamond-pattern fishnet stockings; feet partially out of frame. Indoor setting with dim, deep lighting—blurred doorframe and distant furniture visible. Dark wooden floor reflects faint light spots. Medium close-up composition, subject centered, head in upper third, eye-level gaze creating intimate direct eye contact. Camera at eye level with a slight low angle to accentuate body lines, focus on face and upper body, background blurred with shallow depth of field. Light from front-left, soft and even, illuminating her front with clear rim light, creating subtle highlights and shadow transitions on the fabric, enhancing texture. The atmosphere is quiet and private, color palette of black, white, gray with warm skin tones—a cold yet gentle fashion sensibility. The image draws the viewer's eye first to her face, then follows her gaze and hand gesture down to the full outfit. Professional studio quality with an amateur snapshot feel, rich in detail and layered tones, moderate saturation, balanced contrast. Perfect for fashion photography or cosplay themes with an overtly sensual edge.",
