          "alias": "单女湿身米外套庭院媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands under an arched stone doorway in a courtyard, her long jet-black hair cascading naturally, fair and flawless skin, delicate and refined features, her gaze clear and slightly contemplative, as she turns slightly to look back over her shoulder, lips pressed together in a quiet, introspective expression. She wears a beige and dark brown plaid jacket, fully unbuttoned and open, revealing her bare chest with perky nipples. A light blue shirt is loosely draped, unbuttoned and pushed aside, leaving her torso exposed. She pairs this with a beige high-waisted long skirt that flows smoothly, hugging her waist and hips. Her left hand gently holds a finely woven white straw handbag, round with intricate weave and matching rope strap. Her right hand slips casually into the skirt pocket. She leans gracefully against the white stone arch, its surface rough with age. To the left, a dense thicket of bamboo with vivid green leaves; to the right, a bush bursting with small red flowers. Pink and red petals scatter on the ground. The white wall behind shows moss patches. Soft natural light streams from the upper right, casting gentle shadows over her skin and clothing, creating a warm, filmic, nostalgic atmosphere. The composition centers on her, framed by the arch, as if capturing a quiet, sensual moment in a sun-drenched courtyard.",
