        {
          "id": "krea2-216598bb971261dd796e0f65",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰长裤泳池冷淡坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a gray Pilates reformer, wearing a sheer pink long-sleeve athletic top with a cross-shoulder strap design that slips off one shoulder, exposing her bare breast and nipple. She pairs it with tight dark gray yoga pants that cling to her curves, and thick white slouchy socks that pool at the machine's edge, giving a lazy, comfortable home workout vibe. Her black hair is pulled into a high ponytail with a gray-and-white fabric scrunchie, strands falling softly over her shoulder. One hand lightly touches her hair, the other rests on the reformer's handle. Her body is slightly twisted, head turned to the right, gaze distant, expression relaxed but focused, blending elegance and strength. The foreground shows the reformer's padded carriage, metal frame, branded rail, springs, and adjustment handles. The woman occupies the center-left, the visual focal point. Background is a minimalist interior: left wall with light beige vertical panels, right side a gold-framed glass sliding door revealing storage and warm indoor light. Light wood floor with natural grain. Soft, even lighting from a warm source above right creates natural shadows on her face, arms, and the machine. Slight low-angle shot adds dynamic depth, with her and the machine forming a stable triangle guiding the eye from foreground to figure to background. The overall atmosphere is intimate, artistic, realistic, with warm tones contrasted by cool gray of the reformer, blending everyday casualness with professional fitness aesthetic.",
