          "alias": "单女露胸浴袍花园媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by an intricately carved stone railing in a classical Chinese garden, her traditional hanfu robe open and slipped off her shoulders, exposing her bare breasts and smooth skin. The deep blue silk robe is richly embroidered with gold cloud motifs and flying cranes, with pink peonies and white plum blossoms accenting the fabric. Her glossy black hair is pinned up in an elaborate bun adorned with silk flowers, jade hairpins, pearl strands, and flowing pale purple ribbons that drift in the breeze. She smiles softly, her gaze directed to the right, one hand resting lightly on the carved stone. A branch of blooming plum extends into the foreground, matching the floral embroidery. The background is softly blurred in blue-green tones, hinting at pavilions and trees. Warm side lighting caresses her face and bare chest, creating a gentle, sensual atmosphere. The composition is balanced and elegant, merging classical beauty with explicit allure.",
