          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a wooden window sill, wearing only light blue denim shorts, white knee-high socks, and black Mary Jane shoes. She holds a vintage black rotary phone to her ear, her bare breasts exposed, nipples firm and visible. Her black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, lips slightly parted as if whispering into the receiver, gaze turned slightly toward the camera with a thoughtful, sensual expression. The window sill is covered with a dark brown woven mat; another rotary phone sits on the sill to the right. Behind her, a large window reveals a city river view—boats and yachts on the water, a bridge, and a skyline of modern skyscrapers under a pale blue sky. Soft sunlight streams from the upper right, casting a warm rim light on her body and hair, creating a golden halo. The indoor light is warm, the outdoor light cool, with a natural depth of field blurring the distant city. Composition is vertical, with the woman slightly right of center, her legs extending diagonally to the lower left, guiding the eye from the foreground sill into the background. The image has a subtle film grain, realistic color, and a candid, everyday aesthetic, blending youthful nostalgia with quiet sensuality.",
