        {
          "id": "krea2-8f1b3b7a5666cc11dcd58726",
          "alias": "单女全裸紫浴袍庭院忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty stands in an ancient courtyard, her long black hair piled high in an elaborate bun adorned with delicate white flowers and gold ornaments, a few silken strands falling softly by her ears. She is nude to the waist, her pale, flawless skin glowing in the warm, angled light of dusk. Her face is exquisite, with refined brows and deep, melancholic eyes that gaze into the distance, lips slightly parted as if about to whisper a memory. She wears a sheer, open-front lavender robe of silk with subtle patterns, the wide sleeves trimmed in creamy white fur; the robe hangs loosely off her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts with soft curves and barely visible nipples. The robe’s front is embroidered with elegant blue-purple floral motifs and tiny pearls at the edges. Beneath, she wears a white cross-collar underskirt with light gold floral embroidery, the fabric draped in natural folds. Her hands are clasped gently before her, her posture demure yet inviting. The shot is a close-up, with the subject filling most of the frame, focusing on her facial expression and the details of her clothing, while behind her, traditional Chinese wooden lattice windows cast dappled shadows. The background blurs into a warm-toned courtyard wall and eaves, giving a quiet, timeless atmosphere. Side lighting from behind creates a soft rim light on her shoulder and hair, highlighting her smooth cheeks and the subtle shadow on her nose bridge. The colors are muted purple, white, and brown, creating a serene, sensual mood. The image has a realistic, slightly amateur quality, as if captured with a high-resolution camera in natural light, with a shallow depth of field focusing on her face and bare chest, evoking a classical painting that exudes Eastern aesthetics and quiet eroticism.",
