        {
          "id": "krea2-c42d51f128da27a245d7a50f",
          "alias": "双女黑短裤舞台媚态站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "Two young women in opulent red-and-gold circus-style costumes stand before a deep crimson velvet curtain. The left woman has shoulder-length hair, the right has long straight black hair. Both wear tight black leather micro-shorts and high black leather boots, with their red sequin jackets open wide, baring their midriffs and revealing sheer gold-lace bralettes underneath. Their poses are confident—left hand on hip, right hand brushing through hair or dangling suggestively—gazes intense, sultry, and stage-ready. Between them, a classical crystal candelabrum hangs with multiple candle-shaped bulbs draped in transparent crystal beads, casting warm, soft light across the scene. The floor is covered in an intricate red-and-black vintage patterned carpet, echoing the heavy drapery. Symmetrical composition centers the women and the candelabrum as focal point, drawing the eye deep into the frame. Foreground highlights legs and boots, midground emphasizes the bare midriffs and costume details, background velvet creates theatrical drama. Light falls from above and front in a stage spotlight effect, defining curves, highlighting slick skin and shimmering sequins. Overall palette dominated by red and gold with black accents, strong contrast, rich shadow transitions. The scene feels like a stolen moment just before a circus performance—both ritualistic and modern, with subtle lens noise and natural color temperature of amateur equipment, capturing a candid yet carefully staged visual feast. Expressions are vivid and natural, movements fluid, blending professional poise with effortless sensuality. The image conveys youth, passion, and dreamlike allure.",
