          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a large pale brown floor cushion, wearing only a sheer white cropped cardigan, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal the smooth curve of her bare breasts, her nipples subtly visible through the gauzy fabric. She wears deep grey-brown high-waisted leggings that hug every contour of her hips and thighs. In one hand she holds a translucent pink fabric that drapes and flows in an elegant arc around her body, partially veiling a nipple as it moves. Her weight is shifted onto one straight leg, the other leg bent slightly with toes touching the cushion, creating a balanced, graceful pose. Her hair falls loose, strands lifting with the motion. Her expression is soft, focused, and confident, eyes locked toward the camera with a hint of serene sensuality. The background is a plain soft lavender gradient wall, clean and minimalist. Lighting is soft, from above-front, illuminating the skin's texture and the sheer fabrics, casting subtle shadows that enhance the curves. The foreground includes a large plush brown cushion adding depth. Overall composition is mid-shot, centered slightly left. The style is polished, like high-end studio photography with a premium mirrorless camera, blurring the background just enough to emphasize the subject. The mood is calm, elegant, and alluring, with warm low-saturation tones, blending art photography with commercial fashion aesthetics.",
