          "prompt": "A stunning blonde young woman with piercing blue eyes, wearing a black velvet tight dress with the bodice unzipped to reveal her bare breasts, the dress's unique netting and metal button accents framing her cleavage. She dons slim black-rimmed glasses with soft reflections, black long gloves, and black fishnet stockings paired with high heels. She leans confidently against an antique wooden desk, one leg crossed over the other, a seductive gaze directly into the camera. The scene is set in a luxurious 19th-century European boudoir: a giant ornate golden mirror behind her reflects the room's chandelier and wall decor, blue-green patterned wallpaper, black-and-white marble floor. Warm golden light from above and behind casts soft shadows on her face and curves, highlighting every detail of her exposed skin and the texture of her dress. Framed symmetrically, the composition draws the eye from her expressive face down her body and legs, then into the rich surrounding details—vintage candelabras, glassware, polished wood. The image has a high-end photography feel with subtle grain and natural lens flare, exuding an elegant, cool, and intensely alluring atmosphere.",
