          "alias": "单女舞者短裙舞台微笑站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young female dancer dominates the center stage in a powerful, dynamic dance pose. She wears a black cropped top with crisscross straps across her chest, emphasizing her slender waist, paired with a high-waist mini skirt, black thigh-high stockings, and white platform sneakers with black ankle string decorations. Her right hand is gloved in blue velvet, her left ring finger adorned with a silver ring. Long hair flies as she moves, her face focused and expressive, eyes locked on the camera with a confident smirk. She wears a wireless microphone on her ear. The overall look is futuristic and edgy, oozing stage presence. Her body is in a dynamic balanced stance, arms bent and raised with precise hand gestures, legs crossed and spread for intense visual tension. In the background, another female dancer stands slightly to the left and behind, wearing a gray-white spliced cropped top and black shorts, also holding a microphone and smiling, her movements coordinated. A third dancer is partially visible on the right edge, completing the performance formation. The stage features a huge LED screen showing blue-purple gradient light effects, with multiple spotlights projecting bright blue-white beams from above, creating a strong live atmosphere. Floor reflections of lights and figures enhance depth. The composition is center-focused, using the main dancer's sharp silhouette against blurred background light spots to emphasize motion. Lighting comes diagonally from above, creating contrast between light and shadow, evenly illuminating her face and body while creating soft reflections on the floor and clothing. The overall palette is deep blue and purple, accented with white and gray, giving a futuristic, tech-infused visual. The atmosphere is hot and rhythmic, as if you can hear the music beat and crowd cheers, capturing a moment from a K-pop girl group live performance — combining professionalism with artistic beauty and strong visual impact. Shot in a hyper-realistic cinematic style with a professional film camera, it faithfully reproduces stage lights, performer movements, and environmental details, presenting a refined yet energetic modern pop culture image.",
