          "prompt": "A young woman glances back over her shoulder, her long black wavy hair cascading down, silver hair clips catching the light. She smiles sweetly with clear bright eyes, fair skin, and natural makeup—pink lips and a soft blush. She is topless, her pink floral spaghetti strap dress pulled down to her waist, revealing her bare breasts. Her pose is graceful, body slightly arched back, head turned toward the camera. In the foreground left, a transparent balloon filled with pink and white mini balloons, printed with red \"MAVIS BEAUTY\" text, tied with a pink ribbon bow. Below it, a pink gift box with \"HALO MAVIS BEAUTY\" and website details, edges crisp. On the right, a bouquet of pink roses and dried flowers with layered petals and curved stems. Background is a light gray vertical-stripe wall with fine texture, clean and simple. The slightly tilted camera angle creates a candid, lifestyle feel. Lighting from the left front is soft and even, no harsh shadows, illuminating her face and chest, with subtle highlights on the balloons, box, and flowers. The overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, festive, and feminine, with a palette of pink, cream, and gray. The image has a slight grain and natural depth of field—sharp focus on her face, soft blur on background, simulating a real camera shot. Style is realistic with a touch of aesthetic beauty, blending commercial quality with personal snapshot, no extra clutter, balanced composition, and a sense of relaxed celebratory ritual.",
