          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the center of a room covered in anime posters, her long black hair falling softly over her forehead, eyes clear with a melancholy yet sultry gaze, face soft and pale, lips pale pink, exuding a cool, lazy aura. She wears a sheer white lace crop top that barely covers her chest, leaving her breasts partially exposed, her flat stomach and slender waist visible. She is topless beneath the open shirt, with her plaid shirt casually draped over her shoulders, sleeves dangling. Her high-waisted light blue denim shorts are frayed at the edges, legs slightly apart, body leaning forward, hands resting near her knees, creating an intimate yet distant atmosphere. The background is a dense collage of Japanese anime posters—mecha, magical girls, swordsmen—overlapping and misaligned, vibrant colors. A floral patterned cloth or sheet covers the floor, scattered with books and small items. The room is dim but warm, a golden beam of light from the upper left illuminating her face, arms, and part of her legs, casting strong shadows and highlights on her hair and clothes, with floating dust particles enhancing the realism. The low-angle shot places her centrally, legs leading from the foreground up to her body, creating depth and visual impact. The posters form a diagonal line, adding dynamism. The foreground sheet texture is sharp, background slightly blurred. Overall warm amber tones with cool blue-purple accents, reminiscent of a nostalgic film photograph, no artificial marks, capturing a quiet, pure moment of a girl resting in her own world.",
