          "id": "krea2-bb143b9f5763a31ffb8393f4",
          "alias": "单女露胸绿毛衣门微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless beside a white vintage car, her long, silky black hair cascading naturally, catching the sunlight with a soft sheen, a few strands lifted by a gentle breeze. Her skin is fair and smooth, her features delicate and defined—soft brows, clear bright eyes carrying a serene, tender gaze, lips slightly parted in a subtle, graceful smile. She wears only a tight, mint green high-neck short-sleeve knit top, unzipped to expose her bare chest, the fabric clinging to her slender waist and accentuating the curve of her neck. Below, she has on a brown plaid skirt with classic houndstooth pattern in dark brown, cream, and black, the waistline fitted, the skirt draping naturally. Her left hand rests lightly on the car door edge, fingers long and relaxed. A single round pearl earring glows softly on her ear. The background is an outdoor natural setting: two thick tree trunks frame the sides, their rough bark texture contrasting with the softness of her skin. Behind the trees, a blue corrugated metal wall shows age and patina, with a faint white letter \"W\" and a cluster of green pine branches adding life. The light comes from behind, warm afternoon sun filtering through leaves, casting a golden rim light on her hair and body, with soft, subtle shadows. The overall tone is warm yellow and green, creating a calm, intimate atmosphere. Composition is a mid-shot portrait, she stands slightly right of center, body angled toward the camera, head tilted slightly, gaze directed off to the left foreground. The white car body and window occupy the left side, glass reflecting blurred light, adding depth. Foreground includes part of her and the car door; midground shows her full figure and immediate surroundings; background features trees and metal wall. Layers are distinct, visual flow from her face to the background. The mood is warm and quiet, with a natural, everyday beauty—like a poetic, candid moment captured on film, with moderate saturation, rich detail, and a nostalgic, authentic feel.",
