          "id": "krea2-beedba8991c5716756a18bd1",
          "alias": "单女短裙微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the green hard court, wearing a sheer white off-shoulder top that reveals the curve of her breasts and a hint of nipple, paired with a gradient translucent tennis skirt that shifts from pale blue to lavender to pink, creating a soft rainbow effect. She wears a light blue Wilson visor, her black hair tied in a ponytail that falls naturally, smiling brightly with warm, inviting eyes that gaze directly into the camera, exuding youthful confidence and sensual allure. Her right hand loosely grips a white tennis racket with orange accents, resting diagonally beside her, while her left hand touches the ground, body slightly leaned forward in a relaxed, elegant pose. Her legs are crossed, right knee bent, left leg extended, wearing white sneakers with wavy soles and white socks. Three yellow tennis balls lie scattered nearby—one near the racket, two in the foreground—their fuzzy surface and \"DUNLOP\" imprint clearly visible. The background is a deep green court with crisp white boundary lines, a black tennis net with fine, even mesh extending to the edges, creating strong geometric lines. The scene is brightly lit with soft sunlight from above right, casting natural shadows; her face and body are evenly lit, with delicate shadow variations on the fabric folds. The racket and balls cast clear but soft shadows on the ground. The overall palette is fresh and bright, dominated by greens, whites, and yellows, accented with pink and blue gradients. The composition is low angle, near ground level, emphasizing her figure while using the racket and balls as foreground elements to guide the eye, creating visual depth. The midground features her and the racket, with the court and net in the background, spatial relationships clear. The visual flow starts from the foreground balls, moves past the racket, and settles on her face, evoking a relaxed, playful athletic atmosphere. The image feels like a candid snapshot from a casual afternoon, with slight film grain and natural noise, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, and a warm, intimate, lively everyday photography style—capturing the fusion of sport and beauty, blending the dynamism of competitive tennis with feminine softness and leisurely pleasure.",
