          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black-and-white checkerboard floor, wearing a glossy black bunny bodysuit with a partially untied pink ribbon bow and crisscross straps that reveal her cleavage, sheer black fishnet stockings, and black high heels. A black bunny ear headband sits on her head, her twin-tails fall naturally, and her blunt bangs frame her face. She gazes softly into the camera with a sweet, teasing smile, her left hand gently touching the bow on her chest, her pose elegant yet provocatively playful. The background is a soft pink bedroom with vintage turntable and stereo on the left, a shiny silver disco ball nearby, a black leather sofa and stacked shopping bags on the right, scattered newspapers and clutter on the floor, creating a Japanese otaku-culture space. Medium close-up, she sits slightly turned, legs crossed, her eyes locked on the lens. Soft front-right lighting highlights the glossy texture of the outfit and her skin, with background blur. Color palette: black, white, pink — high contrast yet harmonious. The scene feels like a professional studio portrait blending sexiness and cuteness, with fine details like fabric wrinkles and hair strands, a dreamy yet realistic Japanese idol/cosplay aesthetic.",
