          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙广场媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the floor of a luxurious interior, wearing a sheer white lace dress that leaves her nipples visible beneath the delicate fabric, the long sleeves and floral neckline still framing her body with elegance. She sits sideways on a vintage patterned rug, legs crossed, gold strappy sandals glittering with crystals. Her dark hair is pulled into a low ponytail, a tiny star hairpin at her forehead. She rests her chin on her right hand, fingers curled, looking directly at the camera with a calm, knowing gaze. Her left hand lies gracefully on the rug. A gold diamond-quilted handbag with the iconic CC logo sits beside her. In the background, a classical sofa upholstered in colorful floral fabric, a beige square pillow, and curved wooden frame; behind it, a black iron staircase railing, light walls, and dark wood furniture. A vintage chair is partially visible on the left. Soft warm yellow-white light from natural and indoor sources creates gentle shadows, highlighting the textures of her skin and clothing. The composition is slightly high-angle, with the woman on the left and the environment on the right, drawing the eye from her face down her body to her legs and feet, then to the handbag, and finally to the sofa and staircase. The overall mood blends elegance, luxury, and serene sensuality, like a high-fashion editorial shot in a private residence.",
