          "alias": "单女半褪连体衣门媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a blue hard-shell suitcase, her long, wavy jet-black hair cascading naturally over her shoulders. Her porcelain skin is flawless, her delicate features sharp and alluring. She stares directly into the lens with a deep, focused gaze, lips slightly parted, exuding a cool, mysterious, and subtly seductive air. A small black heart-shaped sticker adorns her cheek, adding a playful, rebellious touch; a tiny silver nose ring glints on her nose, simple studs in her ears, and a delicate circular gold pendant rests at her collarbone. She wears a black, skintight one-piece bodysuit with a deep V-neckline that plunges provocatively, dramatically emphasizing her cleavage and graceful collarbones. The thin spaghetti straps have slipped off one shoulder, revealing a bare shoulder and hinting at her figure. The fabric clings to every curve, showcasing her toned physique. She pulls on long black leather gloves that extend past her elbows, smooth and glossy. Her legs are sheathed in sheer black stockings, with black over-the-knee sock cuffs tightly encircling her thighs just above her knees, creating a stark, sensual layered look. She sits upright yet relaxed, legs slightly apart, one hand resting on her inner thigh, fingers lightly grazing the stocking, while the other hand lies on the suitcase. The background is a clean white wall with a white door featuring a metal handle and keyhole, spare and minimal, focusing all attention on her. The composition is a medium shot, her body turned slightly to the camera, head facing the viewer, strong eye contact. Soft overhead lighting from the right front gently highlights her face and body, creating smooth shadows that accentuate her curves and the glossy textures of latex, leather, and skin. The overall palette is monochrome black and white with the blue suitcase as a vibrant accent, balancing cold and warm tones. The style is a mix of fashion editorial and candid snapshot, with slight grain and natural details, giving an intimate, real, and yet artfully constructed feel. The scene suggests travel or departure, adding narrative depth. The entire frame is focused on her presence, emanating a cool, confident, and deeply alluring energy, blending modern independence with raw sensuality.",
