          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on the floor in an indoor setting, her glossy black hair tied in a high ponytail with two braids falling over her shoulders, fair skin, delicate makeup with soft pink-gradient eyeshadow and pale pink lips, expression sweet and composed. She wears a black ribbed knit cardigan left completely open, revealing her bare chest and perky breasts, paired with a black mini skirt and black high-heeled over-the-knee boots lined with gray fur at the top cuffs. She gazes down at a silver-white smartphone with vintage floral decals in her right hand, left hand resting on her thigh, body slightly leaning forward, elegant yet relaxed, a hint of playful serenity in her eyes. In the foreground are her clear facial features and hand gesture; midground includes a pink bow-shaped chair she sits on and a matching white chair beside it, both with pink cushioned seats and unique double-ring backrest. Background is a light gray cement-textured wall with a framed cat illustration—a white long-haired cat lounging on pink sheets—and a vertical decorative painting of a pink ribbon pattern to the upper right. The floor is large white tiles with dark grout. Soft side lighting from the left illuminates her face and arms, casting gentle shadows on the floor and wall, creating rich tonal depth and an intimate, warm atmosphere. Composition is a low-angle close-up, subject centered slightly left, with a mix of black-and-white tones punctuated by pink accents, balancing realism and dreaminess, as if captured by a professional camera under natural light, crisp details and moderate saturation.",
