        {
          "id": "krea2-c91c8e5af8a118993c02a24a",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙摄影棚微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman with a shoulder-length black bob and straight bangs sits against a pale gray background, her bright, gentle eyes locked on the camera with a subtle, inviting smile. Her arms are raised above her head, fingers slightly spread as if presenting or balancing a black apple-shaped object on top of her head—its top reveals a wedge of golden flesh, creating stark color contrast. She wears a form-fitting red sleeveless dress with a matching wide belt cinching her waist, overlaid with a sheer white lace long-sleeved blouse featuring puffed sleeves and delicate ruffled trim, the lace semi-transparent and clinging to her skin, hinting at her silhouette. Multiple pearl necklaces adorn her neck, one thicker choker with dark gemstones and gold metalwork adding a touch of luxury, while a gold bead bracelet wraps her wrist. Her nails are painted a soft pink. The composition is centered and symmetrical, focusing on her upper body with a slight forward lean, creating intimacy. The clean gray backdrop is uncluttered, with a hint of a red circular object (perhaps a chair or prop) visible on the right edge. Lighting from above-front diffuses softly, highlighting her face and outfit, with natural shadows and a warm, bright studio feel. The style blends high-fashion photography with surreal art, the red-white palette punctuated by black and gold, resulting in a visually striking, whimsical yet elegant NSFW portrait.",
