        {
          "id": "krea2-ef6b9e97c1ab248ce198079b",
          "alias": "单女露胸米外套广场闭眼坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a stone railing by a lake, her short red-brown hair falling naturally with bangs, eyes closed and a serene smile on her face as she tilts her head back to bask in the warm sunlight. Her skin is fair and delicate, lips pale pink, cheeks flushed with a healthy glow. She wears a cream-colored fluffy coat, soft and voluminous, with a thick collar and zipper—unzipped to reveal bare breasts, her nipples lightly visible against the pale fabric edge. The coat has two square metallic decorative buttons on the chest, tightened cuffs and hem, a light-colored high-neck top underneath now partially pushed aside. She wears black slim-fit jeans that hug her legs smoothly, and a brown leather crossbody bag with a gentle curved shape, fine texture, metal chain strap and branded metal clasp, a small elephant charm hanging from it. Silver rings adorn her fingers, hands resting folded on her lap, posture relaxed, body leaning slightly against a thick marble pillar covered in natural gray speckles and patterns, its texture heavy and ancient. The pillar base connects to a beige stone railing with simple geometric carvings along the edge. In the background, the vast lake surface shows deep blue and gray-blue gradients, shimmering with gentle ripples, mirror-like calm. Distant mountain outlines are hazy, veiled in mist. The sky is clear light blue, soft and bright. The sun sits at the upper left, casting warm backlighting that illuminates her hair and silhouette, creating a subtle halo effect. The composition centers on her, a medium shot with her slightly to the left, leaving ample space on the right to show the lake and mountains, creating visual balance. The foreground includes the stone railing and pillar, midground shows her and the near shore, background the lake and distant mountains, distinct layers. Colors are warm yellow, cream, gray-blue, pale pink, evoking a tender, tranquil atmosphere. Light and shadow transition naturally, shadows soft, emphasizing her figure and the texture of the clothing. The scene has a real, candid feel—like a professional camera or high-end phone shot at dawn or dusk, moderate focal length, controlled depth of field with gentle background blur, crisp details, clean and artistic, full of everyday life and beauty, conveying a mood of leisure and present-moment enjoyment, like a carefully composed travel portrait, both realistic and poetic.",
