        {
          "id": "krea2-33b3daf35c11f4ff293dc83f",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉T恤桌边坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at an outdoor table of an American-themed diner, her short brown hair with bangs tied in a messy bun, loose strands framing her face. She smiles softly, eyes clear and direct, fair skin with light, dewy makeup, lips naturally pink. She wears a pink plaid tank top with bow straps, the fabric pulled down to fully expose her breasts, nipples hard against the open weave. A cream knit cardigan with cherry embroidery is draped over the back of her chair, sleeves rolled. Her hands rest clasped on the table, fingers long and nails neat, body slightly forward, relaxed. The table is covered with a worn US flag cloth—blue with white stars, red and white stripes—and holds a transparent plastic bag. In the background, a menu board advertises cream of mushroom soup with a small US flag, reading \"BULL'S AMERICAN DINER\", surrounded by lush dark green leaves. An orange surfboard with \"TOKYO\" graphics leans against the wall to the right. Warm yellow string lights hang above, casting a soft glow. The roof is white metal with corrugated iron, distant palm leaves visible. Soft natural light from above left creates gentle shadows on her face and chest. Mid-shot, slightly right of center. The scene is vibrant red, white, blue with pink, green, orange accents, a warm, nostalgic summer vibe, slightly grainy with smooth bokeh, like a candid travel photo.",
