        {
          "id": "krea2-07ffe7243bdae370624c7bc1",
          "alias": "单女露胸户外微笑站立长发",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors on a red sports court, wearing only loose white sweatpants with three black stripes down the sides, white sneakers, a silver watch, and a white headband, her long hair falling freely. She is topless, leaning casually against a green chain-link fence post, holding an orange-red pickleball paddle in her right hand, smiling toward the right side of the frame, body slightly tilted in a relaxed, natural pose that exudes casual athletic sensuality. The foreground shows her full figure prominently centered left, with the green fence and lawn in the midground, blurred trees and distant sports facilities in the background. Soft, even natural daylight creates a bright, fresh atmosphere. Color palette of white, green, and red is harmonious and vibrant. The image has a realistic, amateur snapshot quality with rich detail and texture; her expression is natural and inviting, the environment authentic, as if capturing a carefree sports moment. Medium focal length at eye level, capturing full posture and layered surroundings, with background blur just enough to keep her as the focal point. The scene feels youthful, alive, and healthy.",
