        {
          "id": "krea2-19570500750f5412e2acae1c",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣酒店媚态站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an elegant vintage interior, wearing a sheer black-and-white houndstooth knit dress with a deep V-neckline exposing her bare cleavage, the white Peter Pan collar and black short-sleeve underlayer removed. Her long hair falls naturally with straight bangs, adorned with small hair accessories. She wears black long gloves, one arm crossed over her chest, the other hand lifting the hem of the dress to reveal her thigh in black over-knee stockings, matched with thick-soled black patent leather loafers. She stares directly at the camera with a confident, serene expression. In the background, a gold-framed decorative mirror reflects her side silhouette, a dark brown carved wooden sideboard with a marble top and metal handles, and a tall gold floor lamp with a cream pleated fabric shade emitting warm light. Semi-transparent beige curtains soften the natural light, bathing the scene in uniform warm tones. The walls are pale pink, the floor covered with a light-colored carpet. The composition is a standard vertical portrait, with the figure centered slightly right, surrounded by rich but balanced environmental details. The lighting is soft, with delicate shadows, evoking a quiet, sensual, and artistic atmosphere, as if captured in a private residence or high-end hotel room, blending realistic everyday moments with studio-quality lighting.",
