          "id": "krea2-930034ad9056f890b4d2a05d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a park before the Eiffel Tower in Paris, her off-white floral-print dress clinging to her curves, with a plunging neckline and a loose satin bow at the chest that hints at easy removal. Her long, wavy hair cascades in soft, sunlit strands, one hand idly brushing a lock from her cheek while the other lets a light-blue handbag hang loosely at her side. She turns her body slightly, her lips parted in a sultry half-smile, eyes half-lidded and dreamy. The dress lifts gently with a breeze, revealing a hint of bare thigh. In front, dense green pines frame the scene, while bare winter branches add texture. Warm golden sunlight streams from the upper right, highlighting the soft curves of her face and body, casting delicate shadows on her skin. The Eiffel Tower rises in the background, its metal catching the light. Shot from a low angle with an 85mm f/1.8 lens, shallow depth of field blurs the background into a creamy bokeh, while her face and figure remain sharp and inviting. The atmosphere is warm, nostalgic, and effortlessly seductive—a perfect, stolen moment of Parisian romance with an adult edge.",
