          "alias": "单女露胸连衣裙花园媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges sensually on an ornate floral-patterned sofa, topless, her dark hair styled in a loose side braid cascading over one shoulder. She wears only a pair of tiny silver earrings and a teasing smile, her soft curves illuminated by warm afternoon light. One hand lightly touches her neck, the other rests on her bare thigh, legs crossed in glossy gold high-heeled sandals studded with rhinestones. Beside her, a gold quilted bag gleams on the seat cushion. The room is bright and airy, with arched glass doors opening to a lush garden, soft ivory curtains drifting in the breeze. The classic sofa features tropical blooms in purple, pink, and green, with gold-piped trim and button detailing. A black wrought-iron staircase railing frames the background, and a circular wooden chair with pale blue upholstery sits in the distance. The carpet beneath her feet is intricately patterned in brown and ivory. Soft, even light from the left casts gentle shadows across her skin and the lace remnants of her folded dress, creating an intimate, upscale atmosphere. The composition centers her slightly right, body forming an elegant S-curve, eyes downcast in serene contentment.",
