        {
          "id": "krea2-8db018fa15e7da978199babb",
          "alias": "单女半褪红挂脖海滩戏谑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a weathered wooden bench at a seaside restaurant, her vibrant red gingham halter dress slipping off one shoulder, revealing the curve of her bare breast and the delicate bow strap. The loose white knit cardigan hangs open, catching a soft breeze, leaving her toned midriff and the torn knees of her denim cutoffs exposed, the ripped fabric teasing hints of pale thigh. Her brown hair is swept into a high ponytail, a single white blossom tucked behind her ear, as she turns her body slightly, one hand trailing along her jawline, her gaze drifting left with a dreamy, contemplative expression. Minimal makeup, natural pink lips, silver drop earrings, a simple chain necklace at her collarbone. Behind her, the ocean stretches into a hazy blue horizon, a distant bridge arcing over the water. In the foreground, a white wooden railing holds black block letters spelling \"OKINAWA,\" with a faint green LED glow beneath. A yellow weathered stool and a red-and-green bench show peeling paint and salt wear. Sunlight spills from the upper right, casting soft shadows across her skin, highlighting the sheen of sweat on her shoulder and the subtle curve of her hip. The frame is medium shot, the woman occupying the right two-thirds, her line of sight drawing the viewer into the leftward scene. The palette is bold red, white, blue, saturated but natural, with a light grain and authentic lens flare, evoking a candid summer holiday snapshot. In the distance, parked cars and tropical foliage ground the setting; above, twisted black spiral ornaments dangle from an unseen structure, adding a playful, festive note. The mood is warm, romantic, and deeply sensual, capturing a stolen moment of oceanside reverie.",
