          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the stone steps of the Seine in Paris, her body slightly turned sideways as she raises her right hand in a gentle wave. She wears a beige vertical-striped long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest, the collar tied with a matching silk ribbon bow. Her light blue high-waisted jeans are cuffed, showing floral-print shoes. Her black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, silver stud earrings catching the light. A pale blue satin handbag rests beside her. In the background, the Eiffel Tower rises in warm gray-brown tones, its structure crisp under the sun. The early spring trees on the far bank are bare, the Seine glistening with soft light. Low-angle shot, the woman positioned center-right, the tower occupying the upper left and background. Foreground rough stone railings framing her body, middle ground her figure, handbag, and riverbank, background the river, city buildings, and tower. Light from upper right, bright but diffused, creating soft chiaroscuro. Her face and clothing are evenly lit, shadows delicate, evoking a warm, quiet afternoon. Color palette beige, light blue, gray-brown, cohesive and elegant with a lived-in, fashion-edge feel. Simulated pro camera with large-aperture prime lens, shallow depth of field, smooth bokeh, retaining fine detail. Slight film grain, candid snapshot aesthetic, as if captured by a traveler’s compact camera, full of narrative warmth and emotion.",
