        {
          "id": "krea2-f04f32be61051e40aa35e280",
          "alias": "单女全裸白连体衣花园媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an outdoor garden, her body barely concealed by a sheer white lace romper that leaves little to the imagination—the high-neck top is transparent, revealing her nipples through the delicate fabric, adorned with ruffled trim and three-dimensional floral appliqués that draw the eye to her full breasts. The semi-transparent lace sleeves billow softly around her arms. Her dark hair is swept into a side braid, trailing down one shoulder, a tiny sparkling headpiece catching the dim light. She tilts her head downward, right hand lightly touching her forehead, fingers grazing her skin, her gaze soft and contemplative as she looks into the lens. Her makeup is subtle—shimmering eyeshadow, pale lips—her skin flawless and luminous. In her left hand she holds a gold-chain mini bag, its metallic sheen contrasting with her near-nude form. Foreground: lush broad-leaved greenery and clusters of hydrangeas in white, pale lavender, and light green, petals full and layered. Midground: her body occupies the right-center of the frame, a classic rule-of-thirds composition. Background: the clean beige wall of a modern building, a large glass sliding door reflecting cloudy sky, dark gray frame, a vintage sconce on the right wall, unlit but elegant. The light is soft, overcast, diffused, no harsh shadows, creating a tranquil, intimate atmosphere. Color palette: white, beige, pale green, gray-blue, harmonious. Visual flow from foreground flowers up along her curved silhouette to her face, lingering on her eyes and the hand at her forehead. Subtle chiaroscuro on the lace folds accentuates the texture of the fabric and her skin beneath. The background is gently blurred, making her the focal point. The overall feel is high-fashion editorial photography infused with a quiet, everyday sensuality—as if captured on a muted afternoon with a medium telephoto lens, rich in detail, realistic yet artistic, still and elegant.",
