          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white wooden bench in a lush garden, her long pink gradient hair in two braids resting on her shoulders, skin fair and features delicate. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, nipples peeking through the dappled sunlight, a gentle smile on her face as she gazes directly at the lens. Her left hand is raised high, palm open, as if playing with the light, adorned with layered bracelets and rings. She wears only a light checkered mini skirt, fabric airy with natural folds, a matching belt cinched at her slender waist, and white lace fishnet stockings with bow details at the cuffs, plus brown thick-soled sandals. Her legs are long and crossed, revealing a perfect curve. In the background, dense tropical plants – large monstera leaves, blooming white daisies, pink flowers, pale yellow hydrangeas – create a vibrant natural setting. Soft sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled highlights across her face and bare chest, illuminating her skin’s glow. The mid-shot composition centers her relaxed pose, body slightly turned, with low flowers and grass in the foreground adding depth. The overall mood is warm, romantic, and summery, with a green-dominant palette accented by pinks, white, and browns. The image is sharp, rich in detail – every leaf vein, petal edge, fabric wrinkle, and skin sheen visible – evoking a high-end commercial yet candid feel, like a spontaneous moment captured on a quiet afternoon, exuding fresh, free, and intimate sensuality.",
