        {
          "id": "krea2-c11c962ec7f91e2e13a5132e",
          "alias": "单女黑泳装浴室媚态站立举手",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a luxurious bathroom, wearing a tight black one-piece swimsuit with white piping along the edges and shoulder straps, a white lace-up detail across her chest accentuating her cleavage and toned midriff. Her black hair is swept up into a high messy bun, a delicate white flower pinned above her ear. She stands in a slight contrapposto, one arm raised gracefully overhead, the other hand resting casually on the edge of a pristine white freestanding bathtub. She wears strappy black stiletto heels with sparkling rhinestones. Her gaze locks directly into the camera, lips parted in a playful, seductive pout, eyes bright and inviting. The scene is an elegant bathroom: pale green walls with dark green subway tile wainscoting and geometric trim, a framed black-and-white landscape photograph on one side, glossy black marble wall panels on the other reflecting warm light. Overhead, recessed lighting casts soft shadows across her skin, highlighting every curve of her body through the wet-look fabric of the swimsuit, water droplets glistening on her shoulders and thighs. The composition is mid-shot, S-curve silhouette, with a cinematic depth of field that focuses on her face and décolletage, while the bathtub and décor frame the intimate, inviting atmosphere.",
