          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with soft pink hair cascading over her shoulders, wearing a partially unbuttoned white high-collar shirt revealing cleavage, a black tight mini skirt, black long gloves, and shoulder armor accents. She carries a black tactical backpack with intricate mechanical parts and teal tassels over her left shoulder, a visible \"HSO-56\" ID tag pinned to her unbuttoned shirtfront. She holds a blue folder in both hands, posing with a subtle head tilt, her narrow-framed glasses framing a calm, focused gaze. Lips slightly parted, expression composed and professional with a hint of sensual confidence. She stands at a street corner beside a Japanese vending machine with bright glass display and cold white light. To the right, a colorful poster with ice cream and drinks in Japanese. Medium shot, low angle, body slightly tilted right, natural leading lines. Lighting from left vending machine creates strong chiaroscuro, illuminating her face and clothing details, casting soft shadows, emphasizing her curves. Color palette cool whites, grays, blacks with pink hair and poster accents. Photo-realistic texture, slight film grain, natural bokeh, foreground sharp with blurred background depth. A futuristic-meets-everyday aesthetic, cold and intimate.",
