        {
          "id": "krea2-8eaf1eb0b5fde63bb7e4401f",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裤舞台媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits at center stage on angular gray steps, completely topless, her black off-shoulder top discarded beside her, revealing bare breasts with hard nipples. She wears high-waist black shorts and knee-high boots, one shoulder strap slipping down, her long hair cascading over her shoulders with soft light highlights. Her makeup is flawless, red lips parted, eyes locked on the camera with a confident, lazy stare. A small ear mic hints at a live performance. One hand rests on her knee, the other casually on the step edge, her pose elegant yet charged with tension. Behind her, a massive LED dot-matrix screen glows deep blue, dense pinpoints of light forming a futuristic texture with subtle reflections. Wispy smoke drifts in the foreground, adding depth and mystery. The composition is centered, her body slightly turned, drawing the eye from her face down her long bare legs, emphasizing the curves. Overhead and front spotlights create stark contrast, harsh light on her skin with soft shadow transitions, highlighting every contour. The screen reflects faint glints. The palette is black, gray, blue with touches of gold and red—cool and striking. The mood blends pop concert energy with high-fashion sensuality, a cinematic stage moment full of visual impact and raw allure.",
