        {
          "id": "krea2-77dcae930d64a8188054c118",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits centered on a vintage brown leather sofa, her light blonde shoulder-length hair neatly framing her face with a straight fringe. Her gaze is calm and focused, with soft facial contours and delicate natural makeup—pale pink lips, fair skin, a refined yet cool elegance. She wears a fitted dark blue denim dress, unbuttoned halfway to reveal her bare chest and perky breasts, the fabric open and undone. Long sleeves, breast pockets, and silver buttons remain, with visible denim texture and creases. The dress ends above her thighs, showcasing long smooth legs. She crosses one leg, wearing black high leather boots with a glossy finish and thick heels, one foot placed on the floor, the other bent. Her right hand rests on the sofa arm, her left hand on her bare thigh, her posture relaxed but inviting. The background is an industrial interior—left wall of red brick partly whitewashed, right wall of rough white brick with a blackboard reading blurry \"TEA COFFEE\" in chalk. The sofa has a Union Jack pillow, worn edges, deep brown leather with scuffs and wrinkles, Chesterfield-style with button tufting and brass nails. Dark wood floors show grain and faint reflections. The composition is a medium shot centered on her, body slightly turned, head facing the camera. Soft natural light from a left window creates warm, even illumination with gentle shadows. Tones of brown, deep blue, and cream dominate, with a nostalgic film-grain feel. The overall mood is intimate, quiet, and urban chic, as if a candid yet carefully styled moment.",
