          "prompt": "A young woman in sheer, loose-fitting traditional robes, her black hair woven into a thick braid adorned with silver leaf ornaments and a single red bead, strands falling softly around her face. She lowers her head, gaze cast down with a gentle, melancholic expression, lips slightly parted and glistening with a subtle red sheen. Her porcelain skin is luminous, with delicate shadows enhancing her soft, refined features. She wears an open, deep purple outer robe of lustrous silk with gold phoenix and cloud embroidery, slipping off one shoulder to reveal her bare breast and the smooth curve of her collarbone. The inner garment is a thin, translucent gold fabric, clinging to her form. The background is blurred into soft bokeh of circular lights and faint white stair-like structures, creating a dreamy, cool-toned atmosphere with blue-violet hues contrasted by warm highlights on her skin and clothing. The composition is a close-up, her head tilted slightly left, with soft, dramatic lighting from the upper right casting delicate shadows across her face and body. The overall effect is a cinematic, high-fashion portrait blending classical Eastern aesthetics with a sensual, modern intimacy, evoking a quiet, seductive melancholy.",
