          "alias": "单女内衣微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a vintage wooden cabinet, her long black hair with blunt bangs framing her face, smiling softly and gazing warmly at the camera. She wears a white high-neck knitted top unbuttoned to expose her full breasts and a delicate lace bra, paired with black leather shorts, thigh-high boots, and an open black leather jacket. Her posture is relaxed and confident—one hand resting lightly on the cabinet edge, the other hanging naturally, legs slightly crossed to emphasize her long lines. Behind her, a dark wall is covered with yellowed old papers and sheet music, creating a nostalgic atmosphere. Wooden bookshelves line the walls, filled with hardcover books, a vintage film camera, a small radio, and decorative trinkets. A red patterned carpet with intricate classical Eastern designs covers the floor. The lighting is soft and warm, coming from the left, casting natural shadows and highlighting the texture of her skin and clothing. The composition is centered, with the woman slightly left of center, the cabinet and carpet in the foreground, and the bookshelves and wall in the background, creating depth. The color palette is dominated by brown, black, cream, and red, evoking a retro film-photography feel. The image simulates an everyday amateur device capture, with subtle grain and natural noise, focusing sharply on the woman while slightly blurring the background. The scene conveys a quiet, intimate afternoon in a study, blending artistry and life.",
