          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on the green velvet seat of a vintage tram, her unbuttoned dark gray wool coat hanging open to reveal pale skin and soft curves. She wears only the coat and a slightly rumpled plaid shirt beneath, the collar undone; her low ponytail and straight bangs frame a gentle smile, eyes clear and inviting as she looks into the lens. Small pearl earrings catch the sunlight. The tram interior features wooden window frames and deep green fabric, a nostalgic atmosphere. Outside, bright blue sky and electric wires cross, with another yellow-green tram visible in the distance, its Japanese ads legible. The window frame acts as a natural picture frame, leading the eye to her bare chest and relaxed pose. Soft side light from the right illuminates half her face and the folds of her coat, casting subtle shadows on the seat. Warm winter afternoon tones of green, gray, and blue mix with the creamy warmth of her skin. Film-grain texture, shallow depth of field, focus on her face and bare torso, background gently blurred. A quiet, intimate moment on a city tram, blending everyday life with subtle eroticism.",
