          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate Rococo-inspired vintage dress, her bodice unlaced and falling open to reveal her bare breasts, her golden curls voluminous and tousled beneath a wide-brimmed straw hat trimmed with layered white lace and delicate pink flowers. She wears a lustrous pearl necklace that rests against her bare skin, her head slightly tilted, lips parted in a soft, dreaming smile, her clear eyes gazing off to the right. The dress is off-white silk with pink floral embroidery and ruffled edges at collar and cuffs; a pink satin ribbon loosely tied at her waist. The skirt is full, the hem embroidered. Background is a deep green bamboo grove with leaves swaying faintly. Close-up shot, subject center-left, looking rightward. Warm, soft side light from upper right illuminates her face, hair, and the curves of her exposed chest, casting gentle shadows to the left. The overall palette is white, pink, gold, and green, creating a sweet, pure, dreamy yet sensual mood. The image feels like a forgotten fairy-tale moment in an afternoon garden, captured with a mix of studio perfection and candid realism.",
