        {
          "id": "krea2-b36e7e5508c37bed2e4f19b3",
          "alias": "单女黑外套媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with silver-white hair and blunt bangs, bright almond eyes, delicate makeup, pale skin, and light lips, her expression cool and alluring. She wears a black high-neck leather jacket with fine texture and shine, intricate shoulder details, and a blue flower brooch on her chest. The jacket is open, revealing a white lace-trimmed blouse partly unbuttoned, showing a hint of cleavage and a black lace bra. Beneath, a short pleated skirt with traditional embroidery rides up her thighs, a dark belt cinching her waist. Black stockings with a subtle garter line and black stilettos elongate her legs. She stands gracefully at center, one hand lifting to her cheek, fingers curled, the other resting on her hip, pushing her jacket open further. The pose creates an elegant S-curve, her body slightly tilted, exuding a cold, sensual mystery. Foreground shows her from waist to feet on worn gray concrete. Background: a metal sliding door with “PUSH” in silver frame, left side white partition wall, dark gray industrial ceiling and walls. Low-angle shot looking up, emphasizing her height and curves. Lighting is cool-toned, strong right-top key light casting sharp shadows, illuminating her right side and leaving the left in shadow, highlighting her silhouette and the glossy leather. The metal door reflects soft halos, and a faint reflection of her legs appears on the floor. Scene feels dramatic, film-like, with subtle amateur realism. Shot simulated on Canon EOS R5 with 85mm f/1.2 lens, shallow depth of field focused on her face, realistic colors, saturated but clean, no distractions. Overall mood: cold, elegant, and intensely sensual, blending futuristic and classical aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
