          "alias": "单女棕外套广场媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, wearing a deep brown high-neck zip-up jacket with a soft matte finish, slightly oversized yet tailored—partially unzipped to reveal a glimpse of cleavage and the smooth curve of her collarbone. The jacket's cuffs and hem are subtly cinched. She pairs it with a black high-slit long skirt that drapes elegantly, the slit rising high on one side to expose a long, toned thigh. The skirt has a slight sheen and fluid weight. On her feet are black square-toe stiletto heels that elongate her legs. Her right hand rests casually in her jacket pocket; her left hand loosely holds a black leather classic tote bag with a rounded silhouette and fine stitching. Her long, jet-black hair falls naturally with soft waves, bangs neatly covering her forehead. Her features are sculpted, makeup subtle with a natural lip, skin luminous. She gazes directly at the camera with a calm, focused, yet subtly seductive expression. Soft, even light from the front left highlights her silhouette and the texture of her clothes. The background is a light gray tiled wall with neat grout lines and a dark gray metal baseboard adding an industrial touch. On the right hangs a framed Chinese landscape painting—layered mountains, misty clouds, in muted grays, browns, and pale yellow, set in a deep red wooden frame. To the left, a white doorframe edge and a black power socket near the baseboard add realism. The floor is covered with a gray woven carpet with visible texture. The overall setup is minimalist, modern, with a black-white-gray palette accented by brown and red. The composition centers her slightly right, with a subtle turn creating dynamic balance. Her gaze leads down her body to the long legs and heels, then to the handbag, and finally to the painting, forming a visual loop. The atmosphere is quiet, sophisticated, with a high-end commercial photo quality—rich details, moderate saturation, gentle contrast, blending everyday elegance with artistic sensuality.",
