          "alias": "单女全裸红连衣裙舞台媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young adult female figure skater stands center stage on the ice, wearing a striking red low-cut sleeveless competition dress with a deep V-neckline that plunges to her navel, the tight fabric covered in dense shimmering silver rhinestones that glitter under the lights. The skirt is ultra-short and layered with ruffled tiers, barely covering her hips, revealing the top of her white lace panties. She wears white skates with nude fishnet stockings visible at the ankle. Her right hand is raised high in a red glove, fingers spread in a seductive wave to the audience. Her face glows with a confident, sensual smile, eyes gleaming with pride and desire. Her black hair is loosely tied with a red ribbon, a few strands falling naturally. Her body leans forward slightly, left leg straight for support, right leg bent and slightly extended back, showcasing her toned thighs and the curve of her ass. The background is a blurred indoor ice rink with dark spectator seats, a large blue billboard reading \"IT\" in white letters partially visible. The ice reflects soft warm yellow lights, scattered with ice shavings and marks. The composition centers on her, shot from a low angle, medium distance, emphasizing her tall, provocative silhouette. The red dress contrasts vividly against the cool blue of the rink, creating a hot, celebratory yet sultry atmosphere. Lighting comes from above and front, evenly illuminating her face and costume details, casting a soft reflection on the ice. The moment captures the athlete's triumphant finish, but with an explicit, alluring twist—her costume is deliberately revealing, her pose slightly more provocative, the overall image resembling a candid photo taken by an amateur camera with slight grain and motion blur, delivering a warm, intimate, and raw documentary aesthetic that evokes applause and cheers from the unseen audience.",
