          "prompt": "A young woman with soft pink hair threaded with tiny white string bow ties sits on a metal-frame chair at an outdoor café. Her delicate, sculpted features catch the natural light; her clear, slightly lazy eyes gaze toward the lens, lips parted in a sweetly inviting expression. She wears a light blue denim jumpsuit unbuttoned to her waist, the sides detailed with zippers and the cuffs tied with brown leather bows, leaving her firm bare breasts fully exposed, nipples visible against the cool air. Her arms cross and rest on her knees, long fingers tipped with pale pink nail polish, a red woven bracelet encircling one wrist. Her body leans forward, right leg bent with foot lifted, left leg dangling relaxed. The foreground shows a brown brick floor worn with age, moss in the cracks. On a round dark gray table sits a bouquet of wildflowers—yellow, white, orange, red daisies and baby's breath wrapped in brown paper—alongside a green ceramic teacup and saucer (white interior, deep green exterior). Behind her, a dense wall of greenery and pink-white blooms (hydrangeas, roses, lavender) blurs into a dreamy bokeh. The low-angle composition places her on the right-center, table and flowers on the left, with focus sharp on her face and torso, fading softly into the garden backdrop. Natural daylight from the upper left casts gentle highlights across her skin, arms, and legs, with subtle shadows on the ground and furniture. The warm spring palette unifies pink, green, brown, denim blue, and ceramic green. A slightly grainy, vintage film look enhances the texture, evoking a relaxed, sensual, and romantic lifestyle.",
