          "alias": "单女露胸白外套公寓媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with deep brown medium-long hair, bangs falling naturally, fair delicate skin, sharp and refined features, and clear bright eyes leans sideways against a retro vending machine. Her lips are slightly parted as she sensually licks an orange-yellow lollipop, her right hand holding the stick with long slender fingers, nails neatly trimmed and painted light pink. She wears white in-ear headphones with cords hanging down. Her top is a creamy white short athletic jacket with a high collar and zipper, black stripe trim on the sleeves, and a small brand logo on the chest. The jacket is unzipped open, revealing her bare breasts—nipples hard and exposed. Her flat stomach shows a smooth abdominal line. She wears loose pink sweatpants slung low on her hips, casual and lazy. Her posture is relaxed, body tilted slightly, head turned a bit to one side, eyes gazing toward the camera. The overall mood is easy and carefree, with a sensual, intimate vibe. The foreground is a sharp close-up of the character, occupying most of the frame in a mid-shot composition, placed slightly to the right for visual weight. The background is a blurred indoor scene with a blue-and-white vending machine showing “3 Reg” and a price tag “99”, plus part of an “O-Rena” logo. Soft warm lighting comes from the upper left, illuminating her face and body, creating natural shadow transitions and rich light-and-shadow layers with moderate contrast, highlighting her contours and fabric texture. The overall image feels like a real, everyday life scene—a spontaneous moment at a convenience store or small shop—with strong documentary realism and intimacy. The color palette is warm yellow and light pink, contrasting with cool blue background elements, enhancing visual impact. Details are rich: fabric wrinkles, hair shine, skin texture, candy surface reflections. The composition uses depth between foreground figure and background objects to create perspective. Visual lines flow from her eyes and actions naturally to background elements. The entire image exudes youthful vitality and relaxed pleasure, like a quiet frame from an independent film capturing beauty in an ordinary moment. The photographic style mimics amateur camera or phone realness, with slight noise and natural color deviation, enhancing authenticity. Standard focal length simulates everyday shooting perspective, with mild edge distortion typical of consumer devices. The atmosphere is warm, comfortable, slightly nostalgic—evoking childhood after-school snack memories or a late-night street encounter. Emotional expression is delicate, capturing her subtle pleasure and satisfaction. The image not only displays her appearance but conveys a treasured enjoyment of simple happiness.",
