          "id": "krea2-c98b2d53c9ee2f51709cac49",
          "alias": "单女露胸沙发困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair and blue eyes sits on a pink plush sofa, wearing a light yellow plaid pajama set with cute Hello Kitty prints and pink bow trim, but the top is unbuttoned all the way down, falling open to reveal her bare breasts. She hugs her knees with both arms, the fabric draping loosely aside, while her gaze is direct and languid, with a hint of sleepy arousal. A simple silver ring sits on her left ring finger, nails painted soft pink. Her right hand rests lightly over her left, body leaning slightly forward in a comfortable, intimate pose. The sofa is soft pink vertical-striped velvet, fluffy and warm; a matching round plush cushion sits to her left. The background is a beige wall, with a wooden drawer cabinet on the right holding a brown tissue box, a copper cylinder container, several pill bottles, a white toilet paper roll, and small clutter. Next to the cabinet, a black cat curls on the floor, ears perked, tail tucked. Lighting is soft and bright, from natural indoor light or warm white lamps, creating a cozy, homely atmosphere. Composition is center-focused, with the subject slightly left of center, a slight downward angle giving an intimate, private feel. Foreground captures details of her body and the sofa; midground shows her torso and furniture; background reveals the wall and cabinet. Layers are clear, visual flow from her face to background objects. Shadows are gentle, no strong contrast. Color palette is pink, beige, light brown, balanced by black hair and the cat. The image feels like a real, warm moment of everyday life, as if shot with an old Canon 5D Mark II, with slight film grain and natural color fading. Focal length around 85mm, aperture f/2.8, shutter speed 1/125s, ISO 400—capturing a quiet afternoon when sunlight filters through curtains. The scene is filled with life and the tender allure of a young woman, carrying strong documentary style and emotional resonance.",
