          "prompt": "A young female model stands in a three-quarter side view, her long straight golden hair cascading over her shoulders with neat bangs across her forehead, the strands gleaming with a cool silver-white sheen under subtle edge lighting against a pure black background. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, nipples erect, skin pale and smooth with a healthy glow. A layered metal chain necklace of varying sizes and textures wraps around her neck, adding a punk-meets-fashion edge. Her right hand rests lightly on her hip, fingers long with white nail polish, wrist adorned with a thin chain bracelet; her left hand hangs naturally at her side. She wears high-waist blue jeans, tight-fitting with visible denim texture and detailed stitching, cinched with a wide black leather belt featuring multiple round metal studs and a square buckle with brushed finish. Her makeup is precise: deep, defined eye makeup with thick curled lashes, natural pink lips. Her gaze is intense and cool, directly at the camera, head slightly tilted, expression confident and powerful. The composition centers her slightly right, dramatic front-left lighting creating soft shadows on the right side of her body, with rim lights outlining her hair and shoulders, enhancing depth. The scene is minimalist with a pure black background, focusing all attention on her, resulting in a striking, modern, high-fashion portrait with strong visual impact—color palette dominated by black, white, gold, denim blue, and metallic gray.",
