          "prompt": "A young woman stands alone on a rain-slicked city street at night, centered slightly left in frame. She wears an open deep-navy velvet trench coat with a glossy sheen, the double-breasted design hanging loose to reveal her bare chest underneath — her full, perky breasts exposed, nipples pebbled from the cool air. A white silk camisole is pushed down around her waist, leaving her torso naked. Her long, silky black hair falls over her shoulders, stirred by a gentle breeze. A dark-blue baseball cap sits low on her head, embroidered with a tiny polo logo. She smiles softly at the camera, eyes warm and confident, lips slightly parted. Her right hand holds the strap of a brown leather handbag with delicate stitching and gleaming gold hardware. Around her neck hangs a multi-layered pearl necklace with tiny charms that sway with her breath. Gold hoop earrings catch the streetlight. Behind her: a blurred city nightscape with warm yellow windows in distant buildings, trees with translucent green leaves, and moving cars leaving red and white light trails on the wet asphalt. The sky is deep ink-blue, with street lamps casting soft golden light across the scene, creating gentle shadows on her skin and the coat's shiny surface. The composition is subtly off-center, with the woman as the clear focal point, foreground sharp and intimate, midground showing blurred traffic and pedestrians, background fading into soft-focus architecture. Lighting comes from the side — warm yellow street lamps and cool blue ambient fill — creating strong chiaroscuro on her face and body, highlighting the curve of her breasts and the glossy texture of the coat. The mood is cinematic, evocative, like a still from an arthouse film: quiet, sensual, real. Slight grain and motion blur add a candid, almost amateur-photography feel, emphasizing the lived-in elegance of a nocturnal wanderer.",
