          "prompt": "Close-up of a young athletic woman crouching on an indoor badminton court, ready to strike. She wears a tight, sweat-soaked off-white cropped T-shirt that clings to her curves, taut nipples clearly visible through the thin fabric, and a dark blue sports short shorts that ride up her toned thighs, exposing the swell of her ass. Her black hair in a low ponytail, side profile, intense eyes focused, lips slightly parted. She grips a blue badminton racket with firm hands, a thin bracelet on her wrist. Her body leans forward, knees deeply bent, powerful leg muscles tensed. The foreground captures her upper body and the racket action. The blue court floor with white lines. In the background, two blurred male players in light and white T-shirts. Ceiling lights cast a soft glow, with natural light from blinds on the left wall, reflections on the floor. A banner with an inspirational slogan on the far wall. The composition uses diagonal lines from her face to the racket. Color palette blue and white with off-white and dark blue accents. The scene has a candid, snapshot feel, capturing a moment of intense training with raw, sensual athletic energy.",
