          "prompt": "A woman in an exquisite blue ancient-style gown sits on a wooden bench, her elaborate silver headdress adorned with sapphires and pearls, cascading tassels trembling in faint light, a small floral ornament on her forehead. Her eyes are downcast, expression serene yet tinged with melancholy, red lips slightly pursed as if lost in deep thought. She wears a sky-blue silk robe with delicate cloud and dragon-phoenix embroidery, the collar and cuffs trimmed with soft white fur, a thick fur collar draping over her bare shoulders, her gown slipping open to reveal her bare chest and nipples, the fabric parted to expose her breasts. Layers of jade pendants and pearl necklaces hang around her neck, matching long earrings, the overall look elegant and noble with classical charm. Her hands rest folded on her knees, posture dignified. The background is a quiet courtyard night scene, bamboo curtains hanging under wooden eaves, warm lantern light glimpsed in the distance creating layered shadows. Thin snow covers the ground, reflecting a cool blue tone, surrounding trees and architecture blurred into soft bokeh. Composition is symmetrical, centered on her figure, focus naturally drawn to her face and clothing details. Foreground shows crisp robe and fur collar, midground the subject, background gradually blurring with shallow depth of field to emphasize her. Light comes from behind-right, forming soft rim lighting that gives a subtle glow to her edges, while her face is evenly lit, skin texture delicate. Overall color is cool blue accented by warm yellow lamplight, creating a serene, cool, slightly mysterious atmosphere. The scene evokes poetic Eastern aesthetics, like a beauty from a classical painting lost in thought on a cold night, with a faint air of melancholy and elegance. Light and shadow interplay as if time freezes, the whole composition cinematic and narrative, high resolution, 4K quality, ultra-fine textures, realistic material rendering, slight fil