          "id": "krea2-b9d4208556a517f6eb75495f",
          "alias": "单女半褪红浴袍竹林媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female assassin in traditional Chinese wuxia attire, her wide-brimmed black bamboo hat adorned with intricate woven rope trim and metal rivets, the edge casting a shadow over her veiled face—only her high-bound bun and sharp, focused eyes visible, cold and resolute. Her right hand grips an ancient long sword, the narrow blade gleaming with a blue-gray metallic sheen, angled upward, the hilt wrapped in dark cloth with red tassels, the tip nearly touching the foreground for a strong leading line. She wears a red-and-black cross-collar robe, the outer layer dark brocade, the inner lining black silk, but the robe is unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, exposing her bare chest—full, firm breasts with erect nipples, her pale skin contrasting with the dark fabric. A wide black leather belt with metal buckle and decorative loops cinches her waist; a short dagger is tucked at her back. Her body leans forward in a dynamic pose, right arm extended, left hand resting at her side, creating a balanced tension. The background is a traditional Japanese or Chinese interior with wooden lattice window frames, square panes casting cold blue light from outside, creating a backlit silhouette effect with soft halos around her form. The scene is bathed in blue-green cool tones, with sharp highlights and shadows on her face, blade, and exposed skin, enhancing three-dimensionality. Close-up composition emphasizes her expression and the action, using the blade as a diagonal leading line from lower left to upper right, guiding the eye to her piercing gaze. Foreground: crisp sword and hand; midground: her body; background: blurred window grid for depth. The style blends Eastern martial arts aesthetics with cinematic quality, capturing a moment of impending violent confrontation. The image is detailed, with moderate saturation but strong cold-warm contrast, realistic yet artistic, like a professional studio shot of a wuxia film still, with subtle film grain and natural noise, using a medium focal length and shallow depth of field to focus on the subject. The atmosphere is still and tense, filled with danger and fate, her bare torso adding a raw, sensual edge to the deadly elegance.",
