        {
          "id": "krea2-96bfe7bd0a21753a7ff48179",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑衬衫海报微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a fantastical poker-card-themed space, wearing a sleek black-and-white outfit: a white lace-trimmed blouse with a black sleeveless corset-style vest adorned with sparkling details and a bow, matched with a short black skirt and a metal-buckled belt, plus chunky black combat boots with studs and zippers—merging school-girl elegance with gothic edge. Her hair is in a neat low bun with tiny accessories, makeup bold with smoky eyes and full lips, a confident smile as she stares into the camera. Her right hand makes a victory sign, left hand hangs naturally, both wrists covered in white lace gloves—though the blouse is unbuttoned and pulled aside, revealing her bare breasts, nipples visible through the sheerness. The background is a surreal 3D structure of giant playing cards (Ace of Hearts, Jack of Spades, King of Diamonds) at various angles; the floor is a black-and-white checkerboard pattern. In the left foreground, a massive card pillar reads \"底牌 EP02\". Right top has \"浙江卫视\" and \"奔跑吧 KEEP RUNNING\" logos; bottom right has \"@angelababy\" watermark. Soft, warm pink-violet light from the upper left casts gentle shadows and rim lighting on her body and the cards, with subtle glow on card edges. Foreground cards are slightly blurred for depth of field, focusing the eye on her centered, slightly turned pose. The overall mood is mysterious, dreamlike, glamorous, and playful—like a high-end commercial poster with a natural, candid quality. High saturation but natural, rich textures on her clothing, skin, and the cards. The scene feels cinematic, inviting one to imagine her erotic adventures in this poker world, with dramatic yet romantic lighting that suggests youthful passion and energy.",
