        {
          "id": "krea2-5e8bfe6b4b9620cac1b89306",
          "alias": "单女湿身米背心健身房媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A toned, athletic woman stands sideways in a dimly lit gym, her long black hair pulled into a high ponytail that cascades down her back. She wears a tight, sweat-drenched khaki workout outfit: a sleeveless top with delicate crisscross straps across her back, and matching high-cut shorts with \"GYM\" printed on the waistband, the fabric clinging to every curve and muscle. Her left wrist has a red-and-black wristband; she holds a black dumbbell plate in her hand. She leans slightly forward, head bowed, eyes fixed on the floor, her expression a mix of focused calm and self-examination, a moment of rest between intense sets. A barbell and weight plates lie in the foreground, metal gleaming. The background reveals rows of squat racks and cable machines, their silver frames reflecting harsh fluorescent light from above, casting sharp shadows that define her shoulder blades, glutes, and the lines of her thighs. A blue towel hangs on a machine in the distance. The composition is mid-shot, her body placed slightly right of center, the left side open to the environment. The cool, industrial lighting highlights the sheen of sweat on her skin, emphasizing her muscular back and the curve of her hips. The background is softly blurred, giving a realistic, slightly grainy film-like quality, as if captured by an amateur camera during an actual gym session—raw, authentic, and deeply sensual. The overall vibe is one of disciplined beauty, health, and restrained eroticism.",
