        {
          "id": "krea2-07c016ac7fc9c7968c5ada03",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑西装办公室媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a dark wood conference table in a modern meeting room, her black suit jacket open, white shirt removed completely, revealing her bare chest with firm nipples visible. She wears a lanyard with a name badge and a wireless earpiece, her expression focused and calm, eyes directed slightly to the right as if listening intently. Her hands are clasped together on the tabletop, posture poised and professional despite her nudity. In the foreground, a white tablet on a simple stand faces her, alongside a closed black notebook with a smooth cover. Several glass water bottles sit beyond, one partially blurred at the edge of the frame for depth. In the right background, a blurred female colleague in similar attire is barely visible, enhancing the workplace realism. The mid-shot centers the protagonist on the left third, her body slightly turned, head facing the camera but gaze distant. The composition uses the rule of thirds and diagonal lines for dynamic balance. Warm-toned vertical wood-paneled walls behind, with soft mixed lighting from above and side, casting delicate highlights on her forehead, nose bridge, and hands, while gentle shadows fall on her shoulders and the table. The overall warm light creates a serious, slightly tense office atmosphere. Color scheme: black, white, brown, with metallic silver of the tablet and transparent glass. Visuals are clean, detailed, with a cinematic documentary feel—high-resolution yet with slight grain and natural reflections for authenticity. The camera angle is slightly low, enhancing her authority and presence. All elements together construct a narrative moment of modern workplace focus, conveying professionalism, responsibility, and composure, while the nudity adds a sensual layer of confidence and vulnerability, creating a high-quality, refined, and tension-filled artistic image.",
