          "alias": "单女白衬衫镜前媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a mirror, snapping a selfie. She wears a short white blouse unbuttoned to reveal a black lace bra, paired with a black high-waisted pleated mini skirt, black-and-white Mary Jane shoes, and white thigh-high stockings. Her long wavy hair falls over her shoulders, side-swept bangs framing her face. She gazes directly into the lens with a cool, confident, and subtly seductive expression, holding a silver-black phone. The mirror reflects her full figure. The composition is centered and vertical. Background: a modern interior with light gray large-format floor tiles, off-white vertical striped walls, black curtain dressing-room dividers, and a closed white doorframe in the distance. Warm, even overhead lighting creates soft shadows and a clean, inviting atmosphere. The image captures crisp details—fabric wrinkles, shoe shine—with a slight warm film-like texture. The overall mood is elegant, independent, and sensual, with a contemporary fashion feel.",
