        {
          "id": "krea2-823c7b357e7df077e74c5098",
          "alias": "单女半褪棕浴袍闺房困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "An ancient Chinese beauty in exquisite Hanfu sits gracefully on a carved wooden chair, her black hair coiled into an elegant bun adorned with lifelike butterflies and dark floral ornaments, colorful wings brushing against her locks. Her eyes are heavily shadowed with orange-red makeup, deep red lips, and a vermillion mole between her brows, exuding mystery and allure. She raises her right hand, fingertips delicately touching her nose in a languid, rhythmic pose, half-closed eyes lost in sensual reverie. Her Hanfu is a luxurious brown silk robe, the outer layer transparent and sheer, slipping off one shoulder to reveal smooth pale skin and a bare, uncovered breast. The inner robe is deep brown brocade, embroidered with a giant golden butterfly on the chest, its wings detailed with tiny white dots and silver thread. A white silk ribbon hangs from her collar, draping over her exposed cleavage. A purple sash cinches at her waist, contrasting vividly. Her legs are crossed, the upper thigh and hip visible beneath a soft cream-colored plush fabric that barely covers her. The foreground focuses on her upper body and parted knees, with the dark carved wooden chair in the midground, its ornate patterns worn with age. The background is a dark screen with pine-needle motifs in deep gold and brown, dramatic side lighting from the left creating strong chiaroscuro, highlighting her face, hand, and the wet gleam of her bare skin. Warm amber tones infuse the image, evoking a nostalgic, dreamy, melancholic eroticism. Center-left composition with dynamic balance, the eye drawn to her face and exposed chest, her hand gesture, and the living butterflies that seem to flutter between her hair and the golden embroidery. The scene feels like a classical oil painting merging with a modern boudoir fantasy—exquisite texture, layered colors, and the scent of sandalwood and flowers lingering in the air.",
