          "alias": "单女黑西装办公室媚态坐马尾",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at an office desk, wearing a black blazer and a white shirt with the top buttons undone, revealing the upper swell of her breasts and a hint of cleavage. Her professional attire contrasts with the sensual openness. A small name badge is pinned to her left lapel. Her brown hair is tied in a low ponytail, with loose strands framing her face. She wears simple gold earrings and a thin black headphone cord connected to a tablet. She smiles warmly at the right, teeth showing, eyes bright and confident. Her left hand holds a dark notebook, fingers long and relaxed. Her right hand rests on the desk. In front of her, a silver-gray tablet on a white adjustable stand. The background is a blurred office interior: light gray walls with papers pinned, two small orange dots (maybe projector lights or indicators), a soft cream vertical curtain on the right, and the edge of a black office chair on the left. The shot is a medium close-up, with the woman centered, head slightly turned, guiding the viewer's eye rightward. Foreground includes the desk and tablet; background is softly out of focus. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft and even, casting gentle shadows with low contrast, creating a warm, calm, professional yet seductive atmosphere. The color palette is black, white, gray, with warm skin tones and the small orange accents. The image has a natural, filmic quality with subtle grain, capturing an intimate moment of a focused, friendly office worker, suggesting a pause in conversation or the start of a new task. The scene evokes customer service, remote collaboration, or a private meeting room. The composition is stable, with clear visual flow and a tranquil, sensual mood.",
