          "alias": "单女全裸白长裤城市冷淡",
          "prompt": "A low-angle upward shot captures a young woman dominating the frame with intense energy. Her hands extend forward, fingers forming an irregular frame that draws the viewer's eye to her expressive eyes. She has long black-to-gray gradient hair with silver-gray streaks swept across her brow, exuding a cool, rebellious vibe. Deep-set eyes shimmer with metallic silver eyeshadow, contrasting sharply with vivid red lips—a futuristic cyberpunk aesthetic. She is completely nude from the waist up, revealing her bare breasts, perky nipples, and a belly button piercing. Her lower body wears loose white casual pants with a black leather belt studded with metal rivets. She layers multiple necklaces: a chunky metal chain and a fine chain with a cross pendant. Her wrists are adorned with various metal bracelets, fingers decorated with rings. Her nails have sheer polish, some edges slightly chipped, adding realism. The background is a minimalist pure gray, with no distractions. Light comes from upper left, soft yet directional, casting strong chiaroscuro with a sharp shadow on the right side of her body, highlighting the curves of her breasts, hands, and clothing folds. The mood is calm, detached, yet powerfully urban. The image resembles a studio shoot but retains real textures: skin pores, natural hair waves, fabric wrinkles. Color palette is black-and-white dominated, with red lips and metallic accessories as accents. The foreground hand gesture creates dynamic tension, making the static image feel narrative and interactive. This balances fine-art photography and street-style portraiture—polished yet rebellious.",
