          "prompt": "A young woman photographed from a low-angle upward perspective, her long black hair with straight bangs and a black bow clip, strands gently flowing in the breeze. Her eyes are bright and clear, with a playful mysterious gaze staring directly into the camera, lips slightly parted in a natural, expressive look. Her hands are clasped over a white metal railing, body leaning slightly forward, elegant yet dynamic. She wears a black lace-trimmed short-sleeve top with delicate ruffled and lace details at the collar and cuffs, emphasizing a sweet Lolita style. A black-and-white checkered pleated skirt made of multiple layers of tulle, edged with black lace, revealing hints of thigh above black suspender garters that add a seductive allure. A small black leather backpack with metal buckles and woven fringe rests on her shoulder. The background is a modern architecture with white metal diagonal beams forming repeating geometric lines that lead the eye upward, creating depth and a futuristic feel. Bright sunlight streams from the upper right, casting soft highlights and shadows on her face, arms, and clothing, accentuating skin texture and fabric folds. The overall palette is black and white with warm tones from her hair and makeup, high contrast, crisp and clean. The composition is tilted for dynamic energy, subject slightly left, allowing the background lines to extend. Foreground emphasizes her body and backpack, midground focuses on the skirt and arm gestures, background blurred geometric structure. The atmosphere blends urban modernity with girlish sweetness, both real street snap and artistic aesthetic. The image is ultra-detailed, natural light, like a high-quality photograph taken on a sunny afternoon, with lifelike skin, subtle nipple outline visible through the lace top, and the skirt slightly lifted by a breeze exposing the garter straps and a glimpse of bare thigh.",
