        {
          "id": "krea2-0af24745495532b79c2f27dc",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔沙漠忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on the center line of a long, straight desert highway, wearing only frayed blue denim shorts and gold stiletto heels. She stands sideways on the yellow double line, head bowed, one hand lightly brushing her bare hip, her other hand trailing down her thigh. Her short brown hair lifts in the hot wind, sun catching its natural shine. Her skin is tanned deep bronze from the harsh sun, every muscle defined—smooth curves, long toned legs. Strong sunlight from the upper right creates sharp highlights and deep shadows, casting a long, sharp shadow across the asphalt. The road stretches to the horizon, flanked by dry sand and sparse grass, with rolling brown mountains under a cloudless blue sky. The scene is blazing midday heat. The composition is centered but slightly off-left, the double yellow lines drawing the eye to a green road sign and distant haze. Foreground shows rough asphalt texture; midground is the woman and her shadow; background is vast wilderness. Warm yellows, earth tones, and blues dominate—a lonely yet free atmosphere. The image feels like a cinematic film still, with subtle grain, rich detail, and a snapshot of raw desire and isolation.",
