        {
          "id": "krea2-b3edb8fd5c91a6098baa06a1",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裤摄影棚俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a taut, powerful pose against a pure white background. She is topless except for a pair of tight black shorts, an orange jacket draped loosely over one shoulder. Barefoot. Her blonde hair is tied into two playful space buns, wispy strands falling across her forehead. Heavy dramatic makeup: violet-pink gradient eyeshadow, dark lipstick, her gaze sharp and confrontational, oozing confidence and defiance. She sits on the floor, left leg stretched upward, right leg bent for support. In her right hand she grips a long blue-handled hammer with a cylindrical head decorated in red-and-white diamond patterns, black edging, wood grain texture. Her foot presses against the lower end of the hammer handle, raising the heavy head high. Composition is off-center: figure on the right, body stretched diagonally. The hammer cuts across the frame from upper left, leading the eye from the weapon to her face. Lighting: soft, from slightly above front, even illumination with almost no shadow, highlighting skin texture, the sheen on her bare torso, the folds of the shorts. Background is clean white, no distractions. Overall mood: clean, modern, fiercely expressionistic. High contrast: black, orange, blue, red accents. The image has a professional studio feel but retains the raw texture of amateur equipment. No text or extra decorations. Focus on her bold pose, her defiant expression, and the dynamic interaction between her bare skin and the massive hammer. The scene conveys freedom, power, and raw sexual energy—a moment frozen between cosplay fantasy and gritty reality. Light defines her silhouette and muscles, adding depth. The cool tones are balanced by the warm orange jacket and makeup, creating visual tension. It feels both cool and narrative, as if the hammer's impact echoes in the silent space, inviting thoughts on strength, identity, and self-expression.",
