          "alias": "单女金外套媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female figure in a futuristic yellow jacket, partially unzipped to reveal a black lace top and a hint of cleavage, paired with glossy black latex leggings that cling to her thighs and hips. She wears a black cat-ear headset over her black twin-tail hair, with blunt bangs and a black face mask covering her lower face. Her eyes are sharp, intense, framed by vivid yellow eyeshadow—a cold, seductive gaze. She stands in a side profile, body leaning slightly back, one hand gripping a black katana with white tassels, the blade angled behind her. Her other hand rests casually at her side. The yellow jacket is printed with black lettering and lines, sleeve stitched \"CR3-TRE03\". She wears black gloves and high boots. The background is a modern industrial complex: gray metal walls, curved ventilation ducts, overcast sky, soft diffused light. Mid-shot composition, slightly low angle, subject centered-right, background blurred. Color palette: yellow, black, gray—the jacket pops against the cold tones. Atmosphere blends cyberpunk and streetwear, gritty yet polished. Image quality is ultra-realistic, like a professional photograph, but with a raw, candid edge—fabric sheen, hair strands, mask texture, sword hilt details all crisp. The overall vibe is a poised, dangerous fighter exuding raw sexuality and power, caught in a moment of restrained tension.",
