          "alias": "单女舞者白衬衫舞台叛逆站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young female dancer in a dimly lit stage center performs an extreme dance pose, wearing a tight white short-sleeve shirt and a short military-green pleated skirt that flips up to reveal her thighs and the edge of her panties. Her hair is in a ponytail with blunt bangs, her face focused and defiant, eyes locked forward, mouth slightly open as if gasping or shouting to the rhythm. Her right leg is lifted high to head height, toes pointed, clad in white socks and black leather shoes; her left leg supports her balance, body arched backward into a graceful curve. Her right hand reaches forward as if grasping, left hand hangs loose. The hem of her shirt and skirt whip violently from the rapid motion, creating dynamic motion blur. The background is pure black, with only a few spotlights from below and the sides casting bright halos. One strong light rises from the floor, illuminating her legs and skirt, while another cold blue light from the left creates hazy light patches in the air, delivering dramatic chiaroscuro. The stage floor reflects her clear silhouette. In the distance, faint blurred figures of other dancers in similar costumes stand out of focus. The composition centers on her, shot from a low angle looking up, emphasizing her strength and dynamic beauty. Visual flow follows her pose and gaze, drawing the eye to her raised leg and flying skirt, forming a tense diagonal layout. Light from below and the side sharpens her contours, with deep, heavy shadows. The overall atmosphere is tense and expressive, like a frozen moment of intense stage performance, with strong cinematic and artistic impact. Details are rich: fabric wrinkles, stray hairs, skin shine, and subtle marks where shoes contact the floor. The texture feels realistic and delicate. The color palette is cool, dominated by black, white, and gray, accented by military green and the blue-white of lights, creating a mundane yet surreal feel, as if captured by amateur equipment with slight grain and lens flare, enhancing realism and presence. The scene radiates youthful vitality and rebellious spirit, showcasing the pure power of dance and the freedom of personal expression.",
