          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bar stool in a café, leaning slightly forward with crossed legs, her pose elegant and relaxed. She is completely nude except for a pair of olive-green thigh-high socks and vintage brown leather shoes with white stitching and a star motif. Her skin glows under soft lighting, her brown hair with blunt bangs falls over her shoulders, and she wears clear-frame glasses. She holds a transparent cup of orange iced drink in one hand and a pink phone with a fluffy white charm in the other. A delicate gold chain necklace with a geometric pendant rests against her bare collarbone. Her lips part slightly, eyes focused on the camera with a lazy, confident expression. Behind her, an industrial café wall with gray concrete, a silver metal pipe, and a wooden railing; a plate of pizza sits on the table to the right. The composition is slightly low-angle, warm lighting from the left creates soft shadows on her body, emphasizing her curves. The scene feels like a candid, everyday moment, blending urban fashion with sensuality.",
