        {
          "id": "krea2-948e2ef8c2edc5bc016068b4",
          "alias": "单女蓝浴袍摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in traditional Hanfu stands before a pure white studio backdrop. Her deep blue wide-sleeved robe hangs open at the chest, revealing the full curve of one breast and a hint of the other, while the thick woolen cloak has slipped to her elbows, baring both shoulders. The cloak's red piping and the delicate red velvet flower at her collar draw the eye. Her hair is swept into a classical updo, with loose strands brushing her neck. Her gaze is lowered, lids heavy, as she brings a glistening candied hawthorn stick to her slightly parted lips. Her right hand holds the skewer near her mouth, the red sugar coating catching the light; her left hand hangs by her side, fingers softly curled. The layered skirt shows an off-white underskirt beneath a gray-green and cream brocade overlay, embroidered with fine geometric patterns. The fabric textures blend linen and velvet. Light slants from the upper left, like a stage spotlight, creating deep shadows and highlighting her face, the exposed skin of her chest, the folds of her robe, and the glossy hawthorn. The background is a soft pale gray gradient. The medium shot is slightly off-center, with the subject to the left and breathing room on the right. The camera angle is slightly low, emphasizing her elegant posture. The color palette is cool – blues, grays, whites – punctuated by the vivid red of the hawthorn and warm yellow details in the fabric. The overall mood is quiet, poetic, and nostalgic, with an erotic tension: an ancient dream meeting a sensual, cinematic moment. The image captures an artistic, hyper-detailed vision of Eastern aesthetics, both real and ethereal, as if stolen from a forgotten dynasty or a gentle time-travel encounter.",
