        {
          "id": "krea2-d6ff48285ee3408b6220898b",
          "alias": "单女外套窗边害羞躺跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on the car seat, her head tilted back in a close-up that dominates the frame. Her long dark hair spills loosely over her shoulders and the upholstery, strands clinging to her flushed cheeks. She gazes upward with half-lidded eyes, a dazed, thoughtful look as faint reflections from the window dance in her pupils. Her lips are parted, natural red, as if caught mid-sentence. She wears thin-framed glasses, the temples visible behind her ears, adding an intellectual, demure air to her exposed throat and bare collarbone. Her outer jacket has been shrugged off, revealing the smooth curve of one shoulder and the top of a simple bralette or bare skin—nipple hinted beneath the fabric’s edge. Pale, delicate skin with a rosy blush across her cheeks and chest, as if warmed by sunlight. Light pours in through the car window, creating soft highlights on her forehead, nose, and cheekbones, while shadows settle along her jaw and hairline. The jacket lies open, its cotton texture contrasting with her soft skin. Background shows the car interior: blurred reflections on the window, a cream ceiling liner, dark gray fabric seats with visible weave, and the faint outline of a black plastic panel and metal door handle. The composition is tilted, camera close and intimate, with strong backlight on the left side creating bright highlights and warm yellow tones on her face, while the right side falls into cooler shadows. Every detail is razor-sharp: fine eyelashes, skin pores, hair sheen, fabric folds, even the faint reflection on her lenses. The scene feels like a slice of real life—quiet, melancholic, and deeply sensual, as if capturing an unguarded, vulnerable moment full of untold stories.",
