        {
          "id": "krea2-05d704fcf56315cfb356f783",
          "alias": "单女露胸绿泳装温泉神秘站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside a Japanese hot spring pool, topless, wearing only low-rise, high-cut olive green bikini bottoms that accentuate her long, toned legs and full hips. Her black hair is tied in a neat low ponytail with a few strands falling naturally around her face. She wears retro square sunglasses reflecting the surroundings, her expression calm and confident as she gazes toward the camera. Her lips are tinted a light red, makeup refined but not heavy, giving an elegant yet mysterious aura. Her right hand rests lightly on her hip, fingers relaxed, left hand hangs at her side, stance relaxed yet poised, subtly showcasing her body. The setting is a typical Japanese open-air onsen with warm brown wooden eaves overhead, small round recessed lights providing soft illumination. To the right is a yellow bamboo fence with neat vertical slats; to the left, a dark wooden wall showing signs of age. In the background, a small stone water basin trickles water into the pool, creating a serene atmosphere. Distant green foliage and mountain outlines hint at a resort in nature. The foreground shows clear hot spring water with gentle ripples reflecting the sky, roof, and her figure. Her legs partially submerged show smooth, glowing skin. Composition uses a slight angle, she is positioned left of center, body angled toward the camera, head turned slightly forward, creating dynamic visual balance. Layers include foreground pool, midground figure, and background architecture/nature. The viewer's eye follows her gaze and posture into the depth of the scene. Lighting comes from above, simulating warm afternoon sunlight filtering through gaps in the roof, creating soft chiaroscuro on her body—face and shoulders illuminated, back and legs in partial shadow, enhancing dimensionality. Bright reflections on the water contrast with darker wooden elements, evoking a warm, intimate atmosphere. The scene blends modern fashion with traditional Japanese aesthetics, conveying a relaxed, private, indulgent lifestyle. Color palette features warm brown, yellow-green, and teal, harmonious and lifelike. The image feels like a story captured with a professional camera using a wide aperture lens.",
