        {
          "id": "krea2-6900780ef4a7e20a14174d2b",
          "alias": "单女黑外套室内媚态跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female character kneels in a dim indoor space, her soft pink hair and blunt bangs glowing under faint light, a black beret tilted low. Her makeup is sharp and cold—dark eyeliner, deep red lips. She wears a black leather jacket with red trim and metal hardware, unzipped to reveal her bare chest and erect nipples, over a black bodysuit that leaves her midriff exposed. A heavy tactical belt loaded with gear cinches her waist. Black stockings cling to her legs, with high-heel black boots. Her right knee is bent, left leg half-squatting, body leaning forward. She grips a black assault rifle with scope and attachments, stock pressed to shoulder. Her left hand, in a red glove, salutes with fingers splayed, palm facing the lens, arm adorned with black gauntlets and metallic wiring. The pose is powerful and graceful—a warrior or futuristic agent. Background: a large indoor venue with cold white spotlights from above, casting dramatic light and shadow across her body. Gray concrete floor with faint reflections. Blurred crowd and display stands in background emphasize her. Low-angle shot, composition triangulated by gun, face, and hand. Harsh chiaroscuro highlights her curves and gear, with deep shadows. Palette: black, gray, red (gloves, hair accents, jacket details). Film-like realism with slight grain and natural exposure, evoking high-quality but authentic photography. Her expression is calm, intense, eyes locked on the viewer, exuding dominance. Sci-fi, military, and fashion blend into a sensual, powerful visual tension.",
