        {
          "id": "krea2-f37f3e63f8d96746c9f280fb",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉浴袍山野媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty in stunning Hanfu stands on an ancient pavilion overlooking Jiangnan's misty waterways. Her jet-black hair is piled high in an elegant Tang dynasty bun, adorned with gold-threaded ruby hair ornaments, small red velvet flowers, and dangling gold tassels, with a tiny vermilion bindi at her brow. Her long, delicately arched brows frame half-lidded eyes that gaze softly down at a book in her hands—her expression serene and absorbed, as if lost in ancient poetry. Her skin is pale jade, lips faint rose, nose straight, features ethereal. Red bead earrings dangle from her ears, a fine red bead necklace graces her neck, and gold bangles encircle her wrists. She wears a translucent pale pink silk outer robe that slips provocatively off one shoulder, revealing bare creamy skin and the swell of one breast, the white inner gown with blue-green mountain patterns partly undone. The waist is cinched with vivid orange-red silk sashes that fall loosely, swaying in the breeze. In her hands, she holds an ancient dark brown leather-bound scroll, pages slightly open, as if caught mid-read. The foreground features intricately carved wooden railings with gold tracery and traditional motifs, heavy and antique. Midground shows classic Chinese garden architecture—eaves upturned, pavilions layered, roofs of gray-black tiles, painted wood beneath. Background fades into hazy green trees and distant mountains, sunlight filtering through leaves casting dappled shadows. The lighting is warm, early afternoon or late morning, with a soft backlight from upper right that outlines her figure in a subtle glow, enhancing dimension. Composition is centered symmetrical, focusing on the woman and her scroll, evoking a quiet elegant classical mood. Color palette of pale pink, off-white, blue-green, and ochre red harmonizes like ink wash painting, poetic and timeless. The scene feels like an ancient beauty scroll come alive—a moment suspended across centuries. Details rich: silk sheen, paper texture, wood grain visible. Shot with an 85mm portrait lens, shallow depth of field softly blurring background, giving professional studio quality yet a candid, handheld realism, as if catching a gentle woman reading in a courtyard—artistic yet lifelike, transporting the viewer into a tranquil, poetic world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
