          "prompt": "A young woman, topless, sits on an aged wooden corridor, her delicate green Hanfu robe slipped open to bare her breasts. Her ink-black hair is piled in an elegant ancient updo, adorned with a magnificent gold phoenix pin and lotus-shaped gold ornaments. Long tassel earrings and multi-layered pearl necklaces glisten against her naked skin. Her makeup is ethereal: soft arched brows, subtle eye shadow, pale lips, her gaze lowered with a melancholic, sensual longing. The green brocade robe has fine dark patterns, silver embroidered trims, layered collars now parted. Her hands lightly rest on her thighs, teasingly close to her skin. Foreground: blurred wooden railing and a few green leaves. Left edge: a dark ceramic pot with gold motifs and orange flowers. Background: soft-focus grey tile roofs and a hazy courtyard. Mid-shot composition, subject center-right, shallow depth of field, soft natural side lighting casting gentle highlights on her face, hair, and exposed skin, with deep, intimate shadows. Overall mood: serene classical poetry with Eastern aesthetics, green tones accented by gold and warm light, rich in texture and detail, like a high-definition photo capturing a timeless, sensual stillness.",
