          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern interior, wearing a pale pink knitted short-sleeve top with fine vertical ribbing and a front tie detail, her top slipping low to reveal the swell of her breasts and the curve of her cleavage, paired with an off-white high-waist mini skirt that hugs her hips and shows plenty of thigh. Her deep brown long wavy hair is styled with a pink headband and simple earrings, a thin chain necklace at her throat, a pearl bracelet on her left wrist, her right hand resting casually beside her. She reclines on a dark brown leather sofa, her body slightly twisted, legs crossed with one extended, the other bent, forming an elegant S-curve. Her expression is soft and slightly lazy, eyes locked on the camera. A black smartphone lies screen-down beside her, near a small light bag. The background reveals a bright modern space: a dark wooden desk with a lamp, folders, and office supplies, an open kitchen beyond with cabinets and sink, and large floor-to-ceiling windows showing city skyline. Walls are pale with mirrored panels reflecting the room, creating depth. Ceiling has recessed lights and AC vents. Floor features a black-and-white geometric rug. Soft lighting from the desk lamp and ambient sources casts warm shadows from the left, highlighting her face, body, and the glossy leather of the sofa. The composition centers her slightly left, with the desk and mirror adding symmetry and leading the eye to her. Warm tones of beige, cream, brown, and soft pink dominate. The scene feels intimate, luxurious, and highly detailed, like a professional photograph with sensual undertones.",
