          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her long, sleek black hair cascading over her shoulders. She has pale, flawless skin, delicate facial features, and a calm, focused gaze, lips slightly parted, expression cool and aloof. She wears a black leather jacket over her bare shoulders, unzipped, revealing she is completely topless underneath—her firm breasts exposed, nipples erect. A short black slip dress is pushed down to her hips, barely covering her waist. Her legs are long and straight, feet in chunky white sneakers with metal chain details, paired with white over-the-knee socks that have visible texture and natural folds. She stands with a slight twist, one arm relaxed at her side, the other hand lightly touching the jacket’s edge. Her legs are crossed, right in front of left, creating a dynamic balance. The foreground is warm, light-brown wooden flooring with visible grain. The subject occupies the center-right of the frame, captured in a full-body portrait from head to toe. The background features a silver, wavy reflective fabric on the left with horizontal folds and subtle light reflections, and a white brick wall on the right with neat mortar lines and a slightly rough texture. Lighting comes from the upper left—soft and even studio light, casting subtle highlights on the jacket and skin, with gentle shadow transitions. The silver fabric produces alternating light and dark stripes, while the brick wall remains evenly lit, bright but not overexposed. The atmosphere is calm, cool, and modern urban. Style blends fashion photography with casual street wear; the color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, accented by the white socks and warm wood tones. The image is photorealistic, rich in detail, with strong visual contrast and artistic expression, capturing an independent, confident, and rebellious female presence.",
