          "alias": "单女黑外套摄影棚微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A stunning white-haired woman sits gracefully on a tall barstool, wearing a sleek black leather jacket, partially unzipped to reveal a low-cut white lace blouse that exposes her cleavage. Her silver-white hair is styled in a high bun with loose strands framing her face, adorned with a futuristic black metal hair ornament. Her deep, intense eyes and a faint, mysterious smile exude seductive confidence. The jacket features gothic steampunk details: metal rivets, chain accents, golden buttons, and decorative zippers, while her black mini skirt, sheer black stockings, and glossy high-heel patent leather shoes accentuate her long legs. She sits with one hand gently touching her cheek, the other resting on her thigh, legs crossed, one foot slightly raised. The modern industrial barstool has a worn brown leather seat and silver-gray metal base. The background is a clean light gray gradient, with soft lighting from the front left, creating subtle chiaroscuro that highlights her curves and the texture of the leather jacket. Medium shot, body slightly angled to the camera, head turned, gaze direct. Black, white, gray palette with silver and brown accents. High-quality, realistic photography style, like a professional studio portrait with an 85mm lens at f/2.8, capturing fine details and sensual atmosphere.",
