          "prompt": "A young woman walks barefoot on an outdoor stone staircase, her short cream-white lace dress unbuttoned at the front, revealing her bare breasts and smooth cleavage, the lace edges framing her nipples. The V-neckline hangs open, and the ruffled sleeves flutter as she moves. Her long, slightly curled hair catches soft sunlight; silver earrings glint. She wears no underwear, the asymmetric hem of her dress barely covering her hips. A man in a dark blue suit, light blue shirt, and matching tie holds her wrist firmly, leading her down the steps. His grip is tender but dominant. To the left, a partial figure in a brown jacket and black jeans watches. Background: blurred city crowd, one person with a gold chain bag. Gray stone steps with inset circular lights. Warm sunlight from above casts sharp shadows, creating deep contrasts and soft gradients. Medium shot, subject slightly right, dynamic walking pose. Visual lines lead down the steps. Color palette: cream, light gray, dark blue. Realistic street photography style with slight motion blur and natural depth of field, as if captured by a high-end camera or smartphone. The scene conveys urban elegance, spontaneous beauty, and a quiet, cinematic narrative.",
