        {
          "id": "krea2-322f6aea2df57ed3b9d3f80d",
          "alias": "单女露胸米内衣摄影棚媚态站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands gracefully inside an abstract sculptural structure of soft pink translucent fabric, wearing only a sheer, pale beige sports bra peeled open to expose her bare breasts, her nipples visible, and deep taupe high-waisted tight yoga pants. One leg slightly bent, toe pointed on the ground, the other leg naturally raised and bent. She gently tugs the flowing fabric with both hands, as if performing a silent dialogue with the air. Her hair is tied in a low ponytail, a few strands falling beside her cheeks. Her gaze is focused and calm, looking directly into the lens, exuding an inner strength and serene sensuality. The foreground shows fluid edges of fabric with delicate folds and light-shadow interplay; the fabric arcs upward from below, creating a surrounding space that centers her. The midground captures her interaction with the fabric, which spreads like wings or soft clouds wrapping around her body, giving a floating illusion. The background is a pure, soft lavender gradient sky, with no distracting elements, emphasizing the subject. The composition is vertical, placing her slightly below center, leaving ample space above to enhance breathing and extension. Visual flow follows a diagonal from bottom-left to top-right through her pose and fabric lines, while her direct gaze establishes emotional connection. Lighting is soft and even, a frontal diffused light that defines her contours without harshness, revealing skin texture and fabric details. The translucent fabric creates subtle chiaroscuro. The overall palette is earth tones—cream, taupe, pinkish purple—low saturation, creating a quiet, warm, slightly futuristic atmosphere. The image quality resembles a professional studio shot with a high-resolution camera and large aperture, showing delicate depth of field, crisp facial details, and a natural bokeh background, as if an amateur camera accidentally captured a transcendent moment. The style blends modern minimalism with Eastern zen, conveying health, freedom, and self-exploration—a silent dance, a deep dialogue with oneself.",
