          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate sheer pink silk Hanfu robes sits gracefully in a dimly lit traditional Chinese interior, the delicate fabric barely veiling her bare breasts as the outer robe hangs open, revealing her peaked nipples and smooth skin. Her inner blue embroidered skirt with red floral patterns is loosely tied at her waist, the deep red sash and green silk floral knot accenting her figure. Her hair is styled in a high double-loop bun adorned with colorful fresh blooms and jade hairpins, tiny butterfly ornaments scattered through her black tresses. A vermilion forehead mark and a delicate red floral bindi accentuate her clear, lustrous eyes, which gaze thoughtfully to the right, full lips slightly parted. She holds a pair of black lacquered chopsticks in her hands, paused mid-meal, as if caught in a moment of quiet contemplation. Before her, a wooden table covered with a blue-and-white geometric cloth bears an array of fine dishes: a celadon bowl of red preserved fruits, a white porcelain bowl of golden round eggs, and a small plate of deep purple grapes, the vivid colors echoing her attire. The warm amber lighting from behind and to the right casts a soft rim light, outlining her silhouette with a gentle glow, catching the subtle highlights on her nose and cheekbones. A shallow depth of field blurs the foreground food items, drawing focus to her face and bare upper body. The scene exudes an intimate, cinematic realism, as if captured in a traditional courtyard teahouse, lush with sensual classical elegance and everyday warmth.",
