          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the marble counter of a luxury bathroom, her deep gray silk robe loosely open to reveal delicate black lace lingerie, the fabric clinging to her curves, one strap slipping off her shoulder. Her short hair is tousled, makeup flawless, eyes half-lidded and dreamy, a lit cigarette dangling from her lips, smoke twisting in the warm amber light. Left hand rests on the counter edge, right hand lightly touching her ribs, posture relaxed yet sensual. One leg bent, the other stretched out, smooth skin glowing under soft directional light. Small pearl earrings catch the glow. To her left, a white freestanding bathtub, pristine, a towel draped over the edge. Behind her, pale marble walls with natural veining, a mirror reflects her silhouette and a white robe hanging opposite. Vertical LED strips emit warm light, casting soft shadows. On the counter: a crystal flute of champagne, a glass ashtray with stubbed-out cigarettes, a black quilted handbag with gold chain, and a smartphone with a black screen. Medium shot, subject centered left, foreground objects framing the scene. Warm cinematic tones, vintage film aesthetic, subtle grain. Golden ratio composition, her gaze directed off-camera, inviting intimacy. A private, melancholic yet seductive moment, as if captured in a luxury hotel bathroom, layers of texture and light creating an atmospheric, story-rich image.",
