        {
          "id": "krea2-63d7dbd208769d117fe94661",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉挂脖雪地微笑倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a pink low-cut halter dress, the skirt fluttering lightly, the bodice trimmed with pearl and black bead embroidery. She wears translucent golden gauze wings with delicate gold thread edges, as if woven from light and dreams. Her brown hair is softly pinned up, a few strands falling by her face. Her features are pretty and sweet, eyes clear and bright, with a playful and tender smile. She leans out of an old wooden window frame, body slightly forward, right hand resting on the windowsill, left hand hanging naturally—elegant and lively. A pearl necklace and a small gold pendant adorn her neck, adding a touch of nobility. To her left sits a cute snowman plushie in a pink striped knit hat and rainbow scarf, red nose and black eyes lively. On the right are two plush fawn toys with soft orange-yellow fur, resting on the sill next to a vintage black metal lantern, adding nostalgia. The window frames the composition with classic central perspective—she is slightly right of center, gaze leading outside. The foreground is a rough concrete windowsill, cracked and peeling white paint, weathered texture. Below lies white snow with scattered dead leaves. The background shows dark wooden roof beams, sturdy tones evoking a rustic cottage. Lighting is soft and even, natural light from the left-front casting a gentle glow on her face and wing edges, with no harsh shadows—warm, tranquil winter afternoon atmosphere. Colors are pink, cream, light brown, accented by the snowman's red and rainbow scarf and the fawns' orange-yellow; rich yet uncluttered. The scene feels dreamlike and fairytale-like yet grounded in real details, as if captured by an old film camera—a moment of subtle emotional connection between the subject and environment. Composition is full and narrative, focus on facial expression and wing details, background elements supporting without overwhelming. Overall a warm, romantic, slightly nostalgic everyday image with artistic beauty and emotional warmth, now enhanced with a sensual edge: the low neckline of her dress reveals the upper curve of her breasts, and through the translucent wings one can glimpse hints of her bare back and side. The fabric of the dress clings to her form, a single strap slipping off her shoulder, suggesting near-toppling elegance.",
