        {
          "id": "krea2-4f2a21628c36b7adfb48bdd7",
          "alias": "单女寺庙媚态交叠",
          "prompt": "A red-haired woman dressed in a sheer black lace and mesh ensemble that reveals her curves, topped with small black horn accessories, embodying a dark demonic allure. She lounges on a spread of deep crimson velvet, legs crossed, one hand brushing her temple while her gaze locks onto the lens with a cold, mysterious expression. Lips slightly parted, she exudes a dangerous seduction. Soft warm yellow light from the upper left creates dramatic chiaroscuro, highlighting her skin and the contours of her body. The scene is set in a deep black void: on the left, several lit white candles cast flickering glow beside a bouquet of vivid red roses; on the right, a pristine white classical column contrasts the darkness. In the foreground, an ornate sword is thrust into the red velvet, its intricate hilt catching faint reflections, with scattered rose petals and candle stubs around it. Low-angle perspective emphasizes her tall, commanding presence; she is positioned slightly right of center, drawing focus to her face and body curves. The side-backlighting defines her silhouette, rendering skin texture in fine detail while shadows remain rich and layered. The palette is dominated by deep red and black, with accents of gold and white light. Every element feels hyper-real—fabric folds, hair sheen, candle flames, metallic blade gleam, velvet texture—yet retains a subtle film grain and natural bokeh, merging realism with stylized fantasy. A red curtain drops in the background, its flowing lines echoing her pose, creating an intimate, closed space. The mood blends luxury and danger, sanctity and decadence, like a midnight ritual steeped in narrative and symbolism. The overall image is a masterpiece of visual tension: sensual, explicit, and psychologically charged.",
