          "prompt": "A young topless woman in a red satin qipao with fluffy white fur trim at collar and cuffs, the dress gaping open to expose her bare breasts, leans sideways on a red velvet surface covered in scattered mahjong tiles. She holds two white mahjong tiles marked with the Chinese character for \"fortune,\" one in each hand, body slightly forward, soft nipples visible as she gazes at the camera with a sultry smile. Her dark hair is pinned in a classical bun adorned with red pom-poms, gold bells, and a phoenix hairpin in red and white; small red bead earrings dangle. Foreground: a pile of white mahjong tiles and red dice, some tiles face up showing symbols for \"center,\" \"fortune,\" \"myriad.\" Midground: her arms crossed loosely over her chest, one tile pressed against her sternum, fingers elegant. Background: a dark red wall, left edge reveals a beige screen with ink bamboo painting. Close-up low-angle shot, soft front light evenly illuminates her face and bare skin, highlighting the gloss of red satin and plush white fur, natural shadowing on cheeks and neck. Warm, layered atmosphere. Dominant red contrasts with the cold white of mahjong and fur. High-resolution, fine texture, gentle film grain, shallow depth of field. Overall an artistic, festive, and sensual portrait blending traditional elegance with modern erotic appeal.",
