          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a weathered wooden ladder, her long black hair and straight bangs framing her face as she gazes softly at the camera with a gentle smile. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, one hand lightly resting on her forehead, the other on the ladder rail. She wears a black high-waist leather mini skirt, tight and shiny, paired with glossy black over-the-knee stiletto heel boots that catch the light. Her legs are crossed, right over left, toes pointing down, emphasizing their length. The background is a cracked and peeling dark gray concrete wall with an old wooden-framed window to the left. Soft natural light streams in from above-left, casting dramatic shadows across her face, arms, and thighs, highlighting the curve of her breasts. The floor is stained gray cement. Medium shot, slightly off-center, her body tilted gracefully. The overall mood blends industrial grit with sensual elegance, monochrome tones punctuated by the warm beige of her discarded top lying nearby. Fine film grain texture, high detail on skin, leather reflections, and wall texture. Realistic, like a candid portrait captured in a quiet afternoon.",
