        {
          "id": "krea2-33a809930aa920d8ef164c30",
          "alias": "单女模特旗袍纯色背景微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young female cosplayer sits cross-legged on a pure white background, wearing an exquisite red Chinese-style costume made of deep crimson silk satin with gold embroidered patterns and frog buttons, the neckline and cuffs trimmed with cream lace ruffles—the outfit is a daring fusion of traditional cheongsam and modern fantasy, with the low-cut bodice offering a generous view of her cleavage and bare shoulders. Her head is adorned with a pair of brown fluffy horse ears, a small gold crown, and a red bow atop her head; her long brown curls cascade naturally, with some strands tied into twin ponytails with red ribbons and a straight fringe over her forehead. Her makeup is flawless, with bright, large blue eyes, a sweet smile, and a soft, inviting gaze directly at the camera. She sits with her legs crossed (right leg in front, left behind) in an elegant pose, holding a red greeting card printed with a chibi version of herself in her right hand, and three more identical cards fanned out in her left hand—cards are red with gold edges, slightly curled at the corners. She wears sheer white thigh-high stockings and red patent leather Mary Jane shoes with gold bow details and thin straps, revealing slender ankle lines. Her long hair falls down her back into a long ponytail that spreads onto the floor. Several red envelopes printed with gold \"福\" characters and auspicious patterns are scattered around her. The composition centers on her, a medium shot with a slight side-sitting posture, body angled slightly right, face straight to the camera, hands holding the cards to the left of her chest as the focal point. The background is a clean white studio backdrop with no distractions. Soft frontal studio lights illuminate her evenly, creating minimal shadows and a bright, clean commercial photography feel. The color palette is dominated by rich red tones, complemented by gold, white, and skin tones, with smooth light transitions and highlights on her face, hands, and costume details. The overall atmosphere is warm, festive, and inviting, yet professional, exuding a high-quality portrait aesthetic reminiscent of a real camera shot with slight film grain and natural exposure detail—warm, saturated tones, layered depth, and crisp clarity, delivering a dreamlike yet realistic visual experience.",
