        {
          "id": "krea2-9033d3b0acd5b4d594a58065",
          "alias": "单女半褪白泳装泳池俏皮站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young Asian woman stands in a private swimming pool, her long, silky brown hair cascading naturally, pale skin glowing. She smiles softly, eyes clear and bright, body slightly turned sideways, left hand resting on the pool edge, right hand gracefully pointing to the side—elegant and relaxed. She wears a white ruffled bikini top, now wet and clinging to her curves, and light blue thin straps, but the top is pulled down to expose her bare breasts, nipples hardening in the warm air. Her high-waisted tie-side bikini bottoms match the blue, hugging her hips, waistline smooth and taut. A simple white smartwatch on her right wrist adds a modern touch. The pool is lined with vivid blue square tiles, water rippling, reflecting sky and surroundings. The poolside has a beige gravel border transitioning naturally. Behind stands a Southeast Asian villa: white walls, dark brown wooden roof structure, red metal support beams under the eaves. Large glass sliding doors are open, revealing interior: a wooden dining table with chairs, a flat-screen TV on the wall, a crystal chandelier emitting warm yellow light, a dark wood door, and an air conditioner unit. To the right, a bed and green curtains are faintly visible. Outside, lush tropical trees and bamboo create rich green layers, sunlight filtering through leaves casting dappled shadows. The scene is bathed in soft afternoon natural light, golden rays highlighting her skin. Low-angle shot, she is in the left foreground, becoming the visual focus. The pool extends to the bottom of the frame, leading the eye toward the villa and yard depth. Architecture and vegetation frame her, enhancing depth. Colors: blue, white, green, with wooden brown and metallic red-grey accents, contrasting yet harmonious. Light and shadow transitions are soft, emphasizing her contours and skin texture. The atmosphere is both lived-in and vacation-like, captured as if by a professional camera in natural light, with slight film grain and realistic exposure details. A balanced, story-rich composition guides the eye from her expression to body posture to environmental details, conveying relaxed, joyful leisure. Abundant details: pool reflections, crystal chandelier, hair shine, fabric wrinkles—all hyper-realistic. The overall style blends artistic beauty with authentic life.",
