        {
          "id": "krea2-5d85a2a12d1938513e10d1b6",
          "alias": "单女束缚黑背心桥忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman captured in a medium close-up, her thick, long curly hair cascading over her shoulders, rich layers of texture and contrast in black-and-white light, delicate highlights and shadow transitions between strands, ends slightly curled, some strands brushing her cheek and neck, creating a lazy, alluring atmosphere. Her facial features are sharp and refined, eyes deep with a hint of melancholy, gazing directly at the lens, lips slightly parted, focused and introspective, as if lost in thought. She wears a black sleeveless top with a low-cut, ruffled neckline—soft, body-hugging fabric, revealing the gentle curve of her collarbone and the top of her chest. Her arms hang naturally, hands clasped in front, left wrist adorned with a fluffy black pom-pom bracelet, the plush texture standing out in the light. Her fingers are long, nails coated in dark glossy polish with metallic accents. Several thin black cords wrap around her wrist like bondage-style straps, adding an edgy, personal touch. The foreground features her hands and the bracelet, occupying a prominent lower area as a visual focal point; the midground shows her upper body and face. The composition is centered slightly to the right, her posture subtly twisted, head tilted, enhancing dynamic energy and intimacy. The background is an indoor setting: on the left, a clothes rack with soft, light-colored garments rendered as gray-white shapes in monochrome; on the right, a simple, even-toned wall. Overall background is softly blurred, emphasizing the subject. Classic centered composition with the figure slightly offset, guiding the eye naturally through her gaze and hand positioning, forming a visual flow from face to hands to background. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft side light sculpting her facial contours and hair edges, creating delicate chiaroscuro highlights on her forehead, nose bridge, and eye sockets, with shadows on her cheek sides and neck, enhancing three-dimensionality. The overall light feels quiet and emotional, black-and-white intensifying a vintage, artistic quality. The image exudes a serene, contemplative, slightly sorrowful everyday moment—like a professional black-and-white portrait or a candid lifestyle shot, with strong personal style and emotional expression. The texture is fine with subtle grain, simulating film photography, rich in detail and layers, the atmosphere calm and deep, full of narrative and artistic beauty.",
