        {
          "id": "krea2-3739c93cd6a45f422ec361c5",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤健身房媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor fitness setting, wearing a form-fitting black long-sleeve crop top and high-waisted black leggings, with a pale blue sports inner layer visible at her waist. She wears white knee-high socks with three black horizontal stripes at the cuffs. Her arms are raised overhead, gripping the crossbar of a Pilates reformer, her body slightly arched back. She smiles gently, eyes locked on the camera, posture elegant and stretched, exuding healthy vitality and confident sensuality. Her long hair falls naturally over her shoulders, soft curls catching the subdued light, facial features sharp with subtle dewy makeup, pale lips, bright focused eyes. In the foreground, the Pilates reformer—wooden frame with grey padded cushion, metallic supports reflecting cool light, a pulley system on the left column, and a pair of fluffy slippers hanging on the right—adds a lived-in touch. The woman occupies the center-left of the frame, her body forming an S-curve, weight balanced, movement fluid. Behind her, a large window covered with translucent white sheer curtains reveals bare winter branches outside, casting soft diffused light. The wall is light beige, the floor pale wood with subtle reflections, enhancing the airy feel. The composition is symmetrical, with the figure centrally placed and equipment balanced on both sides, using horizontal and vertical lines to guide the eye. Light comes from a side window, soft and even, creating a warm morning or afternoon glow. The overall palette is black, white, grey, with accents of pale blue and wood tones—harmonious, quiet, comfortable, professional yet intimate. Details are rich, from fabric folds to floor reflections, with a realistic photographic feel: medium-format or full-frame camera, 85mm f/2.8, ISO 100, 1/125s, delicate depth of field, natural light transition, film-like grain with slight low contrast, mimicking an amateur using Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV, subtle vignetting adding documentary intimacy. The atmosphere is still yet vibrant, capturing a modern urban woman's daily pursuit of a healthy lifestyle with a sensual, alluring edge.",
