        {
          "id": "krea2-3350afaaa41307c8b4eb7076",
          "alias": "单女露胸白和服温泉媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a narrow indoor corridor, her white kimono inner robe loosely open, revealing her bare breasts and smooth skin, the black outer cloak draped off one shoulder. Her jet-black shoulder-length hair falls naturally, bangs neatly framing her forehead, her gaze soft yet seductive directly into the lens, lips parted slightly in a faint, inviting smile. Exuding quiet Eastern elegance with an undercurrent of sensual surrender, she holds a dark handbag loosely in her left hand, arms relaxed at her sides, as if just emerging from a steamy onsen. The modern Japanese-style corridor features grey marble walls with flowing wave-like textures, deep stone floor embedded with warm yellow LED light strips along the base, casting a soft glow upwards and creating subtle shadows. The ceiling is flat off-white with a square vent and small downlights, providing even ambient lighting. At the far end, a blurred green-yellow light reveals a wooden sliding door or screen, hinting at deeper spaces. The entire scene is bathed in low-saturation warm tones, evoking a serene, zen-like yet intimately voyeuristic atmosphere. Central composition with the woman perfectly centered, strong perspective drawing the eye down the corridor. Foreground captures her face and bare upper body, midground her lower half and the walls with light strips, background fading into blurred depth. Side light from floor strips and distant ambient light sculpts her face with soft, crisp edges, creating gentle gradient transitions on walls and floor. The image has a casual, real-life snapshot feel, like a phone or compact camera shot, with subtle noise and natural color shifts, rich in detail without over-polishing. Color palette dominated by grey, black, white, accented by warm yellow tones, cold-warm contrast emphasizing her figure. Stable composition and clear focal point convey a tranquil, intimate, slightly forbidden moment, as if capturing a quiet traveler’s private, post-bath sensuality, full of story and emotional warmth.",
