        {
          "id": "krea2-52d15f45abaa2795b89f6bf2",
          "alias": "单女露胸米连衣裙花园微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a gray golf cart, her cream-white lace dress pooling around her hips, the fabric slipping off one shoulder to reveal smooth skin. Her deep brown hair cascades naturally, makeup fresh and natural, eyes soft and inviting as she gazes at the camera with a faint, knowing smile. One hand rests on the black leather seat, the other holds a small matching handbag. She wears simple cream sandals, her long bare legs extended gracefully. The frame captures the cart's silver rims, black tires, metal frame, and canopy edge. Behind her, lush green shrubs, tall trees, and a wooden trellis draped with climbing vines create a shady garden setting. A low, slightly angled shot emphasizes her figure and the depth of the scene. Dappled sunlight filters through leaves, casting soft, warm highlights on her skin and the dress. The overall palette is green and cream with gray accents. A gentle film grain and subtle lens distortion mimic a candid phone snapshot, giving it a relaxed, high-end resort atmosphere. The composition draws the eye along the cart's lines to her body, then to her gaze, exuding a quiet, sensual summer elegance.",
