        {
          "id": "krea2-edf84868b30b43646bcf7672",
          "alias": "单女露胸橙浴袍冷淡站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center frame, wearing a traditional Hanfu with a pale orange outer robe partially open, revealing her bare breasts and soft skin. The inner dark orange skirt flows silkily, with delicate gold embroidery at the collar and cuffs. A beaded brocade belt cinches her waist. Her hair is pinned high with antique hairpins, tassel earrings dangling. She looks calmly into the lens, slightly tilting her head, holding a white fluffy puppy plushie in her arms—round, cute, with black dot eyes and nose. Her pale yellow embroidered shoes peek out. The pose is natural, slight forward lean, hands cradling the toy in a stable triangle. The background is blurred, showing modern crew members wearing casual clothes, some with masks, some holding equipment, on a gray concrete floor with metal stands and prop boxes—a real film set. Soft, diffused light from an overcast day casts no harsh shadows, highlighting her face and the intricate Hanfu textures. Warm tones of orange, ochre, and beige dominate, contrasting with cool background hues. The composition guides the eye from her face to the plushie, then down her body. Fine chiaroscuro on fabric folds adds volume. The atmosphere is quiet and everyday, blending ancient elegance with modern set reality—a candid moment between takes, where the actress finds solace in the toy. Her serene expression suggests she is about to enter the next scene or has just finished one. The image balances history and contemporary life, warm yet restrained, timeless yet alive.",
