        {
          "id": "krea2-b348c3e25016a505b5e08fca",
          "alias": "单女露胸米外套纯色背景温柔站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young topless woman stands before a pure white background, her bare chest exposed beneath an unzipped beige jacket with fluffy lambswool collar. The jacket hangs open, revealing her nude torso; a dark blue denim skirt sits low on her hips, gold buttons tracing the front placket. In her right hand she holds a clear plastic bottle, lips parted around the straw as she drinks. Her left hand, clad in a pink velvet glove, hangs naturally at her side. Another hand reaches from the upper left frame, fingers gently combing through her long dark brown hair, motion slightly blurred to capture a dynamic instant. She stands center-right in a medium shot, head and upper body filling most of the frame, eyes cast downward in a calm, relaxed gaze. Soft, even light comes from the front-left, casting no harsh shadows. The overall palette is beige, deep blue, white, with accents of pink and gold. The scene feels like a candid backstage snapshot — slight film grain, muted color saturation, faint vignette at the edges. The atmosphere is quiet, casually intimate, and warmly natural, as if a photographer caught a genuine moment between takes.",
