        {
          "id": "krea2-bf489f2b9f8ce1205661b7ea",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙镜前自信站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with golden-highlighted long hair, straight bangs, and soft waves stands topless inside a red wooden doorframe, her hair partly braided and draped over one shoulder, catching the warm sunlight. She wears only a sheer white silk slip dress, unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare chest and the curve of her breasts; the dress features a heart pattern and \"need me\" text, with V-neck ties undone and a bow dangling. Multiple necklaces rest against her skin: a flower bead chain, a thin cross pendant, and a heart-shaped metal mirror charm. Her makeup is precise—pale blue eyeshadow, deep red lips—her gaze direct, expression lazy and confident. Her left hand rests lightly on the doorframe, right hand at her side, standing relaxed and elegant. Behind her, an open window frames a desert landscape with a lone Joshua tree under a cloudless blue sky. Full medium shot, subject slightly angled but facing the camera, centered left. The red doorframe shows peeling paint and exposed wood grain, adding vintage texture. A beige roller blind hangs above the window, edges frayed; a yellow billboard with blurred text is faintly visible on the right. Color palette dominated by red and white, contrasted with blue sky and desert tan. Natural light streams from the left, casting soft shadows across her face and body, creating highlights on the doorframe and her hair, giving a warm, layered mood. The image feels like a real candid snapshot, rich in detail and emotion, evoking a free, nostalgic Western vibe with a fashion-forward, intimate edge.",
