        {
          "id": "krea2-fb972fd6bf7efb42d4b41a27",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍摄影棚微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden rattan chair, wearing a sheer white qipao with blue floral patterns, the thin fabric clinging to her curves and revealing her bare skin beneath. The standing collar and black trim frame her neck and collarbone, with decorative ties hanging loosely. Her legs are crossed, right leg lifted, displaying a black high-heeled shoe with an ornate toe ornament. Her right hand holds an open folding fan painted with calligraphy and ink wash motifs, partially covering her bare chest and hinting at nudity. Her left hand gently touches her cheek, a subtle smile on her lips as she gazes directly at the viewer with inviting eyes. Her hair is styled in a high bun, adorned with small jeweled hairpins, her features delicate and skin fair. The background is a wall covered in deep blue traditional oil-paper umbrellas, layered with red tassels. To the right, a white wall and door frame are visible. The floor has light marble texture. The scene is bright and clean, composed as a medium shot with the figure on the left, creating a stable triangular composition. The eye moves from her face down along her body to her legs and shoes, emphasizing her curves and the clingy fabric of the qipao. Soft lighting from front left, likely natural light or a softbox, casts gentle shadows and defines her silhouette. The color palette is dominated by blue, white, and black, with strong contrast and rich layers. The atmosphere is warm and elegant, blending classical beauty with modern sensuality—a quiet, intimate moment captured with fine detail and balanced saturation, as if in a professional studio yet retaining an air of everyday allure.",
