        {
          "id": "krea2-f2f871eed88919a612b0c051",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣海滩沉思站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a sandy beach, her long, jet-black hair tousled by the sea breeze, strands drifting naturally in the wind. Her fair, delicate skin is flawless, with subtle, elegant makeup—soft pink eyeshadow and lips that complement the serene mood. She tilts her head slightly, eyes cast downward with a contemplative, peaceful expression, her right hand gently brushing a stray lock against her cheek. She wears a loose, light-blue off-shoulder knitted sweater, slipping to reveal one bare shoulder and the thin strap of a white lace bralette, the fabric airy and textured. Below, she is in tight, faded dark-blue jeans with natural creases and worn details, hugging her hips and thighs. The open coastline stretches behind her—blue-green water, gentle waves lapping the shore with white foam, a faint city skyline in the distant haze. The sky is bright gray-white, soft morning or evening light diffused evenly. The composition centers on her, with the figure slightly left, the right side open to show the sea and distant buildings. The wet sand in the foreground shows tidal lines and footprints, adding realism. Lighting comes from the front and side, softly sculpting her face and body with natural shadows. The mood is calm, romantic, with an artistic touch—cool tones of blue and gray dominate, warmed by her skin and the sand. Every detail, from the sweater’s knit to the denim’s frayed edges to the flowing hair, feels real. The pose is relaxed, her gaze inviting a focus on her expression, the background providing context—a fresh, gentle aesthetic ideal for fashion, portrait, or evocative art.",
