          "alias": "单女粉外套城市媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways outdoors at night, wearing a fluffy pink long faux-fur coat that is slightly unbuttoned, revealing a bare shoulder and the curve of one breast, the soft material catching warm golden streetlight. She holds a transparent umbrella in her right hand, its curved black handle visible; the umbrella's surface reflects blurred city lights and a faint hint of her silhouette underneath. Her wavy short brown hair lifts in a breeze, strands brushing her cheek. A pink-to-white gradient scarf wraps loosely around her neck, adding a soft, cozy contrast to her exposed skin. She tilts her head back slightly, lips parted, eyes half-lidded with a sensual, pensive gaze. The coat's hem lifts slightly, hinting at bare thighs above dark leather boots. In the foreground, her figure dominates the frame, with a rough-barked tree and scattered golden-brown autumn leaves around her feet. The background shows blurred distant city lights and a damp dark gray road with yellow safety lines receding into depth. Warm amber lighting from the front left sculpts her face and the fur texture, creating soft highlights and deep shadows. The overall mood is intimate, romantic, and subtly melancholic, with a cinematic snapshot aesthetic—slight grain, shallow depth of field, and a voyeuristic feel.",
