          "prompt": "A young woman with soft, pale blonde hair and straight bangs sits in an ornate antique carved armchair, her expression gentle yet mysterious, delicate makeup with pale lips, flawless fair skin. She wears a tall pointed purple witch’s hat tilted to one side, trimmed with white lace and violet floral patterns, revealing her forehead and elegant features. Her upper body is bare, her breasts fully exposed, the white corset unlaced and hanging open at her sides, the purple satin short skirt hiked high up her thighs, gold embellishments at the chest, puffed purple sleeves with lace cuffs. A black waistband with gold filigree cinches her waist, white gauze panels fall from her hips embroidered with purple vines. Her right hand is gloved in black leather, her left hand rests casually on her bare thigh. She crosses her legs, wearing black stockings and black heels with white lace ankle ties. A circular badge with a purple rose is pinned to her right knee. She sits slightly turned, her left arm draped over the chair’s armrest, pose elegant yet languid. In the foreground left, a stack of aged books, spines yellowed, covers deep blue and brown, a few open with visible handwritten text and illustrations. A single white candle burns beside them, flame flickering warmly. To the right, another lit candle surrounded by blooming red roses and purple hydrangeas, leaves lush. Mid-ground: the golden carved armchair with intricate Baroque details, deep crimson velvet cushion. Background: dark wooden wall with a blurred classical oil painting in gold frame, a large metal candelabra holding multiple burning white candles. More floral arrangements and dark red drapes visible deeper. Warm yellow light from multiple candles casts strong chiaroscuro, highlighting her face, the curves of her bare torso, the folds of fabric, the book pages and flowers. A complex Persian rug on the floor, reddish-brown with geometric and floral motifs. Centrally composed, the subject slightly left, leading the eye from foreground books and flowers to her, then to the background candelabra and drapes. Dominant colors: purple, white, gold, red, brown. Atmosphere: warm, romantic, mysterious — gothic magic academy style. Fine texture, rich detail, high-quality photograph look, 85mm portrait lens, f/2.8, shallow depth of field, soft diffused light, subtle film grain and low saturation, nostalgic vintage feel. The image resembles a fantasy novel cover, capturing a witch’s midnight reverie in her study, poetic and imaginative.",
