          "alias": "单女全裸蓝内衣椅上害羞坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in an outdoor café on a woven rattan chair, wearing only a sheer light blue lace bralette that barely covers her nipples, her bare shoulders and collarbones fully exposed, the delicate lace semitransparent against her skin. She holds a golden puff pastry topped with bright strawberries and orange jam in her right hand, her long fingers polished with pale pink nail polish. With her left hand, she holds her phone taking a selfie, her wrist bent gracefully. She smiles warmly at the camera, her eyes bright and lined with sharp black cat-eye makeup, lashes thick and curled, cheeks flushed with a soft pink blush, lips a nude pink slightly parted. Her deep brown hair is braided thickly over her right shoulder, loose waves catching light. Small gold earrings and a slim rose gold chain necklace adorn her. The café background features black-and-white geometric floor tiles, another rattan chair, metal-framed tables, dark green walls with vintage decor. Soft sunlight streams from the left, casting gentle highlights across her skin, creating a warm honey-toned atmosphere. The composition is a close-up portrait, with the pastry and hand in the foreground, her body and chair in the midground, background slightly blurred. The overall mood is leisurely, sensual, and intimate, with a high-resolution photographic quality and subtle film grain.",
