          "alias": "单女露胸蓝连衣裙城市媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a glass windowsill, her blue-and-white Lolita dress slipping off her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts with pink nipples. The dress's white lace trim and pink satin bow still adorn her waist; the heart-shaped neckline now frames her cleavage. Her golden hair is partly pinned in an elegant updo, loose strands falling. She wears delicate makeup with bold eyes, thick lashes, and glossy pink lips, plus a pink heart sticker on her cheek. Her gaze is soft yet sultry, lips slightly parted, confident and relaxed. One leg is bent, knee drawn to her chest; her left arm rests on her knee, hand lightly touching her ankle, body angled to showcase her curves. Foreground captures her bare skin and dress details; midground shows the glass window frame and a clear city skyline with blue sky, white clouds, and bright sunlight streaming from the right, casting soft highlights on her face and body. The composition is a close-up portrait with shallow depth of field, blurring the background, colors dominated by blue, pink, and white. The lighting is natural, shadows subtle, with a dreamy everyday aesthetic as if captured on a phone camera, slight filter grain, and faint pink hand-drawn lines at the edges, plus floating red hearts and stars in the air, adding a romantic, playful, and youthful vibe. The image feels like a personal, intimate moment—sweet, tender, and explicitly adult.",
