          "alias": "单女全裸咖啡厅专注坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table in an upscale restaurant, completely nude from the waist up, her body partially concealed by the angle of her phone as she takes a mirror selfie. Her deep brown hair is styled in a side braid secured with a silver clip, and her makeup is polished and natural—subtle eyeliner, soft lips. She wears a delicate gold necklace and bracelet, her right hand holding a pink phone case, her left hand brushing a strand of hair from her forehead, her gaze focused on the screen—confident and relaxed. In the foreground, breakfast is laid out: white bowls with granola, strawberries, and peaches, a glass of fresh orange juice, silver cutlery on a bamboo mat, and a beige woven handbag to the left. The background shows an open kitchen with chefs in white uniforms, a large black metal exhaust hood trimmed with gold above, and other diners in the distance. Natural light streams through windows casting soft shadows across the table and her bare skin. Warm tones dominate—light wood ceiling planks, geometric-patterned rug. Centered composition with the subject slightly right, the phone drawing the eye, shallow depth of field blurring the background. Shot with a professional camera, 85mm lens, f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 200, rich detail and natural color saturation, capturing a casual elegant moment of modern urban life.",
