          "alias": "单女绿浴袍室内沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A classical Oriental beauty in exquisite Hanfu sits indoors, her hair piled high in an elaborate ancient style, adorned with intricate gold hairpins and pearl tassels, a few loose strands falling naturally at her temples. She wears a pale green cross-collar robe, open and discarded from one shoulder, revealing bare skin and the soft curve of her breast, the outer brocade cloak with blue-green leaf patterns loosely draped, gold thread tracing veins. A red brocade sash with gold embroidered peony cinches her waist, a jade bead chain hanging below; a black jade bracelet on one wrist, hands resting on her knees, fingers long and elegant. The cuffs of soft pink silk are rolled, showing delicate texture. Background: a hazy blue gauze curtain, warm natural light streaming from the side behind, creating soft rim lighting on her silhouette, a faint golden halo around her form. In the distance, wooden window lattice casts dappled geometric patterns. Medium close-up composition, subject slightly left-center, her gaze lowered, eyes deep and contemplative. Focus on face and clothing details, background softly blurred. Tones: cyan, blue, pink, gold, harmonious. Light and shadow transition naturally, chiaroscuro balanced, creating a quiet, noble classical atmosphere – like a meticulous ancient painting or a high-definition portrait shot in soft light, strongly evocative of Oriental aesthetics, conveying a gentle, serene, and dignified nobility, as if one can hear the rustle of silk and the flow of time.",
