        {
          "id": "krea2-0d5095b28651da7c1c7e0b26",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔博物馆媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her deep brown hair partially falling over her face, the rest swept back, revealing her delicate facial features and striking eyes. Her makeup is flawless, with clear eyeliner, thick lashes, and naturally pink full lips. She looks directly at the camera with a cool, confident expression. She wears a dark blue denim jacket, unbuttoned and hanging open, exposing her bare chest, her breasts fully visible, nipples erect, with metal buttons and pocket details. The left sleeve is black with yellow and white abstract patterns, the right sleeve reveals gray lining. Underneath, she wears nothing else, her skin warm and smooth. She pairs the jacket with dark blue jeans, a black leather belt with a simple metal buckle. Her right hand is tucked into her pocket, her left hand holds a colorful handbag predominantly pink, covered in multicolored round sequins and beads forming a mosaic, with a gold metal plate in the center. She stands in front of rows of light brown wooden benches, arranged neatly, with a warm orange-yellow wall behind her, slightly textured, with soft gradients of light. Light comes from upper left, casting natural shadows on the wall and behind her, creating a warm, soft atmosphere. The composition is centered, medium shot, from waist to knees, the handbag at her side balancing the frame. Foreground highlights the subject and bag, midground includes benches and floor, background blurs the wall and distant seats, enhancing depth. Focus on her face, bare chest, and clothing details, especially the jacket sleeve and bag. Lighting is delicate, moderate contrast, warm tones evoke a high-fashion runway or art exhibition feel. The image looks realistic, shot on professional camera, with cinematic color and detail, yet retains a sense of everyday amateur warmth. Stable composition, harmonious colors, layered, conveying a modern urban woman's independence, confidence, and sensual style.",
