          "alias": "单女露胸红泳装窗边困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by the window of a wooden cabin, her long black wavy hair adorned with a pink tropical flower. She is topless, her bare skin glowing in the soft light, with a red bikini bottom tied at her hips. She turns slightly, one hand resting on her forehead, the other on the wooden window frame—elegant and relaxed. Her skin is healthy and luminous, with delicate tattoos winding across her stomach and thigh, adding an artistic edge. Her expression is calm, slightly dreamy, eyes locked on the viewer as if sharing a silent connection. In the foreground, two beds with white sheets; a woven bag and dried flowers rest on the left bed, a white pillow on the right. The middle ground frames her and the dark, warm wood of the window. Outside, dense tropical greenery, dappled sunlight filtering through leaves. The cabin interior shows rustic wooden walls with vintage birdcage and bird prints, evoking nostalgia and pastoral charm. The composition is centered, with the woman slightly right, balanced by the two beds. Sunlight streams warmly from the window, casting soft shadows on the floor and walls. The palette is warm browns, yellow-green curtains, and the red of her bikini tie—vivid yet harmonious. The atmosphere is lazy, tropical, intimate. The image feels like a real travel photograph: natural light, shallow depth of field, delicate bokeh, preserving textures and lived-in warmth. A sensual, story-rich moment of quiet summer indulgence.",
