          "alias": "单女露胸浴袍摄影棚媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in opulent Hanfu sits gracefully within crimson drapes. She wears a red-and-black traditional ensemble: the outer robe of rich red velvet is partly open, revealing a low-cut black brocade bodice that exposes her full, bare breasts and creamy cleavage. Gold trim and intricate embroidery adorn the collar and cuffs. A wide brocade sash cinches her waist, dangling tassels and beaded ornaments. Her elaborate high bun is adorned with silver hairpins, pearl step-swaying ornaments, and gem-studded hair sticks. Long tassel earrings hang beside her neck, layered with multicolored pearl chains and jade pendants. Her delicate face, pale skin, and vividly painted red lips gaze with a gentle yet sultry smile. One hand rests lightly on her forehead, the other casually touches her exposed upper chest. In the foreground, cascading red silk curtains are strung with strings of white pearls, framing the composition. She sits with legs together, hands folded on her lap, posture demure yet provocatively bare. The background is heavy red silk drapery with soft folds and subtle golden patterns, adding luxury. Center-symmetrical composition, the subject enclosed by red curtains and pearl strands, creating an intimate, ceremonial atmosphere. Soft, diffused lighting from above-front highlights her facial features, the sheen of skin, and the gleam of jewels, with natural shadow transitions. Dominant red tones accented by black, gold, and white, rich and festive. The light catches the fabric and beads, enhancing texture and depth. The mood is both solemn and sensual, evoking an ancient bridal chamber or imperial celebration, blending realistic detail with dreamlike allure—like a high-end studio portrait with a natural, handheld feel.",
