          "prompt": "A young woman in a cream-colored wide-sleeved ancient robe, layered under a thick, fluffy white fur coat, its plush collar and cuffs brushing softly against her skin. Her jet-black hair is swept into a classical updo, a vermilion mark centered on her brow, her makeup precise—elongated winged eyeliner, dense curled lashes, full crimson lips. Her expression is focused, with a trace of melancholy. She holds a small black ceramic bowl filled with pale golden liquid, her right index finger lightly tracing the rim as if performing a ritual. A silver tassel earring dangles from her left ear, swaying subtly. The foreground is a sharp close-up of her face and the bowl; midground reveals her half-body and the snowy set around her. In the blurred background, crew members in heavy winter gear—some holding cameras, others with equipment—stand near a green tent. Snow blankets the ground, flakes drifting through the air, creating a cold, still atmosphere. The composition is a tight close-up, her figure slightly right of center, guiding focus to her face and the object in her hands. Soft natural light from an overcast sky casts even, diffused illumination, accentuating her contours and the fabric's details. The color palette is cool: whites, cream, black, with red accents at her brow and lips adding focus. Shadows are gentle, with no harsh contrast, giving a realistic, cinematic feel. The scene mixes ancient elegance with modern filmmaking—a moment caught on a cold winter day, both a time-travel performance and a documentary of behind-the-scenes work, charged with artistic tension and narrative depth. Her robe is slightly parted at the chest, hinting at the swell of her breasts beneath, the fur and fabric clinging to her form.",
