          "alias": "单女浴袍街道媚态站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an intricately embroidered traditional Hanfu stands in an ancient-style street, her long black hair styled in an elegant bun adorned with pink and white floral ornaments and tiny bead tassels, side braids falling naturally. She gently holds one strand of hair with both hands, her gaze soft and seductive, a subtle smile playing on her lips, exuding a quiet, sensual Eastern charm. Her Hanfu is a vibrant cross-collar robe with wide flowing sleeves, sheer pink outer cape, and a bright yellow inner top, the bodice pulled open to reveal her smooth shoulders and the top of her cleavage. A deep sash cinches her waist, golden patterns accenting, and her white chest panel features an embroidered lion surrounded by blue and orange auspicious clouds. A simple gold necklace grazes her décolletage. The background is a blurred ancient architecture with warm yellow lanterns hanging under eaves, casting soft halos. Distant lights create bokeh, blending warm glow with cool twilight hues. Mid-close-up composition, the woman slightly off-center, head tilted, eyes looking off-frame, inviting. Focus on her face and the exposed skin of her décolletage and shoulders, with deep background blur. Lighting from side and above, softly sculpting her curves, with natural shadow transitions, creating a calm, intimate dusk atmosphere. The image exudes classical aesthetic, like a courtesan from a painting, with a modern, lustful twist. Fine-grained texture, moderate color saturation, high-definition yet with subtle grain and natural depth of field, blending fantasy with authentic, intimate realism.",
