          "alias": "单女露胸粉围裙商店媚态坐吃",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a wooden booth at a Japanese ramen shop, her dark brown chin-length hair with soft natural waves falling loosely. She stares directly at the camera, one eye slightly squinted, lips pressed together in a playful, satisfied smirk. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, the soft warm light catching the curves of her skin. She holds black chopsticks lifting a tangle of golden noodles high from a steaming bowl of ramen, while her other hand grips a wooden ladle filled with clear broth. In the foreground, a blue-and-white ceramic bowl of ramen topped with sliced pork, green onions, and ginger; beside it a small dish of pink pickled radish and a white cup of lemon tea with two lemon slices on a patterned saucer. The table is set with a Japanese-printed placemat and an unopened seasoning packet. Background shows a warm, dimly lit restaurant interior with wooden counter and stacked dishes, a server in a pink apron blurred in the distance. Shallow depth of field focuses on her face and the bowl, with soft overhead and side lighting creating natural highlights and shadows on her skin and food, enhancing texture and depth. Warm color palette of beige, brown, and gold with blue-and-white accents. Slight grain and natural imperfections give a candid, lived-in feel, capturing a cozy, intimate meal where the viewer’s gaze is drawn to her exposed upper body and the sensual act of eating.",
