        {
          "id": "krea2-39d2498f4214e043b7cecbe9",
          "alias": "单女全裸米毛衣窗边媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude by a warm indoor fireplace, her long black hair cascading over her shoulders, her body bathed in the soft glow of crackling flames. She wears only an open, fluffy cream-colored long cardigan, revealing her bare breasts and smooth skin, her nipples slightly peaked from the warmth. In her hands, she holds a simple white ceramic mug, her pose relaxed and elegant—her right leg bent, left leg extended, bare feet in white knitted socks. Her gaze is calm and deep, directly into the lens. The electronic fireplace blazes with orange-red firelight, casting flickering shadows across her thighs and the hem of the cardigan. On the hearth lies a thick black-white-gray fluffy mat, beside which sits a giant gray plush bunny with droopy ears, looking endearingly goofy. Through the window behind, a snowy yard unfolds: a reddish-brown wooden cabin with snow-covered roof, golden fairy lights hanging under the eaves, a small decorated Christmas tree with a star on top, and a wooden rocking chair nearby. The scene is bathed in soft morning or late-afternoon light—a pale blue sky gradient—with sunlight streaming in from the window, illuminating the stone wall, snow, and architectural details. Composition is center-left on the nude woman as the focal point, the warm firelight contrasting with the cold blue-white outdoor snow, creating a strong temperature dichotomy. The texture of the fluffy cardigan and skin against the wood, stone, and snow adds rich tactile layers. The flames at the bottom guide the eye upward toward her bare body, emphasizing the core theme of intimate warmth and sensual comfort. The overall atmosphere blends coziness, stillness, holiday cheer, and modern lifestyle aesthetics, as if captured for a winter travel photoshoot or a high-end lifestyle magazine—realistic yet idealized, with natural light, moderate color saturation, and fine details. The image carries cinematic quality and emotional tension, combining a personal intimate moment with an expansive environmental narrative, perfect for expressing winter healing, home warmth, and the anticipation of the holidays.",
