        {
          "id": "krea2-b5442a81a781f202a7b3976b",
          "alias": "单女舞者黑短裤摄影棚媚态张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A young female dancer in a spacious, bright dance studio performs a deep split, her body clad only in a sheer floral-pattern ballet leotard that clings to her breasts, revealing erect nipples and the outline of her vulva beneath the thin fabric. She wears a pair of tiny black shorts, flesh-toned ballet tights, and black thigh-high stockings. Her legs are spread completely in a perfect split, one foot pointed sharply, the other heel on the floor with toes curled upward. Her arms lift gracefully overhead in an elegant arch, fingers slightly parted like blooming petals. Her gaze is direct and calm, lips pink and slightly parted, skin fair and luminous under the soft overhead LEDs. Her hair is swept into a tight bun, with a few strands falling across her forehead. The low-angle shot makes her silhouette stretch tall and powerful, her spine arched subtly. The scene is clean and minimalist: gray anti-slip floor with faint reflections, a full wall mirror behind her capturing her bare back and the studio's other side—ceiling recessed lights, a circular clock, glass doors, metal railings. The overall color palette is white, gray, black, creating a cool, focused atmosphere. Soft, diffused lighting from multiple LED panels eliminates harsh shadows, highlighting every curve of her body, the tension in her thighs, the gleam of moisture on her skin. The image feels like a stolen moment of private practice—intimate, professional, and deeply sensual.",
