        {
          "id": "krea2-d98eca4b5ecf4e89c5e1bcf1",
          "alias": "单女绿上衣小径媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "In a large outdoor stadium seating area, a young woman in a revealing cheerleader outfit stands before white plastic seats, her pose sensual and confident. She turns slightly, right hand gently touching a massive banner behind her, left hand resting on her hip, a soft teasing smile on her lips as she locks eyes with the viewer. Her outfit—meant for support but now stripped of modesty—consists of a cropped green and white top that barely covers her breasts, the fabric pulled taut over her nipples, with long sleeves and white stripe trim at shoulders and cuffs. The words \"Green Brave\" are printed across her chest, but the top is unbuttoned, exposing her bare midriff and the curve of her cleavage. She wears a white pleated micro-miniskirt with green piping, so short it reveals the tops of her thighs, and thigh-high white boots with green laces and metal buckles, the boots ending just below her ass. Her black hair falls naturally, straight bangs across her forehead, a small green beret perched atop her head, green hoop earrings dangling. The background: a large banner featuring an anime-style girl with blue-purple hair, green eyes, blushing cheeks, hands cupping her face, wearing a light jacket over a yellow top. To the right, bold Japanese characters \"村上枫\" and English \"Green Brave\" with yellow-to-green gradient, stars and sparkles. Above, \"埼玉トヨペット Green Brave\" logo and a smaller poster reading \"五十嵐みさ\". The scene is mid-shot, the woman on the right taking a third of the frame, the banner dominating the left. Foreground: empty white plastic seats, weathered and stained with rust on metal supports. Midground: the woman and banner, a slight space between them but connected by her gaze. Background: stadium structure with dark gray canopy and metal frame, a sliver of yellow at top, pale blue sky with thin clouds, bright soft daylight from upper right, casting natural shadows on her body, highlighting her curves and the folds of her skimpy outfit, the banner colors vivid. Overall atmosphere: playful, erotic, authentic candid feel, as if snapped by a fan at a live event, camera slightly tilted, rich detail, balanced composition, visual path from her face to the banner text and image, down to the seats, clear light direction, realistic amateur quality, strong visual appeal with artistic and documentary value.",
