        {
          "id": "krea2-f4c5d1c1956abece13a86569",
          "alias": "单女警服霓虹夜景媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A female police officer in a tight blue uniform stands beside a white patrol car on a neon-lit city street at night. She wears her cap, long hair flowing, a short skirt, black stockings, and high heels, leaning seductively against the car door. Her hands lightly grip an object, her expression focused and calm. The uniform reads \"POLICE\" with visible shoulder patches, emphasizing authority and allure. The white-and-blue police car has Korean markings, its headlights bright, reflecting the surrounding neon lights. In the background, multi-story buildings display signs like \"HUDSON\" and \"PHOTO STUDIO.\" Pink, blue, and green neon signs flash along the street. Distant crowds blur, some talking, some taking photos. A red taxi's taillights glow dimly. A metal structure with a Korean sign stands on the left. Slight lens distortion and vignetting add realism. The low-angle shot emphasizes her tall figure and the car's imposing presence, with strong depth from the metal pole in the foreground to the buildings behind. Lighting from street lamps and neon creates soft, layered shadows, highlighting her face and body from the side. The scene feels like a candid snapshot blending daily life with artistic composition. Cool blue and warm yellow tones contrast vividly but harmoniously, rich in details from uniform wrinkles to ground reflections and blurred text on distant signs. The atmosphere is calm yet story-laden, evoking the sounds of distant traffic, voices, and neon hum, immersing the viewer in urban night life.",
