        {
          "id": "krea2-ce70516633c9fb33d4824f36",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市微笑倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "Nightfall, the deep blue sky spreads like ink across the frame, city lights flickering faintly in the distance, creating a quiet, slightly detached urban atmosphere. A young woman leans sideways against the bridge railing, her posture elegant and natural. Her long black hair falls softly over her shoulders, bangs lightly brushing her forehead, a small silver hairpin glinting coldly in the dim light. Her delicate features are well-defined, a subtle, charming smile curling at the corners of her mouth. She gazes toward the camera, eyes clear with a hint of playful confidence. She wears a cream-white knit short cardigan—texture visible, neckline crisscross-tied, over a black lace camisole top, creating layered depth. A high-waist black patent leather mini skirt hugs her hips, its glossy surface reflecting ambient light. Her long legs are toned and straight; her right leg bends, foot resting on the railing's crossbar, left leg hanging naturally. She wears black over-the-knee matte leather boots that cling to her legs, toes slightly pointed, exuding strong fashion and power. Her left hand rests lightly on the railing, right hand hanging naturally, fingers slender with neat nails; a simple metal bracelet adorns her wrist. A small black square bag is slung diagonally across her shoulder, clean lines with visible zipper and metal details. In the blurred background, city streets and distant pedestrians fade into soft outlines. Gray paving stones with white lane markings cover the ground; the deep brown metal railing shows slight wear and a patina of age. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot to accentuate her figure and presence, with her positioned slightly right of center, body tilted for dynamic balance. The foreground features crisp railing detail; midground holds the subject; background gradually blurs, drawing focus to her. Light comes from an artificial source above right—possibly a streetlamp or building light—soft but directional, illuminating her face, arms, and legs, creating subtle shadow transitions on skin and clothing. The patent leather skirt and boots catch bright highlights, enhancing texture. The overall palette is cool—black, white, gray, deep blue—with sparse metallic reflections and warm skin tones, evoking the cool, modern, slightly intimate feel of a night cityscape. The scene feels story-rich, like a candid moment from daily life, yet deliberately styled—like an amateur camera's real street photography, retaining authenticity and texture. Image details are rich, layers distinct, visual impact strong, full of artistic tension and emotional expression.",
