          "alias": "单女露胸白旗袍街道微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a lively street market, wearing a short white modified cheongsam top that leaves her midriff bare, the fabric textured with delicate embossed patterns and lace trim, with red frog buttons at the collar and placket that match the red piping along the neckline. Her hair is styled in two cute double buns tied with bright red silk ribbons, a few loose strands falling naturally. She turns slightly sideways, a gentle smile on her face, eyes clear and slightly shy as she looks at the camera, skin pale and luminous, makeup fresh and natural with soft lips. The top is partly unbuttoned, revealing her bare breasts and a hint of nipple, the red buttons contrasting against her skin. Foreground is a clear half-body close-up, with the woman occupying the center-right of the frame. The background is a blurred street scene with stalls, pedestrians, red umbrellas, and hanging lanterns, creating a lively yet authentic ambiance. Light comes from the warm afternoon sun, softly illuminating her face and clothing, casting natural highlights and shadows from the upper left, giving depth to her features and subtle chiaroscuro on the fabric folds. The shallow depth of field blurs the background into soft layers of warm yellows, red accents, and silhouettes. The overall palette is white dominated, accented with red and warm golden sunlight, evoking a cozy, tranquil yet vibrant street atmosphere. The composition is balanced with intentional negative space, her posture relaxed, drawing the viewer’s gaze to her facial expression and the sensual details of her partly open top. The style mimics a candid street shot taken with an amateur film camera, retaining a slightly grainy texture and natural vignette at the edges, enhancing the retro feel. Color saturation is moderate, avoiding over-brightness, resulting in a down-to-earth yet stirring visual experience.",
