          "prompt": "A dignified middle-aged woman in exquisite ancient Chinese court attire, her face elegant yet troubled, eyes gazing into the distance with a pensive, worried expression. Her long black hair is swept into an elaborate high bun adorned with gold ornaments and purple flowers, topped with a magnificent coronet. Pearl earrings dangle from her ears, and a turquoise necklace graces her neck. Her deep purple robe, trimmed with a fur collar and embroidered with dark patterns, is worn open to reveal her red brocade inner garment and the soft curve of her breasts, the red silk sash loosely tied at her waist. She stands slightly turned, her posture graceful and reserved, one hand resting near her collarbone as if lost in thought. The foreground captures her face and upper body in sharp detail, while the background fades into a blur of ancient wooden architecture with latticed windows and dark beams, evoking a historical atmosphere. Soft side lighting sculpts her features and the folds of her half-opened robe, creating rich chiaroscuro. Warm tones contrast with the cool violet-gray of her attire. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with her positioned on the right, leaving space on the left for visual depth. The shot mimics a professional film camera with a large-aperture prime lens, shallow depth of field, fine grain, and subtle film texture, resembling a high-quality TV drama still. The mood is quiet, deep, and sensual, blending classical elegance with modern cinematic precision and a palpable emotional tension.",
