          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude on a dark green fabric sofa, her red knit cardigan discarded beside her, white inner gone, only light blue jeans and white thick-soled sneakers remaining. She rests her left hand on her cheek, right hand lightly touching her bare thigh, gazing at the camera with a soft, thoughtful, yet seductive expression. Her wavy hair is partially braided and falls over her shoulder, small silver earrings visible. The foreground reveals the dark green woven texture of the sofa and a red cushion with white text. Behind, a soft pale green wall shows faint plant silhouettes; a small white side table holds a red cylindrical ornament, and a tall red gourd-shaped vase gleams with a glossy finish. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, focusing on her face and exposed upper body. Bright, even front lighting enhances her skin, creating strong red-green contrast while white elements balance the warmth. The image feels like a candid studio shot, with subtle film grain and natural depth of field, conveying an intimate, vibrant, and artfully real atmosphere.",
