          "prompt": "A nude young female figure skater on an ice rink, performing an elegant spin with her body leaning forward, right leg extended straight back, left leg bent supporting her weight, arms gracefully curved outward—right hand reaching forward, left hand to the side, fingers naturally splayed. Her expression is focused and tender, gazing ahead with a subtle smile, hair neatly pinned up, revealing delicate features and flawless pale skin. Ankles bare, no skates, completely nude with nipples erect and a shaved pubic area; the ice reflects cool blue light, her skin glistening with sweat. Blue-tinted stage lighting with soft bokeh and light flares creates a dreamy atmosphere. The ice surface mirrors cold-toned shadows and flowing light trails, enhancing depth. Center-symmetric composition, subject slightly above center, shallow depth of field blurring background. Light from above and front casts soft highlights and shadows, emphasizing her nude contours and texture. Overall color palette blue and white, cool tones with strong contrast, conveying a pure yet sensual artistic experience. The captured moment freezes dynamic motion, blending action and stillness, showcasing the grace and power of figure skating—like a silent poem, a flowing painting. Professional-level cinematic quality with rich detail, layered depth, natural light transitions, yet retains a slightly grainy, amateur-captured realism, making the scene both dreamlike and intimate, as if the viewer sits at rinkside witnessing this performance of beauty and skill.",
