        {
          "id": "krea2-2b0cd3eba17b120fe232c7ac",
          "alias": "单女半褪蓝连帽衫舞台媚态蹲拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young female model crouches beside a glossy black Ferrari supercar, her light brown hair cascading over one shoulder, makeup flawless with crimson lips parted slightly, eyes soft and seductive as she gazes into the lens. Her left hand rests under her chin, right hand hangs loosely, white manicured nails catching the light. She wears a loose sky-blue hoodie draped off one shoulder, revealing a thin black spaghetti-strap camisole that barely contains her breasts, nipples subtly visible through the fabric. A tight black leather mini shorts hugs her hips, thighs exposed, legs crossed with the right leg forward, left behind. High-shine black patent leather platform boots with thick heels and chunky treads encase her calves. The Ferrari sits beside her, scissor doors slightly ajar, sleek lines reflecting the showroom's spotlights, yellow prancing horse emblem prominent on black bodywork, large multi-spoke black forged wheels with blue brake calipers visible. The scene is an indoor auto expo: deep gray carpeted stage, metal truss ceiling, white \"MCC-Complete\" sign hanging above. Background shows display wheels on walls, some with gold/silver accents. A blurred figure in a gray coat stands in the far distance. Mid-close framing: model on the left-center, car dominating the right, legs and boots sharply in the foreground. Lighting from overhead spots is bright but soft, creating even illumination with glossy reflections on the car's surface. The atmosphere blends futuristic luxury with high-fashion eroticism. Color palette dominated by black, white, gray, with accents of sky blue and red. The composition guides the eye from her face down her body to the Ferrari's details, then up to the brand signage, balancing stability and tension. The image mimics a spontaneous exhibition shot with slight noise and natural dynamic range, yet retains professional lighting and composition, merging commercial appeal with raw sensuality.",
