          "prompt": "A young woman with smooth long brown curly hair, adorned with red rabbit ear headband featuring red bow and gold accents, stands before a white window frame. She wears a revealing red-and-white Japanese maid outfit: the white short-sleeve top is pulled down to expose her bare breasts, with red trim at collar and cuffs; a red sash with tassels and knot cinches her waist; a red pleated miniskirt with white edging and black fine line patterns flares around her hips. Her pale flawless skin, delicate features, and bright clear eyes convey gentle playfulness. Her lips are slightly parted with light pink gloss, natural fresh makeup highlighting youthful vitality. Her body is turned slightly toward the camera, right hand resting on a white ladder beside her, left hand placed naturally over her chest. The skirt lifts to reveal slender bare legs with even skin tone. Interior setting bathed in soft natural light from the left window, creating warm, serene atmosphere. White window frame with clean lines, light wooden floor with subtle sheen. Medium shot, composition with ladder in foreground and window in background adding depth. Soft realistic lighting with gentle shadows, overall palette of red, white, light brown, and beige. Slight grain and mild bokeh give an amateur everyday photo feel, warm and healing with a cute girl-next-door vibe.",
