        {
          "id": "krea2-f47c7494f36604debb3ee258",
          "alias": "单女黑女仆装床媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a black Lolita-style maid ensemble, her head adorned with a cat-ear headband trimmed in black faux fur and white lace. Her long brown hair falls naturally with blunt bangs, her makeup precise—sharp eyeliner, full lips—as she gazes directly at the viewer with a soft, seductive expression. Her hands cup her cheeks, fingers slightly curled, striking a coy yet teasing pose. She wears a short black lace top with cross-bindings across her chest, white lace trims at the collar and cuffs, and voluminous black feather sleeves on her shoulders. Below, high-waisted black shorts with white lace and cross-bindings at the hem. Her legs are sheathed in white fishnet stockings, each ankle tied with a small bow. She sits on the edge of a bed draped in cream gauze fabric, leaning forward, right leg bent and lifted, left leg extended, forming an elegant S-curve. To the left foreground, a large bouquet of blue, purple, white, and yellow flowers mixed with green leaves, interspersed with a few candles, creating a romantic, warm atmosphere. The background is an ornate interior: pale cream walls with soft curved lines and classical moldings, a gold-framed mirror reflecting part of the room—glimpses of a headboard and cushioned seat—and an arched, latticed doorway glowing with warm light. The scene is lit by soft, warm light from the right, casting gentle shadows and highlighting the textures of lace, feathers, and gauze. Composition places the subject slightly right of center, with the foreground flowers and architectural lines drawing the eye. The overall mood is dreamy yet intimate, strongly Japanese sweet-style, as if captured by a professional camera as a high-quality commercial portrait, yet retaining a candid, real-life feel. The image is richly detailed, with balanced color saturation, from the textures of the fabrics to the carefully arranged environment, blending fantasy and reality into an artistic visual experience.",
