          "alias": "单女露胸蓝衬衫楼梯微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an indoor staircase, her long black hair with straight bangs cascading around her face. She flashes a bright, inviting smile, eyes warm and direct, locked on the camera. Her right hand forms a playful, slightly curled gesture, a leopard-print hair tie around her wrist. She wears a light blue striped shirt unbuttoned and open, revealing a dark blue T-shirt underneath with white lettering—but the shirt is pushed aside, leaving her topless, her bare breasts exposed with firm nipples visible. A dark blue pleated skirt with white and light blue stripe trim hugs her hips, the hem rising high as she crosses her long, toned legs on the steps. A blue-and-white jacket adorned with patches and embroidery is tied loosely around her waist. Orange-and-white sneakers and dark blue socks with white stripes complete the look. The stairs are covered in black velvet, each step edged with gold metal, contrasting with the silver railing and white textured wall. Soft light streams from the left, casting natural shadows on her right side and the staircase, creating depth. Mid-shot composition, the woman slightly offset left, body angled, head tilted toward the lens. Foreground shows her and the steps, mid-ground her full figure and more stairs, background the wall and railing. Warm, soft lighting; blue, white, black tones with orange and gold accents. The image feels like an everyday amateur photo, slight film grain, natural color saturation, detailed textures—her lively expression, the fabric creases, smooth skin, and the crisp shadows. The scene is fresh, youthful, and sensually intimate.",
