          "prompt": "A young woman stands by an indoor window at dusk, wearing a tight black knit top with the top two buttons undone, revealing the soft curve of her cleavage, paired with a high-waist black leather mini skirt hugging her hips, a slim dark leather belt cinching her waist, and a deep brown leather shoulder bag slung across her body. Her right hand rests on the windowsill, body slightly turned, head tilted back to look over her shoulder at the camera with a sultry, knowing smile, eyes half-lidded and dreamy. Long black hair falls sleekly over her shoulders, catching warm light that casts soft highlights on the strands. The foreground shows the transparent glass window frame and sill, with blurred city lights and skyline reflecting on the surface, creating depth. She is full-body, centered slightly right, with the camera at waist level capturing her legs in dark sheer stockings and pointed black heels. Soft golden light from the right sculpts her face, nose, and arms with subtle highlights, while leaving shadows on her left side and neck. The background features a twilight city skyline fading from orange-yellow near the horizon to pale blue above, with thin pink-purple clouds; a few street lamps and building lights begin to glow, dotting the quiet evening. The mood is warm and melancholic, with a cinematic, slightly grainy film quality, low saturation, mimicking a full-frame sensor like Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV, 85mm f/2.0 lens, shallow depth of field blurring the background, shutter 1/60s, ISO 400. The composition follows the rule of thirds and golden ratio, emphasizing the woman's sensual stillness and urban solitude, like a frozen moment of intimate self-reflection.",
