          "alias": "单女白旗袍椅上媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a classical Chinese interior, wearing a white modified cheongsam dress with black laces at the collar and straps, a deep front cutout revealing her cleavage and the curve of her breasts, the short hemline clinging to her thighs and showcasing her long legs. Her long black hair falls naturally over one shoulder, adorned with a red-and-white flower pin; delicate pearl earrings dangle from her ears, red bead bracelets and a white bangle wrap her wrist. Her left hand rests on her knee, her right hand holds a white folding fan, pose elegant yet inviting. She gazes directly at the camera with a calm, enigmatic expression, hinting at seduction. Behind her: dark carved wood furniture—a dragon-motif chair on the left, a calligraphy scroll on the wall, a tall ornate cabinet on the right topped with an orange-red lantern casting warm light. The floor has a geometric patterned rug. In the foreground, a gold cushion embroidered with dragons holds another open white fan. Warm tones of yellow, orange, and deep brown dominate; soft light from the front right creates gentle chiaroscuro, accentuating her curves and the fabric's texture, with subtle skin glow and shadow folds. Composition centers her slightly left, with diagonal flow from lantern to figure to cushion, depth from layered furniture. Atmosphere blends classical elegance with modern sensuality, as if a high-end portrait shot with cinematic lighting and intimate realism, evoking a timeless cultural fusion.",
