          "prompt": "A young woman lies topless on pristine fake snow, a fluffy white fur coat draped open around her shoulders, wearing only black lace panties, a silver diamond necklace at her throat. Her intense gaze meets the camera, red lips slightly parted, right hand brushing through her wavy black hair, left hand resting on her stomach. Black wavy hair spreads across the snow and fur. Composition central-right, head tilted, eyes locking with viewer. Foreground: several black square gift boxes with gold ribbons, dusted with snow, some half-buried; lower left two boxes, one horizontal, one tilted. Midground: her body and snow with texture and slight depressions. Right side: a small Christmas tree with frost, gold and black ornaments, warm yellow LED lights glowing softly. Background: blurred snow and tree outlines, distant dark circular objects. High angle top-down shot, diagonal from upper left to lower right. Visual flow from face to eyes to hand to boxes to tree. Cool tone lighting, main light upper left, soft and diffused, no hard shadows, face well lit, skin luminous with subtle reflections on eyeshadow and lip gloss. Snow reflects light, bright but with shadow details. Gold boxes and accessories pop against white. Added glitter and star effects for falling snow and light refraction, dreamy holiday atmosphere. High-end fashion photography style, professional yet candid. Colors: black, white, gold, slight green and warm yellow. Luxurious, ceremonial, with balanced negative space, creating a quiet, romantic, slightly mysterious winter fairy tale.",
