          "alias": "单女旗袍庭院媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a graceful semi-crouch in the courtyard of an ancient building. She wears a modified cheongsam of deep navy with black floral patterns, now with a plunging neckline that reveals the swell of her breasts, the fabric glossy and tight against her curves. The high collar and sleeveless design remain, trimmed with pale gray piping; gold thread details at the front clasp catch the dim light. Her right hand holds a folded black fan decorated with colorful floral motifs, while her left hand rests on her knee, fingers long with pale pink nails. She wears a silver metal bracelet and ring. Her skin is fair and smooth, face sharp with refined features—smoky gray-blue eyeshadow, sharp eyeliner, thick lashes, and coral red lips. She has thin silver-framed glasses with clear lenses. Her black hair is swept back and secured with a clip, revealing a smooth forehead and small earrings. She looks directly at the camera with a cool, slightly mysterious expression, body leaning forward, left leg bent and raised, right leg supporting her weight. On her feet are black pointed-toe stiletto heels, shiny and sleek. The cheongsam has a high slit reaching her upper thigh, exposing smooth skin. Her posture accentuates her curves, the fabric hugging her waist and hips. The scene takes place inside an aged Chinese building with rough gray-brown stone walls, scarred and stained. Three red cylindrical lanterns hang on the wall, each topped with a circular lid and trailing long red tassels, emitting warm orange light that creates soft halos. To the left is an open wooden door, old and worn, with dim light inside revealing a red plastic chair with cut-out back. To the right is a small table with indistinct objects. The floor is uneven gray stone with cracks and wear. Lighting comes from the lanterns and a side source from the upper left, casting highlights on one side of her face and body and deep shadows on the other, enhancing volume and contrast. The background is dark, making her the bright focal point. The composition is a mid-shot from waist to below knee, with her slightly off-center left, drawing attention to her facial expression and the sensual details of her outfit. The overall palette features deep blue, black, red, gray-brown, and warm yellow, creating a nostalgic yet fashionable aesthetic. High-resolution film-like quality with subtle grain, rich detail, and a balanced dynamic range, capturing a moment of Eastern elegance infused with personal allure and mature sensuality.",
