          "alias": "单女全裸粉连衣裙咖啡厅媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench by the cafe window, her body partially nude—the pink silk strapless dress has slipped down to her waist, exposing her bare breasts with soft, natural curves and delicate nipples catching the warm light. The dress remains bunched around her hips, its floral embroidery and flowing ivory satin skirt pooling elegantly on the bench. Her dark brown hair is swept up in a low bun, a few loose strands brushing her cheek; she wears small gold earrings, a fine chain necklace, rings, and a slender gold bracelet. Her right hand lifts a pale ceramic latte cup with delicate foam, while her left hand rests near her chin, fingertips grazing her skin in a thoughtful, sensual gesture. Her gaze drifts out the window, expression serene but with a hint of dreamy desire. Beside her, a pink quilted designer handbag with gold chain, a round silk fan with pearl edging and pink embroidered flowers, and bamboo chopsticks create a fusion of Eastern elegance and modern style. Through the glass, a vibrant city street shows leafy trees, a blue \"ACB\" sign, passing cars, and pedestrians, all softly blurred to keep focus on her. Composition is medium shot, slightly offset to the left, with natural leading lines from her gaze outward. Foreground items—coffee cup, plate, bag, fan—are arranged at angles, enriching depth. Midground is her half-bare figure, background a hazy urban scene, using shallow depth of field. Natural daylight pours in, warm and gentle, illuminating her face and bare skin, highlighting the texture of the dress and the sheen of her body; shadows are soft, no harsh contrasts. Color palette revolves around pink, cream, light brown, accented by green foliage and gray streets. The image feels like an accidental street snapshot with slight film grain and natural exposure, capturing an intimate, elegantly erotic moment in daily life—quiet, nostalgic, urban, and deeply sensual.",
