          "alias": "单女白短裙广场媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young female model in a half-body composition, positioned center-left, with dark medium-length hair and straight bangs, her gaze locked directly at the camera, expression calm but with a detached, sultry edge, lips painted a deep crimson, skin pale and flawless, face defined by soft yet sharp features—modern and artistic. She wears a white short-sleeved sporty top with a high collar, red and blue stripe trim on the sleeves and hem, a red square brand patch on the left chest, but the top is pulled up to expose her bare, toned waist and the underside of her breasts, the fabric barely covering her nipples. A white pleated long skirt sits low on her hips, held by a wide black belt with a gold metal buckle and white lettering. Her right hand hangs naturally, extending to the left edge of the frame, her left hand placed behind her body, posture relaxed yet tense. Two long white fabric straps fall from her shoulders forward, grazing her bare skin, creating leading lines across her exposed torso. Background: to the left, a giant futuristic flower installation made of iridescent sequin or mirror petals in gradients of blue, purple, and green, with intense metallic sheen and three-dimensional depth; to the right, a pale wall or backdrop with blurred geometric patterns and shifting light. Above, bold white \"Harper's BAZAAR\" lettering, below \"AUGUST 2022.\" A colorful snake-shaped decoration adorns the upper right corner. Medium close-up, subject dominates, background adds layers. Lighting from front-upper, soft and even, illuminating facial features, skin texture, and the subtle sheen of exposed skin, while creating strong reflections and highlights on the floral installation and the belt buckle. Cool blue-green atmosphere. Overall color palette: white base accented with blue, purple, black, and red, high contrast, smooth shadows that define the model's silhouette and clothing details. A high-fashion magazine cover aesthetic blending surrealism and street style, cool, avant-garde, and slightly mysterious urban vibe, as if photographed in a brightly lit exhibition space or virtual set, capturing both professional perfection and a hint of everyday intimacy—a visual experience where real and imagined intertwine.",
