          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍桌边冷淡脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep blue modified cheongsam with gold floral embroidery, high collar and sleeveless, delicate gray piping at the neckline and sides—now unbuttoned and pulled open to expose her full breasts, nipples stiff and visible against the cool air. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, lenses catching soft light, black hair pulled back neatly with a few strands falling by her cheeks. Her makeup is precise, sharp eyeliner, warm coral lips, clear facial contours, fair skin. Her gaze is calm and focused on the camera. Her right hand holds an open black folding fan decorated with colorful peacock feather embroidery, each feather outlined in gold thread and adorned with red, blue, green sequins; the fan ribs are dark carved wood. On her wrist a silver metal bracelet, on her finger a simple ring. Her body is slightly turned, left arm hanging naturally, right hand holding the fan in front of her, forming an elegant curve over her exposed chest. The background is an ancient Chinese temple interior, rough gray-blue stone walls with patches of weathering and moss, hung densely with red prayer slips bearing gold characters like \"fortune\" and \"prosperity.\" To the right, a wooden rack with red ribbons and lanterns; to the left, faintly visible, an offering table with incense burner and candles. The floor is hexagonal dark stone tiles with clear grain. Lighting is dim, a soft front light from the left illuminating her face and torso, casting subtle shadows behind her, creating a mysterious and solemn atmosphere. Mid-shot portrait, subject off-center right, strong color contrast of red slips and lanterns against her deep blue outfit and pale skin. The fan's angle directs the eye from her hand up to her face. Overall tone deep blue, black, red with gold accents, classical yet modern East Asian aesthetic, rich in cultural and artistic allure, as if shot with a professional camera and wide aperture lens—detailed, layered, realistic yet slightly dreamlike."