          "alias": "单女白外套街道微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a gray exercise ball outdoors, wearing a voluminous white-gray fur coat that hangs wide open, revealing her completely bare torso, pert nipples, and smooth skin. Her black hair is braided into a side braid resting on her shoulder, with a tiny silver star hairpin, blunt bangs across her forehead. She gazes lovingly at the camera with a slight smile, right hand gently cupping her cheek, fingers slender and elegant. She wears dark brown high leather boots with metal rivet details and side zippers, chunky heels, legs crossed and naturally extended, showing off her long shapely thighs. Background: urban outdoor setting with metal railings and mesh fence, blurred green plants and building silhouettes. Soft backlight from the right, sunlight filtering through leaves casting dappled shadows on the gray concrete floor. Medium shot, subject centered slightly left, body tilted, head turned slightly, direct eye contact with viewer. Visual focus on her face and upper body, while the extended legs and boots guide the eye downward, creating strong depth and spatial layers. Foreground highlights the delicate texture of the fur coat, midground captures the seated pose and legs, background is blurred for bokeh. Lighting is bright and fresh with a Japanese-style soft filter. Color palette: white, beige, gray, brown, with green plant accents, harmonious and unified. The scene exudes an effortless everyday fashion aesthetic, like a street snapshot shot with a professional camera and standard lens, with slight film grain and natural exposure transitions, emphasizing realism and everyday life while preserving artistic lighting. Overall style balances urban edge and gentle warmth, like a quiet moment from a youth film capturing the serene beauty of a winter afternoon.",
