          "alias": "单女制服室内微笑坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a Japanese high school sailor uniform sits on the polished wooden floor of a spacious indoor gymnasium. She wears the classic white long-sleeved blouse, a deep gray pleated skirt, and a gray vest with three white stripes on the vest and cuffs. Her black medium-length hair with bangs falls naturally, slightly wavy and glossy, framing her shoulders. She looks down at the camera with a soft, knowing smile, her eyes clear and focused, radiating youthful energy and a hint of mischief. Her hands are gently tying the laces of her white canvas shoes, but her skirt rides up slightly, revealing a glimpse of bare thigh. The low-angle shot captures her full figure from below, emphasizing the curve of her legs and the subtle tension in her pose. The smooth light brown wooden floor reflects soft light, with blue-green and red sports lines stretching into the distance, creating strong perspective. The background shows the gym walls made of light wood panels, with several white double doors and high windows letting in natural light. The overall lighting is soft and diffused, creating warm, clean shadows. The color palette includes wood browns, grays, whites, and pale pink accents. The image has a slight film grain, evoking a candid, documentary feel. This is a youthful, everyday scene with a seductive twist, capturing the pure yet tantalizing essence of school life.",
