          "alias": "单女半褪灰连帽衫沙发媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges back on a red-and-white striped inflatable sofa, wearing a loose gray printed hoodie with a vintage fire truck logo reading \"Since 1882 MILLION FIRE DEPT.\" — the hoodie unzipped and hanging off one shoulder, exposing a black lace bralette and the curve of her breast. She wears a red plaid pleated miniskirt barely covering her hips, black thigh-high stockings, and a red hair tie. Her long hair cascades naturally, makeup sharp with glossy red lips slightly parted, eyes glazed and lustful, looking off to the side. One hand touches her forehead in a playful, coy gesture while the other hand rests lazily on her inner thigh, hiking the skirt higher. The pose is languid and provocative, blending schoolgirl charm with streetwear attitude. The composition is a low-angle close-up, slightly off-center right, with the inflatable sofa’s striped edge and texture in the immediate foreground. Midground shows her full body and clothing details. Background is an indoor setting with blurred wooden floor and dark furniture, cozy and private. Warm soft side lighting creates natural highlights on her cheek, nose, and hand, with gentle shadows along her body and the sofa’s indentations. The image has a candid, amateur feel with slight film grain and muted saturation, red-and-white contrast vivid but not harsh. Overall mood is intimate, casually rebellious, with a lazy afternoon vibe — hyper-focused on her expression and suggestive body language. No extra props; the scene emphasizes her sensual attitude and outfit details, conveying a carefree, flirtatious lifestyle.",
