          "id": "krea2-83a6bf040f0ffd4b7181445f",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝连衣裙椅上媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a low stool before a wooden vanity, wearing a sheer light-blue long-sleeve dress that clings to her body, the thin fabric barely concealing her bare breasts and nipples visible through the gauze. The dress has ruffled details, a high collar with gold buttons, and flared sleeves that slip off her shoulder. She holds a smartphone in her right hand, its bright blue screen casting a glow on her face, chest, and fingers; her left hand rests casually on the vanity. Her dark brown hair is swept into a loose bun with strands falling beside her cheeks, long tassel earrings dangling, a delicate gold necklace around her neck, and a red string bracelet, gold bangles, and rings adorning her wrists and hands. She tilts her head slightly downward, eyes fixed on the phone with a relaxed, intimate expression, her body turned just enough toward the viewer to reveal the swell of her breasts through the translucent fabric. In the foreground, her legs are parted slightly, the dress riding up her thighs; the midground shows her upper body and part of the vanity, cluttered with cosmetics, a jewelry box, and skincare bottles. The background is a beige wall and a large mirror reflecting the rest of the room—another vanity, sunglasses, and a tissue box—softened by a blurred depth-of-field effect. A long LED strip above the mirror provides warm, even lighting that creates delicate shadows and highlights on her skin and dress, emphasizing her curves and the sheerness of the fabric. The scene is bathed in warm tones of beige, light brown, and blue, evoking a cozy, private atmosphere. The composition is a medium portrait, the subject slightly off-center left, drawing the eye. The lighting from above and the side sculpts her form, giving a realistic, story-rich feel—a quiet, everyday moment tinged with sensual exposure and elegant eroticism.",
