          "alias": "单女半褪灰连帽衫沙发俏皮坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black velvet sofa in a close-up shot, her straight black hair with blunt bangs falling naturally in soft curls, glossy and healthy. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features delicate and three-dimensional, with large bright eyes that lock onto the camera with a playful, confident gaze. Her lips are slightly puckered in a cute pout. She wears a loose gray off-shoulder hoodie with bold purple \"WASHINGTON\" lettering in a retro sporty style, but it's pulled down to bare one shoulder and collarbone, the sleeve slipping off to reveal a bare breast—her nipple exposed, soft and pink. The hoodie is pushed up to just under her chest, leaving her torso completely nude from the waist up. She wears black shorts, but they ride up, showing the curve of her hip and a hint of pubic hair at the waistband. A thin chain necklace with a small heart pendant rests against her bare skin. Her body tilts slightly, left hand lightly gripping the hoodie sleeve, pose natural and relaxed. Background is a simple smooth light gray wall, no texture. Soft, even lighting from front-left creates warm indoor ambiance, light and shadow transitioning smoothly across her face, hair, and bare skin, highlighting texture and fabric folds. Mid-shot composition, subject centered slightly right, dominating the frame. Black sofa contrasts sharply with light gray background, enhancing depth. Foreground shows her body and part of the sofa, midground her head and torso, background wall and sofa back. Visual line from her eyes directly to viewer creates strong interaction. Overall atmosphere is warm, casual, and intimate, like a candid snapshot with subtle film grain and soft tones, emphasizing natural light portrait beauty. Full of youthful energy and personal expression, rich details, harmonious colors, strong visual appeal and emotional resonance.",
