          "alias": "单女湿身粉连衣裙温泉媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a hot spring pool, wearing a sheer pink chiffon dress that clings to her wet body, the translucent fabric soaked through, revealing her bare nipples and the curve of her breasts. Water droplets bead on the material, shimmering as it ripples around her. The skirt is plastered to her thighs, outlining her hips and mound. One strap slips off her shoulder, exposing more skin. Her black hair is damp, strands sticking to her cheeks and forehead. She gazes at the camera with a lazy, sultry expression, slightly leaning to one side, one hand braced on the pool edge, the other dipping into the water, fingers trailing faint ripples. The pool is lined with pale blue mosaic tiles that gleam softly. The wooden edge shows worn grain. Stone slabs surround the pool, with rocks piled nearby. In the distance, another hot spring glimmers, with blurred outlines of a wooden ryokan wall. Light streams from above, casting warm highlights on her wet skin and the water, creating soft shadows. The angle is slightly high, with her body in the lower left, space to the right leading into the background. Colors are soft pink, blue, and gray, giving a natural, film-like quality with subtle grain, as if captured by a simple camera, intimate and unposed.",
