          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street, her soft, light golden hair cascading naturally, strands blowing gently in the breeze, shifting from pale gold at the roots to warm cream at the tips, with delicate highlights and shadows that give it a light, textured sheen. Her facial features are refined and three-dimensional: long, smooth brows, earthy-toned eye makeup with a subtle winged liner, deep and focused eyes, full lips painted with a nude-pink gloss, and fair, luminous skin with a healthy glow. She wears a deep brown spaghetti-strap dress made of ribbed knit fabric, its texture clearly defined, hugging her curves tightly. The neckline is a dramatic deep V that plunges to her navel, revealing the full curve of her breasts, nipples barely concealed by the thin fabric, with the top of the dress sagging slightly to expose the upper swell. The A-line skirt flares naturally, with a panel of transparent gauze at the hem adding layers and a floating effect that hints at her thighs. In her right hand she holds a beige leather handbag with a simple, elegant design, metal buckle and signature double-F logo, a thin leather chain strap, and a fluffy pink pom-pom charm attached, soft and plush, harmonizing with the overall palette. On her wrist is a slim black leather bracelet, and she wears simple gold hoop earrings. The background is a stone wall in European architectural style, made of beige blocks with carved decorative lines and凹凸纹理, large glass windows reflecting a blurred image of the sky and surroundings, gray stone pavement with patches of shadow and reflection. Outdoor daylight, sunlight streaming from an upper angle, creating soft natural shadows across her face, hair, and clothing, accentuating three-dimensionality and texture. The composition is a medium-shot portrait with the woman slightly left of center, her body slightly angled toward the camera, head facing forward, eyes looking straight ahead, exuding confidence and ease. The foreground is sharp on the subject, midground on the figure and bag, background softly blurred to keep focus on her. The overall palette is warm and soft—browns, beiges, golds—contrasting with the cool stone and sky, blending high fashion with everyday urban atmosphere, with delicate light and detail, professional photographic quality, and a natural, casual vibe.",
