        {
          "id": "krea2-aa982f7aafe425107bb590d8",
          "alias": "单女露胸庭院冷淡马尾",
          "prompt": "A young female warrior in minimalist ancient battle armor, her black hair tied high in a ponytail, wearing an ornate golden dragon crown. She is topless, with only a red inner sash and dark gray scale armor covering her lower body, intricate metal guards on shoulders and arms, a brown leather belt with gold buckle, and a black silk cape flowing behind. Her right hand grips a silver long spear, body turned to the right in a half-crouch combat stance. Her eyes are sharp and focused, face cold and determined. Background: ancient stone wall buildings and blooming pink cherry blossoms, cobblestone and gravel ground, wooden benches and greenery in the distance. Medium shot, subject left of center, strong leading lines. Natural sunlight from upper left, soft and layered, dappled shadows from petals on the ground. Atmosphere: spring courtyard mixing calm and tension. Color palette: red, black, gray with bright pink cherry contrast. Rich details, cinematic photorealistic texture, slight film grain and natural depth-of-field blur. Classical martial arts style with historical weight and modern aesthetics, both solemn and dynamic, conveying the character's inner resilience and unyielding will.",
