        {
          "id": "krea2-596a54979a2cef756b96bad9",
          "alias": "单女露胸白外套公寓媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges sideways on a beige fabric sofa in a modern high-rise apartment, wearing only a fluffy white faux fur coat left open, revealing her bare breasts and smooth skin. She sits with her legs crossed, a short camel-colored skirt riding up her thighs, a pair of beige ankle boots dangling from one foot. Her hair is loosely pinned up with a few strands falling across her forehead, a soft, sultry gaze directed at the camera, lips slightly parted, makeup natural and elegant. One hand rests on her knee, the other lightly touches the edge of the coat. On the sofa arm, a fashion magazine lies open to black-and-white architectural photos. The midground captures her full body and the sofa’s silhouette, while the background shows a skyline of glass skyscrapers through floor-to-ceiling windows, one building topped with a red neon sign reading \"Hong Kong.\" Warm afternoon sunlight streams in from the right, casting soft shadows across the walls, furniture, and her body, creating a bright, golden glow. Thick beige curtains are pulled partially aside. The composition places her slightly right of center, using vertical window lines and building geometry to guide the eye from her face, down her body, out to the city, then back to the intimate indoor details. The lighting is warm yellow, with a soft film-grain texture reminiscent of 35mm photography, slightly overexposed edges giving a candid, handheld feel. The scene is sensual, cozy, and urban, blending modern elegance with raw, intimate vulnerability.",
