        {
          "id": "krea2-a2ef57f564eeca33262694ad",
          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫舞台微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, topless, wearing a white button-up shirt unbuttoned and open, paired with loose black wide-leg trousers, a gray knitted scarf draped lazily over one shoulder. Her black hair is styled in twin tails with white hair ornaments, straight bangs framing her face. Her makeup is natural, eyes clear and sparkling, head slightly tilted toward the camera with a playful, thoughtful expression. Her arms are spread in a semicircular gesture, as if performing or expressing. The background is a vibrant cartoon stage set: green grass, pink trees, white flowers, blue sky, creating a fairy-tale pastoral scene. At the bottom, a \"16\" sign and a smiling flower motif are visible. The lighting is bright and even, professional stage lights with soft frontal illumination, casting clear contours with subtle, smooth shadows. The composition is centered and symmetrical, subject occupying the middle. Foreground is a flat light-gray floor with fine grain texture. Midground shows the full-body figure, relaxed pose, detailed. The background uses large color blocks and simple lines, creating strong visual contrast, saturated but not harsh. The overall atmosphere is lively, cheerful, with a childlike playfulness, distinct light and shadow, strong dimensionality, resembling a TV program recording with multiple HD cameras capturing from different angles, like a variety show shoot. Image quality is fine, details rich, skin smooth and fair, clothing folds natural, background elements crisp. Visual focus is on the figure, drawing viewer attention through her pose and gaze, creating a relaxed, warm, approachable feel. The image texture mimics amateur daily shooting equipment, with slight noise and motion blur, simulating a real camera snapshot while retaining enough detail and color reproduction, blending artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, as if a still from a youthful variety show, full of energy and warmth.",
