        {
          "id": "krea2-352bb7dfedc2df2550384eb9",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑靴子室内沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands nude in a festive indoor scene, her only clothing a grey plaid A-line miniskirt and black knee-high matte suede boots. Her shoulder-length black hair has straight bangs, makeup perfect, eyes lowered in a contemplative gaze. She wears small silver heart earrings. Her body is slightly turned, one foot forward, arms relaxed but right hand gently lifting as if adjusting the skirt edge. The red glossy floor reflects her nude torso and the colored LED lights—purple, blue, white—scattered around. A red geometric step with metal trim sits left, holding a white object; a large green plant droops from the right. Gold and silver metallic balloons float above. The background is a pale beige curtain with a blurred banner, crossed by red/white diagonal stripes. Warm, soft lighting from above and side creates gentle shadows on her skin, dress, and the reflective floor. The composition is vertical, subject centered left, evoking a quiet, intimate mood. This scene blends festive celebration with personal exposure, feeling like a polished yet candid portrait. Rich colors: grey, red, gold, black, green. Fine details visible: skin texture, fabric weave, balloon reflections.",
