        {
          "id": "krea2-ed13c1acc4be28c87804e242",
          "alias": "单女黑袜子健身房微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a gym setting performs a deep Pilates stretch on a silver reformer, her body twisted and extended to one side. She wears only sheer black thigh-high socks, her black long-sleeve top and gray leggings discarded on the floor. With her left hand gripping her right ankle, she pulls her leg upward, exposing her bare thigh and the curve of her hip. Her right arm supports her on the platform as she lowers her head, soft smile on her lips, hair flowing with the movement. The warm, even light from above highlights her skin, casting subtle shadows across her toned muscles. The background is a clean, pale beige wall with vertical lines, slightly blurred. The shot is a medium composition, her body centered, the reformer's frame and sliding platform in the foreground, creating a stable visual flow. The color palette is muted—black, gray, and beige—with a natural, slightly grainy texture suggesting a candid camera capture. The scene conveys a blend of athletic grace and sensual tension, emphasizing her exposed flesh and the dynamic curve of her spine.",
