        {
          "id": "krea2-53b702843b513809273af659",
          "alias": "单女拳击黑内衣海报媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the center of a boxing ring, wearing a tight black sports bra and gray shorts, her skin slick with sweat, glistening under the harsh spotlight. Her damp brown hair clings messily to her shoulders, stray strands plastered across her forehead. She stares directly at the lens with intense, hungry eyes, lips slightly parted. Her right hand, clad in a vivid red boxing glove, presses the palm against her mouth, while her left arm is raised high, adjusting the other glove. Her body leans forward, toned abs visible, every muscle defined. Behind her, a massive wall covered in black-and-white Dragon Ball manga panels—Goku, Vegeta, action lines, Japanese sound effects—form a chaotic collage. Colorful anime characters dot the wall. The black ring ropes run from foreground to midground, yellow branding emblazoned on them. The dark blue mat reads \"TIME HOUSE\" and geometric shapes. A single bright spotlight from above casts a circular glow, creating sharp highlights and deep shadows on her face, arms, and gloves. The cold blue-black tones contrast with the red gloves, evoking tension, strength, and rebellious youth. The close-up composition fills the frame with her, the background softly blurred yet detailed, as if captured by an amateur camera with subtle film grain and vignetting. The raw, unpolished aesthetic conveys a sense of real, intimate moment—a fusion of pop culture and athletic grit, with a raw sensuality that speaks to self-expression and defiance.",
