          "alias": "单女蓝T恤城市微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a modern indoor staircase, her blunt bangs and shoulder-length brown hair held by two small orange clips. She gazes calmly at the camera with slightly parted lips and a gentle, knowing smile. Her skin is fair and flawless, her facial features delicately sculpted with a straight nose, natural eye makeup, and long lashes. She wears a deep blue short-sleeve T-shirt, the hem pulled up to expose her bare, perky breasts, topped with a white baseball jacket unzipped, revealing orange and navy trim. Her lower body is clad in loose dark blue denim cargo pants with wide gray-white side stripes accented in orange, cinched by an orange-and-white belt with a metal buckle. Her legs are crossed, body leaning back slightly, right hand resting on the step, left hand draped casually by her knee. She wears chunky white-and-mushroom-gray sneakers with red \"Cm!!\" lettering. The staircase is covered in black velvet steps with gold metal edges, flanked by a transparent glass-and-silver railing against a clean white wall. Soft overhead light creates natural shadows, emphasizing her curves. The composition is centered, with the figure slightly below center, guiding the eye from her face down her body to her legs and shoes, then upward along the staircase. The palette is predominantly black and white, with orange accents as visual highlights, blending urban fashion, youthful vitality, and minimalist aesthetics. The image is crisp and detailed, like a high-end portrait that feels both candid and artfully arranged, radiating effortless sensuality.",
