          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street at night, wearing a black leather biker jacket partially unzipped to reveal her bare chest and cleavage, a matching high-waist mini skirt, and knee-high black leather boots. Her dark hair falls naturally; she has detailed makeup, deadpan eyes locked on the lens, expression calm and confident. Her left hand rests on a white metal railing, right hand hangs loosely at her side with dark nail polish and a ring. Background: a massive red steel-framed structure illuminated against the night sky, behind it traditional Japanese buildings with black tile roofs and wooden frames barely visible in low light. The asphalt reflects scattered light, creating a wet-looking surface. Blurred pedestrians in casual clothes pass in the distance. Composition is symmetrical with the model slightly left of center. A white vertical pillar enters the left foreground. The scene is cold-toned overall, with warm red light from the building as a key highlight; her face and body receive soft fill light, making leather gleam with specular highlights and shadows. Long shadows stretch from streetlights. Cinematic, nocturnal, modern vs. traditional juxtaposition, with a sense of independent, confident, avant-garde urban femininity. Slight film grain, realistic color reproduction, shot with a 50mm or 85mm lens, 3:2 or 4:3 aspect, like a night art-photography or fashion editorial.",
