          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙走廊微笑站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor hallway in front of a mirror, taking a selfie. She wears a sheer white lace dress that reveals her bare breasts and toned body; the dress has intricate cutouts, ruffled hem, and a slightly flared skirt. In her right hand she holds a silver smartphone with a triple-camera array, angled toward the mirror. Her left hand rests on her hip, adorned with gold bracelets, a thin necklace, and a wrist cuff. Her wavy hair is partly pinned up, the rest falling over her bare shoulders. She has a soft, natural smile and gazes at the phone screen. A light blue denim jacket with embroidered details and a worn wash is draped over her left arm. Background: modern interior with light wood-textured walls and pale wooden floor reflecting soft light. On the left, a wooden door emits warm orange light; in the distance, a glass door lets in natural daylight. Ceiling recessed lights provide even illumination. Mirror selfie perspective, subject slightly off-center, body turned to create dynamic lines. Focus on her face and upper body, with shallow depth of field blurring the background. The scene feels intimate, candid, with subtle grain and imperfect focus enhancing realism. Warm beige, cream, and wood tones dominate. The shot resembles a casual phone snapshot, effortlessly sensual and domestic.",
