          "alias": "单女半褪橙浴袍窗边忧伤倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in traditional Hanfu, her warm orange-yellow cross-collared robe undone, the soft fabric slipping off one shoulder to reveal bare skin and the curve of her breast, delicate white trim at the sleeves and collar, her hair twisted into a high bun adorned with small silver hairpins and tassels, a few loose strands framing her face, her expression gentle and melancholic, eyes distant with a quiet longing. She leans against a dark wooden window frame, arms resting lightly on the sill, body posed with natural grace. In the left foreground, a blurred dark shape—perhaps a fold of her robe or furniture edge—creates a voyeuristic depth. The midground shows the interior room, window lattice casting warm golden sunlight that slants in, dappling the walls and floor. On the windowsill sits a blooming yellow orchid in a classical dark pottery pot, lush green leaves, beside an intricately carved wooden side table. The background is an antique room with dark brown wooden paneling and a simple hanging wooden ornament. The scene is bathed in warm amber and brown tones, intimate and still. Composition uses a three-part frame, guiding the eye from the lower-left blur through the window shadows to her face and exposed shoulder. Backlighting creates a soft halo around her silhouette, with subtle film grain and low contrast, evoking a nostalgic, poetic Eastern aesthetic. The mood is sensual and contemplative, as if caught in a quiet afternoon moment, her bare skin glowing in the diffused sunlight.",
