        {
          "id": "krea2-15b352ceb2786942f799ec11",
          "alias": "单女露胸和服庭院困倦坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite Japanese kimono-style outfit sits on a deep crimson wooden railing. Her long black hair has straight bangs, adorned with red bows and white ornaments, and a hairpiece with red tassels. Her makeup is delicate with soft pink eyeshadow and natural pink lips; her expression is sweet, eyes tenderly gazing into the camera. Her right hand lightly touches her hair ornament, left hand rests on the railing, pose elegant and relaxed. She wears a tight red kimono top with a plunging neckline, revealing her collarbone, shoulders, and the full swell of her bare breasts—nipples visible—exposing her upper body completely. Gold decorative bands cross her chest, a wide blue obi cinches her waist with red flowers and gold knots. A short skirt with gold floral embroidery flutters at the hem, and flowing red fabric panels on the side feature blue-and-red floral patterns. Red strapped sandals with white flower decorations and ankle bells adorn her feet. One leg bent, the other extended, legs crossed gracefully, smooth pale skin shining. Soft warm light falls from the left, casting gentle shadows across her face, arms, and thighs. Background: deep night sky with hanging purple wisteria clusters and green ferns, lush and layered, creating a mysterious, intimate atmosphere. Medium shot, subject slightly right of center, dominant in frame. Foreground: the weathered red wooden railing. Background softly blurred with bokeh. Warm yellow light from the left front illuminates her front and body, producing a halo effect, strong chiaroscuro. Overall palette: red, purple, green, gold, black. Artistic, like a ukiyo-e portrait or a courtyard film scene, blending classical and modern beauty. Professional portrait lighting, smooth skin, fine details. Romantic, serene, dreamy, as if in a fantasy Japanese festive night.",
