          "prompt": "A young woman in a revealing red-and-black plaid Lolita dress, unbuttoned white blouse with lace trim pushed down to expose her cleavage, black ruffled hemline hiking up to show lace-top thigh-high stockings and black leather boots. She grips a black Fender electric guitar with both hands, left hand fretting the neck, right hand holding a pick, body slightly tilted, left leg bent, right leg extended in a dynamic pose. Her hair is styled in twin tails with black hair accessories adorned with musical notes and bows, her expression teasing with a bright, flirtatious smile, eyes sparkling with confidence. Pure white background, full-body centered composition. Soft studio lighting from above-left highlights her face, décolletage, and the texture of the dress, with subtle shadows pooled at her feet. Color palette of red, black, and white with gold button and badge accents on the dress. The atmosphere is a pre-performance moment, combining elegant gothic rock with sensual allure, as if she's about to play, exuding youthful energy and provocative charm. High-quality idol-style portrait with realistic detail, focused on her expression and hand positioning.",
