        {
          "id": "krea2-c8e2ec4194a5dc04a54acd05",
          "alias": "单女露胸米外套椅上害羞坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal bench outdoors, her beige wool coat open, revealing her bare chest and erect nipples, the hood trimmed with fluffy light gray faux fur. She cups her hands gently around her cheeks, fingers interlaced, a sweet, shy smile on her lips as she gazes directly at the camera with bright, clear eyes. Her long brown hair falls naturally over her shoulders, shimmering in the sunlight. She wears high, black patent leather stiletto boots with pointed toes, legs crossed at the ankles, a flash of pale skin showing above the boot tops. Her body leans slightly forward, creating an intimate, relaxed pose. The composition is classic rule-of-thirds: she occupies the right third, with a red-and-white striped pillar rising from bottom to top on the right, and a gondola covered in red fabric partially submerged in the calm canal water on the left, reflecting the surroundings. In the background, European-style buildings with brick walls and white columns, steps leading to a dark wooden door, greenery beside it, and distant yellow walls and blurred foliage. The scene is a faux-Venetian water town, the ground paved with dark gray stone slabs with subtle moss in the cracks. Warm afternoon sunlight from above-left casts soft shadows across her face, coat, and the stones, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The warm tone imbues the image with a cozy, serene atmosphere. Colors are mostly beige, black, red, and gray, with the red pillar and boat cover standing out against the cool stone and water. Low-angle shot from slightly below, lens tilted to enhance depth; focus on her face and upper body with moderate background blur. The photo has a lifelike, candid feel, like a professional DSLR shot on a sunny winter day, with slight film grain and natural color shifts. Details are sharp—from coat texture to boot reflections—conveying a leisurely, pleasant winter afternoon vibe, now with a sensual, topless edge.",
