          "prompt": "A young woman stands centered-left in the frame, topless, wearing a bright yellow high-waist miniskirt and black pointed stilettos, her toned torso and healthy skin fully exposed. She holds a black full-face SHARK motorcycle helmet with red and white graphics in her right hand, her left hand casually at her side. Her slightly wavy brown hair falls over her shoulders, and she wears long silver earrings and a watch. Her expression is calm, cool, and confident, looking directly at the camera with a hint of aloofness. Behind her is a high-performance sportbike in black and green, sharp lines, wide tires, and \"298\" decals, suggesting a racing pedigree. The background is a modern urban cityscape with glass facades reflecting pale blue sky, geometric architecture, and blurred windows creating depth. The ground is smooth light gray concrete with subtle texture. Mid-shot composition, the woman dominates the frame with the motorcycle extending from the right into the foreground, creating a diagonal line. Lighting is soft and even from front-top, casting delicate shadows and highlighting the gloss of the helmet, the matte bike surfaces, and her skin. Overall mood is cool, modern, and powerful, with a color contrast of cold blue and bright yellow. The image has a polished commercial photography style with a candid street vibe. Slight low angle enhances her presence. Background blur effectively isolates her while maintaining context. Detailed, layered, and visually striking.",
