        {
          "id": "krea2-9ea4c978822e4dafa4b47f8a",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝外套门沉思坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits inside a white retro-style van, topless, her bare skin catching the golden sunset light. She wears a light blue jacket draped open and a beige trench coat slipping off one shoulder. A red-and-white backpack hangs from her shoulder, with a red plaid baseball cap clipped on, embroidered in yellow: \"THERE IS NO FINISH LINE\". Her dark hair falls naturally, her face in profile, gazing out the open door with a contemplative, yearning expression. One hand touches her cheek, fingers grazing her bare chest. The van interior is cozy with flowers, books, and personal items. The foreground is the woman, bottom right; midground shows the open door and van interior; background is a blurred street and buildings in warm golden dusk light. Sunlight streams through the window, creating delicate shadows on her skin and clothes. Low-angle tilted composition adds dynamic realism. Rich warm tones with blue and red accents. High-resolution, documentary-style, capturing a quiet, intimate moment of freedom and exploration.",
