        {
          "id": "krea2-ca7ffd2fcd7db6ca30c47b58",
          "alias": "单女外套霓虹夜景冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a neon-lit futuristic space, wearing a light gray, worn-in faux leather jacket with natural creases and slight distressing, open over a white lace corset top with crisscross ties at the chest, cinching her slim waist. High-waisted black leather pants hug her hips, accented by a wide belt studded with sparkling crystals and a vintage-style metal buckle, surrounded by tiny silver chain details. Her neck is layered with silver chains—thick links, fine chains, and a pearl strand, with a heart-shaped pendant at center. A simple metal bracelet wraps her wrist. Her dark, slightly wavy hair falls messily over her shoulders, partially covering her forehead; she runs one hand through a lock of hair, looking directly at the camera with a sharp, penetrating gaze. Her lips part slightly, exuding cool confidence and a hint of allure. The background is a soft-focus dark blue space, where purple and pink light orbs drift slowly on the left, creating a gentle glow, while haze swirls on the right, adding a dreamlike stage atmosphere. Light streams from the upper left, casting strong chiaroscuro: soft side light illuminates her face, highlighting the bridge of her nose, cheekbones, and chin, with natural shadows falling across her cheeks and neck. Her shoulders and arms are defined by backlighting. The composition is a medium close-up, with her body slightly off-center left, her head tilted, drawing focus to her expression and clothing details. The colored light sources are scattered for depth. In the foreground, a few strands of hair and delicate chains are faintly visible, enhancing motion and realism. The scene exudes a moody, rebellious urban nightlife aesthetic, dominated by cool tones with warm local accents, creating a tense, cool-and-hot contrast. The image looks like a professional full-frame shot in low light, capturing subtle skin reflections and fabric textures, with soft focus and gradient light, cinematic and artistic. The interplay of light and shadow conveys youthful defiance and self-expression, embodying a unique appeal of modern pop culture.",
