        {
          "id": "krea2-0fe54954e20ebae0e1471a48",
          "alias": "单女露胸米西装高塔微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a green metal table in an outdoor café, her long brown hair cascading over her shoulders, fair skin and delicate features turned toward the camera with a soft, intimate smile. She is completely topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, the cream tweed blazer hanging open at her sides, a loose cream knit top pushed down around her waist. One hand rests on her bare thigh; the other holds a glass of pale white wine. She wears light shorts and cream high boots, her long legs crossed elegantly. The table is filled with fresh food: two green salads with tomatoes and purple cabbage, toasted bread, butter, a small dish of sauce, and a second glass of wine. In the background, a modern city street with distant skyscrapers, trees, and climbing vines on building walls. The ground is gray-and-white geometric tiles; empty green metal chairs sit nearby. Above, a large cream umbrella with radial ribs. The composition is slightly overhead, leading from the food in the foreground to her face, then to the distant cityscape. Soft, diffused natural light from an overcast sky creates even, shadowless illumination, lending a calm, cozy, slightly artistic mood. The color palette is green, cream, and gray, accented by the vibrant food colors. The scene feels like a candid snapshot from a phone or compact camera, with light grain and realistic depth of field, emphasizing everyday beauty and a sensual, relaxed intimacy. Details are rich and layered, inviting narrative immersion.",
