        {
          "id": "krea2-eeb03fbf5aeb56f8bc45918f",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤城市微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a white brick wall, her long straight black hair falling naturally, a few strands brushing her face. She gazes directly at the camera with bright, smiling eyes and a playful, teasing smirk. She wears a loose black short-sleeved T-shirt with pink and blue graphic prints, but the shirt is unbuttoned at the top, exposing the swell of her breasts and a colorful round pin near her cleavage. Her bottom is a black-and-white plaid mini skirt, barely covering her thighs, with white piping along the hem. She wears pure white thigh-high socks that hug her calves, and shiny black Mary Jane heels with small buckles. Her hands gently tug at her hair on either side, drawing attention to her bare shoulders and the hint of underboob. The background is a simple white brick wall, with a graffiti-covered pole on the left covered in stickers and spray paint. The floor is dark gray concrete with subtle stains, giving a gritty urban feel. The composition is centered, with her body slightly angled, head tilted, and gaze locked on the lens. Soft, diffused lighting from above the side creates gentle shadows on her face and clothes, accentuating her curves. The mood is a blend of youthful street style and sensual rebellion, with a natural, film-grain aesthetic that feels like a candid late-night capture.",
