          "alias": "单女半褪米外套城市媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden pallet table in an outdoor café, wearing a loose khaki work jacket open to reveal her bare chest and nipples, with dark shirt fabric slipping off one shoulder. Her black straps hang loose. Her hair is casually pinned up with strands falling naturally. Her face is delicate, gaze to the right, thoughtful and serene. Her hands rest folded on the table, relaxed. The yellow wooden tabletop is rough with wear, supported by metal legs and stacked pallets labeled \"J05 ZHH\". In the background, a person in red sits facing away, another figure partially visible. Left side has a potted pine. Distant urban residential buildings with white walls, many windows and AC units, glass reflecting soft sky. Trees between buildings. Rooftop structures and metal railings visible. Open balcony/terrace space, soft overcast light, cool-toned but warm, fine shadows, even illumination on face, background slightly blurred to focus on her. Composition centered slightly right. Foreground table and her form create a stable frame. She is topless, the jacket parted, her breasts and nipples exposed, inviting and calm. The scene has subtle film grain, moderate saturation, detailed layers, reminiscent of an old digital camera capturing a quiet afternoon. A candid, earthy, real-life mood with gentle grain and natural exposure transitions. She exudes stillness and introspection, her nude upper body harmonizing with the environment, conveying intimate vulnerability. Her expression, bare skin, and relaxed posture form the focal point. The architectural lines and plant shapes contrast, enhancing depth. The whole scene breathes everyday warmth and authentic sensuality.",
