        {
          "id": "krea2-0d0e426ece42fb7a857ae495",
          "alias": "单女露胸衬衫咖啡厅忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table in an outdoor cafe, her plaid shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing bare breasts and a gray long-sleeve pulled down to expose her shoulders. Her dark hair is loosely pinned back, one hand cradling her chin as she gazes at the camera with a melancholic, contemplative expression. Lips slightly parted, she seems lost in thought. Her skin is fair and smooth, features delicate with large bright eyes, thin eyebrows, a straight nose, and a faint blush on her cheeks. She leans forward slightly, her hands resting on the table, the left hand supporting the right arm. The brown-and-black plaid shirt is open, contrasting with the soft gray fabric, while her matching skirt or pants are visible below. In the foreground, a pale wooden table surface shows fine grain and wear, with a black smartphone lying face-up, its metallic edge reflecting ambient light. The background is an open-air cafe under a corrugated metal roof with parallel fluorescent tubes casting warm yellow-white light. To the left, a rough concrete pillar holds a colorful geometric painting with \"VOR\" text below. Further back, a thin figure in a white jacket sits facing away, with short black hair. A low beige wall is partially obscured by dense dark green foliage that drapes over the woman's shoulder. In the distance, modern buildings include a gray high-rise with white windows and a lower red-tiled roof building. The sky is overcast gray, light soft and even. The composition is a close-up, slightly low-angle shot focusing on her face and bare upper body, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background. The lighting from the fluorescents illuminates her skin, with subtle shadows on her neck and sides. The overall warm brown, beige, and gray palette creates a realistic, slightly nostalgic, and intimate atmosphere, with subtle grain suggesting a casual phone photo. The mood is quiet, sensual, and charged with urban melancholy.",
