        {
          "id": "krea2-57ecc68433e1f11191859fdc",
          "alias": "单女露胸米衬衫室内专注坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a bright indoor setting, wearing a partially unbuttoned beige silk blouse that reveals her bare breasts, paired with a lace-trimmed short skirt. She wears brown chunky leather boots with metal buckle rings, blending vintage and modern style. She holds a white smartphone, taking a selfie in a mirror reflection. Her long hair falls naturally, makeup refined, eyes focused on the phone screen. A gold bracelet adorns her left wrist, and a ring on her right ring finger. She sits relaxed and elegant, legs crossed, right leg forward, left behind, in a casual yet deliberate pose. Behind her, a vibrant mustard velvet sofa holds a brown leather handbag with visible strap. The sofa has tufted button details, soft texture. To the left, a tall arched black-framed window with geometric panes shows faint city buildings and night lights. Soft warm overhead lighting creates a cozy atmosphere. Light wood flooring with clear grain reflects the figure and furniture, enhancing depth. Centered composition, the woman is slightly right of center, body tilted, head lowered, gaze downward at the phone, creating a visual line from face to phone to legs. Foreground shows her lower body and boots, midground her full body, sofa, and wall, background the window and blurred environment. Light detail is delicate: main light from front-above casts soft shadows on face and clothes, with clear reflections on the floor. Color palette warm beige, yellow, brown, with black window frame and dark boots for contrast. Overall atmosphere blends everyday casualness with carefully designed aesthetic, like a real-life moment captured by a phone yet with high-fashion magazine quality. Rich details from fabric folds to metal buckle reflections are sharp. The scene exudes urban female independence and personal expression, mixing private intimacy with a polished outward display, quiet yet storytelling, freezing a mundane but shining everyday moment.",
