        {
          "id": "krea2-2984aaaa2b55a3d929c4cfbf",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裤城市媚态坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a green metal table in an outdoor café, her long brown hair falling naturally over her bare shoulders. She is topless, wearing only high-waisted shorts and elegant cream knee-high boots, her breasts fully exposed. She sits sideways, relaxed, her right hand lightly gripping a glass of white wine, eyes lowered into the amber liquid with a serene, contemplative expression. On the table: fresh vegetable salad, toasted bread, a cheese platter, and golden crispy sides; a second full wine glass beside her. Above, a large cream sun umbrella with radiating ribs casts soft shade. The ground is laid with black-white-gray geometric tiles. In the background: a lush green wall, leafy trees, and modern glass curtain walls; distant pedestrians and a vertical sign. Composition is slightly top-down, with the table’s food leading the eye to her nude torso, then to the city background. Light is warm golden natural daylight, filtered through leaves, creating dappled shadows. Atmosphere: quiet, sensual, and refined — a moment of urban indulgence. Film-grain texture, natural color saturation. Tones: cream, light brown, olive green, gray. Balanced framing with strong narrative and emotional pull.",
