          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a modern white bed, her long black hair cascading over bare shoulders, skin pale and smooth, her features delicate with a soft, knowing smile. She wears nothing but black sheer stockings and black suede high-heel ankle boots, the boots hugging her calves, the stockings ending just above the boots, leaving a strip of bare thigh. Her legs are crossed, one foot resting on the floor, the other hooked over the edge of the bed, the pose relaxed and inviting. She leans back slightly, her right hand holding a large cream shopping bag overflowing with pink roses, yellow daisies, and baby’s breath wrapped in white paper with a ribbon bow. Beside her on the bed, a black gift box with gold branding and a discarded light brown faux fur coat add a lived-in feel. The background is all white and pale tones—a tidy bed with white sheets and pillows, one dark grey cushion, and a glass partition revealing a bathroom with a tub and sink. The camera looks down at a slight angle, with her legs and boots in the foreground, her body and the flowers in the midground, and the bed and room behind. Warm indoor lighting falls softly across her skin, while hidden LED strips under the bed cast a cool white glow, creating subtle highlights on her exposed skin and the shiny dress fabric—though she’s mostly bared, the dress lies discarded nearby, a black knit with a white Peter Pan collar still visible, as if she slipped it off. The mood is intimate and sensual, like a captured moment of a special day, candid yet polished, with a natural, story-telling warmth.",
