          "prompt": "A young blonde woman with piercing blue eyes leans back against a glossy white grand piano, her body draped in an intricate gothic rococo gown that has been unbuttoned to reveal her bare breasts and the soft curve of her stomach. She wears a wide-brimmed black hat adorned with blue gems and gold filigree, its edge trimmed with orange-and-black lace. Her naturally curly hair spills over her shoulders, catching warm light. Her gaze is clear and focused on the camera, lips parted in a quiet, mysterious expression. Her right hand rests above the piano keys, a mechanical black glove studded with glowing blue-green crystals on the wrist. Her arm shows fine tattoo work. The outfit is multilayered: a dark bodice with gold metal accents, white ruffles and an orange bow at the chest, a corset belt with vintage leather and circular metal plates, and an orange-red ruffled skirt that bunches around her hips. Sheer nude stockings cover her legs, and she wears mismatched high-heeled boots—one black with gold details, the other green-and-black with a gold heel. She sits on a beige cushioned chair, posture relaxed yet composed. The background is a pale gray wall with a cluster of white flowers in a corner, green vines cascading from the right. Crystal chandeliers hang overhead, casting warm yellow light from above right, creating soft shadows that sculpt her form. The medium shot frames her prominently with the piano as a foreground element, its white body contrasting with her orange skirt. The background is blurred, focusing attention on her face, exposed chest, and intricate costume details. Warm tonal lighting gives the scene a romantic, slightly mysterious atmosphere, as if a noblewoman from a fantasy world reveals her intimate allure in a private space. The image is richly textured and narratively charged.",
