          "prompt": "A young woman takes a mirror selfie indoors, wearing a sheer beige long-sleeve dress with delicate white lace trim at the plunging V-neckline and hemline—the lightweight chiffon fabric is nearly translucent, clinging to her curves and leaving little to the imagination, her nipples and bare skin faintly visible through the material. She crouches on a red-and-white geometric tile floor, legs slightly bent, holding a pale smartphone with her right hand for the mirror shot (lens clearly visible), her left hand resting casually on her knee, red bracelet and gold ring catching the light. Her dark brown hair is loosely pinned up, a few strands falling across her face; her makeup is soft—smoky eyes, nude lips—as she gazes intently at the phone screen with a contemplative expression. In the background, an open walk-in closet: light wood cabinet doors with vertical slats, assorted clothes (purple, black, white tops) hanging on the left, some tidy, some messy. A single white sneaker lies on the floor. On the right, a window with horizontal blinds lets in soft natural light, casting warm side-lighting across her face and dress, creating delicate shadows and highlights. Overall warm tones (beige, light brown, white, red) create a cozy home atmosphere. Medium shot, slightly blurred background to focus on her figure, realistic texture—fabric folds, floor tiles, phone reflection, clothing details—with a serene yet intimate mood. The scene captures a private moment of modern femininity, blending relaxed sensuality with refined aesthetics.",
