          "prompt": "A young female singer performs passionately on an outdoor night music festival stage, wearing a high-waisted black shiny leather short jacket unzipped open to reveal her full bare breasts, matching micro pleated leather miniskirt, and thigh-high glossy black patent leather over-the-knee boots with stiletto heels. Her hair is pulled back into a tight high ponytail with a few strands falling loosely across her forehead, a professional wireless in-ear monitor in her ear. She grips the microphone with her right hand close to her lips, mouth slightly open in an intense vocal delivery, while her left hand extends forward with index finger pointed powerfully toward the audience. Her body leans slightly forward, right leg lifted and boot resting on a large stage speaker, left leg straight for support, creating a powerful, dynamic stage stance. In the foreground, the black speaker features a gridded metal surface and cables, its sharp geometric lines contrasting with her curves. Midground shows a blurred but dense crowd of fans holding up phones, their faces glowing with excitement, creating a warm sea of energy. Background: deep night sky dotted with colorful confetti or smoke particles, illuminated by strong stage lights, with visible metal truss rigs and bright spotlights casting dramatic shadows on the ground and her body. Low-angle shot looking up to emphasize her dominance and stage authority. Composition centers on her, with diagonal dynamic layout; her pointing finger leads the eye toward the audience, enhancing interactive immersion. Lighting is predominantly cool-toned with warm yellow stage lights for contrast, giving a slightly cyberpunk concert vibe. Realistic photography feel with mild grain and lens breathing, as if shot with a professional camera using a wide aperture at night, focused on her face and upper body, background naturally blurred, saturated but natural colors, strong visual impact and artistic expression.",
