          "prompt": "A topless blonde-haired, blue-eyed young woman stands in a confined space packed with vintage audio equipment, wearing only a black leather harness, red gloves, and high leather boots—her body bare from the waist up, nipples erect. She strikes a powerful pose: right leg lifted high, foot planted on a large speaker; torso arched back, left arm raised skyward, fingers splayed as if commanding unseen energy. Her expression is calm, intense, her gaze locked on the viewer. Surrounding her are stacks of retro speakers, amplifiers, and sound cabinets in black, brown, silver, some with metal grilles and wooden frames—an oppressive acoustic maze. Low-angle shot makes her appear towering and dominant. Lighting from above and sides casts soft shadows across her skin and gear, cold tones punctuated by warm highlights. The scene is rich in texture: visible knobs, cables, and brand logos in the foreground; her bare torso with subtle muscle definition and goosebumps; the deep focus and slight film grain give a hyper-real commercial-photography feel. Palette is black, white, gray, accented by red (gloves) and golden trim on her boots—a fusion of technology and nostalgia, raw sensuality and power.",
