        {
          "id": "krea2-110b97a080de2bd26e3b4e47",
          "alias": "单女露胸西装庭院忧伤站立盘发",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a courtyard of blue-gray stone slabs, clad in exquisite ancient battle armor now partially undone. Her golden crown rests atop a high bun of jet-black hair, metal ornaments gleaming among the strands as a few loose tendrils fall across her forehead. Her face is delicate and serene, with eyes cast downward—a mix of melancholy, defiance, and a hint of smoldering desire. Her skin is pale and smooth, lips a faint rose, brows finely arched, nose straight. Her aura is both soft and fiercely powerful. She wears a suit of intricately designed black scale armor, the chest plate pushed aside and hanging open, revealing the plush curve of her bare breasts beneath the crimson inner robe that has slipped down to her elbows. The scale mail is etched with dragon motifs, its metallic edges trimmed in gold, broad shoulder guards carved with beast heads. The red robe contrasts with a white inner layer visible at the cuffs and collar. A wide brown leather belt cinches her waist, its circular metal buckle catching the light. Her layered black skirt and red robe overlap, the hem slightly lifted to expose white-and-black embroidered cloth shoes with flying bird patterns. In her right hand she grips a long spear—silver-gray shaft, golden beast-head tip, a vivid red tassel swaying at the butt. Her body tilts slightly left, head bowed as if in thoughtful waiting. The foreground shows scattered stone bricks, some bathed in warm sunlight. Blurred green leaves create depth on the left. The midground captures her full figure, while the background reveals an ancient wooden porch with translucent blue curtains fluttering. Behind, faint eaves and walls recede into soft shadow. The composition follows the rule of thirds, her face and crown forming the visual apex. Light falls from the upper left, casting dramatic highlights on the metal and the gleam of her exposed skin, shadowing the contours of her armor and the deep red fabric. The overall atmosphere is tranquil yet charged with tension—a quiet monument to loyalty, sacrifice, and carnal presence. The palette is dominated by black, red, and gold, accented by stone gray and distant blue-green. Every detail is vivid and textured, as if captured by professional photography in natural sunlight, blending classical Eastern aesthetics with raw, adult sensuality.",
