          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer flowing Hanfu dress, light pink to orange gradient, wide sleeves with intricate embroidery and beadwork, the delicate fabric clinging to her curves and partially revealing her firm breasts and nipples. A rich orange brocade belt cinches her waist, adorned with gold tassels and colored beads. Her hair is swept into an elaborate high bun crowned with a gold filigree headdress studded with pearls, sapphires, and white jade, a few loose strands falling seductively along her neck. Pearl tassel earrings brush her collarbone. Her gaze is sharp and defiant, lips parted with a hint of sensual tension, as she grips a silver-gray staff wrapped in red silk ribbons that flutter in the breeze. The setting is a lush courtyard with a winding stone path, white flowering trees shedding petals, and blurred ancient architecture in the distance. Medium shot, she stands center-right, the staff prominent in the foreground. Soft diffused light from the upper left models her face and the sheer fabric, casting subtle shadows that accentuate her form. Warm palette of pink, orange, and green with metallic highlights and red accents. Slight lens distortion and film grain mimic professional cinematography. The scene exudes a blend of classical beauty and martial tension, carrying an erotic undertone through the translucent clothing and her commanding yet inviting pose. A handwritten English text overlay reads \"Return of the Eldest Sister,\" adding narrative depth. The overall mood is sensuous, powerful, and cinematic, capturing a moment poised between fate and desire.",
