          "prompt": "A young female singer performs energetically on stage, her delicate features and natural makeup accentuated by short, wavy hair glowing under the lights. Her bright, focused eyes and wide, confident smile radiate pure joy and allure. She holds a silver rhinestone-encrusted microphone in one hand, with long, slender fingers adorned with sparkling nail art, while the other hand sensually brushes against her ear and neckline. She wears a black, short-sleeved cropped top with a deep V-neckline, the cut low enough to reveal the generous swell of her cleavage and the curve of her breasts, the fabric sheer in places, showing hints of bare skin. The top is embroidered with intricate gold knot and circular badge motifs, adding a regal touch. She pairs it with black high-waisted pants cinched with a metallic buckle belt, the pants hugging her hips and thighs tightly, emphasizing her figure. The background is a massive blue LED screen with a pixel-dot effect, creating deep, layered colors. Stage lights from above and front cast dramatic shadows, highlighting her silhouette and the sheen of sweat on her skin. The medium shot frames her slightly off-center, the microphone leading the eye to her face, then down to her exposed neckline. The lighting is soft yet sculptural, casting warm highlights on her face and collarbones. The overall tone is deep blue and black, punctuated by gold, with a film-grain texture that enhances the raw, live performance intimacy. The moment captures her in a state of breathless, passionate delivery, every detail sharp and sensual.",
