          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a corner of an interior room, wearing a long, high-gloss red crocodile-print leather jacket open to reveal black lace lingerie beneath a sheer mesh dress dripping with green crystal pendants and metal chains. Her hair is pulled back into a sharp ponytail, her pale skin flawless, her makeup precise with razor-thin eyeliner and soft pink lips. She looks slightly down at the camera, her expression calm and confident, body angled to one side, left arm hanging naturally, right hand resting on her hip. To her left, a curved mirror catches her profile and the distant buildings outside, while behind her a warm globe light fixture sends soft yellow illumination across the off-white wall. The window’s black frame shows European facades in muted yellow with white window grids. The scene feels intimate, high-fashion, and subtly erotic—the transparency of the dress hints at her bare skin beneath, the leather jacket framing her body with dangerous elegance. Every detail is crisp, the colors rich, the composition sophisticated and sensual, capturing a private moment of poised exhibitionism.",
