          "alias": "单女粉内衣舞台困倦坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a stage, her pink short hair with subtle gradient layers shimmering under warm lights, bangs neatly framing her forehead, a few strands falling naturally beside her cheek. She tilts her head slightly, eyes gazing upward at an angle, lips pressed gently together as she holds a white lollipop between them, the candy tip peeking out, adding a playful tease. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features delicate and sculpted, with heavy, layered eye makeup—dark eyeliner outlining sharp eyes, long curled lashes, and pink-purple eyeshadow that complements the overall palette. She wears a pink lace bra with thin shoulder straps and a heart-shaped metal charm at the center, paired with a pink mini skirt printed with red cherries and white hearts, the pleated skirt flaring naturally. Over her shoulders, a fluffy pink faux-fur coat, thick and plush, cascades down in rich layers. She sits with legs crossed, one foot in a shiny black high-heeled leather boot that reflects the light, the other foot bare, revealing long, toned legs. The foreground focuses on her upper body and part of her legs; the midground shows her full seated pose against a blurred stage background with faint blue and red lights and silhouettes of black equipment. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, emphasizing her elegant posture and visual impact, with the subject slightly right of center and leaning subtly for dynamic balance. The gaze and head direction lead the viewer's eye upward. Lighting is a cold-warm contrast, with the main source from front-left, illuminating her face and body front, while soft shadows fall to the right. Colored background lights add a dreamy atmosphere. Overall color palette is pink, white, and black, creating a sweet yet sensual mood. The image has strong visual appeal and artistic expression, like a professional fashion shoot, rich in detail, realistic texture, moderate saturation, blending casual everyday feel with high-end refinement.",
