        {
          "id": "krea2-75f665776d10acb46f4ef4f0",
          "alias": "单女全裸人鱼银礼服镜前神秘倚靠戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman reclines gracefully sideways in a deep underwater realm, her body bare except for a sheer silver-gray strapless gown clinging to her curves—its surface dense with tiny sequins and pearl shimmer catching faint light in the dark water. The fabric extends into a luxurious mermaid tail, layered translucent panels radiating like sea anemone or scallop frills, edges traced with fine gold lines mimicking delicate marine scales. She leans back slightly, head raised, eyes locked on the viewer with a calm, mysterious expression. Her black hair is swept smoothly back, revealing a long neck and sharp collarbones; sparkling diamond tassel earrings sway with every subtle movement. Her right hand rests on the mirror-like water surface, fingertips rippling the glassy skin. A perfect reflection mirrors her form, creating symmetrical visual appeal. In the foreground, scattered white shells, coral fragments, and glittering starfish lie partially submerged or floating, rich and realistic. The woman appears as a nude mermaid emerging from the depths, her body immersed in a misty aqueous haze. The background fades from deep blue to black, infinite ocean, with faint ghostly lights and floating particles adding depth and mystery. Low-angle composition places her left of center, drawing the eye from her face along the diagonal of her body and tail ornament, with negative space keeping the frame airy. Her gaze and curves guide the viewer from her face to the dress details and seabed treasures—a complete visual journey. A soft cold key light from above and front illuminates her face and upper body, creating fine highlights and shadows that emphasize skin texture and the gown’s luster, while the background stays dark to silhouette her form. Colorful sparkling particles drift on the water like bioluminescent plankton or magical dust, adding a dreamlike touch. The overall mood blends romance, mystery, and luxury—the refined aesthetic of high-fashion photography with a fairy-tale surrealism, as if capturing a deep-sea princess in a silent slumber, brimming with artistic power and narrative.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
