        {
          "id": "krea2-7e8aba353df99136ee296bf4",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a dark metallic background, her white short-sleeve knit polo unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare chest and nipples, the deep red stripes at collar and cuffs framing her skin. She wears a short gray A-line skirt with geometric diamond pattern, hem barely covering her upper thighs, and holds a light blue logo-print backpack by its brown leather handles, the strap dangling at her side. White sneakers with black crisscross laces and pink ankle socks complete her look. Her auburn hair falls in soft waves around her face, and she gazes at the camera with a contemplative, sultry expression. The background is a dark graphite metal wall with subtle texture and reflections, lit by colorful light bokeh and star-shaped flares in yellow, blue, green, and purple. Soft front-top lighting illuminates her body, creating a strong backlight on the wall. The composition is centered but slightly offset, giving a fashion editorial feel with high contrast, cool tones accented by warm light spots, blending industrial grit with sensual intimacy.",
