        {
          "id": "krea2-0229a0b17cf41f96a6282672",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑西装室内微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long, gradient pink hair stands sideways in a room corner, glancing back over her shoulder with a soft, knowing smile, eyes hinting at playful confidence. Her hair cascades naturally, ends slightly curled, catching warm light that highlights its glossy texture. She wears a loose black blazer, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal a bare torso—her breasts partially exposed, nipples visible against the soft fabric edge. On her lower body, a short black pleated skirt flutters, showing a generous view of her thighs. Her legs are clad in gray thigh-high stockings that hug her skin, ending just above the knee, and she wears classic black Mary Jane shoes with cutout details, low heels. She casually holds a brown leather handbag in her left hand, bag strap dangling, with a few colorful papers peeking out. Her body tilts slightly, one step forward, posture relaxed. Background: a pale wall and a warm red-brown wooden paneled wall, with a baseboard heater, soft beige carpet. Her shadow falls sharply on the white wall, adding depth. The lighting is soft, from the left, casting subtle shadows on her face, clothing folds, and the floor. The composition is mid-shot, subject left of center, leaving breathing room. The palette is black, white, brown, gray, with her pink hair and colorful papers as accents. The scene feels intimate, candid, and visually striking—a mundane moment turned sensual.",
