        {
          "id": "krea2-a867a110767561f204648d6f",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑外套害羞坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in front of a deep red velvet curtain, her long black hair flowing with neat air bangs, blue eyes clear and bright, their gaze tender and slightly shy. Her fair delicate skin shows a natural blush on her cheeks, lips parted in a sweet, subtle smile. She wears a large fuzzy brown bow headband made of soft faux fur with polished edges and a deep brown satin ribbon that catches the light; two adorable fluffy ears extend from the sides, adding a playful, girlish charm. Her black short-sleeve jacket is unzipped and pushed open, revealing her bare chest—her breasts fully exposed, nipples erect against the cool air. The jacket has a slight leather-like sheen with white stripe accents on the shoulders and sleeves. She holds a fluffy brown teddy bear in her right arm, its soft warm fur, white nose with dark stitching, and black dot eyes hanging naturally. Her left hand forms a loose fist, knuckles lightly touching her chin as she tilts her head slightly forward, gaze locked on the lens, creating an intimate, inviting connection. In the foreground, a dark blue table holds an orange-framed microphone with a gray mesh head, partially visible. The background is thick deep red velvet with vertical folds, rich and uniform. The composition is a medium close-up, her head slightly left, eyes directly at the viewer; the teddy bear balances the left side. Camera angle is slightly low, enhancing her approachable, three-dimensional presence. Lighting comes from front-right, soft and even, illuminating her face, hair, and the teddy bear's front, with natural shadows on the right side of her face, neck, and arms, accentuating contours. The curtain shows subtle light variations, adding depth. The overall mood is warm and sweet, with youthful vitality and a healing vibe, yet explicitly sexual—her topless state contrasts with the cute accessories and plush toy. Color palette: warm browns, deep reds, black, with white and blue accents. The image has high-quality portrait realism, as if captured by a professional camera but with a spontaneous fan-meeting feel, full of genuine emotion and intimate interaction.",
