        {
          "id": "krea2-b8fc9bd3779fd32f7b08185b",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服城市媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A stunning woman in a glamorous pink sequin gown stands in a modern minimalist interior. The dress is a tight mermaid silhouette with a sweetheart neckline, off-shoulder design that bares her shoulders and showcases a deep cleavage. Horizontal metallic sequin bands accentuate her waist and bust, creating a dazzling layered effect, while the entire skirt is densely covered in fine pink sequins that shimmer and flow with every movement, giving a futuristic and seductive aura. She poses naturally, slightly turned, her right hand gently holding a bouquet of black roses that look mysterious and dark in the dim light. Her left hand hangs down, adorned with an elegant silver bracelet and rings; a delicate diamond necklace rests on her collarbone, and sparkling stud earrings glint from her ears. Her hair is meticulously styled up, with a few strands falling casually, and her makeup is perfect—sharp eyeliner and full, kissable lips. She stares directly into the camera with confident, alluring eyes. The background is a gray tiled wall with subtle texture and a black-framed corner, creating a clean, spatial atmosphere. The composition uses a slight tilt, placing her on the right side with negative space on the left, using diagonal lines to add dynamic energy. Light comes from front-left, softly shining on her face and dress, creating strong contrast—the sequins sparkle and flash in the light, while the background remains dark to emphasize her silhouette. The overall mood is both high-end and intimate, like a moment captured from an exclusive high-society party or fashion event. The image is rich in detail, with medium saturation, realistic yet artfully enhanced, resembling a professional low-light portrait shot with a high-end camera. It radiates a strong visual impact and emotion—no distractions, focused entirely on her beauty and the dress. Through the perfect interplay of light, color, and composition, she embodies an elegant, sexy, and subtly cool urban femme fatale, stepping straight out of a fashion magazine cover. Every detail is designed to perfection, showcasing ultimate aesthetic appeal.",
