        {
          "id": "krea2-1f069f17b98493144049a1da",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙椅上媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a vintage red velvet seat, wearing a black sleeveless dress with delicate white lace trim at the neckline and chest, the cut plunging low to reveal the soft curve of her cleavage. Her short hair is neatly swept to one side, with natural bangs falling softly. Her makeup is fresh and natural, lips a gentle rose red, eyes tenderly fixed on the camera. Her right hand gently cups her chin, fingers long and elegant, adorned with small gold earrings. Her left hand rests casually on her thigh, legs crossed, clad in sheer black stockings and black pointed-toe high heels. The pose is poised yet boldly sensual. In the foreground, her seated figure is fully visible; in the middle ground, the dark wooden chair, a floor lamp, and a marble-textured wooden partition catch the warm yellow glow of the lamp, illuminating her face and hand. The background blurs into a theater interior with rows of red seats, creating rhythmic bokeh and strong depth of field. The whole space is dominated by red tones, the carpet a heavy fabric with orange-red patterns, reflecting a faint sheen. The composition places the subject slightly left of center, using diagonal lines leading from the lower right to the figure, guiding the eye. Lighting comes from the table lamp on the right combined with ambient light, forming soft chiaroscuro—her left face is evenly lit, while the right side has subtle shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm and intimate, like a quiet afternoon moment, with cinematic texture and film-grain quality. The color palette is warm, saturation moderate, detail rich, layers distinct, as if shot with a professional camera and a large aperture, capturing an effortless, artistic beauty in everyday life.",
