        {
          "id": "krea2-6dce47eceee948f0515bb61b",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A majestic Eastern classical beauty sits gracefully on an intricately carved wooden throne, her pitch-black hair styled in an elegant ancient bun adorned with an ornate golden phoenix crown and jeweled hairpins, a delicate flower-shaped *huadian* dot on her forehead. Her eyes are deep and serene, lips pale red, face exquisitely refined, with a hint of melancholic nobility. She wears a white satin robe embroidered with golden phoenix patterns, the front left wide open, revealing one perfectly rounded breast, the nipple a soft pink against her pale skin. A fluffy white fox-fur cape drapes over her shoulders, the fur rich and textured. Her hands rest lightly on her lap, one fingers tracing a suggestive line along her thigh. The background features a traditional Chinese screen with carved latticework, behind which hang rows of pearl curtains, shimmering with soft light. Warm amber backlighting creates a gentle rim glow around her silhouette, casting high-contrast shadows and luxurious highlights on her face and attire. The composition is centered, focusing on her expression—a mixture of regal composure and sensual invitation. The overall palette is cream, gold, and deep brown, evoking an opulent yet tender court atmosphere. The image has a cinematic, almost painterly quality, with soft noise and natural light flow, bridging historical grandeur and modern erotic artistry.",
