        {
          "id": "krea2-2979e250d731ed419ff04cae",
          "alias": "单女露胸金高领衫城市媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways on the stone edge of a bridge over the Seine in Paris, her chin-length brown bob tousled by a gentle breeze, a few strands falling across her forehead, a small black clip in her hair. She wears a unique color-block short-sleeve top—soft pale yellow fitted turtleneck with deep gray-blue shoulders and sleeves, creating a striking contrast—paired with a bright red high-waisted skirt, its hem edged in dark blue. Her pose is elegantly natural, body leaning slightly forward, right hand resting on the rough stone railing. She gazes downward into the distance, her expression calm and contemplative, as if lost in thought or watching the river flow. In the background, blurred classical Parisian buildings with beige facades, arched windows, and balconies, French flags fluttering above. The river sparkles, reflecting the pale blue sky and warm tones of the architecture. Distant silhouettes of pedestrians cross the bridge. Composition: medium shot, figure occupies left two-thirds, with open space on the right showing the river and buildings. Captured with a 50mm lens, sharp focus on her face and upper body, shallow depth of field, natural bokeh. Warm afternoon natural light from the right front, soft and even, casting subtle shadows on her cheek and neck, enhancing dimensionality. Color palette: warm yellows, reds, gray-blue, with beige and gray-green in the background. Her top has been unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest, the fabric falling open slightly, exposing her firm breasts with nipples visible, the red skirt riding up her thigh as she arches her back just a little, one hand brushing her hip. The atmosphere is intimate and poetic, a moment of quiet sensuality amidst urban life. Slight film grain, rich details, natural skin texture, soft clothing folds. A realistic, artful photograph with both fashion polish and everyday warmth, as if capturing a private, candid instant at dusk.",
