          "alias": "单女半褪黑浴袍媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman captures a sensual selfie, wearing an exquisite Chinese traditional outfit - a black satin robe with gold trim and frog buttons, open to reveal a red velvet vest embroidered with golden auspicious clouds and tassels, the robe slipping off one shoulder to expose bare skin. Her black hair is in double braids with bangs, adorned with red flower hair ornaments and gold tassel earrings. She smiles sweetly, eyes bright and direct, her right hand making a V-sign, her left hand tugging the robe slightly lower. The close-up tilted angle frames her face and upper body, highlighting the texture of the skin and the rich details of the clothing. The background is a simple gray wall and dark doorframe, with soft diffused lighting from the front left enhancing the skin's luminosity and the fabric's sheen. The color contrast of black, red, and gold is striking, creating a warm, intimate, and confident mood that blends traditional elegance with modern sensuality.",
