          "alias": "单女半褪金挂脖竹林媚态蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer yellow halter-neck crop-top dress, the lightweight chiffon fabric clinging to her curves, with delicate three-dimensional floral appliqués at the neckline and waist. The dress is hiked up to expose her upper thighs and the edge of her lace panties, while the halter strap has slipped off one shoulder, revealing a bare shoulder and the top of a full, almost-exposed breast. She crouches in a half-squat on a dark wooden bench, her left hand gripping the edge, body leaning forward, head tilted slightly, eyes locked on the camera with a mix of gentle shyness and sultry invitation. Her black hair is swept up in a high bun, baring her long neck. Flawless makeup with rosy blush, natural lip color, and accentuated bright eyes. Small pearl earrings and a delicate white chain bracelet adorn her. In the foreground, the details of her body and the dress; midground includes a woven rattan chair, a gray wicker basket, and several potted plants. The background is a blue-gray brick wall with clear textures and neat mortar lines, tall bamboo and dense green shrubs beside it, and part of a beige plush toy visible on the right. Center-symmetrical composition, the figure slightly left of center, drawing visual focus. Light from front-right, soft and even, highlighting her skin and the fabric with warm, natural shadows and subtle gradients—no harsh contrasts. The overall mood is intimate, cozy, and casually lived-in, like a candid shot taken in a courtyard or café corner—simulated phone or compact camera look with slight grain and realism. Moderate color saturation, harmonious tones, blending fresh, natural aesthetics with a touch of modern sensuality.",
