          "prompt": "A young woman with long dark brown hair and blunt bangs, styled in a high bun secured by a black wide headband with a small black bow. Her right hand touches a strand of hair at her cheek, fingers slender with clean nails. She wears a sleeveless gingham dress, unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, the fabric slipping off one shoulder to reveal a pale collarbone and the curve of her chest. The dress has a large layered bow at the collar, a cutout below the neckline, and a row of small buttons; above her right breast is a silver badge engraved \"ACRN.\" Her makeup is soft and warm: brown eyeshadow, defined eyeliner, thick curled lashes, and glossy pink lips slightly parted. Her skin is fair, facial features delicate. The setting is an elegant interior with a beige textured wall, a large ornate gold-framed mirror on the left reflecting her side, a small round gold mirror on the right, and a wall sconce with a warm yellow glow. The composition is a medium close-up, head tilted, direct eye contact with the viewer. Side lighting creates soft shadows and highlights on her skin, hair, and dress. The color palette is warm yellows and beiges contrasting with the dark gingham and black headband. The image has a vintage film aesthetic—grainy, slightly color-shifted, as if captured by a 50mm lens in twilight—evoking an intimate, sensual, and nostalgic atmosphere.",
