        {
          "id": "krea2-b71eb59dd48b11d5a0a30f18",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔寺庙微笑站立招手",
          "prompt": "A young woman with soft, deep red long curly hair stands in the front row of a brilliantly lit indoor basketball arena, the strands catching warm highlights from the overhead lights. She is completely topless, her breasts bare and full, nipples slightly peaked in the cool air, her skin pale and flawless. She wears only high-waisted tight blue jeans that hug her hips, the waistband low enough to reveal her slender waist and the gentle curve of her belly. Her right hand lifts slowly, fingers brushing the temple of a pair of black sunglasses perched on her head, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side, a delicate gold chain bracelet catching the light. She turns her body sideways, looking back over her shoulder at the camera with a soft, knowing smile, her bright eyes warm and inviting, her lips naturally tinted, her nose straight and elegant. The composition places her in the right foreground, taking up about a third of the frame, creating a visual line from her face diagonally back to the left into the deep arena. Behind her, an NBA game is in full swing—players in purple and gold jerseys run, pass, and shoot on the white court; coaches and referees are visible; the stands are packed with enthusiastic fans waving arms and phones, all in a blur of motion and color. A massive circular electronic scoreboard overhead glows with \"LAKERS\" in bold white on blue, scrolling data and ads like \"MAKE THE PLAY GO THE DISTANCE\". The light from the scoreboard casts cool white highlights on her skin and hair, while the venue's metal framework, layered seating, and suspended audio systems fade into soft focus. The low-angle shot emphasizes both her elegant posture and the grand scale of the scene. The lighting is layered—golden spotlights and cool LED from the board illuminate her front and side, creating gentle highlights on her shoulders and hair, while the background remains darker, enhancing her prominence. The overall color palette is blue-purple with warm yellow accents, giving a vibrant nightlife energy. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy film texture with natural depth-of-field, as if captured by a professional camera during the live event, blending documentary warmth with artistic precision, evoking both the thrill of the sports game and the intimate stillness of a personal moment.",
