          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a minimalist office, wearing a deep blue denim sleeveless top left unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, paired with high-waisted wide-leg jeans in the same shade. Her hair is swept up into an elegant bun with a few loose strands framing her face. She has flawless makeup, red lips slightly parted, and a calm, confident gaze directly at the camera, one hand tucked into her jeans pocket, the other hanging naturally, her pose relaxed yet powerful. On the left foreground sits a black metal-framed desk with a sleek silver modern lamp, a white flip calendar showing \"20\" and \"33\", a cream ceramic mug, a light brown folder with curled edges, and a stainless steel pen holder filled with pens, all contributing to a realistic workplace setting. The background is a pure white wall with subtle cracks and texture, and the floor is covered in fine gray carpet. The composition is off-center, with the woman shifted to the right, leaving the desk items visible on the left for visual balance. The camera angle is slightly below eye level, enhancing her stature. Lighting comes from the front left, soft and even, resembling studio lighting with a mix of natural and artificial sources, casting gentle shadows and highlighting her face and clothing folds. The overall color palette is blue, black, white, and gray, creating a calm, restrained mood with a slightly grainy film-like texture, embodying an urban office woman's everyday aesthetic, suitable for fashion or brand imagery.",
