        {
          "id": "krea2-e3ecd27f6dd4e6b3c348f67d",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰毛衣摄影棚冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an elegant dance pose at center frame, topless, her bare skin glowing under soft front-top lighting. She wears only a deep gray vertical-stripe ribbed knit cardigan unbuttoned, one shoulder slipped down, the fabric cascading open to expose her breasts and torso; a white tank top is absent, replaced by nude skin. Her high-waisted shorts in the same gray tone sit low on her hips, revealing a thin strip of waist. The cardigan's sleeves are loosely rolled, showing her slender arms. Her black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her cheek, adding a soft, lazy feel. She turns slightly, head lowered, gaze downward, expression focused and serene, lost in thought. Right hand lifts above her head, fingers extended, left hand gently holding her right wrist, creating a flowing arc. Her arm lines stretch in a graceful dance freeze. Background is a clean pale blue gradient, from light blue to a slightly gray-tinged soft hue, creating an airy, tranquil atmosphere with no distractions. Composition is vertical, subject slightly left of center, body diagonally extended for dynamic movement, with generous negative space. Low-angle shot emphasizes her long limbs and poised stance. Light is even, from front upper, no harsh shadows; her facial features are clear, skin texture smooth with natural sheen. The knit fabric shows fine folds and realistic depth. Overall palette: cool gray and soft blue, evoking a calm, modern aesthetic. A subtle film grain and analog camera look, as if shot with a professional mirrorless camera and standard prime lens, exposure accurate, colors true, details rich, with a mild vintage filter enhancing the artistic feel. This captures a quiet afternoon moment—a dancer alone in the studio, immersed in thought, poetic and emotionally charged.",
