          "alias": "单女短裙床忧伤持灯",
          "prompt": "A classical oriental beauty in an elaborate Hanfu, the top loosened to reveal her pale shoulders and the swell of her breasts. Her ink-black hair is piled in an elegant cloud bun adorned with gold tassel hairpins and tiny pearls, a few strands brushing her shoulders. Her face is pure and ethereal, with deep, longing eyes and slightly parted red lips, her expression serene but tinged with a hint of melancholy and desire. The white Hanfu features pink cloud embroidery at the collar; the wide, flowing sleeves drape softly off her shoulders, and the light, silk fabric falls naturally. The skirt spreads across a blue bed, beside a vibrant brocade quilt in gold, vermilion, and emerald. In the lower left foreground, a candle flickers, casting warm orange light. Behind her, a wooden lattice window with light green and cream curtains lets in soft natural light, revealing pink cherry blossoms drifting outside. A wooden decorative lantern hangs above. The composition is centered, with the figure as the focal point. Lighting blends natural light from the right window and warm candlelight from the left, creating soft chiaroscuro—highlights on her face, exposed skin, and clothing folds, shadows deepening around her body and the bed. The color palette is warm and muted: cream, pale pink, soft green, gold. The image has a high level of detail, from the metallic sheen of the hairpins to the fabric textures and subtle light variations, rendered in a photorealistic style with shallow depth of field, focusing on her face and bare shoulders, capturing a moment of quiet, sensual elegance.",
