        {
          "id": "krea2-26224afe46e5dc16f3edf7a6",
          "alias": "单女露胸女仆黑女仆装摄影棚戏谑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black metal swing, wearing a revealing black-and-white maid outfit—her white lace collar and cuffs framed by delicate trim, the black cross-straps over her chest left loose, exposing the soft curve of her bare breasts. She wears a sheer black long-sleeve coat, unbuttoned, with white fabric at the cuffs; around her waist, a wide black leather belt with a metal buckle cinches her form. Her skirt is a fluffy white ruffle, barely covering her black lace thigh-high stockings, her legs elegantly crossed. Her long dark brown hair has a tidy fringe, topped with a simple white headband; small silver earrings glint. She stares directly at the camera with clear, inviting eyes, a hint of a teasing smile on her lips. Her right hand lifts to lightly touch her exposed chest, fingers grazing her skin. The dim indoor setting shows a dark gray, textured wall; a sidelight casts long shadows across the swing and floor, creating sharp contrasts. The metal chains and structure of the swing are clearly visible. Shot in a medium close-up with the subject slightly right of center, her body angled to suggest movement. Foreground focuses on her face and torso; midground shows the clothing details and swing; background is a blur of wall and light. The soft top-left lighting highlights her face, shoulders, and exposed skin, forming warm highlights and deep shadows that enhance depth and volume. The overall mood blends vintage and modern with a subtle gothic touch—black, white, gray tones accented by warm amber light, evoking a quiet, mysterious, and sensual atmosphere. The image has a cinematic look, like an artistic studio portrait with slight natural grain, realistic depth of field, and natural reflections, balancing polish with everyday authenticity.",
