        {
          "id": "krea2-4b00dd5040ecbbd2826b836c",
          "alias": "单女半褪白衬衫博物馆俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sophisticated bunny-girl cosplay stands in the center of a bright, spacious indoor exhibition hall. She has short silver-white hair and soft facial features, wearing glossy black bunny ears. Her gaze is slightly lazy but expressive, looking directly at the lens. Her left hand gracefully holds a wooden tray with a stemmed glass of dark red liquid, while her right hand makes a peace sign, balancing playfulness and elegance. She wears a white ruffled blouse that is unbuttoned to reveal the curves of her breasts, over a glossy black corset that pushes her cleavage up, with intricate lace and metal clasps. Her lower body is clad in tight black leather shorts, black thigh-high stockings with bow embellishments, and high-heeled patent leather shoes. The overall look merges cute and sexy elements. She stands slightly turned in the left foreground, forming a beautiful S-curve. The background is a vast exhibition space with a black grid ceiling dotted with countless circular lights creating a dense halo effect. In the distance, blurry exhibition booths, photo equipment, and a few visitors are visible. The floor is highly reflective, mirroring the figure and lights. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot emphasizing her long legs and commanding presence. Visual lines lead from her body and the glass deep into the background. The lighting is cool-toned, coming from above and behind, producing strong chiaroscuro. Her face and upper body are brightly illuminated, highlighting delicate skin texture and glossy fabric, while the background remains relatively dark, creating a theatrical spotlight effect. The overall image feels like a professional studio shoot yet retains a candid event atmosphere. The color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, with the wine red as a focal point. The composition is full and layered, with the foreground figure crisp, midground details visible, and background softly blurred, enhancing depth and dimension. This scene embodies a perfect fusion of modern fashion and anime culture, full of energy and allure. The blouse is left open, exposing the top of her corset and a generous hint of bare skin; the corset is cut low, revealing the upper swell of her breasts, and her nipples are partially visible through the lace trim. The shorts ride up high on her hips, and the stockings are slightly pulled down, showing a strip of bare thigh. Her pose is slightly tilted, one hand resting on her hip, and she bites her lower lip softly, giving an invitation that is both coy and daring.",
