aze creating strong narrative, lighting cool-toned overall bluish-green, side/back light from left and rear creating rim lighting, highlights on hair, glasses, and weapon producing metallic reflections, shadows soft and smooth, ground reflecting her silhouette and lights adding depth, atmosphere futuristic and combat-ready as if about to spring into action, image feels like a professional studio shot with shallow depth of field focusing precisely on her face and sword, background blurred delicately, color saturation moderate, details rich, sharp quality, cinematic visual performance while retaining a natural amateur feel, light distribution realistic without overprocessing.",
