          "alias": "单女透视米毛衣椅上微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits outdoors on a white bench, wearing an oversized cream chunky knit sweater with classic diamond pattern—one side slipped off her shoulder to expose bare skin and a hint of cleavage, wide sleeves, hem falling to mid-thigh. She wears black sheer stockings and high-cream glossy over-the-knee boots that hug her legs tightly. Her short wavy dark brown hair falls naturally around her face. She sits sideways, left leg bent with toes lightly touching the ground, right leg extended, right hand resting on top of her head with fingers slightly curled, gazing at the camera with a soft, inviting look, lips parted in a subtle smile with nude pink lipstick. Natural makeup. Foreground shows gray rough ground; the white bench edge is clean. Midground features dense autumn bushes with deep green and golden leaves; above, tree branches are strung with warm yellow light bulbs, creating soft bokeh. Background is a blurred city nightscape with faint glass building silhouettes. Warm yellow back-and-side lighting casts soft highlights on her bare shoulder, the sweater texture, and the shiny boots. Sensual, romantic autumn night atmosphere with a realistic photography style, shallow depth of field, and rich detail.",
