          "alias": "单女黑礼服害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways against a weathered stone balustrade, wearing a black sleeveless backless gown that falls naturally with soft folds and a bow tied at one side, a single orange-red tulip dangling from the hem. The dress dips dangerously low, exposing the full length of her spine and the subtle curve of her hips. Her long black hair falls in natural waves over her bare shoulders, catching the warm golden sunset light. She tilts her head slightly upward, gazing into the distance with a serene, contemplative expression, lips parted, cheeks flushed with a gentle blush. Her skin is pale and luminous. On her left wrist is a simple silver watch; her right hand holds a bouquet of yellow daffodils and small white flowers, placed on the rough stone railing. In the foreground, the flowers and railing are sharp; she is in the middle; behind her looms a grand classical European building with arched windows and pillars, the facade soft and blurred with bokeh. The sun strikes from upper right, creating a glowing rim light around her silhouette, casting warm shadows across her exposed back and face. The scene feels like a film still, shot with an 85mm lens at f/2.8, shallow depth of field focused on her face and hands. The mood is intimate, romantic, with a quiet sensuality emphasized by the bare skin and the delicate tension of her pose.",
