          "prompt": "A young woman sits on aged wooden steps, nude from the waist up, her bare breasts softly lit by natural sunlight. She wears only a pair of white shorts, legs crossed, one hand holding a tall glass of creamy drink with two straws, the other resting on a red floral cushion beside her. Her head tilts slightly toward the camera, dark hair falling over her shoulders, a pair of black sunglasses perched atop her head. Her skin is fair and smooth, lips natural, nails light pink. The scene is a Southeast Asian outdoor café entrance, with a faded red wooden door on the left, silver handle, hints of diners inside—one in pink top, another in green work pants and hat. To the right, wooden rails and glass windows reflect blue sky, white clouds, and green trees. Two bright round cushions lie beneath her—one red with yellow-green patterns, another with a phoenix design. Beside her rest a traditional straw hat and a woven rattan bag with green lettering. Foreground focuses on her face, chest, and drink; midground includes cushions, hat, bag, and partial architecture; background extends into the dim interior and distant scenery. Composition is symmetrical, subject centered slightly right, eyes drawing attention to her face and the glass. Light comes from the right, casting soft shadows left and downward, enhancing depth. Overall warm tones, with the purple-red of her removed dress (discarded nearby) echoing the red door and cushions, evoking exotic, lazy afternoon sensuality. Image quality is lifelike, with subtle film grain and a candid, everyday feel—rich in detail, layered in gentle realism.",
