          "prompt": "A young woman in a vintage green cheongsam with pink floral patterns, the back is completely bare with thin straps tied at the nape, exposing her smooth, sensual spine and shoulder blades. She wears a wide-brimmed black straw hat adorned with blooming pink flowers and green leaves. Her long black hair falls softly, with neat bangs. Her delicate face has a mysterious, seductive gaze, lips slightly parted, looking directly at the viewer. Her right hand gently holds the hat brim, arm bent, body slightly turned in a half-glance pose, creating an intimate, alluring interaction. Medium close-up, foreground details of the hat flowers and cheongsam fabric. Background: a traditional Chinese courtyard interior, blurred wooden lattice and dark walls. Warm, soft side light from the left, casting gentle shadows on her bare back and highlighting her curves. The composition forms an S-curve from hat to body. Film-like grain and warmth, nostalgic amateur camera feel. The atmosphere is both elegant and erotic, with a quiet, poetic sensuality.",
