          "prompt": "A young woman in a torn dark gray coarse linen robe, her chest partially bared, wearing a black headscarf, her face angular and pale, blood trickling from the corner of her mouth, her eyes cold and intense behind vintage metal sunglasses with dark green lenses showing scratches and wear. She grips a weathered ancient sword hilt, the blade engraved with complex runes and age erosion, her knuckles white and veins prominent with tension. A heavy brown leather crossbody strap studded with brass rivets and buckles cuts across her shoulder, pulling the robe open to reveal the curve of her breast and collarbone. The background is a blurred outdoor battlefield or ancient market with figures in similar attire. Warm afternoon sunlight streams from the upper right, casting dramatic chiaroscuro across her face, hands, and exposed skin, with soft layered shadows. Close-up portrait framing her upper body and face, shallow depth of field, slight lens distortion and film grain for a handheld-camera realism. Cool-toned palette with golden highlights, a mood of exhausted defiance after battle, her lips parted and bloodied, her bare shoulder and the hint of a nipple visible through the torn fabric, sensual and fierce. The visual focus locks on her eyes and wounded mouth, evoking a gritty, narrative-driven independent war film with raw erotic tension.",
