          "alias": "单女黑外套摄影棚媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands confidently at the center of an indoor photo studio or camera shop. She wears a long black coat open over a black strap top and matching short shorts—or nothing underneath but black stockings with thigh slits and black high-heel sandals. Black-rimmed glasses frame her eyes; a white work badge dangles from her neck. Hands on hips, she stares directly at the camera, her expression cool and detached, blending professional chic with raw sensuality. In the left foreground: a green bulletin board on a white metal stand, plastered with colorful flyers and a silver headset. Beside it, a red plastic bin and a small beige plastic stool. On the right: a silver newspaper rack filled with stacked papers, topped with \"ONEONE Selfie\" signage. In the background, a red-white-blue vertical banner reads \"Konica\" and Japanese characters \"コニカ\" with a \"新\" logo. Next to it, a wooden wall and a doorway open into a back area where blue mosaic tiles and blurred shelves are faintly visible. The compact space feels lived-in, lit by overhead fluorescent tubes casting uniform cool white light—flat but clear. Composition is symmetrical, with the woman as the focal point. Foreground clutter, midground figure, and background signage create layered depth. Shadows are soft, yet her silhouette is crisp; the texture of her stockings and the folds of her coat catch the light. The palette is mostly black and white, punctuated by red, blue, and green accents—stark but harmonious. The scene feels like a candid shot from an ordinary workday, yet her bold stance and revealing outfit make it intensely alluring, blending documentary realism with erotic tension.",
