          "prompt": "A classical East Asian beauty sits in a traditional chamber, her elaborate hair crown of pearls, jade, and gold wire flowers towering above, with dangling earrings and a small forehead ornament. Her eyes are downcast, lips pale, skin like jade, expression serene yet sorrowful. She wears only a sheer, wide-sleeved silk robe in pale cyan, embroidered with gold patterns, left open to expose her full bare breasts, the fabric slipping off one shoulder. A blue-and-gold woven panel remains at the chest, and a deep blue inner layer is visible at the hips. Her hands gently hold a white porcelain teapot, as if about to pour tea. On the dark wooden table before her are plates of braised pork, fried items, and green vegetables in simple white porcelain. Behind, a large round screen with warm-brown tinted ink-wash mountains and birds, dark red rim. Soft, warm side lighting from a low angle highlights her skin, the sheen of the robe, and the curves of her exposed body, creating deep shadows and a luminous glow. Medium close-up composition, slightly below eye level, focusing on her face and hands with the table in sharp foreground. Background is blurred, giving a shallow depth of field. Color palette: cyan, warm yellow, ochre. The overall mood is a classic, poetic, sensual stillness, like a Song dynasty lady portrait with modern photographic clarity and intimate adult allure.",
