          "id": "krea2-1cabb4f33c66222e2536c3d0",
          "alias": "单女上衣广场媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the hallway of a modern commercial building, her body poised with a gentle, seductive smile as she looks softly into the camera. Her long light-brown hair falls in soft waves with curled ends, partly braided into a delicate side braid tied with a black ribbon, the rest cascading naturally with a subtle shine under the warm lights. She wears a sheer, off-shoulder gray knit top that slides down to reveal her bare shoulders and the top curves of her full breasts, leaving her nipples faintly visible through the delicate fabric. Below, a high-waisted gray pleated miniskirt hugs her hips, the skirt's hemline lifted slightly as her left hand playfully grasps the edge, exposing the smooth skin of her upper thigh. Her right hand rests casually at her side, and her body twists slightly into an elegant S-curve. She wears tall black leather boots that hug her legs, the chunky heel adding a grounded sensuality. The composition is a mid-shot, capturing her from head to toe. The background shows a modern mall interior: to the left, a glass storefront of a brand boutique with \"PRADA\" partially visible, displaying handbags and accessories inside, reflections of ambient light on the glass; to the right, a beige marble-textured wall with embedded lighting. The ceiling features square metal grilles and recessed spotlights providing even illumination. The floor is large gray-and-white granite tiles with a subtle granular texture, reflecting a soft gloss. The overall scene is clean, urban, and sophisticated. The camera uses a standard lens, sharp focus on the subject, with a slight blur to the background for depth. Lighting comes from warm white LEDs above, soft and even, highlighting her facial features and the delicate folds of her clothes. The color palette is neutral—gray, white, black, beige—creating a harmonious, fresh, and high-end feel. The photographic style resembles a candid street fashion shot, capturing a moment of confident, independent urban femininity with an inviting, sensual presence.",
