          "alias": "单女露胸街道沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on a metal bridge covered in love locks, her deep brown wavy hair cascading over bare shoulders, catching sunlight. She wears only white sneakers and holds a small champagne handbag with a bow; her left hand touches her chest while her right hangs naturally. Her body is slightly turned, face centered, lips parted in a contemplative gaze, natural makeup, clear features. Background shows riverbank buildings, bare trees, distant city. The bridge is lined with colorful love locks—gold, red, silver—forming a dense pattern. Wooden planks warm in sunlight. Strong side lighting from upper left creates dramatic chiaroscuro, highlighting her left side and casting right into soft shadow. Shadows from railings stretch parallel, enhancing depth. Composition follows rule of thirds; the woman occupies main focus, background elements provide environmental context without distraction. Visual lines from planks and railings lead to her, with symmetrical locks framing the scene. Atmosphere is bright, warm, spring-like; light reflects off water and bridge, creating gentle glimmers. Palette includes warm whites, light yellows, pale pinks, contrasted by cool metallic tones. Soft but directional light emphasizes her form and clothing details. Background slightly blurred to sharpen focus on her. Overall feel is candid, street photography aesthetic, with natural grain and subtle overexposure, evoking film photography—a spontaneous, intimate moment captured on a sunny afternoon.",
