          "prompt": "A young woman stands confidently in the center of a grand indoor hall, wearing only a sheer white cropped tank top that exposes her bare breasts and a pair of tight green shorts with a drawstring, the hem riding high on her thighs. Her thick-soled white combat boots are unlaced, revealing blue cloud-patterned socks at the top. A pair of white wired earphones hangs loose around her neck. She tilts her head slightly upward to the left, a soft, knowing smile on her lips as she gazes diagonally upward, one hand resting casually on her bare hip. Her dark curly hair falls naturally, catching the light with a gentle sheen. Behind her, the towering arched lobby is built of warm beige stone with massive grid-paned windows, through which golden sunlight pours, casting dramatic beams across the floor and highlighting her toned figure. Symmetrical wide stone staircases flank the hall, their metal railings gleaming faintly. In the distance, blurred silhouettes of a few pedestrians move, adding a sense of life. The floor is polished light gray marble, reflecting the surrounding light and shadows. The composition is a low-angle shot looking upward, emphasizing her tall, graceful stance and the majestic architecture. The foreground is crisp, with her and the near steps in focus, while the background layers of architectural details and distant figures recede. Her gaze leads the eye upward toward the high ceiling, creating a sense of vertical expansion. The lighting is a mix of soft diffuse light from the windows and direct sunlight patches, producing rich tonal contrasts. The overall vibe blends modern urban sensuality with classical dignity—an intimate, artistic portrait that feels both candid and deliberately composed, capturing a moment of effortless allure in a timeless setting. Warm golden tones dominate, accented by blue, green, and white, creating a harmonious, life-filled palette.",
