          "prompt": "A young woman with short silver-white hair stands barefoot on stone steps beneath a modern arched metal bridge, wearing only an open blue denim jacket, black fishnet stockings, and high-lace boots—her black shorts discarded, leaving her toned thighs and bare ass exposed. She raises her right hand high, clutching a red electric guitar with worn, vintage scratches in her left, her body arched back in a triumphant, rock-star pose. Low-angle shot emphasizes her powerful silhouette. Behind her, a massive white steel arch structure curves with futuristic geometry. Sunlight streams from upper left, creating a bright backlight and a soft halo around her skin, with sweat and muscle definition visible. The sky is pale blue, shadows sharp. Composition places her center-right, the bridge diagonal leading the eye upward. Foreground: rough gray steps. Midground: her naked torso and dynamic stance. Background: sleek modern architecture. Her expression is ecstatic, wild. The scene blends urban edge with raw sexual energy, colors blue/white/red with stark contrasts. Details include fabric folds on her jacket, the gloss of her hair, the sheen of her skin, and reflections off metal. A high-quality, cinematic portrait capturing a moment of unrestrained, defiant sexuality.",
