          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a black leather armchair, legs crossed, body leaning forward, hands resting casually on her knees. She has soft brown hair with blunt bangs, calm eyes gazing intently into the lens, delicate facial features, fair skin, lips slightly parted in a hint of lazy stillness. She wears a tight black long-sleeve top, unbuttoned low to reveal the swell of her bare breasts, and sheer stockings that highlight the long, graceful lines of her legs. The scene is set against dark horizontal blinds with parallel slats, warm golden light slanting in from the right, casting striped shadows across the room. On the left, a black leather cushion; on the right, a wooden side table holding books and a dried plant arrangement. The floor is pale tiled, subtly textured, with a warm yellow floor lamp beneath the chair casting upward light, enhancing depth and intimacy. The composition is centered, subject slightly below mid-frame, head lifted, eyes meeting the viewer directly. Color palette: black, brown, gold, low saturation film-like quality with subtle grain. Medium telephoto lens, shallow depth of field, soft background blur. Warm side-backlight creates gentle rim lighting and smooth shadow transitions. The atmosphere is quiet, introspective, slightly mysterious—a private urban moment blending fashion sensuality with everyday realism, full of narrative tension and a charged, erotic stillness.",
