          "alias": "单女黑外套街道冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on the rear of a heavily modified blue supercar, her long black coat hanging open to reveal her bare chest and short skirt riding high on her thighs. She sits with legs crossed, black stilettos dangling, her gaze cold and mysterious, locked directly at the lens. Her dark wavy hair is tousled by the night breeze, strands lifting. Her right hand rests on the car's massive carbon-fiber spoiler, left hand casually at her side, body leaning forward in a poised, tension-filled balance. The car is a bright blue widebody with aggressive lines, a giant carbon wing with red LED strip underneath, \"Liberty Walk\" decals and a smiley-face sticker. Large multi-spoke wheels with orange centers and thick tires. The scene is a modern city street at night, towering dark-gray buildings with warm orange-lit windows blurred into bokeh, creating a cyberpunk atmosphere. Low-angle shot emphasizes the scale of car and woman. Lighting from side-front highlights her face and body, casting sharp shadows on the ground and undercarriage, with cool blue tones contrasting warm yellow lights. The image has a professional high-resolution look with slight grain and natural light falloff, as if captured by a high-end camera in an impromptu night street shot. Subtle vignetting draws focus to the center. The composition guides the eye from her expression along the car's lines to the glowing city backdrop.",
