          "alias": "单女金浴袍沙发忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in lavish Tang Dynasty Hanfu sits indoors, her raven hair piled high in an intricate ancient updo adorned with gold flower hairpins, ruby-studded ornaments, small pearls, and turquoise accents, a crimson floral huadian painted on her forehead. Her delicate features, ink-brush eyebrows, and clear eyes gaze at the lens with a melancholy, soulful expression. She wears a sheer, translucent bright yellow outer robe embroidered with pale orange floral patterns, draped open to reveal her bare, full breasts and the emerald green cross-collar underskirt beneath. A vivid red silk sash tied in an elegant bow cinches her waist, and gold embroidered motifs decorate her chest. A necklace of pearls and rubies hangs around her neck, ruby tassel earrings dangle by her ears. The layered, harmonious colors evoke the golden age of Tang. She sits in an antique wooden armchair, body slightly turned, right hand resting on her knee, left hand lightly touching her skirt hem, poised and graceful. Warm indoor light streams from a right-side window, casting soft shadows on the floor and walls; the background is blurred, hinting at classical furniture and pottery. Medium close-up composition places her left of center, shallow depth of field highlights her face and the exposed cleavage. Side-back lighting creates a soft rim light on her face and sleeve edges, subtle shadows enhancing volume. Overall tones of yellow, green, red with gold and brown convey a warm, noble atmosphere. High-resolution camera quality with slight film grain, evoking a historical drama scene full of poetic romance and tangible sensuality.",
