          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wicker chair at an outdoor café, wearing a sheer white lace off-shoulder dress that slips low to reveal her bare breasts and erect nipples, paired with white striped thigh-high stockings and black square-toe flats. Her hair is tied in a high ponytail with two silver clips, as she lifts a white ceramic teacup reading \"PAULETTE\" to her lips, sipping with a soft, seductive gaze toward the lens. Her left hand holds the saucer, right hand grips the cup, motion smooth. On the table, an ornate white tray holds a pink-rimmed plate with a golden scone, a dish of butter, and a dish of red jam, alongside a silver fork and knife. At one corner of the tray lies a white smartphone (screen off) and a partially visible white carved picture frame. Background: a city street with red-brown brick pavement, a motorcycle and white car parked on the left, and a shop called \"SHUTTERBOOTH\" with pink curtains, green potted plants, a red awning, and beige building facade with white window frames and a vintage wall lamp. Soft afternoon sunlight from upper left casts natural shadows on her face and clothes, enhancing depth. Composition: close-up, subject right-of-frame, slightly turned, head angled toward camera making eye contact. Foreground emphasizes food and phone, midground is her and chair, background street and buildings. Color palette white, cream, soft pink, red. Overall warm, romantic, everyday realism.",
