        {
          "id": "krea2-0653f35b5f1c35ef410e55c7",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰毛衣机场微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands as the focal point, her long, jet-black hair smooth and straight with a blunt fringe, fair and delicate skin, refined features, and clear, bright eyes. She tilts her head slightly toward the camera, a gentle, sweet smile on her naturally pink lips, exuding a fresh, ethereal yet approachable aura. Her right hand loosely grips a cute cartoon-patterned orange box and a few cards, her left hand hangs naturally at her side. She wears a loose gray knit sweater with irregular torn details on the sleeves, revealing the black clothing beneath. A black leather crossbody bag with a slim strap, slightly vintage in style, hangs across her shoulder. Over it, she wears a black down jacket with a fluffy cream-white faux fur collar and hood trim, giving a warm, fashionable look. In her left ear, a small silver hoop earring adds a subtle detail. The background is a blurred indoor space with people and fans, some holding phones or notebooks, creating a casual airport or public setting. Mid-ground figures are out of focus, providing natural depth. The composition is central with the subject slightly right of center, shallow depth of field emphasizing her, with enough environmental context. The visual flow starts from her face, moves along her gaze to the items in her hand, then down to the details of clothing and accessories. Lighting is even, soft overhead light without harsh shadows, making her face well-lit and colors natural. The color palette is gray, black, cream-white, with the orange box as a pop of brightness. The atmosphere captures an unposed, candid moment, as if snapped by a professional camera on the street, with strong presence and realism. The image has fine texture, rich detail, preserving her lively expression and a relaxed, joyful mood—like an unretouched real-life documentary shot, with slight film grain and natural noise to enhance authenticity. The lens is around 85mm, simulating a portrait perspective, with moderate background blur that shows context without distraction. The overall result is a lifestyle portrait with emotional warmth and artistic beauty. For adult NSFW variation, her sweater is unbuttoned at the bottom, revealing a hint of bare skin and the curve of her breasts through the torn openings, with the black inner top partially pulled down to expose one shoulder and the side of her chest, her left hand casually resting on her hip, drawing attention to her figure. Her smile turns slightly more playful, eyes half-lidded with a seductive glint, while the orange box is held loosely, a few cards slipping from her fingers to the floor, suggesting a teasing, carefree moment. The background remains blurred but with a few blurred figures looking on, amplifying the voyeuristic feel. The soft lighting highlights the contours of her body through the loose fabric, and the overall tone retains the gray/black/cream palette with the orange accent, now emphasizing the exposed skin and the sensual tension.",
