          "prompt": "Low-angle upward shot of a young woman outdoors in bright sunlight, standing topless with her bare breasts exposed, nipples erect, wearing only a pink high-waist skirt and white sneakers. She has shoulder-length wavy brown hair with airy bangs, natural yet seductive makeup, red lips slightly parted, eyes gazing directly at the camera with a lazy, confident expression. Her body leans back slightly against a light gray cement wall, hands resting loosely at her sides or lightly touching the skirt's hem. Long legs are toned, right leg slightly bent in a relaxed stance. The subject occupies the left-center of the frame, visible from waist to head. Background is a deep cloudless blue sky filling the upper half, creating strong color contrast. Left side shows a white building wall and a green metal mesh fence with slight rust. Right side has a distant thin black utility pole and intersecting wires, adding urban daily elements. Classic low-angle composition emphasizes her tall silhouette and spatial depth; figure placed near the golden ratio, her gaze directing focus to her facial expression and naked torso. Lighting is harsh sunlight from upper right, bright and even, casting crisp outlines on her body, detailed fabric folds on the skirt, smooth skin texture, soft shadows on the wall and ground for natural gradient. Sky transitions from deep blue to lighter blue toward the horizon, enhancing depth. Overall atmosphere is fresh, bright, warm, intensely summery afternoon. Color palette dominated by white, pink, blue, accented by green fence and gray wall, harmonious and appealing. Visual guidance through pose, eye line, and lighting draws attention to her exposed chest and confident demeanor. Background is simple yet engaging, evoking a realistic street photography style with slight film grain and natural saturation, mimicking a casual snapshot taken with a standard digital camera on a clear day. Details rich but not overly sharp, retaining soft focus and