        {
          "id": "krea2-fc6e87603f686817edc6a518",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝浴袍街道微笑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands behind a rustic wooden food stall, her blue-gray coarse Hanfu robe hanging open to reveal her bare breasts, the fabric embroidered with delicate geometric patterns and dark blue trim at the cuffs and collar. Her long black hair is braided into two thick plaits that fall over her chest, with a few strands of light green headscarf woven through, shiny and smooth; her forehead has neat bangs, her face is sweet and pretty with curved eyebrows, a warm smile showing clean white teeth, and her bright clear eyes look directly at the viewer with inviting cheerfulness. She holds a food wrapped in oiled paper in her hands as if serving a customer. The thick raw wood counter shows natural grain and age-worn edges, crafted by hand. On it sit wooden trays filled with braised meats and pickled vegetables, glossy red and appetizing. In the background, three hanging bamboo signs hand-painted in bold black calligraphy read \"Spice,\" \"Pork Belly,\" and \"Pig Head.\" They're suspended by thin rope from a simple wooden frame. Behind them, a cream-colored cloth or paper wall diffuses soft natural light coming from the left, creating chiaroscuro on her face and clothes, warm and layered. Mid-shot composition, the woman slightly lower center, her head tilted up a bit, eyes locked with the lens, strong visual focus. A wooden railing runs across the bottom foreground, adding depth, with the background softly blurred to highlight her. The palette is warm yellow and light brown, accented by blue-gray and dark green, harmonious and nostalgic, like an ancient street market scene full of life and human warmth. The texture is fine and realistic, resembling professional film stills, rich details, natural light transitions—a tranquil, humble yet vibrant daily moment, as if you can smell the food and feel the warmth of human existence.",
