          "prompt": "A young woman sits on outdoor concrete stairs, her deep brown hair with blunt bangs falling in loose waves, strands lifted by the wind. Her fair skin glows, delicate features sharp, eyes clear and slightly upturned as she gazes diagonally upward. Lips parted, expression lazy and contemplative. Right hand brushes through her hair at the crown, fingers curled naturally; left hand rests on her left knee. She wears only a sheer black lace long-sleeve top, the intricate floral pattern revealing the contours of her bare breasts, nipples faintly visible through the lace. The lace is unbuttoned at the front, exposing her torso from collarbone to navel, a hint of underboob and smooth stomach. Below, a high-waist black leather mini skirt with metal zipper and wide belt tied in a bow, stitching details. Sleek black leather thigh-high boots, glossy, hugging her legs. Pose diagonal, body tilted, head turned, gaze extending beyond frame. Foreground shows her lower body and legs clearly; midground has upper body and arms. Background: light gray rough wall with subtle stains, silver metal railing extending from top left to upper right, guiding the eye. Stairs are cement, dark gray, rough texture with irregular spots and wear. Close-up perspective, slight overhead angle, soft natural light from upper right casting shadows on left cheek and side, creating highlights on leather and lace. Tones: black, gray, beige, warm skin. Slight grain and realistic exposure, focus on face and upper body, background softly blurred. Captures an intimate, candid moment, raw and sensual, with a storytelling edge.",
