          "alias": "单女米毛衣花园害羞站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a sunlit garden, her soft, long, wavy light-blonde hair glowing with warm highlights, a few strands falling naturally beside her face. She wears a cream-colored knit beanie tilted slightly for a lazy, playful look. Her skin is fair and delicate, cheeks flushed with a gentle blush, lips pink and inviting, eyes bright and clear, gazing softly into the camera with a shy, tender smile. She is dressed in a sheer cream-colored long-sleeve top, unbuttoned to reveal a delicate brown lace high-neck bralette underneath, the layers visible and sensual. A wide vintage leather belt cinches her waist, featuring circular metal buckle accents and blue floral patterns, adding a bohemian touch. Below, a pale pink lace miniskirt with layered, airy ruffles barely covers her thighs, the intricate lace details catching the light. She turns her body slightly, one hand resting casually on her hip, the other lightly touching the belt, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is blurred with green foliage and a white wooden fence; dappled sunlight filters through leaves, casting soft highlights on her form. The composition is a mid-shot focusing on her, with warm tones of cream, pale gold, pink, and green harmonizing. Soft backlighting outlines her silhouette with a golden glow, while her face is evenly lit, revealing every detail. The image has a natural, amateur-shot feel with slight grain and bokeh, enhancing the intimate, candid atmosphere. The overall aesthetic is fresh, poetic, and subtly erotic, capturing a quiet, sensual moment in the afternoon light.",
