          "id": "krea2-8698f477eebc15481d195049",
          "alias": "单女全裸米外套街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the middle of a bustling city street at dusk, her shoulder-length hair and neat bangs framing a face that stares directly into the lens with lazy, seductive eyes. Her lips are slightly pouted, gleaming with a playful, teasing smirk. She wears a loose beige coat, unbuttoned and falling open to reveal her bare chest—the white turtleneck gone, leaving only a thin gold necklace resting against her naked skin, between her breasts. Her stance is casual, one hand loosely at her side, the other brushing her neckline, inviting the gaze. The coat hangs off her shoulders, hinting at the curve of her body beneath. She is front and center in the frame, her upper body dominating the shot with rich skin detail, soft ambient light sculpting her face and collarbones. Behind her, the urban nightscape unfolds: a pink \"Margon Restaurant\" facade glows warmly, neon signs for \"Havana\" and \"Grill\" flicker, and a white police van and car sit parked on the right. Metal railings line the wet sidewalk as the street recedes into a vanishing point, dotted with sparse pedestrians. The sky is a dusky gray-blue, punctuated by lit windows in distant towers. The composition is tightly symmetrical, her figure anchoring the view, while converging lines of the road and buildings draw the eye deeper. Lighting is a mix of cool neon and warm shop windows, reflecting off surfaces, with a soft fill highlighting her naked torso and face. The overall mood blends the noise of city nightlife with an intimate, voyeuristic stillness. The image has a realistic, almost handheld snapshot feel—slight grain, natural color shifts—like a stolen moment of urban sensuality, calm yet charged.",
