          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on a plush pink velvet sofa, wearing a beige silk jacket with brown polka dots, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal a sheer lavender lace top beneath, her bare shoulder exposed as a fluffy light-brown knitted scarf slips down, draping loosely across her chest and arm. Her long black hair falls naturally over her shoulder, gleaming under warm light. She wears delicate silver earrings, and her fingernails are painted deep green. One hand rests relaxed on the sofa arm, the other gently holds a corner of the scarf. She gazes off to the right, eyes thoughtful and distant, lips a natural pink. The foreground shows the full, plush pink sofa with soft creases and fabric texture. On the left, a deep blue wall creates strong contrast. On the right, a metal shelf holds a violin, a black belt, and blurred photographic gear, suggesting a music studio or shooting space. In the far background, the lower half of another person in jeans and dark shoes is faintly visible, adding a lived-in feel. The composition is a medium shot; the woman is slightly off-center, body angled, head turned, her gaze leading the viewer outward. Light from the right casts warm golden rays across her face, hair, arm, and clothing, with soft shadows enhancing depth and volume. The overall mood is intimate, sensual, and nostalgic, evoking a film photograph shot at dusk with slight grain and warm amber tones—rich in detail and emotional tension.",
