          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a bright white floor, her shoulder-length light brown hair softly curled and falling naturally around her face. Her skin is fair and smooth, with delicate makeup—shimmery eyeshadow, full pink lips slightly parted, eyes clear and focused. She is topless, her bare chest exposed, the thin straps of her mushroom-print cream-colored romper sliding down her arms, the fabric bunching at her waist, revealing her collarbones and the curve of her breasts. The romper is covered in colorful red, brown, and white mushroom motifs, retro and playful. Her right hand holds a matching mushroom-print handbag with brown leather handle and metal clasp; her left hand rests on the floor for support. A silver diamond-studded watch gleams on her wrist; a fine chain with a tiny star pendant hangs at her neck, and simple gold earrings adorn her ears. The background is a minimalist white interior with a large abstract wing-like sculpture in dark brown, partially translucent, casting soft light. Low-angle shot, the woman sits slightly to the right, body angled, head turned facing camera, eyes meeting the viewer. Sunlight streams from upper left, casting clear shadows, warm and soft. The overall palette is white with warm accents of cream, tan, and red-orange. High resolution, fine texture, professional commercial photography style, evoking a high-fashion editorial in a bright gallery space, blending elegance and youthful vitality with a subtle erotic undertone.",
