        {
          "id": "krea2-e6dca1caf09a4b0d2e5f8ee5",
          "alias": "单女半褪礼服摄影棚媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman in an extravagant ancient-style gown stands in a three-quarter profile, her ink-black hair cascading down her back, adorned with delicate golden flowers and tassels, a classical coronet atop her head. Her face is refined, with elegant makeup and soft red lips, her gaze gentle as she looks diagonally upward, exuding serene grace. Her right hand holds a white oil-paper umbrella, slightly tilted, with a few golden butterfly ornaments fluttering beneath it in the breeze. The umbrella handle is slender and smooth. She wears a pale pink haute couture dress—strapless, with a completely open back, tightly cinched waist emphasizing her slender figure, and ornate three-dimensional gold embroidery and sequins on her bust and waist, shimmering with a soft metallic luster. The sleeves are wide, cape-like, made of sheer, lightweight fabric with delicate folds and a glossy sheen. The skirt is full and voluminous, layered and flowing, as if swaying gently in the wind. The background is pure black, creating a strong contrast that highlights the subject’s magnificence and nobility. Several dark ribbons drop from above on the right side, their edges faintly glowing, adding depth and movement. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, her body forming an elegant S-curve. The visual flow leads from the umbrella to her face and down to the skirt, creating a smooth path. Lighting comes from the front left—soft, warm tones illuminate her silhouette and the dress details, making the gold accents sparkle, while shadows transition naturally, enhancing the three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is mysterious and romantic, infused with Eastern classical aesthetics, with cinematic quality and high-fashion photography precision, yet retaining a natural, almost amateur-camera feel—as if a photographer captured this fleeting elegance in a dark studio. The image is richly detailed, with balanced color saturation, layered lighting, and sharp clarity, blending dreamlike beauty with realism. The simple backdrop adds tension, emphasizing the subject. The scene evokes ancient Chinese painting or a stage performance, like a fairy stepping out of a scroll holding an umbrella, dancing lightly in the night, every expression a masterpiece. The pose subtly suggests the dress slipping off one shoulder, revealing the bare upper back and a hint of cleavage, the soft curve of her breast partially visible beneath the sheer fabric, adding a sensual, adult allure while maintaining the poetic elegance.",
