        {
          "id": "krea2-aecb60727ec3c85e0651045e",
          "alias": "单女半褪红连衣裙桌边媚态跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on the floor before a dark wooden desk, her long black curly hair cascading over her shoulders, tied with a red ribbon bow. She wears red thin-rimmed glasses, her gaze fixed directly at the camera with a sultry, playful expression. Her makeup is flawless—deep red lips, fair skin dusted with a soft blush. She's dressed in a revealing red lace-trimmed spaghetti-strap dress, the straps slipping off her shoulders, the low neckline showing the swell of her breasts. Red ribbon garters wrap around her thighs above white ankle socks. She leans forward, hands planted on the desk, fingers long with pale nail polish, her body arched in a coy, inviting pose. The foreground focuses on her torso and hands, emphasizing the delicate fabric and lace details. On the desk sits a silver-gray vintage digital camcorder, a brown teddy bear with a yellow bear print, and a red package with white lettering and snowflake patterns. The background is a dark brown wooden wall covered in pink sticky notes reading \"Love yourself,\" alongside heart and apple motifs, some notes tied with red ribbons that dangle down. The composition is centered, with the woman slightly left, drawing attention to her face and upper body. Lighting comes from the front-right, casting soft shadows and creating a warm, intimate glow. The color palette is red, pink, and brown, evoking a retro, romantic, and slightly rebellious teenage vibe. The image has an authentic, amateur film look—slight grain, natural noise, moderate saturation, rich layers, and crisp details, as if captured by an old camcorder, telling a story of self-expression and private youthful memories.",
