        {
          "id": "krea2-68e199d600cb69042385cc66",
          "alias": "单女露胸连衣裙竹林害羞坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully against a rough stone wall, her long black hair cascading over her shoulders, strands gently lifting in the breeze. Her skin is fair and luminous, cheeks flushed with a healthy glow, lips curved in a soft, sweet smile, eyes clear and bright with longing and hope, her head turned slightly to the right as if drawn by something beautiful. She wears a delicate off-shoulder dress, the bodice slipped down to reveal her bare breasts, creamy and full, with nipples peeking out. The dress is a warm cream base embroidered with vibrant floral patterns—red, pink, green blooms and leaves, accented with black stitching and tiny sequins, elegant and ornate. The skirt is wide and voluminous, spreading around her as she sits, creating graceful folds. Her left hand rests under her chin, fingers long and slender, a simple ring on her ring finger; her right hand holds a round woven bamboo basket, light brown with clear weave, edges reinforced with white cord, filled with several bright red fruits—hawthorn or cherries, plump and tempting. Small earrings dangle from her ears, simple yet charming. Her pose is serene and composed, exuding a gentle, refined elegance. Behind her, the stone wall is rough, natural brown, with visible grain and age. In the upper left, three bold red Chinese characters \"以养德\" stand out, rustic and powerful, calligraphy-style, adding cultural depth. The composition is a close-up waist-up view, from above her chest to below her knees, creating an intimate feel. Her slightly tilted body and head guide the viewer’s eye to the right, with her hands and basket forming a stable triangle, enhancing balance. Soft, even light comes from above left, illuminating her face and highlighting the texture of her skin and the details of her dress. The overall palette is warm and harmonious—golden, cream, red, with dark hair and brown background, layered and rich. The mood is tranquil and intimate, like a candid moment captured on a sunny afternoon, realistic and artistic.",
