          "alias": "单女白短裤海滩害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a pink folding chair on a sandy beach, wearing a low-cut pink off-shoulder cropped top that barely covers her chest, paired with white high-waist shorts that hug her hips, white platform sneakers and sheer lace stockings visible as she crosses one leg over the other. Her black hair falls loose around her shoulders, a small pink flower clip tucked behind her ear. She gently cups one breast with her right hand, while her left hand rests casually on the armrest, her posture relaxed yet inviting, eyes locked on the camera with a demure, slightly shy expression. Behind her, a bright pastel building with light blue walls and a yellow curved roof displays the words \"Jo Malone London\" in 3D pink lettering with soft shadows. A white lamppost stands to the side, topped with a clear globe, and a string of red-and-white triangular bunting flutters gently in the breeze. The sunny sky is a vivid blue with thin clouds, strong sunlight casting sharp shadows from the upper right. Golden sand textures fill the foreground, with the woman's feet and chair forming the midsection, the building and sky as background. A low-angle shot makes her figure appear taller and more dominant, leading the eye naturally toward the building signage. The scene is bright, warm, saturated with pink, blue, and yellow tones, evoking a carefree summer day on the beach—sensual yet elegant, like a professional lifestyle shoot with NSFW edge.",
