          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a dark wooden frame chair, leaning back against a grey textured wall. She wears a pale blue sheer slip dress with thin straps, her breasts fully exposed and erect nipples visible through the translucent fabric; the dress has layered ruffled hem cascading from the waist, transparent mesh panels at the shoulders with pearl strand embellishments, and a three-dimensional light blue flower on the right shoulder. She gently touches the straps with her hands, left hand showing a prominent ring, right wrist adorned with a silver bangle. Multi-layered thin pearl necklace hangs around her neck, with white round earrings. Black hair falls naturally, makeup exquisite, red lips slightly parted, eyes direct with a cool, contemplative expression. Legs crossed, she wears silver strappy high-heeled sandals with sparkling crystals on the straps and delicate metal rings around the ankles. The floor is covered with a dark blue and grey-brown abstract patterned carpet, with a few blue petals scattered on the right side. The background wall has a matte finish, with dark brown vertical wooden slats visible on the left. Medium shot composition, subject positioned center-left. Light comes from front-right, soft and even, creating delicate chiaroscuro on her face, arms, and skirt, with cool blue-toned shadows. The background is blurred, drawing focus to the figure. The color palette is cool, with blue and grey harmonizing, evoking a dreamy and elegant visual. The overall style is high-fashion and artistic, as if shot in a professional studio with premium lighting, possessing strong cinematic quality and narrative richness, with intricate details and layered depth, showcasing a serene yet mysterious beauty.",
