        {
          "id": "krea2-23fc2ecd3bb696e069fe6ac1",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰连衣裙摄影棚微笑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde young woman in an elegant gray-violet Lolita-inspired outfit, her soft platinum hair with blunt bangs cascades naturally, a thick braid draped over one shoulder, adorned with black lace headbands and pearl hair clips woven intricately across the crown for a vintage, aristocratic feel. Her clear blue eyes hold a gentle, slightly mysterious gaze, lips parted in a soft pink smile, porcelain skin luminous, face perfectly sculpted. She wears a high-collared gray-purple dress with subtle pleats and glossy fabric, deep blue floral patterns on the chest and sleeves, puffed voluminous sleeves, one shoulder bared, revealing smooth collarbone and shoulder line. Multiple wide black leather belts cinch her waist, layered with silver buckles, creating a structured corset effect; the belts connect via metal rings across the shoulder, forming an elaborate harness. Black leather half-gloves fit snugly, fingers exposed, right hand raised in a V-sign, pose elegant and confident. The dress is unbuttoned at the front, falling open to expose her bare breasts, nipples slightly visible through the fabric's gap, the soft swell of her chest catching the studio light. Background is a seamless light gray gradient, darker at the bottom, soft studio lighting from above, even illumination, gentle shadows highlighting the curves of her body and the shine of the belts. Composition is a mid-shot, centered, head slightly tilted, eyes locked on the viewer, the overall aesthetic refined yet sensual, blending high-fashion editorial with intimate allure, colors dominated by gray-purple, black, white, with accents of blue and gold.",
