        {
          "id": "krea2-dfd440528e491137b0f1ba6d",
          "alias": "单女露胸牛仔船上困倦坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the white leather seat of a luxury yacht, turned sideways with her back to the camera, glancing back over her shoulder. She is completely topless, her bare back exposed, with only a delicate blue string crisscrossing her spine in an open-back design. She wears light denim shorts, barefoot on the cabin floor, her body relaxed and natural. Long, slightly wavy hair falls over her shoulders, fair skin, soft facial features, eyes half-lidded and dreamy, gazing into the distance. Her left hand rests lightly on her knee, adorned with layered bracelets and bangles; her right arm hangs loosely. Her figure is tall and slender, positioned slightly left of center frame, dominating the composition. In the foreground, a white cushioned seat and metal railing of the yacht interior; a wide-brimmed beige straw hat sits on the left. On the right, a small red flag flutters at the bow. The background is vast open blue sea, with varying shades of turquoise and teal, shimmering reflections, a few small boats and a faint coastline in the distance. The sky is layered with stratocumulus clouds, gray-white merging with pale blue, soft even light—overcast or dusk diffuse lighting. The overall mood is calm, slightly melancholic, with a cool color palette of blue, white, gray, punctuated by the black top (now absent) and the red flag for contrast. The composition follows an off-center rule, with the figure near the golden ratio, her gaze leading the viewer’s eye toward the distant horizon, evoking contemplation and a sense of solitary beauty during travel. Strong cinematic and narrative quality, as if capturing a fleeting moment of a traveler’s pause. Style blends modern fashion photography with authentic travel-documentary realism: refined yet casual. Shot with a mid-range camera and standard zoom lens under natural light, sharp detail, rich texture, clear edges, layered depth, slight film grain and color shift enhancing realism and era feel. Artistic touches: subtle blue-toned filter and adjusted contrast for emotional tension and visual depth. Stable composition, slight high-angle, simulating a handheld shot for immersive human-eye perspective. Moderate background blur to keep focus on the subject while retaining enough environmental context. The entire image conveys a sense of freedom, romance, and slight detachment—a summer sea journey with an urban woman’s independent aura, mixed with longing and reflection toward the unknown horizon.",
