          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on the gray asphalt street in front of a curved concrete wall, wearing a tight cream-colored athletic set—short-sleeve high-neck top and high-waist shorts. The fabric clings to her curves, with subtle vertical texture and small creases, glossy under soft natural light. Her dark brown hair falls naturally, lightening to brown at the ends, strands blown across her cheek. She looks down at her stomach, slowly pulling the hem of her top up to reveal the lower curve of her bare breasts, her nipples nearly exposed. Her right wrist wears a black smartwatch with a pink band; her fingers are long, nails with light polish. Her right knee is bent on the ground, left leg straight, showing muscle definition and fine skin texture. She wears blue-and-white sneakers with visible logo and stitching. The background is a rough beige cement wall with irregular grain and cracks, lush green shrubs overhanging at the top edge—leaves dappled with light and shadow. Distant urban buildings, including glass towers and low trees, blur into the background. The street has a gray asphalt surface with a circular metal manhole cover with grid anti-slip pattern. Medium shot composition places her slightly left of center, body forming an S-curve, gaze downward, creating a quiet, introspective mood. Light from upper left is warm, soft, like early morning or late afternoon, casting shadows on the wall, enhancing volume. Colors are cream, gray, green, blue—harmonious and muted. The scene feels like an everyday documentary moment, capturing a private, sensual pause in urban life, calm and slightly languid, with a modern minimalist aesthetic.",
