          "id": "krea2-c39ece409dd1bc26a3cbf20d",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑高领衫城市忧伤坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on a black curved velvet sofa in a minimalist modern interior, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, while she holds a light-colored smartphone in her left hand angling it toward her face for a selfie. Her right arm rests naturally on the sofa edge, a simple silver bracelet at her wrist. Her black hair falls smoothly over bare shoulders, makeup subtle with soft lip color, eyes focused intensely on the phone screen. A pair of round white metal-framed side tables occupy the foreground, one partially obscuring her lower body for layered depth. Behind her, tall floor-to-ceiling windows reveal a winter dusk sky with bare branches and faint streetlights, while warm indoor lighting reflects off the glass, creating a cool-warm tonal contrast. The pale beige walls, white pillars, and built-in AC unit maintain a clean, minimalist aesthetic. The composition places her slightly right of center, with the window's vertical and horizontal lines guiding the eye, and her diagonal pose breaking symmetry to add dynamism. The camera is at a slightly high angle, making her appear intimate yet distant. Natural cold blue-gray light from outside blends with warm yellow interior light, casting soft chiaroscuro across her face, arms, and the folds of her clothing—a black fitted turtleneck has been removed, leaving only the white polka-dot miniskirt. The skin texture, subtle highlights on hair and collarbone, phone screen glow, and environmental reflections in the glass add photorealistic detail. The overall palette is black, white, gray with tiny warm yellow accents, evoking a cool, sophisticated, slightly lonely urban atmosphere. Image quality mimics high-resolution DSLR capture with slight film grain and the casual feel of a real-life snapshot, artistic yet unstaged, full of quiet narrative.",
