          "id": "krea2-ccf8da7a66353fe63a6206a3",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙街道困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde young woman in a romantic retro Lolita dress stands in a cozy, sweet indoor room. She has a soft oval face, fair skin, delicate brows, clear light blue eyes that are gentle yet playful and curious, lips slightly parted with a natural pink sheen, overall makeup natural and exquisite highlighting her youthful charm. Her long blonde hair is styled into twin tails with neat bangs across the forehead, secured with red bow hair clips on each side. She wears a cream-colored Lolita dress with red floral patterns, a tight corset bodice with lace trim and red lacing crossing into a heart shape at the chest, emphasizing her slender waist. The skirt is multi-layered with ruffled hem and white lace, red drawstrings at the side. She has taken off the wine-red knit cardigan, now wearing only the dress, which has a lower neckline exposing the top of her cleavage and a slightly shorter hem showing her upper thighs. Her right hand holds a brown-red checkered handbag (canvas or leather texture), left arm naturally down with fingers slightly curled, pose elegant yet relaxed. Full-body shot from ankles to head, centered symmetrical composition, body slightly turned, face straight to camera. Foreground focuses on her entire figure. Midground shows a cream wall with pink flower and green vine wallpaper pattern, transitioning to soft pink paint at the lower half. Background faintly a vintage pocket watch ornament hanging on a thin string, metal with fine engravings. Lighting is soft even from slightly above front, combined natural and warm indoor light, no harsh shadows, face fully lit with subtle cheek highlights, dress folds have delicate shadows. Overall atmosphere dreamy, sweet, gentle, slightly nostalgic Japanese-style, color palette pink, cream, wine red, saturating moderately, giving intimate peaceful feel. The image appears professionally shot but retains everyday warmth, like a sunny afternoon where the girl is changing outfits and taking photos in her little room, recording her beautiful time. Composition simple but not monotonous, focus clear, person and environment integrated, both artistic and lively, overall visual experience refined yet realistic, but now with a sensual, slightly NSFW twist: her dress is pulled lower at the chest, blouse buttons undone to reveal more skin, and she is pulling up her skirt slightly to show her garter belt and lace top of stockings. Her expression playful and inviting.",
