          "alias": "单女忧伤跪注视",
          "prompt": "A classical woman in a sheer pink hanfu kneels sideways on a jade-green velvet rug, her ink-black hair coiled in an elegant high bun adorned with pale pink and light blue flower ornaments, delicate tassel earrings swaying softly. Her face is refined with sorrowful, contemplative eyes gazing left, lost in a distant tale. The translucent pink hanfu drapes open at the chest, revealing the bare curve of one shoulder and the top of a nipple beneath the semi-sheer fabric, intricately embroidered with floral motifs and pearl trim, the wide sleeves cascading gracefully. She sits upright with hands resting on her knees, body slightly leaning forward. In the foreground, a blurred dark shape—perhaps another figure or clothing—adds narrative depth. The midground captures her three-quarter profile, accentuating facial expression and garment details. Background: an antique interior with wooden furniture and a folding screen faintly lit by a warm yellow lantern, casting soft side lighting that sculpts her face and the sheerness of the fabric, creating gentle chiaroscuro. Warm, filmic tones evoke a quiet, poetic Eastern aesthetic, like a cinematic still from a period drama. Composition uses the rule of thirds, subject on the right, negative space on the left, focus on her face and hair ornaments, with the background softly blurred to emphasize intimacy and artistry.",
