          "alias": "单女连衣裙媚态坐举手",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a red rope swing, wearing a burgundy velvet strapless mini dress with a sweetheart neckline that accentuates her cleavage and exposes her bare shoulders, the skirt flaring in layered petals, cinched at the waist to highlight her slim figure. Her long black hair falls naturally, topped with a black cat-ear headband for a playful touch. She wears delicate makeup, red lips slightly parted, eyes gazing softly yet confidently at the camera. Her left hand brushes through her hair, right hand raised gripping the swing rope, exuding elegant vitality. On her feet are black patent-leather Mary Jane platform shoes with metal buckle straps, revealing a glimpse of her ankles. The set is a vertical pink striped backdrop, deep and light red stripes creating visual rhythm, with a soft pastel pink floor. Scattered on the left are multiple red and silver inflatable letter balloons, including a clear \"LOVE\" in metallic sheen, some crumpled or stacked for natural layering. Lighting comes from front-upper direction, softly and evenly illuminating her face and body, with subtle shadows and glossy highlights on the balloons. The saturated warm red palette is accented by pink, black, and silver. Composition is center-symmetrical, with the model slightly right of center, drawing focus to her face and upper body. The intimate space feels like a glamorous photoshoot with a handheld, real-life vibe, blending romantic festivity with youthful chic. The strapless neckline reveals the soft curve of her breasts, hinting at nipple outline through the velvet, adding a sensual edge to the dreamy scene.",
