          "alias": "单女全裸白丝袜厨房戏谑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the white kitchen counter, her long, thick black hair woven into a heavy braid that falls to one side. She toys with the braid with her right fingers while holding a vintage black film camera in her left hand, its lens tilted slightly downward. Her head is turned, lips parted in a sweet, teasing smile, eyes soft and inviting as she gazes into the lens, exuding a playful yet coy expression. She is completely nude except for a pair of delicate white lace thigh-high stockings with ruffle trim, and a pair of deep burgundy Mary Jane heels with cross-straps and metal buckles. One leg is bent, foot resting on the seat of a nearby white chair; the other leg hangs down, body leaning back slightly, relaxed and elegant. The scene is a typical home kitchen: white tiled walls, upper white cabinets, lower cabinets with arched panel detailing. On the countertop to the left, a transparent glass bowl of fresh strawberries, a red-and-white mug, and a clear glass bottle; to the right, a white retro microwave with a silver coffee machine on top, and a polka-dot white rice cooker. A round white clock on the wall reads about 10:10. The overall color palette is white with red accents, creating a warm, sweet, slightly retro atmosphere. Warm indoor yellow lighting softly illuminates her skin and the objects, casting natural shadows that accentuate her curves and the textures of the lace stockings and leather shoes. The composition uses kitchen lines to guide the eye to her, with foreground items adding a lived-in feel, midground her body and counter, background cabinets and appliances—layered and cinematic, like a nostalgic film photo, rich in detail, high realism, saturated yet soft, radiating cozy domestic sensuality.",
