          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙温柔站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless before a bright pink background wall, her elegant white strapless short dress crumpled around her hips, exposing her bare breasts and smooth torso. Her long black hair is swept to one side, glossy and neat, with a few strands falling naturally across her cheek. She poses sideways, right hand gently cupping her chin, fingers long with pale pink nail polish, gaze slightly lowered, exuding calm confidence. Her skin is fair and flawless, makeup natural yet accentuating her deep eyes and soft lips. The background is a large pink panel bearing \"MUSINSA BEAUTY\" and Korean \"무신사 뷰티 페스타\" in clean sans-serif font, repeating in a rhythmic pattern. Lighting is soft and even from the front, shadows minimal, creating a bright, fresh atmosphere. Center-composition full-body shot, with visual flow from her face down her body to the dress and heels, then to the background text. The image has a high-fashion editorial feel with a candid, real-event quality, similar to a professional red carpet snap but with intimate, revealing edge.",
