        {
          "id": "krea2-6f776bafd814503ed35df59d",
          "alias": "单女露胸银女仆装摄影棚害羞跪躲藏",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired maid kneels on a soft pink velvet rug, her short pastel pink hair adorned with a tiny black hat and pink-and-white floral decorations, bangs falling lightly over her forehead. She gazes at the camera with clear, slightly shy eyes, lips parted, one hand gently touching her cheek, her pose elegant and coy. She wears a black sleeveless top with black-and-white striped collar and cuffs, but her black lace corset is loosely unlaced, revealing her bare breasts with perky nipples peeking out. A white ruffled apron and a bright pink skirt with black trim remain, a bow at her waist. White lace wrist cuffs, black thigh-high stockings with white lace tops at her knees, and black short boots complete the outfit. The overall look is a sweet yet sensual contrast. In the foreground left, a plate of colorful desserts: chocolate cake, strawberry cream tart, glazed donuts, and scattered candies. Right behind, a multi-tiered dessert stand with macarons, fruit tarts, and cookies. The background hints at soft white curtains, purple floral decorations, and blurred fairy-tale furniture. The scene is bathed in dreamy pink-gold tones, warm diffused light from above and sides creating a soft, romantic glow. High saturation, natural light-to-shadow transition, fine shadows. The subject is centered slightly left, shot from a low angle upwards, emphasizing her petite figure and detailed outfit. Foreground desserts are sharp, midground subject prominent, background gently blurred for depth. Visual flow leads from desserts to her face, then to the dessert stand and decorations, forming a circular viewing path. Slight lens flares and particle effects simulate sunlight through mist. The overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, sweetly dreamy, like a fairy-tale afternoon tea party. Strong Japanese anime aesthetic, with fine texture, rich but harmonious colors, detailed fabric folds and accessory shine. A highly artistic photography style, like professional studio work but with a candid, intimate feel. Suitable for roleplay or fantasy themes. Prompt emphasizes realism blended with fantasy, soft light transitions, color harmony, and the interaction between her expression and the scene.",
