          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a black metal-framed chair, wearing only a pink satin high-waist miniskirt with voluminous layered tulle train, her bare breasts exposed, skin glowing. She lounges sideways, right leg bent, left leg extended, her right hand cradling her chin while her left hand rests naturally, holding a small card with a dress design sketch. Her gaze is soft, staring into the lens. Slightly wavy light brown hair, some braided strands falling over her shoulder. Delicate makeup, rose-petal lips, fine chain earrings. On her feet, pink satin stiletto heels with ankle ribbon bows, round toes, thin heels. Background: a light wood wall covered in neatly arranged fashion design sketches of dresses and accessories. To the left, stacked white folding chairs. Dark green carpet with yellow warning stripes. Light from the right casts strong chiaroscuro, a spotlight illuminating her figure, skin smooth and flawless, soft shadows tracing her body contours. Background softly blurred for depth. Low-angle shot emphasizes her elongated silhouette and regal air. Foreground: scattered pink tulle edges and the design card. Midground: her body and the chair. Background: blurred design wall and distant chairs. Visual flow guided by her eyes and hand gestures toward the center. Overall mood blends the intimate backstage of a fashion show with quiet artistic creativity. Color palette: pink, green, black—strong cool-warm contrast, a sense of high-end yet everyday beauty, like a cinematic snapshot taken with a professional camera in dim light, capturing a model prepping before the runway. Rich details, delicate light and shadow, full of narrative tension and emotion.",
