        {
          "id": "krea2-301e885ba62591348cb86ad2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚媚态跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a studio with a pure gray gradient background, wearing a short white sleeveless dress with delicate pleats and golden metal buckle accents, paired with white elbow-length gloves and white striped over-knee stockings, black lace-up shoes. Her black straight hair falls over her shoulders, with a blunt fringe and a white bow headband. She kneels gracefully on the floor, body slightly leaning forward, hands placed on her knees, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed. A fine silver chain rests at her collarbone, small stud earrings on her ears. The foreground emphasizes her legs and feet, the knitted texture of the stockings and the details of the black shoes clearly visible. The midground captures her upper body and face, expression calm and serene with a slight aloofness, lips slightly parted. Several translucent white ribbons float from above her head, curving and flowing around her in soft, blurred motion, as if caught in a breeze. The composition is centered but slightly left, with direct eye contact toward the lens. Lighting is soft, even, and front-top studio lighting, with subtle highlights on facial contours, fabric folds, and ribbon edges, and gentle shadows without harsh contrast. The overall atmosphere is quiet, pure, and otherworldly, with a palette of white, gray, and black accents. The image feels both artistically crafted and naturally captured, with rich detail in skin texture and fabric, evoking a fashion editorial or a film still. The visual flow starts from her face and follows the ribbons outward, creating a sense of contained motion. The dress is slightly lifted to reveal more of her thighs, and the stockings' elastic bands are visible, adding a sensual touch. She looks directly at the viewer with a composed, inviting gaze, her lips parted slightly, exuding a quiet allure. The pose is elegant yet provocative, the semi-kneeling stance accentuating her curves and the tension in her body.",
