          "alias": "单女半褪白衬衫城市微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside the green metal staircase of an urban pedestrian bridge, wearing a partially unbuttoned white collared shirt and a dark gray sweater that has slipped off one shoulder, revealing the curve of her bare shoulder and a hint of lace bra. Her long hair falls naturally, straight bangs slightly veiling her eyes as she gazes softly into the lens with a subtle, knowing smile. Her left hand lightly grips the railing, body tilted forward, posture relaxed and inviting—a serene, lazy sensuality. She is right of center in the frame, shot from a low angle that makes her look tall and approachable. The foreground features the green metal railing stretching diagonally from lower left to upper right, guiding the eye toward her. The railing shows light rust and wear, adding realism. Midground shows the staircase steps, also green metal, with scuffs and peeling paint. Background is a blur of city buildings, faint outlines of beige walls and windows, one window bearing red digits \"15 09\" and \"F2\", hinting at an apartment or office. Overcast sky, soft diffused light, cool tones—green metal and gray sweater contrast with her exposed skin. Diagonal composition with shallow depth of field blurring the background, emphasizing her. The image has a film-grain texture, desaturated colors, natural shadows, evoking a candid moment of urban youth—quiet, introspective, subtly erotic—like a stolen afternoon pause or a wistful night walk, intimate and unposed.",
