        {
          "id": "krea2-807f0e08590942ff55ee20f0",
          "alias": "单女露胸米连衣裙媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the surface of a white vintage dresser, her body turned slightly to the right, legs crossed with the left over the right, exuding an elegant and relaxed pose. She wears a light beige floral lace cami dress that has slipped off her shoulders, the thin straps dangling, exposing her bare breasts with erect nipples; the dress’s delicate lace trim at the neckline and hem contrasts with her smooth skin. Her long dark brown wavy hair falls naturally over her shoulders and chest, slightly messy and shiny, adding a tousled, carefree vibe. Her right hand holds a small white plate containing several red apples and an orange, while her left hand brings a piece of fruit to her slightly parted lips; her tongue touches the fruit as she gazes at the camera with a sultry, satisfied expression and a soft smile. Around her ankle, a white fabric bandage-style wrap is layered with creases, leaving her toes bare with fresh green nail polish. Behind her, a white wall with raised line decorations is covered in photos, postcards, and hand-drawn cards—portraits, landscapes, a \"TAMBURINS\" label, butterfly and mushroom illustrations—creating a personal, artistic ambiance. The dresser’s surface holds scattered papers and cards, with gold circular handles. Warm, soft light streams from the left, casting a bright patch on the wall and highlighting her face and arm, with gentle shadows. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, with the plate and her gaze drawing attention. The palette is cream, light beige, pale yellow, with red and orange accents, evoking a quiet, intimate afternoon. The image has a slightly grainy, film-like texture with natural color transitions, blending realism with a nostalgic, dreamy aesthetic.",
