          "id": "krea2-64d252e53dc9ba308daf387f",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝围裙桌边媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a partially unbuttoned gray striped long-sleeve top, revealing her bare breasts and a hint of cleavage, wears a dark blue apron tied loosely at the waist, her black hair pulled into a high messy bun with a pink plaid scrunchie, thick bangs framing her forehead. She has clear bright eyes, lips slightly parted, a mix of curiosity and sensual surprise, as she leans forward over a wooden worktable, her hands pressing gently into a round lump of wet clay, one hand holding a wooden rolling pin. Her posture is graceful, body tilted forward, fully absorbed in the pottery-making, her breasts subtly swaying with the motion. A close-up foreground shows her hands and the clay in sharp detail—the clay surface smooth, moist, with natural texture and soft reflections; the wood grain of the rolling pin and the skin texture of her fingers rendered realistically. The midground captures her upper body and part of the table, while the background reveals a lived-in pottery studio—shelves with various pots, jars, and tools in beige, gray-brown tones, slightly cluttered yet layered. To the right, a neat row of white unfired clay forms curved silhouettes; to the left, a red plastic bin draped with a colorful fabric adds a warm accent. The scene is lit by soft natural light from a side window, creating warm backlighting that catches the fine hairs on her arms and the curve of her bare shoulders, with a hazy, dreamy glow. The color palette is warm, dominated by grays, browns, and off-white, with touches of red and pink, evoking a vintage film photograph—slight grain and faded tones, like a snapshot from an old album. Composition: a near-macro close-up of hands and clay combined with a mid-shot of the woman, with the subject offset to the right, leaving left space for environmental detail. Shallow depth of field blurs the background, emphasizing her body and the clay. A visual line flows from her gaze and posture down to the work in her hands, creating a smooth movement. Overall atmosphere: warm, intimate, sensual, with the tactile warmth of handmade craft and the everyday beauty of life—a fleeting, ordinary yet deeply erotic creative moment frozen in time, as if captured by an old film camera.",
