          "prompt": "A young woman lounges diagonally on a cream-colored curved sofa, topless, wearing only black lace shorts and black stiletto heels, her long legs and slender waist exposed. She holds a cigarette in her right hand, gazing seductively at the camera with parted lips and a lazy, alluring expression. Her dark hair cascades over her shoulders and the sofa edge, catching soft light. Low-angle shot, foreground focuses on her body lines, midground is a large floor-to-ceiling window revealing a twilight countryside scene: a Dutch windmill stands among sparse winter trees and bushes, warm yellow lights flicker in the distance. Sky is a gradient of deep blue to pale gray-blue with pink and orange clouds. Indoor side lighting illuminates her face and body contours, creating soft shadows. Diagonal composition leads the eye from her body to the windmill. Overall mood blends modern sophistication with rustic tranquility, cinematic, with slight film grain and natural exposure, evoking a candid yet artistically captured intimate moment.",
