          "prompt": "night rain city street corner, a young woman stands under a transparent umbrella, her long black hair falls softly over her shoulders, she wears a gray vertical stripe knit cardigan with delicate tie detail at the neckline, the front open to reveal her bare breasts, a pure white pleated mini skirt with drawstring accents at the sides, very short, her right hand grips the black handle of the transparent umbrella, tilted slightly, raindrops bead on the surface reflecting warm amber streetlights, she stands center-left, looking directly at the camera with a clear, seductive gaze, lips parted in a faint teasing smile, background a quiet street, brick wall and steps on the left, a warmly lit shop visible through glass windows showing tables and chairs, a lush tree on the right with golden-green leaves lit by a lamp, a Korean sign on the trunk reading \"공간21 전용 외부차량 주차금지\" and \"CCTV 작동중\", distant streetlights cast warm glow on the wet ground reflected with lights and tree shadows, twilight/dusk atmosphere, deep peaceful sky, central composition with figure as main focus, foreground sharp figure and umbrella, midground brick wall, steps, shop, background tree and building silhouettes, warm golden lighting contrasting with cool rain night, intimate and melancholic urban night beauty, fine texture, rich color layers, realistic everyday life feel with artistic photography mood, captured like a candid street photo with natural grain and slight motion blur, sensual and poetic atmosphere, inviting and still.",
