        {
          "id": "krea2-ed779e9839e80e9cb0729a32",
          "alias": "单女露胸白短裙街道微笑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless at the entrance of a modern minimalist white building, her bare breasts exposed, nipples gently peaked in the sunlight. She wears a white pleated mini skirt and holds a small black bag with a silver chain strap, arms crossed loosely beneath her chest. Her long black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, a soft smile on her face as she gazes thoughtfully to the left. The scene is bright and warm, sunlight streaming from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the gray stone pavement and red brick wall. The white building has a half-open glass door revealing wooden furniture inside, with white shutters on the window. A blue street sign reads \"동고로5길 Dongguro 5-gil\" in the background. Green trees and a concrete building with wires frame the distance. The composition places her in the lower left, leaving negative space on the right. The image has a film-like, slightly grainy quality with natural bokeh, evoking a candid street photography or fashion editorial style, capturing a quiet, sensual urban spring afternoon.",
