        {
          "id": "krea2-95008cd412ecb31095670e4e",
          "alias": "单女礼服广场媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a graceful side profile, her black hair coiled into a low bun with soft wisps falling at her temples. She glances back over her shoulder, her deep gaze intense and slightly mysterious, red lips parted. She wears a daring avant-garde gown: the top is sheer black lace and transparent fabric, backless, exposing the elegant curve of her spine and bare shoulder blades. The silhouette flows into a layered skirt with a massive black-and-white striped bow at the waist, embellished with irregular black polka dots and shimmering gold brocade featuring intricate floral embroidery. The skirt is full and airy, exuding haute couture opulence. Her left hand gently clasps her right wrist, where a delicate gold bracelet catches the light. Gold earrings with sparkling gems dangle at her ears. The overall look is striking, sensual, and artistic. The backdrop is a rough white wall with subtle cracks and textures, the lower portion covered in dark green square tiles; faint blurred green leaves appear in the corner, adding a natural touch. Shot as a medium close-up, she is positioned slightly left, body tilted, gaze directed up and to the right, guiding the eye from her face down the exposed back and its lines, then to the dress details. Shallow depth of field blurs fore- and background, emphasizing the silhouette and the complex outfit structure. Soft natural light from the left casts delicate shadows on her skin and the fabric, creating smooth gradients that highlight the metallic sheen and folds of the material. The color palette is black, white, gold, with dark green accents — a strong yet harmonious contrast. The atmosphere is tranquil and luxurious, blending modern fashion with retro artistry, as if captured during a haute couture fashion shoot or an art photography session. The image has a cinematic, editorial quality, shot with a large aperture lens for fine detail, sharp focus, natural color saturation, and post-processing that enhances the metallic luster and fabric texture. The result is a sensual, sophisticated, and almost surreal aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
