        {
          "id": "krea2-e91d2bd64ffb2b0f11780781",
          "alias": "单女制服街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a slightly undone Japanese high school uniform stands beside a glowing \"pokka sapporo\" vending machine. She wears a white button-up blouse, partially unbuttoned to reveal her cleavage, a deep blue sleeveless knit vest, and a black ribbon bow tie at her collar. Her pleated gray-black tartan miniskirt is hiked up high, barely covering her upper thighs. She has black leather shoes and white thigh-high socks. Her long brown hair falls naturally over her shoulders. She smiles warmly, looking directly at the camera, with her right hand forming a peace sign near her face and her left hand on her hip, body slightly tilted toward the lens, emphasizing her curves. The vending machine glows blue, its rows of colorful drinks neatly stacked. The background is a subway station or underground passage with light gray walls, gray tiles with yellow tactile paving, and a yellow \"Exit B1\" sign. Fluorescent tube lights provide even, cool illumination. The composition is a medium shot, the woman on the right-center, the machine on the left. Soft reflections from the vending screen fall on her face and clothes. The scene feels like a candid street photography moment, high-resolution, with fine textures and slight film grain. Color palette is blue-white with bright beverage packaging. The mood is playful, slightly nostalgic urban youth culture with a seductive edge.",
