        {
          "id": "krea2-4be94ab54d00e31f19bc90d3",
          "alias": "单女露胸外套广场戏谑蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches in the corner of a room, wearing a tall purple plaid top hat made of pixelated square patches with blurred white letters \"pet\" and \"ress\", the brim trimmed with delicate black lace netting. She cups her cheeks with both hands, fingers lightly touching her jawline, eyes locked on the lens with a playful yet tender expression, lips slightly parted in a teasing smirk. Her short burgundy leather jacket is unzipped and hangs open, exposing her bare breasts, the cuffs and collar adorned with fluffy deep-red feathers that catch the warm light. Underneath she wears only a light-colored thong and sleek black thigh-high boots with a glossy finish, her legs fully visible. The background is a light gray wall with vertical stripe texture and subtle wood grain, a white baseboard dividing the space. The floor is covered in a deep blue carpet with abstract orange and beige curved patterns, creating strong color contrast. Centered composition, symmetrical, with walls receding in a V-shaped perspective, drawing focus to her. Lighting from above-right is warm yellow, soft but directional, casting natural chiaroscuro across her face, hat, and bare skin, with shadows pooling beneath her body and in the corners, enhancing depth. The atmosphere is intimate and theatrical, like a backstage moment or private dressing room, slightly voyeuristic. The camera angle is a slight high-angle tilt, making her appear smaller and more vulnerable, emphasizing the details of her outfit and accessories. The scene blends gothic, lolita, and futuristic aesthetics, with a storytelling quality, as if a fashion editorial or cosplay photoshoot, both modern and nostalgic, expressing a bold, distinctive visual language.",
