          "alias": "单女制服窗边忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the corner of a room with white small-grid tiles, wearing a typical Japanese schoolgirl uniform: a light pink long-sleeve blouse, a gray V-neck knit vest, and a dark gray pleated miniskirt, with a striped dark tie loosely undone at the collar. Her black hair falls naturally, slightly wavy, brushing her cheek and shoulder. She sits sideways, body leaning forward slightly, right hand gently touching her hair, fingers long and elegant. Her gaze drifts to the right, expression thoughtful and distant, with a soft yet detached aura. She is barefoot on a cream-and-light-brown checkered cushion, legs crossed, ankles delicate, skin pale and smooth, one heel slightly lifted, toes relaxed. To her right front on the floor lies a pair of wine-red high heels, shiny, thin-strapped, round-toed, their deep color contrasting with the cool surroundings, hinting at a transformation or upcoming moment. The background is a wall of pure white square tiles, neatly arranged, with visible grout lines forming a grid that enhances geometric modernity. The floor matches the wall, reflecting a faint gloss, making the scene bright and clean. Soft light pours from the upper left, like window light, illuminating the left side of her face and body, creating gentle shading and shadow, warm and calm. The composition is a medium shot, her figure centered slightly left, body in an S-curve, legs bent, knees drawn near chest, a dynamic balance, leaving space on the right for the line of sight to extend to the high heels and distant wall, creating depth. Foreground emphasizes her body and foot details, midground shows her full figure and uniform, background closes with the clean tile wall, focusing on the subject. The overall color palette is cool white, accented with pink, gray, and wine red, harmonious, blending schoolgirl freshness with mature tension. The scene feels like a captured moment of everyday life, perhaps a girl sitting alone during a costume change,