          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a gray fabric armchair in a study, her soft brown hair cascading over her shoulders with a subtle lustrous sheen under soft lighting. She has delicate, refined features, her gaze slightly lazy and contemplative, staring directly into the lens with parted lips painted pale pink—innocent yet provocatively alluring. She wears a white long-sleeved blouse, unbuttoned to reveal a black lace bra, the collar tied loosely with a black ribbon. Over it, a black sleeveless waistcoat hangs open, cinched at the waist with a black leather belt. A black mini skirt rides high on her thighs, and sheer black stockings trace every curve of her legs, the fabric letting her natural skin tone glow through. On her feet, glossy black pointed-toe stilettos with iconic red heels create a stark contrast against the monochrome palette. Her right hand gently brushes the hem of her skirt, drawing it slightly upward, while her left hand rests on her knee. She leans forward just a little, her posture poised yet relaxed, exuding an effortless sensuality. The foreground shows warm brown wooden floorboards with visible grain and light scuff marks, and the edge of a wooden table reflects ambient light on the left. Midground focuses on the woman and the chair, which has a simple backrest, curved armrests, and light wood legs with smooth lines. In the background stands a large dark brown wooden bookshelf with multiple shelves filled with books in blue, green, red, beige, some upright, some stacked. Deep recesses in the shelves add a scholarly atmosphere. At the bottom right of the shelf sits a blue pencil holder with a few pencils, next to a small potted plant with vibrant green leaves adding a touch of life. The room has light gray walls, and soft light streams from the upper left, casting natural shadows across the floor and bookshelf, creating a warm, tranquil mood. The composition is a mid-shot, the woman positioned slightly to the right, drawing the eye to 