          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an indoor staircase, her long, sleek black hair with straight bangs cascading to her shoulders, a large white ribbon bow perched atop her head. She wears a revealing white maid outfit—the top is unbuttoned and pulled down to expose her full, bare breasts, her nipples hard against the cool air. The high-neck dress now hangs open, its frills and lace framing her chest. A fitted white waistband and layered ruffled miniskirt cling to her hips. She dons white over-the-knee stockings and black stiletto heels. Her pose is confident and sultry: right leg bent, foot resting on a step; left leg straight, supporting her weight. Her right hand lightly grips the white banister, left hand hangs at her side. She gazes directly at the camera with a cool, mysterious expression, blending innocence with raw sensuality. The foreground shows the white railing and steps; the background is a dark gray wall and a closed white door. Soft sidelight from the left creates gentle chiaroscuro, highlighting the curves of her face, arms, and exposed chest. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, offset to the right, using the staircase lines to draw the eye upward. Monochrome palette of black, white, and gray emphasizes the purity of the outfit and the stark environment, yet her skin retains a warm glow. Shot with an 85mm lens, the image has shallow depth of field, capturing fine skin texture and fabric details, with a cinematic, professionally lit feel that balances dreamlike fantasy and candid realism.",
