          "alias": "单女露胸蓝毛衣机场微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on gray tiles outside the airport terminal, wearing only a blue tweed knit cardigan left open, topless beneath, with black pleated micro-mini skirt, black-and-white pumps, and a black chain bag slung over her shoulder. She playfully tugs at her earlobe with a coy smile, looking directly at the camera, her long black hair falling naturally over bare shoulders. Skin is fair and smooth, legs long and toned. Background shows Terminal 2 signage with Korean \"항공사\" and English \"Terminal 2\", plus logos of Korean Air, Asiana, China Airlines, Delta, SAS, and a glass door entrance. To the right, a male staff member in dark blue suit and black mask stands watching. Composition centers on her slightly left, medium shot, with yellow tactile paving tiles diagonally leading from lower right toward center. Natural daylight, soft and even, pale blue sky, bright and airy. The atmosphere is casual and candid, like a real street-style capture, camera angle slightly below eye level. Details crisp: wool texture of cardigan, pleats of skirt, faint shoe logo, glass reflections adding depth. Color palette of blue, white, black creates a fresh yet sensual look. She appears unaware of the staff's gaze, embodying youthful urban energy. Soft shadows, no harsh contrast—clean, bright, intimately real.",
