        {
          "id": "krea2-7765ad0a802b2a69d88a52d4",
          "alias": "男女露胸白牛仔街道媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at a street corner in a Japanese city, her long, sleek black hair falling naturally over her shoulders. Her skin is fair and smooth, her facial features delicate and refined. Her gaze is slightly lazy as she looks directly at the camera, lips parted with a subtle upward curl, exuding a casual, seductive charm. She raises her right hand, palm pressed against her forehead in a shielding gesture, as if blocking strong sunlight—a pose that feels both protective and provocatively careless. She is completely topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples visible, with no top covering her. A pair of tight white high-waist denim shorts hugs her hips and thighs, emphasizing her legs. On her left outer thigh, a delicate floral tattoo of pink roses and green leaves adds a touch of personality and artistry. The composition is a mid-shot from the knees up, with the subject centered slightly to the right in the foreground. Behind her, on the left, a cream-colored Honda minivan is parked, its yellow license plate showing a Japanese registration. The van’s body reflects the blurred surroundings. Behind it rises a gray concrete multi-story residential building with orderly balcony railings; windows mirror the sky and distant architecture. On the right in the distance, several black cars are parked. A male pedestrian in a gray hoodie and backpack walks toward a crosswalk, seen from behind, his figure tall. Next to him stands a black parking sign with a white “P”. Farther back, a blue billboard displays a pet image and Japanese text. The street is paved with gray square tiles, white traffic lines marking parking spaces and lanes. Utility poles, streetlights, and various traffic signs—including a red circular no-entry sign and blue directional sign—complete the urban scene. The lighting is strong afternoon sunlight from above left, casting soft shadows on the woman, with natural gradients across her face and subtle highlights on her skin and clothing. The sky is pale blue with thin clouds. The overall color palette is cool—dominated by blue, gray, and white—accented by cream, black, and skin tones, creating a fresh, realistic summer street atmosphere. The shot is taken from a slightly low angle, making the woman appear taller and adding depth. Lines from the car and ground guide the viewer’s eye toward her. Her hand gesture, gaze, and body orientation form the focal point, drawing attention. The mood is natural and candid, like a spontaneous snapshot captured with an ordinary camera or phone, unretouched, retaining authentic texture and subtle emotional expression.",
