        {
          "id": "krea2-8e74150276ff2d2a3ad326d8",
          "alias": "单女露胸桌边冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a warm indoor café, her long black hair falling naturally as she tilts her head slightly downward, gazing at a white Canon mirrorless camera in her hands with focused tenderness. She is topless, her bare chest exposed, the silver ring on her left hand’s ring finger catching the light as her fingers gently rest on the table. A delicate gold chain necklace with a small pendant hangs around her neck, drawing attention to her collarbone and slender neck. Her right hand holds the camera body steadily, finger poised near the shutter button. In the foreground, a wooden table with clear grain holds a white porcelain teacup decorated with classical portrait patterns and gold trim, a matching saucer with a white ceramic spoon, a black smartphone, a transparent glass jar, and other tableware. The middle ground places her slightly left, leaning forward in a natural, relaxed posture. The background reveals the café’s interior with warm yellow walls, several industrial-style vintage pendant lamps—one casting a soft warm glow—a lush green plant in the corner with dense leaves, dried branches adding artistic flair, and dark windows with blurred wine rack outlines showing the blue night sky outside, creating warm-cool contrast. The composition is a close-up combined with mid-shot, focusing on her and the camera, using shallow depth of field to blur the background, with diagonal table edge and her leaning lines guiding the eye from her hands to the camera, then to her expression, finally settling on her concentrated gaze. Lighting is primarily warm, from the overhead lights and pendant lamps, softly illuminating her face, bare skin, and the table, with delicate shadow transitions. Highlights catch on her hair and the camera’s metal parts, enhancing texture. The overall atmosphere is cozy, serene, with an artistic and everyday aesthetic, capturing a quiet afternoon moment of a photographer’s daily ritual, rich in storytelling and emotional resonance.",
